DIALOGEVENT:EvaChina_OpinionCivilianStructures01Subtitle
US: "*General. Be careful that civilian structures are not destroyed"
DE: "*General. Be careful that civilian structures are not destroyed"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, debes evitar destruir edificios civiles."
IT: "\nGenerale, fate attenzione a non distruggere le strutture civili."
KO: "장군. 민간 건물이 파괴되지 않도록 조심하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，小心尚未摧毀那棟平民建築物。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaChina_OpinionCivilianStructures02Subtitle
US: "*Destroying civilian structures will adversely affect our International Opinion!"
DE: "*Destroying civilian structures will adversely affect our International Opinion!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Destruir edificios civiles perjudica a la reputación internacional!"
IT: "\nDistruggendo delle strutture civili la nostra reputazione internazionale subirà un duro colpo!"
KO: "민간 건물 파괴는 국제 여론을 악화시킬 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n搗毀平民建築物將對我們的國際聲望有負面影響！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaChina_OpinionDestroyStatuesSubtitle
US: "*Destroy the GLA statues to increase International Opinion, sir"
DE: "*Destroy the GLA statues to increase International Opinion, sir"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSeñor, destruir las estatuas del GLA mejorará la reputación internacional."
IT: "\nDistruggete tutte le statue dell'ELG per migliorare la reputazione internazionale, signore."
KO: "GLA의 동상들을 파괴하여 국제 여론의 지지를 얻으십시오. 장군님."
ZH: "\n摧毀全球解放軍雕像以提昇國際聲望，長官。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaChina_OpinionDestroyStructuresSubtitle
US: "*Sir. Destroying enemy structures will increase International Opinion of us"
DE: "*Sir. Destroying enemy structures will increase International Opinion of us"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSeñor, destruir edificios enemigos mejorará la reputación internacional."
IT: "\nSignore, distruggendo le strutture nemiche potremo migliorare la nostra reputazione internazionale."
KO: "장군님, 적 건물을 파괴하면 우리에 대한 국제 여론이 향상될 것입니다."
ZH: "\n長官，摧毀敵軍建築將有助於國際聲望的提昇。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaChina_OpinionDestroyTroopsSubtitle
US: "*Destroy more enemy troops to Increase International Opinion"
DE: "*Destroy more enemy troops to Increase International Opinion"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDestruye más tropas enemigas para mejorar la reputación internacional."
IT: "\nDistruggete altre truppe nemiche per migliorare la reputazione internazionale."
KO: "국제 여론을 향상시키려면 더 많은 적 부대를 섬멸하십시오."
ZH: "\n殲滅更多敵軍部隊以提昇國際聲望。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaChina_OpinionFallingSubtitle
US: "*Our International Opinion is falling!"
DE: "*Our International Opinion is falling!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nuestra reputación internacional está cayendo!"
IT: "\nLa nostra reputazione internazionale sta calando!"
KO: "우리에 대한 국제 여론이 나빠지고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n我們的國際聲望正在下滑！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaChina_OpinionLowSubtitle
US: "*Our International Opinion is becoming low"
DE: "*Our International Opinion is becoming low"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestra reputación internacional es baja."
IT: "\nLa nostra reputazione internazionale è piuttosto bassa."
KO: "우리에 대한 국제 여론이 나빠지고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n我們的國際聲望有下降的趨勢。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaChina_OpinionLowCriticalSubtitle
US: "*Our International Opinion is critically low!"
DE: "*Our International Opinion is critically low!"
FR: "***"
