DIALOGEVENT:EvaGLA_LaserDefenseSpeechSubtitle
US: "*General, our opponent has a stronghold in the middle of the city. His laser defense system is devastating, but requires lots of power. He will be forced to divert his power to one point of defense at a time. Use this to your advantage"
DE: "*General, our opponent has a stronghold in the middle of the city. His laser defense system is devastating, but requires lots of power. He will be forced to divert his power to one point of defense at a time. Use this to your advantage"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el oponente tiene un bastión en medio de la ciudad. Su defensa de láser es devastadora pero consume mucho. No podrá mantener más de una defensa a la vez. Aprovéchate de ello."
IT: "\nGenerale, il nostro avversario dispone di una roccaforte al centro della città.\nLe sue difese laser sono devastanti, ma consumano molta\nenergia: dovrà attivarle una sezione alla volta."
KO: "\n장군님, 적군이 시 중심가에 거점을 확보하고 있습니다. 레이저 방어 시스템은 막강하지만\n많은 전력을 소모합니다. 이 점을 기회로 이용하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，敵方的要塞位於城市中心。他們擁有具毀滅性的雷射防禦系統，但是需要大量的電力來啟動，因\n此他將被迫同時挪用電力於某個防禦點上。好好利用這個弱點，當作你的優勢吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

