PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaUSA_SneakAttackLaunchedSubtitle
US: "*Warning. Sneak Attack detected"
DE: "*Warning. Sneak Attack detected"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAviso: ataque furtivo detectado."
IT: "\nAttenzione: rilevato Attacco furtivo."
KO: "경고: 잠입 공격이 탐지되었습니다."
ZH: "\n警告：偵測到偷襲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaUSA_UnitLostSubtitle
US: "*Unit lost"
DE: "*Unit lost"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nUnidad perdida."
IT: "\nUnità perduta."
KO: "아군 유닛 손실"
ZH: "\n損失單位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

