END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaUSA_UpgradeControlRodAdvancedSubtitle
US: "*Advanced Control Rods upgrade complete"
DE: "*Advanced Control Rods upgrade complete"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMejora de barras de control avanzadas completa."
IT: "\nAggiornamento Barre di controllo avanzate completato."
KO: "제어 로드 개발 업그레이드가 완료되었습니다."
ZH: "\n先進核能控制棒升級完成。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaUSA_UpgradeMoabSubtitle
US: "*Moab upgrade complete"
DE: "*Moab upgrade complete"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMejora de MDTB completa"
IT: "\nAggiornamento MDTB completato."
KO: "MOAB 업그레이드 완료"
