END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaUSA_UpgradeSentryDroneSubtitle
US: "*Sentry Drone upgrade complete"
DE: "*Sentry Drone upgrade complete"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMejora de teledirigido centinela completa."
IT: "\nAggiornamento Drone da ricognizione completato."
KO: "센트리 드론 업그레이드 완료"
ZH: "\n無人哨兵機升級完成。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaUSA_VehicleStolenSubtitle
US: "*Vehicle Stolen"
DE: "*Vehicle Stolen"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nVehículo robado"
IT: "\nVeicolo rubato."
KO: "차량을 탈취당했습니다."
ZH: "\n載具被偷了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:EvaUSA_VictorySubtitle
US: "*You are victorious"
DE: "*You are victorious"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Has vencido!"
IT: "\nAvete vinto."
KO: "승리하셨습니다!"
ZH: "\n你贏得勝利！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xBrf01Subtitle
US: "*General, the GLA managed to defeat the US forces in this area. We launched a devastating counter attack, but like roaches they are still alive"
DE: "*General, the GLA managed to defeat the US forces in this area. We launched a devastating counter attack, but like roaches they are still alive"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el GLA ha derrotado a las fuerzas de EE.UU. en esta área. Lanzamos un contraataque devastador, pero sobrevivieron como malas hierbas."
IT: "\nGenerale, l'ELG è riuscito a sconfiggere le forze USA presenti in zona. Abbiamo lanciato un devastante contrattacco, ma il nemico è ancora vivo."
KO: "\n장군님, GLA는 이 지역의 미국군에 타격을 가했습니다. 맹렬한 반격을 가했지만,\n놈들은 바퀴벌레처럼 아직 생존해있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍企圖擊退此區域內的美軍部隊，我方已做出致命的反擊行動，但敵軍就像打不死的蟑\n螂一樣四處亂竄。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xBrf02Subtitle
US: "*Even now the GLA survivors are rebuilding"
DE: "*Even now the GLA survivors are rebuilding"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos supervivientes del GLA se están recomponiendo."
IT: "***"
KO: "지금도 GLA의 생존 병력은 재건하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n即便現在，全球解放軍的倖存者還在重建勢力當中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xBrf03Subtitle
US: "*To finally eliminate the GLA we must send in our forces and root them out of every dark corner in which they hide"
DE: "*To finally eliminate the GLA we must send in our forces and root them out of every dark corner in which they hide"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nPara eliminar del todo al GLA debemos enviar nuestras fuerzas y sacarles\nde cada rincón donde se oculten."
IT: "\nPer annientare l'ELG, dobbiamo stanarli dal loro nascondiglio!"
KO: "GLA 병력을 박멸하려면 놈들이 숨어있는 구석구석에 우리의 병력을 파견해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n為了徹底終結全球解放軍，我們必須派遣部隊深入他們藏匿的每個死角，將他們斬草除根。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xBrf04Subtitle
US: "*General, our new Listening Outposts are stationed in the area. They are at your disposal"
DE: "*General, our new Listening Outposts are stationed in the area. They are at your disposal"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, los nuevos puestos de escucha están en el área.\nLos tienes a tu disposición."
IT: "\nLe nostre Postazioni d'ascolto in zona sono a vostra disposizione."
KO: "장군님, 감시 아웃포스트가 이 지역에 배치되어 장군님의 명령을 기다리고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，新的前哨監聽車已在此區部署完畢，一切將依照您的指令進行作業。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xBrf05Subtitle
US: "*The Listening Outpost itself is unarmed, however its passengers can fire on enemies that venture too close. You will find its long sight range and stealth ability greatly enhances battlefield awareness"
DE: "*The Listening Outpost itself is unarmed, however its passengers can fire on enemies that venture too close. You will find its long sight range and stealth ability greatly enhances battlefield awareness"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl puesto de escucha no está armado, pero sus ocupantes pueden disparar\na enemigos cercanos. Su gran campo de visión y discreción mejorarán\nla percepción del campo de batalla."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n감시 아웃포스트는 무기가 없지만 탑승한 병사들은 근접한 적에게 사격을 할 수 있습니다.\n긴 사정거리와 스텔스 능력은 전투 수행 능력을 증대시킬 것입니다."
ZH: "\n前哨監聽車本身是毫無武裝能力的，因此當敵軍太過逼近時，附近單位可適時攻擊做掩護。由於擁有長\n遠的視野範圍以及隱形能力兩項優點，大大地提高部隊在戰場的警覺性。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xChat01Subtitle
US: "*No GLA will slip past our garrison"
DE: "*No GLA will slip past our garrison"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA no superará nuestra guarnición."
IT: "\nNessuna unità dell'ELG supererà la nostra guarnigione."
KO: "GLA는 우리 수비대를 피해 지나가지 못할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n沒有任何全球解放軍可以偷偷溜過我們的防線。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xChat02Subtitle
US: "*Toxin Tractors! They're trying to poison us allwe need support!"
DE: "*Toxin Tractors! They're trying to poison us allwe need support!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Tractores de toxinas! Quieren envenenarnos… ¡Necesitamos apoyo!"
IT: "\nContaminatori! Stanno tentando di avvelenarci, ci serve aiuto!"
KO: "독소 트랙터다! 중독되기 전에 도움이 필요하다!"
ZH: "\n是毒素車！他們試圖要毒害我們，我們需要支援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xChat03Subtitle
US: "*LookOil Derricksshould we capture them?"
DE: "*LookOil Derricksshould we capture them?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMira… torres de perforación… ¿Las tomamos?"
IT: "\nGuardate, dei Derrick: dobbiamo cercare di catturarli?"
KO: "원유 유정탑이다! 점령하는게 좋지 않을까?"
ZH: "\n看哪，油井！我們應該佔領下來嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xChat04Subtitle
US: "*GLA in your home? Apply a little fireno more GLA"
DE: "*GLA in your home? Apply a little fireno more GLA"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¿Hay GLA en tu casa? Un poco de artillería… y adiós GLA"
IT: "\nL'ELG in casa? Qualche colpo ben assestato e sarà solo un ricordo."
KO: "집구석에 GLA가 있습니까? 불을 뿌려주면 박멸할 수 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n你能想像全球解放軍在你家登堂入室嗎？殺光他們，一個都不要留。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xChat05Subtitle
US: "*The GLA are rebuilding over therestand ready to attack"
DE: "*The GLA are rebuilding over therestand ready to attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA se está recomponiendo allí... Prepárate para el ataque"
IT: "\nL'ELG sta radunando le sue forze per tornare all'attacco."
KO: "GLA가 재건해서 공격 준비를 하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍正在重建勢力中。準備攻擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xChat06Subtitle
US: "*We will win this dayeveryone advance"
DE: "*We will win this dayeveryone advance"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nVamos a ganar... Adelante todos..."
IT: "\nRiusciremo a vincere, se saremo determinati."
KO: "우리는 이번에 꼭 승리할 것이다!"
ZH: "\n我們將贏得今天這場勝利，大家衝啊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xCin01aSubtitle
US: "*I did not think the United States would be defeated so easily"
DE: "*I did not think the United States would be defeated so easily"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNo creí que derrotasen tan fácilmente a los Estados Unidos"
IT: "\nNon credevo che sarebbe stato così facile sconfiggere gli Stati Uniti."
KO: "미국군이 이렇게 쉽게 패배할 줄은 몰랐는걸?"
ZH: "\n我不認為美國會這麼容易被擊敗。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xCin01bSubtitle
US: "*I do not understand why the United States has allowed this to happen"
DE: "*I do not understand why the United States has allowed this to happen"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNo comprendo cómo EE.UU. lo ha permitido."
IT: "\nNon capisco perché gli Stati Uniti hanno permesso che accadesse questo."
KO: "미국군이 이렇게 쉽게 당할 줄이야…"
ZH: "\n我真的不懂為什麼美國會讓這種事情發生。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xCin01cSubtitle
US: "*This can not be allowed to stand. China will make things right"
DE: "*This can not be allowed to stand. China will make things right"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEsto no puede quedar así. China pondrá las cosas en su sitio."
IT: "\nQuesto non può essere tollerato: la Cina sistemerà la situazione."
KO: "우린 저런 놈들을 그냥 내버려두지 않는다!"
ZH: "\n這件事是不允許發生的，中國將會讓事情回到該有的樣子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xCin01dSubtitle
US: "*The GLA's treacherous use of our resources against the Americans has caused great embarrassment to China. They must pay for their insolence"
DE: "*The GLA's treacherous use of our resources against the Americans has caused great embarassment to China. They must pay for their insolence"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl uso traicionero de nuestros recursos que el GLA ha hecho contra EE.UU.\nes muy embarazoso para China.\nPagarán su osadía."
IT: "\nL'ELG ha approfittato di noi: deve pagare!"
KO: "\nGLA가 교활하게 중국의 자원을 사용해서 미국에 대항하는 것이 매우 거슬립니다.\n그들은 댓가를 치뤄야 할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍背信忘義，利用我們的資源對抗美軍，讓中國感到相當的難堪。他們必須為此猖狂的行為付\n出代價。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xCin02Subtitle
US: "*The missiles are prepared and ready for launchfinal countdown started"
DE: "*The missiles are prepared and ready for launchfinal countdown started"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos misiles están listos para el lanzamiento... Cuenta atrás iniciada"
IT: "\nMissili pronti al lancio, conto alla rovescia iniziato."
KO: "미사일 발사 준비 완료. 발사 카운트 다운이 시작되었습니다."
ZH: "\n飛彈已備妥，準備倒數計時以發射。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xCin03Subtitle
US: "*321 Missiles are away"
DE: "*321 Missiles are away"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n3... 2... 1... Misiles fuera"
IT: "\n3... 2... 1... Missili lanciati."
KO: "3, 2, 1, 미사일 발사"
ZH: "\n倒數 3、2、1，發射！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xCin04Subtitle
US: "*They believe they have won the day, but they celebrate too soon"
DE: "*They believe they have won the day, but they celebrate too soon"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCreen haber ganado, pero cantan victoria antes de tiempo."
IT: "\nCredono di aver vinto, ma hanno festeggiato troppo presto."
KO: "놈들은 너무 샴페인을 일찍 터뜨렸어."
ZH: "\n他們自認為會贏得勝利，但是未免高興得太早了吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xCin05Subtitle
US: "*It is pretty when used for the right reasons"
DE: "*It is pretty when used for the right reasons"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEs bonito si se tiene un buen motivo para usarlo..."
IT: "\nQuando la causa è giusta, non c'è nulla di male nell'usare un'arma."
KO: "정의를 위해 작렬하는 버섯구름은 멋지단 말이야."
ZH: "\n如果為了合理的原因，倒是不錯。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xCin06Subtitle
US: "*GLA survivors are running to town for coverthey must be stopped!"
DE: "*GLA survivors are running to town for coverthey must be stopped!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos supervivientes del GLA se refugian en la ciudad... ¡Hay que detenerles!"
IT: "\nI superstiti dell'ELG stanno correndo in città per trovare riparo: devono essere fermati!"
KO: "GLA 잔존 병력이 숨기 위해 도시로 들어오고 있습니다. 그들을 막아야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n全球解放軍的倖存者正逃往城鎮尋求庇護，快阻止他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xCin07Subtitle
US: "*We are in positionbomb bay doors open"
DE: "*We are in positionbomb bay doors open"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEn posición... Compartimento de bombas abierto..."
IT: "\nSiamo in posizione, portelli delle bombe aperti."
KO: "작전 준비 완료. 폭탄 투하구 개방!"
ZH: "\n我們已經就定位，炸彈艙門已開啟。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xCin08Subtitle
US: "*We have spotted survivors. Ground assault will be necessary"
DE: "*We have spotted survivors. Ground assault will be necessary"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSupervivientes divisados. Será necesario un ataque terrestre."
IT: "\nAbbiamo individuato dei superstiti. Sarà necessario un assalto terrestre."
KO: "잔존 병력 발견. 대지 공격 필요."
ZH: "\n我們發現解放軍倖存者的蹤跡，準備進行地面攻襲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xXO01Subtitle
US: "*General, our former base in the region was overrun by the GLA. You will need to construct a new base before you can engage the enemy"
DE: "*General, our former base in the region was overrun by the GLA. You will need to construct a new base before you can engage the enemy"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA ha invadido nuestra antigua base en la región. Hay que construir una nueva antes de atacar al enemigo."
IT: "\nGenerale, la nostra vecchia base nella regione è ora sotto il controllo dell'ELG: dovrete realizzarne una nuova prima di assalire il nemico."
KO: "\n장군님, 이 지역의 우리 기지는 현재 GLA가 점령하고 있습니다. 적과 교전하기 전에\n새 기지를 건설해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍橫行於我們早先的基地上，你必須在有能力與敵軍接戰之前，重新建造新的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xXO02Subtitle
US: "*May I suggest that you garrison several of the nearby buildings to defend our base"
DE: "*May I suggest that you garrison several of the nearby buildings to defend our base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSugiero guarnecer varios edificios cercanos para defender la base."
IT: "\nPosso suggerirvi di presidiare gli edifici nelle vicinanze per difendere la nostra base?"
KO: "기지 방어를 위해 근처의 건물에 병력을 주둔시키십시오."
ZH: "\n我想建議你駐守在附近幾棟建築，來防禦我們的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xXO03Subtitle
US: "*General, the GLA has garrisoned several buildings throughout the town. Perhaps you could use a Dragon tank to clear out those garrisons"
DE: "*General, the GLA has garrisoned several buildings throughout the town. Perhaps you could use a Dragon tank to clear out those garrisons"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el GLA ha guarnecido varios edificios en la ciudad. Quizá podrían limpiarse esos focos con un tanque Dragon."
IT: "\nGenerale, l'ELG presidia diversi edifici in città: forse con un Carro Dragon potreste riuscire a eliminare la minaccia."
KO: "\n장군님, GLA가 도시 곳곳의 건물에 병력을 배치했습니다.그 주둔 병력을 소탕하려면\n드래곤 탱크를 이용하는게 좋을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍在整座城鎮中已攻佔數棟建築。或許你可以利用火龍坦克，以肅清那些駐軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xXO04Subtitle
US: "*General, the GLA is moving Toxin Tractors towards our garrisoned buildings. If those tractors attack those buildings, everyone inside will be eliminated"
DE: "*General, the GLA is moving Toxin Tractors towards our garrisoned buildings. If those tractors attack those buildings, everyone inside will be eliminated"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el GLA desplaza tractores de toxinas hacia nuestros edificios guarnecidos. Si atacan dichos edificios, todo el que esté dentro morirá"
IT: "\nGenerale, l'ELG sta portando dei Contaminatori nei pressi delle strutture presidiate: se sferreranno un attacco, tutte le nostre forze all'interno saranno distrutte."
KO: "\n장군님, GLA는 독소 트랙터를 우리 병력이 배치된 건물로 보내고 있습니다.\n독소 트랙터의 공격을 받으면 건물 내 병력은 전멸할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍的毒素車正往我們所駐守的建築推進中，如果讓他們攻堅成功，我們在裡面的部隊將\n被全部殲滅。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xXO05Subtitle
US: "*The GLA are using these Oil Derricks to fund their forces. One of our Red Guard could capture those derricks. The proceeds would help defeat the GLA"
DE: "*The GLA are using these Oil Derricks to fund their forces. One of our Red Guard could capture those derricks. The proceeds would help defeat the GLA"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA se financia con estas torres de perforación. Nuestra Guardia Roja podría tomarlas. Eso nos ayudaría a vencerles."
IT: "\nL'ELG utilizza questi Derrick per rifornire le sue forze: un membro della Guardia Rossa potrebbe catturarli. In questo modo, la lotta contro l'ELG farebbe un passo avanti."
KO: "\nGLA는 자금 조달을 위해 원유 유정탑을 사용하고 있습니다. 홍위병으로 유정탑을\n점령하게 하여 GLA 소탕을 앞당기십시오."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍利用這些油井為部隊提供資金。我們其中一名紅衛兵可以佔領油井，憑藉這些收益將對擊垮\n全球解放軍有很大的助益。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xXO06Subtitle
US: "*General, is it wise to destroy these Oil Derricks? They would provide valuable resources for us. One of our Red Guard could capture them"
DE: "*General, is it wise to destroy these Oil Derricks? They would provide valuable resources for us. One of our Red Guard could capture them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, ¿es correcto destruir estas torres? Son valiosas. Nuestra Guardia Roja podría tomarlas."
IT: "\nGenerale, è saggio distruggere questi Derrick? Potrebbero esserci di grande aiuto: basterebbe una Guardia Rossa per catturarli."
KO: "\n장군님, 이 원유 유정탑들을 파괴하는 것이 옳은 일일까요? 이들은 우리에게 소중한\n자원입니다. 홍위병이 이들을 점령할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，你覺得將這些油井全數摧毀是個明智的作法嗎？油井可以提供我們有用的資源，而且只要一名\n紅衛兵即可佔領下來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xXO07Subtitle
US: "*You have caught them off-guard, General. One of your Red Guard could capture their buildings before they are able to respond"
DE: "*You have caught them off-guard, General. One of your Red Guard could capture their buildings before they are able to respond"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLes has sorprendido. La Guardia Roja podría tomar los edificios antes de que puedan reaccionar."
IT: "\nLi avete colti di sorpresa, generale! Una delle Guardie Rosse potrebbe catturare le strutture prima che possano reagire."
KO: "\n공격을 받지 않고 건물에 접근했습니다. 적이 공격하기 전에 홍위병으로건물을\n점령할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n你已經乘其不備逮到他們了，將軍。在他們有所反應之前，一名紅衛兵即可佔領他們的建築。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xXO08Subtitle
US: "*Now that you have re-established our base of operations, it is time to root out all remaining GLA forces in the area"
DE: "*Now that you have re-established our base of operations, it is time to root out all remaining GLA forces in the area"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAhora que la base está restablecida, es el momento de acabar con los restos del GLA en la zona."
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 아군의 기지가 원활히 가동되므로 GLA를 섬멸할 시간이 되었습니다."
ZH: "\n你已經重建完成我方的軍事基地，現在正是我們根除所有全球解放軍殘存勢力的時候了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI01xXO09Subtitle
US: "*Congratulations, General. You have freed the town of all GLA forces. Once you have wiped out their final base, your mission will be complete"
DE: "*Congratulations, General. You have freed the town of all GLA forces. Once you have wiped out their final base, your mission will be complete"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nFelicidades. Has liberado a la ciudad del GLA. Cuando aniquiles su base final, habrás cumplido la misión."
IT: "\nCongratulazioni, generale: avete liberato la città dalle forze dell'ELG. Una volta distrutta la loro ultima base, la missione sarà conclusa."
KO: "\n축하합니다, 장군님. GLA로부터 도시를 해방시켰습니다. 그들의 마지막 기지를\n제거하면 임무는 완료될 것입니다."
ZH: "\n恭喜你，將軍。你已經解救了這個充斥全球解放軍的城鎮，一旦搗毀他們最終的基地，你的任務即將完\n成。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisChi02Lin13Subtitle
US: "*The Terrorist threat is finished. Good work, General"
DE: "*The Terrorist threat is finished. Good work, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa amenaza terrorista ha terminado. Buen trabajo, general."
IT: "\nLa minaccia terrorista è stata annientata. Ottimo lavoro, generale."
KO: "테러리스트의 위협이 제거되었습니다. 수고하셨습니다, 장군님."
ZH: "\n恐怖份子的威脅已經解除。幹得好，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf01Subtitle
US: "*General, the GLA are attempting to steal the nuclear warheads stored at this facility"
DE: "*General, the GLA are attempting to steal the nuclear warheads stored at this facility"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el GLA intenta robar las cabezas nucleares almacenadas en estas instalaciones."
IT: "\nGenerale, l'ELG sta tentando di rubare le testate nucleari ospitate in questa struttura."
KO: "장군님, GLA는 이 시설에 저장된 핵탄두를 탈취하려고 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍試圖竊取位於工廠內的核子彈頭。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf01aSubtitle
US: "*General, the GLA are attempting to destroy our main nuclear power plant"
DE: "*General, the GLA are attempting to destroy our main nuclear power plant"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el GLA intenta destruir nuestra principal central nuclear."
IT: "\nGenerale, l'ELG sta cercando di distruggere la nostra centrale nucleare principale."
KO: "장군님, GLA는 우리의 핵 발전소를 파괴하려고 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍企圖摧毀我方的主力核電廠。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf02Subtitle
US: "*Our brave soldiers held off their attack but at great cost and the GLA is still out there"
DE: "*Our brave soldiers held off their attack but at great cost and the GLA is still out there"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "*"
KO: "\n우리의 용감한 병사들은 GLA를 격퇴하였으나 손실이 매우 크고, 아직도 그들은\n섬멸되지 않았습니다."
ZH: "\n我們英勇的士兵，犧牲生命奮勇抵抗全球解放軍，但敵軍仍然十分猖獗。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf03Subtitle
US: "*You must hold off the GLA and insure that every one of our Bunkers is protected"
DE: "*You must hold off the GLA and insure that every one of our Bunkers is protected"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHay que mantener a raya al GLA y proteger todos nuestros búnkeres."
IT: "\nDovete contenere l'assalto dell'ELG e proteggere tutti i nostri bunker."
KO: "GLA의 공격을 격퇴하고 모든 벙커가 파괴되지 않아야 합니다."
ZH: "\n你必須抵擋全球解放軍的進犯，並確實做好每一座碉堡的防衛陣線。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf03aSubtitle
US: "*You must hold off the GLA to insure that the facility is not destroyed"
DE: "*You must hold off the GLA to insure that the facility is not destroyed"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "GLA의 공격을 격퇴하고 핵시설이 파괴되지 않아야 합니다."
ZH: "\n你必須抵擋全球解放軍，以確保工廠不被其摧毀殆盡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf04Subtitle
US: "*We have several new technologies that should be of great benefit to your mission, General"
DE: "*We have several new technologies that should be of great benefit to your mission, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDispones de nuevas y útiles tecnologías"
IT: "***"
KO: "임무에 큰 도움을 줄 신기술들이 있습니다, 장군님."
ZH: "\n我方擁有好幾樣新技術，對你完成任務會有相當的助益，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf05Subtitle
US: "*Our Nuclear Cannons are now upgraded to fire neutron shells. These new shells effectively eliminate soldiers and vehicle drivers. Once the radiation has cleared, one of our infantrymen can then capture the surviving vehicles"
DE: "*Our Nuclear Cannons are now upgraded to fire neutron shells. These new shells effectively eliminate soldiers and vehicle drivers. Once the radiation has cleared, one of our infantrymen can then capture the surviving vehicles"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAhora, los cañones nucleares disparan proyectiles de neutrones.\nEliminan soldados y conductores de vehículos que la infantería\npuede tomar al desaparecer la radiación"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n우리의 핵 캐논은 중성자 탄두를 장착할 수 있게 되었습니다. 이 신형 탄두들은 적 병사와\n차량 운전자들을 제거합니다. 방사능이 사라지면 아군 보병으로 차량을 탈취하십시오."
ZH: "\n我方的核子加農炮已可升級發射中子砲彈。這砲彈將有效地清除士兵及載具的駕駛員，一旦解除輻射的\n威脅後，我方步兵將可接管殘餘的載具"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf06Subtitle
US: "*Our buildings can now upgrade to Neutron mines. While still effective against infantry, they will also temporarily incapacitate enemy vehicles"
DE: "*Our buildings can now upgrade to Neutron mines. While still effective against infantry, they will also temporarily incapacitate enemy vehicles"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestros edificios pueden disponer de minas de neutrones. Son efectivas contra infantería e incapacitan vehículos enemigos temporalmente"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n아군 건물은 이제 중성자 지뢰 업그레이드가 가능합니다. 적 병사와 차량 무력화에\n효과가 있습니다."
ZH: "\n我方建築將可升級中子地雷。如此一來，不僅可有效抵擋步兵來襲，亦可暫時癱瘓敵方載具"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf07aSubtitle
US: "*General, your reinforcements will arrive in 15 minutes"
DE: "*General, your reinforcements will arrive in 15 minutes"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, los refuerzos llegarán en 15 minutos."
IT: "\nGenerale, i rinforzi arriveranno fra 15 minuti."
KO: "장군님, 지원군이 15분 내에 도착합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，援軍將在 15 分鐘後抵達。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf07bSubtitle
US: "*General, your reinforcements will arrive in 10 minutes"
DE: "*General, your reinforcements will arrive in 10 minutes"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, los refuerzos llegarán en 10 minutos."
IT: "\nGenerale, i rinforzi arriveranno fra 10 minuti."
KO: "장군님, 지원군이 10분 내에 도착합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，援軍將在 10 分鐘後抵達。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf07cSubtitle
US: "*General, your reinforcements will arrive in 5 minutes"
DE: "*General, your reinforcements will arrive in 5 minutes"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, los refuerzos llegarán en 5 minutos."
IT: "\nGenerale, i rinforzi arriveranno fra 5 minuti."
KO: "장군님, 지원군이 5분 내에 도착합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，援軍將在 5 分鐘後抵達。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xBrf07dSubtitle
US: "*General, your reinforcements will arrive soon"
DE: "*General, your reinforcements will arrive soon"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, pronto llegarán los refuerzos."
IT: "\nGenerale, i rinforzi saranno presto qui."
KO: "장군님, 지원군이 곧 도착합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，援軍即將抵達。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat01Subtitle
US: "*Enemy forces sighted. We will hold them back"
DE: "*Enemy forces sighted. We will hold them back"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nFuerzas enemigas avistadas. Las contendremos."
IT: "\nForze nemiche individuate. Le respingeremo."
KO: "적 병력 발견. 그들을 저지할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n發現敵軍部隊蹤跡，我們將抵擋他們進犯。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat02Subtitle
US: "*We're taking fire on the right flanksupport is needed here"
DE: "*We're taking fire on the right flanksupport is needed here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNos atacan por el flanco derecho... Requerimos apoyo."
IT: "***"
KO: "우측에 적의 공격을 받고 있습니다. 지원이 필요합니다."
ZH: "\n我方在右翼遭受猛烈攻擊，需要立即支援。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat03Subtitle
US: "*They are behind usdirect all fire to the south!"
DE: "*They are behind usdirect all fire to the south!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEstán detrás de nosotros... ¡Todo el fuego hacia el sur!"
IT: "\nSono dietro di noi! Concentrate i colpi a sud!"
KO: "적이 후방에 있다. 사격을 남쪽으로 집중하라!"
ZH: "\n敵軍正尾隨在後，命令所有攻擊火力集中南方！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat04Subtitle
US: "*GLA base in rangeall teams ready to attack, General"
DE: "*GLA base in rangeall teams ready to attack, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBase del GLA a tiro... Todos los equipos listos para atacar."
IT: "\nLa base ELG a tiro, tutte le unità pronte all'attacco, generale."
KO: "GLA 기지가 사정권에 있습니다. 공격 준비 완료."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍基地皆在射程中，全員已待命準備攻擊，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat05Subtitle
US: "*Enemy buildings on that ridge. Give the word, General, and we will roll over them"
DE: "*Enemy buildings on that ridge. Give the word, General, and we will roll over them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEdificios enemigos en esa montaña. Atacaremos en cuanto recibamos la orden."
IT: "\nCi sono strutture nemiche su quella dorsale: date l'ordine e le annienteremo, generale."
KO: "저 곳에 적 건물이 있습니다. 공격 명령만 내리십시오. 장군님."
ZH: "\n許多敵軍建築散佈在山脊上。傳令下去，將軍，我們將剷平他們的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat06Subtitle
US: "*Watch those RPG Troopers! We need help!"
DE: "*Watch those RPG Troopers! We need help!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Mirad esos soldados RPG! ¡Necesitamos ayuda!"
IT: "\nAttenzione a quei Soldati RPG! Ci serve aiuto!"
KO: "RPG 트루퍼를 조심하라! 지원이 필요하다!"
ZH: "\n小心那些火箭兵！我們需要支援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat07Subtitle
US: "*General, we are over the target area now and have commenced bombing"
DE: "*General, we are over the target area now and have commenced bombing"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, estamos sobre el objetivo y hemos iniciado el bombardeo."
IT: "\nGenerale, siamo sul bersaglio e iniziamo il bombardamento."
KO: "장군님, 목표 지역 상공에서 폭격을 시작했습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們正位於目標區域上，並已著手進行轟炸。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat08Subtitle
US: "*Rolling out the carpetof bombs. Heheh"
DE: "*Rolling out the carpetof bombs. Heheh"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSacando la alfombra... de bombas. Je, je"
IT: "\nIniziamo il bombardamento a tappeto."
KO: "융단 폭격 개시!"
ZH: "\n炸碎這些地毯式炸彈，哈哈…"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat09Subtitle
US: "*Enemy air defenses are thick herewe are taking heavy damage"
DE: "*Enemy air defenses are thick herewe are taking heavy damage"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas defensas aéreas del enemigo están causando daños importantes."
IT: "\nLa contraerea nemica è impenetrabile, stiamo subendo gravi danni."
KO: "적의 대공 방어가 두터워서 피해가 큽니다."
ZH: "\n敵軍此處的空中防禦系統嚴密，造成我們損失慘重。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat10Subtitle
US: "*Stinger sites have locked onto uswe are in trouble!"
DE: "*Stinger sites have locked onto uswe are in trouble!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos emplazamientos Stinger nos apuntan... ¡Tenemos problemas!"
IT: "\nStinger bloccati su di noi, siamo nei guai!"
KO: "스팅어 사이트가 우리를 정조준했습니다!"
ZH: "\n我們已被針刺飛彈鎖定，這下麻煩大了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat11Subtitle
US: "*Stop that Rebel, he's trying to capture our bunker!"
DE: "*Stop that Rebel, he's trying to capture our bunker!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Hay que detener a ese rebelde! ¡Pretende tomar nuestro búnker!"
IT: "\nFermate quel Ribelle, sta cercando di conquistare il bunker!"
KO: "저 반군을 막아라! 우리의 벙커를 점령하려 한다!"
ZH: "\n殺了那個反抗軍，他企圖佔領我方碉堡！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat12Subtitle
US: "*It isn't a Battlemaster, but it will have to do"
DE: "*It isn't a Battlemaster, but it will have to do"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNo es un Battlemaster, pero tendremos que apañárnoslas."
IT: "\nNon è un Battlemaster, ma dovrà bastare."
KO: "이건 배틀 마스터는 아니지만 쓸만하겠는걸."
ZH: "\n這不是戰神坦克，但充其量還是輛坦克。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat13Subtitle
US: "*I prefer my Gattling Tank"
DE: "*I prefer my Gattling Tank"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nPrefiero mi tanque Gattling."
IT: "***"
KO: "내 개틀링 탱크가 훨씬 좋군."
ZH: "\n我比較喜歡我的蓋特坦克。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat14Subtitle
US: "*Another GLA wave!"
DE: "*Another GLA wave!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Otra carga del GLA!"
IT: "\nUn'altra ondata dell'ELG!"
KO: "GLA의 공격이 재개된다!"
ZH: "\n另一波全球解放軍的攻擊來了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat15Subtitle
US: "*We must protect our bunkers!"
DE: "*We must protect our bunkers!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Debemos proteger nuestros búnkeres!"
IT: "\nDobbiamo proteggere i nostri Bunker!"
KO: "우리의 벙커를 사수해야 한다!"
ZH: "\n我們必須守住碉堡的防線！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat15aSubtitle
US: "*We must protect the nuclear reactor!"
DE: "*We must protect the nuclear reactor!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Debemos proteger el reactor nuclear!"
IT: "\nDobbiamo proteggere il Reattore nucleare!"
KO: "원자력 발전소를 사수해야 한다!"
ZH: "\n我們必須保護核子反應爐的安全！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat16Subtitle
US: "*Now we will show them how to attack a base!"
DE: "*Now we will show them how to attack a base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Vamos a enseñarles a atacar una base!"
IT: "\nOra gli mostreremo come si attacca una base!"
KO: "기지 공격은 어떻게 하는 건지 보여주마!"
ZH: "\n現在讓你們見勢一下什麼叫做直搗黃巢！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat17Subtitle
US: "*Reinforcements! We are glad to see you!"
DE: "*Reinforcements! We are glad to see you!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Refuerzos! ¡Nos alegramos de veros!"
IT: "\nRinforzi! Siamo felici di vedervi!"
KO: "지원군이다! 정말 와줘서 고맙군."
ZH: "\n援軍來了！真高興看到你們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xChat18Subtitle
US: "*We are ready for your orders, General. Where do you need us?"
DE: "*We are ready for your orders, General. Where do you need us?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nListos para las órdenes, general. ¿Dónde nos quieres?"
IT: "\nSiamo in attesa di ordini, generale. Dove dobbiamo andare?"
KO: "명령만 내려주십시오, 장군님."
ZH: "\n我們隨時聽從您的指示，將軍。有什麼可以為您效勞的嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin01Subtitle
US: "*We must be on our guard. Reports say the GLA might attack as revenge for our entering the war"
DE: "*We must be on our guard. Reports say the GLA might attack as revenge for our entering the war"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDebemos estar alerta. Los informes dicen que el GLA podría atacarnos\ncomo venganza por entrar en la guerra."
IT: "\nDobbiamo stare in guardia, l'ELG potrebbe vendicarsi."
KO: "방어를 강화해야 합니다. GLA가 우리의 참전에 복수하기 위해 공격을 준비한다고 합니다."
ZH: "\n我們必須提防全球解放軍，情報顯示他們很可能為了我們參戰一事展開報復攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin01aSubtitle
US: "*I don't feel safe guarding this nuclear plant"
DE: "*I don't feel safe guarding this nuclear plant"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNo me siento a salvo protegiendo esta central nuclear"
IT: "\nNon mi sento al sicuro, qui di guardia a questo impianto nucleare."
KO: "원자력 발전소를 지키는 건 위험한 일인것 같군."
ZH: "\n我覺得守衛核電廠亂不安全的"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin01bSubtitle
US: "*Yah. I wish I had joined up with the air force instead"
DE: "*Yah. I wish I had joined up with the air force instead"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSí. Ojalá me hubiese alistado en las fuerzas aéreas."
IT: "\nGià. Vorrei essermi arruolato in aeronautica."
KO: "맞아, 공군에 지원했어야 하는 건데."
ZH: "\n是啊，真希望我加入的是空軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin01dSubtitle
US: "*Surely after our recent victory they would not dare to attack us here"
DE: "*Surely after our recent victory they would not dare to attack us here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTras nuestra reciente victoria, no creo que osen atacarnos aquí."
IT: "\nCerto, dopo la nostra recente vittoria non oserebbero mai colpirci qui."
KO: "하지만 최근에 우리가 계속 승리했으니 놈들은 감히 우릴 공격하지 못할 거야."
ZH: "\n相信我方在贏得最近一場勝利後，他們絕不敢再越雷池一步。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin01cSubtitle
US: "*Their food is much better. And they get to wear those fancy helmets"
DE: "*Their food is much better. And they get to wear those fancy helmets"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSu comida es mucho mejor. Y pueden llevar esos cascos tan elegantes."
IT: "\nIl loro cibo è decisamente migliore. E indossano quegli elmetti alla moda..."
KO: "놈들은 우리보다 더 잘 먹고 멋진 헬멧도 쓰는군."
ZH: "\n他們的伙食比我們豐盛，而且穿戴的盔甲也比較炫。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin02Subtitle
US: "*GLA forces! We're under attack!"
DE: "*GLA forces! We're under attack!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Fuerzas del GLA! ¡Nos atacan!"
IT: "\nUnità ELG! Siamo sotto attacco!"
KO: "GLA다! 공격당하고 있다!"
ZH: "\n全球解放軍部隊來襲！我們正遭受突襲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin03Subtitle
US: "*They're everywhere! We're being overrun"
DE: "*They're everywhere! We're being overrun"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Están por todas partes! Nos están superando"
IT: "\nSono dappertutto! Ci stanno schiacciando!"
KO: "놈들이 사방에 있다! 우리가 밀리고 있다!"
ZH: "\n他們從四面八方而來！我方被敵軍慘電。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin04Subtitle
US: "*Another wave! We need reinforcements!"
DE: "*Another wave! We need reinforcements!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Otra carga! ¡Necesitamos refuerzos!"
IT: "\nUn'altra ondata! Servono rinforzi!"
KO: "적이 쇄도한다! 지원군이 필요하다!"
ZH: "\n另一波攻擊來襲！我們需要增援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin04aSubtitle
US: "*Another wave! They've got bomb trucks and terrorists! We need reinforcements!"
DE: "*Another wave! They've got bomb trucks and terrorists! We need reinforcements!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Otra carga! ¡Tienen camiones bomba y terroristas! ¡Necesitamos refuerzos!"
IT: "\nNe arrivano degli altri! Hanno Camion-bomba e Terroristi! Servono rinforzi!"
KO: "적 병력이 쇄도한다! 폭탄 트럭과 테러리스트가 몰려온다! 지원이 필요하다!"
ZH: "\n又一波攻擊！敵軍的炸彈卡車以及恐怖份子來襲！我們需要增援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin04bSubtitle
US: "*Another wave! They're using suicide tactics! Where are those reinforcements?!"
DE: "*Another wave! They're using suicide tactics! Where are those reinforcements?!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Otra carga! ¡Emplean tácticas suicidas! ¡¿Dónde están esos refuerzos?!"
IT: "\nUn'altra ondata! Usano tattiche suicide, dove sono quei dannati rinforzi?"
KO: "적이 또 쇄도하고 있다! 자살 전술을 쓰고있다! 지원군은 언제 도착하지?"
ZH: "\n又一波襲擊！他們運用自殺策略進行毀滅性攻擊！我們的增援到底在哪？！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin05Subtitle
US: "*We've lost the airfield!"
DE: "*We've lost the airfield!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Hemos perdido el aeródromo!"
IT: "\nAbbiamo perso l'aeroporto!"
KO: "공군력을 상실했다!"
ZH: "\n我方機場淪陷了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin06Subtitle
US: "*They're trying to get to the storage bunkers! Protect them at all costs!"
DE: "*They're trying to get to the storage bunkers! Protect them at all costs!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Van a por los búnkeres de almacenamiento!\n¡Hay que protegerlos a cualquier precio!"
IT: "\nCercano di arrivare ai bunker! Difendiamoli!"
KO: "놈들이 저장 벙커로 오고 있다! 무슨 일이 있어도 방어해라!"
ZH: "\n他們企圖搶攻儲存碉堡！不惜一切代價保護碉堡！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin06aSubtitle
US: "*They're trying to get to the main reactor! Protect it at all costs!"
DE: "*They're trying to get to the main reactor! Protect it at all costs!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Quieren alcanzar el reactor principal! ¡Hay que protegerlo a toda costa!"
IT: "\nSi dirigono verso il reattore! Proteggiamolo!"
KO: "놈들이 주 발전소로 오고 있다! 무슨 일이 있어도 방어해라!"
ZH: "\n他們試圖逼近我方主反應爐！誓死守住反應爐！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin07Subtitle
US: "*The Command Centerthey got the Command Center"
DE: "*The Command Centerthey got the Command Center"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl centro de mando... Tienen el centro de mando."
IT: "\nIl Centro comando! Hanno conquistato il Centro comando."
KO: "놈들이 커맨드 센터를 점령한다!"
ZH: "\n天啊，他們攻入指揮中心了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin08Subtitle
US: "*We held remaining forces report in"
DE: "*We held remaining forces report in"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTenemos... Informen fuerzas restantes..."
IT: "\nLe forze residue facciano rapporto."
KO: "남은 병력을 보고하라."
ZH: "\n我們殘餘的軍隊到了…"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin09Subtitle
US: "*Not much left. We're going to need reinforcements"
DE: "*Not much left. We're going to need reinforcements"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNo quedan muchos. Vamos a necesitar refuerzos."
IT: "\nNon siamo rimasti in molti: serviranno dei rinforzi."
KO: "많지 않다. 병력 지원이 필요하다."
ZH: "\n彈藥及兵力所剩不多，我們急需增援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xCin10Subtitle
US: "*The message got through, but we'll have to hold until they get here"
DE: "*The message got through, but we'll have to hold until they get here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl mensaje llegó, pero tendremos que resistir hasta que acudan"
IT: "\nIl messaggio è partito, dobbiamo resistere fino al loro arrivo."
KO: "요청이 접수되었다. 하지만 지원군이 도착할 때까지 버텨내야 한다."
ZH: "\n訊息已經傳達出去，但是我們必須苦撐等候增援前來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO01Subtitle
US: "*General, our reinforcements have arrived!"
DE: "*General, our reinforcements have arrived!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, los refuerzos han llegado!"
IT: "\nGenerale, i rinforzi sono arrivati!"
KO: "장군님, 지원군이 도착했습니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，我方增援已經抵達！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO02Subtitle
US: "*General, GLA forces are attacking the bunkers"
DE: "*General, GLA forces are attacking the bunkers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, fuerzas del GLA atacan los búnkeres."
IT: "\nGenerale, le forze dell'ELG assaltano i bunker!"
KO: "장군님, GLA 병력이 벙커를 공격하고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍部隊正在攻擊我方碉堡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO02aSubtitle
US: "*General, GLA forces are attacking the nuclear plant!"
DE: "*General, GLA forces are attacking the nuclear plant!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, fuerzas del GLA atacan la central nuclear!"
IT: "\nGenerale, le forze dell'ELG assaltano l'impianto nucleare!"
KO: "장군님, GLA 병력이 핵 발전소를 공격하고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍部隊正在攻擊我方核電廠！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO03Subtitle
US: "*The GLA is attempting to capture one of our bunkers"
DE: "*The GLA is attempting to capture one of our bunkers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA trata de tomar uno de nuestros búnkeres."
IT: "\nL'ELG sta cercando di conquistare uno dei nostri bunker."
KO: "GLA가 우리 벙커 하나를 점령하려고 합니다."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍正試圖佔領我方碉堡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO04Subtitle
US: "*General, this bunker is badly damaged. May I suggest it be repaired before another GLA attack"
DE: "*General, this bunker is badly damaged. May I suggest it be repaired before another GLA attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, este búnker está muy dañado. Sugiero repararlo antes de que el GLA vuelva a atacar."
IT: "\nGenerale, questo bunker è gravemente danneggiato: andrebbe riparato, prima di un nuovo assalto dell'ELG."
KO: "장군님, 이 벙커는 심하게 손상되었습니다. GLA 공격이 재개되기 전에 수리되어야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，這座碉堡損失慘重，我建議應在全球解放軍另一波攻擊來臨之前儘速修復。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO04aSubtitle
US: "*General, our nuclear plant is badly damaged. May I suggest it be repaired before another GLA attack"
DE: "*General, our nuclear plant is badly damaged. May I suggest it be repaired before another GLA attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, nuestra central nuclear está muy dañada. Sugiero repararla antes de que el GLA vuelva a atacar."
IT: "\nGenerale, l'impianto nucleare è gravemente danneggiato: andrebbe riparato, prima di un nuovo assalto dell'ELG."
KO: "장군님, 핵 발전소가 심하게 손상되었습니다. 다음 번 GLA 공격 전에 수리하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，我方核電廠受創嚴重，我建議應在全球解放軍另一波攻擊來臨之前儘速修復。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO05Subtitle
US: "*General, that last attack severely weakened several bunkers. If one of them is destroyed, the GLA will win this encounter"
DE: "*General, that last attack severely weakened several bunkers. If one of them is destroyed, the GLA will win this encounter"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el último ataque debilitó mucho varios búnkeres. Si destruyen alguno, el GLA ganará este enfrentamiento"
IT: "\nSe uno dei bunker sarà distrutto, l'ELG avrà vinto."
KO: "\n장군님, 저번 공격으로 몇몇 벙커들이 심하게 손상되었습니다. 벙커가 하나라도 파괴되면\nGLA가 승리하게 됩니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍最後一波攻擊嚴重地削弱我方數座碉堡防線，如果任何一座碉堡遭到摧毀，敵軍將贏\n得這場遭遇戰的勝利"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO05aSubtitle
US: "*General, that last attack severely weakened the nuclear plant. If it is destroyed, we will fail our mission!"
DE: "*General, that last attack severly weakened the nuclear plant. If it is destroyed, we will fail our mission!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el último ataque debilitó mucho la central nuclear. ¡Si la destruyen, nuestra misión fracasará!"
IT: "\nGenerale, l'ultimo assalto ha indebolito seriamente l'impianto nucleare: se sarà distrutto, l'ELG avrà vinto."
KO: "\n장군님, 저번 공격으로 핵 발전소가 크게 손상되었습니다. 만약 파괴된다면 우리의 임무는\n실패합니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，敵軍最後一波攻擊使核電廠嚴重受損，如果核電廠遭摧毀，任務即告失敗！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO06Subtitle
US: "*WarningGLA forces moving towards the bunkers"
DE: "*WarningGLA forces moving towards the bunkers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAlerta... Fuerzas del GLA avanzan hacia los búnkeres."
IT: "ATTENZIONE:\nForze ELG dirette verso i bunker."
KO: "경고: GLA가 벙커로 접근중"
ZH: "\n警告：全球解放軍部隊正朝碉堡方向前進。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO06aSubtitle
US: "*WarningGLA forces are moving towards the power plant!"
DE: "*WarningGLA forces are moving towards the power plant!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAlerta... Fuerzas del GLA avanzan hacia la central eléctrica."
IT: "ATTENZIONE:\nForze ELG dirette verso la centrale energetica."
KO: "경고: GLA가 발전소로 접근중"
ZH: "\n警告：全球解放軍部隊正朝核電廠方向前進。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO07Subtitle
US: "*General, I've made contact with one of our spy outposts. They are under GLA attack. If we can rescue them, I can patch into their system and we will be able to call in carpet bombers"
DE: "*General, I've made contact with one of our spy outposts. They are under GLA attack. If we can rescue them, I can patch into their system and we will be able to call in carpet bombers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, he contactado con uno de nuestros puestos espía.\nLes está atacando el GLA.\nSi les rescatamos, puedo entrar en su sistema y pedir bombarderos a nivel."
IT: "\nDifendete l'avamposto:\notterrete un Bombardamento a tappeto!"
KO: "\n장군님, 스파이 아웃포스트와 접촉했는데, 지금 GLA의 공격을 받고 있다고 합니다.\n그들을 구해내면 그들의 시스템에 접속하여 융단 폭격을 요청할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我已與間諜通訊站取得聯繫，他們正遭受全球解放軍的襲擊。如果我們前去拯救他們，我可以修\n復系統，並呼叫地毯式炸彈轟炸進行反擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO08Subtitle
US: "*General, if you can secure that spy outpost, it will allow you to direct carpet bombing runs on the GLA forces"
DE: "*General, if you can secure that spy outpost, it will allow you to direct carpet bombing runs on the GLA forces"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, con ese puesto espía podríamos dirigir bombarderos a nivel\ncontra las fuerzas del GLA."
IT: "\nConquistate l'avamposto:\notterrete un Bombardamento a tappeto!"
KO: "\n장군님, 스파이 아웃포스트와 접촉했는데, 지금 GLA의 공격을 받고 있다고 합니다.\n그들을 구해내면 그들의 시스템에 접속하여 융단 폭격을 요청할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，如果你能保護間諜站的安全，將能呼叫地毯式炸彈轟炸，對抗全球解放軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI02xXO09Subtitle
US: "*General, now that our reinforcements have arrived it is time to eliminate the GLA from this area"
DE: "*General, now that our reinforcements have arrived it is time to eliminate the GLA from this area"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, ahora que han llegado los refuerzos es el momento de eliminar al GLA\nde esta área."
IT: "\nGenerale, ora dobbiamo spazzare via l'ELG."
KO: "장군님, 지원군이 도착했으니 이제 이 지역에서 GLA를 섬멸할 때가 왔습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，既然援軍已經抵達，該是我們肅清本區全球解放軍的時刻了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisChi03RedChat12Subtitle
US: "*To battle!"
DE: "*To battle!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡A la carga!"
IT: "\nIn battaglia!"
KO: "전쟁이다!"
ZH: "\n作戰！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisChi03RedChat19Subtitle
US: "*Bring in the tanks! Level them!"
DE: "*Bring in the tanks! Level them!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Que vengan los tanques! ¡Aplastadles!"
IT: "\nFate avanzare i carri! Distruggeteli!"
KO: "탱크를 가져와! 적을 뭉개버리자!"
ZH: "\n亮出我們的戰車！把他們夷為平地！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xBrf01Subtitle
US: "*Greetings, Commander. Now that we have thwarted the GLA's counterattack, it is time to press our advantage!"
DE: "*Greetings, Commander. Now that we have thwarted the GLA's counterattack, it is time to press our advantage!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSaludos, comandante. ¡Tras rechazar el contraataque del GLA, podemos aumentar nuestra ventaja!"
IT: "***"
KO: "안녕하십니까, 사령관님. GLA의 공격을 물리쳤으니 이제 우리가 공격할 차례입니다!"
ZH: "\n您好，指揮官。由於我方使得全球解放軍的反擊遭受挫敗，現在該是我們祭出殺手鐧的時候了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xBrf02Subtitle
US: "*We must liberate this town from the GLA's clutches"
DE: "*We must liberate this town from the GLA's clutches"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDebemos liberar esta ciudad de las garras del GLA."
IT: "\nDobbiamo liberare la città dalla presenza dell'ELG."
KO: "이 마을을 GLA의 손아귀에서 해방시켜야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我們必須解救這個城鎮使其脫離全球解放軍的魔掌。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xBrf03Subtitle
US: "*There is a very heavily defended GLA base north of the river. We must destroy it, but it will not be an easy task"
DE: "*There is a very heavily defended GLA base north of the river. We must destroy it, but it will not be an easy task"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAl norte del río hay una base del GLA muy protegida. Debemos destruirla, pero no será tarea fácil."
IT: "\nA nord del fiume c'è una base dell'ELG pesantemente difesa: dobbiamo distruggerla, ma non sarà facile."
KO: "\n강 북쪽에 방어가 탄탄한 GLA 기지가 있습니다. 이를 파괴해야 하는데, 결코 쉬운 임무가\n아닐 겁니다."
ZH: "\n在河的北方有一座防禦極為嚴密的全球解放軍基地。我們必須將它摧毀，但這不是件容易的任務。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xBrf04Subtitle
US: "*Our operations have attracted much attention from the rest of the world, and we will be watched closely. The longer this battle goes on, the lower our International Opinion will fall"
DE: "*Our operations have attracted much attention from the rest of the world, and we will be watched closely. The longer this battle goes on, the lower our International Opinion will fall"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTras nuestras operaciones, el resto del mundo nos estará observando. Cuanto más dure esta batalla, más caerá nuestra reputación internacional."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n우리의 작전은 전 세계의 관심을 끌고 있습니다. 작전을 오래 끌수록 국제 여론은\n악화될 것입니다."
ZH: "\n我們的軍事行動已經吸引世界其他各國的許多目光，並備受高度關切。這場戰役若是持續愈久，我們的\n國際聲望就會掉得愈低。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xBrf05Subtitle
US: "*Damage to civilian property must be avoided. Our operation must be precise, and swift. Destruction of GLA forces will cause International Opinion to rise, in our favor"
DE: "*Damage to civilian property must be avoided. Our operation must be precise, and swift. Destruction of GLA forces will cause International Opinion to rise, in our favor"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHay que evitar todo daño a la propiedad civil. Debemos ser rápidos y precisos. Destruir las fuerzas del GLA hará que aumente nuestra reputación internacional."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n민간인의 생명과 재산에 피해가 생겨서는 안됩니다.\n정밀하고 신속한 작전으로 GLA 병력을 파괴하면 국제 여론을 우호적으로 만들 것입니다."
ZH: "\n此次行動講求快和準，應避免對平民的身家財產造成任何損失。殲滅全球解放軍的部隊，將提昇國際聲\n望，對我們相當有利。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xBrf09Subtitle
US: "*If our International Opinion becomes high enough, the people of the town might join our cause"
DE: "*If our International Opinion becomes high enough, the people of the town might join our cause"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSi nuestra reputación internacional aumenta lo suficiente, los ciudadanos podrían unirse a nuestra causa."
IT: "\nSe la reputazione internazionale salirà a sufficienza, gli abitanti della città potrebbero unirsi alla nostra causa."
KO: "우리에 대한 국제 여론이 충분히 높이 향상되면, 마을의 사람들도 우리에게 동조할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n如果我們國際聲望夠高的話，這個城鎮的人民將起而加入我們的行列。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xBrf10Subtitle
US: "*It will then be easy to annihilate the GLA's defenses"
DE: "*It will then be easy to annihilate the GLA's defenses"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAsí sería fácil aniquilar las defensas del GLA."
IT: "\nAllora sarà facile annientare le difese dell'ELG."
KO: "그러면 GLA의 방어를 무너뜨리기가 쉬워질 것입니다."
ZH: "\n如此一來，瓦解全球解放軍的防禦將是指日可待。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat01Subtitle
US: "*They must have a camouflaged Tunnel Network near here"
DE: "*They must have a camouflaged Tunnel Network near here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDeben tener una red de túneles oculta cerca de aquí..."
IT: "\nQui vicino dev'esserci una Rete di tunnel mimetizzata."
KO: "그들은 이곳 근처에 위장 터널 네트워크를 가지고 있을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n他們必定在此地擁有偽裝能力的地道網路系統。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat02Subtitle
US: "*They've ambushed us!"
DE: "*They've ambushed us!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nos han tendido una emboscada!"
IT: "\nCi hanno teso un'imboscata!"
KO: "적의 매복입니다!"
ZH: "\n他們突襲我們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat03Subtitle
US: "*They've ambushed our base!"
DE: "*They've ambushed our base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Han tendido una emboscada en nuestra base!"
IT: "\nHanno teso un'imboscata alla nostra base!"
KO: "적 매복 병력이 우리 기지에 출현했습니다!"
ZH: "\n他們突襲我方基地！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat04Subtitle
US: "*We have found their secret base!"
DE: "*We have found their secret base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Hemos encontrado su base secreta!"
IT: "\nAbbiamo trovato la loro base segreta!"
KO: "적의 비밀 기지를 발견했습니다!"
ZH: "\n我們已發現敵軍的秘密基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat05Subtitle
US: "*They are coming from the far side of the lake"
DE: "*They are coming from the far side of the lake"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nVienen del lado más alejado del lago."
IT: "\nArrivano dalla sponda opposta del lago."
KO: "호수의 저편에서 적이 오고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n他們從湖的遠方而來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat06Subtitle
US: "*Their troops must be hidden in the forest"
DE: "*Their troops must be hidden in the forest"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSus tropas deben estar escondidas en el bosque."
IT: "\nLe loro forze devono essere nascoste nella foresta."
KO: "숲에 적 병력이 숨어있을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n他們的部隊勢必隱藏在森林的某處。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat07Subtitle
US: "*I wonder what's across the river"
DE: "*I wonder what's across the river"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMe pregunto qué hay al otro lado del río..."
IT: "\nMi chiedo cosa ci sia al di là del fiume."
KO: "강 저편에 무엇이 있는지 궁금합니다."
ZH: "\n我不懂是什麼渡過河而來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat08Subtitle
US: "*Their hit-and-run attacks are proving inconvenient"
DE: "*Their hit-and-run attacks are proving inconvenient"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSus ataques sorpresa resultan incómodos."
IT: "\nLe loro tattiche mordi-e-fuggi sono davvero fastidiose."
KO: "적들의 치고 빠지는 공격이 매우 성가십니다."
ZH: "\n他們的打跑戰術顯然造成相當程度的困擾。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat09Subtitle
US: "*The buggies are back!"
DE: "*The buggies are back!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Vuelven los buggies!"
IT: "\nLe buggy sono tornate!"
KO: "버기들이 돌아왔습니다!"
ZH: "\n吉普車又回來了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat10Subtitle
US: "*Sneak attack!"
DE: "*Sneak attack!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Ataque furtivo!"
IT: "\nAttacco furtivo!"
KO: "잠입 공격입니다!"
ZH: "\n偷襲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat11Subtitle
US: "*Crush that Inferno Cannon!"
DE: "*Crush that Inferno Cannon!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Destruid ese cañón Inferno!"
IT: "\nDistruggete quel Cannone Inferno!"
KO: "인퍼노 캐논을 파괴하라!"
ZH: "\n快碾碎地獄火加農砲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat12Subtitle
US: "*The people are too afraid to come out from their homes"
DE: "*The people are too afraid to come out from their homes"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa gente está demasiado asustada para salir de casa."
IT: "\nLa gente ha troppa paura per uscire di casa."
KO: "주민들은 두려워서 집에서 나오지를 못합니다."
ZH: "\n人民都嚇得不敢踏出家門一步。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xChat13Subtitle
US: "*We must free them from this oppression!"
DE: "*We must free them from this oppression!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Debemos liberarles de esta opresión!"
IT: "\nDobbiamo liberarli dall'oppressore!"
KO: "우리는 이들을 압제에서 해방시켜야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n我們必須讓他們掙脫敵軍的壓迫！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO01Subtitle
US: "*The people rise to support us!"
DE: "*The people rise to support us!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡La gente se levanta para apoyarnos!"
IT: "\nLa gente si solleva per aiutarci!"
KO: "주민들이 우리를 지지하며 봉기했습니다!"
ZH: "\n人民都起而支持我們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO10Subtitle
US: "*General. Destroying the GLA statues will be critical to increasing our International Opinion and will boost support of our efforts amongst the population"
DE: "*General. Destroying the GLA statues will be critical to increasing our International Opinion and will boost support of our efforts amongst the population"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, destruir las estatuas del GLA nos dará una reputación internacional favorable, y disparará el apoyo de la población."
IT: "\nGenerale, distruggete le statue dell'ELG."
KO: "장군님, GLA 동상을 파괴하면 국제 여론이 향상되고 주민들의 협조를 이끌어낼 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，摧毀全球解放軍雕像將可決定性的影響我們國際聲望的提昇，並且拉抬人民對我們所付出的支持。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO11Subtitle
US: "*They have dispatched a Toxic Tractor to clear our garrisonned structures!"
DE: "*They have dispatched a Toxic Tractor to clear our garrisonned structures!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Han enviado un tractor de toxinas para limpiar nuestros edificios guarnecidos!"
IT: "\nHanno inviato un Contaminatore per eliminare le truppe di presidio nelle strutture!"
KO: "독소 트랙터가 우리의 건물 주둔 병력을 공격하러 오고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n他們已派遣毒素車前來剿毀我方駐守的建築！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO12Subtitle
US: "*Our Dragon Tanks will be a high priority targetguard them well"
DE: "*Our Dragon Tanks will be a high priority targetguard them well"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestros tanques Dragon son su objetivo principal... Protégelos."
IT: "\nI nostri carri Dragon saranno un bersaglio primario: sorvegliateli a dovere."
KO: "우리의 드래곤 탱크는 매우 중요하므로 잘 방어해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我方的火龍坦克將是敵軍第一順位的攻擊目標。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO13Subtitle
US: "*Well done, sir. The destruction of the statue has caused world opinion to rise"
DE: "*Well done, sir. The destruction of the statue has caused world opinion to rise"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBien hecho, señor. Nuestra reputación internacional es mayor tras destruir la estatua."
IT: "\nBen fatto! La nostra reputazione è migliorata."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 동상의 파괴로 국제 여론이 우리에게 우호적이 되었습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，長官。雕像的摧毀使得我們國際聲望上揚。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO16Subtitle
US: "*Do not let them destroy the buildings!"
DE: "*Do not let them destroy the buildings!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡No permitas que destruyan los edificios!"
IT: "\nNon lasciate che distruggano gli edifici!"
KO: "적들이 건물을 파괴하지 못하게 막으십시오!"
ZH: "\n不要讓他們摧毀建築！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO17Subtitle
US: "*Use the Neutron Shell to clear buildings without damaging them"
DE: "*Use the Neutron Shell to clear buildings without damaging them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEmplea el proyectil de neutrones para limpiar edificios sin dañarlos."
IT: "\nUsate i Proiettili ai neutroni per ripulire le strutture senza danneggiarle."
KO: "중성자탄을 이용하여 건물을 파괴하지 않고 적들을 제거하십시오."
ZH: "\n使用中子砲彈清除建築內敵軍，並保持建築完好。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO18Subtitle
US: "*Beware! Their defensive structures are hidden with camo-netting"
DE: "*Beware! Their defensive structures are hidden with camo-netting"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Cuidado! Sus edificios defensivos están ocultos con una red de camuflaje."
IT: "\nAttenzione! Le loro strutture difensive sono sotto una rete mimetica."
KO: "조심하십시오! 적들의 방어 건물은 위장망으로 가려져 있습니다."
ZH: "\n小心！敵軍利用偽裝網將防禦建築隱藏起來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO19Subtitle
US: "*General, the GLA have the city well-defended. We need to clear them out"
DE: "*General, the GLA have the city well-defended. We need to clear them out"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el GLA tiene bien protegida la ciudad. Tenemos que echarlos de ahí."
IT: "\nGenerale, annientate le difese nemiche."
KO: "장군님, GLA는 도시에 튼튼한 방어시설을 구축했습니다. 그들을 제거해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍嚴密防禦此城市，因此我們必須將他們殲滅。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO20Subtitle
US: "*You're making good progress, Commander. Much of the city is now free of GLA control"
DE: "*You're making good progress, Commander. Much of the city is now free of GLA control"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nProgresas a buen ritmo. Buena parte de la ciudad ya está libre del GLA."
IT: "\nState andando bene, comandante! Continuate così!"
KO: "잘 하고 계십니다, 사령관님. 도시 대부분이 GLA의 통제에서 벗어났습니다."
ZH: "\n您的攻擊行動獲得相當大的進展，指揮官。城市中大部分區域皆已脫離全球解放軍的控制。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO21Subtitle
US: "*Sir! The city is rising up against our foes!"
DE: "*Sir! The city is rising up against our foes!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor! ¡La ciudad se subleva contra el enemigo!"
IT: "\nSignore! La città si è sollevata contro il nemico!"
KO: "장군님! 시민들이 우리의 적에 항거하고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n長官！城市的人民已群起抵抗我們的敵人！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO22Subtitle
US: "*General, we must clear the GLA from this area!"
DE: "*General, we must clear the GLA from this area!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Debemos eliminar al GLA de esta área!"
IT: "\nGenerale, dobbiamo spazzare via l'ELG da questa zona!"
KO: "장군님, 이 지역에서 GLA를 제거해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，我們必須肅清此區的全球解放軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI03xXO23Subtitle
US: "*Our International Opinion is high. Great work!"
DE: "*Our International Opinion is high. Great work!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestra reputación internacional es alta. ¡Buen trabajo!"
IT: "\nLa nostra reputazione internazionale è elevata: ottimo lavoro!"
KO: "우리의 국제 여론이 매우 향상되었습니다. 잘하셨습니다."
ZH: "\n我們的國際聲望高漲，太棒了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat01Subtitle
US: "*They have almost escaped! We must stop them!"
DE: "*They have almost escaped! We must stop them!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Casi han escapado! ¡Debemos detenerles!"
IT: "\nSono quasi fuggiti, dobbiamo fermarli!"
KO: "적들이 거의 탈출했습니다! 이를 막아야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n敵軍幾乎都逃跑了！我們必須抓住他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat010Subtitle
US: "*They are skirting the lake. Intercept them!"
DE: "*They are skirting the lake. Intercept them!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEstán bordeando el lago. ¡Intercéptalos!"
IT: "\nStanno fiancheggiando il lago. Intercettateli!"
KO: "적들이 호수를 공격하고 있습니다. 그들을 막으십시오!"
ZH: "\n他們正繞過河的邊緣地帶，快截斷他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat011Subtitle
US: "*They're coming for our base!"
DE: "*They're coming for our base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Vienen por nuestra base!"
IT: "\nStanno puntando alla nostra base!"
KO: "적들이 기지를 공격하러 오고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n他們正前往我方基地！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat012Subtitle
US: "*We have stopped the first wave of GLA!"
DE: "*We have stopped the first wave of GLA!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Hemos rechazado el primer ataque del GLA!"
IT: "\nAbbiamo fermato la prima ondata dell'ELG!"
KO: "GLA의 첫번째 공격을 막았습니다!"
ZH: "\n我們阻擋了全球解放軍第一波的攻勢！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat013Subtitle
US: "*Again we have put them in their place!"
DE: "*Again we have put them in their place!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Otra vez les hemos puesto en su sitio!"
IT: "\nGli abbiamo insegnato a stare al loro posto!"
KO: "GLA의 공격을 다시 한번 막았습니다!"
ZH: "\n我們又再一次取代他們的地位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat014Subtitle
US: "*No one can stand to the might of China!"
DE: "*No one can stand to the might of China!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nadie se resiste al poder de China!"
IT: "\nNessuno può resistere alla potenza della Cina!"
KO: "중국의 힘에 대항할 자는 없다!"
ZH: "\n沒有人可以對抗中國的強權！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat015Subtitle
US: "*Sun Tzu would be proud"
DE: "*Sun Tzu would be proud"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSun Tzu estaría orgulloso."
IT: "\nSun Tzu sarebbe fiero di voi."
KO: "손자병법은 우리 민족이 만든 거라구!"
ZH: "\n連中國的孫子都會翹起大拇指。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat016Subtitle
US: "*Victory is ours!"
DE: "*Victory is ours!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡La victoria es nuestra!"
IT: "\nLa vittoria è nostra!"
KO: "승리는 우리의 것이다!"
ZH: "\n勝利是屬於我們的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat017Subtitle
US: "*None shall pass"
DE: "*None shall pass"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNadie pasará."
IT: "\nNon passerà nessuno!"
KO: "누구도 여기를 통과할 수 없다."
ZH: "\n沒有人過得了這一關。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat018Subtitle
US: "*We will banish them from the skies!"
DE: "*We will banish them from the skies!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Les aniquilaremos desde los cielos!"
IT: "\nLi spazzeremo via dai cieli!"
KO: "공중에서 놈들의 자취를 감추게 하자!"
ZH: "\n我們會將他們從空中趕走！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat019Subtitle
US: "*Our power is unsurpassed!"
DE: "*Our power is unsurpassed!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nuestro poder es insuperable!"
IT: "\nLa nostra potenza è senza pari!"
KO: "우리의 병력은 비할 데가 없다!"
ZH: "\n我們擁有無比的力量！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat02Subtitle
US: "*Cut them off at the village!"
DE: "*Cut them off at the village!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Córtales el paso en el pueblo!"
IT: "\nBloccateli al villaggio!"
KO: "마을에서 놈들을 차단하라!"
ZH: "\n切斷他們在村莊的後路。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat020Subtitle
US: "*The Helix isn't the only powerhouse"
DE: "*The Helix isn't the only powerhouse"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Helix no es el único recurso poderoso."
IT: "***"
KO: "헬릭스만 대단한 건 아니라구."
ZH: "\n我們不是只有螺旋直昇機而已。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat03Subtitle
US: "*We cannot let them get past that hill"
DE: "*We cannot let them get past that hill"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNo podemos permitir que pasen de esa colina."
IT: "\nNon possiamo lasciare che superino quella collina."
KO: "놈들이 언덕을 통과하게 해서는 안돼지."
ZH: "\n不能讓他們跨越那個山頭。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat04Subtitle
US: "*They will surely pass by here. We should defend this area"
DE: "*They will surely pass by here. We should defend this area"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSeguramente pasen por aquí. Deberíamos defender esta área."
IT: "\nPasseranno di sicuro di qua: dobbiamo difendere questa zona."
KO: "놈들이 이 지역을 지나가려 할 것이 분명하다. 이 지역을 방어해야 한다."
ZH: "\n他們百分之百會路過此地，我們就在此守株待兔吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat05Subtitle
US: "*Here is another choke point"
DE: "*Here is another choke point"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAquí hay otro cuello de botella."
IT: "\nEcco un altro passaggio obbligato."
KO: "이곳이 중요한 길목이군."
ZH: "\n這裡是另一個瓶頸地帶。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat06Subtitle
US: "*We should secure these buildings"
DE: "*We should secure these buildings"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDeberíamos asegurar estos edificios."
IT: "\nDovremmo prendere il controllo di queste strutture."
KO: "이 건물들을 확보해야 된다."
ZH: "\n我們應該安全佔領這些建築。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat07Subtitle
US: "*What are they doing?"
DE: "*What are they doing?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¿Qué están haciendo?"
IT: "***"
KO: "놈들이 뭘 하는 거지?"
ZH: "\n他們在幹嘛？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat08Subtitle
US: "*Watch out for the toxin!"
DE: "*Watch out for the toxin!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Cuidado con la toxina!"
IT: "\nAttenzione alla tossina!"
KO: "독소를 조심해!"
ZH: "\n小心毒素車！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat09Subtitle
US: "*We've been ambushed!"
DE: "*We've been ambushed!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nos han tendido una emboscada!"
IT: "\nCi hanno teso un'imboscata!"
KO: "적 매복이다!"
ZH: "\n我們遭到埋伏了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat15Subtitle
US: "*Our forces are in position. We are ready for anything"
DE: "*Our forces are in position. We are ready for anything"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestras fuerzas están en posición. Estamos listos para cualquier cosa."
IT: "\nLe nostre forze sono in posizione, siamo pronti a tutto."
KO: "병력 배치 완료. 어떤 임무든 맡겨주십시오."
ZH: "\n我方部隊已就戰鬥位置，聽由您的任何指示。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xChat16Subtitle
US: "*They are stronger than we thought. We need air support. Send in the Helix now!"
DE: "*They are stronger than we thought. We need air support. Send in the Helix now!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSon más fuertes de lo previsto. Necesitamos apoyo aéreo. ¡Enviad el Helix, ya!"
IT: "\nSono più forti del previsto, serve supporto aereo: inviate subito l'Helix."
KO: "적은 우리 예상보다 강력합니다. 공군의 지원이 필요합니다. 헬릭스를 당장 보내주십시오!"
ZH: "\n他們比我們想像中強上許多。我們需要空中支援，立刻派遣螺旋直昇機！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO01Subtitle
US: "*The GLA is sending forth another wave!"
DE: "*The GLA is sending forth another wave!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡El GLA envía otra oleada!"
IT: "\nL'ELG sta inviando un'altra ondata!"
KO: "GLA의 다음 공격부대가 몰려옵니다!"
ZH: "\n全球解放軍正發起另一波攻擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO02Subtitle
US: "*This wave is retreating towards the north"
DE: "*This wave is retreating towards the north"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEsta oleada se retira hacia el norte."
IT: "\nQuesta ondata si sta ritirando verso nord."
KO: "적들은 북쪽으로 퇴각하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n這一波正往北撤退中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO03Subtitle
US: "*They are retreating to the northeast"
DE: "*They are retreating to the northeast"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSe retiran hacia el noreste."
IT: "\nSi stanno ritirando verso nord-est."
KO: "적들은 북동쪽으로 퇴각하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n他們往東北方撤退。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO04Subtitle
US: "*This wave is retreating to the east"
DE: "*This wave is retreating to the east"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEsta oleada se retira hacia el este."
IT: "\nQuesta ondata si sta ritirando verso est."
KO: "적들은 동쪽으로 퇴각하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n這一波正往東撤退中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO05Subtitle
US: "*The European Union is extremely pleased with our performance, General. We need to stay aggressive and eliminate the GLA"
DE: "*The European Union is extremely pleased with our performance, General. We need to stay aggressive and eliminate the GLA"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa Unión Europea está muy satisfecha con nuestra actuación. Debemos mantenernos agresivos para eliminar al GLA."
IT: "\nL'ONU è soddisfatto del vostro comportamento, generale. Dobbiamo mantenere l'iniziativa ed eliminare l'ELG."
KO: "\n유럽 연합은 우리가 거둔 성과에 매우 만족해합니다, 장군님. 더욱 공격적으로 나아가\nGLA를 섬멸해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n歐盟對於我們的表現十分激賞，將軍。我們必須保持最佳戰鬥狀態，殲滅所有全球解放軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO06Subtitle
US: "*This force was only a diversion!"
DE: "*This force was only a diversion!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Este ataque sólo era una distracción!"
IT: "\nQuesta forza era solo un diversivo!"
KO: "이 부대는 양동작전이었다!"
ZH: "\n這個部隊只有一個師的規模。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO07Subtitle
US: "*General, they have a scud storm! We must spread out our troops to deny them a target!"
DE: "*General, they have a scud storm! We must spread out our troops to deny them a target!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, tienen una tormenta SCUD! ¡Debemos dispersar las tropas para que no sean su objetivo!"
IT: "\nGenerale, hanno uno SCUD Storm! Dobbiamo far disperdere le truppe o saremo un facile bersaglio!"
KO: "장군님, 적이 스커드 폭풍을 가지고 있습니다! 병력을 분산시켜 피해를 최소화해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，他們擁有生化死雨風暴！我們必須將部隊散開，避免成為靶子！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO08Subtitle
US: "*Waitthey're not targeting us"
DE: "*Waitthey're not targeting us"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEspera... Su blanco parece ser otro..."
IT: "\nUn attimo... Non siamo noi l'obiettivo."
KO: "적이 우리를 조준하고 있지 않습니다."
ZH: "\n等一下，他們沒有以我們為攻擊目標。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO09Subtitle
US: "*The GLA have no honor! They have decimated the village to clear a path!"
DE: "*The GLA have no honor! They have decimated the village to clear a path!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡El GLA no tiene honor! ¡Han diezmado el pueblo para abrirse camino!"
IT: "\nL'ELG è senza onore! Hanno decimato il villaggio per aprirsi la strada!"
KO: "GLA는 무자비하게도 공격로 확보를 위해 마을을 날려버렸습니다!"
ZH: "\n全球解放軍毫無榮譽感可言，他們為了前進不惜殘害整個村莊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO10Subtitle
US: "*We should assemble a base to secure this region"
DE: "*We should assemble a base to secure this region"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDebemos instalar una base para controlar la región."
IT: "\nDovremmo organizzare una base per controllare la regione."
KO: "이 지역의 방어를 위해 기지를 확립해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我們應該建立一個基地以防禦此區的安全。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO11Subtitle
US: "*Our Helix is the Overlord of the skies. Build more to help us control the area"
DE: "*Our Helix is the Overlord of the skies. Build more to help us control the area"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestro Helix es el Overlord de los cielos.\nConstruye más y será más fácil controlar el área."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n아군의 헬릭스는 하늘의 오버로드라 할만합니다.\n이 지역을 통제할 수 있도록 더 많이 생산하십시오."
ZH: "\n我方的螺旋直昇機是空中之王。大量建造有助於取得此區控制權。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO12Subtitle
US: "*Sir, I recommend placing Listening Outposts at key locations"
DE: "*Sir, I recommend placing Listening Outposts at key locations"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecomiendo colocar puestos de escucha en los lugares clave."
IT: "\nSignore, consiglio di posizionare delle Postazioni d'ascolto nelle posizioni chiave."
KO: "장군님, 감시 아웃포스트를 주요 지역에 배치할 것을 권합니다."
ZH: "\n長官，我建議在某些重要地點放置前哨監聽車。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO13Subtitle
US: "*Current Intel reports that the GLA are retreating towards this location. We will make our stand here. Do not permit any GLA units to leave this area. Our new Helix Helicopter should assure your success. The appearance of our forces from the south will signal the completion of your main objective"
DE: "*Current Intel reports that the GLA are retreating towards this location. We will make our stand here. Do not permit any GLA units to leave this area. Our new Helix Helicopter should assure your success. The appearance of our forces from the south will signal the completion of your main objective"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA se retira hacia aquí. Que ninguna unidad del GLA salga del área.\nNuestro helicóptero Helix es una garantía. Tu objetivo se cumplirá\ncuando nuestras fuerzas aparezcan por el sur."
IT: "\nLe unità dell'ELG non devono fuggire: annientatele!"
KO: "\nGLA가 이 지역을 향해 후퇴하는 중이라고 합니다. GLA 유닛 하나라도 놓치지 마십시오.\n헬릭스를 활용하십시오. 남쪽에서 아군이 출현하면 임무 성공입니다."
ZH: "\n最新情報顯示全球解放軍正朝此處撤退之中，我們將在這裡等候，絕不允許他們一兵一卒活著離開這裡，\n我方新型螺旋直昇機將會助您一臂之力。當任務目標完成時，我們位於南方的部隊將會打暗號告知。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO14Subtitle
US: "*Current Intel reports that the GLA are retreating towards this location. We will make our stand here. Do not permit any GLA units to leave this area. If too many of them escape, our mission will be a failure. Our new Helix Helicopter should assure your success. The appearance of our forces from the south will signal the completion of your main objective"
DE: "*Current Intel reports that the GLA are retreating towards this location. We will make our stand here. Do not permit any GLA units to leave this area. If too many of them escape, our mission will be a failure. Our new Helix Helicopter should assure your success. The appearance of our forces from the south will signal the completion of your main objective"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA se retira hacia aquí. Que ninguna unidad del GLA salga del área.\nNuestro helicóptero Helix es una garantía. Tu objetivo se cumplirá\ncuando nuestras fuerzas aparezcan por el sur."
IT: "\nLe unità dell'ELG non devono fuggire: annientatele!"
KO: "\nGLA가 이 지역을 향해 후퇴하는 중이라고 합니다. GLA 유닛이 너무 많이 탈출하면\n임무 실패입니다. 헬릭스를 활용하십시오. 남쪽에서 아군이 출현하면 임무 성공입니다."
ZH: "\n最新情報顯示全球解放軍正朝此處撤退之中，我們將在這裡等候，絕不允許他們一兵一卒活著離開這裡，\n我方新型螺旋直昇機將會助您一臂之力。當任務目標完成時，我們位於南方的部隊將會打暗號告知。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO15Subtitle
US: "*A wave of GLA is approaching from the west"
DE: "*A wave of GLA is approaching from the west"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nUna oleada del GLA se aproxima por el oeste."
IT: "\nUn'ondata dell'ELG si avvicina da ovest."
KO: "GLA의 병력이 서쪽에서 다가오고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍的攻擊波從西方接近中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO16Subtitle
US: "*There is a wave of GLA approaching from the south"
DE: "*There is a wave of GLA approaching from the south"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nUna oleada del GLA se aproxima por el sur."
IT: "\nOndata ELG in arrivo da sud."
KO: "남쪽에서 GLA의 병력이 접근하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n有一波全球解放軍的攻擊行動從南方接近中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO17Subtitle
US: "*GLA forces have been spotted approaching from the southwest"
DE: "*GLA forces have been spotted approaching from the southwest"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSe han divisado fuerzas del GLA acercándose por el suroeste."
IT: "\nForze ELG individuate in avvicinamento da sud-ovest."
KO: "남서쪽에서 GLA 병력의 출현이 보고되었습니다."
ZH: "\n已偵察到全球解放軍部隊從西南接近中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO18Subtitle
US: "*GLA forces incoming from the southeast"
DE: "*GLA forces incoming from the southeast"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nFuerzas del GLA llegan por el sureste."
IT: "\nForze ELG in arrivo da sud-est."
KO: "GLA의 병력이 남동쪽에서 출현했습니다."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍部隊從東南方來襲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO19Subtitle
US: "*A wave of GLA forces are approaching from the southwest"
DE: "*A wave of GLA forces are approaching from the southwest"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nUna oleada del GLA se acerca por el suroeste."
IT: "\nUn'ondata di forze dell'ELG si avvicina da sud-ovest."
KO: "GLA의 병력이 남서쪽에서 출현했습니다."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍部隊的攻擊波從西南方接近中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO20Subtitle
US: "*Another GLA wave is approaching"
DE: "*Another GLA wave is approaching"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSe acerca otra oleada del GLA."
IT: "\nIn arrivo un'altra ondata dell'ELG."
KO: "GLA의 추가 병력이 다가오고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n另一波全球解放軍部隊接近中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO21Subtitle
US: "*Excellent work, sir. Intel confirms that you have destroyed the entire wave"
DE: "*Excellent work, sir. Intel confirms that you have destroyed the entire wave"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nExcelente trabajo. Inteligencia confirma la destrucción completa de la oleada."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, signore: è stata confermata la distruzione dell'intera ondata."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 적의 전 병력이 소탕되었다는 정보가 들어왔습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，長官。情報證實你已殲滅敵軍連續的攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO22Subtitle
US: "*The enemy is about to breach our defenses"
DE: "*The enemy is about to breach our defenses"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl enemigo va a abrir brecha en nuestras defensas."
IT: "\nIl nemico sta per sfondare le difese."
KO: "적이 우리의 방어 시설을 돌파하려고 합니다."
ZH: "\n敵軍將要突破我方的防禦陣線。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO23Subtitle
US: "*Multiple Scud Storm launches detected"
DE: "*Multiple Scud Storm launches detected"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDetectados múltiples lanzamientos de tormenta SCUD."
IT: "\nRilevati lanci multipli di SCUD Storm."
KO: "다수의 스커드 폭풍이 발사되었습니다."
ZH: "\n偵測到多枚生化死雨風暴已發射。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO24Subtitle
US: "*Our defenses have been breached commander, we have failed the mission"
DE: "*Our defenses have been breached commander, we have failed the mission"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHan superado nuestras defensas, comandante. La misión ha fracasado."
IT: "\nLe nostre difese sono state sfondate, comandante, abbiamo fallito."
KO: "우리의 방어가 뚫렸습니다, 사령관님. 임무 실패입니다."
ZH: "\n我方已被攻破防線，指揮官。我們任務失敗。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO25Subtitle
US: "*Commander, our forces from the south have arrived. Out mission was a success"
DE: "*Commander, our forces from the south have arrived. Out mission was a success"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nComandante, han llegado nuestras fuerzas desde el sur. La misión ha sido un éxito."
IT: "\nComandante, i rinforzi da sud sono appena arrivati: abbiamo vinto."
KO: "사령관님, 아군 병력이 남쪽에 나타났습니다. 임무 성공입니다."
ZH: "\n指揮官，我方從南面而來的部隊已抵達。任務完成。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO26Subtitle
US: "*General, enemy forces are dangerously close to making their escape. We must deal with them quickly!"
DE: "*General, enemy forces are dangerously close to making their escape. We must deal with them quickly!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, fuerzas enemigas están a punto de escapar. ¡Debemos ir ya a por ellas!"
IT: "\nGenerale, le forze nemiche sono a un passo dalla fuga, dobbiamo eliminarle rapidamente!"
KO: "장군님, 적 병력이 거의 탈출했습니다. 그들을 빨리 처리해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，敵軍部隊正準備逃脫，我們必須盡快把他們解決掉！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO27Subtitle
US: "*GLA forces have been detected fleeing through this location. Move into defensive positions and await enemy contact"
DE: "*GLA forces have been detected fleeing through this location. Move into defensive positions and await enemy contact"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSe han detectado fuerzas del GLA huyendo por este lugar. Adoptad posiciones defensivas y esperad contacto con el enemigo."
IT: "\nLe forze dell'ELG sono in fuga verso questa posizione: assumete la posizione difensiva e attendete il contatto con il nemico."
KO: "\n이 지역으로 GLA 병력이 탈출하는 것이 발견되었습니다.\n방어 태세를 취하고 적과의 교전을 준비하십시오."
ZH: "\n我方已偵察到全球解放軍從此處逃竄。快就防禦位置，靜待敵軍出現。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO28Subtitle
US: "*General, Wave 1 of the enemies retreat has been detected entering the area and intel has them moving along the path shown on the your radar"
DE: "*General, Wave 1 of the enemies retreat has been detected entering the area and intel has them moving along the path shown on the your radar"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSe ha detectado a la oleada 1 de la retirada enemiga entrando en el área;\nel radar muestra su ruta."
IT: "\nGenerale, l'ondata 1 della ritirata nemica è in avvicinamento."
KO: "\n장군님, 적의 첫번째 후퇴 병력이 작전 지역으로 진입하는 것이 확인되었습니다.\n적의 움직임은 레이더에 나타나고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我方偵察到敵軍第一波的撤退正進入這個區域，而且從您雷達上的情報可窺見他們逃走的路線。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

