DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO32Subtitle
US: "*General, Wave 5 of the enemies retreat has been detected entering the area and intel has them moving along the path shown on the your radar"
DE: "*General, Wave 5 of the enemies retreat has been detected entering the area and intel has them moving along the path shown on the your radar"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSe ha detectado a la oleada 5 de la retirada enemiga entrando en el área;\nel radar muestra su ruta."
IT: "\nGenerale, l'ondata 5 della ritirata nemica è in avvicinamento."
KO: "\n장군님, 적의 다섯번째 후퇴 병력이 작전 지역으로 진입하는 것이 확인되었습니다.\n적의 움직임은 레이더에 나타나고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我方偵察到敵軍第五波的撤退正進入這個區域，而且從您雷達上的情報可窺見他們逃走的路線。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
