DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO33Subtitle
US: "*Our forces have arrived from the south. You have been successful in preventing the enemy retreat. Good job General"
DE: "*Our forces have arrived from the south. You have been successful in preventing the enemy retreat. Good job General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHan llegado nuestras fuerzas desde el sur.\nHas evitado la huida del enemigo.\nBuen trabajo, general."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n우리의 병력이 남쪽으로부터 도착했습니다. 적의 후퇴를 성공적으로 저지했습니다.\n수고하셨습니다, 장군님."
ZH: "\n我方從南面而來的部隊已抵達，你已成功阻斷敵軍的撤退之路。做得很好，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI04xXO34Subtitle
US: "*General, the enemy forces have escaped to the North. We have failed the mission"
DE: "*General, the enemy forces have escaped to the North. We have failed the mission"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, las fuerzas enemigas han huido al norte. La misión ha fracasado."
IT: "\nGenerale, le forze nemiche sono fuggite a nord: abbiamo fallito la missione."
KO: "장군님, 적 병력이 북쪽으로 후퇴했습니다. 임무 실패입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，敵軍部隊已經往北方逃脫。我們任務失敗。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisChi05OfficerC01Subtitle
US: "*It's time we corrected our mistake. Kill them all!"
DE: "*It's time we corrected our mistake. Kill them all!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nYa era hora de corregir nuestro error. ¡Matadlos a todos!"
IT: "\nDobbiamo riparare al nostro errore: massacrateli tutti."
KO: "우리의 실수를 만회할 때입니다. 적을 섬멸하십시오!"
ZH: "\n我們報仇血恨的時刻到了，把他們殺光！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisChi05OfficerC02Subtitle
US: "*Let us flush these rats from their holes. Death to the cowards!"
DE: "*Let us flush these rats from their holes. Death to the cowards!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSaquemos a esas ratas de sus agujeros. ¡Muerte a los cobardes!"
IT: "\nStaniamo quei topi dalle loro tane. Morte ai codardi!"
KO: "쥐구멍에서 쥐들을 쓸어낼 때가 왔습니다. 비겁자들에게 죽음을 내리십시오!"
ZH: "\n看你們這些鼠輩還往哪裡逃，淹死你們。膽小鬼是難逃一死的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xBrf01Subtitle
US: "*Thanks to your remarkable efforts in Halberstadt the GLA are all but finished. US intel has located the last GLA stronghold outside of Hamburg. Unfortunately we were too late to help the Americans in this area and the GLA captured their base. Build your forces and destroy both the GLA and US bases"
DE: "*Thanks to your remarkable efforts in Halberstadt the GLA are all but finished. US intel has located the last GLA stronghold outside of Hamburg. Unfortunately we were too late to help the Americans in this area and the GLA captured their base. Build your forces and destroy both the GLA and US bases"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGracias a tus esfuerzos en Halberstadt, el GLA está casi acabado.\nSe ha detectado su último bastión fuera de Hamburgo. Pero el GLA capturó\nla base americana. Destruye la base del GLA y la de EE.UU."
IT: "\nPreparate le vostre forze e distruggete le basi USA e dell'ELG."
KO: "\n할버슈타트에서의 성과로 GLA는 거의 제거되었지만, 그들은 함부르크 외곽의 요새를\n거점으로 이 지역의 미국군 기지를 점령했는데, GLA와 미국군 기지를 모두 파괴하십시오."
ZH: "\n謝謝你在赫爾伯斯特德的傑出表現，全球解放軍已被殲滅。美國情報單位已鎖定全球解放軍在漢堡城外\n的最後據點，但我們來不及支援而讓敵軍佔領美軍基地。建立你的部隊並摧毀全球解放軍及美軍基地。"
BP: "\nO E.L.G. está quase acabado. A inteligência dos E.U.A. localizou a última defesa deles.\nNão há mais tempo para ajudar os Americanos. O E.L.G. capturou a\nbase deles. Reforce-se e destrua as duas bases, do E.L.G. e dos E.U.A."
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xBrf02Subtitle
US: "*The GLA have captured an old US base in the region and are building up. Your Final Objective is to Destroy both the US and GLA bases"
DE: "*The GLA have captured an old US base in the region and are building up. Your Final Objective is to Destroy both the US and GLA bases"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA se ha reforzado tomando una antigua base de EE.UU. en la región. Tu objetivo final es destruir la base de EE.UU. y la del GLA."
IT: "\nL'ELG ha catturato la base USA nella regione. L'obiettivo finale è distruggere le basi USA e dell'ELG."
KO: "\nGLA는 이 지역의 미국군 기지를 점령했고 점점 확장하고 있습니다.\n미국군과 GLA 기지 모두를 파괴하십시오."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍已經佔領舊的美軍基地，並積極加強部署一切。你的最後任務目標就是同時摧毀全球解放軍\n及美軍基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xBrf03Subtitle
US: "*The GLA have increased their stealth abilities, General. They can now stealth just about anything. We'll need to stay alert"
DE: "*The GLA have increased their stealth abilities, General. They can now stealth just about anything. We'll need to stay alert"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA ha mejorado su capacidad de encubrimiento. Son capaces de ocultar casi cualquier cosa. Tendremos que mantenernos alerta."
IT: "\nL'ELG ha aumentato le capacità di operare furtivamente, generale. Dovremo stare all'erta."
KO: "GLA는 스텔스 기능을 강화했습니다, 장군님. 이를 경계하십시오."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍已增強他們的匿蹤能力，將軍。他們將可殺人於無形之中，我們必須要提高警覺了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xBrf04Subtitle
US: "*Use your Listening Outposts to detect stealthed units"
DE: "*Use your Listening Outposts to detect stealthed units"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEmplea tus puestos de escucha para detectar unidades infiltradas."
IT: "\nUsa le Postazioni d'ascolto per scoprire le unità mimetizzate."
KO: "감시 아웃포스트를 활용하여 스텔스 유닛을 발견하십시오."
ZH: "\n利用前哨監聽車來偵測隱形的單位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xBrf05Subtitle
US: "*General, I suggest you first concentrate your attack on the US base. We need to take out their Particle Cannons"
DE: "*General, I suggest you first concentrate your attack on the US base. We need to take out their Particle Cannons"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, sugiero comenzar el ataque por la base de EE.UU. Debemos eliminar sus cañones de partículas."
IT: "\nGenerale, vi suggerisco di assalire prima la base USA, ci servono i loro Cannoni particellari."
KO: "장군님, 처음에는 미국군 기지에 공격을 집중하십시오. 그들의 파티클 캐논을 제거해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我建議你先集中火力攻擊美軍基地，我們必須優先摧毀離子砲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xChat01Subtitle
US: "*It feels like we are on an Easter Egg hunt, General"
DE: "*It feels like we are on an Easter Egg hunt, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEs como jugar al escondite, General."
IT: "\nSembra di andare a caccia di fantasmi."
KO: "마치 숨겨진 보물 찾기를 하는 기분이군요, 장군님."
ZH: "\n感覺我們好像在玩尋找復活節彩蛋的遊戲，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xCin01Subtitle
US: "*Corporal! Any sign of the Chinese yet?"
DE: "*Corporal! Any sign of the Chinese yet?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Cabo! ¿Alguna señal de los chinos?"
IT: "\nCaporale! Qualche segno dei cinesi?"
KO: "하사! 중국군이 올 기미가 없나?"
ZH: "\n下士！看到中國人了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xCin02Subtitle
US: "*No sir, the last message received was at 02:00nothing since"
DE: "*No sir, the last message received was at 02:00nothing since"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNo, señor. Nada nuevo desde el último mensaje recibido a las 02:00."
IT: "\nNo, signore: ultimo messaggio ricevuto alle 02:00."
KO: "아직 없습니다! 02:00시 이후로 연락이 오지 않습니다!"
ZH: "\n沒有，長官。自 02:00 時之後就沒有更新的消息了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xCin03Subtitle
US: "*Well, I hope they get here soon. Our intel points to a full-scale GLA attack"
DE: "*Well, I hope they get here soon. Our intel points to a full-scale GLA attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBueno, espero que lleguen pronto. Nuestros informes sugieren un ataque a gran escala del GLA."
IT: "\nBeh, spero che arrivino presto. Ci aspettiamo un attacco massiccio dell'ELG."
KO: "음, 빨리 도착해줘야 할텐데. GLA가 총공격을 해올 것이라는 정보가 왔는데 말이야."
ZH: "\n我希望他們能盡快前來。根據情報指出，全球解放軍將發動大規模的攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xCin04Subtitle
US: "*Yes, sir"
DE: "*Yes, sir"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSí, señor."
IT: "\nSissignore."
KO: "네, 그렇습니다."
ZH: "\n是的，長官。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xCin06Subtitle
US: "*What the...!? Enemy contact!"
DE: "*What the...!? Enemy contact!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¿¡Pero qué...!? ¡Contacto enemigo!"
IT: "\nMa che...! Contatto nemico!"
KO: "어엇! 이건…!? 적이다!"
ZH: "\n挖咧…！？敵軍接觸！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xCin07Subtitle
US: "*Our base has been breached.all units to your stations! Where are those Chinese we were promised!?"
DE: "*Our base has been breached.all units to your stations! Where are those Chinese we were promised!?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHan entrado en la base... ¡Todas las unidades a sus puestos! ¿¡Dónde están esos chinos que nos prometieron!?"
IT: "\nLa base è stata violata, tutte le unità ai propri posti! Ma dove sono quei cinesi che aspettavamo?"
KO: "우리 기지가 침투당했습니다! 전원 작전 위치로! 지원해준다던 중국군은 다 어디 간거야?"
ZH: "\n我們已被突破防線，全員就戰鬥位置！中國人不是承諾會前來的嗎，人咧！？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xCin08Subtitle
US: "*Fox in the hole! Fox in the hole!"
DE: "*Fox in the hole! Fox in the hole!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Zorro en el gallinero! ¡Zorro en el gallinero!"
IT: "\nNemico nella base! Nemico nella base!"
KO: "적이 침투했다!"
ZH: "\n敵暗我明，現在是貓捉老鼠！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xCin09Subtitle
US: "*Where'd they come from?!"
DE: "*Where'd they come from?!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡¿De dónde han salido?!"
IT: "\nDa dove sono arrivati?"
KO: "어디에서 튀어나온 거지?"
ZH: "\n他們從哪裡生出來的啊？！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xCin10Subtitle
US: "*They're capturing our buildings! We can't hold! All units, fall back! Repeat, fall back!"
DE: "*They're capturing our buildings! We can't hold! All units, fall back! Repeat, fall back!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Están tomando nuestros edificios! ¡No podemos resistir! ¡A todas las unidades, retirada! ¡Repito, retirada!"
IT: "\nStanno conquistando le nostre strutture! Ripiegare! Ripeto, ripiegare!"
KO: "적들이 우리 건물을 점령하고 있다! 더 이상 버틸 수 없어! 모두 물러나라! 퇴각!"
ZH: "\n他們佔領了我方建築！我們抵擋不住了！全員後退！重複一次，後退！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO01Subtitle
US: "*That's it! Power to the US base is down! Finish them quickly before they can rebuild!"
DE: "*That's it! Power to the US base is down! Finish them quickly before they can rebuild!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Eso es! ¡La base de EE.UU. está sin energía! ¡Acaba con ellos antes de que reaccionen!"
IT: "\nCi siamo! La base USA è senza energia! Finiteli prima che si riprendano!"
KO: "바로 이거다! 미국군 기지의 전력이 차단되었다. 다시 재건하기 전에 해치우자!"
ZH: "\n沒錯！美軍基地的電力供應中斷！在他們重建之前滅了他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO02Subtitle
US: "*Well done, General. The enemy can no longer produce US units"
DE: "*Well done, General. The enemy can no longer produce US units"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBien hecho, general. El enemigo ya no puede producir unidades americanas."
IT: "\nBen fatto, generale: il nemico non può più produrre unità USA."
KO: "잘하셨습니다, 장군님. 적은 이제 미국군 유닛을 더이상 생산할 수 없습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍。敵軍無法繼續生產美軍單位了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO03Subtitle
US: "*Well done, General. The enemy can no longer produce GLA units"
DE: "*Well done, General. The enemy can no longer produce GLA units"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBien hecho, general. El enemigo ya no puede producir unidades del GLA."
IT: "\nBen fatto, generale: il nemico non può più produrre unità dell'ELG."
KO: "잘하셨습니다, 장군님. 적은 이제 GLA 유닛을 더이상 생산할 수 없습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍。敵軍無法繼續生產全球解放軍的單位了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO04Subtitle
US: "*Well done, General. The US base has been neutralized. Destroy the GLA base to finish this battle"
DE: "*Well done, General. The US base has been neutralized. Destroy the GLA base to finish this battle"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBien hecho, general. La base de EE.UU. ha sido neutralizada.\nDestruye la del GLA para acabar la batalla."
IT: "\nBen fatto! Ora distruggete la base dell'ELG."
KO: "\n잘하셨습니다, 장군님. 미국군 기지는 이제 무력화되었습니다.\nGLA 기지를 파괴하여 전투를 끝내십시오."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍，美軍基地已經癱瘓。快摧毀全球解放軍的基地，結束這場戰役。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO05Subtitle
US: "*Well done, General. The GLA base has been neutralized. Destroy the US base to finish this battle"
DE: "*Well done, General. The GLA base has been neutralized. Destroy the US base to finish this battle"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBien hecho, general. La base del GLA ha sido neutralizada.\nDestruye la de EE.UU. para acabar la batalla."
IT: "\nBen fatto! Ora distruggete la base USA.\n"
KO: "\n잘하셨습니다, 장군님. GLA 기지는 이제 무력화되었습니다.\n미국군 기지를 파괴하여 전투를 끝내십시오."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍，全球解放軍的基地已經癱瘓。快摧毀美軍基地，結束這場戰役。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO06Subtitle
US: "*We must finish what the US was not able to do. The GLA must fall and the world will be at peace"
DE: "*We must finish what the US was not able to do. The GLA must fall and the world will be at peace"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDebemos completar lo que EE.UU. no fue capaz de hacer.\nEl GLA ha de caer por la paz mundial."
IT: "\nL'ELG dovrà cadere, solo allora il mondo avrà la pace."
KO: "\n미국군이 막지 못했던 이 적들을 없애야 합니다.\nGLA는 반드시 섬멸되어 세계 평화를 되찾아야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我們必須完成美國未能成就的事，全球解放軍必將垮台，世界和平將指日可待。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO07Subtitle
US: "*If we are able to defeat the GLA and save Europe from its clutches then there are great rewards to be had"
DE: "*If we are able to defeat the GLA and save Europe from its clutches then there are great rewards to be had"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSi vencemos al GLA y salvamos Europa de sus garras, nos esperan grandes recompensas."
IT: "***"
KO: "만약 GLA를 무찌르고 그들의 손아귀에서 유럽을 지켜낸다면 커다란 보상이 있을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n如果我們能擊垮全球解放軍，並拯救歐洲脫離他的魔掌，我們將獲得許多獎賞。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO08Subtitle
US: "*General, you will take your place among China's finest heroes. The GLA has fallen and China is the shining beacon in a new world. Take you place of honor and bask in the glory that is China"
DE: "*General, you will take your place among China's finest heroes. The GLA has fallen and China is the shining beacon in a new world. Take you place of honor and bask in the glory that is China"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nOcuparás tu lugar entre los héroes más admirados de China. El GLA ha caído y China es el líder del nuevo orden mundial. Ocupa tu lugar de honor y goza de la gloria de China"
IT: "\nGenerale, sarete annoverato fra gli eroi della Cina:\nl'ELG è caduta e siamo la nazione guida del mondo\nlibero! Godetevi il vostro momento di gloria."
KO: "\n장군님은 이제 중국의 영웅의 반열에 올라섰습니다.\nGLA는 무너졌고 중국은 세계 평화의 수호자가 되었습니다.\n영광의 자리를 차지하고 영광을 마음껏 누리십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，您將躋身於中國傑出英雄的名單。全球解放軍已經垮台，中國現在是一個全新世界的閃亮指標，\n您將登上榮譽榜，並同時享受中國光榮的浸潤"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO09Subtitle
US: "*General, the enemy has improved their stealth ability, but they do not appear to be using tanks"
DE: "*General, the enemy has improved their stealth ability, but they do not appear to be using tanks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el enemigo ha mejorado su capacidad encubierta, pero no parece que usen tanques."
IT: "\nGenerale, il nemico opera in modo furtivo, ma sembra non disporre di carri armati."
KO: "장군님, 적들은 스텔스 기능을 강화했지만 탱크를 사용하는 것 같지는 않습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，敵軍已經加強了匿蹤能力，但是他們看起來並沒有坦克可使用。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO10Subtitle
US: "*General, the GLA commander is lacking tanks. Perhaps we can overwhelm him with our forces"
DE: "*General, the GLA commander is lacking tanks. Perhaps we can overwhelm him with our forces"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el comandante del GLA no tiene tanques. Tal vez nuestras fuerzas puedan desbordarle."
IT: "\nGenerale, il comandante dell'ELG è senza carri armati, potremmo soverchiarlo con le nostre forze."
KO: "\n장군님, GLA는 현재 탱크를 사용하지 않는듯 합니다.\n우리의 병력으로 그들을 압도할 수 있다고 봅니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍的坦克短缺，或許我方部隊可以獲得壓倒性的勝利。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO11Subtitle
US: "*General, we are losing vehicles to Jarmen Kell. You must track him down if we are to stand a chance"
DE: "*General, we are losing vehicles to Jarmen Kell. You must track him down if we are to stand a chance"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, Jarmen Kell nos hace perder vehículos. Debes atraparlo o no tendremos ninguna posibilidad."
IT: "\nGenerale, Jarmen Kell sta rubando i nostri veicoli: dovete localizzarlo al più presto."
KO: "\n장군님, 쟈멘 켈에게 우리의 차량들을 탈취당하고 있습니다.\n승리를 위해서는 그를 찾아내어 없애야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，賈曼卡爾正在狙擊我方載具。如果有機會的話，你必須跟蹤然後幹掉他。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO12Subtitle
US: "*General, the enemy is using HIJACKERS! We need to stop them!"
DE: "*General, the enemy is using HIJACKERS! We need to stop them!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, el enemigo emplea SECUESTRADORES! ¡Debemos detenerles!"
IT: "\nGenerale, il nemico usa dei Dirottatori! Dobbiamo fermarli!"
KO: "장군님, 적들은 하이재커를 사용하고 있습니다! 그들을 막아야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，敵軍利用劫持犯偷取載具！我們必須阻止他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO13Subtitle
US: "*General, the enemy has positioned SNIPERs in the local villages. We must clear them out"
DE: "*General, the enemy has positioned SNIPERs in the local villages. We must clear them out"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el enemigo ha colocado FRANCOTIRADORES en los pueblos. Debemos sacarlos de ahí."
IT: "\nGenerale, ci sono Cecchini nemici nei villaggi, dobbiamo eliminarli."
KO: "장군님, 적들은 마을에 저격병을 배치했습니다. 그들을 제거해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，敵軍在當地村莊埋伏狙擊手，我們必須幹掉他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO14Subtitle
US: "*General, we are losing troops to the enemy's Quad Cannons, we need heavy armor out here"
DE: "*General, we are losing troops to the enemy's Quad Cannons, we need heavy armour out here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, perdemos tropas por culpa de los cañones Quad; necesitamos blindaje pesado."
IT: "\nGenerale, i Cannoni quadrupli nemici ci fanno a pezzi, ci servono mezzi corazzati pesanti."
KO: "장군님, 적의 쿼드 캐논에 병력을 잃고 있습니다. 중화기로 대응해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我方部隊遭受四管加農砲的攻擊，我們這裡需要大量火力支援。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO15Subtitle
US: "*General, current intel suggests Jarmen Kell may be holed up in this small village"
DE: "*General, current intel suggests Jarmen Kell may be holed up in this small village"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, inteligencia sugiere que Jarmen Kell podría estar refugiado en este pueblo."
IT: "\nGenerale, Jarmen Kell si trova in questo villaggio."
KO: "장군님, 쟈멘 켈이 이 작은 마을에 은신해 있다는 정보를 입수했습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，最新情報顯示賈曼卡爾也許躲藏在這個小鎮內。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO16Subtitle
US: "*General, the enemy's base seems to be on the other side of this river. Perhaps we can lock him in by positioning forces near the bridges"
DE: "*General, the enemy's base seems to be on the other side of this river. Perhaps we can lock him in by positioning forces near the bridges"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, la base enemiga parece estar al otro lado del río.\nQuizá podamos bloquearle colocando fuerzas cerca de los puentes."
IT: "\nBloccate i ponti per isolare il nemico."
KO: "\n장군님, 적의 기지는 강 저편에 있는 듯 합니다.\n아마도 다리 근처에 병력을 배치해서 적을 도망가지 못하게 할 수 있을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，敵軍基地似乎在河的另一邊。或許我們可以駐守於橋頭附近，封鎖他們的進路。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO17Subtitle
US: "*General, we have many driverless vehicles in the fieldsend units to recapture them"
DE: "*General, we have many driverless vehicles in the fieldsend units to recapture them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTenemos muchos vehículos sin conductor en el campo... Envía unidades a recuperarlos."
IT: "\nGenerale, ci sono dei veicoli senza autisti: inviate delle unità a riconquistarli."
KO: "장군님, 운전병이 없는 빈 차량들이 많습니다. 유닛을 보내 다시 우리 유닛으로 확보하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們有很多無人駕駛的載具在戰場上，快派遣單位前去奪回他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO18Subtitle
US: "*Sir! We have detected Battle buses in sector C. We should deal with them before they can reach our base"
DE: "*Sir! We have detected Battle buses in sector C. We should deal with them before they can reach our base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor! Hemos detectado buses de combate en el sector C. Debemos ocuparnos de ellos antes de que alcancen nuestra base."
IT: "\nSignore, Autobus da battaglia nel settore C: dobbiamo impedire che raggiungano la nostra base."
KO: "장군님! C 구역에서 배틀 버스를 발견했습니다. 우리의 기지로 다가오기 전에 처리해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n長官！我們偵察到戰鬥巴士出現在 C 防禦區，我們應該在他們靠近我方基地之前，做掉他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO19Subtitle
US: "*General, the enemy has slipped units into our base! We should improve our defenses!"
DE: "*General, the enemy has slipped units into our base! We should improve our defenses!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, el enemigo ha infiltrado unidades en nuestra base! ¡Debemos mejorar nuestras defensas!"
IT: "\nGenerale, il nemico ha fatto penetrare delle unità nella nostra base! Dobbiamo rinforzare le difese!"
KO: "장군님, 적이 우리의 기지로 침투해 들어왔습니다! 기지 방어를 강화해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，敵軍單位已經滲透我方基地！我們應該加強防禦能力！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO20Subtitle
US: "*General, the enemy has infiltrated our base!"
DE: "*General, the enemy has infiltrated our base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, el enemigo se ha infiltrado en nuestra base!"
IT: "\nGenerale, il nemico si è infiltrato nella base!"
KO: "장군님, 적이 기지에 침투했습니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，敵軍已經滲透我方基地！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO21Subtitle
US: "*General! Taking out the American Command Center will put a stop to his heavy Air support"
DE: "*General! Taking out the American Command Center will put a stop to his heavy Air support"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General! Eliminar el centro de mando americano les privará de su abundante apoyo aéreo."
IT: "\nGenerale! Conquistando il Centro comando USA bloccherete il supporto aereo nemico."
KO: "장군님, 미국군 커맨드 센터를 제거하면 공군 지원을 멈출 수 있을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍！摧毀美軍指揮中心將可終止他們密集的空中支援。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO22Subtitle
US: "*General, we need to get our INTERNET CENTER built as quickly as possible. It will help us locate enemy positions"
DE: "*General, we need to get our INTERNET CENTER built as quickly as possible. It will help us locate enemy positions"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, necesitamos nuestro CENTRO DE INTERNET lo antes posible.\nNos ayudará a dar con la posición del enemigo."
IT: "\nDobbiamo costruire un Centro Internet per localizzare il nemico."
KO: "장군님, 인터넷 센터를 빨리 건설하면 적의 위치를 파악하는데 큰 도움이 될 것입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們必須立即建造網際網路中心。將有助於我方鎖定敵軍位置。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO23Subtitle
US: "*General, the enemy has left his Flank unguarded! Now is our chance to counter attack!"
DE: "*General, the enemy has left his Flank unguarded! Now is our chance to counter attack!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, el enemigo tiene un flanco indefenso! ¡Es nuestra oportunidad para contraatacar!"
IT: "\nGenerale, il nemico ha il fianco scoperto! Ecco l'occasione per contrattaccare!"
KO: "장군님, 적의 측면 방어가 소홀합니다! 역습할 기회입니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，敵軍的左翼防線出現漏洞！現在是我們反擊的時候了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisCHI05xXO24Subtitle
US: "*General, the Americans have superior stealth detection technology. Perhaps you should capture this base instead of destroying it"
DE: "*General, the Americans have superior stealth detection technology. Perhaps you should capture this base instead of destroying it"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, la tecnología de detección americana es superior. Deberíamos tomar su base en vez de destruirla."
IT: "\nGenerale, gli USA hanno delle tecnologie di rilevamento avanzate, forse dovreste catturare la loro base, invece di distruggerla."
KO: "\n장군님, 미국군은 더욱 우수한 스텔스 탐지 기능을 가지고 있습니다.\n그들의 기지를 파괴하기 보다는 점령하는 편이 나을 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，美軍擁有優良的隱形偵察技術，或許你應該佔領這個基地而並非摧毀他才是。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

