IT: "\nI cinesi sono vicini."
KO: "중국군이 접근한다."
ZH: "\n中國人來了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01Scorpion108Subtitle
US: "*We have found a secret way. It's poorly guarded"
DE: "*We have found a secret way. It's poorly guarded"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHemos encontrado una entrada secreta. Está poco vigilada."
IT: "\nAbbiamo trovato una via poco sorvegliata."
KO: "비밀 통로를 발견했다. 방어가 허술하다."
ZH: "\n我們發現一條密道，沿路沒什麼人防衛。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01Scorpion109Subtitle
US: "*We're under fire!"
DE: "*We're under fire!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nos atacan!"
IT: "\nCi sparano addosso!"
KO: "공격받고 있다!"
ZH: "\n我們正遭受攻擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xChat01Subtitle
US: "*Enemy defense structures sighted, General"
DE: "*Enemy defense structures sighted, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAvistados edificios defensivos enemigos, general."
IT: "\nIndividuate strutture difensive nemiche, generale."
KO: "적 방어 건물이 보입니다, 장군님"
ZH: "\n發現敵軍防禦建築，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xChat02Subtitle
US: "*Enemy position spotted! We must find a way past them!"
DE: "*Enemy position spotted! We must find a way past them!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Posición enemiga avistada! ¡Debemos hallar la forma de rebasarla!"
IT: "\nPosizione nemica individuata! Dobbiamo riuscire a superarla!"
KO: "적 위치가 확인되었습니다! 그들을 지나갈 방법을 찾으십시오!"
ZH: "\n發現敵軍位置！我們必須想辦法穿越他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xChat03Subtitle
US: "*Enemy patrol! All units, open fire!"
DE: "*Enemy patrol! All units, open fire!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Patrulla enemiga! ¡Todas las unidades, abran fuego!"
IT: "\nPattuglia nemica! Aprite il fuoco!"
KO: "적의 정찰이다! 전 유닛, 사격 개시!"
ZH: "\n敵軍巡邏隊！所有單位，開火！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xChat04Subtitle
US: "*American Sentry Drones! We must destroy them quickly before they sound the alarm!"
DE: "*American Sentry Drones! We must destroy them quickly before they sound the alarm!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Teledirigidos centinelas americanos! ¡Debemos destruirlos antes de que hagan sonar la alarma!"
IT: "\nDroni da ricognizione USA! Dobbiamo distruggerli prima che diano l'allarme!"
KO: "미국군의 센트리 드론이다! 그들이 경보를 울리기 전에 파괴하라!"
ZH: "\n發現美軍無人哨兵機！在他們啟動警報前，盡快摧毀他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xChat05Subtitle
US: "*Look at them scramble! Our attack was a complete surprise!"
DE: "*Look at them scramble! Our attack was a complete surprise!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Observa su reacción! ¡Nuestro ataque les ha cogido por sorpresa!"
IT: "\nGuardate! Li abbiamo colti completamente di sorpresa!"
KO: "저 우왕좌왕하는 모습을 봐라! 우리의 공격은 완전히 성공했다!"
ZH: "\n看他們被我們搞得一團混亂！好一個奇襲戰術！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xChat06Subtitle
US: "*American attackers closing in! We must hold our position, General!"
DE: "*American attackers closing in! We must hold our position, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Atacantes americanos acercándose! ¡Mantengamos nuestra posición, general!"
IT: "\nAssalitori USA in avvicinamento! Dobbiamo difendere la posizione, generale!"
KO: "미국군의 공격부대가 다가오고 있습니다! 우리의 위치를 사수해야 합니다, 장군님!"
ZH: "\n美軍攻擊者慢慢往前包圍了！我們要嚴守陣線，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xChat07Subtitle
US: "*Our surprise was complete! All units, concentrate on their power plants!"
DE: "*Our surprise was complete! All units, concentrate on their power plants!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Les hemos sorprendido! ¡Que todas las unidades se concentren en sus centrales eléctricas!"
IT: "\nLa sorpresa è riuscita! Concentrare l'attacco sulle centrali energetiche!"
KO: "우리의 기습은 완벽했다! 전 유닛, 발전소 공격에 화력을 집중하라!"
ZH: "\n奇襲戰術成功！所有單位將火力集中發電廠！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xChat08Subtitle
US: "*General! We are taking heavy losses!"
DE: "*General! We are taking heavy losses!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General! ¡Sufrimos muchas pérdidas!"
IT: "\nGenerale! Stiamo subendo gravi perdite!"
KO: "장군님! 손실이 매우 큽니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍！我們現在損失慘重！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin01Subtitle
US: "*Patrol to base: Target has been located and we are in pursuit"
DE: "*Patrol to base: Target has been located and we are in pursuit"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nPatrulla a base: Objetivo localizado."
IT: "\nPattuglia a base: bersaglio localizzato."
KO: "기지 순찰: 목표가 설정되었습니다."
ZH: "\n巡邏中隊回報基地：目標已經鎖定，我們正在追擊敵人。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin02Subtitle
US: "*Be advised, the bombing campaign has already begun. Be careful, Patrol"
DE: "*Be advised, the bombing campaign has already begun. Be careful, Patrol"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTengan en cuenta que el bombardeo ha comenzado. Mucho cuidado, patrulla."
IT: "\nAttenzione, i bombardamenti sono iniziati, agite con cautela."
KO: "순찰대는 주의하라. 포격이 이미 시작되었다."
ZH: "\n注意了，轟炸行動已經開始，小心！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin03Subtitle
US: "*Roger that, base. I'm on the right"
DE: "*Roger that, base. I'm on the right"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecibido, base. Voy por la derecha."
IT: "\nRicevuto, base. Sono sulla destra."
KO: "알았다. 나는 오른쪽을 순찰한다."
ZH: "\n瞭解了，基地。我在右翼攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin04Subtitle
US: "*I'll take the left"
DE: "*I'll take the left"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nYo iré por la izquierda."
IT: "\nIo vado a sinistra."
KO: "나는 왼쪽을 순찰하겠다."
ZH: "\n我會從左翼進行攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin05Subtitle
US: "*I'm taking fire!"
DE: "*I'm taking fire!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Me atacan!"
IT: "\nSono colpito!"
KO: "공격받고 있다!"
ZH: "\n我遭受襲擊了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin06Subtitle
US: "*Stay on them!"
DE: "*Stay on them!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡No les dejes!"
IT: "\nStagli addosso!"
KO: "응사하라!"
ZH: "\n阻止他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin07Subtitle
US: "*Look out!"
DE: "*Look out!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Cuidado!"
IT: "\nAttenzione!"
KO: "조심해!"
ZH: "\n注意！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin08Subtitle
US: "*Base! Charlie three is down! Repeat: Charlie three is down!"
DE: "*Base! Charlie three is down! Repeat: Charlie three is down!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Base! ¡Charlie Tres abatido! Repito: ¡Charlie Tres abatido!"
IT: "\nBase! Charlie tre è andato! Ripeto: Charlie tre andato!"
KO: "기지 응답하라! 찰리 3이 당했다! 반복한다: 찰리 3이 당했다!"
ZH: "\n呼叫基地！失去C 3 小隊！重述：失去C 3 小隊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin09Subtitle
US: "*Continue pursuit, Charlie two! This is our best shot at him!"
DE: "*Continue pursuit, Charlie two! This is our best shot at him!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Charlie Dos, continúe! ¡Esta vez lo tenemos a tiro!"
IT: "\nContinua l'inseguimento, Charlie due."
KO: "추적을 계속하라 찰리2! 이 기회를 놓치면 안된다!"
ZH: "\n繼續追捕行動，C 2！現在是我們逮到他的好機會！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin10Subtitle
US: "*Escorts eliminated! I've got him!"
DE: "*Escorts eliminated! I've got him!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Escoltas eliminados! ¡Le tengo!"
IT: "\nScorta eliminata! Ce l'ho!"
KO: "호위 병력 제거 완료! 잡았다!"
ZH: "\n護衛隊已殲滅！我幹掉他了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin11Subtitle
US: "*Nooooo!"
DE: "*Nooooo!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nooooo!"
IT: "\nNooo!"
KO: "안돼!!!!"
ZH: "\n不……"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin12Subtitle
US: "*Heh heh. General, we've made our escape.and are headed for the rendevouz point. The GLA shall rise again"
DE: "*Heh heh. General, we've made our escape.and are headed for the rendevouz point. The GLA shall rise again"
FR: "***"
ES: "Je, je. General, hemos escapado y nos dirigimos al punto de encuentro.\nEl GLA se alzará de nuevo."
IT: "\nEh eh... Generale, siamo diretti al punto d'incontro."
KO: "헤헤, 장군님, 탈출에 성공했고 곧 접선 지점에 도착합니다. GLA는 다시 부흥할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n嘿嘿。將軍，我們已經成功的脫逃，而且正往會合點前進，全球解放軍將重振雄風。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin13Subtitle
US: "*Affirmative. Scout team moving out"
DE: "*Affirmative. Scout team moving out"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAfirmativo. Reconocimiento retirándose."
IT: "\nAffermativo. Squadra di esplorazione in azione."
KO: "알았다. 정찰 팀이 나간다."
ZH: "\n確認，偵搜小隊出動。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin14Subtitle
US: "*This is scout team. We detect no enemy presence. Wait"
DE: "*This is scout team. We detect no enemy presence. Wait"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAquí reconocimiento. No detectamos presencia enemiga. Un momento..."
IT: "\nQui squadra di esplorazione: nessuna presenza nemica. Un attimo..."
KO: "정찰팀이다. 적의 징후가 없다. 대기하라."
ZH: "\n偵搜小隊報告，目前沒有敵軍蹤跡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin15Subtitle
US: "*American ambush! They have us surrounded!"
DE: "*American ambush! They have us surrounded!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Emboscada americana! ¡Estamos rodeados!"
IT: "\nImboscata americana! Ci hanno circondato!"
KO: "미국군 매복입니다! 우리는 포위됐습니다!"
ZH: "\n美軍埋伏在此！我們被包圍了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xCin16Subtitle
US: "*Sentry Drones! These Americans are most clever. Their drones are hidden when they are still. You must proceed with caution, General"
DE: "*Sentry Drones! These Americans are most clever. Their drones are hidden when they are still. You must proceed with caution, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Teledirigidos centinelas! Estos americanos son de lo más espabilado. Se ocultan cuando no hay movimiento. Precaución, general."
IT: "\nDroni da ricognizione! Questi americani sono furbi, i Droni sono invisibili finché restano fermi. Procedete con cautela, generale."
KO: "\n센트리 드론입니다! 미국군의 기술은 뛰어납니다.\n그들의 드론은 멈춰 있을 때는 보이지 않습니다. 각별한 주의가 요구됩니다, 장군님."
ZH: "\n是無人哨兵機！這些美軍相當的機靈，當他們按兵不動時，無人飛機是隱藏起來的。你必須要特別小心\n的行動，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen01Subtitle
US: "*The Americans have surrounded our stronghold with military checkpoints. You must clear the way"
DE: "*The Americans have surrounded our stronghold with military checkpoints. You must clear the way"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos americanos han rodeado nuestro bastión con controles militares. Hay que despejar el camino."
IT: "***"
KO: "미국군은 우리의 거점을 군사 체크포인트로 포위했습니다. 진로를 확보해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n美軍在我方基地已設下重重的軍事關卡，你必須殺出一條血路。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen02Subtitle
US: "*General, you must help our true leader escape, so that the GLA can live on"
DE: "*General, you must help our true leader escape, so that the GLA can live on"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, hay que ayudar a escapar a nuestro líder para que el GLA subsista."
IT: "\nGenerale, aiutate il nostro vero leader a fuggire, così l'ELG vivrà!"
KO: "장군님, 우리의 진정한 영도자를 탈출시켜서 GLA가 계속 번영하도록 해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，你必須協助我方真正的領導人逃亡，如此一來全球解放軍才能延續下去。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen03Subtitle
US: "*Dr. Thrax may have died for the cause but he was inconsequential. If our brother escapes the US will not have seen the last of the GLA"
DE: "*Dr. Thrax may have died for the cause but he was inconsequential. If our brother escapes the US will not have seen the last of the GLA"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Dr. Thrax ha muerto por la causa, pero era prescindible.\nSi nuestro hermano escapa, EE.UU. no habrá acabado con el GLA."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n스랙스 박사 역시 대의를 위한 희생에 동의하겠지만, 그게 중요한 게 아닙니다.\n만약 우리의 형제가 탈출한다면 GLA는 계속 세력을 영위해 나갈 것입니다."
ZH: "\n崔克斯博士可能已經為目標而犧牲，但他並不重要。如果我們弟兄們能逃脫出去，那美軍將沒能把我們\n全球解放軍趕盡殺絕。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen04Subtitle
US: "*General. The Fire Base defenses around this American position are too strong. We should avoid a direct confrontation and find another way into the base"
DE: "*General. The Fire Base defenses around this American position are too strong. We should avoid a direct confrontation and find another way into the base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, las defensas de esta base de disparo son demasiado fuertes. Debemos evitar un ataque frontal y buscar otra vía de entrada."
IT: "\nGenerale, la Base di fuoco è troppo ben difesa, dobbiamo evitare il confronto diretto e penetrare nella base in un altro modo."
KO: "\n장군님, 이 미국군 거점 주변의 파이어 베이스가 너무 강력합니다.\n이곳과 맞닥뜨리지 않고 기지로 침투할 방법을 찾아야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，這附近美軍的火力基地防禦太過嚴密，我們應該避免與其正面的衝突，而改採迂迴策略突入。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen05Subtitle
US: "*Hold you forces back, General. We are sending in a team to scout the other side of the bridge. They will report back on enemy positions"
DE: "*Hold you forces back, General. We are sending in a team to scout the other side of the bridge. They will report back on enemy positions"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHay que contener a las fuerzas, general. Enviaremos un equipo de reconocimiento al otro lado del puente. Nos informará de la posición del enemigo."
IT: "\nTrattenete le truppe, generale: stiamo inviando una squadra a controllare dall'altra parte del ponte. Fornirà informazioni sulle posizioni nemiche."
KO: "병력을 물리십시오, 장군님. 다리 저편으로 정찰대를 보내고 있습니다.\n그들은 적의 위치에 대해 알려줄 것입니다."
ZH: "\n撤離你的部隊，將軍。我們將派遣一支偵搜小隊到橋的另一邊一探虛實，然後回報最新的敵軍位置。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen06Subtitle
US: "*My General. One of our Quick Strike teams has managed to elude their American pursuers, and have agreed to aid us in our mission. Their rocket pods should prove most useful against enemy armor"
DE: "*My General. One of our Quick Strike teams has managed to elude their American pursuers, and have agreed to aid us in our mission. Their rocket pods should prove most useful against enemy armor"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMi general, uno de nuestros equipos de actuación rápida ha eludido\na sus perseguidores y acepta colaborar en la misión.\nSus compartimentos para cohetes nos servirán contra los blindajes."
IT: "\nGenerale, una squadra di disertori USA ha deciso di aiutarci."
KO: "\n장군님, 우리의 타격대가 미국군 추격 부대를 유인했고, 우리의 작전에 참여하게 되었습니다.\n그들의 로켓 포드는 적의 장갑에 위력을 발휘할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我方的快攻小隊已經設法巧妙地閃躲美軍的追捕，並且同意支援我們的任務。小隊中的火箭兵將\n對敵軍的裝甲部隊造成最有效的攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen07Subtitle
US: "*We have discovered one of our demolitions teams. They will help us to clear a path by destroying the outlying US support bases"
DE: "*We have discovered one of our demolitions teams. They will help us to clear a path by destroying the outlying US support bases"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHemos descubierto uno de nuestros equipos de demolición. Nos ayudará a abrir un camino destruyendo las bases de apoyo americanas."
IT: "\nAbbiamo individuato una squadra di demolizione: ci aiuterà ad aprirci una strada, distruggendo le basi di supporto USA esterne."
KO: "\n아군 폭파 팀을 만났습니다. 그들은 미국군 지원 기지를 파괴함으로써 진로를 확보하도록\n우리를 도울 것입니다."
ZH: "\n我們已找到爆破小隊，他們將炸毀美軍邊陲地帶的補給基地，以幫助我們掃清進路。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen08Subtitle
US: "*General. We must secure the airfield before the transport plane arrives. The survival of the GLA depends on your success"
DE: "*General. We must secure the airfield before the transport plane arrives. The survival of the GLA depends on your success"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el aeródromo debe ser seguro cuando llegue el avión de transporte. La supervivencia del GLA depende de ese éxito."
IT: "\nGenerale, dobbiamo conquistare l'aeroporto prima dell'arrivo del trasporto aereo. Dal vostro successo dipende la sopravvivenza dell'ELG."
KO: "\n장군님, 수송기가 도착하기 전에 비행장을 확보해야 합니다.\nGLA 병력의 운명이 장군님의 성공 여부에 달려있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們必須在運輸機抵達之前死守機場，這項任務的成功與否將關係到全球解放軍的存亡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen09Subtitle
US: "*Our Combat Cycles are very versatile. They enhance the abilities of our loyal infantry, and are able to travel over rough terrain. They are even able to survive a jump off cliffs. Use them to bypass American strong-points and attack their vulnerable sides"
DE: "*Our Combat Cycles are very versatile. They enhance the abilities of our loyal footsoldiers, and are able to travel over rough terrain. They are even able to survive a jump off cliffs. Use them to bypass American strongpoints and attack their vulnerable sides"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestras motos de combate son versátiles. Complementan a los soldados y superan terrenos abruptos. Incluso resisten fuertes caídas. Úsalas para superar posiciones fuertes de los americanos y atacar sus puntos vulnerables."
IT: "\nLe Moto da combattimento sono versatili e potenziano i nostri fanti. Sono in grado di superare dirupi e terreni accidentati. Usatele per superare le postazioni americane e colpire dove il nemico è vulnerabile."
KO: "\n우리의 컴뱃 사이클은 여러 모로 유용합니다. 거친 지형의 탐색이 가능하고, 심지어\n절벽에서 점프할 수도 있습니다.\n미군의 취약한 부분을 우회 공격하는데 사용하십시오."
ZH: "\n我方的戰鬥摩托車屬於全面性多功能的載具，不僅提高了步兵的攻擊能力，還能行進於高低不平的地形\n上，甚至從懸崖上猛然一躍依然能完好無缺。利用他們繞過美軍要塞，並適時突襲他們脆弱的防線。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen10Subtitle
US: "*General! The Americans have sent a second group of pursuers to capture our leader. Protect him at all costs!"
DE: "*General! The Americans have sent a second group of pursuers to capture our leader. Protect him at all costs!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General! Los americanos han enviado un segundo grupo para capturar a nuestro líder. ¡Hay que protegerlo a cualquier precio!"
IT: "\nGenerale! Gli americani hanno inviato un secondo gruppo per catturare il nostro leader: proteggetelo!"
KO: "\n장군님! 미국군은 우리의 지도자를 생포하기 위해 두번째 추격 부대를 보냈습니다.\n무슨 일이 있어도 그를 보호하십시오!"
ZH: "\n將軍！美軍已派出第二支追緝隊要活捉我方領導人，務必不計任何代價來保護他！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen11Subtitle
US: "*General, this hidden base can provide us with the resources we need to push past the American siege and reach the airfield"
DE: "*General, this hidden base can provide us with the resources we need to push past the American siege and reach the airfield"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, con los recursos de esta base oculta podemos superar\nel cerco americano y llegar al aeródromo."
IT: "***"
KO: "장군님, 이 숨겨진 기지는 미국의 포위를 뚫고 비행장에 도착하는 데 도움을 줄 것입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，這個秘密基地可以提供我們向美軍基地推進時所需的資源，並且順利到達機場。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen12Subtitle
US: "*General, our leader is under attack! He must not fall to the Americans!"
DE: "*General, our leader is under attack! He must not fall to the Americans!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, atacan a nuestro líder! ¡No debe caer ante los americanos!"
IT: "\nGenerale, il nostro leader è sotto attacco! Non deve cadere!"
KO: "장군님, 우리의 지도자가 공격받고 있습니다! 그는 미국군의 손에 희생되어서는 안됩니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，我方領導人有危險！絕對不能讓他掉入美軍的手中！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen13Subtitle
US: "*General, your forces are moving too far ahead of our leader. Remember that he must reach the airfield if our cause is to survive"
DE: "*General, your forces are moving too far ahead of our leader. Remember that he must reach the airfield if our cause is to survive"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTus fuerzas están dejando atrás a nuestro líder.\nDebe llegar al aeródromo para que nuestra causa sobreviva."
IT: "\nGenerale, le nostre truppe sono troppo lontane dal leader."
KO: "\n장군님, 병력이 우리의 지도자로부터 너무 멀리 떨어져 있습니다.\n우리의 대의 명분을 지켜 나가기 위해서 그는 반드시 비행장에 도달해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，你的部隊超越我方領導人太遠了，如果我們的目標是要存活下來，切記一定要順利到達機場。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen14Subtitle
US: "*Another American base. It must be eliminated. Be wary of their Fire Bases, sir"
DE: "*Another American base. It must be eliminated. Be wary of their Fire Bases, sir"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nOtra base americana. Debe ser eliminada. Cuidado con sus bases de disparo."
IT: "\nUn'altra base americana: distruggetela e fate attenzione alle Basi di fuoco."
KO: "또 다른 미국군 기지입니다. 반드시 제거하십시오. 미국군의 파이어 베이스를 조심하십시오."
ZH: "\n另一個美軍基地，一定要消滅它。小心他們的火力基地，長官。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen15Subtitle
US: "*We are within reach of the airfield, General. Destroy the American forces and secure the area that we may fly our leader to safety"
DE: "*We are within reach of the airfield, General. Destroy the American forces and secure the area that we may fly our leader to safety"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTenemos el aeródromo al alcance, general. Destruye las fuerzas americanas y asegura el área; así nuestro líder volará seguro."
IT: "\nSiamo vicini all'aeroporto, generale: annientate le forze americane e controllate la zona, per portare in salvo il nostro leader."
KO: "\n비행장 부근에 도달했습니다, 장군님. 미국군을 파괴하고 비행장을 확보하여\n우리의 지도자를 안전한 곳으로 피신시켜야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我們已經進入機場的範圍了，將軍。摧毀美軍部隊並守護此區，讓領導人能安然離開。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen16Subtitle
US: "*Well done, General. With you in command, we can not fail"
DE: "*Well done, General. With you in command, we can not fail"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBien hecho, general. Contigo al mando, no podemos fallar."
IT: "\nBen fatto, generale: con lei alla guida non possiamo fallire."
KO: "잘하셨습니다, 장군님. 장군님의 지도하에 우리는 실패를 모르게 되었습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍。有你英明的指揮，我們是不會輸的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen17Subtitle
US: "*We have reached the airfield, sir. Make sure our leader is ready and waiting at the air strip when his plane arrives"
DE: "*We have reached the airfield, sir. Make sure our leader is ready and waiting at the air strip when his plane arrives"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHemos alcanzado el aeródromo. Asegúrate de que nuestro líder esté esperando en la pista cuando llegue su avión."
IT: "\nSiamo all'aeroporto: fate in modo che il leader sia sano e salvo sulla pista, all'arrivo dell'aereo."
KO: "비행장에 도달하였습니다. 비행기가 도착할때 지도자가 활주로에서 대기하고 있어야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我們已經抵達機場，長官。當飛機飛抵機場時，請確認領導人一切準備就緒並等待登機。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen18Subtitle
US: "*Our plane is on approach, General! Just hold your position for a little longer. Our leader must survive to board that plane!"
DE: "*Our plane is on approach, General! Just hold your position for a little longer. Our leader must survive to board that plane!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nuestro avión se acerca, general! Sólo hay que aguantar un poco más. ¡Nuestro líder debe subir a ese avión!"
IT: "\nL'aereo sta arrivando, generale! Resistete ancora qualche istante, il nostro leader deve sopravvivere!"
KO: "\n비행기가 오고 있습니다, 장군님. 위치를 조금만 더 사수하면 됩니다.\n우리의 지도자는 반드시 비행기에 살아서 탑승해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n我方飛機快接近機場了，將軍！再抵擋敵軍一會兒守住陣線，直到我方領導人安全地登機。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen19Subtitle
US: "*The plane has arrived. Load our leader in so that we may fly him to safety and regroup"
DE: "*The plane has arrived. Load our leader in so that we may fly him to safety and regroup"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHa llegado el avión. Que suba nuestro líder para que podamos ponerle a salvo y reagruparnos."
IT: "\nL'aereo è arrivato: fate salire il leader e radunate le vostre forze."
KO: "비행기가 도착했습니다. 우리의 지도자를 탑승시켜 안전한 곳으로 피신시키고\n후에 재집결하도록 합니다."
ZH: "\n飛機已經抵達機場，盡快讓領導人登機，讓我們將他送至安全的地點，並重新整編部隊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen20Subtitle
US: "*The plane is waiting for our leader to board. Make haste and bring him in, General. Our forces cannot hold out indefinitely against the Americans"
DE: "*The plane is waiting for our leader to board. Make haste and bring him in, General. Our forces cannot hold out indefinitely against the Americans"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl avión está esperando a que suba nuestro líder. Hay que traerlo enseguida, general. No resistiremos indefinidamente ante los americanos."
IT: "\nL'aereo attende il nostro leader: cercate di sbrigarvi, generale, le nostre forze non reggeranno a lungo contro gli americani."
KO: "\n비행기가 우리의 지도자의 탑승을 기다리고 있습니다. 서둘러 그를 탑승시키십시오.\n우리의 병력은 미국군의 공격을 오래 버텨내지 못합니다."
ZH: "\n飛機已經停妥正在等待領導人登機，快催促他登機，將軍。我方部隊不知道還能抵抗美軍多久。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen21Subtitle
US: "*Our operative, Jarmen Kell, has been harassing the American supply lines. He will be of great help to our mission, General"
DE: "*Our operative, Jarmen Kell, has been harrassing the American supply lines. He will be of great help to our mission, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestro agente, Jarmen Kell, ha estado acechando las líneas de suministro americanas. Será de gran ayuda para esta misión, general."
IT: "\nIl nostro agente, Jarmen Kell, sta disturbando i rifornimenti americani. Sarà molto utile per la vostra missione, generale."
KO: "\n우리의 공작원 쟈멘 켈이 미국군의 보급선을 교란하고 있습니다.\n그는 우리의 임무에 큰 도움을 줄 것입니다."
ZH: "\n我方幹員賈曼卡爾正在對美軍補給線進行侵擾，他將對我們的任務有極大的貢獻，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen22Subtitle
US: "*Excellent work, General. We will show the Americans that we still have the power to resist them"
DE: "*Excellent work, General. We will show the Americans that we still have the power to resist them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nExcelente trabajo, general. Los americanos van a ver\nque aún tenemos fuerzas para resistir."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, generale!"
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 미국군에게 우리가 아직 저항할 힘이 있다는 걸 보여줍시다."
ZH: "\n漂亮，將軍。讓美國人看看我們還是有反抗能力的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen23Subtitle
US: "*We have discovered an advance scout force, General. They have offered to aid us with our mission"
DE: "*We have discovered an advance scout force, General. They have offered to aid us with our mission"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHemos descubierto una avanzadilla de reconocimiento. Se han ofrecido para colaborar en la misión."
IT: "\nAbbiamo scoperto una squadra di ricognizione, generale: ci aiuteranno nella nostra missione."
KO: "고등 정찰 병력을 발견했습니다, 장군님. 그들이 우리의 임무 수행에 도움을 줄 것입니다."
ZH: "\n我們發現一支偵搜部隊，將軍。他們願意支援完成我方任務。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen24Subtitle
US: "*General! Take out the American power plants to shut down their base defenses!"
DE: "*General! Take out the American power plants to shut down their base defenses!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General! ¡Hay que acabar con las centrales eléctricas americanas para anular sus defensas de base!"
IT: "\nGenerale! Distruggete le centrali energetiche USA\nper disattivare le difese della loro base!"
KO: "장군님, 미국군의 발전소를 파괴하여 기지 방어 시설을 무력화시키십시오!"
ZH: "\n將軍！摧毀美軍發電廠，癱瘓他們基地的防禦能力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA01xKen25Subtitle
US: "*Our forces have been weakened, General. We must choose our battles more wisely"
DE: "*Our forces have been weakened, General. We must choose our battles more wisely"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestras fuerzas están debilitadas, general.\nDebemos escoger bien nuestras batallas."
IT: "\nLe nostre forze sono indebolite, generale!"
KO: "우리의 병력이 약화되었습니다, 장군님. 더 현명한 방법으로 전투를 수행해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我方部隊勢力已被削弱，將軍。我們必須好好運用智慧來進行這場戰役。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02Chatter04Subtitle
US: "*We are here and ready for your command"
DE: "*We are here and ready for your command"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAquí estamos, esperando órdenes."
IT: "\nSiamo in attesa di ordini."
KO: "배치 완료! 명령만 내려주십시오!"
ZH: "\n我們在此聽從您的差遣。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02Chatter18Subtitle
US: "*So much for American"
DE: "*So much for American"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nYa está bien de americanos."
IT: "\nNessun problema..."
KO: "미국군 쯤이야!"
ZH: "\n好多美軍…"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
US: superiorite
DE: superioritg
FR: superioritf
ES: superiorits
IT: superioriti
KO: superioritk
ZH: superioritc
BP: superioritb
PL: superioritp
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02General07Subtitle
US: "*American forces are coming. Get ready!"
DE: "*American forces are coming. Get ready!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLlegan las fuerzas americanas. ¡Todos preparados!"
IT: "\nForze americane in arrivo: prepararsi!"
KO: "미국군이 온다! 준비!"
ZH: "\n美軍部隊要攻進來了，準備接戰！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xChat01Subtitle
US: "*The enemy, they are attacking!"
DE: "*The enemy, they are attacking!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡El enemigo ataca!"
IT: "\nIl nemico ci attacca!"
KO: "적이 공격합니다!"
ZH: "\n敵軍展開攻擊了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xChat02Subtitle
US: "*The resistance is too strong, there must be another way"
DE: "*The resistance is too strong, there must be another way"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa resistencia es demasiado fuerte; tiene que haber otra forma."
IT: "\nLa resistenza è troppo forte, dev'esserci un'altra strada."
KO: "저항이 꽤 셉니다. 다른 방법이 있을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n他們的頑強抵抗，一定有其他辦法可以瓦解。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xChat03Subtitle
US: "*The Prince must be stopped. The GLA must not fall to him!"
DE: "*The Prince must be stopped. The GLA must not fall to him!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHay que detener al príncipe. ¡El GLA no ha de caer en sus manos!"
IT: "\nDobbiamo fermare il principe, l'ELG non può cedere!"
KO: "왕자를 멈춰야 합니다. GLA는 그에게 당해서는 안됩니다!"
ZH: "\n一定要阻止王子的進犯，全球解放軍絕不能淪陷在他手上。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xChat04Subtitle
US: "*Our base is under attack!"
DE: "*Our base is under attack!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Atacan nuestra base!"
IT: "\nLa nostra base è sotto attacco!"
KO: "기지가 공격당하고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n我方基地遭到攻擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xChat05Subtitle
US: "*Our Palace is destroyed!"
DE: "*Our Palace is destroyed!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nuestro palacio está destruido!"
IT: "\nHanno distrutto il nostro palazzo!"
KO: "아군의 궁전이 파괴되었습니다!"
ZH: "\n我們的皇宮被摧毀了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xChat06Subtitle
US: "*We have lost our Barracks"
DE: "*We have lost our Barracks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHemos perdido los barracones."
IT: "\nAbbiamo perso la Caserma!"
KO: "아군의 막사가 파괴되었습니다!"
ZH: "\n我方兵營全遭炸毀。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xChat07Subtitle
US: "*We must rebuild our Arms Dealer quickly"
DE: "*We must rebuild our Arms Dealer quickly"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDebemos reconstruir nuestra tienda de armas."
IT: "\nDobbiamo ricostruire il Trafficante d'armi."
KO: "무기상을 빨리 건설해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我們必須盡快重建我方軍火商。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xCin01Subtitle
US: "*This is Recon 1 to base. I am finishing my patrol. Sector is clear"
DE: "*This is Recon 1 to base. I am finishing my patrol. Sector is clear"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAquí Recon 1 a base. Estoy acabando mi patrulla. El sector está despejado."
IT: "\nRicognitore 1 a base, concludo la pattuglia, settore sicuro."
KO: "정찰 1팀이다. 정찰을 마쳤다. 정찰 지역은 안전하다."
ZH: "\n一號偵察車呼叫基地，完成巡邏任務，防禦區沒有發現敵軍蹤跡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xCin02Subtitle
US: "*This is base. Are you certain, Recon 1? We've had reports of troop movements linked to Prince Kassad"
DE: "*This is base. Are you certain, Recon 1? We've had reports of troop movements linked to Prince Kassad"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAquí base. ¿Seguro, Recon 1? Nos informan de movimientos de tropas\nvinculadas al príncipe Kassad."
IT: "\nQui base: conferma, Ricognitore 1."
KO: "여기는 기지다. 확실한가, 정찰1팀? 카사드 왕자와 연관된 부대의 움직임에 대한 보고가 있었다."
ZH: "\n基地回答，你確定嗎，一號偵察車？我們有報告顯示，有科塞德王子部隊移動的消息。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xCin03Subtitle
US: "*I am most certain. I haven't seen anything but dust and shrubs for hours now. Returning to base after this"
DE: "*I am most certain. I haven't seen anything but dust and shrubs for hours now. Returning to base after this"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCompletamente seguro.\nLlevo horas sin ver otra cosa que polvo y matorrales.\nRegresaré a la base a continuación."
IT: "\nNe sono più che certo, ho visto soltanto sabbia e polvere. Torno alla base."
KO: "거의 확실하다. 먼지와 덤불밖에 보이지 않는다. 이제 기지로 돌아간다."
ZH: "\n我非常確定，幾個小時下來我只看到塵土和灌木叢。報告完畢後，立即返回基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xCin04Subtitle
US: "*What the?"
DE: "*What the?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¿Pero qué...?"
IT: "\nMa che..."
KO: "엇, 이건..?"
ZH: "\n挖咧，那是？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xCin05Subtitle
US: "*Recon 1 to base! Enemy contact! Repeat, enemy contact!"
DE: "*Recon 1 to base! Enemy contact! Repeat, enemy contact!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Recon 1 a base! ¡Contacto enemigo! ¡Repito, contacto enemigo!"
IT: "\nRicognitore 1 a base! Contatto nemico! Ripeto, contatto nemico!"
KO: "정찰 1팀이다! 적군과 교전을 시작했다! 반복한다! 적군과 교전이다!"
ZH: "\n一號偵察車呼叫基地！發現敵軍！重述，發現敵軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xCin06Subtitle
US: "*Recon 1! What is your position?"
DE: "*Recon 1! What is your position?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Recon 1! ¿Cuál es tu posición?"
IT: "\nRicognitore 1! Qual è la tua posizione?"
KO: "정찰 1팀! 정확한 위치를 말하라!"
ZH: "\n一號偵察車！報告你的位置？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xCin07Subtitle
US: "*He's preparing to fire!"
DE: "*He's preparing to fire!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Se prepara para atacar!"
IT: "\nSi sta preparando a sparare!"
KO: "적은 이제 막 공격하려고 한다!"
ZH: "\n敵軍正準備開火！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xCin08Subtitle
US: "*Recon 1, what is your status? Recon 1! Report!"
DE: "*Recon 1, what is your status? Recon 1! Report!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecon 1, ¿cuál es tu estado? ¡Recon 1! ¡Informa!"
IT: "\nRicognitore 1! Rispondi!"
KO: "정찰 1팀! 상태가 어떤가? 보고하라!"
ZH: "\n一號偵察車，報告目前狀況？一號偵察車！快回答！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xCin09Subtitle
US: "*Once Prince Kassad is removed the GLA will be under our control. Then vengeance will be ours and the American infidels will burn"
DE: "*Once Prince Kassad is removed the GLA will be under our control. Then vengeance will be ours and the American infidels will burn"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCuando nos deshagamos del príncipe Kassad, controlaremos el GLA. La venganza será nuestra y los infieles americanos arderán."
IT: "\nUna volta eliminato il principe Kassad, l'ELG sarà nostro: potremo vendicarci e gli infedeli americani bruceranno fra le fiamme."
KO: "\n카사드 왕자가제거되면 GLA는 우리의 수중에 들어올 것입니다.\n복수는 우리의 것이고 미국의 이교도들은 불태워질 것입니다."
ZH: "\n一旦科塞德王子的勢力被移除，全球解放軍將會受控於我們。之後我們將展開復仇行動，美國異教徒的\n一切將會灰飛湮滅。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xCin10Subtitle
US: "*Prince Kassad is beginning to take control wherever he can. We must put an end to his vie for power"
DE: "*Prince Kassad is beginning to take control whereever he can. We must put an end to his vie for power"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl príncipe Kassad está tomando el control de todo lo que puede. Debemos acabar con su sed de poder."
IT: "\nIl principe Kassad sta cercando di acquisire sempre più potere: dobbiamo porre fine alla sua ambizione."
KO: "카사드 왕자가 병력을 장악하기 시작했습니다. 그의 야욕을 여기서 멈추어야 합니다."
ZH: "\n科塞德王子所到之處皆已取得掌控權，我們必須終止他的勢力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen01Subtitle
US: "*General, our resources are running low -- we must find a new source of supplies!"
DE: "*General, our resources are running low -- we must find a new source of supplies!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, nos quedan pocos recursos; ¡necesitamos otra fuente de suministros!"
IT: "\nGenerale, le nostre risorse scarseggiano: dobbiamo trovare una nuova fonte di approvvigionamenti!"
KO: "장군님, 자원이 부족해지고 있습니다. 서플라이를 모을 곳을 새로 찾아야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，我們的資源愈來愈少了…必須尋找新的補給來源！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen02Subtitle
US: "*Kassad is attempting to capture nearby resources! We must not let him take what is rightfully ours!"
DE: "*Kassad is attempting to capture nearby resources! We must not let him take what is righfully ours!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Kassad trata de apoderarse de los recursos cercanos! ¡No le dejaremos tomar lo que nos pertenece!"
IT: "\nKassad sta tentando di prendere il controllo delle risorse, non possiamo permetterlo!"
KO: "\n카사드가 근처의 자원을 차지하려 합니다! 당연히 우리 것인 그 자원들을\n그에게 뺏겨서는 안됩니다!"
ZH: "\n科塞德企圖佔領附近的資源！我們必須阻止他奪取應該屬於我們的東西。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen03Subtitle
US: "*We must reunite the GLA under one leader!"
DE: "*We must reunite the GLA under one leader!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Debemos reunificar el GLA bajo un solo líder!"
IT: "\nDobbiamo riunire l'ELG sotto un'unica guida!"
KO: "한 명의 지도자 하에서 GLA를 통일해야 한다!"
ZH: "\n我們必須將全球解放軍重新整合在一個領導人之下。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen04Subtitle
US: "*Beware! Kassad has launched a sneak attack against us!"
DE: "*Beware! Kassad has launched a sneak attack against us!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Cuidado! ¡Kassad nos ha lanzado un ataque furtivo!"
IT: "\nAttenzione! Kassad ha lanciato un Attacco furtivo contro di noi!"
KO: "조심하십시오! 카사드는 잠입 공격을 개시했습니다!"
ZH: "\n小心！科塞德已經向我們進行偷襲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen05Subtitle
US: "*We have much bigger plans than that rat Kassad. The world will quake as we unleash the fury of the GLA"
DE: "*We have much bigger plans than that rat Kassad. The world will quake as we unleash the fury of the GLA"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTenemos planes mucho mayores que esa rata de Kassad. El mundo temblará cuando se desate la furia del GLA."
IT: "\nAbbiamo grandi progetti per questo piccolo mondo, al contrario di quel verme di Kassad."
KO: "\n그 생쥐같은 카사드보다 훨씬 웅대한 계획이 있습니다.\n우리가 GLA의 분노를 폭발시킬때, 천지가 진동할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n我們比那鼠輩科塞德擁有更了不起的計畫。當全球解放軍發洩心中的怒吼時，整個世界都將為之震撼。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen06Subtitle
US: "*We have acquired GPS Scramble technology! Now we can use Kassad's tricks against him!"
DE: "*We have acquired GPS Scramble technology! Now we can use Kassad's tricks against him!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Tenemos tecnología de codificación GPS!\n¡Le daremos a Kassad su propia medicina!"
IT: "\nAbbiamo recuperato la tecnologia Interferenza GPS!"
KO: "\nGPS 교란 기술을 획득했습니다.\n이제 우리는 카사드의 잔재주를 역으로 그에게 사용할 수 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n我們已獲得GPS干擾器技術！現在我們可以其人之道還治其人之身，來對付科塞德了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen07Subtitle
US: "*Excellent, General! We have secured the Sneak Attack ability!"
DE: "*Excellent, General! We have secured the Sneak Attack ability!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Excelente, general! ¡Hemos asegurado la capacidad de ataque furtivo!"
IT: "\nOttimo, generale, abbiamo l'abilità Attacco furtivo!"
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님! 잠입 공격 능력을 확보했습니다!"
ZH: "\n太棒了，將軍！我們取得偷襲能力了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen08Subtitle
US: "*Capture the enemy Command Centers"
DE: "*Capture the enemy Command Centers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nToma los centros de mando enemigos."
IT: "\nConquistate i Centri comando nemici."
KO: "적의 커맨드 센터를 점령하십시오."
ZH: "\n設法佔領敵軍指揮中心。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen09Subtitle
US: "*If we can capture the enemy Command Center we can use their technology against them"
DE: "*If we can capture the enemy Command Center we can use their technology against them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSi tomamos el centro de mando enemigo, podremos usar su tecnología contra ellos."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n만약 적의 커맨드 센터를 점령한다면 우리는 그들의 기술을 역으로 그들에게 사용할 수\n있게 됩니다."
ZH: "\n如果我們佔領敵軍指揮中心，即可運用他們的技術進行反擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen10Subtitle
US: "*General, we must capture their Command Center and use their knowledge to progress towards our goal of uniting the GLA under one flag"
DE: "*General, we must capture their Command Center and use their knowledge to progress towards our goal of uniting the GLA under one flag"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDebemos capturar su centro de mando; sus conocimientos nos ayudarán a unir el GLA bajo una sola bandera."
IT: "\nGenerale, dobbiamo conquistare il loro Centro comando e usare le loro tecnologie per riunire l'ELG sotto un'unica bandiera."
KO: "\n장군님, 적 커맨드 센터를 점령해서 그들의 기술을 사용하여 GLA를 하나의 깃발 아래\n통일하는 우리의 목표로 한 걸음 나아가십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們必須佔領敵軍指揮中心，並利用他們的技術，加速我們在一位領導人帶領之下重整的目標。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen11Subtitle
US: "*We are running low on resources. We must capture some oil derricks"
DE: "*We are running low on resources. We must capture some oil derricks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNos quedan pocos recursos. Debemos tomar algunas torres de perforación."
IT: "\nLe nostre risorse scarseggiano: dobbiamo conquistare qualche Derrick."
KO: "자원이 바닥나고 있습니다. 원유 유정탑을 확보하는게 좋을듯 합니다."
ZH: "\n我們的資源不足，必須佔領一些油井來補充。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen12Subtitle
US: "*Our enemy is attacking our Oil Supply! They must be stopped!"
DE: "*Our enemy is attacking our Oil Supply! They must be stopped!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Atacan nuestro suministro de petróleo! ¡Hay que detenerles!"
IT: "\nIl nemico assalta le nostre fonti di petrolio: dovete fermarlo!"
KO: "적이 우리의 원유 유정탑을 공격하고 있습니다! 이를 저지하십시오!"
ZH: "\n敵軍正在襲擊我方油料補給！快阻止他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen13Subtitle
US: "*Use the GPS scramble to sneak past the enemy defenses!"
DE: "*Use the GPS scramble to sneak past the enemy defenses!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Usa el codificador GPS para superar inadvertido las defensas enemigas!"
IT: "\nUsate l'Interferenza GPS per superare le difese nemiche!"
KO: "GPS 교란 장치를 활용하여 적 수비진을 뚫고 들어가십시오!"
ZH: "\n利用GPS干擾器悄悄穿越敵軍防線！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen14Subtitle
US: "*The GPS Scramble will not work here, there are too many Stinger Sites.We will need to use a different tactic"
DE: "*The GPS Scramble will not work here, there are too many Stinger Sites.We will need to use a different tactic"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl codificador GPS no funcionará aquí; hay muchos emplazamientos Stinger. Necesitamos otra táctica."
IT: "\nL'Interferenza GPS non funzionerà, ci sono troppe Postazioni Stinger: dovremo usare un'altra tattica."
KO: "\n너무 많은 스팅어 사이트가 있어서 GPS 교란장치는 여기서 작동하지 않습니다.\n다른 전술을 사용해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n由於太多針刺飛彈陣地，使得GPS干擾器無用武之地。我們必須運用其他戰術。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen15Subtitle
US: "*Perhaps we can find an unguarded area to use our new Sneak Attack ability"
DE: "*Perhaps we can find an unguarded area to use our new Sneak Attack ability"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nQuizá en un área sin vigilar podamos usar nuestro nuevo ataque furtivo."
IT: "\nForse potremo usare l'abilità Attacco furtivo in una zona poco sorvegliata."
KO: "\n아마 방어가 허술한 지역을 찾아서 우리의 새로 획득한 잠입 공격 능력을 사용할 수 있을\n것입니다."
ZH: "\n或許可用我們新的偷襲能力，運用在防禦薄弱的區域上。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen16Subtitle
US: "*Do not destroy the Command Center. We need to capture the structure and keep it intact"
DE: "*Do not destroy the Command Center. We need to capture the structure and keep it intact"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNo destruyas el centro de mando. Necesitamos tomarlo y mantenerlo intacto."
IT: "\nNon distruggete il Centro comando, la struttura ci serve intatta."
KO: "커맨드 센터를 파괴하지 마십시오. 그 건물을 점령하고 파괴되지 않게 해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n切記不要摧毀指揮中心，我們必須完好無缺的佔領它。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen17Subtitle
US: "*Their knowledge must be stolen. We need to use their advanced tactics to defeat them!"
DE: "*Their knowledge must be stolen. We need to use their advanced tactics to defeat them!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDebemos apoderarnos de su conocimiento. ¡Con sus tácticas avanzadas les derrotaremos!"
IT: "\nDobbiamo rubare le loro tecnologie: useremo le loro tattiche contro di loro!"
KO: "그들의 기술을 훔쳐야 합니다. 그들의 진보된 기술을 사용하여 그들을 무찔러야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n我們必須偷學他們的經驗及技術，並運用更先進的戰術來擊敗他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen18Subtitle
US: "*General, be wary of snipers -- Kassad loves to use them"
DE: "*General, be wary of snipers -- Kassad loves to use them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, cuidado con los francotiradores; Kassad suele emplearlos."
IT: "Generale, attenzione ai cecchini, Kassad li utilizza spesso."
KO: "장군님, 저격병을 조심하십시오. 카사드는 저격병을 잘 사용합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，小心提防狙擊手…他們是科塞德最愛的戰術。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen19Subtitle
US: "*This bridge is heavily defended. We will need assistance in getting across it"
DE: "*This bridge is heavily defended. We will need assistance in getting across it"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEste puente está fuertemente resguardado. Necesitaremos ayuda para cruzarlo."
IT: "\nQuesto ponte è pesantemente difeso, avremo bisogno di assistenza."
KO: "이 다리는 경계가 삼엄합니다. 건널려면 지원 병력이 필요할 것 같습니다."
ZH: "\n橋頭陣線防禦嚴密，我們需要支援才能過橋。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen20Subtitle
US: "*Capture the enemy Command Center to the North!"
DE: "*Capture the enemy Command Center to the North!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Toma el centro de mando enemigo del norte!"
IT: "\nConquistate il Centro comando nemico a nord!"
KO: "북쪽의 커맨드 센터를 점령하라!"
ZH: "\n佔領北邊的敵軍指揮中心！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen21Subtitle
US: "*Capture the enemy Command Center to the West!"
DE: "*Capture the enemy Command Center to the West!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Toma el centro de mando enemigo del oeste!"
IT: "\nConquistate il Centro comando nemico a ovest!"
KO: "서쪽의 커맨드 센터를 점령하라!"
ZH: "\n佔領西邊的敵軍指揮中心！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen22Subtitle
US: "*General, if we capture this cannon, we can use it against Kassad's forces!"
DE: "*General, if we capture this cannon, we can use it against Kassad's forces!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, si tomamos este cañón, podemos usarlo contra las fuerzas de Kassad!"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군님, 캐논을 점령하면 카사드의 병력을 상대로 이를 사용할 수 있게 됩니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，如果我們拿下這門加農砲，可用來對付科塞德的部隊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen23Subtitle
US: "*If we capture the Command Center, we can use their abilities to turn the tide of this battle"
DE: "*If we capture the Command Center, we can use their abilities to turn the tide of this battle"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSi tomamos el centro de mando, podremos cambiar el signo de esta batalla\ncon sus capacidades."
IT: "\nConquistate il Centro comando per usare le abilità nemiche."
KO: "커맨드 센터를 점령하면, 그들의 기술을 이용하여 전세를 뒤집을 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n如果我們佔領指揮中心，即可利用他們的技術將戰爭局勢逆轉。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen24Subtitle
US: "*Prince Kassad is no more. The GLA are once again united against our enemies!"
DE: "*Prince Kassad is no more. The GLA are once again united against our enemies!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSe acabó el príncipe Kassad. ¡El GLA vuelve a estar unido contra sus enemigos!"
IT: "\nIl principe Kassad è morto: l'ELG è di nuovo unito contro i suoi nemici!"
KO: "카사드 왕자는 이제 사라졌습니다. GLA는 다시 하나가 되어 적들에 맞설 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n科塞德王子的時代已經過了，全球解放軍又再一次重整以對抗敵軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen25Subtitle
US: "*Now that we have GPS scramble, we can move unseen past Kassad's bridge defenses!"
DE: "*Now that we have GPS scramble, we can move unseen past Kassad's bridge defenses!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Con el codificador GPS, podremos atravesar las defensas del puente\nde Kassad sin ser vistos!"
IT: "\nCon l'Interferenza GPS possiamo superare le difese del ponte!"
KO: "\n이제 GPS 교란장치를 사용하여 카사드의 다리 수비진을 들키지 않고 통과할 수 있게\n되었습니다!"
ZH: "\n由於現在擁有GPS干擾器，我們可以通過科塞德的橋頭防線，而不為所知。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen26Subtitle
US: "*The traitor has fortified himself on this hilltop and cut all other means of access. Sneak Attack is the only way we have to strike at his main base"
DE: "*The traitor has fortified himself on this hilltop and cut all other means of access. Sneak Attack is the only way we have to strike at his main base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl traidor se ha hecho fuerte en la cumbre y ha cortado las\notras vías de acceso. Sólo podremos asaltar su base con un ataque furtivo."
IT: "\nUsate l'Attacco furtivo per raggiungere il traditore."
KO: "\n그 배반자는 언덕 위에 요새를 짓고 접근할 수 있는 모든 길을 차단했습니다.\n잠입 공격이 그의 본 기지를 공격할 수 있는 유일한 방법입니다."
ZH: "\n這個叛徒已在山頂上修築防禦工事，並切斷所有進路。因此偷襲是我們進攻主要基地的唯一途徑。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen27Subtitle
US: "*General, this area is being controlled by Prince Kassad. He has turned his back on his brethren and will not aid us in our cause against the infidels"
DE: "*General, this area is being controlled by Prince Kassad. He has turned his back on his brethren and will not aid us in our cause against the infidels"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el príncipe Kassad controla esta área. Ha dado la espalda a\nsus hermanos; no colaborará en nuestra cruzada contra los infieles."
IT: "\nGenerale, questa zona è sotto il controllo del principe Kassad."
KO: "\n장군님, 이 지역은 카사드 왕자의 통제 하에 있습니다. 그는 동족을 배반하고 이교도 처단을\n향한 우리의 대의 명분에 협조하지 않을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，這個區域是由科塞德王子所控管，他已經背棄弟兄們，也不會幫助我們共同對抗美國。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen28Subtitle
US: "*Kassad is a master of stealth, hiding his forces in plain sight. He refuses to share his knowledge with us, so we will take it from him"
DE: "*Kassad is a master of stealth, hiding his forces in plain sight. He refuses to share his knowledge with us, so we will take it from him"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nKassad es un maestro ocultando sus fuerzas en cualquier lugar. No quiere compartir su conocimiento, así que se lo arrebataremos."
IT: "\nKassad possiede tecnologie di cui abbiamo bisogno."
KO: "\n카사드는 스텔스의 달인이라 그의 병력을 잘 숨깁니다.\n그는 우리에게 기술을 넘겨주지 않으므로, 힘으로 뺏는 수밖에 없습니다."
ZH: "\n科塞德善於運用隱形，神不知鬼不覺的讓部隊隱形在大庭廣眾之下。既然他拒絕教授我們技巧，我們只\n得從他那裡竊取了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen29Subtitle
US: "*A GLA splinter cell commanded by Prince Kassad is controlling this area. Kassad refuses to let us use his abilities for the good of the GLA"
DE: "*A GLA splinter cell commanded by Prince Kassad is controlling this area. Kassad refuses to let us use his abilities for the good of the GLA"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa zona está controlada por una célula escindida del GLA con el príncipe Kassad al mando, que no permite que el GLA haga uso de sus capacidades."
IT: "\nUn gruppo ribelle dell'ELG, guidato dal principe Kassad, controlla questa zona. Kassad non vuole mettere le sue abilità a disposizione dell'ELG."
KO: "\n카사드 왕자의 지휘를 받는 GLA의 세포 조직이 이 지역을 지휘하고 있습니다.\n카사드는 우리가 GLA의 발전을 위해 그의 기술을 사용하는 것을 거부했습니다."
ZH: "\n由科塞德王子所統帥的全球解放軍分裂派系，已經控制此區。科塞德拒絕成全全球解放軍來運用他的技\n能。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen30Subtitle
US: "*Kassad is a master of stealth, relying on several techniques to surprise and attack his enemies"
DE: "*Kassad is a master of stealth, relying on several techniques to surprise and attack his enemies"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nKassad domina las técnicas de encubrimiento y ataque por sorpresa."
IT: "\nKassad possiede tecnologie di cui abbiamo bisogno."
KO: "카사드는 스텔스의 달인으로, 적들을 기습하는 몇몇 기술을 가지고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n科塞德善於運用隱形，並憑藉數種奇襲的技能來擊敗敵軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen31Subtitle
US: "*GPS scramble gives him the power to have any unit strike unseen against an enemy"
DE: "*GPS scramble gives him the power to have any unit strike unseen against an enemy"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa codificación GPS le da el poder de atacar al enemigo sin ser visto."
IT: "\nL'Interferenza GPS permette a qualsiasi unità di colpire il nemico non vista."
KO: "GPS 교란장치는 적에게 들키지 않고 공격하는 것을 가능하게 합니다."
ZH: "\nGPS干擾器使任何單位皆獲得隱形的能力以對抗敵軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen32Subtitle
US: "*Tunnel sneak attacks offer further tactical advantages"
DE: "*Tunnel sneak attacks offer further tactical advantages"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl ataque furtivo en túnel ofrece ventajas tácticas adicionales..."
IT: "\nGli attacchi tramite i tunnel offrono evidenti vantaggi tattici."
KO: "터널 잠입 공격은 전략적 이익을 가져다 줍니다."
ZH: "\n使用地道偷襲能力將可以取得更多的戰術優勢。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA02xKen33Subtitle
US: "*We must have these technologies. If Kassad will not share, we will take them from him. Capture his command centers and turn his own abilities against him!"
DE: "*We must have these technologies. If Kassad will not share, we will take them from him. Capture his command centers and turn his own abilities against him!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNecesitamos esa tecnología. Si Kassad no la comparte\nse la arrebataremos.\n¡Toma sus centros de mando y emplea sus capacidades contra él!"
IT: "\nKassad non vuole cederle: ce le prenderemo."
KO: "\n이 기술들을 반드시 탈취해야 합니다. 만약 카사드가 기술 제공을 거부하면, 그에게서\n뺏는 수밖에 없습니다. 커맨드 센터를 점령하고 그의 기술을 사용하여 그를 공격하십시오!"
ZH: "\n我們一定要取得這些技術，如果科塞德不願分享，我們將竊取這些能力。設法佔領指揮中心，讓科塞德\n自食惡果。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03Kenwar03Subtitle
US: "*Free our imprisoned brothers"
DE: "*Free our imprisoned brothers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLibera a nuestros hermanos apresados."
IT: "\nLiberate i nostri fratelli prigionieri."
KO: "우리의 형제들을 해방하십시오!"
ZH: "\n釋放我們被囚禁的弟兄們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03Kenwar15Subtitle
US: "*We have spotted a Prison Camp, our brothers are held inside"
DE: "*We have spotted a Prison Camp, our brothers are held inside"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHemos divisado un campo de prisioneros donde retienen a nuestros hermanos."
IT: "\nAbbiamo individuato un campo di prigionia."
KO: "포로 수용소를 발견했습니다. 우리의 형제들이 안에 갇혀있습니다."
ZH: "\n我方發現了一個戰俘營，我們的弟兄被扣留其中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xBrf01Subtitle
US: "*Welcome, Commander!"
DE: "*Welcome, Commander!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Bienvenido, comandante!"
IT: "***"
KO: "안녕하십니까, 사령관님."
ZH: "\n歡迎您，指揮官！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xBrf02Subtitle
US: "*Kassad was too cowardly to make an attempt against the US such as this. General, you are truly a master mind"
DE: "*Kassad was too cowardly to make an attempt against the US such as this. General, you are truly a master mind"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nKassad era demasiado cobarde para ir contra los EE.UU.\nGeneral, gozas de una mente privilegiada."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n카사드는 너무 겁장이라 미국에 이런 식으로 대항할 용기기 없습니다.\n장군님. 정말 위대한 지도자이십니다."
ZH: "\n科塞德真是膽小如鼠，根本無法與美國抗衡。將軍，您才是有膽識與才智的領導人。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xBrf03Subtitle
US: "*Once the US Mediterranean naval force is shattered all of Europe will be in our grasp"
DE: "*Once the US Mediterranean naval force is shattered all of Europe will be in our grasp"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nUna vez destruida la flota americana del mediterráneo,\nEuropa estará a nuestro alcance."
IT: "***"
KO: "미국 지중해 해군 병력이 붕괴되면 전 유럽이 우리 손 안에 들어올 것입니다."
ZH: "\n一旦美國在地中海的海軍部隊被粉碎後，整個歐洲將落入我們的支配。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xBrf04Subtitle
US: "*Now that we are again united, it is time to make our strength felt!"
DE: "*Now that we are again united, it is time to make our strength felt!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Ahora que volvemos a estar unidos, haremos sentir nuestro poder!"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 우리가 다시 하나가 되었으니, 우리의 힘을 떨칠 때가 왔습니다!"
ZH: "\n我們現在又再次重整勢力，感受一下我們的力量！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xBrf05Subtitle
US: "*The USA has attacked our secret base in the Mediterranean"
DE: "*The USA has attacked our secret base in the Mediterranean"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos EE.UU. han atacado nuestra base secreta del Mediterráneo."
IT: "\nGli USA hanno assalito la nostra base segreta nel Mediterraneo."
KO: "미국이 지중해에 있는 우리의 비밀 기지를 공격했습니다."
ZH: "\n美國正在攻擊我方位於地中海的秘密基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xBrf06Subtitle
US: "*But before it was wiped out, we learned of the location of their Particle Cannon and naval fleet in the region"
DE: "*But before it was wiped out, we learned of the location of their Particle Cannon and naval fleet in the region"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nPero antes averiguamos la ubicación de su cañón de partículas y su flota naval en la zona."
IT: "\nPrima che la annientassero, però, abbiamo localizzato il loro Cannone particellare e la loro flotta."
KO: "\n그러나 그 기지가 제거되기 전에, 그들의 파티클 캐논과 해군 함대의 위치를 알아내는데\n성공했습니다."
ZH: "\n在肅清他們之前，我們得知他們在此區擁有離子砲及海軍艦隊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xBrf07Subtitle
US: "*Most of their ships are in port and helpless. We will steal their Particle Cannon and use it to take out their Aircraft Carrier!"
DE: "*Most of their ships are in port and helpless. We will steal their Particle Cannon and use it to take out their Aircraft Carrier!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCasi todos sus barcos están atracados e indefensos. ¡Robaremos su cañón de partículas para eliminar con él su portaaviones!"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n대부분의 함정들은 항구에 있고 무방비상태입니다. 우리는 그들의 파티클 캐논을 탈취하여\n그들의 항공모함을 격파하는데 사용할 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n他們大部分船艦都停泊在港口內而且並無用處。我們將竊取他們的離子砲，用以炸毀他們的航空母艦。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xBrf08Subtitle
US: "*Look for an opportunity to reclaim and rebuild our secret base"
DE: "*Look for an opportunity to reclaim and rebuild our secret base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBusca la forma de recuperar y reconstruir nuestra base secreta."
IT: "\nRiconquistate e ricostruite la nostra base segreta."
KO: "기회를 봐서 우리의 기지를 다시 탈취하여 재건해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n找機會收回並重建我方秘密基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xChat01Subtitle
US: "*We'll die for you!"
DE: "*We'll die for you!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Moriremos por ti!"
IT: "\nSiamo pronti a morire per voi!"
KO: "목숨을 바치자!"
ZH: "\n為了你，我們死不足惜。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xChat02Subtitle
US: "*Another one bites the dust"
DE: "*Another one bites the dust"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nOtro que muerde el polvo."
IT: "\nUn altro nemico distrutto."
KO: "또 한명이 죽어나가는군."
ZH: "\n又一個陣亡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xChat03Subtitle
US: "*More victims for me"
DE: "*More victims for me"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMás víctimas para mí."
IT: "\nAltre vittime per me."
KO: "내가 더 많이 파괴하겠어."
ZH: "\n又有更多人來送死了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xChat04Subtitle
US: "*Mow them down!"
DE: "*Mow them down!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Hagámosles picadillo!"
IT: "\nChe muoiano!"
KO: "다 쓸어버리자!"
ZH: "\n一個都不要留！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xChat05Subtitle
US: "*They cannot escape our wrath!"
DE: "*They cannot escape our wrath!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡No escaparán a nuestra furia!"
IT: "\nNon possono sfuggirci!"
KO: "우리의 분노에서 탈출할 수 없다!"
ZH: "\n他們逃不掉我們的懲罰！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xChat06Subtitle
US: "*We have them where we want them!"
DE: "*We have them where we want them!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Los tenemos donde los queremos!"
IT: "\nSono proprio dove li vogliamo!"
KO: "우리가 맘만 먹으면 이렇게 다 없애버릴 수 있지!"
ZH: "\n他們逃不出我們的手掌心！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xChat07Subtitle
US: "*Victory will be ours!"
DE: "*Victory will be ours!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡La victoria será nuestra!"
IT: "\nLa vittoria sarà nostra!"
KO: "승리는 우리의 것이다!"
ZH: "\n勝利將是屬於我們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xChat08Subtitle
US: "*That made a big splash!"
DE: "*That made a big splash!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Menudo salpicón!"
IT: "\nChe botto!"
KO: "정말 물 한번 크게 튀는군!"
ZH: "\n炸得漂亮啊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xCin01Subtitle
US: "*We will avenge this cowardly attack!"
DE: "*We will avenge this cowardly attack!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nos vengaremos de este ataque cobarde!"
IT: "\nVendicheremo questo vile attacco!"
KO: "이런 비겁한 공격에 복수를 해주겠다!"
ZH: "\n我們將報這卑劣攻擊的一箭之仇！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xCin02Subtitle
US: "*Their carrier will be turned into scrap!"
DE: "*Their carrier will be turned into scrap!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Haremos añicos su portaaviones!"
IT: "\nFaremo a pezzi la loro portaerei."
KO: "놈들의 항공모함을 고철로 만들자!"
ZH: "\n他們的航空母艦將會變成破銅爛鐵！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xCin03Subtitle
US: "*We have proven the might of the GLA!"
DE: "*We have proven the might of the GLA!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Hemos demostrado el poder del GLA!"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리는 GLA의 위력을 몸소 보여줬다!"
ZH: "\n我們證實了全球解放軍的威力！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen01Subtitle
US: "*Our Hijackers could take that tank easily"
DE: "*Our Hijackers could take that tank easily"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리의 하이재커들이 탱크를 쉽게 처리할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n我方劫持犯可以輕鬆的偷取那輛坦克。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen02Subtitle
US: "*That Ranger is running for help! We must not let him get away"
DE: "*That Ranger is running for help! We must not let him get away"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Ese ranger va en busca de ayuda! No podemos permitir que escape."
IT: "\nQuel Ranger sta andando a cercare aiuto! Non deve sfuggirci."
KO: "저 레인저가 도움을 요청하러 도망갑니다! 그냥 놔둬서는 안됩니다."
ZH: "\n那個遊騎兵跑去求救了！不能讓他跑了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen03Subtitle
US: "*We'll need this Particle Cannon to sink the enemy Carrier. Defend it well!"
DE: "*We'll need this Particle Cannon to sink the enemy Carrier. Defend it well!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNecesitamos este cañón de partículas para hundir la nave enemiga.\n¡Defiéndelo bien!"
IT: "\nCi serve questo Cannone particellare per affondare la portaerei nemica: difendetelo."
KO: "적 항공모함을 침몰시키려면 이 파티클 캐논이 필요합니다. 잘 방어하십시오."
ZH: "\n我們需要這門離子砲來擊沈敵軍的航空母艦，好好守住它！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen04Subtitle
US: "*Our rebels can use their Capture Building ability to take control of the Particle Cannon"
DE: "*Our rebels can use their Capture Building ability to take control of the Particle Cannon"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestros rebeldes, con su capacidad para tomar un edificio, pueden apoderarse del cañón de partículas."
IT: "\nI nostri Ribelli possono usare l'abilità Conquista struttura per catturare il Cannone particellare."
KO: "우리의 반군이 건물 점령 능력을 사용하여 파티클 캐논을 점령할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n反抗軍可以利用佔領建築的技能，來控制離子砲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen05Subtitle
US: "*We can use our Sneak Attack to create Tunnel Networks on nearby islands"
DE: "*We can use our Sneak Attack to create Tunnel Networks on nearby islands"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nPodemos utilizar nuestro ataque furtivo para crear redes de túneles en islas cercanas"
IT: "\nPossiamo usare un Attacco furtivo per creare Reti di tunnel sulle isole vicine."
KO: "잠입 공격 능력을 사용하여 터널 네트워크를 가까운 섬에 만들 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n我們可利用偷襲，在附近島嶼建立地道網路系統。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen06Subtitle
US: "*We must not let the pilot reach his Tomahawk!"
DE: "*We must not let the pilot reach his Tomahawk!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡No permitamos que el piloto llegue a su Tomahawk!"
IT: "\nIl pilota non deve raggiungere il suo Tomahawk!"
KO: "조종사가 토마호크를 발사하지 못하게 해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n不能讓駕駛員抵達戰斧飛彈！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen07Subtitle
US: "*They're coming after the Tomahawk!"
DE: "*They're coming after the Tomahawk!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Vienen en busca del Tomahawk!"
IT: "\nStanno venendo per il Tomahawk!"
KO: "토마호크를 쫒고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n他們會於戰斧飛彈之後繼續發動攻擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen08Subtitle
US: "*This Barracks is now ours"
DE: "*This Barracks is now ours"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAhora estos barracones son nuestros."
IT: "\nOra questa caserma è nostra."
KO: "이제 막사는 우리의 것입니다."
ZH: "\n這個兵營現在是我們的了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen09Subtitle
US: "*We have liberated this Palace"
DE: "*We have liberated this Palace"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "궁전을 해방시켰습니다."
ZH: "\n我們解救了這個皇宮。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen10Subtitle
US: "*This Arms Dealer will serve us well"
DE: "*This Arms Dealer will serve us well"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEsta tienda de armas nos será útil."
IT: "\nIl Trafficante d'armi ci sarà utile."
KO: "무기상을 획득했습니다."
ZH: "\n這個軍火商對我們很有幫助。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen11Subtitle
US: "*We have reclaimed our Command Center!"
DE: "*We have reclaimed our Command Center!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Hemos recuperado nuestro centro de mando!"
IT: "\nAbbiamo riconquistato il Centro comando!"
KO: "우리의 커맨드 센터를 되찾았습니다!"
ZH: "\n我們重新奪回指揮中心了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen12Subtitle
US: "*General, do you see those enemy supply planes? If we could destroy their drop zones, we would cripple their production!"
DE: "*General, do you see those enemy supply planes? If we could destroy their drop zones, we would cripple their production!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, ¿ves esos aviones enemigos de suministro?\n¡Si destruimos sus zonas de lanzamiento, paralizaremos su producción!"
IT: "\nGenerale, vedete quegli aerei da trasporto? Distruggendo le loro zone\ndi lancio, bloccheremo i rifornimenti nemici!"
KO: "\n장군님, 적들의 서플라이 수송기가 보이십니까? 그들의 투하 지역을 파괴하면\n그들의 유닛 생산 속도를 저하시킬 수 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，看到那些敵軍的補給飛機了嗎？如果我們能摧毀補給空投區，將能癱瘓他們的建造能力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen13Subtitle
US: "*Ah, this toxic tractor will come in handy"
DE: "*Ah, this toxic tractor will come in handy"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAh, este tractor de toxinas nos vendrá bien."
IT: "\nAh, questo Contaminatore sarà utile."
KO: "아, 이 독소 트랙터는 매우 유용하게 쓰일 것입니다."
ZH: "\n這台毒素車將會派上用場。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen14Subtitle
US: "*These Quad Cannons will defend us from enemy aircraft"
DE: "*These Quad Cannons will defend us from enemy aircraft"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEstos cañones Quad nos defenderán de la aviación enemiga."
IT: "\nQuesti Cannoni quadrupli ci difenderanno dagli aerei nemici."
KO: "이 쿼드 캐논은 적 항공기로부터 우리를 보호할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n這些四管加農砲將能擊落敵軍飛機。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen15Subtitle
US: "*These Marauders will boost our firepower"
DE: "*These Marauders will boost our firepower"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEstos Marauder multiplicarán nuestra potencia de fuego."
IT: "\nQuesti Marauder ci daranno potenza di fuoco."
KO: "이 머로더 탱크는 우리의 화력을 증가시킬 것입니다."
ZH: "\n這些侵略者將促使我們加強軍事火力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen16Subtitle
US: "*Destroy these tanks and we can liberate the Barracks!"
DE: "*Destroy these tanks and we can liberate the Barracks!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Destruye los tanques y liberaremos los barracones!"
IT: "***"
KO: "적 탱크들을 파괴하고 막사를 해방시키십시오!"
ZH: "\n摧毀這些坦克，我們便能解救兵營！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen17Subtitle
US: "*If we clear this area, we can safely occupy the Command Center"
DE: "*If we clear this area, we can safely occupy the Command Center"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSi despejamos esta área, ocuparemos el centro de mando sin peligro."
IT: "\nLiberando questa zona potremo occupare il Centro comando."
KO: "이 지역을 확보하고 커맨드 센터를 점령하면 됩니다."
ZH: "\n如果我們肅清此區，即可成功的佔領指揮中心。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen18Subtitle
US: "*Kill those troops and the Arms Dealer will be ours!"
DE: "*Kill those troops and the Arms Dealer will be ours!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Aniquila a esas tropas y la tienda de armas será nuestra!"
IT: "\nUccidete queste truppe e il Trafficante d'armi sarà vostro."
KO: "저 부대를 제거하고 무기상을 탈취하십시오!"
ZH: "\n清除那些部隊，軍火商就屬於我們的了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen19Subtitle
US: "*They may be launching an attack against us! Defend our buildings!"
DE: "*They may be launching an attack against us! Defend our buildings!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Puede que lancen un ataque contra nosotros! ¡Defiende nuestros edificios!"
IT: "\nPotrebbero lanciare un attacco contro di noi! Difendete le strutture!"
KO: "우리를 향한 공격이 시작될듯 합니다! 우리의 건물을 방어하십시오!"
ZH: "\n他們可能會對我們發動攻擊！小心保護建築！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen20Subtitle
US: "*Comanches! Rally our air defenses!"
DE: "*Comanches! Rally our air defenses!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Comanches! ¡Concentra las defensas aéreas!"
IT: "\nComanche! Preparate le difese antiaeree!"
KO: "코만치다! 방어를 강화하십시오!"
ZH: "\n卡曼契直昇機臨空！啟動所有空中防禦系統！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen21Subtitle
US: "*We must defend against those Comanches!"
DE: "*We must defend against those comanches!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Debemos defendernos de esos Comanches!"
IT: "\nDobbiamo difenderci da quei Comanche!"
KO: "코만치로부터 방어해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n我們必須抵擋那些卡曼契的攻擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen22Subtitle
US: "*They are trying to retake the Particle Cannon!"
DE: "*They are trying to retake the Particle Cannon!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Tratan de recuperar el cañón de partículas!"
IT: "\nStanno cercando di riprendere il Cannone particellare!"
KO: "적들이 파티클 캐논을 다시 탈취하려 합니다!"
ZH: "\n他們企圖要搶回離子砲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen23Subtitle
US: "*Their aircraft have destroyed our Tunnel Network!"
DE: "*Their aircraft have destroyed our Tunnel Network!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Su aviación ha destruido nuestra red de túneles!"
IT: "\nI loro aerei hanno distrutto la Rete di tunnel!"
KO: "적의 항공기가 우리의 터널 네트워크를 파괴했습니다!"
ZH: "\n他們的飛機已摧毀我方的地道網路系統！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen24Subtitle
US: "*Those clever villains! They are targeting our Power Plants. We need power to use the Particle Cannon"
DE: "*Those clever villains! They are targeting our Power Plants. We need power to use the Particle Cannon"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Alimañas retorcidas! Su blanco son nuestras centrales eléctricas. Necesitamos energía para el cañón de partículas."
IT: "\nSono astuti, mirano alle nostre centrali energetiche: per usare il Cannone particellare ci serve la loro energia."
KO: "\n교활한 악당들 같으니! 적들은 우리의 발전소를 표적으로 삼았습니다.\n파티클 캐논을 사용하려면 발전소가 있어야 합니다."
ZH: "\n那些聰明的壞蛋！他們正鎖定要炸毀我方發電廠，阻止我們利用電力來使用離子砲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen25Subtitle
US: "*Almost all of the power plants have been destroyed. We must have power to use the Particle Cannon!"
DE: "*Almost all of the power plants have been destroyed. We must have power to use the Particle Cannon!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHan destruido casi todas las centrales eléctricas. ¡Necesitamos energía para el cañón de partículas!"
IT: "\nQuasi tutte le centrali energetiche sono distrutte: se vogliamo usare il Cannone particellare ci serve energia!"
KO: "\n우리의 발전소 대부분이 파괴되었습니다.\n파티클 캐논의 사용을 위해서는 발전소가 있어야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n幾乎所有的發電廠都被炸毀了，我們需要電力才能使用離子砲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen26Subtitle
US: "*If we could capture some power plants, we could use the Particle Cannon against them"
DE: "*If we could capture some power plants, we could use the Particle Cannon against them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSi tomamos algunas centrales, podremos usar el cañón de partículas contra ellos."
IT: "\nSe riuscissimo a conquistare delle centrali energetiche, potremmo usare il Cannone particellare contro di loro."
KO: "발전소를 몇 개 점령할 수 있으면 그들을 향해 파티클 캐논을 사용할 수 있을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n如果我們能佔領一些發電廠，即可使用離子砲來抵擋他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen27Subtitle
US: "*Ahh.. We have found some hidden goodies"
DE: "*Ahh.. We have found some hidden goodies"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAhh... Hemos encontrado unas cositas escondidas."
IT: "\nAh, abbiamo trovato delle risorse nascoste."
KO: "아..숨겨진 보물을 찾았습니다."
ZH: "\n嗯…我們發現一些隱藏的物資。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen28Subtitle
US: "*This pass is well defended. We should use the Particle Cannon to blast through"
DE: "*This pass is well defended. We should use the Particle Cannon to blast through"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEste paso está bien custodiado.\nUsemos el cañón de partículas para abrirnos paso."
IT: "\nQuesto passo è ben difeso: usiamo il Cannone particellare\nper aprirci la strada."
KO: "이 길은 수비가 견고합니다. 파티클 캐논을 사용하여 길을 뚫어야 합니다."
ZH: "\n敵軍在這個隘道防禦嚴密，我們應該利用離子砲把它炸開。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen29Subtitle
US: "*Be careful! This pass is heavily guarded!"
DE: "*Be careful! This pass is heavily guarded!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Cuidado! ¡Este paso está muy vigilado!"
IT: "\nAttenzione, il passo è pesantemente sorvegliato!"
KO: "조심하십시오! 이 길은 경비가 철통같습니다!"
ZH: "\n小心！這個隘道防禦甚為嚴密！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen30Subtitle
US: "*They've dispatched infantry onto the islands!"
DE: "*They've dispatched infantry onto the islands!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Han enviado infantería a las islas!"
IT: "\nHanno inviato della fanteria sulle isole!"
KO: "적들이 섬으로 병사들을 보냈습니다!"
ZH: "\n他們已經派遣步兵至島嶼上！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen31Subtitle
US: "*They're choppers are bringing reinforcements!"
DE: "*They're choppers are bringing reinforcements!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Sus helicópteros traen refuerzos!"
IT: "\nI loro elicotteri stanno portando qui dei rinforzi!"
KO: "적의 헬리콥터가 지원군을 데려오고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n直昇機替他們帶來增援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen32Subtitle
US: "*They have launched an A10 Strike against us!"
DE: "*They have launched an A10 Strike against us!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Han lanzado un ataque de A-10 contra nosotros!"
IT: "\nHanno lanciato un attacco con A10 contro di noi!"
KO: "적들이 A10으로 공격을 합니다!"
ZH: "\nA10 攻擊機已升空準備攻擊我們了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen33Subtitle
US: "*They've paradropped onto the Particle Cannon!"
DE: "*They've paradropped onto the Particle Cannon!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Se han tirado en paracaídas sobre el cañón de partículas!"
IT: "\nLanci di paracadutisti sul Cannone particellare!"
KO: "적들이 파티클 캐논으로 공수 투하를 합니다!"
ZH: "\n他們已經開始空投於離子砲的上方。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen34Subtitle
US: "*We have disabled their Supply Drop Zones! Their production will be crippled!"
DE: "*We have disabled their Supply Drop Zones! Their production will be crippled!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Hemos inhabilitado sus zonas de lanzamiento de suministros! ¡Se bloqueará su producción!"
IT: "\nAbbiamo distrutto le loro Zone di lancio dei rifornimenti!\nLa loro produzione è bloccata!"
KO: "적의 투하 지역을 무력화시켰습니다! 그들의 유닛 생산 속도가 저하될 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n我們已經破壞補給空投區了！他們的建造能力將被癱瘓！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen35Subtitle
US: "*Your mission is to destroy the enemy Aircraft Carrier with the Particle Cannon. You will have to penetrate their base on the mainland to get a visual lock on the Carrier so that you can destroy it"
DE: "*Your mission is to destroy the enemy Aircraft Carrier with the Particle Cannon. You will have to penetrate their base on the mainland to get a visual lock on the Carrier so that you can destroy it"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTu misión es destruir el portaaviones enemigo con el cañón de partículas. Aproxímate a su base en tierra para identificar el objetivo y destrúyelo."
IT: "\nDovete distruggere la portaerei usando il Cannone particellare. Penetrate nella base sulla terraferma per inquadrare e distruggere l'unità navale."
KO: "\n이번 임무는 적의 항공 모함을 파티클 캐논으로 파괴하는 것입니다. 육지에 있는 적의\n기지에 침투하여 항공 모함에 대한 시야 확보를 하여 파괴할 준비를 해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n你的任務就是利用離子砲將敵軍的航空母艦擊沈。你必須滲透主要陸地上的基地，並取得最好的視角鎖\n定航艦，才能徹底的摧毀它。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen36Subtitle
US: "*Great work! Now we must secure some Power Plants"
DE: "*Great work! Now we must secure some Power Plants"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Buen trabajo! Aseguremos ahora algunas centrales eléctricas."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro! Ora ci servono delle centrali energetiche."
KO: "훌륭합니다! 이제 발전소를 확보해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好！現在我們必須安全佔領一些發電廠。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen37Subtitle
US: "*The Tunnel Network will bring us to the next island"
DE: "*The Tunnel Network will bring us to the next island"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa red de túneles nos llevará hasta la siguiente isla."
IT: "\nLa Rete di tunnel ci porterà sulla prossima isola."
KO: "터널 네트워크로 다음 섬으로 이동할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n地道網路系統將帶領我們前往下一座島嶼。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen38Subtitle
US: "*The Particle Cannon is now online. We should defend it and the Power Plants"
DE: "*The Particle Cannon is now online. We should defend it and the Power Plants"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl cañón de partículas está activado. Debemos defenderlo junto a las centrales eléctricas."
IT: "\nQuesto Cannone particellare è operativo. Difendiamolo insieme alle centrali energetiche."
KO: "파티클 캐논은 준비 완료되었습니다. 캐논과 발전소를 방어해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n現在離子砲已經備妥，我們應該保護它以及發電廠的安全。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen39Subtitle
US: "*All of our units and buildings have been destroyed!"
DE: "*All of our units and buildings have been destroyed!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Han destruido todas nuestras unidades y edificios!"
IT: "\nTutte le nostre unità e strutture sono state distrutte!"
KO: "우리의 모든 유닛과 병력이 파괴되었습니다!"
ZH: "\n我方所有的單位和建築已被摧毀！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen40Subtitle
US: "*Without the Particle Cannon, it will be impossible to sink the Carrier"
DE: "*Without the Particle Cannon, it will be impossible to sink the Carrier"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSin el cañón de partículas, no podremos hundir el portaaviones."
IT: "\nSenza Cannone particellare, non possiamo affondare la portaerei."
KO: "파티클 캐논 없이는 항공 모함을 침몰시키는 것은 불가능합니다."
ZH: "\n如果沒有離子砲助陣，我們絕不可能擊沈航艦。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen41Subtitle
US: "*Now the Americans shall taste bitter defeat!"
DE: "*Now the Americans shall taste bitter defeat!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Los americanos sufrirán una amarga derrota!"
IT: "\nOra gli americani assaggeranno la sconfitta!"
KO: "이제 미국군은 쓰라린 패배를 맛보고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n現在美國佬將要嚐嚐挫敗的痛苦了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen42Subtitle
US: "*They destroyed our Tunnel Network! Use the sneak attack to reclaim the Particle Cannon!"
DE: "*They destroyed our Tunnel Network! Use the sneak attack to reclaim the Particle Cannon!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Han destruido nuestra red de túneles! ¡Usa el ataque furtivo para recuperar el cañón de partículas!"
IT: "\nHanno distrutto la Rete di tunnel! Usate l'Attacco furtivo per conquistare il Cannone particellare!"
KO: "\n적들이 우리의 터널 네트워크를 파괴했습니다!\n잠입 공격을 시도하여 파티클 캐논을 탈취하십시오."
ZH: "\n他們摧毀了我方的地道網路系統！快利用偷襲重新奪回離子砲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen43Subtitle
US: "*We are closing in on the Aircraft Carrier. It is just south of here"
DE: "*We are closing in on the Aircraft Carrier. It is just south of here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNos acercamos al portaaviones. Lo tenemos en dirección sur."
IT: "\nSiamo a un passo dalla portaerei, si trova appena più a sud."
KO: "항공 모함에 근접하고 있습니다. 여기서 바로 남쪽입니다."
ZH: "\n我們很接近航空母艦了，它就位於這裡的南方。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen44Subtitle
US: "*There's the Aircraft Carrier! Destroy it using the Particle Cannon!"
DE: "*There's the Aircraft Carrier! Destroy it using the Particle Cannon!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Ahí está el portaaviones! ¡Destrúyelo con el cañón de partículas!"
IT: "\nEcco la portaerei! Distruggetela con il Cannone particellare!"
KO: "항공모함입니다! 파티클 캐논으로 파괴하십시오!"
ZH: "\n航空母艦就在眼前！快利用離子砲炸毀它！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen45Subtitle
US: "*Jarmen Kell is here to serve us"
DE: "*Jarmen Kell is here to serve us"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "쟈멘 켈이 우리를 도와줄 것입니다."
ZH: "\n賈曼卡爾在此為我們效命。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen46Subtitle
US: "*His snipe ability can disable enemy vehicles, allowing our infantry to then capture them"
DE: "*His snipe ability can disable enemy vehicles, allowing our infantry to then capture them"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그의 저격 능력은 적 차량을 무력화 시키고 우리의 병사가 차량을 탈취하도록 돕습니다."
ZH: "\n他的狙擊能力可以癱瘓敵軍載具，並使我方步兵佔領它們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen47Subtitle
US: "*These docked Battleships are harmless"
DE: "*These docked Battleships are harmless"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEstos buques de guerra atracados son inofensivos."
IT: "\nLe Navi da guerra nel porto sono indifese."
KO: "정박한 전함들은 전혀 위협이 되지 않습니다."
