BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen48Subtitle
US: "*The Battleship is bombarding us! Destroy it!"
DE: "*The Battleship is bombarding us! Destroy it!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡El buque de guerra nos bombardea! ¡Destrúyelo!"
IT: "\nLa Nave da guerra ci sta bombardando: distruggetela!"
