ZH: "\n這個一定是敵軍的主要基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen50Subtitle
US: "*These fake buildings will fool our foes"
DE: "*These fake buildings will fool our foes"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEstos edificios falsos confundirán al enemigo."
IT: "\nQuesti falsi edifici inganneranno il nemico."
