BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA03xKen51Subtitle
US: "*Build more fake structures to trick the enemy!"
DE: "*Build more fake structures to trick the enemy!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Construye más edificios falsos para engañar al enemigo!"
IT: "\nCostruite altre strutture false per ingannare il nemico!"
KO: "적들을 교란하기 위해 더 많은 위장 건물을 건설하십시오!"
