KO: "미군 병력이 오고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n美軍部隊正向前推進中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat01Subtitle
US: "*We've got to clear out those bunkers!"
DE: "*We've got to clear out those bunkers!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Debemos barrer esos búnkeres!"
IT: "\nDobbiamo eliminare quei bunker!"
KO: "저 벙커들을 제거해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n我們必須肅清那些碉堡！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat02Subtitle
US: "*Their power is down! No Patriots to deal with!"
DE: "*Their power is down! No Patriots to deal with!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "적의 전력이 제거되었습니다! 이제 패트리어트는 신경 안써도 됩니다!"
ZH: "\n他們的電力停擺！不用擔心愛國者飛彈系統！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat03Subtitle
US: "*Break down the fences and rescue our brethren!"
DE: "*Break down the fences and rescue our brethren!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDestruye las vallas y rescata a nuestros hermanos"
IT: "\nAbbattete le difese e salvate i nostri fratelli!"
KO: "우리의 형제들을 구출하십시오!"
ZH: "\n搗毀這些圍籬並救出我們的伙伴！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat04Subtitle
US: "*Now our brothers may be free!"
DE: "*Now our brothers may be free!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nuestros hermanos serán libres!"
IT: "\nOra i nostri fratelli saranno liberi!"
KO: "우리의 형제들은 이제 자유를 찾았습니다!"
ZH: "\n現在我們的兄弟應該自由了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat05Subtitle
US: "*An american chinook would help to transport our troops. Capture this supply depot if you can"
DE: "*An american chinook would help to transport our troops. Capture this supply depot if you can"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nUn Chinook americano ayudaría a transportar nuestras tropas. Si puedes, hazte con el depósito de suministros."
IT: "\nUn Chinook americano sarebbe utile per trasportare le truppe: conquistate questo deposito rifornimenti, se possibile."
KO: "\n미국군 치누크가 우리의 부대를 수송하는 데 도움을 줄 것입니다.\n서플라이 센터를 점령하십시오."
ZH: "\n美軍運輸直昇機可以幫助我們運送部隊，如果可以的話，佔領這個補給站。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat06Subtitle
US: "*Get some anti air over here, general! Their Comanches are tearing us to bits!"
DE: "*Get some anti air over here, general! Their Commanche's are tearing us to bits!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Consigue alguna defensa antiaérea! ¡Sus Comanches nos están haciendo pedazos!"
IT: "\nPortate qui la contraerea, generale, i Comanche\nnemici ci stanno facendo a pezzi!"
KO: "대공 방어를 요청하십시오, 장군님! 적의 코만치가 우리를 산산조각 내고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n這裡需要防空武器支援，將軍！美軍的卡曼契直昇機快把我們撕成碎片了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat07Subtitle
US: "*General, we must find some way to take out these bridge defenses!"
DE: "*General, we must find some way to take out these bridge defenses!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, hemos de aniquilar las defensas del puente!"
IT: "\nGenerale, dobbiamo riuscire a eliminare le difese del ponte!"
KO: "장군님, 이 다리 방어를 제거할 방법을 찾아내야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，快想辦法瓦解橋頭的防線！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat08Subtitle
US: "*General, we are using our cell phones to call in a surprise tunnel network!"
DE: "*General, we are using our cel phones to call in a surprise tunnel network!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, estamos solicitando una red de túneles sorpresa!"
IT: "\nGenerale, usiamo i nostri cellulari per organizzare una Rete di tunnel."
KO: "장군님, 기습 터널 네트워크를 요청하기 위해 휴대폰을 사용하는 중입니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，利用行動電話呼叫奇襲地道網路系統！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat09Subtitle
US: "*We'll need these tractors if we want to clear any bunkers"
DE: "*We'll need these tractors if we want to clear any bunkers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSi queremos barrer los búnkeres, necesitaremos estos tractores."
IT: "\nSe vogliamo togliere di mezzo i bunker ci servono questi Contaminatori."
KO: "벙커를 소탕하려면 이 트랙터들이 필요할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n如果要攻下碉堡，我們將需要毒素車來完成。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat10Subtitle
US: "*This ferry is under our control now! You will take us where we want to go!"
DE: "*This ferry is under our control now! You will take us where we want to go!"
FR: "***"
ES: "Tenemos el control de este transbordador!\n¡Nos llevarás adonde queramos ir"
IT: "\nQuesto traghetto è nostro: ci porterà dove vogliamo."
KO: "이 페리는 이제 우리 것입니다! 이제 아무 곳이나 병력을 이동시킬 수 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n現在渡輪在我們的控制之下！你要帶我們到任何想去的地方！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat11Subtitle
US: "*Yes, yes. I will do what you say!"
DE: "*Yes, yes. I will do what you say!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSí, sí. ¡Haré lo que diga!"
IT: "\nSì, sì, farò quello che dite."
KO: "네, 네 , 분부대로 하겠습니다!"
ZH: "\n好的，我會照你的意思去做。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat12Subtitle
US: "*Our brothers have been freed"
DE: "*Our brothers have been freed"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestros hermanos han sido liberados."
IT: "\nI nostri fratelli sono liberi."
KO: "우리의 형제가 해방되었습니다."
ZH: "\n我們的弟兄被釋放了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat13Subtitle
US: "*There sure are a lot of sports utility vehicles in this strange land"
DE: "*There sure are a lot of sports utility vehicles in this strange land"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSeguro que en esta extraña tierra hay un montón de deportivos."
IT: "\nIn questa strana terra di sono davvero molti SUV."
KO: "이 이상한 섬에는 레저용 차량이 아주 많군요."
ZH: "\n在這個怪島上，一定有不少四輪傳動多功能載具可供利用。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat14Subtitle
US: "*We have a GLA sympathizer in this area. He and his brothers have agreed to help us"
DE: "*We have a GLA sympathizer in this area. He and his brothers have agreed to help us"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEn este área hay un simpatizante del GLA.\nSus hermanos y él han decidido ayudarnos."
IT: "\nIn questa zona vive un simpatizzante dell'ELG:\nha accettato di unirsi a noi insieme ai suoi fratelli."
KO: "GLA 동조자들을 만났습니다. 그들은 우리를 돕는데 동의했습니다."
ZH: "\n我們有位全球解放軍的支持者在這裡，他和他的同伴們已同意援助我們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xChat15Subtitle
US: "*Tanks! Take off! Go, Go, Go!"
DE: "*Tanks! Take off! Go, Go, Go!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Tanques! ¡Despegue! ¡Adelante!"
IT: "\nCarri armati! Decollare! Via, via!"
KO: "이륙하라! 출동이다!"
ZH: "\n是坦克！幹掉他們！快啊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin01Subtitle
US: "*This is team one. We are in position"
DE: "*This is team one. We are in position"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAquí Equipo Uno. Estamos en posición"
IT: "\nQui squadra uno, siamo in posizione."
KO: "팀1, 정위치!"
ZH: "\n這裡是第一隊，我們已經就位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin02Subtitle
US: "*My brethren, be careful, as we tread on enemy soil. Our main objective is to obtain chemical samples from the nearby American toxin facility"
DE: "*My brethren, be careful, as we tread on enemy soil. Our main objective is to obtain chemical samples from the nearby American toxin facility"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCuidado, hermanos: pisamos suelo enemigo.\nDebemos obtener muestras químicas de las cercanas instalaciones de toxinas."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n형제여 조심하십시오, 우리의 주된 목표는 근처의 미군 독소 시설에서\n화학 샘플을 획득하는 것입니다."
ZH: "\n伙伴，凡事小心。因為我們踏在敵人的土地上。我們的主要任務是從附近的美軍毒素工廠，取得生化\n樣本。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin03Subtitle
US: "*The remains of the American naval force have moved to the Mediterranean, in response to the loss of their command fleet. This has allowed us to slip in"
DE: "*The remains of the American naval force have moved to the Mediterranean, in response to the loss of their command fleet. This has allowed us to slip in"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLo que queda de la flota americana ha marchado al Mediterráneo\ncomo respuesta a la pérdida de su buque principal.\nEso nos ha permitido colarnos."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n미국 해군 병력의 남은 세력은 지휘 함선을 잃은 후 지중해로 이동했고,\n그래서 우리가 쉽게 침투할 수 있었습니다."
ZH: "\n由於指揮艦隊的折損，剩餘的美國海軍部隊已移師到地中海。現在是我們偷溜進去的時候了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin04Subtitle
US: "*We defeated them there, and we shall be victorious here"
DE: "*We defeated them there, and we shall be victorious here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLes derrotamos allí y triunfaremos aquí."
IT: "***"
KO: "우리는 그들을 항상 이길 수 있어야 합니다."
ZH: "\n以前我們在那裡擊敗過他們，現在同樣也能在這裡贏得勝利。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin05Subtitle
US: "*Brothers rejoice! Once we have the toxins from this facility, our scientists will be able to forge a weapon of mass infection"
DE: "*Brothers rejoice! Once we have the toxins from this facility, our scientists will be able to forge a weapon of mass infection"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Alegría, hermanos!\nCon estas toxinas, nuestros científicos crearán un arma de infección masiva."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n기뻐하십시오 형제여! 이 시설에서 독소를 획득하기만 하면 우리의 과학자들이\n대량 살상 무기를 제조할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n太好了！一旦我們從工廠獲得毒素，我們的科學家就可研發造成大量感染的生化武器。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin06Subtitle
US: "*The Americans have meddled for too long. With this new weapon, we shall be able to strike fear into the hearts of our oppressors!"
DE: "*The Americans have meddled for too long. With this new weapon, we shall be able to strike fear into the hearts of our oppressors!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos americanos son unos entrometidos.\n¡Con esta arma, atemorizaremos los corazones de esos opresores!"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n미국군은 우리를 너무 오래 괴롭혔습니다. 이 새로운 무기들로 적들의 마음에\n공포를 불어넣을 수 있을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n美國佬太愛插手管閒事了。有了這個新武器，就可以把他們嚇得膽顫心驚！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin07Subtitle
US: "*(Very evil laugh)"
DE: "*(Very evil laugh)"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n(Risa muy maligna)"
IT: "***"
KO: "클클클"
ZH: "\n（極度邪惡的笑聲）"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin08Subtitle
US: "*Team one, are toxins secured and on board?"
DE: "*Team one, are toxins secured and on board?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEquipo Uno, ¿las toxinas están seguras y a bordo?"
IT: "\nSquadra uno, le tossine sono a bordo?"
KO: "팀1, 독소가 안전하게 탑재되었는가?"
ZH: "\n第一隊，毒素是否沒問題並且備妥？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin09Subtitle
US: "*We have the samples"
DE: "*We have the samples"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTenemos las muestras."
IT: "\nAbbiamo i campioni."
KO: "여기 샘플이 있네."
ZH: "\n我們有樣本了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin10Subtitle
US: "*We are ready for takeoff"
DE: "*We are ready for takeoff"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEstamos listos para despegar."
IT: "\nSiamo pronti al decollo."
KO: "이륙 준비 완료."
ZH: "\n我們準備好起飛了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin11Subtitle
US: "*Check. Package is secure"
DE: "*Check. Package is secure"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "\nVerificato. Merce al sicuro."
KO: "확인 완료. 패키지는 안전하다."
ZH: "\n確認，「貨」已備妥。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin12Subtitle
US: "*You are clear to proceed. We will defend your escape!"
DE: "*You are clear to proceed. We will defend your escape!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTienes vía libre. ¡Cubriremos tu huida!"
IT: "\nSiamo pronti a procedere: vi copriremo la fuga!"
KO: "이제 출발하라. 퇴로를 확보하겠다!"
ZH: "\n你可以繼續進行下個步驟，我們將掩護你脫逃！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin13Subtitle
US: "*General the Patriots are online!"
DE: "*General the Patriots are online!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, los Patriot están activados!"
IT: "\nGenerale, i Patriot sono operativi!"
KO: "패트리어트가 가동 준비되었다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，愛國者飛彈系統已上線！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin14Subtitle
US: "*Hold them back until we clear the landing strip!"
DE: "*Hold them back until we clear the landing strip!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Contenlos hasta que despejemos la pista!"
IT: "\nTeneteli a bada mentre ripuliamo la pista d'atterraggio!"
KO: "활주로를 정리할 때까지 그들을 막아줘!"
ZH: "\n抵擋他們直到我們攻下臨時跑道。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin15Subtitle
US: "*Keep them off our tail!"
DE: "*Keep them off our tail!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Evita que nos sigan!"
IT: "\nTeneteli lontani dalla nostra coda!"
KO: "그들을 떨쳐내!"
ZH: "\n將他們甩離我們的尾翼！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin16Subtitle
US: "*Get away you stupid Americans!"
DE: "*Get away you stupid Americans!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Fuera, estúpidos americanos!"
IT: "\nLevatevi dai piedi, stupidi americani!"
KO: "저리 꺼지라구, 멍청한 미국인들아!"
ZH: "\n快滾吧，你們這些豬頭美國佬！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin17Subtitle
US: "*We'll meet again when we reach the toxin facility"
DE: "*We'll meet again when we reach the toxin facility"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNos reuniremos al llegar a las instalaciones de toxinas."
IT: "\nCi incontreremo di nuovo al centro di produzione delle tossine."
KO: "독소 시설에 도달하면 다시 봅시다."
ZH: "\n當我們到達毒素工廠再會面。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin18Subtitle
US: "*The Americans think they have driven us out"
DE: "*The Americans think they have driven us out"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos americanos creen que nos han expulsado."
IT: "\nGli americani pensano di averci sconfitto."
KO: "미군들은 우리를 몰아냈다고 생각하겠지."
ZH: "\n美國人以為已經把我們趕走了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin19Subtitle
US: "*We will divide and conquer"
DE: "*We will divide and conquer"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDivide y vencerás"
IT: "\nLi divideremo e li conquisteremo."
KO: "우리는 일단 갈라진 뒤 그들을 물리칠 것이다."
ZH: "\n我們將分裂並征服敵人。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin20Subtitle
US: "*We are nothing against this air power!"
DE: "*We are nothing against this air power!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡No somos rival para esta potencia aérea!"
IT: "\nNon possiamo nulla contro questa superiorità aerea!"
KO: "공군에 대항할 병력이 없다!"
ZH: "\n對抗這場空戰，我們根本是微不足道！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin21Subtitle
US: "*You have not seen the last of us!"
DE: "*You have not seen the last of us!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡No hemos dicho la última palabra!"
IT: "\nNon è ancora finita!"
KO: "아직 우리를 다 발견하진 못했다!"
ZH: "\n走著瞧，我們會再碰面的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin22Subtitle
US: "*We will get our revenge, you filthy Americans!"
DE: "*We will get our revenge, you filthy Americans!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nos vengaremos, sucios americanos!"
IT: "\nCi vendicheremo, luridi americani!"
KO: "우린 꼭 복수할 거다, 역겨운 미국놈들!"
ZH: "\n你們這些齷齪的美國佬！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin23Subtitle
US: "*Let's do our part to take down these capitalist pigs!"
DE: "*Let's do our part to take down these capitalist pigs!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Contribuyamos para acabar con estos cerdos capitalistas!"
IT: "\nAbbattiamo questi porci capitalisti!"
KO: "이 자본주의의 노예들을 무너뜨리자!"
ZH: "\n讓我們善盡職責，殺了這些資本主義的走狗！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin24Subtitle
US: "*These Americans will pay for the lives of our brethren"
DE: "*These Americans will pay for the lives of our brethren"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEstos americanos pagarán por las vidas de nuestros hermanos"
IT: "\nQuesti americani pagheranno per la vita dei nostri fratelli."
KO: "이 미국놈들은 우리 형제들의 목숨에 대한 댓가를 치룰 것이다!"
ZH: "\n這些美國佬得為我們同袍們償命！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin25Subtitle
US: "*Let's light up these GLA intruders! Fox 1!"
DE: "*Let's light up these GLA intruders! Fox 1!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Vamos a enfocar a esos intrusos del GLA! ¡Zorro 1!"
IT: "\nFacciamo a pezzi le forze dell'ELG! Fox 1!"
KO: "GLA 침입자들에 맞서 싸우자! 폭스1 !"
ZH: "\n讓我們炸毀全球解放軍入侵者吧！狐狸一號！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin26Subtitle
US: "*GLA spotted offshore! All units to defense positions"
DE: "*GLA spotted offshore! All units to defense positions"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡GLA cerca de la costa! Todas las unidades en posición defensiva."
IT: "\nForze ELG individuate al largo: tutti ai posti di combattimento."
KO: "GLA가 해안 부근에서 발견되었다! 모든 유닛 방어 위치로!"
ZH: "\n海面上有全球解放軍的蹤跡！所有單位就防禦位置。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin27Subtitle
US: "*We got GLA infiltration at coordinated 77BetaGamma! All available units move to respond!"
DE: "*We got GLA infiltration at coordinated 77BetaGamma! All available units move to respond!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Infiltración del GLA en las coordenadas 77-Beta-Gamma! ¡Acudan todas las unidades disponibles!"
IT: "\nInfiltrazione ELG alle coordinate 77 Beta Gamma! Tutte le unità pronte al combattimento!"
KO: "77베타감마 좌표구역에서 GLA의 침투를 받았다! 모든 전투 가능 유닛들은 응답하라!"
ZH: "\n我們於座標 77BetaGamma 處發現全球解放軍滲透的足跡！所有單位立即前往該處！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin28Subtitle
US: "*There's more of them on the beach!"
DE: "*There's more of them on the beach!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Hay más en la playa!"
IT: "\nCe ne sono altri sulla spiaggia!"
KO: "해변가에서 놈들의 움직임이 포착되었다!"
ZH: "\n灘頭還有更多的全球解放軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin29Subtitle
US: "*GLA infiltrators spotted on the ledge!"
DE: "*GLA infiltrators spotted on the ledge!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Infiltrados del GLA en el perímetro!"
IT: "\nInfiltrati ELG individuati sulla sponda!"
KO: "GLA 침입자들이 외곽에서 발견되었다!"
ZH: "\n岩礁上有全球解放軍的滲透者！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xCin30Subtitle
US: "*We've got GLA inside city limits! All units converge on coordinates 34AlphaAlpha"
DE: "*We've got GLA inside city limits! All units converge on coordinates 34AlphaAlpha"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Los GLA están dentro de la ciudad! Todas las unidades a las coordenadas 34-Alfa-Alfa"
IT: "\nForze ELG sono penetrate in città! Convergere sulle coordinate 34 Alfa Alfa."
KO: "GLA 침입자들이 도시 경계에서 침투한다! 모든 병력은 34알파알파 좌표구역을 사수하라!"
ZH: "\n我們發現全球解放軍滲透進入城市！所有單位立即前往座標 34AlphaAlpha 集合！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen01Subtitle
US: "*Good job, General! Only 15 more toxin samples to be retrieved"
DE: "*Good job, General! Only 15 more toxin samples to be retrieved"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Buen trabajo, general! Sólo quedan por obtener 15 muestras tóxicas."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, generale: mancano solo 15 campioni di tossine."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 이제 독소 샘플을 15개 더 확보하면 됩니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍！只要再奪回15份毒素樣本。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen02Subtitle
US: "*Good job, General! Only 10 more toxin samples to be retrieved"
DE: "*Good job, General! Only 10 more toxin samples to be retrieved"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Buen trabajo, general! Sólo quedan por obtener 10 muestras tóxicas."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, generale: mancano solo 10 campioni di tossine."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 이제 독소 샘플을 10개 더 확보하면 됩니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍！只要再奪回10份毒素樣本。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen03Subtitle
US: "*Good job, General! Only 5 more toxin samples to be retrieved"
DE: "*Good job, General! Only 5 more toxin samples to be retrieved"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Buen trabajo, general! Sólo quedan por obtener 5 muestras tóxicas."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, generale: mancano solo 5 campioni di tossine."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 이제 독소 샘플을 5개 더 확보하면 됩니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍！只要再奪回5份毒素樣本。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen04Subtitle
US: "*General, we have a plan to attack America's Central Command in Europe. But we do not yet have the power to strike at them directly. We need a new toxin weapon"
DE: "*General, we have a plan to attack America's Central Command in Europe. But we do not yet have the power to strike at them directly. We need a new toxin weapon"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, tenemos un plan para atacar el mando central americano en Europa.\nPero aún no tenemos el poder para atacarles.\nNecesitamos una nueva arma tóxica."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n장군님, 우리는 미국군의 유럽 중앙 사령부를 공격할 계획이 있습니다.\n그러나 정면 공격을 할 병력은 없습니다. 독소 무기를 사용하는 게 좋겠습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們計畫攻擊美國駐歐洲中央指揮部。但是我們尚未擁有直接突襲的能力，我們需要新的毒素武\n器才行。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen05Subtitle
US: "*Both of our forces are in place. The two groups must work together if we are to retrieve the toxins"
DE: "*Both of our forces are in place. The two groups must work together if we are to retrieve the toxins"
FR: "***"
ES: "Nuestras dos fuerzas están en posición.\nDeberán colaborar para conseguir las toxinas."
IT: "***"
KO: "우리 병력 두 부대가 정위치에 있습니다. 독소를 확보하기 위해서는 두 부대가 협력해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我方兩支部隊都到定位了。如果想要取得毒素，兩個小隊必須通力合作。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen06Subtitle
US: "*Our hijackers can capture vehicles and they are stealthed unless they are moving"
DE: "*Our hijackers can capture vehicles and they are stealthed unless they are moving"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos secuestradores pueden conseguir vehículos y no ser vistos salvo al moverse."
IT: "\nI nostri Dirottatori possono catturare i veicoli e sono invisibili quando non si muovono."
KO: "\n우리의 하이재커들은 차량을 탈취할 수 있고, 움직이기 전까지는 스텔스 상태를\n유지할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n我方劫持犯可佔領載具，當他們靜止不動時是呈現隱形狀態。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen07Subtitle
US: "*Jarmen Kell can snipe pilots from vehicles and also take out infantry at long range"
DE: "*Jarmen Kell can snipe pilots from vehicles and also take out infantry at long range"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nJarmen Kell puede abatir a gran distancia a pilotos de vehículos e infantería."
IT: "\nJarmen Kell può uccidere gli autisti e la fanteria, restando a distanza."
KO: "쟈멘 켈은 차량 운전자를 저격할 수 있고 먼 거리에서 적 병사들을 제거할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n賈曼卡爾可狙擊載具上的駕駛員，並且在很遠的射程內幹掉步兵。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen08Subtitle
US: "*Our Saboteurs can perform a number of secret operations like shutting down power plants"
DE: "*Our Saboteurs can perform a number of secret operations like shutting down power plants"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos saboteadores pueden efectuar operaciones secretas como desactivar centrales eléctricas."
IT: "\nI nostri Sabotatori possono compiere diverse operazioni segrete, come disattivare le centrali energetiche."
KO: "새보터들은 발전소 무력화 등의 비밀 작전을 수행할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n我方的破壞者可以執行數種秘密行動，例如癱瘓發電廠的運作。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen09Subtitle
US: "*Our rebels are camouflaged, and can capture buildings to aid us in our cause"
DE: "*Our rebels are camoflauged, and can capture buildings to aid us in our cause"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestros rebeldes están camuflados y pueden tomar edificios para apoyar nuestra causa."
IT: "\nI Ribelli sono mimetizzati e possono conquistare strutture per la nostra causa."
KO: "우리의 반군은 위장된 상태이고, 우리를 돕기 위해 건물을 점령할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n我方的反抗軍具偽裝能力，可以幫助我們佔領建築達成任務目標。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen10Subtitle
US: "*Good luck, General. May stealth and cunning be with you in your quest"
DE: "*Good luck, General. May stealth and cunning be with you in your quest"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuena suerte, general. Que la discreción y la astucia te acompañen en tu misión."
IT: "\nBuona fortuna, generale: che l'astuzia vi assista nella vostra missione."
KO: "행운을 빕니다, 임무 내내 스텔스와 임기응변의 힘이 당신과 함께 하기를."
ZH: "\n祝好運，將軍。在完成你的任務過程中，願匿蹤與狡詐與你同在。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen11Subtitle
US: "*Good morning, General"
DE: "*Good morning, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuenos días, general."
IT: "\nBuongiorno, generale."
KO: "안녕하십니까, 장군님"
ZH: "\n早安，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen12Subtitle
US: "*General, we must capture that ferry"
DE: "*General, we must capture that ferry"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군님, 저 페리를 확보해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們必須佔領渡輪。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen13Subtitle
US: "*General, there are mines here, but we cannot detect them! We need a Radar Van!"
DE: "*General, there are mines here, but we cannot detect them! We need a Radar Van!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, aquí hay minas pero no las podemos detectar!\n¡Necesitamos una furgoneta radar!"
IT: "\nGenerale, qui ci sono delle mine, ma non possiamo\nrilevarle: ci serve un Furgone radar!"
KO: "장군님, 지뢰가 있습니다. 그러나 우리는 지뢰 탐지가 불가능합니다! 레이더 밴이 필요합니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，這裡到處都是地雷，我們無法拆除它們！現在需要雷達車！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen14Subtitle
US: "*General, get someone into that Valve station by the river. Draining the coolant reservoir will allow our brothers to continue further"
DE: "*General, get someone into that Valve station by the river. Draining the coolant reservoir will allow our brothers to continue further"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEnvía a alguien a la estación de válvulas junto al río.\nVaciar el depósito de refrigerante permitirá llegar más lejos\na nuestros hermanos."
IT: "\nGenerale, mandate qualcuno nella stazione di controllo accanto al fiume:\nscaricando le cisterne di raffreddamento i nostri fratelli\npotranno avanzare."
KO: "\n장군님, 강 옆의 밸브 스테이션으로 병사를 보내십시오. 냉각수 저수지의 물을 빼면\n우리의 형제들의 진격을 도울 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，快派人進入河邊的活門站。排出貯存槽中的冷卻水，可讓我們的弟兄繼續向前推進。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen15Subtitle
US: "*Excellent"
DE: "*Excellent"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nExcelente."
IT: "\nEccellente."
KO: "훌륭합니다."
ZH: "\n太棒了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen16Subtitle
US: "*Good work"
DE: "*Good work"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuen trabajo."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro."
KO: "잘하셨습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen17Subtitle
US: "*General! Destroy that airfield before we are wiped out!"
DE: "*General! Destroy that airfield before we are wiped out!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General! ¡Destruye el aeródromo antes de que nos aniquilen!"
IT: "\nGenerale, distruggete l'aeroporto prima che ci annientino!"
KO: "장군님! 우리가 섬멸되기 전에 비행장을 파괴하십시오!"
ZH: "\n將軍！在我們被殲滅之前，摧毀那座機場！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen18Subtitle
US: "*General. We must destroy their power! Then the Americans will be sitting ducks for sure!"
DE: "*General. We must destroy their power! Then the Americans will be sitting ducks for sure!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, ¡debemos destruir su central! ¡Así los americanos estarán indefensos!"
IT: "\nGenerale, dobbiamo annientare la loro potenza,\nallora gli americani saranno privi di difese!"
KO: "장군님, 그들의 전력을 제거해야 합니다! 그러면 미국군은 옴짝달싹 못하게 될 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，我們必須破壞他們的電力系統！這樣美國佬就理所當然的成為我們的活靶！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen19Subtitle
US: "*General, we must capture that toxin facility"
DE: "*General, we must capture that toxin facility"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, debemos tomar las instalaciones de toxinas."
IT: "\nGenerale, dobbiamo conquistare quell'impianto di produzione delle tossine."
KO: "장군님, 독소 시설을 점령해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們必須佔領那間毒素工廠。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen20Subtitle
US: "*Excellent work, General. Now we must protect these trucks as they transport the toxins to the cargo plane"
DE: "*Excellent work, General. Now we must protect these trucks as they transport the toxins to the cargo plane"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nExcelente trabajo, general.\nAhora, protejamos los camiones que llevan las toxinas al avión de carga."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, generale, ora dobbiamo proteggere questi camion\nmentre trasportano le tossine sull'aereo."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 이제 이 트럭들이 수송기로 독소를 운반하는 동안 이들을 보호해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍。現在我們必須護送卡車安然的將毒素運送到載貨飛機上。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen21Subtitle
US: "*Use the trucks to begin gathering toxins from the facility"
DE: "*Use the trucks to begin gathering toxins from the facility"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nUsa los camiones para recoger las toxinas en las instalaciones."
IT: "\nUsate il camion per iniziare a recuperare tossine nell'impianto."
KO: "트럭을 사용하여 시설에서 독소를 모으기 시작하십시오."
ZH: "\n利用卡車匯集在工廠內的毒素。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen22Subtitle
US: "*General, the Americans have sent reinforcements!"
DE: "*General, the Americans have sent reinforcements!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, los americanos han enviado refuerzos!"
IT: "\nGenerale, gli americani hanno inviato dei rinforzi!"
KO: "장군님, 미국군이 지원군을 파견했습니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，美軍已經派遣增援了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen23Subtitle
US: "*Another cell of hijackers has arrived to support our cause"
DE: "*Another cel of hijackers has arrived to support our cause"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nOtra célula de secuestradores ha llegado para apoyarnos."
IT: "\nAlcuni Dirottatori sono giunti per sostenere la nostra causa."
KO: "우리를 지원하기 위해 하이재커들이 왔습니다!"
ZH: "\n另一名劫持犯抵達並將提供協助我方任務。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen24Subtitle
US: "*Another cell of rebels has arrived to support our cause"
DE: "*Another cel of rebels has arrived to support our cause"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nOtra célula de rebeldes ha llegado para apoyarnos."
IT: "\nUn altro gruppo di Ribelli si è unito alla nostra causa."
KO: "우리를 지원하기 위해 반군들이 왔습니다!"
ZH: "\n另一名反抗軍抵達並將提供協助我方任務。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen25Subtitle
US: "*JarmenKell has been found and he has returned to help our cause"
DE: "*JarmenKell has been found and he has returned to help our cause"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHan encontrado a Jarmen Kell y ha vuelto para apoyar la causa."
IT: "\nJarmen Kell è stato localizzato, ora è di nuovo al nostro fianco."
KO: "쟈멘 켈이 우리를 지원하기 위해 왔습니다!"
ZH: "\n已發現賈曼卡爾，他願意支援我方任務。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen26Subtitle
US: "*Our brothers have broken through and provided us with reinforcements"
DE: "*Our brothers have broken through and provided us with reinforcements"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestros hermanos se han abierto paso y nos proporcionan refuerzos."
IT: "\nI nostri fratelli sono riusciti a passare, i rinforzi sono arrivati."
KO: "우리의 형제들이 기습 공격을 통해 우리를 지원합니다."
ZH: "\n弟兄們已經突出防線，並為我們提供增援。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen27Subtitle
US: "*The US will not suspect an attack on their soil after our victory in Greece"
DE: "*The US will not suspect an attack on their soil after our victory in Greece"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEE.UU. no esperará un ataque en su territorio tras nuestra victoria en Grecia."
IT: "\nGli USA non si aspetteranno un attacco in casa loro, dopo la nostra vittoria in Grecia."
KO: "미국군은 우리가 그리스에서 승리한 이후 다음은 그들 본토 차례라는 걸 믿어 의심치 않습니다."
ZH: "\n在希臘一役勝利之後，美國一定想不到我們竟然在他們土地上來一個突襲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen28Subtitle
US: "*Kassad would never have had the courage to attack the US homeland"
DE: "*Kassad would never have had the courage to attack the US homeland"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nKassad nunca habría osado atacar la patria de los EE.UU."
IT: "\nKassad non avrebbe mai avuto il coraggio di colpire gli USA sul loro territorio."
KO: "카사드는 미국 본토를 공격할 배짱이 없습니다."
ZH: "\n科塞德永遠也不敢在美國本土上進行攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA04xKen29Subtitle
US: "*Once we've stolen the secret toxin agent from the US Bio Center, we will be unstoppable"
DE: "*Once we've stolen the secret toxin agent from the US Bio Center, we will be unstoppable"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTras robar el agente tóxico de la planta química de EE.UU., seremos imparables"
IT: "\nCon la tossina segreta USA, saremo inarrestabili."
KO: "미국의 바이오 센터에서 비밀 독소를 훔쳤으니 이제 우리는 최강이 되었습니다!"
ZH: "\n一旦我們從美國生化中心竊取秘密毒素藥劑，我們的勢力將無人能擋"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05Buggy104Subtitle
US: "*Beware Patriot Batteries, they are dangerous"
DE: "*Beware Patriot Batteries, they are dangerous"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCuidado con las baterías Patriot; son peligrosas."
IT: "\nAttenzione ai Missili Patriot, sono pericolosi."
KO: "패트리어트 미사일들을 조심해라! 매우 강하다."
ZH: "\n小心愛國者飛彈台，它們深具危險性。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05Buggy108Subtitle
US: "*Go to your graves, American scum!"
DE: "*Go to your graves, American scum!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Morid, escoria americana!"
IT: "\nA morte, feccia americana!"
KO: "무덤에 처넣어주마, 미국 쓰레기딀!"
ZH: "\n去死吧，美國人渣！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05Kenwar02bSubtitle
US: "*Destroy the American airbase and they will lose much of their ability to project power in this region"
DE: "*Destroy the American airbase and they will lose much of their ability to project power in this region"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDestruye la base aérea americana y perderán gran parte de su poder y control\nsobre la región."
IT: "\nDistruggete la base aerea americana e annienterete buona\nparte della loro potenza in questa regione."
KO: "\n미국 공군 기지를 파괴하면 그들은 이 지역으로 병력을 파병하는 능력을 대부분 상실할\n것입니다."
ZH: "\n摧毀美國空軍基地，他們將失去在此區的作戰能力。"
BP: "Destrua a base aérea americana e eles irão perder muito da capacidade de exercer poder nesta região"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05Kenwar05Subtitle
US: "*The Americans will use their airpower to stop us"
DE: "*The Americans will use their airpower to stop us"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos americanos usarán su potencia aérea para detenernos."
IT: "\nGli americani useranno la loro forza aerea per fermarci."
KO: "미국군은 우리를 막기 위해 공군력을 사용할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n美國佬會利用他們的空中優勢來阻擋我們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05Quad201Subtitle
US: "*Die American!"
DE: "*Die american!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Morid, americanos!"
IT: "\nMuori, americano!"
KO: "죽어라 미국놈들!"
ZH: "\n去死吧，美國佬！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05Rebel02Subtitle
US: "*We are defenseless against American air attacks!"
DE: "*We are defenseless against American air attacks!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Estamos indefensos ante ataques aéreos americanos!"
IT: "\nNon possiamo nulla contro gli attacchi aerei americani!"
KO: "미국의 공군 공격에 대해 무방비 상태입니다!"
ZH: "\n我們無法防禦美軍的空擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05Scorpion105Subtitle
US: "*American cowards! Fight on the ground, like men!"
DE: "*American cowards! Fight on the ground, like men!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Americanos cobardes! ¡Luchad en tierra firme, como hombres!"
IT: "\nCodardi americani! Combattete a terra da veri uomini!"
KO: "미국 겁장이들! 남자답게 땅 위에서 붙어보자!"
ZH: "\n美國膽小鬼！像個男人般出來打一仗吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xChat01Subtitle
US: "*This region is under the control of the United States Air Force General Granger. We can and will use force to remove you from this area. You are hereby under order to clear out immediately"
DE: "*This region is under the control of the United States Air Force General Grainger. We can and will use force to remove you from this area. You are hereby under order to clear out immediately"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl general Grainger de las fuerzas aéreas americanas controla la región. Usaremos la fuerza para expulsaros de esta área. Se os ordena la retirada inmediata."
IT: "\nQuesta regione è sotto il comando del Generale Granger, delle forze aeree americane. Siamo pronti a ricorrere alla forza per eliminare la vostra presenza: vi ordiniamo di allontanarvi immediatamente."
KO: "\n이 지역은 미국 공군의 그랭거 장군의 통제 하에 있다. 귀하를 제거하기 위해 무력을 사용할\n것이다. 속히 이 지역에서 물러날 것을 권고한다."
ZH: "\n這一區是由美國空軍葛陵格將軍所控管。我們不但能並且將要使用武力將你驅逐出境，你最好聽從命令\n立刻給我閃開。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xCin01Subtitle
US: "*Our forces are few, but we can use what we have to come out on top"
DE: "*Our forces are few, but we can use what we have to come out on top"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDisponemos de pocas fuerzas, pero podemos usarlas para salir triunfantes."
IT: "***"
KO: "우리의 병력은 적습니다, 하지만 우리는 이기기 위해 여러 가지 방법을 사용해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我方的部隊雖然不多，但我們可以寡敵眾，跌破專家眼鏡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xCin02Subtitle
US: "*Since we do not have a base in this region we must take one!"
DE: "*Since we do not have a base in this region we must take one!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Dado que no tenemos base en esta región, debemos tomar una!"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 지역에 아군 기지가 없기 때문에 여기서 하나를 획득해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n我們在此地並無任何基地，因此勢必要佔領一個才是！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xCin03Subtitle
US: "*The Chinese base We must strike now! Their Base will soon be ours!"
DE: "*The Chinese base We must strike now! Their Base will soon be ours!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa base china... ¡Debemos atacar ahora! ¡Su base pronto será nuestra!"
IT: "***"
KO: "중국군 기지를 공격하십시오! 곧 우리의 수중에 떨어질 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n我們必須拿下中國基地！我們將會馬上佔領它！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xJarmen01Subtitle
US: "*If you rescue our fellow comrades from the Southern US base, our elite warriors will fight alongside you!"
DE: "*If you rescue our fellow comrades from the Southern US base, our elite warriors will fight alongside you!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Si rescatas a los camaradas de la base sur de EE.UU., nuestros guerreros de élite lucharán a tu lado!"
IT: "\nSe salverete i nostri compagni nella base USA meridionale, saranno pronti a unirsi a voi!"
KO: "\n만약 우리 동료를 남쪽의 미국군 기지에서 구출하면, 그들은 엘리트 전사로서 장군님 편에\n서서 싸울 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n如果你能從南方的美國基地救出我們的伙伴，我們的精英戰士將誓言追隨你！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xJarmen02Subtitle
US: "*Thank you for rescuing our brothers! In return we will open up an area of the US base for you to begin your assault"
DE: "*Thank you for rescuing our brothers! In return we will open up an area of the US base for you to begin your assault"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Gracias por rescatar a nuestros hermanos! A cambio, abriremos un área de la base de EE.UU. para que inicies el asalto."
IT: "\nGrazie per aver liberato i nostri fratelli!\nIn cambio combatteremo al vostro fianco!"
KO: "\n우리의 형제를 구출해주셔서 감사합니다! 보답으로 우리는 공격을 시작할 수 있도록\n미국 기지의 취약한 부분을 열어줄 것입니다."
ZH: "\n感謝你拯救我們的弟兄！我們將開啟其中一區美國基地，好讓你們開始進行突擊以為酬謝。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xJarmen03Subtitle
US: "*Heh heh heh heh heh (Sinister Laugh) That will teach them"
DE: "*Heh heh heh heh heh (Sinister Laugh) That will teach them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nJe, je, je, je, je... Así aprenderán."
IT: "\nEh eh eh... Questo gli servirà da lezione."
KO: "헤헤헤헤! 맛좀 봐라!"
ZH: "\n嘿嘿嘿（邪惡的笑聲），給他們一點教訓。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xJarmen04Subtitle
US: "*Do not let our deaths go unpunished!"
DE: "*Do not let our deaths go unpunished!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Que nuestras muertes no queden sin castigo!"
IT: "\nVendicate i nostri morti!"
KO: "그들의 죽음이 헛되지 않게 하십시오!"
ZH: "\n不要讓我們白白犧牲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xJarmen05Subtitle
US: "*Together we have beaten the enemy! Victory is ours!"
DE: "*Together we have beaten the enemy! Victory is ours!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Juntos hemos derrotado al enemigo! ¡La victoria es nuestra!"
IT: "\nInsieme abbiamo sconfitto il nemico! Vittoria!"
KO: "함께 적을 물리쳤습니다! 승리는 우리의 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n我們共同擊敗了敵人！勝利是屬於我們的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xJarmen06Subtitle
US: "*Thank you for your help in rescuing my soldiers. We shall repay the favor and help you to take out the U.S. Central Command Base"
DE: "*Thank you for your help in rescuing my soldiers. We shall repay the favor and help you to take out the U.S. Central Command Base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGracias por ayudar a rescatar a mis soldados.\nAyudaremos a eliminar la base del mando central de EE.UU."
IT: "\nGrazie per avermi aiutato a liberare i miei uomini: vi ripagheremo\naiutandovi a distruggere il Centro comando USA."
KO: "\n병사들을 구출하는데 도움을 주셔서 감사합니다. 우리는 이러한 도움에 보답할 것이고\n미국 중앙 사령부를 공격하는 것을 도와줄 것입니다."
ZH: "\n感謝你幫忙營救我的弟兄，我們會協助你摧毀美國中央指揮基地，以報答你的恩惠。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen01Subtitle
US: "*Once this base is destroyed the US will scurry home like cowardly dogs. All of Europe will be ours"
DE: "*Once this base is destroyed the US will scurry home like cowardly dogs. All of Europe will be ours"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDestruyendo esa base, los americanos huirán a casa como perros cobardes. Toda Europa será nuestra."
IT: "\nUna volta distrutta la base, gli americani scapperanno come vigliacchi e l'intera Europa sarà nostra."
KO: "\n이 기지가 일단 파괴되면 미국군은 겁장이 개처럼 집으로 황급히 도망갈 것입니다.\n유럽 전체가 우리의 것이 될 것입니다."
ZH: "\n一旦基地被毀，美國勢必像小狗一樣，嚇得夾著尾巴逃回家鄉。歐洲將全部屬於我們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen02Subtitle
US: "*The Americans have our brethren held hostage in their base. We must rescue them"
DE: "*The Americans have our brethren held hostage in their base. We must rescue them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos americanos retienen en su base a nuestros hermanos. Debemos rescatarles."
IT: "\nGli americani tengono prigionieri i nostri fratelli nella loro base: dobbiamo salvarli."
KO: "미국군은 그들의 기지에 우리의 형제들을 인질로 잡고 있습니다. 그들을 구출해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n在美軍的基地挾有我方人質，我們必須前去解救他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen03Subtitle
US: "*It is in our best interest to rescue the POW's from the clutches of the Americans"
DE: "*It is in our best interest to rescue the POW's from the clutches of the Americans"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNos conviene rescatar a los prisioneros de las garras de los americanos"
IT: "\nDobbiamo riuscire a liberare i prigionieri in mano agli americani."
KO: "미국군의 손아귀에서 포로들을 구출해야만 합니다!"
ZH: "\n從美國的魔掌下拯救戰俘，將對我們的情勢相當有利"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen04Subtitle
US: "*Good work! Capture or eliminate this base to ensure the POW's safety"
DE: "*Good work! Capture or eliminate this base to ensure the POW's safety"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Buen trabajo! Toma o elimina la base para garantizar la seguridad de los prisioneros"
IT: "\nConquistate o distruggete questa base per salvare i prigionieri."
KO: "잘하셨습니다! 포로들의 안전을 위해 기지를 점령하거나 제거하십시오."
ZH: "\n幹得好！佔領或殲滅這個基地，以確保戰俘的安全"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen05Subtitle
US: "*We must transport them safely back home to their base in the North. No harm must come to them"
DE: "*We must transport them safely back home to their base in the North. No harm must come to them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDebemos llevarles de vuelta a su base en el norte. No deben sufrir ningún daño."
IT: "\nDobbiamo riportarli nella loro base, a nord, senza che nessuno rimanga ucciso."
KO: "그들을 북쪽에 있는 기지로 안전하게 이송해야 합니다. 그들이 공격받아서는 안됩니다."
ZH: "\n我們必須將他們安全送回北方的基地，絕不能讓他們受到任何傷害。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen06Subtitle
US: "*We are running low on supplies. We must spread out and capture new resources"
DE: "*We are running low on supplies. We must spread out and capture new resources"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNos quedan pocos suministros. Debemos dispersarnos y conseguir más."
IT: "\nLe nostre scorte scarseggiano, dobbiamo ottenere nuove risorse."
KO: "서플라이가 점점 떨어지고 있습니다. 새로운 자원을 찾아봐야 할 때입니다."
ZH: "\n我方目前補給不足，我們必須分散開來並奪取新的資源。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen07Subtitle
US: "*More attacks from the air! We must build more air defenses"
DE: "*More attacks from the air! We must build more air defenses"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Más ataques desde el aire! Debemos construir más defensas aéreas..."
IT: "\nAltri attacchi dall'aria! Dobbiamo rinforzare la contraerea."
KO: "공중에서 공격이 계속됩니다! 대공 방어를 구축해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n空中攻擊不斷來襲！我們必須建立更多的防空系統。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen08Subtitle
US: "*Rebuild our defenses quickly, we haven't long before the next attack"
DE: "*Rebuild our defenses quickly, we haven't long before the next attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRápido, reconstruye las defensas; pronto volverán a atacar"
IT: "\nRipristinate subito le difese, il prossimo attacco è imminente."
KO: "방어 체제를 빨리 재건하십시오. 다음 공격까지 시간이 얼마 없습니다."
ZH: "\n盡快重建我方防線，在下一波攻擊來臨前時間所剩無幾"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen09Subtitle
US: "*The new toxin agent we borrowed from the US will be especially effective against their own forces"
DE: "*The new toxin agent we borrowed from the US will be especially effective against their own forces"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl agente tóxico que hemos tomado \"prestado\" de EE.UU. será muy efectivo contra sus fuerzas."
IT: "\nIl nuovo agente tossico rubato agli USA sarà molto efficace contro le forze nemiche."
KO: "우리가 미군으로부터 '빌려온' 새 독성 물질은 특히 그들 자신들에게 효과적일 것입니다."
ZH: "\n我們從美國「借」來的新毒素藥劑，將以毒攻毒更有效的還原在他們自己的部隊身上。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen10Subtitle
US: "*First the Mediterranean fleet, then an attack upon US soiland now begins our European domination"
DE: "*First the Mediterranean fleet, then an attack upon US soiland now begins our European domination"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nPrimero, la flota mediterránea; luego, un ataque en suelo americano;\ny ahora, la dominación europea."
IT: "***"
KO: "먼저 지중해 함대를 타격하고, 미국 본토를 공격하면 우리의 유럽 지배가 시작될 것입니다."
ZH: "\n第一步炸毀地中海艦隊，然後在美國本土上的奇襲，接下來我們即將擁有在歐洲的霸權。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen11Subtitle
US: "*We are being attacked from the east. End the attacks now, we must eliminate them so we can focus on the main base to the north"
DE: "*We are being attacked from the east. End the attacks now, we must eliminate them so we can focus on the main base to the north"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNos atacan por el este.\nAcabemos con ellos para concentrarnos en la base del norte."
IT: "\nCi attaccano da est: reagite subito generale,\ncosì potremo dedicarci alla base principale, a nord."
KO: "\n동쪽에서 공격받고 있습니다. 공격을 멈추게 하십시오. 북쪽의 주 기지에 집중하려면\n동쪽 공격을 멎게 해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n東邊有敵軍來襲！馬上阻止他們，這樣我們才能將攻擊主力放在北方的主要基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen12Subtitle
US: "*Almost there The U.S. will pay dearly for their transgressions against our people"
DE: "*Almost there The U.S. will pay dearly for their transgressions against our people"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCasi estamos... Los EE.UU. pagarán un alto precio por sus crímenes contra los nuestros."
IT: "\nCi siamo quasi: gli USA pagheranno le angherie inflitte alla nostra gente."
KO: "이제 거의 다 됐다. 미국놈들은 우리 형제들에게 함부로 대한 댓가를 치를 것이다."
ZH: "\n差不多了，美國將因違背我們的人民而付出慘痛的代價。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen13Subtitle
US: "*We are running low on funds. Scout the area for resources, we must not be stopped"
DE: "*We are running low on funds. Scout the area for resources, we must not be stopped"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNos quedan pocos fondos. Explora el área en busca de recursos; no podemos detenernos."
IT: "\nI fondi scarseggiano: cercate delle risorse, non possiamo fermarci adesso."
KO: "자금이 바닥나고 있습니다. 자원을 찾아 정찰을 보내십시오."
ZH: "\n我們目前資金不足。盡快找尋是否有其他資源可取用，我們的建造能力不可因此停擺。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen14Subtitle
US: "*With this area secure we must now build up and launch an assault on the U.S. European Central Command Base"
DE: "*With this area secure we must now build up and launch an assault on the U.S. European Central Command Base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCon el área asegurada, preparemos y lancemos un asalto sobre la base del mando central de EE.UU. en Europa."
IT: "\nCon questa zona sotto controllo, possiamo preparare l'assalto contro la base del Centro comando europeo degli USA."
KO: "\n안전하게 확보한 이 지역에서 전열을 재정비하고 미국 유럽 중앙 사령부 기지를 공격해야\n합니다."
ZH: "\n由於攻下了此區，現在我們必須對美國駐歐洲中央指揮部進行突襲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen15Subtitle
US: "*The Americans are relying heavily on air units. Build more Stinger sites and Quad Cannons"
DE: "*The Americans are relying heavily on air units. Build more Stinger sites and Quad Cannons"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos americanos dependen mucho de sus unidades aéreas.\nCrea más emplazamientos Stinger y cañones Quad."
IT: "\nGli americani si affidano alle unità aeree: costruite altre Postazioni Stinger e Cannoni quadrupli."
KO: "\n현재 미국군은 공중 유닛에 지나치게 의존하고 있습니다. 스팅어 사이트와 쿼드 캐논을\n더 많이 건설하십시오."
ZH: "\n美軍主要仰賴空中單位進行攻擊。建造更多針刺飛彈陣地和四管加農砲來擊落敵機。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen16Subtitle
US: "*They are targeting our defenses, we must camouflage the stinger sites"
DE: "*They are targeting our defenses, we must camoflauge the stinger sites"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nApuntan a nuestras defensas; debemos camuflar los emplazamientos Stinger."
IT: "\nStanno colpendo le difese, dobbiamo mimetizzare le Postazioni Stinger."
KO: "적은 우리의 방어 시설을 목표로 하고 있습니다. 스팅어 사이트를 위장으로 감추어야 합니다."
ZH: "\n他們正在鎖定我方基地，我們必須讓針刺飛彈陣地進行偽裝。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen17Subtitle
US: "*My General, we need to build a Scud Storm"
DE: "*My General, we need to build a Scud Storm"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMi general, debemos construir una tormenta SCUD."
IT: "\nMio generale, dobbiamo realizzare uno SCUD Storm."
KO: "장군님, 스커드 폭풍을 건설해야 할 때입니다."
ZH: "\n我的好將軍，我們需要建立生化死雨風暴。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen18Subtitle
US: "*The American General is using a Particle Cannon against us"
DE: "*The American General is using a Particle Cannon against us"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl general americano usa un cañón de partículas contra nosotros."
IT: "\nIl Generale americano usa un Cannone particellare contro di noi."
KO: "미국 제너럴이 우리에게 파티클 캐논을 발사합니다."
ZH: "\n美國將軍正利用離子砲來轟炸我們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen19Subtitle
US: "*We have to try a different tactic. Use a sneak attack to get units into the base"
DE: "*We have to try a different tactic. Use a sneak attack to get units into the base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHemos de intentarlo con una táctica diferente. Usa un ataque furtivo para introducir unidades en la base."
IT: "\nDobbiamo tentare una tattica diversa: usate un Attacco furtivo per penetrare nella base."
KO: "다른 전술을 사용해야 합니다. 적진에 침투하는 기습 공격을 시도해 보십시오."
ZH: "\n我們該換一下策略，試試使用偷襲獲得單位並進入基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen20Subtitle
US: "*Capture the U.S. base and build it up. We can use their weapons against them"
DE: "*Capture the U.S. base and build it up. We can use their weapons against them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nToma la base de EE.UU. y amplíala. Podemos usar sus armas contra ellos."
IT: "\nConquistate la base USA e rinforzatela: useremo le loro armi per colpirli."
KO: "미국 기지를 점령해서 이를 잘 활용하십시오. 그들 자신의 무기로 그들을 공격하십시오."
ZH: "\n佔領並建設美國基地，我們將運用他們的武器來反制他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen21Subtitle
US: "*You must take out the Particle Cannon!"
DE: "*You must take out the Particle Cannon!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Debes eliminar el cañón de partículas!"
IT: "\nDovete distruggere quel Cannone particellare!"
KO: "파티클 캐논을 반드시 제거해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n你必須幹掉那門離子砲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen22Subtitle
US: "*They are attacking from the ground now. Defend our base!"
DE: "*They are attacking from the ground now. Defend our base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAhora atacan desde tierra. ¡Defiende nuestra base!"
IT: "\nOra ci attaccano da terra: difendete la base!"
KO: "적은 이제 지상 공격을 합니다. 기지를 방어하십시오!"
ZH: "\n現在他們改從地面襲擊，堅守我們的基地！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen23Subtitle
US: "*Rebuild the base quicklyWe must prepare for more attacks!"
DE: "*Rebuild the base quicklyWe must prepare for more attacks!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRápido, reconstruye la base... ¡Nos esperan más ataques!"
IT: "\nRicostruite subito la base, dobbiamo prepararci a nuovi attacchi!"
KO: "기지를 빨리 재건하십시오. 앞으로 더 있을 공격에 대비해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n快速重建基地！我們還得面對更多波的攻擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen24Subtitle
US: "*Well done, General. Thanks to your superior tactics we now control all three super weapons. The Americans will never know what hit them!"
DE: "*Well done, General. Thanks to your superior tactics we now control all three super weapons. The Americans will never know what hit them!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBien hecho, general. Gracias a tus tácticas, controlamos las tres superarmas.\n¡EE.UU. no sabrá ni con qué le hemos dado!"
IT: "\nBen fatto, generale: grazie a voi ora controlliamo le tre armi speciali. Gli americani non avranno scampo!"
KO: "\n잘하셨습니다, 장군님. 훌륭한 전략에 힘입어 우리는 세 가지 슈퍼 무기를 전부 조종하게\n되었습니다. 미국군은 영문도 모르고 당할 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍。謝謝你的英明睿智讓我們得以控制所有三種超級武器。美國佬永遠也搞不清楚自己是怎\n麼死的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen25Subtitle
US: "*Finish the Americans, General. They cannot hold for much longer"
DE: "*Finish the Americans, General. They cannot hold for much longer"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, hay que acabar con los americanos. No resistirán por mucho más tiempo."
IT: "\nFinite gli americani, generale: non resisteranno ancora a lungo."
KO: "미국군을 끝장내십시오! 장군님. 적은 오래 못버틸 것입니다."
ZH: "\n美國佬大勢已去了，將軍。他們現在有如風中殘燭一般。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen26Subtitle
US: "*General, we can target their chemical bunkers and create havoc in their own base"
DE: "*General, we can target their chemical bunkers and create havoc in their own base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, podemos apuntar a sus búnkeres químicos y sembrar el caos en su propia base."
IT: "\nGenerale, possiamo colpire i loro bunker chimici per creare lo scompiglio nella loro base."
KO: "장군님, 적의 화학 벙커를 공격해서 자신들의 기지에 피해를 입게 하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們可以鎖定他們的生化碉堡，並在基地內製造一片混亂。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen27Subtitle
US: "*Their Particle Cannon is no more"
DE: "*Their Particle Cannon is no more"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSe acabó su cañón de partículas."
IT: "\nIl loro Cannone particellare è distrutto."
KO: "적의 파티클 캐논은 이제 파괴되었습니다."
ZH: "\n幹掉離子砲了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen28Subtitle
US: "*The Americans have built another Particle Cannon. They must not be allowed to use it against us"
DE: "*The Americans have built another Particle Cannon. They must not be allowed to use it against us"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos americanos han construido otro cañón de partículas.\nNo permitiremos que lo usen contra nosotros."
IT: "\nGli americani hanno costruito un altro Cannone particellare:\nnon devono usarlo contro di noi."
KO: "미국군은 또 다른 파티클 캐논을 건설했습니다. 그냥 내버려둬서는 안됩니다."
ZH: "\n美軍又重新建造離子砲，千萬不能再讓他們使用它對付我們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen29Subtitle
US: "*We must eliminate the enemy's Southern support base now! The longer we wait, the more their attacks grow in strength"
DE: "*We must eliminate the enemy's Southern support base now! The longer we wait, the more their attacks grow in strength"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Eliminemos la base sur que da apoyo al enemigo! Cuanto más esperemos, más fuertes serán sus ataques."
IT: "\nDobbiamo eliminare la base di supporto meridionale! Più aspettiamo, più il nemico diventa forte."
KO: "적의 남쪽 지원 기지를 파괴해야만 합니다! 오래 시간을 끌수록 적의 공격이 강력해질 것입니다."
ZH: "\n現在就必須摧毀敵軍南方的補給基地！我們時間耗得愈久，他們攻擊的火力就愈強大。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen30Subtitle
US: "*Reports indicate that the POW's held captive in the U.S. Base will be moved soon. We must rescue them quickly!"
DE: "*Reports indicate that the POW's held captive in the U.S. Base will be moved soon. We must rescue them quickly!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nPronto trasladarán a los prisioneros de la base de EE.UU. ¡Debemos rescatarles enseguida!"
IT: "\nI rapporti indicano che i prigionieri nella base USA saranno trasferiti presto: dobbiamo liberarli subito!"
KO: "\n보고에 따르면 미국군 기지에 잡혀있는 포로들은 곧 이송될 것이라고 합니다.\n빨리 그들을 구출해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n消息指出，受監禁於美國基地的戰俘將被移至別處。我們必須盡快去解救他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen31Subtitle
US: "*You will need to completely clear the U.S. base area to free the POW's"
DE: "*You will need to completely clear the U.S. base area to free the POW's"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nPara liberar a los prisioneros, despeja por completo el área de la base de EE.UU."
IT: "\nDovrete distruggere la base USA per liberare i prigionieri."
KO: "포로들을 해방시키려면 미국군 기지를 완전히 파괴해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n你必須徹底的肅清美國基地，並釋放所有的戰俘"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen32Subtitle
US: "*Hurry, the POW's need to be rescued now!"
DE: "*Hurry, the POW's need to be rescued now!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Deprisa, rescata ya a los prisioneros!"
IT: "\nPresto, dovete salvare i prigionieri!"
KO: "서두르십시오, 포로들은 지금 구출되어야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n動作快，立刻救出戰俘！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen33Subtitle
US: "*We need to bring Radar online by upgrading it from the China Command Center"
DE: "*We need to bring Radar online by upgrading it from the China Command Center"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTenemos que activar el radar mejorándolo desde el centro de mando chino."
IT: "\nDobbiamo attivare un radar, eseguendo l'aggiornamento nel Centro comando cinese."
KO: "중국 커맨드 센터에서 업그레이드를 통해 레이더를 가동시켜야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我們必須在中國的指揮中心升級雷達，來啟動雷達。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen34Subtitle
US: "*It is imperative that you build a GLA Command Center"
DE: "*It is imperative that you build a GLA Command Center"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEs imperativo que construyas un centro de mando del GLA."
IT: "\nDovete realizzare un Centro comando dell'ELG."
KO: "어서 빨리 GLA 커맨드 센터를 건설하십시오."
ZH: "\n建造一個全球解放軍指揮中心乃當務之急。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen35Subtitle
US: "*With the small southern base gone we can focus on the U.S. European Central Command base"
DE: "*With the small southern base gone we can focus on the U.S. European Central Command base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSin la base del sur, podemos concentrarnos en el mando central europeo de EE.UU."
IT: "\nUna volta distrutta la piccola base meridionale, potremo concentrarci\nsul Centro comando europeo."
KO: "\n남쪽의 지원 기지가 파괴되었으니 이제 미국 유럽 중앙 사령부 기지에 공격을 집중할 수\n있게 됐습니다."
ZH: "\n當較小的南方基地被清除後，我們便可以將攻擊火力集中在美國駐歐洲中央指揮部。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen36Subtitle
US: "*The U.S. Central Command Base is massive, we have to find a way in! Perhaps sneak attacks would work"
DE: "*The U.S. Central Command Base is massive, we have to find a way in! Perhaps sneak attacks would work"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl mando central de EE.UU. es enorme; Para entrar, inténtalo con ataques furtivos."
IT: "\nLa base del Centro comando europeo degli USA è ben difesa:\nforse un Attacco furtivo farà al caso nostro."
KO: "\n미국 유럽 중앙 사령부는 거대하고, 우리는 안으로 침입할 방법을 찾아야 합니다!\n아마 잠입 공격이 효과적일 것입니다."
ZH: "\n美國中央指揮基地的規模十分龐大，我們必須想辦法進入！或許偷襲可以奏效。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen37Subtitle
US: "*We need to deliver the POW's to their village so that they will reawaken their Terror Cell"
DE: "*We need to deliver the POW's to their village so that they will reawaken their Terror Cell"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDebemos llevar a los prisioneros a su pueblo para que reactiven\nsu célula terrorista"
IT: "***"
KO: "포로들을 마을로 데려가서 테러 점조직들을 다시 활성화 시키도록 해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我們需將戰俘送回他們的村莊，才能讓他們回憶起恐怖囚房"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen38Subtitle
US: "*Our brothers are being attacked! We must help them!"
DE: "*Our brothers are being attacked! We must help them!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Atacan a nuestros hermanos! ¡Debemos ayudarles!"
IT: "\nI nostri fratelli sono sotto attacco, dobbiamo aiutarli!"
KO: "우리의 형제들이 공격당하고 있습니다! 도와야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n我們的弟兄正遭受攻擊！快幫助他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen39Subtitle
US: "*Return the POW's to their village, follow the river North until you reach it"
DE: "*Return the POW's to their village, follow the river North until you reach it"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDevuelve los prisioneros a su pueblo siguiendo el río hacia el norte"
IT: "\nRiportate i prigionieri al loro villaggio, procedendo verso nord."
KO: "포로들을 그들의 마을로 돌아가게 도와주십시오. 강물을 따라 북쪽으로 향하십시오."
ZH: "\n護送戰俘回到村莊，一直往北沿著河流前行。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen40Subtitle
US: "*The POW's are safe! We must help them return to their village so that they may aid us in our fight against the US!"
DE: "*The POW's are safe! We must help them return to their village so that they may aid us in our fight against the US!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Los prisioneros están a salvo! Ayudémosles a regresar a su pueblo para que nos ayuden en la lucha contra EE.UU."
IT: "\nI prigionieri sono in salvo! Dobbiamo condurli al loro villaggio."
KO: "\n포로들은 안전합니다! 그들이 안전하게 마을로 돌아가서 미국을 향한 우리의 전투를\n도와주도록 하십시오."
ZH: "\n戰俘安全了！我們必須協助他們重返家園，或許他們可以助我們一臂之力抵抗美國！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen41Subtitle
US: "*Take these tanks and we will use them as our own!"
DE: "*Take these tanks and we will use them as our own!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Toma esos tanques y los usaremos como si fueran nuestros!"
IT: "\nPrendete questi carri armati, potremo usarli contro il nemico."
KO: "이 탱크들을 포획해서 우리의 것으로 사용해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n奪取這些坦克，並將他們視為己有。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen42Subtitle
US: "*Secure the supplies and we will hold the perfect area from which to launch our assaults on the Americans!"
DE: "*Secure the supplies and we will hold the perfect area from which to launch our assaults on the Americans!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Asegura los suministros y tendremos el área ideal desde la que atacar a los americanos!"
IT: "\nAssicuratevi i rifornimenti e avremo la base perfetta da cui far partire l'assalto agli americani!"
KO: "이 서플라이들을 확보하여 미국을 공격하는데 사용하십시오!"
ZH: "\n守護這些補給，我們將佔有地利之便可對美軍發動突襲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen43Subtitle
US: "*The soldiers are safe and their families are full of joy! They will fight with us and we have been given more supplies as well"
DE: "*The soldiers are safe and their families are full of joy! They will fight with us and we have been given more supplies as well"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos soldados están a salvo y sus familias, felices. Lucharán con nosotros.\nTambién hemos recibido más suministros."
IT: "\nI soldati sono salvi, le loro famiglie sono felici. Combatteranno\nper noi e avremo anche accesso a\nulteriori risorse."
KO: "\n병사들은 무사히 귀환했고 가족들은 기쁨에 넘쳐합니다!\n그들은 우리와 힘을 합쳐 싸울 것입니다."
ZH: "\n士兵們個個平安，他們的家人都欣喜若狂！他們將加入戰鬥的行列，並且提供我們更多的補給。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen44Subtitle
US: "*We have let our brothers down but they will still fight alongside us"
DE: "*We have let our brothers down but they will still fight alongside us"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHemos defraudado a nuestros hermanos, pero aún así lucharán a nuestro lado."
IT: "\nAbbiamo deluso i nostri fratelli, ma essi combatteranno ugualmente al nostro fianco."
KO: "우리는 형제들을 실망시켰지만, 그들은 여전히 우리의 편일 것입니다."
ZH: "\n雖然我們讓弟兄們失望了，但他們依然會與我們並肩作戰到底。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen45Subtitle
US: "*Our brothers will fight on our side to avenge the death of the POW's!"
DE: "*Our brothers will fight on our side to avenge the death of the POW's!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nuestros hermanos lucharán para vengar la muerte de los prisioneros!"
IT: "\nI nostri fratelli lotteranno con noi!"
KO: "포로들의 죽음에 복수하기 위해 우리의 형제들은 우리 편에 서서 싸울 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n弟兄們將加入我們的行列，並為戰俘的死復仇雪恨！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen46Subtitle
US: "*The Americans have moved the POW's, but our brothers will still fight alongside us against our enemy!"
DE: "*The Americans have moved the POW's, but our brothers will still fight alongside us against our enemy!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEE.UU. ha trasladado a los prisioneros, pero nuestros hermanos lucharán a nuestro lado."
IT: "\nGli americani hanno trasferito i prigionieri,\nma i nostri fratelli saranno ugualmente con noi\ncontro il nemico!"
KO: "미국군은 포로들을 모두 이송했지만, 우리의 형제들은 우리의 편에 서서 싸울 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n美軍已將戰俘移走，但是弟兄們還是將繼續與我們共同對抗敵人！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xKen47Subtitle
US: "*Europe will soon be ours!"
DE: "*Europe will soon be ours!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Pronto, Europa será nuestra!"
IT: "\nPresto l'Europa sarà nostra!"
KO: "유럽은 곧 우리가 점령할 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n歐洲很快將屬於我們所有！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xPOW01Subtitle
US: "*Free us from our captors. Protect us from all US attacks and we will assist you!"
DE: "*Free us from our captors. Protect us from all US attacks and we will assist you!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLibéranos de nuestros captores. ¡Protégenos de los ataques de EE.UU. y te ayudaremos!"
IT: "\nLiberateci dai nostri carcerieri: proteggeteci dagli attacchi USA e noi vi aiuteremo."
KO: "우리를 압제자로부터 해방시켜주십시오. 미국의 공격에서 지켜주면 당신들을 돕겠습니다!"
ZH: "\n快從敵人手中解救我們，保護我們免受美軍的攻擊，我們將會幫助你們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xPOW02Subtitle
US: "*We are ready to travel home when you are"
DE: "*We are ready to travel home when you are"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEstamos listos para volver a casa."
IT: "\nSiamo pronti a tornare a casa."
KO: "우리는 장군님과 함께 할 준비가 되었습니다!"
ZH: "\n我們正等著你們解救並帶我們回家。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xPOW03Subtitle
US: "*Hurry, there is little time!"
DE: "*Hurry, there is little time!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Deprisa, hay poco tiempo!"
