KO: "서두르십시오, 시간이 없습니다!"
ZH: "\n快點，時間所剩不多了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA05xPOW04Subtitle
US: "*Our time is running out!"
