BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA08Kenwar10Subtitle
US: "*We will have to hit them with everything we have"
DE: "*We will have to hit them with everything we have"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHabrá que atacarles con todo lo que tengamos."
IT: "\nDovremo colpirli con tutto ciò che abbiamo."
KO: "모든 수단을 동원하여 적들을 공격해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n我們將使出渾身解數來攻擊他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisGLA08Kenwar39Subtitle
US: "*Our forces are prepared to begin the assault"
DE: "*Our forces are prepared to begin the assault"
FR: "***"
