KO: "빠른 속도의 공격이 감지되었습니다."
ZH: "\n有快速移動物體接近中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01Commander09Subtitle
US: "*Echo company, bomber in-bound, you're too close, pull back!"
DE: "*Echo company, bomber in-bound, you're too close, pull back!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Compañía Eco, se acerca un bombardero! ¡Estáis muy cerca, apartaos!"
IT: "\nCompagnia Eco, bombardiere in arrivo, siete troppo vicini, ripiegate!"
KO: "폭격기 접근중. 물러나십시오!"
ZH: "\nEcho 連，炸彈來襲，你們太靠近了，後退！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01Echo108Subtitle
US: "*More contacts, range 300"
DE: "*More contacts, range 300"
FR: "***"
