KO: "부상당했다!"
ZH: "\n我被擊中了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01Eva02Subtitle
US: "*General, capture enemy oil derricks to secure more supplies for the war effort"
DE: "*General, capture enemy oil derricks to secure more supplies for the war effort"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nToma las torres de perforación; son una garantía de suministros para la campaña bélica."
IT: "\nGenerale, conquistate i Derrick nemici per ottenere ulteriori rifornimenti."
KO: "장군님, 적의 원유 유정탑을 점령하여 전선에 더 많은 자금을 보급하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，快佔領油井以確保有更多的補給以利作戰。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01Raptor201Subtitle
