DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xChat06Subtitle
US: "*Somebody garrison that Radio Station! We need air support now!"
DE: "*Somebody garrison that Radio Station! We need air support now!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Que alguien guarnezca esa emisora! ¡Necesitamos apoyo aéreo ya!"
IT: "\nQualcuno presidi la Stazione radio: ci serve subito il supporto aereo!"
KO: "라디오 방송국에 병사를 보내십시오! 공중 지원이 필요합니다!"
ZH: "\n誰來駐守廣播電台！我們現在需要呼叫空中支援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xChat07Subtitle
US: "*Aim for those barrels! They're explosive!"
DE: "*Aim for those barrels! They're explosive!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Apunta a esos barriles! ¡Son explosivos!"
IT: "\nMirate a quei barili. Possono esplodere!"
KO: "저 통들을 조준하라! 폭발물들이다!"
ZH: "\n瞄準那些油桶！它們會爆炸！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xChat08Subtitle
US: "*Ok boys. Let's load 'em up, and mooove 'em out!"
DE: "*Ok boys. Lets load em up, and mooove em out!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDe acuerdo, chicos. ¡Hay que cargarlos y sacarlos de aquí!"
IT: "\nBene, ragazzi, prepariamo tutto e diamoci una mossa!"
KO: "좋아, 놈들을 싹 쓸어버리자!"
ZH: "\n好的，讓我們將砲彈上膛，然後狠狠的發射出去！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xChat09Subtitle
US: "*Stinger sites are down! Repeat Stingers down! All units converge on GLA structures! Let's tear this place up!"
DE: "*Stinger sites are down! Repeat Stingers down! All units converge on GLA structures! Let's tear this place up!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Emplazamientos Stinger inoperativos! ¡Repito, Stingers inoperativos! ¡Hay que concentrarse en los edificios del GLA! ¡Arrasemos este lugar!"
IT: "\nPostazioni Stinger distrutte! Ripeto: Postazioni Stinger distrutte!\nTutte le unità sulle strutture dell'ELG,\nfacciamo a pezzi questo posto!"
KO: "\n스팅어 사이트를 제거했다! 반복한다, 스팅어 사이트를 제거했다!\n모든 유닛은 GLA의 건물에 사격을 집중하라! 이곳을 박살내버리자!"
ZH: "\n針刺飛彈陣地被摧毀了！重述，針刺飛彈全毀！所有單位集中火力在全球解放軍的建築！讓我們把這裡\n連根拔起！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xChat10Subtitle
US: "*More GLA structures to the west!"
DE: "*More GLA structures to the west!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Más edificios del GLA al oeste!"
IT: "\nAltre strutture dell'ELG a ovest!"
KO: "서쪽에 GLA 건물이 더 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n西邊有更多全球解放軍的建築！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xChat12Subtitle
US: "*Will do, HQ! Got 'em in my sights"
DE: "*Will do, HQ! Got 'em in my sights"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡De acuerdo, CG! Los tengo a tiro."
IT: "\nD'accordo, quartier generale. Ci sono."
KO: "알았다 본부! 지금 시야에 들어왔다."
ZH: "\n讓我來，總部！他們將從我的視線全部消失。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xChat13Subtitle
US: "*Delivering payload"
DE: "*Delivering payload"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSoltando carga."
IT: "\nSto consegnando il pacco."
KO: "폭탄 배달중"
ZH: "\n投彈完成。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xChat14Subtitle
US: "*Love that fresh smell of MOAB in the morning"
DE: "*Love that fresh smell of MOAB in the morning"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMe encanta el aroma a MDTB por la mañana..."
IT: "\nAdoro il fresco profumo della MDTB al mattino presto."
KO: "이른 아침의 신선한 폭탄 냄새는 정말 훌륭하군."
ZH: "\n我愛死了一早聞到炸彈之母的鮮味。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xCin01Subtitle
US: "*All units clear the launch area. Launch is scheduled in t-minus"
DE: "*All units clear the launch area. Launch is scheduled in t-minus"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nA todas las unidades: despejen área de lanzamiento. Lanzamiento en..."
IT: "\nA tutte le unità: allontanarsi dalla zona di lancio. Il missile partirà fra..."
KO: "모든 유닛은 발사 지역에서 벗어나라. 발사는 곧 진행된다."
ZH: "\n所有單位準備摧毀目標區域，發射將倒數計時。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

