DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xCin08Subtitle
US: "*We have launch"
DE: "*We have launch"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nYa."
IT: "\nLancio."
KO: "발사"
ZH: "\n準備發射。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xCin09Subtitle
US: "*Launch is a go"
DE: "*Launch is a go"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLanzamiento confirmado."
IT: "\nLancio eseguito."
KO: "발사"
ZH: "\n發射！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xCin10Subtitle
US: "*Filthy Americans. We will torch your presence here"
DE: "*Filthy Americans. We will torch your presence here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSucios americanos. Os echaremos de aquí."
IT: "\nLuridi americani: vi spazzeremo via."
KO: "역겨운 미국놈들, 다 태워줄테다."
ZH: "\n卑鄙的美國佬，我們要把你當場燒死。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xCin11Subtitle
US: "*Stupid American cowboys!"
DE: "*Stupid American cowboys!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Estúpidos cowboys americanos!"
IT: "\nStupidi cowboy!"
KO: "멍청한 미국 카우보이들!"
ZH: "\n愚蠢的美國牛仔！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva01Subtitle
US: "*Good work, General. The depot is secured"
DE: "*Good work, General. The depot is secured"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuen trabajo, general. Depósito asegurado."
IT: "***"
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 역을 확보했습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍。我們攻下火車站了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva02Subtitle
US: "*Now we need to build an attack force large enough to destroy the GLA base"
DE: "*Now we need to build an attack force large enough to destroy the GLA base"
FR: "***"
ES: "TRANSMISIÓN:\nCreemos una fuerza de ataque que permita destruir la base del GLA.\nTraslada las unidades a los vagones"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 GLA 기지를 전부 파괴할 만큼 대규모의 병력을 모아야 합니다."
ZH: "\n現在我們需要建立大型攻擊部隊，才足以摧毀全球解放軍的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva03Subtitle
US: "*Load your best units onto the train"
DE: "*Load your best units onto the train"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCarga el tren con las mejores unidades."
IT: "***"
KO: "최정예 유닛들만 기차에 탑승시키십시오."
ZH: "\n把你最精良的單位裝載至火車上。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva04Subtitle
US: "*The train will depart when it is completely full"
DE: "*The train will depart when it is completely full"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl tren partirá cuando esté completamente lleno."
IT: "\nIl treno partirà una volta completo."
KO: "기차는 유닛들로 가득차면 출발합니다."
ZH: "\n當火車滿載的時候就準備出發。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva05Subtitle
US: "*Good work, General the train is full"
DE: "*Good work, General the train is full"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuen trabajo, general; el tren está lleno."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, generale, il treno è carico."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 기차가 가득 찼습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍。火車已經滿載。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva06Subtitle
US: "*Get that Dragon Tank up there to clear out those buildings"
DE: "*Get that Dragon Tank up there to clear out those buildings"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLleva el tanque Dragon allí arriba para despejar esos edificios."
IT: "\nUsate quel Carro Dragon per dare una ripulita a quelle strutture."
KO: "건물 내부를 소탕하려면 드래곤 탱크를 불러오십시오."
ZH: "\n利用火龍坦克肅清那些建築。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva07Subtitle
US: "*Build more units. We don't want to fail in our surprise attack"
DE: "*Build more units. We don't want to fail in our surprise attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nConstruye más unidades. No queremos que fracase nuestro ataque sorpresa."
IT: "\nRealizzate altre unità: il nostro attacco a sorpresa non deve fallire."
KO: "더 많은 유닛을 만드십시오. 우리의 기습공격을 성공시켜야 합니다."
ZH: "\n建造更多的單位。我們不想在奇襲戰術上挫敗。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva08Subtitle
US: "*General! Get your men out of the pit! We've got MOABS on the way that are gonna blow this place to bits"
DE: "*General! Get your men out of the pit! We've got MOABS on the way that are gonna blow this place to bits"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General! ¡Saca a esos hombres del foso! Las MDTB que se acercan reducirán ese lugar a escombros."
IT: "\nGenerale, fate uscire da lì i vostri uomini! MDTB in arrivo, questo posto sarà ridotto a brandelli."
KO: "\n장군님! 유닛들을 목표지역에서 이동시키십시오!\n이 지역을 산산조각낼 MOAB이 곧 투하될 것입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍！快叫弟兄們離開戰壕！炸彈之母已經發射，而且將會把這裡炸到翻過來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva09Subtitle
US: "*We need to finish destroying this base!"
DE: "*We need to finish destroying this base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Destruyamos de una vez esta base!"
IT: "\nDobbiamo portare a termine la distruzione della base!"
KO: "이 기지를 마저 파괴해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n我們必須完成摧毀這個基地的任務！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva10Subtitle
US: "*The MOABs will be here any minute!"
DE: "*The MOABs will be here any minute!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Las MDTB llegarán en cualquier momento!"
IT: "***"
KO: "MOAB이 곧 투하됩니다!"
ZH: "\n炸彈之母隨時都會臨空而降！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva11Subtitle
US: "*Alpha Wing! Area is clear. You may proceed"
DE: "*Alpha Wing! Area is clear. You may proceed"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "알파 윙! 확인 완료! 전진해도 좋습니다!"
ZH: "\nAlpha 聯隊！區域安全了，你可以繼續進行。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA01xEva12Subtitle
US: "*Good work, General. It looks like the GLA threat has finally been removed. It's time to put all this behind us and get looking for those WMDs"
DE: "*Good work, General. It looks like the GLA threat has finally been removed. It's time to put all this behind us and get looking for those WMDs"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuen trabajo, general. Parece que al fin hemos eliminado la amenaza del GLA.\nDejemos esto atrás y busquemos esas armas de destrucción masiva"
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, ora possiamo cercare le armi di distruzione di massa."
KO: "\n잘하셨습니다, 장군님. GLA의 위협은 이제 사라진 것 같습니다.\n이제 대량 살상 무기를 찾아야 할 때가 왔습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍。看來全球解放軍的武力威脅已經解除，現在該把這一切都拋至身後，然後找尋大規模毀\n滅性武器的下落"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02Comanche101Subtitle
US: "*Thanks for getting me out, sir! Things were getting a little dicey for me"
DE: "*Thanks for getting me out, sir! Things were getting a little dicey for me"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Gracias por salvarme, señor! Las cosas se estaban poniendo feas."
IT: "\nGrazie per avermi liberato, signore! La mia situazione era tutt'altro che piacevole."
KO: "구출해주셔서 감사합니다! 정말 위험한 상황이었습니다."
ZH: "\n謝謝你救我脫困，長官！剛剛的情況實在有點危險。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02Comanche204Subtitle
US: "*They're swarming us, sir!"
DE: "*They're swarming us, sir!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Vienen en masa, señor!"
IT: "\nCi stanno circondando, signore!"
KO: "적들이 득실거립니다!"
ZH: "\n他們成群結隊朝我們而來，長官！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xBrf01Subtitle
US: "*The docks have been cleared, General. Our first task will be to hold them while the supply trucks are brought in. Until the Dozers arrive, we will have to defend this position with our troops as they filter in"
DE: "*The docks have been cleared, General. Our first task will be to hold them while the supply trucks are brought in. Until the Dozers arrive, we will have to defend this position with our troops as they filter in"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl puerto está despejado, general. La prioridad es conservarlos mientras traen los camiones de suministros. Hasta que lleguen las excavadoras, defenderemos la posición con nuestras tropas."
IT: "\nIl porto è sicuro, generale: ora dovremo difenderlo fino all'arrivo dei camion dei rifornimenti. Finché non avremo i Bulldozer, dovremo mantenere la posizione con le forze a nostra disposizione."
KO: "\n도크를 확보했습니다, 장군님. 우리의 첫번째 임무는 서플라이 트럭이 오는 동안\n이 곳을 지키는 것입니다. 건설 불도저가 도착할 때까지 병사들로 이 곳을 지키십시오."
ZH: "\n碼頭已經肅清，將軍，我們第一個任務就是守護碼頭直到補給卡車抵達。另外，在推土機到達之前，我\n們要嚴守陣線以防止鼠輩的滲透。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xBrf02Subtitle
US: "*Most of our fleet survived the GLA Baikonur Attack. Our Aircraft Carrier and Battleship escorts are at your disposal to aid with this operation"
DE: "*Most of our fleet survived the GLA Baikonur Attack. Our Aircraft Carrier and Battleship escorts are at your disposal to aid with this operation"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCasi toda la flota sobrevivió al ataque de Baikonur del GLA.\nNuestro portaaviones y los buques escolta están a tu disposición ."
IT: "\nBuona parte della flotta è sopravvissuta all'attacco ELG di Baikonur:\nportaerei e navi di scorta sono a vostra disposizione."
KO: "\n대부분의 우리의 함대가 GLA의 바이코누르 공격에서 살아남았습니다.\n항공모함과 호위 전함들은 이번 작전 지원을 위해 장군님의 명령만 기다리고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n我方大部分艦隊，在全球解放軍巴以庫爾所發動的攻擊中倖存，因此航空母艦及護航戰艦群將在你的指\n揮之下，支援此次作戰。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xChat01Subtitle
US: "*Air-strike Launched"
DE: "*Airstrike Launched"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAtaque aéreo lanzado."
IT: "\nAttacco aereo lanciato."
KO: "공습 발진"
ZH: "\n空擊行動開始了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xChat02Subtitle
US: "*Battleship commencing bombardment"
DE: "*Battleship commencing bombardment"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuque de guerra iniciando bombardeo."
IT: "\nLa Nave da guerra inizia il bombardamento."
KO: "전함이 함포 사격을 시작합니다."
ZH: "\n我方戰艦開始進行砲轟。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xChat03Subtitle
US: "*Docks are all clear. No GLA in sight"
DE: "*Docks are all clear. No GLA in sight"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nPuerto despejado. No hay GLA a la vista."
IT: "\nIl porto è sicuro, nessuna unità ELG in vista."
KO: "도크를 확보했다. GLA는 보이지 않는다."
ZH: "\n碼頭安全了，沒有全球解放軍的鬼影子了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xChat04Subtitle
US: "*Roger that"
DE: "*Roger that"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecibido."
IT: "\nRicevuto."
KO: "알았다."
ZH: "\n收到。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xChat05Subtitle
US: "*Commencing Attack"
DE: "*Commencing Attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nIniciando ataque."
IT: "\nInizio l'attacco."
KO: "공격 개시!"
ZH: "\n開始發動攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xChat06Subtitle
US: "*Launching Air-strike"
DE: "*Launching Airstrike"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLanzando ataque aéreo."
IT: "\nAttacco aereo lanciato."
KO: "공습 개시!"
ZH: "\n開始進行空擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xChat07Subtitle
US: "*Guns a blazing"
DE: "*Guns ablazing"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos cañones escupen fuego."
IT: "\nArmi in azione."
KO: "포격중!"
ZH: "\n火砲發射！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xChat08Subtitle
US: "*We'll give them some red glare alright"
DE: "*We'll give them some red glare alright"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nVamos a deslumbrarlos en rojo."
IT: "\nGli daremo una bella lezione."
KO: "번쩍이는 불꽃을 선물해주마!"
ZH: "\n給他們點「眼」色瞧瞧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xCin01Subtitle
US: "*Carrier Command to fleet. Keep up the fire, boys. The GLA are bringing in reinforcements"
DE: "*Carrier Command to fleet. Keep up the fire, boys. The GLA are bringing in reinforcements"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMando del portaaviones a flota. Seguid disparando, chicos. El GLA trae refuerzos."
IT: "\nPortaerei alla flotta: continuate a sparare, ragazzi, arrivano dei rinforzi dell'ELG."
KO: "항공모함 사령관이 함대에 전한다. 사격을 계속 하게나, 제군들. GLA의 지원군이 오고 있다."
ZH: "\n航艦艦長呼叫艦隊，繼續發射，年輕人，全球解放軍的援軍到了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xCin02Subtitle
US: "*Roger that, Carrier command. Maintaining suppression fire on the docks"
DE: "*Roger that, Carrier command. Maintaining suppression fire on the docks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecibido, mando. Mantenemos fuego de cobertura en el puerto."
IT: "\nRicevuto, Portaerei. Continuiamo il fuoco di soppressione sul porto."
KO: "알겠습니다, 도크로 압박 사격을 유지하라!"
ZH: "\n收到，艦長。繼續提供碼頭的火力壓制。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xCin03Subtitle
US: "*Be careful what you hit. We just want to clear it out, not destroy it"
DE: "*Be careful what you hit. We just want to clear it out, not destroy it"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nVigilad dónde disparáis. Queremos limpiarlo, no destruirlo."
IT: "\nAttenti a dove sparate: dobbiamo conquistarlo, non distruggerlo."
KO: "\n조심해서 사격하십시오. 적들을 제거하는 것이 목표이지 이 곳을 파괴하는 것이\n목표가 아닙니다."
ZH: "\n注意你要開火的目標，我們只是要攻下來，並不是要全盤摧毀它。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva01Subtitle
US: "*Good work, sir! Our next objective is to provide safe passage for the supply trucks as they travel through the city. The trucks must reach the city's supply warehouse. We must also retain control of the docks. Good luck, sir"
DE: "*Good work, sir! Our next objective is to provide safe passage for the supply trucks as they travel through the city. The trucks must reach the city's supply warehouse. We must also retain control of the docks. Good luck, sir"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Buen trabajo! Ahora hay que dotar de un corredor seguro a los camiones de suministros a su paso por la ciudad. Deben llegar hasta el almacén. Además, hay que mantener el control del puerto. Buena suerte, señor."
IT: "\nBel lavoro, signore! Il prossimo obiettivo è permettere il passaggio dei camion di rifornimenti in città: devono raggiungere il magazzino. Inoltre, dovrete mantenere il controllo del porto."
KO: "\n잘하셨습니다. 다음 목표는 서플라이 트럭이 도시를 무사히 지나 서플라이 보관소에\n도달하도록 안전한 루트를 제공하는 것입니다. 도크 역시 계속 지켜내야 합니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，長官！我們下一個任務是要安全的護送補給卡車穿越城鎮，直到抵達補給倉庫。另外，我們還\n得保有碼頭的控制權。祝你好運，長官。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva02Subtitle
US: "*Supply Trucks are beginning to move, General. We must provide protection as they make their way to the drop off point"
DE: "*Supply Trucks are beginning to move, General. We must provide protection as they make their way to the drop off point"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, los camiones de suministros se ponen en marcha. Protejámoslos durante su desplazamiento hasta el punto de entrega."
IT: "\nI camion iniziano a muoversi, generale: proteggeteli fino a destinazione."
KO: "서플라이 트럭이 움직이기 시작합니다, 장군님. 목표 지점까지 트럭들을 보호해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n補給卡車即將要出發，將軍。我們必須沿途保護它們直到目的地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva03Subtitle
US: "*I'm sending you some new prototype sentry drones. The enemy can't detect them if they stay still. The drones are also capable of spotting stealthed units as well as GLA demo traps. They should prove to be very useful"
DE: "*I'm sending you some new prototype sentry drones. The enemy can't detect them if they stay still. The drones are also capable of spotting stealthed units as well as GLA demo traps. They should prove to be very useful"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTe mando unos nuevos prototipos de teledirigidos centinelas. Son indetectables cuando se quedan quietos. Detectan unidades encubiertas y trampas de demolición del GLA. Resultarán muy útiles."
IT: "\nSto inviando dei nuovi prototipi di Drone da ricognizione, che risultano invisibili quando non si muovono e possono individuare unità mimetizzate e Trappole demolitrici. Vi saranno utili."
KO: "\n지금 시제품 센트리 트론을 몇 대 보냅니다. 이 센트리 드론은 움직이지 않을 경우\n적에게 보이지 않습니다. 적 스텔스 유닛과 GLA 폭약 함정을 탐지할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n我派遣了新式標準的無人哨兵機前來，如果它們靜止不動的時候，敵軍無法偵測到它們的存在。蜂型機\n還具有偵察匿蹤單位及炸藥陷阱的能力，它們是非常有用的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva04Subtitle
US: "*Our dozer has arrived sir! Begin building up your base. The GLA are preparing a new wave of attacks against us!"
DE: "*Our dozer has arrived sir! Begin building up your base. The GLA are preparing a new wave of attacks against us!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Ha llegado nuestra excavadora! Hay que empezar a construir la base.\n¡El GLA prepara nuevos ataques!"
IT: "\nIl nostro Bulldozer è arrivato, iniziate a costruire la base!\nL'ELG sta organizzando una nuova ondata di attacchi!"
KO: "건설 불도저가 도착했습니다! 기지 건설을 시작하십시오. GLA는 다음 공격을 준비중입니다!"
ZH: "\n無人哨兵機已經抵達，長官！立刻開始建造基地，全球解放軍正在計畫新一波的攻擊行動！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva05Subtitle
US: "*Great job, sir! The people of this city have expressed their gratitude for the relief supplies. Our final objective is to drive the GLA from the area. Destroy their main base overlooking the city and the area will be secured"
DE: "*Great job, sir! The people of this city have expressed their gratitude for the relief supplies. Our final objective is to drive the GLA from the area. Destroy their main base overlooking the city and the area will be secured"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Excelente trabajo! La ciudad está agradecida por los suministros.\nNuestro objetivo final es expulsar de la zona al GLA.\nDestruye la base que domina la ciudad, y el área será segura."
IT: "\nSplendido lavoro, signore, gli abitanti della città ci sono grati.\nIl nostro obiettivo finale è scacciare l'ELG dalla zona:\ndistruggete la base primaria che domina la città."
KO: "\n훌륭합니다, 장군님! 시민들은 구호물자에 대하여 깊은 감사를 표시했습니다.\n우리의 마지막 목표는 GLA를 몰아내는 것입니다. 그들의 본 기지를 파괴하십시오."
ZH: "\n幹得好，長官！城鎮人民已經表示對我們提供的救援物資感到相當感激。我們下一個任務是要將全球解\n放軍趕出這個區域，並摧毀他們山上的主要基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva06Subtitle
US: "*Reinforcements incoming, General"
DE: "*Reinforcements incoming, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLlegan refuerzos, general."
IT: "\nRinforzi in arrivo, generale."
KO: "지원군이 도착하고 있습니다, 장군님."
ZH: "\n援軍抵達，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva07Subtitle
US: "*General, our Sentry Drones can help spot GLA Demo Traps"
DE: "*General, our Sentry Drones can help spot GLA Demo Traps"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, los teledirigidos centinelas pueden localizar trampas de demolición del GLA."
IT: "\nGenerale, i Droni da ricognizione possono individuare le Trappole demolitrici dell'ELG."
KO: "장군님, 센트리 드론은 GLA의 폭약 함정을 탐지할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我方的無人哨兵機可以協助偵察全球解放軍炸藥陷阱的位置。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva08Subtitle
US: "*Sir, there are still GLA near the warehouse. We need to clear them out immediately"
DE: "*Sir, there are still GLA near the warehouse. We need to clear them out immediately"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAún hay restos del GLA cerca del almacén. Tenemos que barrerlos inmediatamente."
IT: "\nSignore, ci sono ancora unità ELG nei pressi del magazzino: distruggetele."
KO: "장군님, 보관소 주변에 아직 GLA가 있습니다. 즉시 제거하십시오."
ZH: "\n長官，倉庫附近依然有鼠輩蹤跡，我們必須立刻將他們清除殆盡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva09Subtitle
US: "*Supply Trucks are under attack!"
DE: "*Supply Trucks are under attack!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Atacan a los camiones de suministros!"
IT: "\nI camion dei rifornimenti sono sotto attacco!"
KO: "서플라이 트럭들이 공격당하고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n補給卡車正遭受攻擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva10Subtitle
US: "*Good job, all trucks are safely to the docks, now lets get them to the city"
DE: "*Good job, all trucks are safely to the docks, now lets get them to the city"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuen trabajo; los camiones están a salvo en el puerto.\nAhora, llevémoslos a la ciudad."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, i camion sono arrivati al porto, ora conduceteli in città."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 모든 트럭은 도크로 안전하게 이동했습니다. 이제 트럭들을 도시로 보내십시오."
ZH: "\n太好了，所有卡車都安全抵達碼頭，現在讓我們護送它們前往城鎮吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva11Subtitle
US: "*Try to minimize civilian casualties"
DE: "*Try to minimize civilian casualties"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTrata de minimizar las bajas civiles."
IT: "\nRiducete al minimo le perdite fra i civili."
KO: "민간인 피해를 최소화하십시오."
ZH: "\n務必盡量減低平民的傷亡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva12Subtitle
US: "*You've discovered a GLA training camp, sir. Intelligence believes that members of this camp were partially responsible for the Baikonur Launch. We have been ordered to take it out"
DE: "*You've discovered a GLA training camp, sir. Intelligence believes that members of this camp were partially responsible for the Baikonur Launch. We have been ordered to take it out"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHas hallado un campo de entrenamiento del GLA. Creemos que sus miembros fueron responsables en parte del lanzamiento de Baikonur. Se nos ha ordenado eliminarlo."
IT: "\nAvete scoperto un campo di addestramento dell'ELG: sembra che da qui provengano i responsabili del lancio di Baikonur. Dobbiamo radere tutto al suolo."
KO: "\nGLA의 훈련소를 발견했습니다. 정보에 따르면 여기서 훈련받은 자들이 바이코누르 발사와\n연관되어 있다고 합니다. 이곳을 파괴하라는 지시가 내려왔습니다."
ZH: "\n發現一處全球解放軍的訓練營，長官。情報表示在這裡的部分成員，是負責巴以庫爾的飛彈發射任務。\n我們受命要將他們幹掉。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva13Subtitle
US: "*Secure the warehouse so the supply trucks can proceed safely"
DE: "*Secure the warehouse so the supply trucks can proceed safely"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAsegura el almacén para que los camiones avancen sin complicaciones."
IT: "\nConquistate il magazzino per garantire la sicurezza dei camion."
KO: "보관소를 안전하게 확보하여 트럭들이 안전하게 이동하게 하십시오."
ZH: "\n守護倉庫好讓補給卡車安全的進行任務。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva14Subtitle
US: "*Once the warehouse is secure the supply trucks will proceed"
DE: "*Once the warehouse is secure the supply trucks will proceed"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos camiones avanzarán cuando el almacén sea seguro."
IT: "\nUna volta conquistato il magazzino, i camion si metteranno in movimento."
KO: "보관소가 안전하게 확보되면 서플라이 트럭들은 이동할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n一旦確認倉庫安全之後，補給卡車將可繼續任務。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva15Subtitle
US: "*Dozers have arrived general. You are cleared to eliminate the GLA at your discretion"
DE: "*Dozers have arrived general. You are cleared to eliminate the GLA at your discretion"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHan llegado las excavadoras, general. Tienes vía libre para eliminar al GLA como estimes conveniente."
IT: "\nI Bulldozer sono arrivati, generale: eliminate l'ELG a vostra discrezione."
KO: "건설 불도저가 도착했습니다, 장군님. 이제 GLA를 제거할 때입니다."
ZH: "\n推土機已經抵達，將軍。你可隨時下令殲滅全球解放軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva16Subtitle
US: "*Get the food to the city before the GLA can steal or destroy it"
DE: "*Get the food to the city before the GLA can steal or destroy it"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nQue la comida llegue a la ciudad antes de que el GLA la robe o destruya."
IT: "\nPortate il cibo in città prima che l'ELG lo rubi o lo distrugga."
KO: "GLA가 훔치거나 파괴하기 전에 이 식량들을 도시로 운송하십시오."
ZH: "\n盡快將食物送抵城鎮，以防全球解放軍試圖偷取或是摧毀它。。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva17Subtitle
US: "*General, we've done it. The city is free from the GLA tyranny. It looks like they've got some Intel that will lead us straight to those hidden WMDs"
DE: "*General, we've done it. The city is free from the GLA tyranny. It looks like they've got some Intel that will lead us straight to those hidden WMDs"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, lo logramos. La ciudad está libre de la tiranía del GLA. Tienen información que nos podría llevar hasta las armas de destrucción masiva"
IT: "\nGenerale, ce l'abbiamo fatta. La città è libera dalla tirannia dell'ELG!"
KO: "\n장군님, 성공입니다. 도시는 GLA의 압제에서 해방되었습니다. 그리고 대량 살상 무기의\n존재에 대한 첩보가 들어왔습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們成功了，城市已經脫離全球解放軍的高壓統治。看來人民將帶領我們前去找尋隱藏的大規模\n毀滅性武器。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva18Subtitle
US: "*Full naval support is available for this operation"
DE: "*Full naval support is available for this operation"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEsta operación cuenta con apoyo naval completo."
IT: "\nDisponete di pieno supporto navale."
KO: "이번 작전에는 전폭적인 해군 지원이 있습니다."
ZH: "\n全體海軍艦隊將支援此次的作戰。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva19Subtitle
US: "*Use the battleships and aircraft carrier at your discretion"
DE: "*Use the battleships and aircraft carrier at your discretion"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nUsa los buques de guerra y portaaviones como consideres oportuno."
IT: "\nUsate le navi da guerra e la portaerei a vostra discrezione."
KO: "전함과 항공모함을 필요할 때 사용하십시오."
ZH: "\n戰艦及航空母艦將依你的調配來行動。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva20Subtitle
US: "*The battleships are in range and awaiting targets, General"
DE: "*The battelships are in range and awaiting targets, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos buques están en la zona esperando órdenes, general."
IT: "\nLe navi da guerra attendono un bersaglio, generale."
KO: "전함 함포 사격 준비 완료"
ZH: "\n戰艦已經鎖定射程範圍並正搜索目標當中，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva21Subtitle
US: "*The CVN Daedalus is standing by with aircraft at the ready"
DE: "*The CVN Daedalus is standing by with aircraft at the ready"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl CVN Daedalus está disponible y con la aviación a punto."
IT: "\nLa CVN Daedalus è pronta a lanciare i suoi aerei."
KO: "CVN 다이달로스 준비 완료"
ZH: "\nCVN 帝德拉斯號戰艦隨護航空母艦，已經準備就緒。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva22Subtitle
US: "*The warehouse needs to be secured, but the safety of the docks must not be compromised"
DE: "*The warehouse needs to be secured, but the safety of the docks must not be compromised"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHay que asegurar el almacén sin descuidar la seguridad del puerto."
IT: "\nDovete conquistare il magazzino, senza perdere il porto."
KO: "보관소를 안전하게 확보하는 동시에 도크도 빼앗겨서는 안됩니다."
ZH: "\n我們將守護倉庫的安全，但是碼頭的控制權也不能有所讓步。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva23Subtitle
US: "*Our forces are limited in this area. You will receive reinforcements as they become available"
DE: "*Our forces are limited in this area. You will recieve reinforcements as they become available"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEn esta área nuestras fuerzas son limitadas. Recibirás refuerzos en cuanto estén disponibles."
IT: "\nLe nostre forze sono limitate: riceverete dei rinforzi non appena sarà possibile."
KO: "병력이 이 지역에 한정되어 있습니다. 때가 되면 지원군이 도착할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n我們此區的部隊有限，時機一到，會有援軍抵達。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva24Subtitle
US: "*Secure the warehouse without compromising the safety of the docks"
DE: "*Secure the warehouse without compromising the safety of the docks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAsegura el almacén sin descuidar la seguridad del puerto."
IT: "\nConquistate il magazzino senza perdere il porto."
KO: "도크를 빼앗기지 않도록 주의하면서 보관소를 안전하게 확보하십시오."
ZH: "\n守護倉庫，同時不要放棄保護碼頭的安全。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva25Subtitle
US: "*The convoy has resupplied the warehouse"
DE: "*The convoy has resupplied the warehouse"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl convoy ha reabastecido el almacén."
IT: "\nIl convoglio ha rifornito il magazzino."
KO: "호송대가 보관소에 물자를 공급했습니다."
ZH: "\n車隊已經從倉庫完成再補給。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xEva26Subtitle
US: "*The GLA Base is the next objective, General"
DE: "*The GLA Base is the next objective, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa base del GLA es el próximo objetivo, general."
IT: "\nIl prossimo obiettivo è la base dell'ELG, generale."
KO: "다음 목표는 GLA의 기지입니다."
ZH: "\n摧毀全球解放軍基地是我們下一個目標，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xSupply01Subtitle
US: "*As soon as that warehouse is safe, we will roll out"
DE: "*As soon as that warehouse is safe, we will roll out"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNo saldremos hasta que ese almacén sea seguro."
IT: "\nNon appena il magazzino sarà sicuro, procederemo."
KO: "보관소가 안전하게 확보되는 즉시 출발합니다."
ZH: "\n一旦確認倉庫安全，我們就要來個絕地大反攻。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xSupply02Subtitle
US: "*Thanks for the cover fire, General! All trucks loaded and ready to move out. Just clear out that city for us, sir!"
DE: "*Thanks for the cover fire, General! All trucks loaded and ready to move out. Just clear out that city for us, sir!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Gracias por cubrirnos, general! Camiones cargados y listos para partir. ¡Necesitamos la ciudad limpia, señor!"
IT: "\nGrazie per l'aiuto, generale: tutti i camion sono pronti a partire. Ripulite la città, signore!"
KO: "\n엄호 사격에 감사드립니다, 장군님! 모든 트럭에 짐을 실었고 출발할 준비가 되었습니다.\n적들을 도시에서 몰아내 주십시오!"
ZH: "\n謝謝你的掩護射擊，將軍！所有卡車已經裝載補給即將出發，幫我們肅清整個城鎮吧，長官！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xSupply03Subtitle
US: "*The streets are lined with Demo Traps, sir! We'll need them swept clear!"
DE: "*The streets are lined with Demo Traps, sir! We'll need them swept clear!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Las calles están llenas de trampas de demolición! ¡Necesitamos que las limpien!"
IT: "\nLe strade sono piene di Trappole demolitrici, dovete rimuoverle!"
KO: "도로에는 폭약 함정들이 줄을 지어 있습니다. 모두 제거해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n整條路都佈滿了炸藥陷阱，長官！請將它們全部清除。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xSupply04Subtitle
US: "*We've reached the warehouse, General. Thanks for the escort!"
DE: "*We've reached the warehouse, General. Thanks for the escort!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, hemos llegado al almacén. ¡Gracias por escoltarnos!"
IT: "\nSiamo arrivati al magazzino, generale, grazie per l'aiuto!"
KO: "보관소에 도착했습니다. 호위해주셔서 감사합니다!"
ZH: "\n我們已經抵達倉庫，將軍。謝謝你們的隨護！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xSupply05Subtitle
US: "*Convoy's arrived safely, sir. Thanks for the cover"
DE: "*Convoy's arrived safely, sir. Thanks for the cover"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSeñor, el convoy a llegado sano y salvo. Gracias por cubrirnos."
IT: "\nConvoglio al sicuro, signore: grazie."
KO: "호송대가 무사히 도착했습니다. 엄호해주셔서 감사드립니다."
ZH: "\n車隊已經安全抵達，長官，謝謝你們提供的掩護。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xVillager01Subtitle
US: "*Oh thank you"
DE: "*Oh thank you"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nOh, gracias."
IT: "\nOh, grazie."
KO: "감사합니다!"
ZH: "\n喔，謝謝你們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xVillager02Subtitle
US: "*Bless You"
DE: "*Bless You"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBendito seas."
IT: "\nChe Dio vi benedica."
KO: "감사합니다!"
ZH: "\n祝福你們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xVillager03Subtitle
US: "*I haven't eaten in so long"
DE: "*I haven't eaten in so long"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHace tanto que no como..."
IT: "\nNon mangiavo da molto tempo."
KO: "너무 오랫동안 먹지를 못했어요."
ZH: "\n我好久沒有吃東西了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA02xVillager04Subtitle
US: "*Will there be any more?"
DE: "*Will there be any more?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¿Habrá más?"
IT: "\nCe ne sarà ancora?"
KO: "더 없습니까?"
ZH: "\n還會有更多的嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03Comanche102Subtitle
US: "*Quad Cannons are picking us apart, sir"
DE: "*Quad Cannons are picking us apart, sir"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos cañones Quad nos están destrozando."
IT: "\nI Cannoni quadrupli ci stanno facendo a pezzi."
KO: "쿼드 캐논이 우리를 박살내고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n四管加農砲的火力超強，長官。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03Crusader105Subtitle
US: "*We need more support! They're chewing us up!"
DE: "*We need more support! They're chewing us up!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Necesitamos más apoyo! ¡Nos están machacando!"
IT: "\nCi servono rinforzi! Ci stanno massacrando!"
KO: "도와주십시오! 적들이 우리를 전멸시키려고 합니다!"
ZH: "\n我們需要更多支援！他們快把我們炸爛了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03Crusader108Subtitle
US: "*Someone get those buggies off us!"
DE: "*Someone get those buggies off us!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Que alguien nos quite de encima esos buggies!"
IT: "\nQualcuno tolga di mezzo quelle buggy!"
KO: "누가 저 버기들좀 없애줘!"
ZH: "\n誰來幫我們幹掉這些火箭吉普車！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03Crusader304Subtitle
US: "*Enemy contacts confirmed! They're moving in fast!"
DE: "*Enemy contacts confirmed! They're moving in fast!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Confirmado contacto con el enemigo! ¡Se mueven rápido!"
IT: "\nContatto nemico confermato! Sono veloci!"
KO: "적들이 빠른 속도로 접근하고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n確認敵軍接觸！他們正快速移動中！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03Crusader307Subtitle
US: "*All units! Keep up the fire!"
DE: "*All units! Keep up the fire!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Todas las unidades! ¡Sigan disparando!"
IT: "\nA tutte le unità, continuate a sparare!"
KO: "전 유닛 사격 계속하라!"
ZH: "\n所有單位！繼續攻擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBrf01Subtitle
US: "*General, Col Burton and Black Lotus are in position and ready for your orders"
DE: "*General, Col Burton and Black Lotus are in position and ready for your orders"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el coronel Burton y Loto Negro están listos para recibir órdenes."
IT: "***"
KO: "장군님, 버튼 대령과 흑수선이 배치되었습니다. 명령만 내리십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，貝頓上校和黑蓮花已就位，並等候你下令。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBrf02Subtitle
US: "*Their primary objective is this secret laboratory. It's location was revealed by the documents captured during your last mission"
DE: "*Their primary objective is this secret laboratory. It's location was revealed by the documents captured during your last mission"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSu objetivo principal es el laboratorio secreto.\nLos documentos obtenidos en la última misión nos revelaron su ubicación"
IT: "***"
KO: "첫번째 목표는 비밀 연구소입니다. 지난번 임무에서 획득한 문서에 위치가 나와있습니다."
ZH: "\n這次的主要任務跟這個秘密實驗室有關。在你上次任務中所取得的文件，上面揭露了這個實驗室的位置。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBrf03Subtitle
US: "*The GLA are working on a new weapon of mass destruction. Black Lotus must download this data so we know how far along their research has come"
DE: "*The GLA are working on a new weapon of mass destruction. Black Lotus must download this data so we know how far along their research has come"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA trabaja en una nueva arma de destrucción masiva.\nLoto Negro debe averiguar cuál es el estado de sus investigaciones."
IT: "***"
KO: "\nGLA는 새로운 대량 살상 무기를 연구하고 있습니다. 흑수선을 보내 그 데이터를\n다운로드해서 연구 결과가 얼마나 진척되었는지 알아내야 합니다."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍正在研發一種新式的大規模毀滅性武器。因此，黑蓮花在此次任務中，必須下載這個資料，\n我們才能掌握敵軍目前的研發進度。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBrf04Subtitle
US: "*Once she has completed her download, Col Burton must bring the mountainside down on the lab and bury it forever"
DE: "*Once she has completed her download, Col Burton must bring the mountainside down on the lab and bury it forever"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDespués, el coronel Burton debe provocar un derrumbamiento de la ladera\nque entierre el laboratorio."
IT: "***"
KO: "다운로드가 완료되면 버튼 대령은 산사태를 일으켜서 연구실을 영원히 파묻어버릴 것입니다."
ZH: "\n一旦黑蓮花完成她的下載任務，貝頓上校必須將整個山腰剷平，永遠的埋了這間實驗室。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton01Subtitle
US: "*We're at the bridge. Lotus, take care of that Scorpion, I'll deal with the other guards"
DE: "*We're at the bridge. Lotus, take care of that Scorpion, I'll deal with the other guards"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEstamos en el puente. Loto, ocúpate de ese Scorpion y yo iré a por los otros guardias."
IT: "\nSiamo al ponte: Loto Nero, elimina quello Scorpion, io penserò alle altre guardie."
KO: "\n흑수선 응답하라. 우리는 다리에 있다. 스콜피온 탱크를 처리해주기 바란다.\n나는 다른 경비병들을 맡겠다."
ZH: "\n我們現在在橋上。黑蓮花，幹掉那些毒蠍團，我來解決其他的守衛。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton02Subtitle
US: "*That wasn't part of the plan, Lotus"
DE: "*That wasn't part of the plan, Lotus"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEso no era parte del plan, Loto."
IT: "\nQuesto non faceva parte del piano, Loto Nero."
KO: "이건 계획에 없었잖은가. 흑수선."
ZH: "\n那並不在計畫之中，黑蓮花"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton03Subtitle
US: "*You'll wait for me? All right, Lotus, let's race"
DE: "*You'll wait for me? All right, Lotus, let's race"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¿Me esperarás? Muy bien, Loto; a correr..."
IT: "\nMi aspetterai? E va bene, Loto Nero, facciamo una gara."
KO: "나를 기다렸나? 좋아, 달리자!"
ZH: "\n你會等我？好的，黑蓮花，咱們來比賽吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton04Subtitle
US: "*I'm on my way"
DE: "*I'm on my way"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nVoy de camino."
IT: "\nVado."
KO: "가는 중이다."
ZH: "\n我在路上了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton05Subtitle
US: "*All right, I see the POW camplooks like they have a Tunnel Network that passes under the river"
DE: "*All right, I see the POW camplooks like they have a Tunnel Network that passes under the river"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nVeo el campo de prisioneros... Parece que una red de túneles pasa bajo el río."
IT: "\nMolto bene, vedo il campo di prigionia. Sembra ci sia una\nRete di tunnel che passa sotto il fiume."
KO: "좋아, 저 포로 수용소는 강 밑을 지나가는 터널 네트워크가 있는 듯 하군."
ZH: "\n好的，我看到戰俘營了，他們似乎在河面下設有地道網路系統。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton06Subtitle
US: "*Nice work, LotusTunnels down herejust take care of a couple guards and I'll have everyone freed"
DE: "*Nice work, LotusTunnels down herejust take care of a couple guards and I'll have everyone freed"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuen trabajo, Loto... Los túneles bajan hasta aquí...\nEncárgate de un par de guardias y liberaré a todos."
IT: "\nBel lavoro, Loto Nero. Eliminiamo qualche guardia\ne i prigionieri saranno liberi."
KO: "훌륭하다, 흑수선. 터널들이 여기 있다. 경비병들을 처리하면 내가 포로들을 탈출시키겠네."
ZH: "\n幹得好，黑蓮花。地道系統就在下方，你只管解決幾個守衛，我會將每個人都救出來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton07Subtitle
US: "*Those vehicles would come in handy if the intel about the defenses around the mountains are correct. General, we ought to rescue them, too"
DE: "*Those vehicles would come in handy if the intel about the defenses around the mountains are correct. General, we ought to rescue them, too"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSi la información sobre las defensas que rodean las montañas es cierta,\nesos vehículos nos vendrían bien.\nTambién deberíamos rescatarlos."
IT: "\nQuei veicoli saranno molto utili, se i dati sulle difese della montagna sono esatti. Generale, dovremmo salvare anche loro."
KO: "\n산 주변의 방어 시설에 대한 정보가 맞다면, 저 차량들은 매우 유용할 것입니다,\n장군님. 그들을 구출해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n如果所得情報正確的話，這些載具應該可以派上用場來突出防線。將軍，我們一定要救出他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton08Subtitle
US: "*General, I'm in position near the second POW Campthere's a Tunnel Network and guards out front. I could slip past them into the compound if I climbed down the cliffs on the south end of the camp"
DE: "*General, I'm in position near the second POW Campthere's a Tunnel Network and guards out front. I could slip past them into the compound if I climbed down the cliffs on the south end of the camp"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, estoy cerca del segundo campo de prisioneros...\nHay una red de túneles y guardias delante.\nPodría colarme bajando por el barranco del extremo sur."
IT: "\nGenerale, sono nei pressi del secondo campo di prigionia: c'è una\nRete di tunnel, con alcune guardie. Potrei penetrare\nnel complesso, scendendo dai pendii."
KO: "\n장군님, 두번째 포로 수용소 가까이 있습니다. 터널 네트워크와 경비병들이 보이는데,\n수용소 남쪽 끝의 절벽을 타고 내려가면 그들을 피해 잠입할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我現在位於靠近第二個戰俘營的位置，前方有地道網路系統以及守衛。如果我從峭壁爬下至南邊\n盡頭的戰俘營，即可避開他們然後偷偷進入庭院。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton09Subtitle
US: "*Don't get cocky, Lotus, you haven't won this race yet"
DE: "*Don't get cocky, Lotus, you haven't won this race yet"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNo seas arrogante, Loto; aún no has ganado esta carrera"
IT: "\nNon cantare vittoria, Loto Nero, non è ancora finita."
KO: "너무 우쭐대지 말라구, 흑수선. 아직 이긴 게 아니야."
ZH: "\n不要太驕傲，黑蓮花，比賽還沒有結束"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton10Subtitle
US: "*That's the last of themsecond POW Camp is securedsomeone should tell Lotus to hurry upI don't want to be kept waiting at the Lab"
DE: "*That's the last of themsecond POW Camp is securedsomeone should tell Lotus to hurry upI don't want to be kept waiting at the Lab"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nÉse era el último. Segundo campo asegurado.\nQue Loto se dé prisa; no quiero esperar en el laboratorio."
IT: "\nQuello era l'ultimo: il secondo campo di prigionia è sicuro.\nQualcuno dovrebbe dire a Loto Nero di sbrigarsi,\nnon voglio aspettarla al laboratorio."
KO: "\n두번째 포로 수용소를 접수했다. 흑수선한테 좀 서두르라고 전해줘.\n연구소에 먼저 도착해서 기다리기는 싫은걸."
ZH: "\n那是最後一個了，第二個戰俘營已經攻下，快派人通知黑蓮花動作加快，我可不想一直在實驗室等待。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton11Subtitle
US: "*That's some new toy. General, if you focus it at those Tunnel Networks and Stinger Sites guarding the mountain, I'll slip right by them"
DE: "*That's some new toy. General, if you focus it at those Tunnel Networks and Stinger Sites guarding the mountain, I'll slip right by them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEse juguete es nuevo. Si lo concentras en los túneles y los emplazamientos\nStinger que protegen la montaña, los podré sortear."
IT: "\nEcco un nuovo giocattolo, generale: usatelo sulla Rete di tunnel\ne sulle Postazioni Stinger a guardia della montagna;\nin questo modo riuscirò a passare."
KO: "\n이 신무기를 사용할 기회입니다. 산을 방어하고 있는 터널 네트워크와 스팅어 사이트에\n사용하고 있는 동안 그 곳들을 몰래 지나가겠습니다."
ZH: "\n又在搞什麼新花樣。將軍，如果你可以護衛山區，集中火力在地道網路系統及針刺飛彈陣地，我便可趁\n機穿越他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton12Subtitle
US: "*Looks like a whole GLA base. Intel never said anything about this being here"
DE: "*Looks like a whole GLA base. Intel never said anthing about this being here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nParece una base completa del GLA. Inteligencia no nos informó de esto."
IT: "\nSembra un'altra base dell'ELG. Non sapevamo della sua presenza."
KO: "GLA 기지로군. 이 곳에 기지가 있다는 정보는 들어본 적이 없는데 말이야."
ZH: "\n看起來這是個完整的全球解放軍基地，情報上沒有提到這裡有這玩意兒。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton13Subtitle
US: "*Doesn't look like they were expecting mea little C4 here and there and I'll make short work of this placejust say the word, General"
DE: "*Doesn't look like they were expecting mea little C4 here and there and I'll make short work of this placejust say the word, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNo parece que me esperasen... Un poco de C4 y acabaré con el lugar...\nSólo necesito la orden, general."
IT: "\nPare che non aspettassero visite: un po' di C4\ne questo posto non sarà più un problema, generale."
KO: "\n놈들은 내가 여기 올 줄 몰랐겠지. 기지 여기 저기에 C4를 설치했습니다.\n명령만 내리십시오, 장군님."
ZH: "\n看起來他們不會發現我會在這些地方裝設 C4 炸彈，只要將軍一聲命下，我會迅速完成任務。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton14Subtitle
US: "*I should be safe moving through the villagejust need to watch out for any Radar Vans monitoring the area. Wish I had a couple Flash Bangs"
DE: "*I should be safe moving through the villagejust need to watch out for any Radar Vans monitoring the area. Wish I had a couple Flash Bangs"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDebería estar a salvo si me muevo por el pueblo y tengo cuidado con las furgonetas radar. Ojalá tuviese un par de granadas cegadoras."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n마을을 통과하는 것은 안전하겠지. 이 지역을 감시하는 레이더 밴만 조심하면 되겠어.\n섬광폭음탄이 좀 있으면 좋았을걸."
ZH: "\n穿過這個村莊應該沒有大礙，只要小心是否有雷達車在此防禦。真希望我有一些閃光彈。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton15Subtitle
US: "*This is it! I'm moving into position above the Labdon't keep me waiting Lotus, its cold up here"
DE: "*This is it! I'm moving into position above the Labdon't keep me waiting Lotus, its cold up here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Ya está! Me coloco en posición sobre el laboratorio... Loto, no me hagas esperar; aquí hace frío."
IT: "\nCi siamo, mi porto sopra il laboratorio. Non farmi aspettare, Loto Nero,\nsi gela quassù!"
KO: "좋았어! 지금 연구소 위쪽에 도착했다. 너무 오래 기다리게 하진 말게나, 흑수선.\n여긴 너무 추워."
ZH: "\n就是這裡！我會移動到實驗室的上方。黑蓮花，不要讓我等太久，這裡超冷的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton16Subtitle
US: "*Charges setsay when, Lotus"
DE: "*Charges setsay when, Lotus"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCargas colocadas... Cuando digas, Loto."
IT: "\nCariche pronte... Dimmi tu quando, Loto Nero."
KO: "폭약 장착 완료. 언제 터뜨릴지 말만 하라구, 흑수선."
ZH: "\n我來安置炸藥，你完成任務就說一聲，黑蓮花。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton17Subtitle
US: "*Well, Lotus, you're fastI'll give you that. I'll be there as soon as I can"
DE: "*Well, Lotus, you're fastI'll give you that. I'll be there as soon as I can"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEres rápida, Loto; lo reconozco. Estaré allí lo antes posible."
IT: "\nBeh, Loto Nero, sei veloce, te lo concedo. Arriverò il prima possibile."
KO: "음, 흑수선, 자네가 빠르니 이걸 자네에게 주겠네. 최대한 빨리 가도록 노력하지."
ZH: "\n好吧，黑蓮花，你如果夠快的話，我就照你說的做。我會盡快前往那裡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xBurton18Subtitle
US: "*AlrightI'm at the mountainTell me when your download finishes, Lotus, and I'll bury that lab where no one will ever find it again"
DE: "*AlrightI'm at the mountainTell me when your download finishes, Lotus, and I'll bury that lab where no one will ever find it again"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBueno; estoy en la montaña. Loto, avísame cuando tengas la información\ny enterraré el laboratorio."
IT: "\nBene, sono sulla montagna. Dimmi quando hai finito, Loto Nero, e raderò al suolo il laboratorio."
KO: "\n좋아, 나는 산에 있다. 다운로드가 끝나면 알려주게, 흑수선. 그 다음엔 이 연구소는\n영원히 묻혀버리겠지."
ZH: "\n好，我現在在山上。黑蓮花，當你下載完畢後跟我說一聲，我要埋了這個實驗室，就像不曾有過這個地\n方一樣。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xChat01Subtitle
US: "*Garrisoneat Flash Bang"
DE: "*Garrisoneat Flash Bang"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTropa... hay granada cegadora para comer"
IT: "\nGuarnigione eliminata."
KO: "이 섬광 폭음탄 맛좀 봐라!"
ZH: "\n餵你們吃閃光彈。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xChat02Subtitle
US: "*There they areremember, short controlled bursts"
DE: "*There they areremember, short controlled bursts"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAhí están... Recuerda: breves ráfagas controladas."
IT: "\nEccoli. Ricordate: raffiche brevi e mirate."
KO: "놈들이 저기 있다. 적에게 연사를 퍼붓도록."
ZH: "\n他們在那裡，記住了，快、狠、準。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xChat03Subtitle
US: "*Infantry? No problem"
DE: "*Infantry? No problem"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¿Infantería? No hay problema."
IT: "\nFanteria? Nessun problema."
KO: "보병? 문제 없지."
ZH: "\n步兵？沒問題。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xChat04Subtitle
US: "*We're taking firewe need some support here!"
DE: "*We're taking firewe need some support here!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNos atacan... ¡Necesitamos apoyo!"
IT: "\nCi sparano contro, abbiamo bisogno di aiuto!"
KO: "공격당하고 있다! 지원이 필요하다!"
ZH: "\n我們遭受砲火攻擊，這裡需要支援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xCin01Subtitle
US: "*This is Spirit, I am rolling in over the target area"
DE: "*This is Spirit, I am rolling in over the target area"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAquí Spirit, llegando al área objetivo..."
IT: "\nQui Spirit, mi porto sull'area del bersaglio."
KO: "스피릿입니다. 목표 지점에 접근중입니다."
ZH: "\n這裡是聖靈，我已進入目標區域。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xCin02Subtitle
US: "*Roger, Spirit, mission is go. You ready to do this?"
DE: "*Roger, Spirit, mission is go. You ready to do this?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecibido, Spirit; misión confirmada. ¿Listo para hacerlo?"
IT: "\nRicevuto, Spirit, missione confermata. Sei pronto?"
KO: "알았다, 스피릿. 임무 개시하라. 준비 됐나?"
ZH: "\n收到，聖靈。任務開始，準備好了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xCin03Subtitle
US: "*Yes, Colonel, let us begin"
DE: "*Yes, Colonel, let us begin"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSí, coronel; comencemos."
IT: "\nSì, colonnello, diamoci da fare."
KO: "네, 대령님. 시작하겠습니다."
ZH: "\n是的，上校。讓我們開始吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xCin04Subtitle
US: "*This is Spirit, bomb bay doors open bombs are away"
DE: "*This is Spirit, bomb bay doors open bombs are away"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAquí Spirit; compartimento de bombas abierto... Bombas fuera"
IT: "\nQui Spirit, scomparto bombe aperto, bombe sganciate."
KO: "폭탄 투하구 개방, 폭탄 투하 완료!"
ZH: "\n這裡是聖靈，炸彈艙門已開啟，發射。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xCin05Subtitle
US: "*Spirit to Infiltrator, your LZ is clearGood Luck"
DE: "*Spirit to Infiltrator, your LZ is clearGood Luck"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSpirit a Infiltrator; tu zona de aterrizaje está despejada... Suerte"
IT: "\nSpirit a infiltrato, la zona d'atterraggio è libera."
KO: "스피릿이 침투조에 알린다. 착륙 지점은 안전하다. 행운을 빈다."
ZH: "\n聖靈呼叫滲透者，你的降落區安全了，祝你好運。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xCin06Subtitle
US: "*Roger, Spirit, nice shooting"
DE: "*Roger, Spirit, nice shooting"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecibido, Spirit; buen disparo"
IT: "\nRicevuto, Spirit. Bel colpo."
KO: "알았다, 스피릿. 훌륭한 폭격이었다."
ZH: "\n收到，聖靈，射得真準！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xCin07Subtitle
US: "*On stationeverybody out who's staying"
DE: "*On stationeverybody out who's staying"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nA sus puestos... Que salgan los que queden"
IT: "\nTutti fuori, presto."
KO: "모두 출발한다!"
ZH: "\n每個人撤出崗位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xCin08Subtitle
US: "*Thanks for the lift boyssee you soon"
DE: "*Thanks for the lift boyssee you soon"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGracias, chicos... Hasta pronto..."
IT: "\nGrazie per il passaggio ragazzi, a presto."
KO: "태워줘서 고맙네. 또 보자구."
ZH: "\n謝謝你的幫忙，我們下次見。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xCin09Subtitle
US: "*Your small Chinooks are efficientbut I prefer the strength of our Helixes..."
DE: "*Your small Chinooks are efficientbut I prefer the strength of our Helixes..."
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSus pequeños Chinook son eficientes...\npero prefiero el poderío de nuestros Helix..."
IT: "\nI piccoli Chinook sono efficienti, ma io preferisco gli Helix..."
KO: "자네들의 치누크는 참 유용하지만, 난 우리 헬릭스의 파워가 더 맘에 든다네."
ZH: "\n你的運輸直昇機很有效率，但我還是偏愛我們螺旋直昇機的威力…"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xDrvr01Subtitle
US: "*We're free! Everyone to your vehicles!"
DE: "*We're free! Everyone to your vehicles!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Somos libres! ¡Todo el mundo a los vehículos!"
IT: "\nSiamo liberi! Tutti ai veicoli!"
KO: "풀려났다! 차량에 탑승하자!"
ZH: "\n我們自由了！每個人快上車！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xDrvr02Subtitle
US: "*Thanks, General. We're at your command"
DE: "*Thanks, General. We're at your command"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGracias, general. Esperamos órdenes."
IT: "\nGrazie, generale: siamo ai vostri ordini."
KO: "감사합니다, 장군님. 명령만 내려주십시오."
ZH: "\n謝了，將軍，我們等候你的命令。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva01Subtitle
US: "*General, your first objective is the destruction of this bridge. Its destruction will cut off GLA reinforcements from the other side of the river"
DE: "*General, your first objective is the destruction of this bridge. Its destruction will cut off GLA reinforcements from the other side of the river"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el primer objetivo es destruir este puente. Eso impedirá el paso de refuerzos del GLA desde el otro lado del río."
IT: "\nGenerale, dovete distruggere questo ponte: così i rinforzi dell'ELG non potranno attraversare il fiume."
KO: "\n장군님, 첫번째 목표는 이 다리를 파괴하는 것입니다. 그러면 강 저편으로 GLA의 지원군이\n합류하는 것을 막을 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，你的第一個任務是要摧毀這座橋。如此一來便能截斷全球解放軍從河的另一邊所派來的援軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva02Subtitle
US: "*General, GLA reinforcements have been sighted crossing the bridge"
DE: "*General, GLA reinforcements have been sighted crossing the bridge"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, se han divisado refuerzos del GLA cruzando el puente."
IT: "\nGenerale, rinforzi ELG stanno attraversando il ponte."
KO: "장군님, GLA의 지원군이 다리를 건너는 것이 목격되었습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們發現全球解放軍的援軍正越過橋頭。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva03Subtitle
US: "*Another GLA squad has entered the area, General. Perhaps we should take care of that bridge now?"
DE: "*Another GLA squad has entered the area, General. Perhaps we should take care of that bridge now?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nOtra patrulla del GLA ha entrado en el área, general. Tal vez sea el momento de ocuparnos de ese puente."
IT: "\nUn'altra squadra dell'ELG è arrivata in zona. Forse è il momento di occuparsi di quel ponte, generale?"
KO: "또 다른 GLA 부대가 이 지역에 나타났습니다. 이제 다리를 처리할 때가 되지 않았습니까?"
ZH: "\n又一個全球解放軍小隊進入此區，將軍。或許該是炸毀這座橋的時候了？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva04Subtitle
US: "*General, it appears that there are several GLA Radar Vans in the area, if your forces get to close, they will be detected"
DE: "*General, it appears that there are several GLA Radar Vans in the area, if your forces get to close, they will be detected"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, parece que hay varias furgonetas radar del GLA en el área;\nsi las fuerzas se acercan mucho, las detectarán."
IT: "\nGenerale, ci sono numerosi Furgoni radar dell'ELG in zona:\nscopriranno le vostre forze!"
KO: "\n장군님, 이 지역에 GLA 레이더 밴이 몇 대 있습니다. 가까이 접근하면 우리 부대를\n탐지해낼 것입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，看樣子此區有數輛雷達車駐守，如果你的部隊太過靠近，將會被偵測到行蹤。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva05Subtitle
US: "*Excellent job, General. Now you only need to worry about GLA forces on this side of the river"
DE: "*Excellent job, General. Now you only need to worry about GLA forces on this side of the river"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nExcelente trabajo, general. Ahora sólo hay que preocuparse de las fuerzas del GLA de este lado del río"
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, generale, ora non restano che le forze dell'ELG su questa sponda del fiume."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 이제 강 이쪽 편의 GLA 병력만 신경쓰면 됩니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍。現在你只需要擔心河這一面的全球解放軍了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva06Subtitle
US: "*The GLA have a POW camp along the route Col Burton must take to the GLA Lab. If you free the men held there, Col Burton will have an easier time getting to the Lab"
DE: "*The GLA have a POW camp along the route Col Burton must take to the GLA Lab. If you free the men held there, Col Burton will have an easier time getting to the Lab"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa ruta del coronel Burton hacia el laboratorio del GLA pasa por un campo de prisioneros. Si liberas a los allí retenidos, el coronel Burton llegará más fácilmente al laboratorio."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n버튼 대령이 GLA 연구소로 가는 길을 따라 포로 수용소들이 있습니다. 그 곳의 포로들을\n풀어주면 버튼 대령은 더욱 쉽게 연구소로 갈 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n沿著貝頓上校前往實驗室的路途中，你會看到一個全球解放軍的戰俘營。如果你救出被囚禁的人，貝頓\n上校將可有更充裕的時間到達實驗室。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva07Subtitle
US: "*General, intel suggests you free the men at the POW camp before you send Col Burton too far away"
DE: "*General, intel suggests you free the men at the POW camp before you send Col Burton too far away"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, inteligencia sugiere que liberes a los prisioneros antes de enviar demasiado lejos al coronel Burton."
IT: "\nGenerale, dovreste liberare i prigionieri prima di far procedere oltre il Colonnello Burton."
KO: "장군님, 버튼 대령이 더 나아가기 전에 포로 수용소의 포로들을 풀어주시기를 권합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，有情報建議在貝頓上校離開太遠之前，先拯救戰俘營裡的戰俘。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva08Subtitle
US: "*Congratulations, General, I'm sure the families of those men will be happy to hear they've been rescued"
DE: "*Congratulations, General, I'm sure the families of those men will be happy to hear they've been rescued"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nFelicidades, general; las familias de esos hombres\nse alegrarán de su liberación."
IT: "\nCongratulazioni, generale, le famiglie dei prigionieri vi saranno\neternamente grate."
KO: "축하합니다, 장군님. 풀려난 포로들의 가족들이 매우 기뻐할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n恭喜你，將軍。我相信這些戰俘的家人，一定相當樂於聽到他們獲得解救的消息。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva09Subtitle
US: "*General, the GLA's Lab is directly north of your current position. There are a number of GLA defenses still along your routebe careful"
DE: "*General, the GLA's Lab is directly north of your current position. There are a number of GLA defenses still along your routebe careful"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el laboratorio del GLA está justo al norte de su posición. Aún quedan defensas del GLA en su camino... Cuidado."
IT: "\nGenerale, il laboratorio dell'ELG è a nord della posizione attuale: ci sono diverse difese ancora attive, fate attenzione."
KO: "\n장군님, GLA의 연구소는 현 위치에서 정북 방향에 있습니다. 그곳에 도달하는 도중\n상당수의 GLA 병사들을 만날 것입니다. 조심하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，實驗室就在你現在位置的正北方。沿路上有為數不少的全球解放軍建立的防線，小心一點。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva10Subtitle
US: "*It appears that those Oil Derricks are the only source of income for the GLA base. If you can destroy them you will cripple the GLA here"
DE: "*It appears that those Oil Derricks are the only source of income for the GLA base. If you can destroy them you will cripple the GLA here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nParece que esas torres de perforación son la única fuente de ingresos de la\nbase del GLA. Si las destruyes, el GLA saldrá muy perjudicado."
IT: "\nPare che quei Derrick siano gli unici rifornimenti della base dell'ELG:\ndistruggeteli e per il nemico non ci sarà via di scampo."
KO: "\n원유 유정탑이 GLA 기지의 유일한 자금 수입원인 것 같습니다. 그것을 파괴할 수만 있다면\nGLA를 무력화 시킬 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n由此看來，那些油井是全球解放軍基地唯一的資源收入。如果你能摧毀它們，將可癱瘓他們的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva11Subtitle
US: "*General, I'm patching through Black Lotus"
DE: "*General, I'm patching through Black Lotus"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, estoy conectando con Loto Negro."
IT: "\nGenerale, sto preparando Loto Nero."
KO: "장군님, 흑수선을 연결하겠습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我會幫助黑蓮花的"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva12Subtitle
US: "*General, the men you just rescued are driving our newest vehicle, the Microwave Tank"
DE: "*General, the men you just rescued are driving our newest vehicle, the Microwave Tank"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, los recién rescatados conducen nuestro nuevo vehículo: el tanque de microondas."
IT: "\nGenerale, gli uomini che avete salvato dispongono di un nuovo veicolo, il Carro a microonde."
KO: "장군님, 방금 구출한 병사가 우리의 신형 무기인 초단파 탱크를 조종하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，你剛才解救的人。正是我方最新載具的駕駛 - 微波坦克。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva13Subtitle
US: "*This vehicle has two modes: The first generates a continuous microwave field in front of the vehicle - very lethal to all infantry. The second allows it to disrupt the functions of any targeted building"
DE: "*This vehicle has two modes: The first generates a continuous microwave field in front of the vehicle - very lethal to all infantry. The second allows it to disrupt the functions of any targeted building"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEste vehículo tiene dos modos:\nuno genera delante un campo de microondas continuo, letal para la infantería;\notro permite alterar las funciones de un edificio objetivo."
IT: "\nQuesto veicolo ha due modalità d'uso: la prima genera un campo\ndi microonde letale per la fanteria, la seconda\npermette di distruggere qualsiasi edificio."
KO: "\n이 차량은 두 가지 모드가 있습니다: 첫번째는 지속적인 초단파 장을 차량 앞에 생성하는데,\n이는 모든 보병에 치명적입니다. 두번째는 조준된 건물들의 기능을 마비시키는 것입니다."
ZH: "\n此載具擁有兩種類型：一種從載具的前方會產生持續性的微波，對步兵有致命的殺傷力。第二種則可使\n得任何鎖定中的建築全面癱瘓。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva14Subtitle
US: "*General, the GLA know we are here and appear to be on heightened alert. Be careful when moving Col Burton into position above their Secret Lab"
DE: "*General, the GLA know we are here and appear to be on heightened alert. Be careful when moving Col Burton into position above their Secret Lab"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el GLA sabe que estamos aquí y parece estar en estado de alerta.\nCuidado al situar al coronel Burton sobre su laboratorio secreto."
IT: "\nGenerale, l'ELG sa che siamo qui e pare che sia in stato di allarme.\nFate attenzione mentre conducete il Colonnello Burton\nal laboratorio."
KO: "\n장군님, GLA는 우리의 존재를 알아차리고 경계를 강화했습니다. 버튼 대령을 비밀 연구소\n위쪽으로 움직일 때 특히 조심하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍知道我們在此，因此大為提高警戒。當移動貝頓上校到秘密實驗室之上時，要特別\n留意。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva15Subtitle
US: "*General, the GLA have upgraded their tank shells to contain poisons. Be careful."
DE: "*General, the GLA have upgraded their tank shells to contain poisons. Be careful."
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el GLA ha mejorado sus proyectiles de tanque para que contengan veneno. Cuidado."
IT: "\nGenerale, i proiettili dei carri dell'ELG ora contengono del veleno: fate attenzione."
KO: "장군님, GLA는 독소 탱크 포탄으로 업그레이드 했습니다. 조심하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，全球解放軍已經升級坦克砲彈為含毒武器，小心。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva16Subtitle
US: "*I'm showing a GLA patrol in that village, Generalas well as a number of enemy forces garrisoned throughout the village"
DE: "*I'm showing a GLA patrol in that village, Generalas well as a number of enemy forces garrisoned throughout the village"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDetecto una patrulla del GLA en ese pueblo, general, y fuerzas enemigas repartidas por la población."
IT: "\nIn quel villaggio c'è una pattuglia dell'ELG, oltre a diverse truppe di presidio."
KO: "마을에는 건물에 주둔한 병력 외에도 병사들이 정찰을 계속 하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，不只有一支全球解放軍的巡邏隊在村莊，還有很多部隊駐守在各個角落。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva17Subtitle
US: "*Maybe Black Lotus can find out more Intel about who is behind the GLA WMD program"
DE: "*Maybe Black Lotus can find out more Intel about who is behind the GLA WMD program"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLoto Negro podría averiguar quién está tras el programa de armas de destrucción masiva del GLA."
IT: "\nForse Loto Nero potrà scoprire chi si nasconde dietro le armi di distruzione di massa dell'ELG."
KO: "\n아마 흑수선은 GLA의 대량 살상 무기 계획의 배후에 누가 있는지에 대한 더 많은 정보를\n얻을 수 있을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n或許黑蓮花可以查出誰是主導大規模毀滅性武器的幕後黑手。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xEva18Subtitle
US: "*That was incredible General. Looks like the GLA won't be using that facility anymoreand it seems Black Lotus downloaded some vital info about the source of this lab. For now, let's regroup and see what she was able to find out. Great work"
DE: "*That was incredible General. Looks like the GLA won't be using that facility anymoreand it seems Black Lotus downloaded some vital info about the source of this lab. For now, let's regroup and see what she was able to find out. Great work"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHa sido increíble, general. El GLA ya no usará esas instalaciones... y, según parece, Loto Negro ha obtenido información vital referente al origen del laboratorio. Por ahora, reagrupémonos y veamos qué ha averiguado. Buen trabajo"
IT: "\nFantastico: quella struttura non servirà mai più la causa dell'ELG."
KO: "\n훌륭합니다. GLA는 그 시설을 더 이상 사용할 수 없을 것입니다. 흑수선은 이 연구소의\n배후에 대한 중요한 정보를 얻었습니다. 일단 재편성한 뒤 정보를 확인합시다."
ZH: "\n真是太棒了，將軍，看來全球解放軍無法再使用實驗室進行任何武器研發，黑蓮花也已成功下載了其中\n重要的資訊。現在，讓我們重新組合看看她能理出什麼頭緒。做得太好了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus01Subtitle
US: "*The scorpion is disabledI will take care of matters across the river. Wait until I am across and then destroy the bridge"
DE: "*The scorpion is disabledI will take care of matters across the river. Wait until I am across and then destroy the bridge"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Scorpion está desactivado... Me ocuparé del otro lado del río. Espera hasta que cruce y después destruye el puente."
IT: "\nLo Scorpion è disattivato! Mi occuperò dei problemi al di là del fiume: aspettate che sia passato e poi distruggete il ponte."
KO: "\n스콜피온 탱크를 무력화시켰어요. 강 건너 문제는 내가 처리할테니 내가 강을 건너\n다리를 파괴할 때까지 기다려요."
ZH: "\n毒蠍團已經不成威脅了，我渡河之後會解決掉那些傢伙。等我過去以後便摧毀這座橋。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus02Subtitle
US: "*It is now. Don't worry, I'll wait for you at the labdo hurry"
DE: "*It is now. Don't worry, I'll wait for you at the labdo hurry"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAhora. No te preocupes: esperaré en el laboratorio... Deprisa."
IT: "\nAdesso. Non ti preoccupare, ti aspetterò al laboratorio. Fai presto."
KO: "지금이다. 걱정 말아요. 내가 연구소에서 기다리고 있을테니. 서두르시죠."
ZH: "\n就是現在，不用擔心，我會在實驗室等你，動作快。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus03Subtitle
US: "*General, I am in a position to help free your forces held prisoner. Perhaps Col. Burton would like to help?"
DE: "*General, I am in a position to help free your forces held prisoner. Perhaps Col. Burton would like to help?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, estoy en disposición de ayudar a liberar a las fuerzas apresadas.\nTal vez el coronel Burton quiera colaborar."
IT: "\nGenerale, sono in posizione e posso liberare i prigionieri.\nForse il Colonnello Burton potrebbe darci una mano?"
KO: "\n장군님, 포로들을 풀어줄 준비가 되었습니다.\n버튼 대령도 역시 도울 준비가 되어있는 듯 하군요."
ZH: "\n將軍，我已準備好幫助你解救戰俘，或許貝頓上校願意幫忙？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus04Subtitle
US: "*General, could you ask Col Burton to please hurry to the POW campI'm tired of waiting on him"
DE: "*General, could you ask Col Burton to please hurry to the POW campI'm tired of waiting on him"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, hay que pedir al coronel Burton que venga enseguida\nal campo de prisioneros... Me he cansado de esperarle."
IT: "\nGenerale, potete dire al Colonnello Burton di raggiungere il campo di prigionia? Sono stanco di aspettarlo."
KO: "장군님, 버튼 대령에게 포로수용소로 빨리 좀 오라고 명령하시겠습니까? 기다리다 지쳤습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，可否麻煩你請貝頓上校盡快到達戰俘營，我已經受夠了這樣一直等下去。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus05Subtitle
US: "*I will draw the camp guards attention to this side of the river. That should let you and your pet robots handle the Tunnel and free your captured men"
DE: "*I will draw the camp guards attention to this side of the river. That should let you and your pet robots handle the Tunnel and free your captured men"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAtraeré la atención de los guardias hacia este lado del río.\nAsí, tú y tus robots mascota podréis usar el túnel y liberar a tus hombres."
IT: "\nAttirerò le guardie su questo lato del fiume: in questo\nmodo potrai ripulire il tunnel e liberare i prigionieri."
KO: "\n내가 경비병들의 주의를 강의 이쪽 편으로 끌을테니 당신 부대는 터널을 맡고\n포로를 구출하세요."
ZH: "\n我會把守衛的注意力引到河的這邊，這樣可以讓你和你的機器寵物搞定地道網路系統，並救出戰俘。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus06Subtitle
US: "*Generalmy forces are moving on the final GLA positions this side of the river. Please inform Col Burton that he should hurryI would prefer not to wait too long for him to catch up"
DE: "*Generalmy forces are moving on the final GLA positions this side of the river. Please inform Col Burton that he should hurryI would prefer not to wait too long for him to catch up"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, mis fuerzas están alcanzando las últimas posiciones del GLA a este lado del río.\nDile al coronel Burton que debe darse prisa... No quiero tener que esperarle."
IT: "\nGenerale, le mie forze sono dirette contro le ultime postazioni ELG su\nquesto lato del fiume: dite al Colonnello Burton\ndi darsi una mossa!"
KO: "\n장군님, 병력이 강 이쪽의 마지막 GLA 거점으로 이동중입니다. 버튼 대령에게 서두르라고\n전해주십시오! 너무 오래 기다리기는 싫습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我的部隊將繼續前往河這一面的全球解放軍基地。請你代為轉達請貝頓上校動作加快，我比較傾\n向於不要花太多時間於等待。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus07Subtitle
US: "*Please inform Col Burton that I shall be waiting for HIM at the Lab"
DE: "*Please inform Col Burton that I shall be waiting for HIM at the Lab"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDile al coronel Burton que le espero en el laboratorio."
IT: "\nInformate il Colonnello Burton che lo aspetterò al laboratorio."
KO: "버튼 대령에게 잠시 후에는 내가 연구소에 먼저 가서 기다릴 거라고 전해주십시오."
ZH: "\n請告訴貝頓上校，我會在實驗室等「他」。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus08Subtitle
US: "*I'm here, Colonelyou win. The GLA put up a stronger fight than I had anticipated. Beginning download"
DE: "*I'm here, Colonelyou win. The GLA put up a stronger fight than I had anticipated. Beginning download"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEstoy aquí... Tú ganas. El GLA se ha resistido más de lo esperado. Iniciando descarga de datos."
IT: "\nSono qui, colonnello. L'ELG si è rivelato più resistente del previsto.\nInizio a scaricare i dati."
KO: "대령, 난 여기 있어요. 당신이 이겼군요. 내 예상보다 GLA의 경계가 두터웠죠.\n다운로드를 시작합니다."
ZH: "\n我在這裡，上校，你贏了。全球解放軍佈下的防線比我預期中的要嚴密，開始下載檔案。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus09Subtitle
US: "*I have the data! Now, Colonel!"
DE: "*I have the data! Now, Colonel!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Tengo la información! ¡Ahora, coronel!"
IT: "\nHo i dati! Adesso, colonnello!"
KO: "데이터를 확보했어요, 대령!"
ZH: "\n下載完成！走吧，上校！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus10Subtitle
US: "*General. I am ready and waiting at the Labwhenever the Colonel would like to arrive and finish this mission"
DE: "*General. I am ready and waiting at the Labwhenever the Colonel would like to arrive and finish this mission"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, estoy esperando en el laboratorio a que llegue el coronel y complete la misión."
IT: "\nGenerale, sono in attesa al laboratorio: quando arriverà il colonnello, potremo portare a termine la missione."
KO: "장군님, 연구소에서 기다리고 있습니다. 대령이 도착하자 마자 이 임무를 끝내도록 하겠습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，不管貝頓上校何時會到達並完成任務，我都將在實驗室和他會合。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus11Subtitle
US: "*It is cold out here. You are coming aren't you Burton?"
DE: "*It is cold out here. You are coming aren't you Burton?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAquí hace frío. ¿Vas a venir o no, Burton?"
IT: "\nQui fa freddo. Dove sei finito, Burton?"
KO: "여긴 너무 추운걸. 버튼 대령, 오기는 오는 거예요?"
ZH: "\n這裡好冷喔，你也會一起來吧，貝頓？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xLotus12Subtitle
US: "*Downloading the information now"
DE: "*Downloading the information now"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDescargando información."
IT: "\nScarico le informazioni."
KO: "지금 정보를 다운로드하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n現在下載資料。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xRngr01Subtitle
US: "*Thanks for the rescue, Sir"
DE: "*Thanks for the rescue, Sir"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGracias por el rescate, señor."
IT: "\nGrazie per il salvataggio, signore."
KO: "구해주셔서 고맙습니다!"
ZH: "\n謝謝你的解救，長官。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xRngr02Subtitle
US: "*A couple of our men broke off to check out the village east of here before we were captured. They may still be over there"
DE: "*A couple of our men broke off to check out the village east of here before we were captured. They may still be over there"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAntes de ser capturados, 2 de los hombres se separaron para explorar el pueblo al este.\nQuizá sigan allí."
IT: "\nUn paio dei nostri sono andati a controllare il villaggio a est,\nprima della nostra cattura. Potrebbero essere\nancora là."
KO: "\n우리가 잡히기 직전에 우리 중 두어명이 여기서 동쪽에 있는 마을을 확인하러 갔습니다.\n아마 그 곳에 아직 있을 겁니다."
ZH: "\n在我們被俘虜之前，我們有幾個弟兄分頭從東邊進入村莊查探狀況，他們應該還在那裡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xRngr03Subtitle
US: "*Good to see you, General, we thought we were going to end up captured"
DE: "*Good to see you, General, we thought we were going to end up captured"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNos alegramos de verle, general; creíamos que al final nos capturarían."
IT: "\nMeno male che siete arrivato, generale, temevo che ci avrebbero catturato."
KO: "만나서 반갑습니다, 장군님! 포로로 잡힐 줄로만 알고 있었습니다."
ZH: "\n真高興見到你，將軍。我們原以為是死路一條了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xRngr04Subtitle
US: "*The rest of our team was captured just after we got to the village. General, we'd like to volunteer to rescue them"
DE: "*The rest of our team was captured just after we got to the village. General, we'd like to volunteer to rescue them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCapturaron al resto del equipo después de llegar al pueblo.\nGeneral, nos ofrecemos voluntarios para rescatarlos."
IT: "\nIl resto della squadra è stato catturato subito dopo che siamo arrivati al villaggio. Ci offriamo volontari per liberarli."
KO: "우리가 마을로 들어가자 마자 나머지 우리 팀원들이 잡혔습니다. 그들을 구출해내고 싶습니다."
ZH: "\n在我們進入村莊之後，此地剩餘的弟兄被俘虜了。將軍，我們自願前往拯救他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA03xRngr05Subtitle
US: "*General, a squad of vehicles was captured just after we were taken. The GLA are holding them in a camp just north of here"
DE: "*General, a squad of vehicles was captured just after we were taken. The GLA are holding them in a camp just north of here"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, tras apresarnos fue capturada una patrulla de vehículos.\nEl GLA los tiene en un campo al norte de este lugar."
IT: "\nGenerale, un gruppo di veicoli è stato catturato subito dopo di noi: l'ELG li tiene in un campo appena più a nord."
KO: "\n장군님, 우리가 잡히기 직전에 우리 차량 몇 대가 적에게 포획되었습니다.\nGLA는 이 곳의 북쪽에 있는 기지에 그 차량들을 놔뒀습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，在我們被俘虜之後，有一組載具被佔領了。全球解放軍將其扣留在這裡以北的戰俘營裡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04Eva02Subtitle
US: "*Reinforcements arrived"
DE: "*Reinforcements arrived"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHan llegado refuerzos."
IT: "\nI rinforzi sono arrivati."
KO: "지원군이 도착했습니다."
ZH: "\n援軍抵達。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04Eva07Subtitle
US: "*We need to clear out these Stinger Sites before we can bring in our bombers to clear the GLA from the area"
DE: "*We need to clear out these Stinger Sites before we can bring in our bombers to clear the GLA from the area"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTenemos que eliminar los emplazamientos Stinger antes de poder traer\nlos bombarderos y barrer al GLA de la zona."
IT: "\nDobbiamo distruggere le Postazioni Stinger prima\nche i nostri bombardieri possano spazzare via l'ELG."
KO: "이 지역에서 GLA를 몰아낼 폭격기를 요청하기 전에 우선 이 스팅어 사이트들을\n파괴해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n在我們派遣轟炸機將此區的全球解放軍炸光之前，必須先肅清針刺飛彈陣地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04Eva08Subtitle
US: "*Construction crews have arrived sir. You'll need to get our base setup before we're overrun by the GLA"
DE: "*Construction crews have arrived sir. You'll need to get our base setup before we're overrun by the GLA"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHan llegado pelotones de construcción, señor. Hay que levantar nuestra base antes de que el GLA nos invada."
IT: "\nGli addetti alla costruzione sono arrivati, generale: organizzate la base, prima che l'ELG ci distrugga."
KO: "건설 요원들이 도착했습니다. GLA가 쳐들어오기 전에 기지를 건설하십시오."
ZH: "\n建造小組已經抵達，長官。在尚未被全球解放軍擊潰之前，你必須盡快建立基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04Eva09Subtitle
US: "*Our final objective is this GLA base here, in the hills. Take it out, and the operation is complete"
DE: "*Our final objective is this GLA base here, in the hills. Take it out, and the operation is complete"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl objetivo final es la base del GLA en las colinas. Tras destruirla, la misión estará cumplida."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n우리의 마지막 목표는 바로 이 곳 언덕에 있는 GLA 기지입니다.\n이 기지를 파괴하면 임무가 완료됩니다."
ZH: "\n我們最終的目標就是摧毀在山上的 - 全球解放軍基地。如此一來，任務即可完成。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04Officer03Subtitle
US: "*Terrorists detected. All units be on the alert"
DE: "*Terrorists detected. All units be on the alert"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTerroristas detectados. A todas las unidades: alerta."
IT: "\nRilevata la presenza di terroristi. Massima allerta."
KO: "테러리스트들이 탐지되었습니다. 경계하십시오."
ZH: "\n偵測到恐怖份子，所有單位提高警覺。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04Ranger01Subtitle
US: "*Calling in GLA bunker location at grid square Beta Charlie 6-8-9er-4-4"
DE: "*Calling in GLA bunker location at grid square Beta Charlie 6-8-9er-4-4"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLocalización de búnker GLA en coordenadas Beta Charlie 6-8-9er-4-4."
IT: "\nPosizione bunker ELG nella griglia Beta Charlie 6-8-9-4-4."
KO: "GLA 벙커는 지도 기준선 찰리 6-8-9er-4-4 에 위치합니다."
ZH: "\nBC 6-8-93er-4-4 小隊回報全球解放軍碉堡座標位置。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04Transport01Subtitle
US: "*Transport teams 1 and 2 approaching the landing zone"
DE: "*Transport teams 1 and 2 approaching the landing zone"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEquipos de transporte 1 y 2 aproximándose a zona de aterrizaje."
IT: "\nSquadre da trasporto 1 e 2 in avvicinamento alla zona di atterraggio."
KO: "현재 이동중인 팀 1과 팀 2, 착륙 지점에 접근중."
ZH: "\n運輸機第一、二小隊正接近降落區。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04Transport03Subtitle
US: "*Transport Team 1 reporting! Mission completed! I'm pulling out!"
DE: "*Transport Team 1 reporting! Mission completed! I'm pulling out!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Equipo de transporte 1 informando! ¡Misión cumplida! ¡Me retiro!"
IT: "\nSquadra da trasporto 1 a rapporto: missione compiuta! Me ne vado!"
KO: "이동중인 팀 1이 보고합니다! 임무를 완수했습니다! 철수하겠습니다!"
ZH: "\n運輸機第一小隊報告！任務完成，正撤離中！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xBrf01Subtitle
US: "*General, intelligence reports that the rogue forces behind this GLA splinter cell are commanded by Dr. Thrax"
DE: "*General, intelligence reports that the rogue forces behind this GLA splinter cell are commanded by Dr. Thrax"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, inteligencia señala que las fuerzas detrás de la célula escindida están bajo el mando del Dr. Thrax."
IT: "\nGenerale, le forze dell'ELG sono agli ordini del Dott. Thrax."
KO: "\n장군님, 정보 보고에 따르면 GLA의 점조직 배후의 세력은 스랙스 박사에 의해\n조종되고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，情報顯示在全球解放軍分裂派系背後的兇殘部隊，是由崔克斯博士所領導。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xBrf02Subtitle
US: "*Dr. Thrax is a wanted criminalresponsible for notorious terror crimes against the US military. He must be brought to justice"
DE: "*Dr. Thrax is a wanted criminalresponsible for notorious terror crimes against the US military. He must be brought to justice"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Dr. Thrax es un criminal muy buscado... por actos terroristas contra el ejército de EE.UU. Debe responder ante la justicia."
IT: "\nIl Dott. Thrax è un criminale responsabile di gravi attentati contro le forze militari USA. Dev'essere consegnato alla giustizia."
KO: "\n스랙스 박사는 미국군에 대한 테러를 지휘한 혐의로 수배중인 범죄자입니다.\n그는 정의의 심판을 받아야 합니다."
ZH: "\n崔克斯博士是被通緝的罪犯，他專門製造惡名昭彰的恐怖犯罪以對抗美國軍方。他必須接受法律的制裁。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xBrf03Subtitle
US: "*Dr. Thrax was developing a brand new toxin at his secret mountain lab. Thank goodness Lotus and Burton were there to stop him"
DE: "*Dr. Thrax was developing a brand new toxin at his secret mountain lab. Thank goodness Lotus and Burton were there to stop him"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Dr. Thrax desarrollaba una nueva toxina en su laboratorio secreto de la montaña. Gracias a Dios que Loto y Burton le detuvieron."
IT: "\nIl Dott. Thrax stava sviluppando una nuova tossina, nel laboratorio segreto: per fortuna Loto Nero e Burton lo hanno fermato."
KO: "\n스랙스 박사는 산 속의 연구소에서 새로운 독소를 개발 중에 있습니다.\n다행히도 흑수선과 버튼 대령이 그를 막기 위해 그 곳으로 파견되었습니다."
ZH: "\n崔克斯博士曾在秘密實驗室研發一種全新的毒素，好在黑蓮花及貝頓上校及時阻止他。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xBrf04Subtitle
US: "*Dr. Thrax is receiving his funding from his oil fields. We must cut off his flow of oil"
DE: "*Dr. Thrax is receiving his funding from his oil fields. We must cut off his flow of oil"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Dr. Thrax se financia con sus campos petrolíferos. Debemos interrumpir su flujo de petróleo."
IT: "\nIl Dott. Thrax riceve fondi dai suoi giacimenti petroliferi: dobbiamo interrompere i suoi rifornimenti."
KO: "스랙스 박사는 유전에서 자금을 조달하고 있습니다. 그 자금의 흐름을 막아야 합니다."
ZH: "\n崔克斯博士從油田取得他資金的來源，我們必須斷絕他油料的供應。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xBrf05Subtitle
US: "*The Intel we retrieved from the Secret Lab proves the GLA have seized these oil fields to help fund the nefarious Dr. Thrax. They may destroy them, rather then let you recapture them. Beware General, the GLA have started using Booby Trapsuse Dozers to remove BOOBY TRAPS safely"
DE: "*The Intel we retrieved from the Secret Lab proves the GLA have seized these oil fields to help fund the nefarious Dr. Thrax. They may destroy them, rather then let you recapture them. Beware General, the GLA have started using Booby Trapsuse Dozers to remove BOOBY TRAPS safely"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa información hallada prueba que el GLA usa los campos petrolíferos\npara financiar al Dr. Thrax. Los destruirán para no permitir su recuperación.\nCuidado: Emplean trampas explosivas. Para retirarlas, usa excavadoras."
IT: "***"
KO: "\nGLA가 사악한 스랙스 박사를 돕기 위해 이 유전들을 확보했다는 것이 증명되었습니다.\nGLA는 부비 트랩을 사용하기 시작했습니다. 건설 불도저로 안전하게 제거하십시오."
ZH: "從秘密實驗室擷取的情報證實，全球解放軍已佔領油田，並資助邪惡的崔克斯博士研發毀滅性武器。他\n們寧可摧毀油田，也不願被你奪回。將軍，小心全球解放軍利用詭雷佈下的陷阱。利用推土機可以安全\n的清除它們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat01Subtitle
US: "*Sir! Toxin Tractors are eating us up! Send help!"
DE: "*Sir! Toxin Tractors are eating us up! Send help!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor! ¡Los tractores de toxinas nos están diezmando! ¡Necesitamos ayuda!"
IT: "\nSignore, i Contaminatori ci stanno massacrando! Aiuto!"
KO: "장군님! 독소 트랙터가 우리를 끝장내려고 합니다! 지원군을 보내주십시오!"
ZH: "\n長官！毒素車正在鯨吞蠶食！快派支援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat02Subtitle
US: "*Toxin Tractors! Pull your infantry back!"
DE: "*Toxin Tractors! Pull your infantry back!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Tractores de toxinas! ¡Retira la infantería!"
IT: "\nContaminatori! Ritirate la fanteria!"
KO: "독소 트랙터다! 보병을 철수시키십시오!"
ZH: "\n是毒素車！撤回你的步兵！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat03Subtitle
US: "*Quad Cannons spotted sir!"
DE: "*Quad Cannons spotted sir!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Cañones Quad divisados, señor!"
IT: "\nIndividuati Cannoni quadrupli!"
KO: "쿼드 캐논이 발견되었습니다!"
ZH: "\n發現四管加農砲，長官！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat04Subtitle
US: "*We're losing units to Quad Cannons, sir! Send armor!"
DE: "*We're losing units to Quad Cannons, sir! Send armour!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Los cañones Quad aniquilan las unidades! ¡Necesitamos blindados!"
IT: "\nI Cannoni quadrupli ci stanno facendo a pezzi. Servono mezzi corazzati."
KO: "쿼드 캐논에 유닛들을 잃고 있습니다. 탱크를 보내십시오!"
ZH: "\n四管加農砲造成我們的傷亡，長官！快派裝甲部隊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat05Subtitle
US: "* NO! Bravo Three was killed by a Quad Cannon, Sir!"
DE: "* NO! Bravo Three was killed by a Quad Cannon, Sir!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡NO! ¡Bravo Tres destruido por cañón Quad, señor!"
IT: "\nNo! Bravo Tre è stato ucciso da un Cannone quadruplo!"
KO: "브라보 3이 쿼드 캐논에 당했습니다."
ZH: "\n不！B 3 被四管加農砲擊中，長官！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat06Subtitle
US: "*The enemy has started sending tanks, sir! Send Missile defenders!"
DE: "*The enemy has started sending tanks, sir! Send Missile defenders!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡El enemigo ha comenzado a enviar tanques, señor! ¡Necesitamos defensores de misiles!"
IT: "\nIl nemico sta inviando dei carri armati, signore! Inviate delle difese missilistiche."
KO: "적이 탱크를 보내기 시작했습니다. 미사일 디펜더를 보내주십시오!"
ZH: "\n敵軍開始派遣坦克出擊，長官！快叫飛彈防禦兵！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat07Subtitle
US: "*Ha! GLA tanks are no match for us!"
DE: "*Ha! GLA tanks are no match for us!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Ja! ¡Los tanques del GLA no son rival para nosotros!"
IT: "\nAh! I carri dell'ELG cadono sotto il nostro fuoco!"
KO: "하핫! GLA 탱크는 상대가 안되지!"
ZH: "\n哈！全球解放軍的坦克部隊根本不是我們的對手！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat08Subtitle
US: "*Sir, we're losing units to enemy Tanks!"
DE: "*Sir, we're losing units to enemy Tanks!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Tanques enemigos aniquilan las unidades!"
IT: "\nSignore, i carri nemici ci stanno facendo a pezzi!"
KO: "장군님, 적 탱크에게 유닛을 잃고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n長官，敵軍的坦克造成我們的損失！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat09Subtitle
US: "*What's the enemy doing with those radar vans?"
DE: "*What's the enemy doing with those radar vans?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¿Qué hace el enemigo con esas furgonetas radar?"
IT: "\nChe cosa sta combinando il nemico con quei Furgoni radar?"
KO: "저 레이더 밴으로 놈들이 뭘 하고 있는 거지?"
ZH: "\n敵軍拿雷達車出來搞什麼啊？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat10Subtitle
US: "*Was that a car bomb?"
DE: "*Was that a car bomb?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¿Eso ha sido un coche bomba?"
IT: "\nEra un'Autobomba?"
KO: "차량 폭탄이다!"
ZH: "\n該不會是汽車炸彈吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat11Subtitle
US: "*Where are those car bombs coming from?"
DE: "*Where are those car bombs coming from?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¿De dónde vienen esos coches bomba?"
IT: "\nDa dove arrivano quelle Autobombe?"
KO: "저 차들이 다 어디서 오는 거지?"
ZH: "\n那些汽車炸彈是從哪兒冒出來的啊？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat12Subtitle
US: "*Sir, we need more defenses out here! Car Bombs are tearing us up!"
DE: "*Sir, we need more defenses out here! Car Bombs are tearing us up!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor, necesitamos más defensas aquí fuera! ¡Los coches bomba nos están haciendo pedazos!"
IT: "\nSignore, ci servono altre difese! Le Autobombe ci stanno massacrando!"
KO: "장군님! 더 많은 병력이 이곳에 필요합니다! 차량 폭탄에 당하고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n長官，我們這裡需要加強防線！汽車炸彈快把我們轟慘了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat13Subtitle
US: "*Bomb trucks?! That's not fair!"
DE: "*Bomb trucks?! That's not fair!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡¿Camiones bomba?! ¡Eso es juego sucio!"
IT: "\nCamion-bomba? Non è corretto!"
KO: "폭탄 트럭? 안돼!!"
ZH: "\n炸彈卡車？！不公平！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat14Subtitle
US: "*Sir, we need better defenses against these Bomb Trucks!"
DE: "*Sir, we need better defenses against these Bomb Trucks!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor, necesitamos mejores defensas contra los camiones bomba!"
IT: "\nSignore, servono difese contro i Camion-bomba!"
KO: "장군님, 폭탄 트럭에 대한 방어를 확실히 해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n長官，我們需要更嚴密的防禦才能抵擋炸彈卡車！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat15Subtitle
US: "*Sir, we've engaged angry mobs! Send anti-personnel units!"
DE: "*Sir, we've engaged angry mobs! Send anti-personel units!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor, hemos atraído turbas! ¡Necesitamos unidades antipersonal!"
IT: "\nSignore, la folla qui è inferocita, inviate delle unità antisommossa!"
KO: "장군님, 성난 군중이 몰려오고 있습니다! 대인 공격용 유닛을 보내주십시오!"
ZH: "\n長官，我們與暴民接戰中！快派殺傷人員單位！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat16Subtitle
US: "*Angry mobs are destroying us! Send some snipers out here!"
DE: "*Angry mobs are destroying us! Send some snipers out here!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡La turba nos está destruyendo! ¡Necesitamos algunos francotiradores!"
IT: "\nLa folla ci sta facendo a pezzi! Mandate subito dei cecchini!"
KO: "성난 군중들에게 당하고 있습니다! 저격병을 보내주십시오!"
ZH: "\n暴民快擊潰我們了！快找一些狙擊手過來！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat17Subtitle
US: "*Sir, we need to do something about these ANGRY MOBS!"
DE: "*Sir, we need to do something about these ANGRY MOBS!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor, tenemos que hacer algo con estas TURBAS!"
IT: "\nSignore, dovete fare qualcosa per questa folla inferocita!"
KO: "장군님, 이 성난 군중에 대해 대책을 세워야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n長官，我們該想辦法治這些暴民了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat18Subtitle
US: "*Sir, we're losing units to Terrorists, can we get a sniper out here?"
DE: "*Sir, we're losing units to Terrorists, can we get a sniper out here?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos terroristas nos destrozan; ¿va a venir algún francotirador?"
IT: "\nSignore, i Terroristi ci stanno attaccando, potete mandarci un cecchino?"
KO: "장군님, 유닛들을 테러리스트에게 잃고 있습니다. 저격병을 보내줄 수 없습니까?"
ZH: "\n長官，恐怖份子摧毀我們的單位，可以找一名狙擊手來這裡嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat19Subtitle
US: "*Sir, these Terrorists are chewing us up! Send support!"
DE: "*Sir, these Terrorists are chewing us up! Send support!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor, los terroristas nos están machacando! ¡Necesitamos apoyo!"
IT: "\nSignore, i Terroristi ci stanno facendo a pezzi, aiutateci!"
KO: "장군님, 테러리스트들에게 당하고 있습니다! 지원이 필요합니다!"
ZH: "\n長官，這些恐怖份子正在侵擾我們！快派支援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat20Subtitle
US: "*Geez! What's with all these demo traps!"
DE: "*Jees! Whats with all these demo traps!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Caray! ¿Qué son todas estas trampas de demolición?"
IT: "\nAccidenti, da dove spuntano tutte queste Trappole demolitrici?"
KO: "저런! 폭약 함정들이 너무 많아!"
ZH: "\n天啊！全部都是炸藥陷阱！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat21Subtitle
US: "*Sir, this field is littered with Demo Traps! We need to clear them out!"
DE: "*Sir, this field is littered with Demo Traps! We need to clear them out!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor, este campo está infestado de trampas de demolición! ¡Hay que eliminarlas!"
IT: "\nSignore, qui è pieno di Trappole demolitrici! Dobbiamo rimuoverle!"
KO: "장군님, 이 부근은 폭약 함정이 너무 많습니다! 우선 이것들을 제거해야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n長官，這塊地滿是炸藥陷阱！我們必須將它們清除！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat22Subtitle
US: "*What?! We've lost a structure to a CAR BOMBER!"
DE: "*What?! We've lost a structure to a CAR BOMBER!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡¿Qué?! ¡Un edificio perdido por un COCHE BOMBA!"
IT: "\nCosa? Un'AUTOBOMBA ha distrutto una nostra struttura!"
KO: "뭐라고?! 차량 폭탄에 건물이 날아갔다고?"
ZH: "\n什麼？！汽車炸彈摧毀我們一棟建築！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat23Subtitle
US: "*Car Bombers are attacking us! The appear to be coming from the local town"
DE: "*Car Bombers are attacking us! The appear to be coming from the local town"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Los coches bomba nos atacan! Parecen venir de la ciudad."
IT: "\nCi attaccano con le Autobombe, sembra che provengano dalla città qui vicino."
KO: "차량 폭탄에 공격받고 있습니다! 마을에서부터 오는 것으로 보입니다."
ZH: "\n汽車炸彈正在攻擊我們！它們是從當地城鎮來的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat24Subtitle
US: "*Whoa! Those bomb trucks pack a punch!"
DE: "*Whoa! Those bomb trucks pack a punch!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Uf! ¡Esos camiones bomba pegan fuerte!"
IT: "\nQuei Camion-bomba sono davvero molto potenti."
KO: "아악! 이 폭탄 트럭들은 한 방이 있군."
ZH: "\n啊！那些炸彈卡車威力真猛！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat25Subtitle
US: "*Ouch! That one hurt!"
DE: "*Ouch! That one hurt!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Ay! ¡Eso ha dolido!"
IT: "\nAhi! Che male!"
KO: "아앗! 이번 건 좀 세군."
ZH: "\n哎喲！痛死了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat26Subtitle
US: "*Sir, build more defenses to protect against the BOMB TRUCKS!"
DE: "*Sir, build more defenses to protect against the BOMB TRUCKS!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor, construyamos más defensas contra los CAMIONES BOMBA!"
IT: "\nSignore, realizzate delle difese contro i Camion-bomba!"
KO: "장군님, 폭탄 트럭에 대비할 방어 시설을 건설하십시오!"
ZH: "\n長官，建立防線以抵抗炸彈卡車！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat27Subtitle
US: "*Whoa! Those mobs are ANGRY!"
DE: "*Whoa! Those mobs are ANGRY!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Uf! ¡Esas turbas están FURIOSAS!"
IT: "\nEhi! Questi tizi sono davvero furiosi!"
KO: "우와! 저 성난 군중들을 봐!"
ZH: "\n啊！那些真的是「爆」民啊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat28Subtitle
US: "*Sir, we need a Pathfinder to deal with those ANGRY MOBS!"
DE: "*Sir, we need a Pathfinder to deal with those ANGRY MOBS!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor, necesitamos que un batidor se ocupe de esas TURBAS!"
IT: "\nSignore, ci serve un Esploratore per calmare la folla infuriata!"
KO: "장군님, 성난 군중들을 처리할 패스파인더가 필요합니다!"
ZH: "\n長官，我們需要尖兵來處理掉那些暴民！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat29Subtitle
US: "*Sir, we need anti-personnel out here NOW! These angry mobs are chewing us up!"
DE: "*Sir, we need anti-personel out out here NOW! These angry mobs are chewing us up!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor, necesitamos antipersonal aquí YA! ¡Estas turbas nos están machacando!"
IT: "\nServono subito unità antisommossa, la popolazione infuriata ci sta facendo a pezzi!"
KO: "장군님, 성난 군중들에게 당하고 있습니다! 대인 공격용 유닛이 필요합니다!"
ZH: "\n長官，我們需要殺人單位立刻前來！這些暴民正瘋狂的攻擊我們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat30Subtitle
US: "*Sir, we've lost a building to a car bomb"
DE: "*Sir, we've lost a building to a car bomb"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSeñor, un coche bomba ha destruido un edificio."
IT: "\nSignore, un'Autobomba ha distrutto una struttura."
KO: "장군님, 차량 폭탄에 건물을 한 채 잃었습니다."
ZH: "\n長官，汽車炸彈摧毀我們一棟建築！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat31Subtitle
US: "*Terrorists are destroying our buildings! Call in snipers!"
DE: "*Terrorists are destroying our buildings! Call in snipers!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Los terroristas destruyen nuestros edificios! ¡Que vengan francotiradores!"
IT: "\nI Terroristi fanno saltare gli edifici! Inviate dei cecchini!"
KO: "테러리스트들이 건물을 파괴하고 있습니다! 저격병을 사용하십시오!"
ZH: "\n恐怖份子正在摧毀我方建築！撤回狙擊手！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xChat32Subtitle
US: "*Sir! Their Bomb Trucks are destroying our base!"
DE: "*Sir! Their Bomb Trucks are destroying our base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor! ¡Los camiones bomba destruyen nuestra base!"
IT: "\nSignore, i Camion-bomba stanno distruggendo la base!"
KO: "장군님! 폭탄 트럭이 우리 기지를 파괴하고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n長官！炸彈卡車正在摧毀我們的基地！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCIA01Subtitle
US: "*Good to see some friendlies! Let's rock!"
DE: "*Good to see some friendlies! Let's rock!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Me alegro de ver un rostro amigo! ¡Adelante!"
IT: "***"
KO: "아군을 만나니 반갑군! 놈들을 혼내주자고!"
ZH: "\n看到自己人真好！咱們上吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCIA02Subtitle
US: "*Following your lead, General"
DE: "*Following your lead, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGuíanos."
IT: "\nAgli ordini, generale."
KO: "명령에 따르겠습니다, 장군님."
ZH: "\n我們跟隨你，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCIA03Subtitle
US: "*Here I am, lead on"
DE: "*Here I am, lead on"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAquí estoy; guíame."
IT: "\nEccomi, fate strada."
KO: "여기 있소. 명령을 내리시오."
ZH: "\n我在這裡，跟著我。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin01Subtitle
US: "*Satcom, this is Charlie 5. Approaching TARGET, no hostiles sightedwaitTARGET is in sight, Satcomover"
DE: "*Satcom, this is Charlie 5. Approaching TARGET, no hostiles sightedwaitTARGET is in sight, Satcomover"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSatcom, aquí Charlie 5. Acercándonos a OBJETIVO, sin resistencia... OBJETIVO a la vista, Satcom... cambio"
IT: "\nSatcom, qui Charlie 5. In avvicinamento, nessun nemico in vista. Bersaglio individuato, Satcom, passo."
KO: "\n위성 통신 센터, 여기는 찰리 5다. 목표물에 접근중이다. 적의 기미는 보이지 않는다.\n목표물이 시야에 들어왔다. 통신 종료."
ZH: "\nC 5 呼叫衛星通訊中心，目標接近中。未發現敵軍蹤跡。等等…目標進入視線。衛星通訊中心，完畢。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin02Subtitle
US: "*Roger that 5You are a go, over"
DE: "*Roger that 5You are a go, over"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecibido, 5... Tienes luz verde, cambio"
IT: "\nRicevuto 5, avete l'autorizzazione, passo."
KO: "알았다 찰리5, 개시하라, 오버."
ZH: "\n收到，C 5。準備發射，完畢。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin03Subtitle
US: "*Roger Satcompayload is awayleaving hotzone! Over"
DE: "*Roger Satcompayload is awayleaving hotzone! Over"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecibido Satcom... Carga fuera... ¡Saliendo de la zona! Cambio"
IT: "\nRicevuto Satcom. Bombe sganciate, mi allontano, passo."
KO: "알았다 통신 센터, 탄두가 옮겨지고 있다! 오버."
ZH: "\n收到，衛星通訊中心。炸彈已發射！完畢。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin04Subtitle
US: "*Roger that 5, out. Victor 3 you are go for IMMEDIATE dropover"
DE: "*Roger that 5, out. Victor 3 you are go for IMMEDIATE dropover"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecibido 5, corto. Víctor 3: luz verde para lanzamiento INMEDIATO... cambio"
IT: "\nRicevuto 5. Victor 3, procedete al dispiegamento immediato."
KO: "알았다 찰리, 빅터 3은 즉시 강습 준비를 하라."
ZH: "\n收到，C 5，通話完畢。V 3，立即進行轟炸。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin05Subtitle
US: "*Roger Satcomapproaching target area"
DE: "*Roger Satcomapproaching target area"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecibido Satcom... Acercándonos al área objetivo…"
IT: "\nRicevuto Satcom, in avvicinamento al bersaglio."
KO: "알았다 통신 센터, 목표 지점으로 접근하고 있다."
ZH: "\n收到，衛星通訊中心。目標區域接近中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin06Subtitle
US: "*Lock and Load!"
DE: "*Lock and Load!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Armas preparadas!"
IT: "\nPrepararsi!"
KO: "발사 준비!"
ZH: "\n鎖定、發射！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin07Subtitle
US: "*Jump! Jump!"
DE: "*Jump! Jump!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Saltad! ¡Saltad!"
IT: "\nFuori! Fuori!"
KO: "뛰어! 뛰어!"
ZH: "\n跳！跳！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin08Subtitle
US: "*Careful not to get slimed, boyschem weapons sighted"
DE: "*Careful not to get slimed, boyschem weapons sighted"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCuidado con el barro, chicos... Armas químicas avistadas."
IT: "\nAttenti a non fare una brutta fine, ragazzi."
KO: "어설프게 당하지 않도록 조심하게, 제군들. 화학 무기가 시야에 들어왔다."
ZH: "\n小心不要招惹別人，年輕人。發現化學武器。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin09Subtitle
US: "*This is no MILK RUN, boys! Keep your heads!"
DE: "*This is no MILK RUN, boys! Keep your heads!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Esto no es un entrenamiento, chicos! ¡No bajéis la guardia!"
IT: "\nQuesta non è una passeggiata, ragazzi! Giù la testa!"
KO: "이건 일상 정찰 비행이 아니야! 정신들 차려!"
ZH: "\n這可不是例行飛行，年輕人！小心前方！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin10Subtitle
US: "*Stay in formation!! No Cowboys!"
DE: "*Stay in formation!! No Cowboys!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡¡Mantened la formación!! ¡Nada de cowboys!"
IT: "\nRestate in formazione! Non fate gli eroi!"
KO: "대형을 유지하라! 혼자서 튀면 안된다!"
ZH: "\n保持隊形！！不，年輕人！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin11Subtitle
US: "*Goats are away. Retuning to barn. Out"
DE: "*Goats are away. Retuning to barn. Out"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas cabras han salido. Volviendo al establo. Corto."
IT: "\nPecorelle sul campo, torno all'ovile. Chiudo."
KO: "염소들은 다 나갔다. 헛간으로 돌아간다. 교신 끝."
ZH: "\n山羊小隊現在返回基地，通話完畢。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin12Subtitle
US: "*Bravo team, your primary objective is the small airstrip to your South. Secure it for incoming reinforcements. Out"
DE: "*Bravo team, your primary objective is the small airstrip to your South. Secure it for incoming reinforcements. Out"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEquipo Bravo, el objetivo es la pista de aterrizaje que tenéis al sur.\nAseguradla para los refuerzos que lleguen. Corto."
IT: "***"
KO: "브라보 팀, 가장 중요한 목표는 남쪽의 활주로다. 곧 도착할 지원군을 위해 확보해놓도록."
ZH: "\nB 小隊，你的主要任務就是守護南方的機場，到援軍抵達，通話完畢。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin13Subtitle
US: "*Roger Satcom, moving out. Listen up kids! This is a FREE FIRE ZONE! Watch for ROACHES! If it moves kill it"
DE: "*Roger Satcom, moving out. Listen up kids! This is a FREE FIRE ZONE! Watch for ROACHES! If it moves kill it"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecibido Satcom; en marcha. ¡Atención, chicos! ¡Esto es una ZONA DE COMBATE! ¡Cuidado con las CUCARACHAS! Disparad a todo lo que se mueva."
IT: "\nRicevuto, Satcom, ci muoviamo. Ascoltate bene, questa è una zona di guerra! Occhi aperti: sparate su qualsiasi cosa si muova."
KO: "\n알았다, 통신 센터. 이동한다. 모두 잘 듣도록! 여기서부터는 움직이는 모든 것은 사격한다!\n바퀴벌레 같은 저 놈들을 조심하라!"
ZH: "\n收到，衛星通訊中心，我們立刻出發。聽好了！這裡是自由開火區！注意那些出沒的「蟑螂」！只要他\n敢動一下，就幹掉他。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xCin14Subtitle
US: "*Airstrip secured, GeneralReinforcements en route"
DE: "*Airstrip secured, GeneralReinforcements en route"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nPista de aterrizaje asegurada, general... Refuerzos en camino."
IT: "\nPista d'atterraggio sotto controllo, generale. Rinforzi in arrivo."
KO: "활주로를 확보 완료했습니다, 장군님. 지원군은 목표로 이동중입니다."
ZH: "\n機場安全了，將軍。援軍正在路上。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva01Subtitle
US: "*The GLA has started using BOOBY-TRAPS on structures in this area. They will explode if you try to capture or garrison them. Use Dozers to remove them"
DE: "*The GLA has started using BOOBY-TRAPS on structures in this area. They will explode if you try to capture or garrison them. Use Dozers to remove them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA está usando trampas explosivas en edificios de la zona.\nExplotarán al tratar de atraparlos o guarnecerlos.\nElimínalas con excavadoras."
IT: "***"
KO: "\nGLA는 이 지역의 건물에 부비 트랩을 사용하기 시작했습니다. 그 건물들을 점령하려\n하거나 병사를 주둔시키려 하면 폭발할 것입니다. 건설 불도저를 사용하여 제거하십시오."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍於本區的數棟建築使用詭雷，一旦我們想要佔領或駐守它們，將被炸得支離破碎。利用推土\n機來清除詭雷。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva02Subtitle
US: "*The GLA has seized the nearby oil fields. Protect the derricks and destroy the GLA base"
DE: "*The GLA has siezed the nearby oil fields. Protect the derricks and destroy the GLA base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA ha tomado los campos de petróleo cercanos. Protege las torres y destruye su base."
IT: "***"
KO: "GLA는 근처의 유전을 가지고 있습니다. 유정탑을 보호하고 GLA 기지를 파괴하십시오."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍已經攻佔附近的油田。快保護油井並摧毀他們的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva03Subtitle
US: "*BE CAREFUL, General; the enemy may have set up traps in the oil field"
DE: "*BE CAREFUL, General; the enemy may have set up traps in the oil field"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCUIDADO, general; el enemigo puede haber colocado trampas en el campo de petróleo."
IT: "***"
KO: "조심하십시오, 장군님. 적들이 유전에 함정을 설치해 놓았을지 모릅니다."
ZH: "\n小心，將軍；敵軍可能已在油田中設下陷阱。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva04Subtitle
US: "*Good news, General. Colonel Burton knows several covert operatives in this area. Lead Burton to the ops to solicit their help"
DE: "*Good news, General. Colonel Burton knows several covert operatives in this area. Lead Burton to the ops to solicit their help"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuenas noticias, general. El coronel Burton conoce a varios agentes secretos en esta zona. Llévale hasta ellos para que solicite su ayuda."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n좋은 소식입니다, 장군님. 버튼 대령은 이 지역에서 작전중인 비밀 첩보원들을 몇 명\n알고 있다고 합니다. 버튼 대령을 보내 이 요원들의 도움을 요청하십시오."
ZH: "\n好消息，將軍，貝頓上校在這裡曾結識幾位秘密幹員。帶領貝頓上校找到幹員並尋求他們的協助。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva05Subtitle
US: "*Good news, General. There are several covert operatives in this area. Find them to solicit their help"
DE: "*Good news, General. There are several covert operatives in this area. Find them to solicit their help"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuenas noticias, general. Hay varios agentes secretos en esta zona. Localízalos y solicita su ayuda."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n좋은 소식입니다, 장군님. 이 지역에 몇 명의 비밀 첩보원이 활동하고 있습니다.\n그들을 찾아내서 도움을 요청하십시오."
ZH: "\n好消息，將軍，有幾位秘密幹員在這裡行動。找到他們並尋求他們的協助。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva06Subtitle
US: "*Well done General, this region is now free of GLA troublemakers"
DE: "*Well done General, this region is now free of GLA troublemakers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBien hecho, general; la región está libre del GLA."
IT: "\nBen fatto, generale, ora questa zona è libera dall'ELG."
KO: "잘하셨습니다, 장군님. 이제 이 지역은 GLA 폭도들로부터 해방되었습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍。這裡不會再有全球解放軍胡搞了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva07Subtitle
US: "*Well done, General. This area has been secured"
DE: "*Well done, General. This area has been secured"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBien hecho, general. El área está asegurada."
IT: "\nBen fatto, generale, la zona è sotto controllo."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 이 지역이 확보되었습니다."
ZH: "\n太棒了，將軍，這個區域安全了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva08Subtitle
US: "*General, Your ultimate objective is to destroy the GLA base in this area. Your main source of funding will be the oil derricks. You must secure and protect them!"
DE: "*General, Your ultimate objective is to destroy the GLA base in this area. Your main source of funding will be the oil derricks. You must secure and protect them!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el objetivo final es destruir la base del GLA en la zona.\nTu principal fuente de financiación serán las torres de perforación.\n¡Hay que asegurarlas y protegerlas!"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n장군님, 최종 목표는 이 지역의 GLA 기지를 파괴하는 것입니다. 장군님의 주요 자금 원천은\n원유 유정탑이 될 것입니다. 이 유정탑을 확보한 후 지키십시오!"
ZH: "\n將軍，你最終的目標就是摧毀全球解放軍的基地，油井將是你主要的資金來源。你必須安全佔領並保護它們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva09Subtitle
US: "*Well done, General. Your mission is a success"
DE: "*Well done, General. Your mission is a success"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBien hecho, general. La misión ha sido un éxito."
IT: "\nBen fatto, generale, la vostra missione è stata un successo."
KO: "잘하셨습니다, 장군님. 임무를 완수하셨습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍，你的任務圓滿達成。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva10Subtitle
US: "*General, the local town is being poisoned by GLA propaganda and are launching attacks against us. Destroy the GLA radio station to quell the uprising"
DE: "*General, the local town is being poisoned by GLA propaganda and are launching attacks against us. Destroy the GLA radio station to quell the uprising"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, nos ataca la población local, contaminada por la propaganda del GLA.\nDestruye la emisora del GLA para sofocar la revuelta."
IT: "\nGenerale, la città qui vicino è avvelenata dalla propaganda dell'ELG\ne ci sta attaccando. Distruggete la Stazione radio\nper risolvere il problema."
KO: "장군님, 이 지역 마을은 GLA의 선전에 동요되어 우리에게 공격을 감행하고 있습니다.\nGLA 라디오 방송국을 파괴하여 주민들을 평정하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，當地城鎮由於受到全球解放軍思想強化的毒害，因此對我們群起發動攻擊。摧毀全球解放軍廣播\n電台以鎮壓暴動發生。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva11Subtitle
US: "*Destroy the GLA radio-station in the city to quell the uprising"
DE: "*Destroy the GLA radio-station in the city to quell the uprising"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDestruye la emisora del GLA en la ciudad para sofocar la revuelta."
IT: "\nDistruggete la Stazione radio dell'ELG in città per sedare le sommosse."
KO: "도시 안의 GLA 라디오 방송국을 파괴하여 주민들의 반란을 진압하십시오."
ZH: "\n摧毀城市中全球解放軍廣播電台，以鎮壓暴動發生。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva12Subtitle
US: "*Well done, General. The GLA propaganda machine has been destroyed"
DE: "*Well done, General. The GLA propaganda machine has been destroyed"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBien hecho, general. La maquinaria propagandística del GLA ha sido destruida."
IT: "\nBen fatto, generale: la macchina della propaganda dell'ELG\nè stata distrutta."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. GLA의 선전의 도구가 이제 파괴되었습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍，全球解放軍的思想強化機器已遭摧毀。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva13Subtitle
US: "*Destroy the GLA RADIO STATION in the city to stop the car-bomb attacks"
DE: "*Destroy the GLA RADIO STATION in the city to stop the car-bomb attacks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDestruye la EMISORA del GLA en la ciudad para detener los ataques con coche bomba."
IT: "\nDistruggete la Stazione radio dell'ELG in città per fermare le Autobombe."
KO: "차량 폭탄 공격을 멈추기 위해 도시 안의 GLA 라디오 방송국을 파괴하십시오."
ZH: "\n摧毀城市中全球解放軍廣播電台，以阻止汽車炸彈的攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva14Subtitle
US: "*Destroy the GLA RADIO STATION in the city to stop the bomb-truck attacks"
DE: "*Destroy the GLA RADIO STATION in the city to stop the bomb-truck attacks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDestruye la EMISORA del GLA en la ciudad para detener los ataques con camión bomba."
IT: "\nDistruggete la Stazione radio dell'ELG in città per fermare i Camion-bomba."
KO: "폭탄 트럭 공격을 멈추기 위해 도시 안의 GLA 라디오 방송국을 파괴하십시오."
ZH: "\n摧毀城市中全球解放軍廣播電台，以阻止炸彈卡車的攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva15Subtitle
US: "*Destroy the GLA RADIO STATION in the city to stop the suicide attacks"
DE: "*Destroy the GLA RADIO STATION in the city to stop the suicide attacks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nDestruye la EMISORA del GLA en la ciudad para detener los ataques suicidas."
IT: "\nDistruggete la Stazione radio dell'ELG in città per fermare gli attacchi suicidi."
KO: "자폭 공격을 멈추기 위해 도시 안의 GLA 라디오 방송국을 파괴하십시오."
ZH: "\n摧毀城市中全球解放軍廣播電台，以阻止自殺性攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva16Subtitle
US: "*General, there are several ARTILLERY PLATFORMS in the area. Capture them for suppression fire"
DE: "*General, there are several ARTILLERY PLATFORMS in the area. Capture them for suppression fire"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, hay varias ESTACIONES DE ARTILLERÍA en el área. Captúralas para obtener fuego de cobertura."
IT: "\nGenerale, ci sono diverse Postazioni di artiglieria in zona:\nconquistatele e usatele per il fuoco di soppressione."
KO: "장군님, 이 지역에 캐논 플랫폼이 몇 개 있습니다. 점령해서 진압용으로 사용하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，區域內有許多砲兵陣地，佔領它們以提供壓制火力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva17Subtitle
US: "*General, There is a REPAIR PAD in the area. Capture it to help heal our vehicles"
DE: "*General, There is a REPAIR PAD in the area. Capture it to help heal our vehicles"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHay una PLATAFORMA DE REPARACIÓN en el área. Captúrala para reparar nuestros vehículos."
IT: "\nC'è un Centro riparazioni in zona: conquistatelo per riparare i nostri veicoli."
KO: "장군님, 이 지역에 수리 패드가 있습니다. 점령해서 우리 차량을 수리하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，區域內有個維修機坪，佔領它讓載具可以在此設施內維修。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva18Subtitle
US: "*Sir, please build more defenses to protect against the car bombers"
DE: "*Sir, please build more defenses to protect against the car bombers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor, hay que construir más defensas contra los COCHES BOMBA!"
IT: "\nSignore, realizzate ulteriori difese come protezione contro le Autobombe."
KO: "장군님, 차량 폭탄 공격에 대비할 방어 시설들을 더 건설하십시오."
ZH: "\n長官，請多建立鞏固我們的防線，以阻止汽車炸彈的攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva19Subtitle
US: "*Sir, the enemy has started deploying Radar Vans, they can spot our pathfinders!"
DE: "*Sir, the enemy has started deploying Radar Vans, they can spot our pathfinders!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSeñor, el enemigo ha desplegado furgonetas radar; pueden localizar a nuestros batidores."
IT: "\nSignore, il nemico utilizza dei Furgoni radar con cui può individuare i nostri Esploratori!"
KO: "\n장군님, 적이 레이더 밴을 배치하기 시작했습니다.\n그들은 이제 우리의 패스파인더를 발견할 수 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n長官，敵軍開始部署雷達車用以偵測我們的尖兵！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva20Subtitle
US: "*Sir, the enemy's Radar Vans are sweeping for our pathfindersbe careful"
DE: "*Sir, the enemy's Radar Vans are sweeping for our pathfindersbe careful"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas furgonetas radar del enemigo están intentando localizar a nuestros batidores... Cuidado."
IT: "\nSignore, i Furgoni radar nemici stanno cercando i nostri Esploratori."
KO: "장군님, 적의 레이더 밴이 우리의 패스파인더를 찾고 있습니다. 조심하십시오."
ZH: "\n長官，敵軍的雷達車正徹底的消滅我們的尖兵。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva21Subtitle
US: "*Sir, we should build Patriots to counter the bomb trucks"
DE: "*Sir, we should build Patriots to counter the bomb trucks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSeñor, construyamos Patriots para contrarrestar los camiones bomba."
IT: "\nSignore, dovremmo posizionare dei Patriot contro i Camion-bomba."
KO: "장군님, 폭탄 트럭에 맞서려면 패트리엇 미사일을 건설해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n長官，我們應該建造愛國者飛彈系統來反擊炸彈卡車。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva22Subtitle
US: "*Sir, Enemy Terrorists are proving highly effective. I suggest you send Pathfinders"
DE: "*Sir, Enemy Terrorists are proving highly effective. I suggest you send Pathfinders"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos enemigos terroristas están siendo muy efectivos. Sugiero el envío de batidores."
IT: "\nSignore, i Terroristi nemici sono pericolosi, contrastateli con gli Esploratori."
KO: "장군님, 적의 테러리스트들이 매우 위협적입니다. 패스파인더를 보내서 처리할 것을 권합니다."
ZH: "\n長官，敵軍恐怖份子具有相當的毀滅性，我建議派遣尖兵與其對陣。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva23Subtitle
US: "*Sir! We're losing units to Demo Traps, please be more careful!"
DE: "*Sir! We're losing units to Demo Traps, please be more careful!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Señor! Las trampas de demolición destruyen unidades. ¡Cuidado!"
IT: "\nSignore, le Trappole demolitrici ci stanno decimando, fate più attenzione!"
KO: "장군님, 폭약 함정에 유닛을 잃고 있습니다. 조심하십시오!"
ZH: "\n長官，炸藥陷阱使我們損失不小，請小心應戰！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva24Subtitle
US: "*General, There is an OIL REFINERY in the area. Capture it to reduce vehicle cost"
DE: "*General, There is an OIL REFINERY in the area. Capture it to reduce vehicle cost"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, hay una REFINERÍA DE PETRÓLEO en el área. Captúrala y se reducirá el coste de los vehículos."
IT: "*"
KO: "장군님, 근처에 정유 공장이 있습니다. 점령해서 차량 생산 비용을 줄이십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，區域內有一座煉油廠，佔領它以降低載具的成本。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva25Subtitle
US: "*Sir, the enemy has begun attacking the OIL FIELDS"
DE: "*Sir, the enemy has begun attacking the OIL FIELDS"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSeñor, el enemigo está atacando los CAMPOS DE PETRÓLEO."
IT: "\nSignore, il nemico sta assalendo i giacimenti petroliferi."
KO: "장군님, 적이 유전을 공격하기 시작했습니다!"
ZH: "\n長官，敵軍已經開始攻擊油田。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva26Subtitle
US: "*WARNING: OIL derrick DESTROYED!\nOnly 1 derrick remains!"
DE: "*WARNING: OIL derrick DESTROYED!\nOnly 1 derrick remains!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAVISO: ¡torre de perforación DESTRUIDA!\n¡Sólo queda 1 torre!"
IT: "\nATTENZIONE: Derrick distrutto!\nRimane soltanto 1 Derrick."
KO: "경고: 원유 유정탑 파괴됨.\n1개만 남았음!"
ZH: "警告：油井已被摧毀！\n只剩餘 1 座油井！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva27Subtitle
US: "*WARNING: OIL derrick DESTROYED!\nOnly 5 derricks remain"
DE: "*WARNING: OIL derrick DESTROYED!\nOnly 5 derricks remain"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAVISO: ¡torre de perforación DESTRUIDA!\n¡Sólo quedan 5 torres!"
IT: "\nATTENZIONE: Derrick distrutto!\nRimangono soltanto 5 Derrick."
KO: "경고: 원유 유정탑 파괴됨.\n5개 남음."
ZH: "警告：油井已被摧毀！\n只剩餘 5 座油井！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva28Subtitle
US: "*WARNING: OIL derrick DESTROYED!\nOnly 10 derricks remain"
DE: "*WARNING: OIL derrick DESTROYED!\nOnly 10 derricks remain"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAVISO: ¡torre de perforación DESTRUIDA!\n¡Sólo quedan 10 torres!"
IT: "\nATTENZIONE: Derrick distrutto!\nRimangono soltanto 10 Derrick."
KO: "경고: 원유 유정탑 파괴됨.\n10개 남음."
ZH: "警告：油井已被摧毀！\n只剩餘 10 座油井！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva29Subtitle
US: "*WARNING: OIL derrick DESTROYED!\n15 derricks remain"
DE: "*WARNING: OIL derrick DESTROYED!\n15 derricks remain"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAVISO: ¡torre de perforación DESTRUIDA!\nQuedan 15 torres."
IT: "\nATTENZIONE: Derrick distrutto!\nRimangono soltanto 15 Derrick."
KO: "경고: 원유 유정탑 파괴됨.\n15개 남음."
ZH: "警告：油井已被摧毀！\n只剩餘 15 座油井！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva30Subtitle
US: "*General, our cash reserves are running low -- capture oil derricks for needed cash"
DE: "*General, our cash reserves are running low -- capture oil derricks for needed cash"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCaen nuestras reservas de capital;\nnecesitamos torres de perforación para obtener ingresos."
IT: "\nGenerale, le nostre finanze scarseggiano, dovete conquistare i Derrick."
KO: "장군님, 자금이 부족합니다. 원유 유정탑을 점령하여 자금을 충당하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們現金所剩不多。佔領油井以增加所需的現金。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva31Subtitle
US: "*WARNING: SCUDSTORM DETECTED!"
DE: "*WARNING: SCUDSTORM DETECTED!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAVISO: ¡DETECTADA TORMENTA SCUD!"
IT: "\nAVVISO: RILEVATO SCUD STORM!"
KO: "경고: 스커드 폭풍이 탐지되었습니다!"
ZH: "警告：偵測到生化死雨風暴！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva32Subtitle
US: "*General! Colonel Burton is down!"
DE: "*General! Colonel Burton is down!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General! ¡El coronel Burton ha caído!"
IT: "\nGenerale, il Colonnello Burton è stato ucciso!"
KO: "장군님! 버튼 대령이 당했습니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍！貝頓上校已陣亡！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva33Subtitle
US: "*All the oil derricks have been DESTROYED! Your mission is a failure"
DE: "*All the oil derricks have been DESTROYED! Your mission is a failure"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Han DESTRUIDO todas las torres de perforación! La misión ha fracasado."
IT: "\nTutti i Derrick sono stati distrutti: la missione è fallita."
KO: "모든 원유 유정탑이 파괴되었습니다! 임무 실패입니다."
ZH: "\n所有油井都被摧毀！你的任務失敗。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva34Subtitle
US: "*Your base has been destroyed! Your mission is a failure"
DE: "*Your base has been destroyed! Your mission is a failure"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Han destruido la base! La misión ha fracasado."
IT: "\nLa vostra base è stata distrutta: la missione è fallita."
KO: "아군 기지가 모두 파괴되었습니다! 임무 실패입니다."
ZH: "\n你的基地被摧毀了！任務失敗。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA04xEva35Subtitle
US: "*Good luck, sir"
DE: "*Good luck, sir"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuena suerte, señor."
IT: "\nBuona fortuna, signore."
KO: "행운을 빕니다, 장군님."
ZH: "\n祝你好運，長官。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xChat01Subtitle
US: "*Our base is being attacked sir. They built a tunnel network inside our base without us knowing"
DE: "*Our base is being attacked sir. They built a tunnel network inside our base without us knowing"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAtacan nuestra base, señor. Han construido una red de túneles sin que lo supiéramos."
IT: "\nStanno attaccando la base: hanno costruito una Rete di tunnel sotto i nostri piedi."
KO: "\n우리 기지가 공격당하고 있습니다, 장군님! 그들은 우리 몰래 기지 안에 터널 네트워크를\n건설했습니다!"
ZH: "\n我方基地正遭受攻擊，長官。他們在我們未察覺的情況下，在我方基地內建造了地道網路系統。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xChat02Subtitle
US: "*Those buses are loaded with hostiles sir! Watch out!"
DE: "*Those buses are loaded with hostiles sir! Watch out!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Esos buses están cargados de enemigos! ¡Cuidado!"
IT: "\nQuegli autobus sono carichi di nemici, fate attenzione!"
KO: "저 버스들 안에는 적들이 타고 있습니다! 조심하십시오!"
ZH: "\n那些卡車裡面運載著敵軍，長官！小心！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xChat03Subtitle
US: "*Our base is being attacked sir. They built a tunnel network inside our base without us knowing"
DE: "*Our base is being attacked sir. They built a tunnel network inside our base without us knowing"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nAtacan nuestra base, señor. Han construido una red de túneles sin que lo supiéramos."
IT: "\nStanno attaccando la base: hanno costruito una Rete di tunnel sotto i nostri piedi."
KO: "\n우리 기지가 공격당하고 있습니다, 장군님! 그들은 우리 몰래 기지 안에 터널 네트워크를\n건설했습니다!"
ZH: "\n我方基地正遭受攻擊，長官。他們在我們未察覺的情況下，在我方基地內建造了地道網路系統。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xChat04Subtitle
US: "*We offer you our assistance to rid us of this Toxin Monger. His obsession will kill us all and that we cannot allow"
DE: "*We offer you our assistance to rid us of this Toxin Monger. His obsession will kill us all and that we cannot allow"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nOfrecemos nuestro apoyo para librarnos de este traficante de toxinas.\nSu obsesión nos matará a todos; no podemos permitirlo."
IT: "\nVi offriamo assistenza per liberarci del signore delle tossine:\nfinirà per ucciderci tutti e non possiamo permetterlo."
KO: "\n이 독소 미치광이를 제거하기 위해 당신들을 돕겠소. 그의 망상은 결국 우리 모두를 파멸로\n이끌 것이고, 그렇게 하도록 내버려 둘 수는 없소."
ZH: "\n我們提供你協助以擺脫這個毒素販子的威脅，他對毒素的著魔，只會害我們走上死亡，當然這將不為我\n們所容許。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xChat05Subtitle
US: "*Death to the Devil of Disease!"
DE: "*Death to the Devil of Disease!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Muerte al demonio de la enfermedad!"
IT: "\nMorte al diavolo delle pestilenze!"
KO: "병균에 미친 마귀에게 죽음을!"
ZH: "\n殺了你這個萬惡的魔頭！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xChat06Subtitle
US: "*Help! Over here, please release me"
DE: "*Help! Over here, please release me"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Ayuda! Aquí, por favor; libérame."
IT: "\nAiuto! Qui, per favore, liberatemi."
KO: "여기 좀 도와주시오! 나를 풀어주시오."
ZH: "\n救命啊！在這裡，請救我出去。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xChat07Subtitle
US: "*Thank you for releasing me. Transport me to my base in the East and I can help you"
DE: "*Thank you for releasing me. Transport me to my base in the East and I can help you"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGracias por liberarme. Llévame a mi base en el este y podré ayudarte."
IT: "\nGrazie per avermi liberato: conducetemi alla mia base, a est, e potrò esservi di aiuto."
KO: "풀어줘서 고맙소. 나를 동쪽 기지로 데려다 주면 도와주겠소."
ZH: "\n謝謝你救了我，將我送回北邊的基地後，我可以助你一臂之力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xCin01Subtitle
US: "*Sat-Com A4 has confirmation on base location. Visuals are uploading now"
DE: "*Sat-Com A4 has confirmation on base location. Visuals are uploading now"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSatcom A4 puede confirmar la ubicación de la base. Se están transfiriendo las imágenes."
IT: "***"
KO: "위성 통신 센터 응답하라. A4가 기지의 위치를 확인했다. 시각 정보를 업로드 중이다."
ZH: "\n衛星通訊中心，A4 已經確認基地位置，影像正在上傳中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xCin02Subtitle
US: "*Field, please verify status of Toxin Production facilities"
DE: "*Field, please verify status of Toxin Production facilities"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCampo, comprueba el estado de las instalaciones de toxinas."
IT: "\nVerificare le condizioni degli impianti di produzione delle tossine."
KO: "작전 부대 응답하라. 독소 생산 시설의 상황을 확인해달라."
ZH: "\n衛星，請確認毒素工廠的狀況。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xCin03Subtitle
US: "*Then we have a go upon presentation of final clearance code"
DE: "*Then we have a go upon presentation of final clearance code"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEntonces, intentaremos transmitir el código de autorización final."
IT: "\nDopo il codice di autorizzazione finale, entreremo in azione."
KO: "그렇다면 최종 기밀 코드를 제시하면 작전을 개시하겠다."
ZH: "\n現在就等待最後的攻擊代號，我們就可以立即執行任務。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xCin04Subtitle
US: "*Roger that, Alpha Whiskey Echo, the birds are in the air"
DE: "*Roger that, Alpha Whiskey Echo, the birds are in the air"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nRecibido, Alpha Whisky Eco; los pájaros están en el aire."
IT: "\nRicevuto, Alfa Whiskey Eco, gli uccelli sono in volo."
KO: "알았다. 알파, 위스키, 에코. 새들이 공중에 있다."
ZH: "\n收到，Alpha Whiskey Echo，飛彈升空了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xCin05Subtitle
US: "*Toxin Production Facilities confirmed sir"
DE: "*Toxin Production Facilities confirmed sir"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "\nImpianti di produzione delle tossine confermati."
KO: "독소 생산 시설이 확인되었습니다, 장군님."
ZH: "\n確認毒素工廠，長官。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xCin06Subtitle
US: "*Clearance code is Sierra, Hotel, Oscar, Charlie Kilo"
DE: "*Clearance code is Sierra, Hotel, Oscar, Charlie Kilo"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl código de autorización es Sierra, Hotel, Óscar, Charlie Kilo."
IT: "\nCodice di autorizzazione Sierra, Hotel, Oscar, Charlie, Kilo."
KO: "기밀 취급 허가 코드이다: 시에라, 호텔, 오스카, 찰리, 킬로."
ZH: "\n攻擊代號是 Sierra、Hotel、Oscar、Charlie、Kilo（SHOCK）。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva01Subtitle
US: "*Phase one of our operation has been completed General. Our Tomahawk Missile strike was successful in destroying all of GLA's Toxin production facilities. Only their main base and Toxin Missile silo's remain to be eliminated"
DE: "*Phase one of our operation has been completed General. Our Tomahawk Missile strike was successful in destroying all of GLA's Toxin production facilities. Only their main base and Toxin Missile silo's remain to be eliminated"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSe ha completado la fase uno de la operación, general. Nuestro ataque con misiles Tomahawk tuvo éxito, destruyendo todas las instalaciones de toxinas del GLA. Sólo quedan su base principal y sus silos de misiles con toxinas."
IT: "\nLa fase 1 dell'operazione si è conclusa, generale: il missile Tomahawk ha distrutto gli impianti di produzione delle tossine dell'ELG. Ora rimangono solo la loro base e il silo del missile con testata alle tossine."
KO: "\n작전 1단계가 완료되었습니다, 장군님. 우리의 토마호크 미사일 공격은 GLA의 독소 생산\n시설을 모두 파괴했습니다. 본 기지와 독소 미사일 사일로를 마저 제거해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n第一階段的軍事行動已經完成，將軍。我方的戰斧飛彈已成功的炸毀全球解放軍毒素工廠，他們的主要\n基地以及毒素飛彈發射井，則是我們接下來待摧毀的目標。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva02Subtitle
US: "*General, we've tracked Dr. Thrax to this remote location. He is in possession of chemical tipped missiles, and has them prepped for launch. Destroying his toxin storage tanks has slowed him down, but we must move in and secure those missiles before they can be launched"
DE: "*General, we've tracked Dr. Thrax to this remote location. He is in posession of chemical tipped missiles, and has them prepped for launch. Destroying his toxin storage tanks has slowed him down, but we must move in and secure those missiles before they can be launched"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, hemos rastreado al Dr. Thrax hasta este remoto lugar. Tiene preparados sus misiles con carga química añadida. Destruir sus tanques de toxinas le ha retrasado, pero hay que controlar esos misiles antes de que los lance."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n장군님, 스랙스 박사는 현재 화학 탄두를 장착한 미사일을 발사 준비중이라고 합니다.\n독소 저장 탱크를 파괴하여 지연시키긴 했지만, 반드시 발사되기 전에 탈취해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們已追蹤到崔克斯博士的位置，他擁有化學毒素飛彈準備發射攻擊我方。雖然我們已摧毀毒素\n儲存坦克拖慢了他的速度，但必須在他發射飛彈之前，盡快把它們清除掉。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva03Subtitle
US: "*General, Dr. Thrax was able to develop small quantities of his new toxin. Make sure your forces are on high alert"
DE: "*General, Dr. Thrax was able to develop small quantities of his new toxin. Make sure your forces are on high alert"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el Dr. Thrax ha fabricado pequeñas cantidades de su nueva toxina. Que tus fuerzas estén en alerta."
IT: "\nGenerale, il Dott. Thrax ha prodotto una quantità limitata della sua nuova tossina: mantenete lo stato di massima allerta."
KO: "\n장군님, 스랙스 박사는 새로운 독소를 소량이지만 개발했다고 합니다.\n전 부대원에 1급 경계령을 내리십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，崔克斯博士已經得以研發出小量的新型毒素武器，確認你的軍隊皆在高度的戒備當中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva04Subtitle
US: "*General, due to the civilian presence in this location you will need to use ground forces to assault the final base and capture the 4 toxin missile sites in the area. Our successful liberation of the oil sites in Amisbad has provided us with additional resources for this operation"
DE: "*General, due to the civilian presence in this location you will need to use ground forces to assault the final base and capture the 4 toxin missile sites in the area. Our successful liberation of the oil sites in Amisbad has provided us with additional resources for this operation"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, dada la presencia civil, habría que emplear fuerzas terrestres\npara asaltar la base y tomar los 4 silos de misiles.La liberación de\nlas plantas petrolíferas de Amisbad nos ha dado recursos adicionales."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n장군님, 이 지역에는 민간인이 있으므로 지상 병력을 사용하여 마지막 기지를 점령하고\n4기의 독소 미사일을 탈취해야 합니다. 이번 작전에는 유전에서 얻은 여유 자금이 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，由於此區有平民的關係，你必須利用地面部隊發動對敵軍基地的襲擊，並佔領此區四座毒素飛彈\n發射井。我們在馬塞漢的油田提供了此次作戰所需的額外資源。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva05Subtitle
US: "*Dr. Thrax must be defeated so he can't inflict further terror on the world. General, you must stop him"
DE: "*Dr. Thrax must be defeated so he can't inflict further terror on the world. General, you must stop him"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nHay que derrotar al Dr. Thrax para que deje de aterrorizar al mundo.\nGeneral, hay que detenerlo"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n스랙스 박사는 반드시 제거되어서 더 이상 세계에 테러를 저질러서는 안됩니다.\n장군님, 그를 어서 막으십시오."
ZH: "\n崔克斯博士必須被殲滅，不能再讓他尋求世界上其他恐怖份子的協助。將軍，你必須阻止他。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva06Subtitle
US: "*Our Intel indicates that this is the best area to build your base. Local unrest may be in your favor. Good luck"
DE: "*Our Intel indicates that this is the best area to build your base. Local unrest may be in your favor. Good luck"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos informes señalan este lugar como el mejor para construir la base. La inestabilidad puede jugar a tu favor. Buena suerte."
IT: "\nLe informazioni indicano questa come la posizione ideale per la base. I disordini potrebbero giocare a vostro favore."
KO: "\n정보에 따르면 이 지역이 기지를 건설하기에 가장 좋은 곳입니다. 어수선한 주변환경 역시\n유리하게 작용합니다. 행운을 빕니다."
ZH: "\n根據情報顯示，這裡是你建立基地的絕佳地點。當地的動盪不安或許對你有利，祝你好運。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva07Subtitle
US: "*General, the local GLA have responded to your rescue and have given us control of their base. You may now use their forces in your attack"
DE: "*General, the local GLA have responded to your rescue and have given us control of their base. You may now use their forces in your attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA local nos ha dado el control de su base como respuesta a tu rescate. Ahora puedes usar sus fuerzas en el ataque."
IT: "\nGenerale, le forze dell'ELG locali hanno apprezzato l'aiuto ricevuto, consegnandoci la base. Ora potete usare le loro unità."
KO: "\n장군님, 이 지역의 일부 GLA 병력이 당신의 구출에 대한 답례로 그들의 기지 통제권을\n넘겨줬습니다. 이제 그들의 병력을 공격에 사용할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，當地的全球解放軍對你的拯救行動，表示願意提供他們的基地為您所指揮。現在你可以運用他們\n的部隊進行攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva08Subtitle
US: "*General, your main objective is to capture the 4 Toxin Missile Silo's targeted on US major metropolitan areas before they launch"
DE: "*General, your main objective is to capture the 4 Toxin Missile Silo's targeted on US major metropolitan areas before they launch"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, el objetivo es tomar los 4 silos de misiles con toxinas que apuntan\na grandes áreas metropolitanas de EE.UU. antes de su lanzamiento."
IT: "\nGenerale, l'obiettivo principale è la cattura dei 4 silo per missili\ncon testata alle tossine. I missili sono puntati\ncontro quattro aree densamente popolate degli USA."
KO: "\n장군님, 이번 임무의 주 목표는 미국의 주요 도시를 겨냥한 4기의 독소 미사일이\n발사되기 전에 탈취하는 것입니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，你的主要任務是在敵軍飛彈發射之前，摧毀已瞄準美國主要大城的四座毒素飛彈發射井。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva09Subtitle
US: "*General, infrared scans of the area indicate that they are preparing to launch the Toxin Missiles"
DE: "*General, infrared scans of the area indicate that they are preparing to launch the Toxin Missiles"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, los barridos del área con infrarrojos indican que van a lanzar los misiles tóxicos."
IT: "\nGenerale, la scansione a infrarossi dell'area rivela\nche sono quasi pronti a lanciare i missili con\ntestata alle tossine."
KO: "장군님, 이 지역의 적외선 스캔 결과 적들은 독소 미사일 발사를 준비하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，紅外線掃瞄表示敵軍已經準備發射毒素飛彈。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva10Subtitle
US: "*Missile launch in 5 minutes Your final offensive should commence now"
DE: "*Missile launch in 5 minutes Your final offensive should commence now"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLanzamiento del misil en 5 minutos... Tu ofensiva final debe comenzar ya."
IT: "***"
KO: "5분 내에 미사일이 발사됩니다. 지금 마지막 공격을 시작해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n飛彈將在 5 分鐘後發射。現在開始做好最後的防禦準備。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva11Subtitle
US: "*Missile launch in 4 minutes"
DE: "*Missile launch in 4 minutes"
FR: "***"
