IT: "***"
KO: "미사일이 4분 내에 발사됩니다."
ZH: "\n飛彈將在 4 分鐘後發射。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva12Subtitle
US: "*Missile launch in 3 minutes"
DE: "*Missile launch in 3 minutes"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLanzamiento del misil en 3 minutos..."
IT: "***"
KO: "미사일이 3분 내에 발사됩니다."
