BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva13Subtitle
US: "*Missile launch in 2 minutes"
DE: "*Missile launch in 2 minutes"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLanzamiento del misil en 2 minutos..."
IT: "***"
KO: "미사일이 2분 내에 발사됩니다."
ZH: "\n飛彈將在 2 分鐘後發射。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva14Subtitle
US: "*Missile launch in 1 minute We must move in now!"
DE: "*Missile launch in 1 minute We must move in now!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLanzamiento del misil en 1 minuto... ¡Actuemos ya!"
IT: "***"
KO: "미사일이 1분 내에 발사됩니다. 지금 막아야 합니다!"
ZH: "\n飛彈將在 1 分鐘後發射，我們現在必須離開！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva15Subtitle
US: "*30 seconds until missile launch It's almost too late General!"
DE: "*30 seconds until missile lauch It's almost too late General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n30 segundos para el lanzamiento... ¡Ya casi no hay tiempo, general!"
IT: "***"
KO: "미사일 발사 30초 전입니다! 희망이 없어지고 있습니다!"
ZH: "\n距離飛彈發射還剩 30 秒，快來不及了，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva16Subtitle
US: "*10 seconds until missile launch"
DE: "*10 seconds until missile lauch"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n10 segundos para el lanzamiento..."
IT: "***"
KO: "미사일 발사 10초 전입니다!"
ZH: "\n距離飛彈發射還剩 10 秒。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva17Subtitle
US: "*5 4 3 2 1 (gasp) Toxin Missile Launch detected General"
DE: "*5 4 3 2 1 (gasp) Toxin Missile Launch detected General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n5... 4... 3... 2... 1... Lanzamiento de misil tóxico detectado."
IT: "***"
KO: "5..4..3..2..1 독소 미사일이 발사되었습니다, 장군님!"
ZH: "\n5、4、3、2、1 偵測到毒素飛彈發射升空，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva18Subtitle
US: "*Toxin Missile Impact has been detected and Hot Zone is now confirmed. The casualties are incalculable General, we have failed"
DE: "*Toxin Missile Impact has been detected and Hot Zone is now confirmed. The casualties are incalculable General, we have failed"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nImpacto de misil tóxico detectado; contaminación confirmada. Las bajas son incalculables, general; hemos fracasado."
IT: "\nL'impatto del missile tossico è stato confermato.\nIl numero delle vittime è incalcolabile.\nAbbiamo fallito, generale."
KO: "독소 미사일의 탄착지점이 확인되었고 사상자는 이루 말할 수 없습니다. 우리는 실패했습니다."
ZH: "\n毒素飛彈偵測到撞擊，災區已確認。傷亡損失無法估計，將軍，我們任務失敗。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva19Subtitle
US: "*The first Missile Silo has been captured and the HazMat decontamination team is en-route. One to go Commander"
DE: "*The first Missile Silo has been captured and the HazMat decontamination team is en-route. One to go Commander"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl primer silo de misiles ha sido tomado\ny el equipo de descontaminación está de camino.\nQuedan tres, comandante."
IT: "\nIl primo silo missilistico è stato catturato, la squadra di\ndecontaminazione è in arrivo.\nAncora tre, comandante."
KO: "첫 번째 미사일을 탈취했고 위험 물질 제독팀이 오는 중입니다. 하나 처리되었습니다."
ZH: "\n我們已經佔領第一座飛彈發射井，消除放射性污染的緊急應變小組已待命中。還有三座，指揮官。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva20Subtitle
US: "*Good job, sir. The second Missile Silo has been captured. Two to go"
DE: "*Good job, sir. The second Missile Silo has been captured. Two to go"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuen trabajo, señor. El segundo silo de misiles ha sido tomado. Quedan dos."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, signore: secondo silo catturato. Ne mancano due."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 두 번째 미사일이 탈취되었습니다. 앞으로 두 개 남았습니다."
ZH: "\n幹得好，長官，已佔領第二座發射井。還剩兩座。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva21Subtitle
US: "*Good job, sir. The third Missile Silo has been captured. One to go"
DE: "*Good job, sir. The third Missile Silo has been captured. One to go"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBuen trabajo, señor. El tercer silo de misiles ha sido tomado. Queda uno."
IT: "\nBene, signore, terzo silo missilistico catturato. Ne resta solo uno."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 세 번째 미사일이 탈취되었습니다. 앞으로 한 개 남았습니다."
ZH: "\n太好了，長官，已佔領第三座發射井。還剩一座。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva22Subtitle
US: "*Great work, General. We now have control of all 4 Toxin Missile silo's. The operation is a success"
DE: "*Great work, General. We now have control of all 4 Toxin Missile silo's. The operation is a success"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nExcelente trabajo, general. Controlamos los 4 silos de misiles tóxicos.\nLa operación ha sido un éxito."
IT: "\nOttimo lavoro, generale, ora controlliamo tutti e 4 i silo,\nl'operazione è riuscita."
KO: "훌륭합니다, 장군님. 모든 4기의 독소 미사일을 탈취했습니다. 작전 성공입니다."
ZH: "\n太完美了，長官。我們已經佔領所有四座毒素飛彈發射井，任務成功。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva23Subtitle
US: "*Toxin breach, you have 2 minutes to guide the Bio-engineer to the hot zone to neutralize the threat"
DE: "*Toxin breach, you have 2 minutes to guide the Bio-engineer to the hot zone to neutralize the threat"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nBrecha tóxica; tienes 2 minutos para guiar al bio-ingeniero hasta la contaminación para que la neutralice."
IT: "\nContaminazione tossica: avete due minuti per portare in\nzona la squadra di decontaminazione."
KO: "\n독소가 유출되고 있습니다! 2분 내로 생화학 기술자들을 인도하여 유출 지역으로 가서\n독소를 중화하십시오."
ZH: "\n你有兩分鐘的時間引導生化工程師至災區，解除毒素散佈的威脅。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva24Subtitle
US: "*We have a green light for the operation. Launch the attack on GLA's perimeter base"
DE: "*We have a green light for the operation. Launch the attack on GLA's perimeter base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa operación tiene luz verde. Ataca el perímetro de la base del GLA."
IT: "\nAbbiamo il via libera: assalite il perimetro della base dell'ELG."
KO: "작전에 청신호가 들어왔습니다. GLA의 주변 기지들을 공격하십시오."
ZH: "\n作戰還在持續進行當中，攻擊全球解放軍周邊的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva25Subtitle
US: "*Intel says that the Missile Sites we are looking for are in this region. Use caution and make sure those toxins aren't released"
DE: "*Intel says that the Missile Sites we are looking for are in this region. Use caution and make sure those toxins aren't released"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nSegún los informes, los silos de misiles que buscamos están en la región.\nTen cuidado y evita que se liberen las toxinas."
IT: "\nLe informazioni indicano la presenza dei silo in questa regione.\nProcedete con cautela e non disperdete\nle tossine nell'ambiente."
KO: "\n정보에 따르면 우리가 찾고 있는 미사일 사이트가 이 근처에 있다고 합니다.\n조심해서 독소가 새나가지 않도록 하십시오."
ZH: "\n情報顯示飛彈所在地點就在這一區，小心並確保別讓毒氣外散。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva26Subtitle
US: "*Infantry won't work well here, General. Our enemy is using toxins in almost every weapon that they throw at us"
DE: "*Infantry won't work well here, General. Our enemy is using toxins in almost every weapon that they throw at us"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa infantería no servirá de mucho aquí, general.\nEl enemigo usa toxinas en casi todo lo que nos lanza"
IT: "***"
KO: "여기서는 보병이 소용 없을 것입니다. 적은 거의 모든 무기에 독소를 사용하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n我方步兵在此無用武之地，將軍。敵軍使用的每一種武器幾乎都內含毒氣"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva27Subtitle
US: "*General, your objective is to capture this structure, not destroy it! If those toxins are released then the region will be contaminated for 100 square miles!"
DE: "*General, your objective is to capture this structure, not destroy it! If those toxins are released then the region will be contaminated for 100 square miles!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡General, hay que tomar el edificio, no destruirlo! ¡Si se liberan esas toxinas, se contaminarán 250 kilómetros cuadrados de la región!"
IT: "\nGenerale, l'obiettivo è conquistare la struttura, non distruggerla!"
KO: "\n장군님, 우리의 목표는 이 건물을 점령하는 것이지 파괴하는 것이 아닙니다!\n만약 독소가 새나간다면 이 곳의 반경 100 평방 마일이 오염될 것입니다!"
ZH: "\n將軍，你的任務是佔領而非摧毀這個建築！如果那些毒氣外洩的話，將近一百平方英里的區域將受毒害！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva28Subtitle
US: "*General, our intel indicates that if we can leak the napalm in those tanks into those nearby tunnels exits we can flood their whole system"
DE: "*General, our intel indicates that if we can leak the napalm in those tanks into those nearby tunnels exits we can flood their whole system"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nGeneral, inteligencia señala que podríamos inundar su sistema con una fuga del napalm de esos tanques que fluyera hacia los túneles."
IT: "\nGenerale, pare che facendo penetrare il napalm contenuto in quei serbatoi nei tunnel nelle vicinanze potrete allagare l'intero sistema."
KO: "\n장군님, 정보에 따르면 우리가 저 곳의 저장 탱크 안의 네이팜을 근처 터널들로 흘려보내면\n전체 시스템을 마비시킬 수 있다고 합니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，我方情報指出，如果我們將坦克內的汽油滲漏至附近的地道出口，將可完全癱瘓他們的系統。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva29Subtitle
US: "*Congratulations General. Dr. Thrax won't be poisoning the world with his creations any longer"
DE: "*Congratulations General. Dr. Thrax won't be poisoning the world with his creations any longer"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nFelicidades, general. El Dr. Thrax ya no seguirá envenenando al mundo"
IT: "\nCongratulazioni, generale."
KO: "축하합니다, 장군님. 스랙스 박사는 더이상 세계를 오염시키지 못할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n恭喜你，將軍。崔克斯博士無法再用新武器來荼毒這個世界了"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva30Subtitle
US: "*Now that Dr. Thrax is defeated we can finally bring our boys home. Good work, General"
DE: "*Now that Dr. Thrax is defeated we can finally bring our boys home. Good work, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTras derrotar al Dr. Thrax, podemos enviar a casa a nuestros chicos.\nBuen trabajo, general."
IT: "\nOra che il Dott. Thrax è stato sconfitto,\npossiamo riportare a casa i nostri ragazzi."
KO: "\n이제 스랙스 박사가 패했으니 우리 병사들을 집에 돌려보낼 수 있게 되었습니다.\n수고하셨습니다, 장군님."
ZH: "\n崔克斯博士已經被殲滅，我們終於能帶弟兄們回家了。幹得好，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva31Subtitle
US: "*We have a green light on Operation: Eagle's Strike. Launch the attack on Toxin Production facilities"
DE: "*We have a green light on Operation: Eagle's Strike. Launch the attack on Toxin Production facilities"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa operación tiene luz verde: Ataque del Águila. Lánzalo sobre las instalaciones de toxinas."
IT: "\nVia libera per l'operazione attacco dell'aquila. Assalite gli impianti di produzione delle tossine."
KO: "작전에 청신호가 들어왔습니다. 공습입니다. 공격을 독소 생산 시설에 퍼부으십시오."
ZH: "\n「鷹襲作戰」還在持續進行當中，全面攻擊毒素工廠。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva32Subtitle
US: "*General, your orders are to build a base to attack the Toxin General. As your forces are ready then capture the enemies 4 Toxin Missile sites before they can launch"
DE: "*General, your orders are to build a base to attack the Toxin General. As as your forces are ready then capture the enemies 4 Toxin Missile sites before they can launch"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas órdenes son crear una base para atacar al general de las toxinas. Cuando las fuerzas estén listas, toma los 4 emplazamientos enemigos de misiles tóxicos antes de que los lancen."
IT: "\nGenerale, dovete realizzare una base per assalire il Generale tossine. Quando le vostre forze saranno pronte, catturate i quattro silo prima del lancio dei missili."
KO: "\n장군님, 독소 제너럴을 공격할 기지를 만든 후, 병력이 준비 되면 적의 독소 미사일 4기를\n발사되기 전에 탈취하십시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，你的任務是建造一個基地以攻擊毒素將軍。一旦部隊備妥，在他們發射飛彈之前，盡快佔領敵軍\n的四座毒素飛彈發射井。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva33Subtitle
US: "*General, the GLA base to the east has decided to Rebel against the Toxin General and his mass use of toxins. They wish to aid us in our attack against the General by giving us use of their base"
DE: "*General, the GLA base to the east has decided to Rebel against the Toxin General and his mass use of toxins. They wish to aid us in our attack against the General by giving us use of their base"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa base del GLA del este se ha rebelado contra el general de las toxinas\nDesean ayudarnos en nuestro ataque al general cediéndonos su base."
IT: "***"
KO: "\n장군님, 동쪽의 GLA 기지는 독소 제너럴과 그의 독소 대량 사용에 대해 반기를 들기로\n결정했습니다. 그들은 자신들의 기지 사용을 허락했습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，位在東側的反全球解放軍部隊，可以幫助我們對抗毒素將軍以及大量的毒氣攻擊，並且還願意提\n供他們的基地以幫助我們攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva34Subtitle
US: "*General, the enemy has detected our presence in their main base and have begun launch preparations for the Toxin Missiles. The should have launch capability in approximately 30 minutes. Intel has located and revealed the 4 missile sites on your radar screen"
DE: "*General, the enemy has detected our presence in their main base and have begun launch preparations for the Toxin Missiles. The should have launch capability in approximately 30 minutes. Intel has located and revelaed the 4 missile sites on your radar screen"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl enemigo nos ha detectado e iniciado el lanzamiento de misiles con toxinas. Estarán en disposición de lanzarlos en unos 30 minutos. Hemos identificado los 4 emplazamientos en tu pantalla de radar."
IT: "\nGenerale, il nemico sa che ci troviamo all'interno della sua base e ha\niniziato i preparativi per il lancio dei missili.\nCi vorranno circa 30 minuti."
KO: "\n장군님, 적은 그들의 주 기지에 우리가 들어온 것을 탐지하고 독소 미사일 발사 준비에\n들어갔습니다. 약 30분 내로 발사될 이 미사일들은 레이더 스크린에 표시되었습니다."
ZH: "\n將軍，敵軍已偵測到我們出沒在他們的基地，並已做好毒素飛彈發射的準備，他們大約在30分鐘後擁有\n發射的能力。情報已在你的雷達螢幕顯示四座飛彈地點的位置。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xEva35Subtitle
US: "*General, Intel puts some of the Missiles in this region. Take care not to release the toxin!"
DE: "*General, Intel puts some of the Missiles in this region. Take care not to release the toxin!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nInteligencia sitúa algunos de los misiles en esta región. ¡Hay que evitar que se libere la toxina!"
IT: "\nGenerale, pare che alcuni dei missili si trovino in questa regione. Fate attenzione alla tossina!"
KO: "\n장군님, 정보국이 이 지역의 미사일들을 포착했습니다. 독소가 새어나가지 않도록\n주의하십시오!"
ZH: "\n將軍，情報顯示在這個區域有一些飛彈存在，小心處理不要讓毒氣外洩。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xThrax01Subtitle
US: "*You are too late infidel, the launch is commencing to cleanse your lands in pestilence. Hahahaha"
DE: "*You are too late infidel, the launch is commencing to cleanse your lands in pestilence. Hahahaha"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLlegas tarde, infiel: la purificación de tu pestilente tierra ya está en marcha. Ja, ja, ja, ja..."
IT: "\nTroppo tardi, infedele, il lancio è iniziato, la vostra terra sarà sconvolta dalla pestilenza, ah ah ah!"
KO: "\n이미 늦었어, 이교도 양반. 네놈의 나라를 전염병으로 쓸어버릴 미사일들의 발사가\n시작되고 있다네. 으하하하!"
ZH: "\n太遲了，野蠻人！毒氣飛彈發射後將會「靜」化你們死寂的大地。哇哈哈哈哈！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xThrax02Subtitle
US: "*Your betrayal has not gone unnoticed. You will burn with the infidels you now assist. May your sons camels swell with virulence!"
DE: "*Your betrayal has not gone unnoticed. You will burn with the infidels you now assist. May your sons camels swell with virulence!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTu traición no ha pasado desapercibida. Arderás con los infieles a los que ahora ayudas. ¡Así se mueran los camellos de tu hijo!"
IT: "\nIl vostro tradimento non sarà perdonato: brucerete con gli infedeli! Che i vostri figli muoiano fra i tormenti della malattia!"
KO: "\n네놈들의 배신은 이미 다 알아차렸다. 네놈들이 돕고 있는 이교도들과 더불어\n죽음을 맞을 것이다! 그리고 네놈들의 자녀들과 낙타들 모두 전염병에 희생될 것이다!"
ZH: "\n你以為你的背叛就這樣算了嗎？你會跟那些你幫助的野蠻人一樣，統統被燒死。願你的後代子孫因為劇\n毒，腫起像駱駝般的凸起物。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA05xThrax03Subtitle
US: "*My reach is long and now you will feel my wrath! Die infidel dogs, die!"
DE: "*My reach is long and now you will feel my wrath! Die infidel dogs, die!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMi radio de acción es amplio; ¡sentiréis mi furia! ¡Morid, perros infieles, morid!"
IT: "\nLa mia collera vi colpirà ovunque! A morte, cani infedeli, a morte!"
KO: "\n내가 갈 수 없는 곳은 없다! 가까이에 있으니 내 분노가 느껴지는가?\n죽어라 이교도의 개들, 죽어라!"
ZH: "\n我的所及範圍深遠，現在感受一下我復仇的滋味吧！去死吧，野狗！納命來！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA06Crusader101Subtitle
US: "*Enemy sighted!"
DE: "*Enemy sighted!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Enemigo a la vista!"
IT: "\nNemico individuato!"
KO: "적을 발견했다!"
ZH: "\n發現敵軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA06Crusader102Subtitle
