DE: "*More GLA. Lock and load"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nMás GLA. Preparad las armas."
IT: "\nAltre forze ELG. Pronti all'azione."
KO: "GLA 놈들이다! 공격 준비!"
ZH: "\n更多全球解放軍來襲，鎖定、裝填。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA06Crusader202Subtitle
US: "*They're too well dug in! We need reinforcements!"
DE: "*They're too well dug in! We need reinforcements!"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Están muy bien atrincherados! ¡Necesitamos refuerzos!"
IT: "\nSono ben difesi! Ci servono dei rinforzi!"
KO: "쉽게 없애지 못하겠는데? 지원군이 필요하다!"
ZH: "\n他們的防線太過堅強！我們需要增援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA06Crusader206Subtitle
US: "*Stop those Tractors!"
DE: "*Stop those Tractors!"
