BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA07Crusader204Subtitle
US: "*We've broken through to the north! Send reinforcements"
DE: "*We've broken through to the north! Send reinforcements"
FR: "***"
ES: "\n¡Nos hemos abierto paso hacia el norte! Necesitamos refuerzos."
IT: "\nAbbiamo sfondato a nord! Inviate dei rinforzi!"
KO: "북쪽이 뚫렸다! 지원군을 보내라!"
ZH: "\n我們北邊被攻破防線！快派援軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:MisUSA07Crusader205Subtitle
