IT: "***"
KO: "내 병력은 자네를 바람처럼 휩쓸고 갈 것이네, 장군."
ZH: "\n你的部隊遇到我們，就像秋風掃落葉一樣，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA003Subtitle
US: "*Your men are like sheep before my warriors"
DE: "*Your men are like sheep before my warriors"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 군대는 늑대 앞의 양과 같아."
ZH: "\n在我的戰士面前，你們就像溫馴的綿羊一般聽話。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA004Subtitle
US: "*Look at all the wonderful toys you have brought to me. I broke all my toys as a child, General, and now I will break yours"
DE: "*Look at all the wonderful toys you have brought to me. I broke all my toys as a child, General, and now I will break yours"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n정말 멋진 장난감들을 가져왔군, 장군. 어렸을 때 장난감들을 많이 부쉈는데,\n이번에는 자네 걸 부숴야겠어."
ZH: "\n看看你們帶來這些多麼棒的「玩具」啊，我小時候把所有的玩具都弄壞了，將軍，現在讓我再來摔你的\n好了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA005Subtitle
US: "*Your forces fall like wheat before my sword"
DE: "*Your forces fall like wheat before my sword"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 병력은 짚단처럼 쓰러질 것이네."
ZH: "\n你的部隊對我來說易如反掌。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA006Subtitle
US: "*You have done well against my Generals, but I have all of their power combined. What will you do against that, General?"
DE: "*You have done well against my Generals, but I have all of their power combined. What will you do against that, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n자네는 내 부하들을 상대로 잘 버텼지만, 난 내 부하들의 모든 장점을 갖추고 있지.\n과연 이번에도 잘 버틸 수 있을까?"
ZH: "\n你對抗我的將軍們時，表現得不錯，但是我擁有他們結合起來的力量。你將要怎麼對付我啊，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA007Subtitle
US: "*You will never even see my forces, Generaluntil it is too late"
DE: "*You will never even see my forces, Generaluntil it is too late"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "너무 늦고 나서야 내 병력을 볼 수 있을테지."
ZH: "\n你甚至沒有機會看到我的部隊，將軍，在那之前你就已經失敗了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA008Subtitle
US: "*We will sweep you from our lands, General"
DE: "*We will sweep you from our lands, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 땅에서 자네를 몰아내겠네, 장군."
ZH: "\n我們將把你掃出我們的土地，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA009Subtitle
US: "*Now you will see what your useless invasion has brought you, General"
DE: "*Now you will see what your useless invasion has brought you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 무의미한 침략이 어떤 건지 똑똑히 보게나, 장군."
ZH: "\n現在你看看那無效的攻擊你得到了什麼，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA010Subtitle
US: "*You have dared to challenge me--now you will reap the terrible reward"
DE: "*You have dared to challenge me--now you will reap the terrible reward"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "감히 내게 도전하다니... 끔찍한 종말을 맞으시게."
ZH: "\n你竟敢挑戰我 -- 現在你將獲得最「棒」的獎賞。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA011Subtitle
US: "*How do you feel, General, as the horsemen ride to your doorstep?"
DE: "*How do you feel, General, as the horsemen ride to your doorstep?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 병사들이 문 앞까지 다가가니 기분이 어떻소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n當騎兵已經前進到你的門前，你心裡是什麼滋味呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA012Subtitle
US: "*You've had your chance to retreat, now we will annihilate you"
DE: "*You've had your chance to retreat, now we will annihilate you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "후퇴할 기회를 포기하다니, 초토화시켜 주겠소."
ZH: "\n我不是沒給你機會撤退，現在我們準備要殲滅你了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA013Subtitle
US: "*Bear witness to the power of my will, General"
DE: "*Bear witness to the power of my will, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나의 강력한 의지를 두 눈으로 똑똑히 보시오, 장군."
ZH: "\n讓你親眼瞧瞧我的厲害，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA014Subtitle
US: "*My rage will tear your war-machine to dust"
DE: "*My rage will tear your war-machine to dust"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 분노는 자네의 전쟁 기계들을 먼지로 만들 것이네."
ZH: "\n我的仇恨會將你的機器大卸八塊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA015Subtitle
US: "*ToxinexplosivesstealthAny one of these you have defeated, but all three? All is lost, General. You should surrenderfor the good of your men"
DE: "*ToxinexplosivesstealthAny one of these you have defeated, but all three? All is lost, General. You should surrenderfor the good of your men"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n독소... 폭탄... 위장술... 이들 하나 하나는 정복했겠지만 한꺼번에 이들을 사용한다면?\n끝난 이야기지, 장군. 당신 병사들을 위해 항복하는 것이 좋겠네."
ZH: "\n毒素、炸藥，匿蹤，有哪一樣你曾被攻擊敗過，全部三種嗎？你已經全盤皆輸，將軍。為了保全你的手\n下，快投降吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA016Subtitle
US: "*Your world has made you soft, General. Mine has made me strong"
DE: "*Your world has made you soft, General. Mine has made me strong"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n자네가 살아온 세계는 당신을 나약하게 만들었소, 장군.\n내가 자라온 세계는 날 강하게 만들었지."
ZH: "\n你的世界使你變軟弱，將軍，我的世界則讓我更強大。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA017Subtitle
US: "*You will learn to respect my power, General"
DE: "*You will learn to respect my power, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 힘을 인정하게 될 것이오, 장군."
ZH: "\n你會學到如何尊重我的力量，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA018Subtitle
US: "*You will pause while I build my next attack, then the battle will resume"
DE: "*You will pause while I build my next attack, then the battle will resume"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 다음 공격을 준비하는 동안 자네는 한숨 돌리겠지만 곧 전투가 재개될테니 대비하게나."
ZH: "\n你將在我下一次攻擊前獲得喘息的機會，但是攻擊會持續的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA019Subtitle
US: "*Have you grown tired dying against my defenses, General?"
DE: "*Have you grown tired dying against my defenses, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 방어선 앞에서 죽어가는데 질렸나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n一直慘死在我的防禦之下，你會不會覺得厭煩，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA020Subtitle
US: "*The battlefield is quiet, General. Are you waiting for me to finish this?"
DE: "*The battlefield is quiet, General. Are you waiting for me to finish this?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전장이 조용하군, 내가 끝내길 바라시오?"
ZH: "\n戰場已經漸漸安靜下來，將軍。你在等我做個了結嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA021Subtitle
US: "*We await your next pathetic attack with great anticipation"
DE: "*We await your next pathetic attack with great anticipation"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 무의미한 공격을 부푼 마음으로 기다리고 있네."
ZH: "\n我們非常期盼你們下一波可憐的攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA022Subtitle
US: "*Has this been the extent of your power, General? Truly pathetic"
DE: "*Has this been the extent of your power, General? Truly pathetic"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 힘은 겨우 이 정도였나, 장군? 정말 어처구니 없군."
ZH: "\n這就是你們最後的招數了嗎，將軍！？真可憐。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA023Subtitle
US: "*Your attacks have been like pathetic screams amidst the howl of a raging storm"
DE: "*Your attacks have been like pathetic screams amidst the howl of a raging storm"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 공격은 마치 폭풍 속에서 부르짖는 비참한 비명소리같네."
ZH: "\n你的攻擊就像狂風所引起的可怕刺耳聲響，但是中看不中用。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA024Subtitle
US: "*This battle is beginning to bore me, General"
DE: "*This battle is beginning to bore me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전투가 싫증나기 시작했는걸, 장군."
ZH: "\n這場戰役開始讓我覺得無聊了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA025Subtitle
US: "*How much longer should I let you live, General?"
DE: "*How much longer should I let you live, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "얼마나 더 오래 살고 싶은가?"
ZH: "\n我到底應該讓你再活多久呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA026Subtitle
US: "*General, my subject require my attentionhow much longer do you intend to dance around like a clown?"
DE: "*General, my subject require my attentionhow much longer do you intend to dance around like a clown?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 내 부하들은 명령을 기다리고 있네. 언제까지 광대처럼 놀고 있을 거요?"
ZH: "\n將軍，我的任務目標令我驚覺我究竟還要忍受你裝傻抵抗多久？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA027Subtitle
US: "*General, your tactics remind me of a child learning to play chess"
DE: "*General, your tactics remind me of a child learning to play chess"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 당신의 전술은 막 체스를 처음 배운 아이의 모습이 연상되네."
ZH: "\n將軍，你的戰略讓我想起小孩子學下棋。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA028Subtitle
US: "*Are you done, General? Have you exhausted your pathetic resources?"
DE: "*Are you done, General? Have you exhausted your pathetic resources?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 끝났나, 장군? 미천한 자원을 모두 사용했소?"
ZH: "\n你好了嗎，將軍？你把那些可憐的資源都耗盡了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA029Subtitle
US: "*General, I was bored minutes ago--now I'm beginning to fall asleep"
DE: "*General, I was bored minutes ago--now I'm beginning to fall asleep"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 조금 전까진 지루했네... 이젠 졸리군."
ZH: "\n將軍，幾分鐘之前我已經覺得無聊 -- 現在我開始想睡了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA030Subtitle
US: "*How does it feel to challenge a true military genius?"
DE: "*How does it feel to challenge a true military genius?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "진정한 군사 전략가를 만나니 기분이 어떤가?"
ZH: "\n跟一個真正的軍事天才作戰是什麼感覺啊？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA031Subtitle
US: "*Anything you gain I will destroy"
DE: "*Anything you gain I will destroy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신이 얻는 건 그대로 부숴주겠네."
ZH: "\n任何你增加的一兵一卒，我都會把他毀了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA032Subtitle
US: "*Now your Barracks falls--soon all shall fall"
DE: "*Now your Barracks falls--soon all shall fall"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 당신 막사가 무너질 것이네... 그리고 다른 모든 것들도 뒤따를테지."
ZH: "\n現在你的兵營垮了 -- 整個基地很快的就要被摧毀了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA033Subtitle
US: "*Your War Factory is lost--rebuild it and I'll destroy it again"
DE: "*Your War Factory is lost--rebuild it and I'll destroy it again"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 군수공장은 이제 끝이네. 언제든 다시 건설해보시오. 다시 파괴해줄테니."
ZH: "\n你的戰車工廠被摧毀了 -- 就算再重建起來，我也會再次毀了它。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA034Subtitle
US: "*I have relieved you of your Air Field, General"
DE: "*I have relieved you of your Air Field, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 비행장의 부담을 덜어주겠네, 장군."
ZH: "\n我把你們的機場奪了過來，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA035Subtitle
US: "*Your base defenses cannot stop my forces, General"
DE: "*Your base defenses cannot stop my forces, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 기지 방어는 우리 부대를 멈추지 못해."
ZH: "\n你的基地防禦阻擋不了我的部隊，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA036Subtitle
US: "* General, if you cannot even hold on to your Command Center, how do you hope to defeat me?"
DE: "* General, if you cannot even hold on to your Command Center, how do you hope to defeat me?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 커맨드 센터 하나 제대로 못지키면서 감히 나를 이길려고 했단 말인가?"
ZH: "\n將軍，如果你連指揮中心都保不住的話，你要如何期望打贏這場仗？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA037Subtitle
US: "*So many of your structures have fallen, General--why not retreat the field and spare yourself any further embarrassment?"
DE: "*So many of your structures have fallen, General--why not retreat the field and spare yourself any further embarrassment?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 건물들이 너무 많이 파괴되었는데, 이제 그만 속편하게 도망치는게 어떤가?"
ZH: "\n這麼多的建築已經倒塌，將軍 -- 為什麼不現在撤退，不要讓自己輸得太難看吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA038Subtitle
US: "*Do not test my patience further by destroying any more of my Oil Derricks, General"
DE: "*Do not test my patience further by destroying any more of my Oil Derricks, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지금 성격 테스트하나? 내 원유 유정탑을 그만좀 파괴하시지?"
ZH: "\n不要再藉由摧毀油井來測試我忍耐的限度，好嗎，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA039Subtitle
US: "*You dare to destroy my Barracks, General?!"
DE: "*You dare to destroy my Barracks, General?!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 막사를 감히 파괴했나, 장군?!"
ZH: "\n你竟敢摧毀我的兵營，將軍？！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA040Subtitle
US: "*General, I require an Arms Dealer to do my business. Do not destroy another one"
DE: "*General, I require an Arms Dealer to do my business. Do not destroy another one"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이봐 장군, 난 무기상이 없으면 아무것도 못하니, 또 부수진 말게나."
ZH: "\n將軍，我需要軍火商跟我談生意，不要再摧毀另一個了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA041Subtitle
US: "*You think to crush my defenses, General? More will rise in their place"
DE: "*You think to crush my defenses, General? More will rise in their place"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 방어를 뚫을 수 있다고 생각하나? 그 자리에 더 많은 방어 시설이 들어설 걸세."
ZH: "\n你以為可以突破我的防線嗎，將軍？源源不絕的弟兄會堅守他們的崗位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA042Subtitle
US: "*That is the last building you will destroy, General. My patience has limits"
DE: "*That is the last building you will destroy, General. My patience has limits"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이게 당신이 부술 수 있는 마지막 건물일걸세. 나도 참는데는 한계가 있다고."
ZH: "\n那是最後一棟讓你摧毀的建築了，將軍。我的忍耐是有限度的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA043Subtitle
US: "*My Command Center! You have forced me to retreat underground, but this isn't over yet, General"
DE: "*My Command Center! You have forced me to retreat underground, but this isn't over yet, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 커맨드 센터!! 나를 지하로 피신하도록 만드는데, 이게 끝난건 아니지."
ZH: "\n我的指揮中心！你已經逼我撤到地下，但是戰爭還沒結束，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA044Subtitle
US: "*You have destroyed many of my machine, General. Perhaps I underestimated you"
DE: "*You have destroyed many of my machine, General. Perhaps I underestimated you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 차량들을 너무 많이 파괴했군. 내가 자넬 너무 과소평가한건 인정하지."
ZH: "\n你已經摧毀我許多武器，將軍。或許我太低估你了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA045Subtitle
US: "*My men are not targets for your practice, General. Their blood is on your hands"
DE: "*My men are not targets for your practice, General. Their blood is on your hands"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 병사들이 자네의 사격연습 상대는 아니지않은가! 자네 손은 그들의 피로 범벅이 되었네."
ZH: "\n我的弟兄們不是你練習的活靶，將軍。他們的生命掌握在你的手上。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA046Subtitle
US: "*Release my Oil Derrick or I will burn it down"
DE: "*Release my Oil Derrick or I will burn it down"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 원유 유정탑에서 물러나시지! 안그러면 불테워버릴테다!"
ZH: "\n放棄佔領我的油井，否則我就用一支火柴把它燒了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA047Subtitle
US: "*I see you've captured that derelict Artillery Platform. Best of luck making it work"
DE: "*I see you've captured that derelict Artillery Platform. Best of luck making it work"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "버려져 있는 캐논 플랫폼을 하나 점령했군. 어디 한번 잘써보게나."
ZH: "\n我知道你佔領了那個廢棄的砲兵陣地，先祝你好運，如果還能用的話。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA048Subtitle
US: "*That Oil Refinery will not turn the tide to your favor, General"
DE: "*That Oil Refinery will not turn the tide to your favor, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "정유 공장 하나로 전세가 뒤바뀌지는 않네."
ZH: "\n光靠那個煉油廠是不會成氣候的，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA049Subtitle
US: "*Impudent fool! You have invaded into my home far enough"
DE: "*Impudent fool! You have invaded into my home far enough"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어리석기는! 자넨 지금 우리 앞마당에 불법침입했네."
ZH: "\n放肆的傢伙！你竟敢侵入到我家來，真的是夠了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA050Subtitle
US: "*You are like a stinging insect, General, and it is time to squash your annoying presence"
DE: "*You are like a stinging insect, General, and it is time to squash your annoying presence"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자넨 성가신 벌레같단 말이야. 이제 벌레를 으깨죽일 때가 왔군."
ZH: "\n你就像一隻會咬人的昆蟲，將軍。該是把你打扁丟掉的時候了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA051Subtitle
US: "*The enemy is in our presence! Destroy him! Destroy them all!"
DE: "*The enemy is in our presence! Destroy him! Destroy them all!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "적이 앞에 있다! 다 없애버려!!"
ZH: "\n敵軍就在眼前！殲滅他們！全部殺光！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA052Subtitle
US: "*Fool! You have crossed the line! Your forces are forfeit!"
DE: "*Fool! You have crossed the line! Your forces are forfeit!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "바보같으니! 넘지 말아야 할 선을 넘었어. 자네 병력을 압수하겠네."
ZH: "\n豬頭！你太超過了！你的部隊將會是處罰！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA053Subtitle
US: "*Ah, a flanking attackcrude, but at least it is a strategy"
DE: "*Ah, a flanking attackcrude, but at least it is a strategy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아, 측면 공격이라. 조잡하긴 하지만 그래도 꼴에 전략은 쓰는군."
ZH: "\n嗯，零散的側翼攻擊，但是至少是個策略啦。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA054Subtitle
US: "*Attempting to attack my back-door, General?"
DE: "*Attempting to attack my back-door, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "뒷문으로 들어오시겠다?"
ZH: "\n想要從後面突襲嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA055Subtitle
US: "*A frontal attack? You should have brought more forces"
DE: "*A frontal attack? You should have brought more forces"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "정면 승부? 그렇다면 병력을 좀 더 데려왔어야지."
ZH: "\n至於正面攻擊呢？你要多帶一點兵力才是。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA056Subtitle
US: "*I see you've found my extra suppliesand I stress, my extra supplies. Leave them now"
DE: "*I see you've found my extra suppliesand I stress, my extra supplies. Leave them now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 여분의 보급물자를 발견했나본데, 다시 말하지만 그것들은 내 것이니까 놔두라고."
ZH: "\n我知道你已經發現我額外的補給，我強調一次，是額外的。馬上離開那裡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA057Subtitle
US: "*Approaching my base from that path will only lead you to death"
DE: "*Approaching my base from that path will only lead you to death"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그쪽에서 우리 기지로 접근해봤자 죽기밖에 더하겠나?"
ZH: "\n從那條路進入我的基地，只有死路一條。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA058Subtitle
US: "*Stay out of that village, General. I protect those under my care"
DE: "*Stay out of that village, General. I protect those under my care"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "마을에서 떨어지게, 장군. 그 마을은 내가 평화롭게 보호하는 곳이야."
ZH: "\n離開那個村莊，將軍，我來保護那些補給。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA059Subtitle
US: "*Those resources are for my people, General. They are not your for the taking"
DE: "*Those resources are for my people, General. They are not your for the taking"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 자원들은 우리 사람들을 위한 것인데 왜 막 가져가나."
ZH: "\n那些資源是要給我的人民的，將軍，不是要讓你帶走的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA060Subtitle
US: "*Those buildings were not placed here for your use, General. Do not disrupt my infrastructure"
DE: "*Those buildings were not placed here for your use, General. Do not disrupt my infrastructure"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 건물들은 자네가 쓰라고 있는 게 아니라네. 내 산업기반시설들을 망쳐놓지 말게."
ZH: "\n那些建築不是要供你用的，將軍，請不要破壞我的基礎建設。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA061Subtitle
US: "*It seems you appetite has overstretched your resources, General. I hope you get your power back up before we reach your base"
DE: "*It seems you appetite has overstretched your resources, General. I hope you get your power back up before we reach your base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 과욕이 능력을 앞서갔군. 우리가 자네 기지에 도착하기 전에 전력을 회복해놓길 바라네."
ZH: "\n看來你快吃光你的資源了，將軍。希望在我們到達你的基地之前，你還足夠支撐你的電力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA062Subtitle
US: "*Our land is without powertoo bad your base cannot run without its dependence"
DE: "*Our land is without powertoo bad your base cannot run without its dependence"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리 기지도 전기가 없긴 한데, 원래 우린 전기 없이도 잘 산다네."
ZH: "\n我們土地上沒有電力無妨，但是你的基地則不能不依賴它而存活。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA063Subtitle
US: "*Out of funds, General?"
DE: "*Out of funds, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자금이 떨어졌나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n資金不夠了嗎？將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA064Subtitle
US: "*General, you are taxing my resources. Your little war will cause my people to go hungry"
DE: "*General, you are taxing my resources. Your little war will cause my people to go hungry"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이봐 장군, 내 자원을 낭비하게 만드는군. 이 자잘한 전쟁으로 우리 국민들이 더 궁핍해지겠어."
ZH: "\n將軍，你在耗用我的資源，你這場小小的戰爭將導致我的人民走向飢餓。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA065Subtitle
US: "*A Scud Storm?! You have stolen our technology! You will pay for this, General"
DE: "*A Scud Storm?! You have stolen our technology! You will pay for this, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 폭풍? 우리 기술을 훔치다니! 반드시 댓가를 치를 거요."
ZH: "\n生化死雨風暴？！你偷了我們的技術！你完蛋了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA066Subtitle
US: "*Building nuclear weapons, General? I figured you would resort to such cowardice"
DE: "*Building nuclear weapons, General? I figured you would resort to such cowardice"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵 미사일을 건설한다고, 장군? 역시 겁장이는 그런 무기에 의존하는군."
ZH: "\n建造核子武器嗎？我早知道你是這麼懦弱膽怯的人了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA067Subtitle
US: "*Particle Cannon? Your beams from space cannot reach us beneath the earth"
DE: "*Particle Cannon? Your beams from space cannot reach us beneath the earth"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "파티클 캐논? 아무리 우주에서 광선을 발사해도 지하에 있는 우리는 못 건드릴텐데."
ZH: "\n離子砲？你覺得從太空打得到地球嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA068Subtitle
US: "*So many base defenses. You must truly fear my power, General"
DE: "*So many base defenses. You must truly fear my power, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "너무 방어 시설이 많군. 내가 그리도 무서운가?"
ZH: "\n這麼嚴密的基地防線啊，你一定怕死了我的力量吧，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA069Subtitle
US: "*How many tanks do you require, General?"
DE: "*How many tanks do you require, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "도대체 탱크가 몇 대나 필요한거야?"
ZH: "\n你還需要多少坦克才能擋住我呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA070Subtitle
US: "*You fill the air with those annoying gnats. Now we will swat them down"
DE: "*You fill the air with those annoying gnats. Now we will swat them down"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "하늘을 날파리들로 가득 채워놨군. 좀 있다가 처리해주지."
ZH: "\n你放了這麼多煩人的蚊子在空中，現在我們要把它一隻隻的打下來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA071Subtitle
US: "*Train all the men you wish, General, but the loss of life will only grow greater by the minute"
DE: "*Train all the men you wish, General, but the loss of life will only grow greater by the minute"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "원하는 만큼 많은 병사를 훈련시키게. 어차피 인명피해만 늘어날테니."
ZH: "\n訓練所有你要的人，將軍，但是人命的損失將會隨著每一分鐘而持續增加。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA072Subtitle
US: "*Your base has grown large, Generalperhaps too large"
DE: "*Your base has grown large, Generalperhaps too large"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 기지가 커가고 있군. 자네한텐 너무 커."
ZH: "\n你的基地愈來愈壯大了，但是好像也太大了吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA073Subtitle
US: "*Launch your toxins at us, General; we have prepared for much worse"
DE: "*Launch your toxins at us, General; we have prepared for much worse"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "독소를 우리에게 발사하게. 우린 더 심하게 다뤄줄테니."
ZH: "\n發射你的毒氣飛彈吧，將軍。我們已經做好最壞的打算了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA074Subtitle
US: "*Everyone, underground! Their nuclear missiles approach"
DE: "*Everyone, underground! Their nuclear missiles approach"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "모두들 지하로 숨어! 핵 미사일이 오고 있다!"
ZH: "\n每個人快到地底下！敵軍的核子飛彈接近中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA075Subtitle
US: "*Yes, use your particle beam--show the world your cowardice"
DE: "*Yes, use your particle beam--show the world your cowardice"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 파티클 빔을 한번 써보시지. 전 세계에 자네는 겁장이라고 알리라고."
ZH: "\n好的，秀出你的粒子光束 -- 讓全世界的人瞭解你的懦弱吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA076Subtitle
US: "*Garrison the building, General--hide like rats in a wall"
DE: "*Garrison the building, General--hide like rats in a wall"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "병사들을 건물에 주둔시킨다.. 벽 속에 숨는 쥐들같군!"
ZH: "\n守住建築吧，將軍 -- 不要像老鼠一樣躲在牆壁裡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA077Subtitle
US: "*Colonel Burton will not save you, General. You'll have to fight this war yourself"
DE: "*Colonel Burton will not save you, General. You'll have to fight this war yourself"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "버튼 대령이 자네를 구해주진 못해. 이 전쟁은 자네 스스로 싸워야 하네."
ZH: "\n貝頓將軍不會來救你的，將軍。你要靠自己救自己了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA078Subtitle
US: "*Ah, the beautiful Black Lotus. Join me, Lotus, and you could like as a queen"
DE: "*Ah, the beautiful Black Lotus. Join me, Lotus, and you could like as a queen"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오, 아름다운 흑수선. 내 편으로 오라구. 내가 여왕처럼 모실께!"
ZH: "\n哎呀，美麗的黑蓮花，加入我們吧，我們會待你如同皇后一般。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA079Subtitle
US: "*Jarmen Kell? He dares to stand against me?! My vengeance will be mostunpleasant"
DE: "*Jarmen Kell? He dares to stand against me?! My vengence will be mostunpleasant"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "쟈멘 켈? 그 놈이 나한테 대적한다고?! 가슴 아프지만 놈에게 복수해줘야겠군."
ZH: "\n賈曼卡爾？他竟敢對抗我？！我會很不客氣的進行復仇計畫。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA080Subtitle
US: "*Your Air Field will not stand against my assault, General"
DE: "*Your Air Field will not stand against my assault, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행장이 내 공격을 견뎌내진 못할텐데."
ZH: "\n你的機場無法承受我的攻擊的，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA081Subtitle
US: "*Finally built a War Factory, eh General? What took you so long?"
DE: "*Finally built a War Factory, eh General? What took you so long?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "드디어 군수 공장을 건설했군. 왜 이렇게 오래 걸렸어?"
ZH: "\n終於建好一座戰車工廠了，將軍？你的動作還真慢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA082Subtitle
US: "*Your pathetic Barracks will be of no use to you, General"
DE: "*Your pathetic Barracks will be of no use to you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 그 초라한 막사가 과연 쓸모 있을까?"
ZH: "\n你那可憐的兵營，對你沒有幫助的，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA083Subtitle
US: "*Selling off your buildings to fund your army? Hardly seems logical, does it, General"
DE: "*Selling off your buildings to fund your army? Hardly seems logical, does it, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자금을 조달하려고 건물을 팔아? 옳은 생각은 아닌듯 한데."
ZH: "\n賣了你的建築來資助軍隊？實在是不太合乎邏輯，不是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA084Subtitle
US: "*This is impossible! You cannot defeat me!"
DE: "*This is impossible! You cannot defeat me!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이건 불가능해! 자네는 날 이길 수 없어!"
ZH: "\n這怎麼可能！你不可能擊敗我！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA085Subtitle
US: "*You may think you have the upper-hand, but this battle will turn like the wind"
DE: "*You may think you have the upper-hand, but this battle will turn like the wind"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지금 자네가 앞선다고 생각하겠지만, 이 전투는 순식간에 뒤집어질거야."
ZH: "\n你可能認為現在你佔了上風，但是戰爭就跟風一樣，隨時都有可能轉向。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA086Subtitle
US: "*Your soldiers may outnumber mine now, but battles are won by more than numbers, General"
DE: "*Your soldiers may outnumber mine now, but battles are won by more than numbers, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n지금 자네 병사들이 내 병사들보다 많긴 하지.\n하지만 병사 수가 많다고 전쟁에 이기는 건 아니지."
ZH: "\n你的士兵或許比我的多，但是戰爭不是人多就會贏得勝利的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA087Subtitle
US: "*I can't believe that I'm being beaten by such a weak-minded fool. The shame will mark me forever"
DE: "*I can't believe that I'm being beaten by such a weak-minded fool. The shame will mark me forever"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 저런 겁장이한테 졌다는 게 믿기지 않는군. 이 치욕은 영원히 잊지 않겠네."
ZH: "\n真不敢相信我居然被一個這麼怯懦的笨蛋給打敗。這個恥辱會一輩子跟著我。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA088Subtitle
US: "*Defeated by a foolthe humiliation is too great to bearplease leave me to my torment"
DE: "*Defeated by a foolthe humiliation is too great to bearplease leave me to my torment"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "바보한테 져버리다니. 모욕감이 너무 크군. 날 좀 괴로워하게 내버려둬."
ZH: "\n被豬頭打敗的羞辱實在讓人無法承受，請你讓我解脫這個痛苦吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA089Subtitle
US: "*General, I smell the stench of fear and desperation coming from you base"
DE: "*General, I smell the stench of fear and desperation coming from you base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 자네의 기지에서 공포와 절망의 악취가 새어나왔소."
ZH: "\n將軍，我從你的基地聞到恐懼以及絕望的惡臭。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA090Subtitle
US: "* I sense the time of your demise growing near, General"
DE: "* I sense the time of your demise growing near, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신이 사망할 시간이 다가오는 게 느껴져."
ZH: "\n我感覺得到你的死期已近，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA091Subtitle
US: "*Your forces are beginning to be overrun, General. Soon they will be my prisoners"
DE: "*Your forces are beginning to be overrun, General. Soon they will be my prisoners"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 병력은 곧 패할 거요, 장군. 그들은 곧 내 포로가 되겠지."
ZH: "\n你的部隊即將要被殲滅，將軍。他們很快就會變成我的階下囚。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA092Subtitle
US: "*We are kicking you like a wounded goat, General. Admit defeat to spare your agony"
DE: "*We are kicking you like a wounded goat, General. Admit defeat to spare your agony"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리는 자네를 상처 입은 염소를 발로 차듯 하고 있네. 고통에서 벗어나려면 패배를 인정하게."
ZH: "\n你現在就像是隻受傷的山羊，將軍。快承認失敗解脫你的苦痛吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA093Subtitle
US: "*You are defeated. This is what happens to all who stand against me , General"
DE: "*You are defeated. This is what happens to all who stand against me , General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자넨 졌어. 나한테 도전하면 다 이렇게 되지."
ZH: "\n你被擊敗了，將軍，這就是所有與我為敵的人的下場。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA094Subtitle
US: "*You are a fool to challenge me, General"
DE: "*You are a fool to challenge me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나한테 도전한 것 자체가 자네는 바보라는 걸 말해주지."
ZH: "\n你跟我打？真的是笨到家了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA095Subtitle
US: "*All the powers of the GLA are at my disposal"
DE: "*All the powers of the GLA are at my disposal"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "GLA의 모든 힘이 나에게 있다."
ZH: "\n所有全球解放軍部隊都在我指揮之下。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA096Subtitle
US: "*I am more dangerous than all my three Generals combined"
DE: "*I am more dangerous than all my three Generals combined"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나는 우리 3명의 장군을 다 합친 것보다 더 강력해."
ZH: "\n我比我的三個將軍加起來還要具威脅性。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA097Subtitle
US: "*You have won, General. Why do you continue to torture me by examining these statistics?"
DE: "*You have won, General. Why do you continue to torture me by examining these statistics?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네가 이겼네, 장군. 전투 통계를 보면서 날 좀 더 괴롭게 만들지 그러나?"
ZH: "\n你贏了，將軍。你為什麼還要繼續用這些統計數字來折麼我呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA098Subtitle
US: "*Yes, you can now see why you have lostthe numbers speak for themselves"
DE: "*Yes, you can now see why you have lostthe numbers speak for themselves"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 자네는 왜 패배했는지 게임 통계를 보면서 반성할 필요가 있어."
ZH: "\n是的，你可以仔細看看你的傷亡數字在說話。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA099Subtitle
US: "*You have traveled far and faced many opponents to reach me General"
DE: "*You have traveled far and faced many opponents to reach me General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "많은 장군들을 상대하며 여기까지 오느라 수고 많았네."
ZH: "\n你大老遠跑來，而且過關斬將才找到我，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA100Subtitle
US: "*I commend your efforts, but they have wholly unprepared you for what you are about to face"
DE: "*I commend your efforts, but they have wholly unprepared you for what you are about to face"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "노력은 가상하지만, 그들은 자네에게 무슨 일이 생길지는 알려주지 않았군."
ZH: "\n對於你的努力，我要給你拍拍手，但是你的士兵根本還沒準備好他們所要面對的一切。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA101Subtitle
US: "*You have faced Dr. Thrax's toxic warriors; Kassad's stealth legions and Juhziz's demolitions, but I taught them all in the art of war"
DE: "*You have faced Dr. Thrax's toxic warriors; Kassad's stealth legions and Juhziz's demolitions, but I taught them all in the art of war"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n스랙스 박사의 독소 전사들, 카사드의 스텔스 군단, 유지즈의 폭발물 등에 맞서 싸워왔겠지.\n하지만 그들은 다 내가 가르쳤어."
ZH: "\n你已經見識到崔克斯博士的毒氣戰士；科塞德的匿蹤部隊；莊斯的炸藥，但是我只有教導他們戰爭的藝\n術，並非實際作戰經驗。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA102Subtitle
US: "*This will be your final battle, General. May whatever gods you pray to have mercy on youbecause I will not"
DE: "*This will be your final battle, General. May whatever gods you pray to have mercy on youbecause I will not"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n이것이 자네의 마지막 전투가 될것이네. 어떤 신을 믿건 빨리 자비를 구하는 기도를 해놓게.\n왜냐하면 나는 자비를 베풀 생각이 없거든."
ZH: "\n這將是你最後的戰役了，將軍，希望你所信奉的神會拯救你，因為我將摧毀你。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossGLA103Subtitle
US: "*This will be your final battle, General. Make your peace and prepare for the end"
DE: "*This will be your final battle, General. Make your peace and prepare for the end"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이번이 자네의 마지막 전투가 될걸세. 마음을 평안히 가지고 마지막 가는 길을 준비하게."
ZH: "\n這將是你最後的戰役了，將軍，準備安息吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA001Subtitle
US: "*Well, there you are. Too late to run now, Boy"
DE: "*Well, there you are. Too late to run now, Boy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "음, 거기 있군. 도망가긴 늦었지?"
ZH: "\n逮到你了，來不及逃了，年輕人。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA002Subtitle
US: "*I hope you're ready, cause we're coming for ya"
DE: "*I hope you're ready, cause we're coming for ya"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "준비 되었길 바라네, 곧 공격 가거든."
ZH: "\n希望你已經準備好了，因為我們來了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA003Subtitle
US: "*Set the table, Kid, cause we're coming for dinner"
DE: "*Set the table, Kid, cause we're coming for dinner"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "꼬마야 상 차려 놓아라! 저녁 먹으러 간다!"
ZH: "\n等著吧，小子，我們準備痛宰你一頓了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA004Subtitle
US: "*I've got three things to teach you, Kid: How to lose; how to cry; and how to die"
DE: "*I've got three things to teach you, Kid: How to lose; how to cry; and how to die"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 전투에서 내가 딱 세 가지만 가르쳐주지. 어떻게 지는가. 어떻게 우는가. 어떻게 죽는가."
ZH: "\n我會教你三件事：怎麼輸，怎麼哭還有怎麼死！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA005Subtitle
US: "*We're coming to attack soon, so get out all your white flags"
DE: "*We're coming to attack soon, so get out all your white flags"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "곧 쳐들어 갈테니 백기 준비해놓게."
ZH: "\n我們就要發動攻擊了，快準備好你的白旗吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA006Subtitle
US: "*Here we come, Kidtry not to wet yourself, okay?"
DE: "*Here we come, Kidtry not to wet yourself, okay?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "곧 쳐들어간다 꼬마, 무섭다고 오줌싸면 혼날줄 알게."
ZH: "\n我們來了，希望你不要嚇得尿褲子，小子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA007Subtitle
US: "*What part of \"die\" didn't you understand?"
DE: "*What part of \"die\" didn't you understand?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "죽음에 대해서 뭘 더 가르쳐주면 되겠나?"
ZH: "\n\"死亡\"的哪個部分是您不明白的？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA008Subtitle
US: "*Ooh, you're going to get it now, Kid"
DE: "*Ooh, you're going to get it now, Kid"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오, 이제 곧 간다, 꼬마야"
ZH: "\n你的死期到了，小子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA009Subtitle
US: "*You ready? Cause here comes a tactic you may have learned in school. You ready to go back to school?"
DE: "*You ready? Cause here comes a tactic you may have learned in school. You ready to go back to school?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "학교에서 배웠을만한 전술을 보여주겠네. 다시 수업 들을 준비 되었나?"
ZH: "\n你準備好了？現在我要用的這個戰術，你可能以前已經學過。你準備要回學校了上課嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA010Subtitle
US: "*It's time for me to teach you a thing or two about the back of my hand"
DE: "*It's time for me to teach you a thing or two about the back of my hand"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 가진 게 무엇인지 가르쳐줄 때가 왔군."
ZH: "\n該是我教你一兩樣關於我的手背的事了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA011Subtitle
US: "*You should have run when you had the chance. Now I'm going to teach you the meaning of respect"
DE: "*You should have run when you had the chance. Now I'm going to teach you the meaning of respect"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기회가 있었을 때 도망쳤어야 했네. 이제 내가 왜 존경받는지를 가르쳐주겠네."
ZH: "\n當你一有機會，你真的應該逃跑的。現在我要來教教你尊重的意義。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA012Subtitle
US: "*So, about your funeralopen casket or closed?"
DE: "*So, about your funeralopen casket or closed?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 장례식 얘기좀 해보지. 관은 개방형, 밀폐형 중에 어떤 걸 고르려나?"
ZH: "\n所以是關於你的葬禮開棺還是蓋棺？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA013Subtitle
US: "*I'm gonna march into your base and plant my foot in your butt, <sarcastic> \"General.\""
DE: "*I'm gonna march into your base and plant my foot in your butt, <sarcastic> \"General.\""
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 곧 자네 기지로 쳐들어가서 내 발을 자네 엉덩이에 심어주지."
ZH: "\n我準備進入你的基地，然後用腳踢你的屁股。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA014Subtitle
US: "*Here we come, Punk--step aside or get stepped on"
DE: "*Here we come, Punk--step aside or get stepped on"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 간다! 물러서지 않으면 나한테 밟히지."
ZH: "\n我們來了，笨蛋 -- 讓開一點要不然就來吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA015Subtitle
US: "*You call yourself a \"General\"? I call you a pain in the butt, is what I call you"
DE: "*You call yourself a \"General\"? I call you a pain in the butt, is what I call you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자신을 장군이라고 부르나? 이제부터 난 자네를 엉덩이의 종기라고 부르기로 했네."
ZH: "\n您稱呼您自己是位將軍\"\"？我說您是個搗蛋鬼才對，我說的才是事實"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA016Subtitle
US: "*This is your idea of strategy? Of tactics? \"Tank blob\" is the best you can come up with? Patheticjust pathetic"
DE: "*This is your idea of strategy? Of tactics? \"Tank blob\" is the best you can come up with? Patheticjust pathetic"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n이게 자네가 생각하는 전략이란 건가? 전술? 탱크 부스러기들이 전부라니..\n비참하군. 정말 비참해."
ZH: "\n這是您的策略？還是戰略？ \"坦克車隊\"是您想出的最好辦法阿？真是可憐又可悲呀"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA017Subtitle
US: "*Yeah, I've read Sun Tzu too, Sport: \"Greater enemy--retreat. Smaller enemy--attack.\" Is that all you got for me?"
DE: "*Yeah, I've read Sun Tzu too, Sport: \"Greater enemy--retreat. Smaller enemy--attack.\" Is that all you got for me?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n그래 손자병법은 나도 읽었지. '적이 강하면 후퇴하고 약하면 공격하라'\n지금 이 전술을 행하는 건가?"
ZH: "\n我也讀過孫子，老兄： \"敵眾則退之；敵寡則攻之。 \"這是您想告訴我的嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA018Subtitle
US: "*So, where's your army, Boy? Or did you just want to bare-knuckle it? Cause I'll slap you down with my bare hands if you want. You want a piece of that, Boy?"
DE: "*So, where's your army, Boy? Or did you just want to bare-knuckle it? Cause I'll slap you down with my bare hands if you want. You want a piece of that, Boy?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n그래, 자네 병력은 다 어디 있지? 그냥 일대일로 붙자는 건가?\n뭐 원한다면 그렇게 해주지만 아마 나한테 박살날걸? 그걸 원하나? 응?"
ZH: "\n所以，你的軍隊呢，小子？還是你就一個人要跟我硬上？因為我只要赤手空拳就可以把你撂倒，如果你\n要的話。你要嚐嚐看嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA019Subtitle
US: "*You got me out of bed for this? I aught to take you over my knee right now"
DE: "*You got me out of bed for this? I aught to take you over my knee right now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "겨우 이런 소동을 부릴려고 자는 나를 깨운건가? 무릎 꿇고 사죄하게 만들어주지."
ZH: "\n你把我從床上叫起來就為了這個？我應該現在就把你取而代之。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA020Subtitle
US: "*I got more medals than you've got teeth, Boywhich won't be saying much after I get done knocking them out for you"
DE: "*I got more medals than you've got teeth, Boywhich won't be saying much after I get done knocking them out for you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n내 훈장은 자네 이빨 수보다 많다네, 애송이 친구.\n그나마 내가 후려 갈겨서 좀 날려주면 더 차이나겠군."
ZH: "\n我拿過的勳章比你現在的牙齒還要多，小子。在我把他們都擊敗之後就不用解釋太多，你應該瞭解吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA021Subtitle
US: "*Are you putting all of your defenses at the front of your base? You don't think we can go around that? Well, do you?"
DE: "*Are you putting all of your defenses at the front of your base? You don't think we can go around that? Well, do you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n지금 병력을 다 전면에만 배치한 건가?\n우리가 뒤로 돌아 들어갈 수도 있다는 생각은 안해봤고? 안그래?"
ZH: "\n你把所有的兵力都放在基地的前方嗎？你不認為我們可以繞過那裡，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA022Subtitle
US: "*Boy, you think I'm playing with you? You better think again"
DE: "*Boy, you think I'm playing with you? You better think again"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지금 장난하는 건가? 다시 잘 좀 생각해보라고."
ZH: "\n小子，你以為我是在跟你玩嗎？你最好想清楚一點。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA023Subtitle
US: "*Better check your flanks there, Partner; I think some of my troops just snuck into your base"
DE: "*Better check your flanks there, Partner; I think some of my troops just snuck into your base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "측면을 잘 확인하는게 좋을거야. 내 병사 몇명이 자네 기지를 향해 몰래 접근하거든."
ZH: "\n最好再確認一下你的側翼防線，伙伴；我想我的部隊剛剛已經混進你的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA024Subtitle
US: "*Do you think this is a game? Well do you? Wait, don't answer that"
DE: "*Do you think this is a game? Well do you? Wait, don't answer that"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이게 그냥 게임이라고 생각하나? 정말? 아 잠깐, 대답 안해도 되네."
ZH: "\n你以為這是一場遊戲嗎？是這樣嗎？等一下，不要回答。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA025Subtitle
US: "*Kid, who taught you military tactics? Huh? Cause you should go slap him square in the mouth, I tell you"
DE: "*Kid, who taught you military tactics? Huh? Cause you should go slap him square in the mouth, I tell you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n애송이 친구, 군사 전략은 대체 누구한테 배웠어?\n그 가르쳐준 작자를 당장 찾아가서 입을 한방 갈겨주게."
ZH: "\n小子，誰教你軍事戰略的？是誰？我告訴你，你應該去替他掌嘴。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA026Subtitle
US: "*I have the whole United States military behind me, Son, and I've just decided that we don't like you"
DE: "*I have the whole United States military behind me, Son, and I've just decided that we don't like you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "모든 미국군이 내 편이야. 그리고 우리는 이제 자네를 좀 미워해주기로 결정했네."
ZH: "\n我們全部的美國軍隊都在我們身後，小子，而且我們決定不喜歡你了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA027Subtitle
US: "*Is this tactic of yours supposed to be some kind of joke I'm not aware of?"
DE: "*Is this tactic of yours supposed to be some kind of joke I'm not aware of?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이게 전술인가 아니면 내가 요즘 못들어본 새로운 농담인가?"
ZH: "\n你的戰略是我不知道的某種笑話嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA028Subtitle
US: "*So, you're not a real general, are you? You're like the Surgeon General or something like that, right?"
DE: "*So, you're not a real general, are you? You're like the Surgeon General or something like that, right?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그러니까 자네는 진짜 장군이 아니로구만. 혹시 똘이장군 아닌가?"
ZH: "\n所以，你不是真正的將軍，是吧？你是類似外科將軍之類的吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA029Subtitle
US: "*Does your mommy know you're out by yourself?"
DE: "*Does your mommy know you're out by yourself?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지금 혼자 나와 있는걸 자네 엄마가 아시나?"
ZH: "\n你親愛的媽媽知道你自己一個人跑了出來嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA030Subtitle
US: "*You can tell me.. We're just Generals here Do your men know you're incompetent?"
DE: "*You can tell me.. We're just Generals here Do your men know you're incompetent?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n괜찮아, 나한테 말해도 되네. 장군끼리 있으니 하는 말인데,\n자네 병사들이 자네가 바보라는 건 눈치 챘나?"
ZH: "\n既然我們在場的都是將軍，你告訴我句實話…你的弟兄知道你根本沒有能力的事嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA031Subtitle
US: "*Did you know you just lost a Tech Building, Sport?"
DE: "*Did you know you just lost a Tech Building, Sport?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 방금 테크 빌딩을 잃은 걸 아나?"
ZH: "\n你知道你剛損失一個科技建築嗎，老兄？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA032Subtitle
US: "*Just blew-up your Barracks, Skippy. What you gonna do about it?"
DE: "*Just blew-up your Barracks, Skippy. What you gonna do about it?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 막사를 방금 날려버렸네. 이제 어떻게 할 건가?"
ZH: "\n剛剛炸了你的兵營，隊長。你該怎麼辦呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA033Subtitle
US: "*There goes your War Factory. You mad yet, Boy?"
DE: "*There goes your War Factory. You mad yet, Boy?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이번엔 군수공장을 날렸네. 아직 화 안났지, 친구?"
ZH: "\n現在是你的戰車工廠。你還沒瘋嗎，小子？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA034Subtitle
US: "*I don't know why you bothered to build that Air Field if you aren't going to protect it"
DE: "*I don't know why you bothered to build that Air Field if you aren't going to protect it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "방어하지도 못할 비행장은 왜 건설했나?"
ZH: "\n我不懂你為何要花時間建設機場，因為你根本守不住嘛。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA035Subtitle
US: "*Who put these base defenses down like this? They can't defend anything like that"
DE: "*Who put these base defenses down like this? They can't defend anything like that"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "누가 기지 방어를 이런 식으로 했어? 이래가지고 방어를 할 수 있겠나?"
ZH: "\n是誰把基地的防禦摧殘殆盡的？他們承受不了這種打擊的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA036Subtitle
US: "*I should let you build another Command Center just so I could knock it down again"
DE: "*I should let you build another Command Center just so I could knock it down again"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나중에 커맨드 센터를 다시 짓게 해주겠네. 그러니까 이건 없어도 되지?"
ZH: "\n我應該讓你建造另一個指揮中心，這樣我才能再摧毀它一次。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA037Subtitle
US: "*I feel like I'm kicking over sand castles. How many of your buildings you gonna let me destroy there, Sport?"
DE: "*I feel like I'm kicking over sand castles. How many of your buildings you gonna let me destroy there, Sport?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "마치 모래성을 부수는 기분이군. 내가 건물을 몇개까지 부수도록 놔둘건가, 친구?"
ZH: "\n我覺得我好像在踢垮用沙堆的城堡一樣。還有多少建築你打算讓我這麼輕鬆的摧毀呢，老兄？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA038Subtitle
US: "*I let you have that Tech Building, Boy. I don't need it to beat you"
DE: "*I let you have that Tech Building, Boy. I don't need it to beat you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 그 테크 빌딩들 없어도 난 자네를 이길 수 있네."
ZH: "\n我讓你的科技建築苟延殘喘，因為我根本不需要它來擊敗你。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA039Subtitle
US: "*Kid, that Barracks was not a military target. Do that again and this will get ugly"
DE: "*Kid, that Barracks was not a military target. Do that again and this will get ugly"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "애송이 친구, 그 막사는 중요 시설이 아니야. 근데 한번만 더 그러면 가만 안놔두겠네."
ZH: "\n小子，那個兵營不是我們的軍事目標。不要再做這種破壞名譽的事了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA040Subtitle
US: "*You better stand down, Son--I'm not going to stand for you blowing-up my War Factories, you hear?"
DE: "*You better stand down, Son--I'm not going to stand for you blowing-up my War Factories, you hear?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "조심해, 꼬마녀석. 내 군수공장을 파괴하고 무사할 줄 알면 오산이야. 내 말 들리나!"
ZH: "\n你最好退下，小子 -- 我不能容許你炸掉我的戰車工廠，聽到了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA041Subtitle
US: "*Do you know how much those jets cost? I coulda fed the whole world with what you just destroyed"
DE: "*Do you know how much those jets cost? I coulda fed the whole world with what you just destroyed"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 전투기들이 얼마인지나 알아? 지금 파괴된 비행기들을 팔면 수억명은 먹여살린다고!"
ZH: "\n你知道那些飛機價值多少嗎？你剛剛摧毀了我要供應給全世界的量。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA042Subtitle
US: "*Cracking my defenses, huh? Well, go on--it should be me just enough time to overrun your base"
DE: "*Cracking my defenses, huh? Well, go on--it should be me just enough time to overrun your base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지 방어의 헛점을 찾으셨다? 좋아, 계속 해보시지. 나도 똑같이 해줄테니."
ZH: "\n衝破我的防線嗎？好啊 -- 只要我就足夠摧毀你的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA043Subtitle
US: "*That's enough buildings, Son. Why don't you try attacking my forces now"
DE: "*That's enough buildings, Son. Why don't you try attacking my forces now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 건물은 이제 충분히 부쉈으니 내 부대와 한번 붙어보지 그러나?"
ZH: "\n夠了吧，不用再摧毀建築了。為什麼不試試攻擊我的部隊呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA044Subtitle
US: "*My Command Center?! You think I'm just going to sit here and take that?"
DE: "*My Command Center?! You think I'm just going to sit here and take that?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 커맨드 센터! 내가 그 안에 앉아서 당하고 있을줄 알았나?"
ZH: "\n我的指揮中心？！你以為我就只坐在這裡等你攻下它嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA045Subtitle
US: "*You had best leave my pilots alone, Boy. Planes are one thing, but you let my pilots return safe, you hear?"
DE: "*You had best leave my pilots alone, Boy. Planes are one thing, but you let my pilots return safe, you hear?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n내 조종사들은 건드리지 않는게 좋을거야.\n비행기까지는 괜찮은데 조종사들은 무사히 돌려보내주게, 알겠나?"
ZH: "\n你最好不要動我的飛行員一根汗毛，飛機就另當別論，但是最好讓飛行員平安回來，聽到了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA046Subtitle
US: "*You're a sneaky little 'cuss, aren't you? But I think that's enough of my vehicles destroyed, don't you?"
DE: "*You're a sneaky little 'cuss, aren't you? But I think that's enough of my vehicles destroyed, don't you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 교활한 인간 같으니.. 이제 우리 차량은 부술만큼 부쉈지?"
ZH: "\n你真是個鬼鬼祟祟的小傢伙啊？但是我的武器就治得了你了，不是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA047Subtitle
US: "*Let's get armor and air support out there--our grunts are getting torn apart!"
DE: "*Let's get armor and air support out there--our grunts are getting torn apart!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기갑부대와 공중 유닛으로 저 보병들을 지원하라! 크게 당하고 있다!"
ZH: "\n讓我們去那裡尋求裝甲部隊和空中支援吧 -- 弟兄們快被擊潰了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA048Subtitle
US: "*Let that Oil Derrick go, Boy. This war ain't about the price of gas you know"
DE: "*Let that Oil Derrick go, Boy. This war ain't about the price of gas you know"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "원유 유정탑은 그냥 가지게나. 뭐 이 전쟁이 기름값 때문에 하는 전쟁도 아니고."
ZH: "\n放過那座油井吧，這場戰爭跟石油扯不上什麼關係。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA049Subtitle
US: "*Think you know how to use that Artillery Platform, Son?"
DE: "*Think you know how to use that Artillery Platform, Son?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "캐논 플랫폼 사용법은 알고 있긴 한가?"
ZH: "\n我想你應該知道怎麼利用砲兵陣地吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA050Subtitle
US: "*That Oil Refinery is not a viable target, Son. And it don't belong to you, so we're coming to get it back"
DE: "*That Oil Refinery is not a viable target, Son. And it don't belong to you, so we're coming to get it back"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "정유 공장은 중요하지 않아. 게다가 원래 자네 것이 아니니까 곧 뺏으러 가겠네."
ZH: "\n那座煉油廠沒有什麼用途，而且他不屬於你，我們要把它要回來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA051Subtitle
US: "*Well, you managed to get to my side of the map. Didn't think you had it in ya"
DE: "*Well, you managed to get to my side of the map. Didn't think you had it in ya"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어떻게 내 기지까지 오긴 왔군. 자네랑 같은 지도에 있는 줄 몰랐어."
ZH: "\n你想要從我這裡取得地圖，門都沒有。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA052Subtitle
US: "*You planning to attack, or you just going to stand out there all day?"
DE: "*You planning to attack, or you just going to stand out there all day?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "공격 준비하나? 아니면 하루 종일 거기 서있을건가?"
ZH: "\n你要進攻了嗎？還是你要站在那裡一整天呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA053Subtitle
US: "*You'll get out of my base if you know what's good for you, Boy"
DE: "*You'll get out of my base if you know what's good for you, Boy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지에서 빨리 사라지는게 좋을거야, 애송이 친구."
ZH: "\n如果你知道怎麼樣對你比較好，就滾出我的基地吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA054Subtitle
US: "*Enemy's in our perimeter--all forces repel the invaders"
DE: "*Enemy's in our perimeter--all forces repell the invaders"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "적이 우리 기지 반경에 있다. 전군, 침입자를 제거하라."
ZH: "\n敵軍靠近 -- 所有部隊全力抵抗入侵者來襲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA055Subtitle
US: "*Those ain't your supplies, Sport. Best to step-off now, before you get hurt"
DE: "*Those ain't your supplies, Sport. Best to step-off now, before you get hurt"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "저것들은 자네의 서플라이가 아니야. 다치기 전에 손떼는게 좋을걸세."
ZH: "\n那些不是你的補給，老兄。最好在你受傷之前盡快離開。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA056Subtitle
US: "*A flanking attack?! Don't make me laugh, Boy"
DE: "*A flanking attack?! Don't make me laugh, Boy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "옆구리 공격? 간지럽히지 말게, 친구."
ZH: "\n側翼攻擊？！不要笑死我了，小子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA057Subtitle
US: "*Trying to attack from my back-door? Good luck with that"
DE: "*Trying to attack from my back-door? Good luck with that"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오호, 뒤에서 침입하시겠다? 행운을 비네."
ZH: "\n想要從背後進攻？祝你好運了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA058Subtitle
US: "*You coming to attack me, Boy? Nice to see you have some guts"
DE: "*You coming to attack me, Boy? Nice to see you have some guts"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "날 공격하겠다고? 용기 한번 가상하군."
ZH: "\n你要來攻擊我，小子？真高興看到你還有些膽量。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA059Subtitle
US: "*Get away from my Tech buildings, if you know what's good for you"
DE: "*Get away from my Tech buildings, if you know what's good for you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "목숨이 소중한지 안다면 내 테크 빌딩에서 멀리 떨어져!"
ZH: "\n如果你知道什麼是對你好的，就滾開我的科技建築。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA060Subtitle
US: "*My forces have your base in sight, Kid. What you gonna do now?"
DE: "*My forces have your base in sight, Kid. What you gonna do now?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 기지가 슬슬 보이는군. 이제 어떻게 할건가?"
ZH: "\n你的基地就在我們眼前，小子。你現在怎麼辦？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA061Subtitle
US: "*Here comes the hammer, Punk, and you don't want to be the nail"
DE: "*Here comes the hammer, Punk, and you don't want to be the nail"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여기 망치가 간다네 ,친구. 못이 되고 싶진 않겠지?"
ZH: "\n鐵鎚來了，笨蛋，你該不會想要當釘子吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA062Subtitle
US: "*Knock-knock, we're coming in!"
DE: "*Knock-knock, we're coming in!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "똑똑, 들어갑니다!"
ZH: "\n衝啊，我們要攻進來了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA063Subtitle
US: "*Things are about to get real bad for you, Sport. Don't say I didn't warn you"
DE: "*Things are about to get real bad for you, Sport. Don't say I didn't warn you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 자네 큰일났어. 내가 예고도 없이 왔다고 화내진 말게."
ZH: "\n情況對你而言真的很糟，老兄。不要說我沒有警告你。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA064Subtitle
US: "*So, here's where you're hiding your resources. Mind if I take a few?"
DE: "*So, here's where you're hiding your resources. Mind if I take a few?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여기가 자네 자원이 있는 곳이군. 내가 좀 가져가도 될까?"
ZH: "\n所以，這裡就是你隱藏資源的地點。介意我帶走一些？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA065Subtitle
US: "*You're flank's wide open, Sport"
DE: "*You're flank's wide open, Sport"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "측면이 아주 허술하군."
ZH: "\n你的側翼現在門戶洞開，老兄。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA066Subtitle
US: "*Maybe we'll come in your back-door. Whadda you think about that?"
DE: "*Maybe we'll come in your back-door. Whadda you think about that?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 기지 뒷문으로 좀 들어갈까 하는데, 어떻게 생각하나?"
ZH: "\n或許我該從後面攻進去，你覺得怎麼樣？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA067Subtitle
US: "*Look out, we're coming through the front-door!"
DE: "*Look out, we're coming through the front-door!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "조심하게 친구, 우린 앞문으로 떳떳하게 들어간다네!"
ZH: "\n小心，我們要從正面進攻了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA068Subtitle
US: "*What do we have here?"
DE: "*What do we have here?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여긴 뭐가 있나 볼까?"
ZH: "\n這裡有什麼？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA069Subtitle
US: "*Well, look at this"
DE: "*Well, look at this"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오 이것 좀 보게."
ZH: "\n嗯，你看這個。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA070Subtitle
US: "*What did you plan to do without power? I can't wait to see this strategy"
DE: "*What did you plan to do without power? I can't wait to see this strategy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전력이 없으면 전략도 무용지물이지."
ZH: "\n如果沒有電力，你還有什麼搞頭？我等不及要看你的表演了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA071Subtitle
US: "*You better pay you power bill or we're going to have to postpone this fight"
DE: "*You better pay you power bill or we're going to have to postpone this fight"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전기세 좀 내지 그랬나. 전투를 연기할까?"
ZH: "\n你最好付一下電費，要不然這場戰爭可能要延期了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA072Subtitle
US: "*You're out of resources? Boy, you don't start the dance if you can't pay the bill"
DE: "*You're out of resources? Boy, you don't start the dance if you can't pay the bill"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자금이 바닥났다구? 저런, 돈이 없으면 시작을 말았어야지."
ZH: "\n資源用完了嗎？小子，如果你不付電費的話，這場仗就不用打了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA073Subtitle
US: "*Uh-oh, looks like we're going to have to do some deficit spending"
DE: "*Uh-oh, looks like we're going to have to do some deficit spending"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "저런, 이거 좀 아껴써야겠군."
ZH: "\n看來我們要讓人家白吃白喝了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA074Subtitle
US: "*Built yourself a Scud Storm there? You can't hit the side of a barn with a scud, don't you know that?"
DE: "*Built yourself a Scud Storm there? You can't hit the side of a barn with a scud, don't you know that?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 폭풍을 만든다고? 스커드로는 헛간 옆구리도 맞추지 못할걸? 그건 알고 있었나?"
ZH: "\n在那裡建造生化死雨風暴？你不能用它來炸旁邊的穀倉，你不知道嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA075Subtitle
US: "*Bringing out your nukes, huh? If Washington hadn't tied my hands, I'd show you some nukes, I tell you"
DE: "*Bringing out your nukes, huh? If Washington hadn't tied my hands, I'd show you some nukes, I tell you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵폭탄이라.. 나도 워싱턴에서 금지하지만 않았다면 몇 방 날려줬을텐데, 진짜로."
ZH: "\n使出你的核子武器？如果華盛頓沒有綁住我的手，我會讓你見識什麼叫做核武。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA076Subtitle
US: "*How'd you get a Particle Cannon, Son? That's supposed to me top-secret"
DE: "*How'd you get a Particle Cannon, Son? That's supposed to me top-secret"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어떻게 파티클 캐논을 손에 넣었지? 내 1급 기밀인데!"
ZH: "\n你怎麼會有離子砲？那應該是我的秘密武器。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA077Subtitle
US: "*So many base defenses. I can just smell the fear coming off you, Boy"
DE: "*So many base defenses. I can just smell the fear coming off you, Boy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "방어 시설 참 많군. 겁나면 그렇게라도 하게."
ZH: "\n這麼多的基地防線，我能聞到你們身上的恐懼，小子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA078Subtitle
US: "*Oh, look at thishere comes the tank blob. Not gonna work against me, Son"
DE: "*Oh, look at thishere comes the tank blob. Not gonna work against me, Son"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오 저런, 탱크들이 보이는군. 나한텐 안통할걸."
ZH: "\n看看這裡，一小撮的坦克，打不倒我的，小子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA079Subtitle
US: "*That's a lot of expensive planes you're putting in the air, Kid. Sure you wanna spend that money?"
DE: "*That's a lot of expensive planes you're putting in the air, Kid. Sure you wanna spend that money?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아주 비싼 비행기들을 띄워놨군. 헛돈 들인걸세, 애송이 친구."
ZH: "\n你們派了好多昂貴的飛機在空中啊，你確定要花這麼多錢嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA080Subtitle
US: "*Hope all those grunts know what you're getting them into"
DE: "*Hope all those grunts know what you're getting them into"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 보병들이 자네가 어디로 그들을 몰고 가는지 알았으면 좋겠네."
ZH: "\n希望所有的士兵知道你是要他們去跳火坑。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA081Subtitle
US: "*That's a lot of buildings, Son. You know that buildings can't fight for you, right?"
DE: "*That's a lot of buildings, Son. You know that buildings can't fight for you, right?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건물이 많군. 근데 건물은 자네를 위해 싸워주진 못해, 알지?"
ZH: "\n好多的建築啊，小子。你知道建築物沒有辦法替你打仗吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA082Subtitle
US: "*Bring the scuds, Punk--I'll show you the storm"
DE: "*Bring the scuds, Punk--I'll show you the storm"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 스커드를 발사해봐. 내가 폭풍을 보여줄테니."
ZH: "\n笨蛋，讓你見識見識什麼是生化死雨風暴。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA083Subtitle
US: "*You're going to regret nuking me, Kid. I don't take kindly to that"
DE: "*You're going to regret nuking me, Kid. I don't take kindly to that"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵 미사일을 사용한걸 후회하게 해주겠다, 애송이 같으니."
ZH: "\n你會後悔用核武攻擊我的，小子。我會記住這筆帳的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA084Subtitle
US: "*Using a particle beam, eh? You better put me away with that cause you won't like my counter-attack"
DE: "*Using a particle beam, eh? You better put me away with that cause you won't like my counter-attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "감히 파티클 캐논을 사용해? 내 반격이 겁나지도 않나 보군."
ZH: "\n用粒子光束攻擊？你最好可以用它擊敗我，要不然就等著我的反擊吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA085Subtitle
US: "*You know, only a coward fights from inside buildings. You know that, right?"
DE: "*You know, only a coward fights from inside buildings. You know that, right?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오직 겁장이만 건물 안에 숨어서 싸우는 거 알지?"
ZH: "\n你知道嗎，只有膽小鬼才會躲在建築裡面打仗，我想你應該知道吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA086Subtitle
US: "*Welcome, Colonel Burton. Sorry you had to get tied up in this thing. No hard feelings"
DE: "*Welcome, Colonel Burton. Sorry you had to get tied up in this thing. No hard feelings"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "버튼 대령, 환영하네. 이런 일에 휘말리게 된 걸 유감으로 생각하네. 날 너무 원망하진 말게나."
ZH: "\n歡迎你，貝頓上校。抱歉你必須被綁在這件事上，不要想太多。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA087Subtitle
US: "*Black Lotus ain't your salvation, Boy. She ain't gonna get anywhere near my base"
DE: "*Black Lotus ain't your salvation, Boy. She ain't gonna get anywhere near my base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "흑수선이 자네를 구해주진 못할거야. 우리 기지 근처에도 못올테니."
ZH: "\n黑蓮花不是你的救星，小子。她沒辦法進到我的基地的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA088Subtitle
US: "*Jarmen Kell's just another sniper, Punk. I've got dozens of snipers"
DE: "*Jarmen Kell's just another sniper, Punk. I've got dozens of snipers"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "쟈멘 켈은 단지 저격수잖나. 난 저격수가 수십명 있다고."
ZH: "\n我已經幹掉好幾打狙擊手了，賈曼卡爾只不過是另外一個，笨蛋。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA089Subtitle
US: "*Yeah, build your Air Field--get some birds in the air. May be your only shot a stopping me"
DE: "*Yeah, build your Air Field--get some birds in the air. May be your only shot a stopping me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 비행장을 건설해서 비행기좀 몇 대 날려봐."
ZH: "\n耶，建設機場 -- 發動空中攻擊，可能是你可以阻止我的機會吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA090Subtitle
US: "*Only one War Factory? It's gonna take at least half-a-dozen to stop me, Kid"
DE: "*Only one War Factroy? It's gonna take at least half-a-dozen to stop me, Kid"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "군수공장이 단 하나밖에 없어? 한 여섯 개는 있어야 날 막을텐데."
ZH: "\n只有一座戰車工廠？你可能需要起碼半打才檔得住我吧，小子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA091Subtitle
US: "*Is that Barracks a little close to the front-lines, Kid? Hard to sleep with bullets in your barracks"
DE: "*Is that Barracks a little close to the front-lines, Kid? Hard to sleep with bullets in your barracks"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "저 막사는 최전선에서 너무 가깝지 않나? 총소리가 시끄러워서 잠자기 힘들텐데."
ZH: "\n小子，你的兵營會不會太接近前線了？應該很難跟子彈一起進入夢鄉吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA092Subtitle
US: "*Don't just sell one building, Boy--sell them all and hope that I don't come for you anyway"
DE: "*Don't just sell one building, Boy--sell them all and hope that I don't come for you anyway"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건물 하나 팔아선 모잘라. 몽땅 팔고 내가 쳐들어오지 않기를 기도하시지."
ZH: "\n不要只賣一棟建築而已，小子。全部賣了吧，然後祈禱我不要再靠近。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA093Subtitle
US: "*Don't get cocky, Boy--this ain't over yet"
DE: "*Don't get cocky, Boy--this ain't over yet"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자만하지 말라고, 애송이씨. 아직 끝난게 아니야."
ZH: "\n不要太驕傲，小子。還沒有結束呢。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA094Subtitle
US: "*You may think you have the upper-hand, but I've got a few tricks left in me. You'll see"
DE: "*You may think you have the upper-hand, but I've got a few tricks left in me. You'll see"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네가 더 좋은 패를 가졌다고 생각하겠지. 하지만 내가 부리는 마술을 한번 보게나."
ZH: "\n你可能以為現在佔了上風，可是我還有些計謀留了一手，等著瞧吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA095Subtitle
US: "*I've dug myself outta worse holes than this, Punk. You ain't gonna win that easily"
DE: "*I've dug myself outta worse holes than this, Punk. You ain't gonna win that easily"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "난 더 처절한 상황에서도 살아남았었지. 쉽게 날 이기진 못할걸."
ZH: "\n我已經做好最壞的打算了，豬頭。你不會這麼容易就贏的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA096Subtitle
US: "*You think you're beating me? You best think again"
DE: "*You think you're beating me? You best think again"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "날 이길 거라고 생각하나? 다시 생각해봐."
ZH: "\n你以為你能打敗我？你最好再想清楚一點。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA097Subtitle
US: "*HuhI guess it's over. Nice work, Kid. I guess you took me down a peg or two"
DE: "*HuhI guess it's over. Nice work, Kid. I guess you took me down a peg or two"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "흠, 끝났군. 잘했네, 애송이씨. 내가 지긴 했군."
ZH: "\n我想戰爭已經結束了。幹得好，小子。你已經擊敗我了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA098Subtitle
US: "*Can you feel my fist starting to close around your neck, Punk?"
DE: "*Can you feel my fist starting to close around your neck, Punk?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 손이 자네 목을 조르는게 느껴지나? 얼간이씨?"
ZH: "\n你有感覺我一開始用手繞住你的脖子嗎，豬頭？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA099Subtitle
US: "*Don't take losing to me so hard--everyone loses to me, Kid"
DE: "*Don't take losing to me so hard--everyone loses to me, Kid"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나한테 졌다고 너무 기분 상하지 말게. 원래 나한테는 다들 지던걸."
ZH: "\n輸給我不要太難過 -- 大家都是我的手下敗將，小子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA100Subtitle
US: "*Give me a sec to get some tanks together and I'll end this little skirmish"
DE: "*Give me a sec to get some tanks together and I'll end this little skirmish"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "탱크 몇 대만 주면 이 작은 전쟁 쯤이야 쉽게 끝내지!"
ZH: "\n給我幾秒鐘整頓一下坦克，我將要結束這個小小的遭遇戰。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA101Subtitle
US: "*Why don't you just give up now, <sarcastic> \"General.\""
DE: "*Why don't you just give up now, <sarcastic> \"General.\""
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이쯤에서 포기하는게 어때? '장군'?"
ZH: "\n你為什麼不乾脆投降算了？ <嘲笑> \"將軍。\""
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA102Subtitle
US: "*Boy, I beat you like an old drum. Who gave you a command? Cause I've got some word for them"
DE: "*Boy, I beat you like an old drum. Who gave you a command? Cause I've got some word for them"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n애송이 친구, 내가 식은 죽 먹기로 이겨버렸군. 누가 자네를 사령관으로 임명했는지\n내가 가서 혼좀 내줘야 겠어."
ZH: "\n小子，你很輕易的就被我擊敗。是誰給你指揮權的？我有話要跟他們說。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA103Subtitle
US: "*Don't click that button unless you're serious, Boy"
DE: "*Don't click that button unless you're serious, Boy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장난으로 선택하려면 그 버튼을 누르지도 말게."
ZH: "\n不要按下那個按鈕，除非你是認真的，小子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA104Subtitle
US: "*You wanna tangle with me? I think you better think again, Kid"
DE: "*You wanna tangle with me? I think you better think again, Kid"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나랑 붙어보자고? 다시 한번 생각해보는게 좋을거야."
ZH: "\n你想要來一場混戰嗎？我想你最好想清楚，小子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA105Subtitle
US: "*Don't bring that attitude in here unless you can back it up, Punk"
DE: "*Don't bring that attitude in here unless you can back it up, Punk"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "능력도 없으면서 거만 떨지 말지 그래?"
ZH: "\n不要把那種態度帶來這裡，除非你能承擔後果，蠢豬。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA106Subtitle
US: "*Show me what you got"
DE: "*Show me what you got"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "얼마나 대단한지 한번 볼까?"
ZH: "\n讓我秤秤你有多少斤兩。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA107Subtitle
US: "*Maybe you could make a few extra bucks polishing my boots, cause you sure ain't no general"
DE: "*Maybe you could make a few extra bucks polishing my boots, cause you sure ain't no general"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 구두를 닦아주면 몇푼 쥐어주지. 자네는 장군감은 아닌데?"
ZH: "\n或許你可以幫我擦擦軍靴，掙個幾塊錢，因為你已經不是將軍了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA108Subtitle
US: "*Good work, General. I salute you"
DE: "*Good work, General. I salute you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "훌륭하오 장군, 내 경례를 받으시오."
ZH: "\n幹得好，將軍，向你至上崇高的敬意。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_BossUSA109Subtitle
US: "*I ain't gonna give no speeches, so let's just get this on"
DE: "*I ain't gonna give no speeches, so let's just get this on"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전투 전의 연설은 생략하겠네. 바로 시작하지."
ZH: "\n我不想無聲無息的消失，讓事情繼續進行吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo001Subtitle
US: "*I have some surprises for you, General. Why don't you come out and play?"
DE: "*I have some surprises for you, General. Why don't you come out and play?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "깜짝 놀랄 선물을 준비했다네. 어디 한번 나와서 놀아보지?"
ZH: "\n我有個驚喜要送給你，將軍，為什麼不出來玩一玩呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo002Subtitle
US: "*Now that the field is covered with explosives, I suppose we'll attack"
DE: "*Now that the field is covered with explosives, I suppose we'll attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 전장이 폭약으로 뒤덮였으니 싸울 때가 되었군."
ZH: "\n現在機場滿是炸藥，我想我們應該趁勢攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo003Subtitle
US: "*General, I have a delivery for yousign for it, won't you?"
DE: "*General, I have a delivery for yousign for it, won't you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군 내가 택배를 하나 보낼테니 서명 부탁하네."
ZH: "\n將軍，我有一個包裹要送給你，簽一下名字，好嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo004Subtitle
US: "*Careful, who knows when Jarmen Kell will sneak into your base"
DE: "*Careful, who knows when Jarmen Kell will sneak into your base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "조심해, 언제 쟈멘 켈이 자네 기지에 숨어 들어갈지 모르니."
ZH: "\n小心一點，誰知道什麼時候，賈曼卡爾會悄悄混進你的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo005Subtitle
US: "*Did your building just blow up? HmmI wonder how that happened?"
DE: "*Did your building just blow up? HmmI wonder how that happened?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 건물이 방금 터진 건가? 어떻게 그런 일이 가능하지?"
ZH: "\n你的建築剛剛爆炸嗎？嗯，不知道怎麼會這樣喔？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo006Subtitle
US: "*All of my forces are packed with explosives, General. I wouldn't shoot at them if I were you"
DE: "*All of my forces are packed with explosives, General. I wouldn't shoot at them if I were you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 병사들 전원은 모두 폭약으로 위장했네. 나라면 그들에게 총을 쏘진 못할텐데."
ZH: "\n我的所有部隊都配有炸藥，將軍。如果我是你，我是不會對他們開槍的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo007Subtitle
US: "*My Terrorists have learned to disguise themselves asoops, have I said too much?"
DE: "*My Terrorists have learned to disguise themselves asoops, have I said too much?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 테러리스트들으 위장술을 배웠지. 이런, 내가 너무 많이 얘기해줬나?"
ZH: "\n我的恐怖份子已經學會把他們自己偽裝成…啊！我會不會說太多了？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo008Subtitle
US: "*You might notice that my explosives pack a bit more punchI hope you appreciate our attention to quality"
DE: "*You might notice that my explosives pack a bit more punchI hope you appreciate our attention to quality"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 폭발물 꾸러미는 좀 강력하니 양질의 폭약을 즐겨보게나."
ZH: "\n你應該有注意到我的炸藥包只有一點點，希望你能感謝我們沒有把你們炸得太難看。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo009Subtitle
US: "*Look how quickly the Scud Launcher destroys a building nowjust wait, it's amazing"
DE: "*Look how quickly the Scud Launcher destoys a building nowjust wait, it's amazing"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 발사기가 건물을 순식간에 부수는 걸 보게. 놀라운걸."
ZH: "\n看生化飛彈發射車摧毀建築的速度有多快啊，等一下，真是太神奇了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo010Subtitle
US: "*First, all is silencethen \"boom!\"ahhdon't you just love it, General?"
DE: "*First, all is silencethen \"boom!\"ahhdon't you just love it, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "일단 적막만이 흐르다가 쾅! 하는 거지. 정말 멋지지 않나?"
ZH: "\n一開始，一片死寂，然後 \"轟！\"哎呀，您不喜歡這個嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo011Subtitle
US: "*I rarely attack, you should feel honored"
DE: "*I rarely attack, you should feel honored"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "난 웬만해선 공격을 안하니, 나한테 당하는 걸 영광으로 생각하게."
ZH: "\n我很少攻擊別人，你應該感到相當榮幸。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo012Subtitle
US: "*Here comes another attack, General"
DE: "*Here comes another attack, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "또 한 방 있네."
ZH: "\n又有另一波攻擊了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo013Subtitle
US: "*My troops are coming to assault your basemake them feel welcome"
DE: "*My troops are coming to assault your basemake them feel welcome"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 부대원들이 자네 기지를 공격할텐데, 환영 좀 부탁하네."
ZH: "\n我的部隊要突襲你的基地了，好好歡迎他們吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo014Subtitle
US: "*Please ignore my workers, General; they're just burying someummgarbage for me"
DE: "*Please ignore my workers, General; they're just burying someummgarbage for me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리 일꾼은 그냥 무시하시게, 장군. 쓰레기를 좀 묻고 있을 뿐이야."
ZH: "\n請不要傷害我的工人，將軍。他們只是在幫我清除一些垃圾而已。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo015Subtitle
US: "*Oh, General, you must see thisit's the bomb. <childish laugh>"
DE: "*Oh, General, you must see thisit's the bomb. <childish laugh>"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오, 장군, 이게 뭔지 아나? 폭탄이다! 아하핫!"
ZH: "\n喂，將軍，你一定要看看這個，一顆炸彈耶。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo016Subtitle
US: "*We're going out for more explosives, General. Be right back"
DE: "*We're going out for more explosives, General. Be right back"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "폭탄을 더 가져오겠네. 곧 돌아오겠네."
ZH: "\n我們去準備更多的炸彈，將軍。我們馬上回來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo017Subtitle
US: "*It's quiet out there, General. You know what quiet means, right? BOOM!!!"
DE: "*It's quiet out there, General. You know what quiet means, right? BOOM!!!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "밖은 조용하군. 조용한 게 뭘 의미하는지 아나? 조금 있으면 쾅!! 하는 소리가 나겠지."
ZH: "\n將軍，那邊有點安靜喔，你應該知道安靜表示什麼意思吧？轟隆！！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo018Subtitle
US: "*I am the master of explosives, General. You have no defense against me"
DE: "*I am the master of explosives, General. You have no defense against me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나는 폭약의 대가라네. 내 공격을 방어하긴 힘들걸."
ZH: "\n我是炸彈大師，將軍。你根本防不了我。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo019Subtitle
US: "*Your base has been targeted for demolition"
DE: "*Your base has been targeted for demolition"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 기지가 폭파 목표 대상으로 선정되었네."
ZH: "\n你的基地已經被鎖定，即將爆炸。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo020Subtitle
US: "*Do you fear my next attack, General? You should"
DE: "*Do you fear my next attack, General? You should"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 다음 공격이 벌써 겁나지 않소? 당연히 그래야지."
ZH: "\n你怕不怕我下一波攻擊啊，將軍。你是應該害怕。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo021Subtitle
US: "*As we speak my agents are sneaking into your base and planting explosives"
DE: "*As we speak my agents are sneaking into your base and planting explosives"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리가 지금 말하는 순간에도 내 요원들이 당신 기지에 침투해서 폭약을 설치하고 있소."
ZH: "\n當我們在說話的時候，我的幹員正潛入你的基地，並且安置炸彈。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo022Subtitle
US: "*Your building could be wired to explode right now. You'll never know until it's too late"
DE: "*Your building could be wired to explode right now. You'll never know until it's too late"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 건물들은 지금이라도 폭약이 설치될 수가 있소. 알아차렸을땐 이미 늦었을 거요."
ZH: "\n你的建築可能已經快要爆炸，除非事情發生，否則你永遠也不會知道。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo023Subtitle
US: "*There are few units that can detect my demolitionsdo you know which ones they are?"
DE: "*There are few units that can detect my demolitionsdo you know which ones they are?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 폭약을 다룰 수 있는 유닛은 얼마 안되지."
ZH: "\n我有一些單位可以偵測炸藥的存在，你知道是哪些嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo024Subtitle
US: "*Demo Traps are difficult to construct, General. To appreciate their beauty you have to see one up close"
DE: "*Demo Traps are difficult to construct, General. To appreciate their beauty you have to see one up close"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n폭약 함정은 설치하기 어렵다네, 장군.\n아름답게 설치된 모습을 보려면 아주 가까이서 봐야 한다네."
ZH: "\n炸藥陷阱是很難建造的，將軍。如果你要欣賞它的美，必須要靠近一點才行。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo025Subtitle
US: "*How are you enjoying my tricks and traps so far?"
DE: "*How are you enjoying my tricks and traps so far?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기술과 함정들을 잘 감상하고 있는가?"
ZH: "\n到目前為止，你還喜歡我的作戰技巧跟陷阱嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo026Subtitle
US: "*Awwyour Tech Building went boom"
DE: "*Awwyour Tech Building went boom"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오우, 자네의 테크 빌딩이 날아갔군."
ZH: "\n你的科技建築被炸掉了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo027Subtitle
US: "*We've destroyed your BarracksI hope no one was in there"
DE: "*We've destroyed your BarracksI hope no one was in there"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 막사가 날아갔어! 안에 아무도 없었기를.."
ZH: "\n我們已經摧毀你的兵營了，希望裡面沒人在。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo028Subtitle
US: "*Your War Factory has fallen, General. Build another one so we can knock it down again"
DE: "*Your War Factory has fallen, General. Build another one so we can knock it down again"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "군수공장이 날아갔군. 또 부술 수 있게 하나 더 지어줘."
ZH: "\n你的戰車工廠被摧毀了，再建一座吧，這樣我才能再次摧毀它。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo029Subtitle
US: "*Air Fields are so fragile--it's hardly even fun to destroy them"
DE: "*Air Fields are so fragile--it's hardly even fun to destroy them"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행장은 너무 파괴되기 쉬워서, 사실 폭파하는 것도 재미 없지."
ZH: "\n這機場也太脆弱了 -- 摧毀它們一點樂趣也沒有。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo030Subtitle
US: "*Your base defenses cannot take my explosives, General"
DE: "*Your base defenses cannot take my explosives, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기지 방어 시설로 내 폭발물을 막는 건 불가능하다네."
ZH: "\n你的基地防禦擋不了我的炸藥，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo031Subtitle
US: "*Ah, there's nothing quite like destroying a Command Center"
DE: "*Ah, there's nothing quite like destroying a Command Center"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "커맨드 센터를 날리는 것 만큼 재미있는 일은 없지."
ZH: "\n嗯，沒有什麼比得上摧毀指揮中心的感覺。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo032Subtitle
US: "*We've destroyed so many of your buildings, GeneralI appreciate you building more for our ammusement"
DE: "*We've destroyed so many of your buildings, GeneralI appreaciate you building more for our ammusement"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 건물을 너무 많이 파괴했네. 좀 더 건설해서 우릴 즐겁게 해주게."
ZH: "\n我們已經摧毀你們很多建築了，將軍。何不再多建造一些讓我們玩玩。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo033Subtitle
US: "*You've destroyed our Oil Derrick. Now you're getting into the spirit of things"
DE: "*You've destroyed our Oil Derrick. Now you're getting into the spirit of things"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리 건물을 파괴했군. 슬슬 성질을 건드리는데?"
ZH: "\n你已經摧毀我們的油井。現在你進入到事情的核心部分了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo034Subtitle
US: "*My Barracks! Many of my demolitions were in there, General. I'll make you pay for this"
DE: "*My Barracks! Many of my demolitions were in there, General. I'll make you pay for this"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 막사! 많은 폭약들이 거기 있었는데. 후회하게 될거요."
ZH: "\n我的兵營！裡面存放了大量的炸藥，將軍，我要你全部還來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo035Subtitle
US: "*Not my War Factory! General, this annoy habit you've developed cannot continue"
DE: "*Not my War Factory! General, this annoy habit you've developed cannot continue"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 군수공장은 안돼! 계속 이렇게 내버려두진 않겠어."
ZH: "\n不要動我的戰車工廠！將軍，你養成的壞習慣不能再繼續下去了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo036Subtitle
US: "*Not to worry, my base defenses are only an early-warning signal. Now you must walk through my true defenses"
DE: "*Not to worry, my base defenses are only an early-warning signal. Now you must walk through my true defenses"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "걱정 마시오. 내 방어 시설들은 단지 조기 경보용이지. 이제 내 진짜 방어에 부딪힐 거요."
ZH: "\n不用擔心，我的基地防禦只是一個預先警報的信號。現在你必須通過我真正的防線。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo037Subtitle
US: "*Too many! You've destroy too many of my structures, General. Now the fighting gets dirty"
DE: "*Too many! You've destroy too many of my structures, General. Now the fighting gets dirty"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "너무 많아! 너무 많은 건물을 부쉈어. 장군. 전투가 점점 지저분해지겠는데."
ZH: "\n太誇張了！你摧毀太多我的建築了，將軍。現在戰爭愈變愈血腥了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo038Subtitle
US: "*We will rebuild that Command Center, General, and you will play for this transgression"
DE: "*We will rebuild that Command Center, General, and you will play for this transgression"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "커맨드 센터를 다시 만들어야겠군. 지금 한 짓을 후회하게 될 거요."
ZH: "\n我們會重建指揮中心，將軍。你將要為你的行為贖罪。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo039Subtitle
US: "*General, how do you expect me to defeat you if you keep destroying my vehicles?"
DE: "*General, how do you expect me to defeat you if you keep destroying my vehicles?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 자꾸 내 차량을 부수면 내가 자네를 이길 수 없잖소."
ZH: "\n將軍，如果你再繼續摧毀我的載具，你要我怎麼在這場戰爭擊敗你呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo040Subtitle
US: "*You're cutting my men down before they can place their demolitionsthat doesn't seem right, does it, General?"
DE: "*You're cutting my men down before they can place their demolitionsthat doesn't seem right, does it, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 병사들이 폭약을 설치하기도 전에 없애버리는군. 이건 반칙이야. 안그렇소?"
ZH: "\n你在我的士兵們放置炸藥之前就把他們殺了，你覺得這樣對嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo041Subtitle
US: "*Ah yes, capture that Oil Derrick, General. Then we'll have more to destroy"
DE: "*Ah yes, capture that Oil Derrick, General. Then we'll have more to destroy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래 좋소, 원유 유정탑을 가지시오. 우리가 부숴버릴 게 더 늘어나는군."
ZH: "\n沒錯，去佔領那座油井，將軍。這樣我們至少還有東西可以摧毀。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo042Subtitle
US: "*General, why do you want that Artillery Platform?"
DE: "*General, why do you want that Artillery Platform?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 그 캐논 플랫폼은 가져서 뭐에 쓸 거요?"
ZH: "\n將軍，你還要那個砲兵陣地幹嘛？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo043Subtitle
US: "*Good, General, capture the Oil Refinerythey blow-up so dramatically"
DE: "*Good, General, capture the Oil Refinerythey blow-up so dramatically"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "잘했소, 장군. 정유 공장을 점령하고 있으면 내가 영화처럼 폭파시켜주지."
ZH: "\n太好了，將軍，佔領煉油廠。他們被炸的時候，將很引人注目。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo044Subtitle
US: "*Be careful, General--your men have just enter the danger zone around my base. Even I don't remember where all the traps are set out there"
DE: "*Be careful, General--your men have just enter the danger zone around my base. Even I don't remember where all the traps are set out there"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n조심하시게, 장군. 당신 병사들이 방금 위험 지역으로 들어왔네.\n폭탄이 어디에 설치되었는지는 나조차도 기억이 안나는걸."
ZH: "\n小心，將軍 -- 你的弟兄剛踏進我的危險基地，我實在不記得我在哪些地方佈下了陷阱。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo045Subtitle
US: "*General, your men are coming dangerously close to my base. I'd turn back if I were you"
DE: "*General, your men are coming dangerously close to my base. I'd turn back if I were you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 자네 병사들이 기지로 다가오는데 아주 위험할거요. 나라면 돌아가겠소."
ZH: "\n將軍，你的弟兄正靠近基地附近的危險區域。如果我是你，我會要他們撤出。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo046Subtitle
US: "*Get out of my base, General. This whole area is wired with explosives, and I'm not afraid to use them"
DE: "*Get out of my base, General. This whole area is wired with exploses, and I'm not afraid to use them"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지에서 나가시오, 장군! 이 곳 전체는 폭약이 깔려 있소."
ZH: "\n滾出我的基地，將軍。這整個區域都佈滿了炸藥，而且我不怕把它們引爆。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo047Subtitle
US: "*You fool! Do you know how many explosives are surrounding your men right now?"
DE: "*You fool! Do you know how many explosives are surrounding your men right now?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이런 바보같으니! 지금 얼마나 많은 폭약들이 자네 병사를 둘러싸고 있는지 아나?"
ZH: "\n你是豬啊！你知道你的弟兄現在被多少炸藥包圍了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo048Subtitle
US: "*Attacking from the flank, General? There might be few defenses there, but what about traps?"
DE: "*Attacking from the flank, General? There might be few defenses there, but what about traps?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "측면 공격이라.. 그쪽엔 물론 병력이 별로 없긴 하지. 하지만 폭약 함정들은 어떻게 할 건가?"
ZH: "\n從側翼攻擊，將軍？那裡或許防禦較薄弱，但是你知道有多少陷阱嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo049Subtitle
US: "*The back of my base is particularly nasty, General. I wouldn't recommend an assault from there"
DE: "*The back of my base is particularly nasty, General. I wouldn't recommend an assault from there"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지 뒷쪽은 꽤 위험하니 그곳에서 공격하는 것은 비추천이오."
ZH: "\n我的基地後面可說危機重重，將軍。我不會建議從那裡進行突擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo050Subtitle
US: "*A frontal assault?! You are more of a fool than I thought, General"
DE: "*A frontal assault?! You are more of a fool than I thought, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "정면 공격? 내가 생각했던 거보다 더 바보로군."
ZH: "\n正面攻擊？！你比我想像中的還要愚蠢，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo051Subtitle
US: "*There is nothing in this valley for you except death"
DE: "*There is nothing in this valley for you except death"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 계곡에 당신을 위한 것은 죽음 뿐이오."
ZH: "\n除了死亡之外，這個溪谷沒有任何您想要的東西。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo052Subtitle
US: "*Careful, General; this looks like a good place for an ambushoops, too late"
DE: "*Careful, General; this looks like a good place for an ambushoops, too late"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "조심하시게, 장군. 여긴 매복에 좋은 장소거든. 아차 괜히 얘기했군."
ZH: "\n將軍！小心！這裡看來是適合伏擊的好地點。哎喲！已經太遲了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo053Subtitle
US: "*You think I didn't prepare for you coming here, General? Fool"
DE: "*You think I didn't prepare for you coming here, General? Fool"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신에 대한 대비를 안해놓았을 줄 아는가, 장군? 바보같으니."
ZH: "\n將軍，您以為我沒料到您要來這裡嗎？您這個笨蛋！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo054Subtitle
US: "*Those are my resources, General. Go find your own"
DE: "*Those are my resources, General. Go find your own"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 자원에 손대지 말고 딴데 가서 알아보시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，那些是我的資源。去找您自己的來用。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo055Subtitle
US: "*General, you've entered my demolitions storage facility. One false move and we all die"
DE: "*General, you've entered my demolitions storage facility. One false move and we all die"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 내 폭약 창고시설에 들어왔네. 한 걸음이라도 잘못 움직이면 우리 모두 날아갈거요."
ZH: "\n將軍，您已經進入我的炸藥貯藏庫中。一個不小心的話，我們將同歸於盡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo056Subtitle
US: "*Ah, I see we hit one of your power lines. I hope your power isn't out for too long"
DE: "*Ah, I see we hit one of your power lines. I hope your power isn't out for too long"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아, 저런 우리 병사들이 전깃줄을 건드렸나 보군. 너무 오래 정전되지 않기를 바라네."
ZH: "\n哎呀！我發現我們打中您某一條電力線。希望您的電力不會停太久。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo057Subtitle
US: "*Your dependency on electricity will be you undoing, General"
DE: "*Your dependency on electricity will be you undoing, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신은 너무 전기에 의존해서 망하는 것 같소, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，您對電力的依賴將導致您的滅亡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo058Subtitle
US: "*Your resources are exhausted, General. My forces are circling for the kill"
DE: "*Your resources are exhausted, General. My forces are circling for the kill"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자원이 바닥났소, 장군? 내 병사들이 끝장낼려고 주변을 맴도는군."
ZH: "\n將軍，您的資源已經耗盡。我的軍隊正包圍住您，準備要殺了您。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo059Subtitle
US: "*My resources are low, General. Mind if we come take some of yours?"
DE: "*My resources are low, General. Mind if we come take some of yours?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자원이 좀 부족하군. 당신 걸 훔쳐도 되겠소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，我的資源不足。您介意我向您拿一些嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo060Subtitle
US: "*A Scud StormI seeWell, perhaps it is time to build one of my own"
DE: "*A Scud StormI seeWell, perhaps it is time to build one of my own"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 폭풍이다! 나도 하나 건설해야겠군."
ZH: "\n原來是生化死雨風暴阿，我明白了。好吧，或許是該建一個屬於我自己的時候了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo061Subtitle
US: "*I wonder how many explosives it will take to destroy that Nuclear Silo?"
DE: "*I wonder how many explosives it will take to destroy that Nuclear Silo?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "저 핵 미사일을 파괴하려면 폭약이 몇 개나 있어야 될까?"
ZH: "\n我想知道要用多少炸藥才能摧毀那個核彈發射井？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo062Subtitle
US: "*Now why do you want to build a Particle Cannon? We were just beginning to have fun, General"
DE: "*Now why do you want to build a Particle Cannon? We were just beginning to have fun, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "왜 벌써 파티클 캐논을 건설하려고 하지? 이제 겨우 재미있기 시작했는데."
ZH: "\n現在您為什麼想建一座離子砲？將軍，我們才剛開始有點樂子而已。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo063Subtitle
US: "*So many base defenses, General. How do you expect my bombers to enter your base now?"
DE: "*So many base defenses, General. How do you expect my bombers to enter your base now?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기지 방어 시설이 너무 많군. 이래선 우리 병사들이 당신 기지에 못 숨어들어가잖소."
ZH: "\n將軍，這麼多的基地防禦單位，難道你很希望我的轟炸機群立刻進入您的基地嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo064Subtitle
US: "*Tanksso many tanks. I'll enjoy watching your tanks hit my traps, General"
DE: "*Tanksso many tanks. I'll enjoy watching your tanks hit my traps, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "탱크가 너무 많군. 탱크들이 함정에 걸리는 걸 즐겁게 지켜보겠소."
ZH: "\n這麼多的坦克。將軍，我正享受您的坦克正被我軍襲擊的樂趣。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo065Subtitle
US: "*Stop building planes, Generalyou'll miss the genius of my traps"
DE: "*Stop building planes, Generalyou'll miss the genius of my traps"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행기를 너무 많이 만들지 말란 말이오! 내 예술작품 폭탄들을 못 써먹잖아."
ZH: "\n停止建造飛機吧，將軍！不然您將錯過我精心布置的地面陷阱！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo066Subtitle
US: "*With that many infantry you're sure to set-off my Demo Traps. I'd tell them to spread out when crossing the field, Generalor not"
DE: "*With that many infantry you're sure to set-off my Demo Traps. I'd tell them to spread out when crossing the field, Generalor not"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n저 많은 수의 보병들은 확실히 내 폭약에 걸려들겠군.\n이동 시에 넓게 퍼져서 움직이라고 전해주시오."
ZH: "\n您有這麼多的步兵，絕對會引爆我的炸藥陷阱！當他們經過陷阱區時，我會叫他們分散開來行動的，將\n軍！絕對！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo067Subtitle
US: "*So many buildings Your base is a perfect target for my explosives, General. Thank you"
DE: "*So many buildings Your base is a perfect target for my explosives, General. Thank you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건물이 너무 많군. 내 폭약의 좋은 목표가 되겠어. 고맙소."
ZH: "\n這麼多的建築物？將軍，您的基地對我的炸藥而言是最理想的攻擊標靶，謝謝您！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo068Subtitle
US: "*Foolish move, General. Your Scud Storm won't stop me"
DE: "*Foolish move, General. Your Scud Storm won't stop me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어리석은 생각이군. 스커드 폭풍으로 날 막을 순 없소."
ZH: "\n將軍，移動是多此一舉，您的生化死雨風暴是無法阻止我的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo069Subtitle
US: "*Nuclear missile! You will pay for this, General"
DE: "*Nuclear missile! You will pay for this, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵 미사일! 후회할거요."
ZH: "\n核子飛彈！您將為此付出代價，將軍。。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo070Subtitle
US: "*No! That particle beam will set off my explosives!"
DE: "*No! That particle beam will set off my explosives!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "안돼! 파티클 캐논은 내 폭약들을 날려버릴거야!"
ZH: "\n不！那粒子光束將引爆我的炸藥！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo071Subtitle
US: "*Yes, garrison that building, General--it probably doesn't have explosives attached to it"
DE: "*Yes, garrison that building, General--it probably doesn't have explosives attached to it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 병력을 그 건물에 주둔시키게. 아마 거기엔 폭약이 설치 안됐겠군."
ZH: "\n沒錯，派兵駐守那棟建築物，將軍--或許建築物裡並沒有放炸藥。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo072Subtitle
US: "*Hello, Colonel Burton. Try not to step on any traps"
DE: "*Hello, Colonel Burton. Try not to step on any traps"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "버튼 대령, 안녕하시오. 함정을 밟지 않게 조심하시오."
ZH: "\n哈囉，貝頓上校。試著別踩到任何陷阱吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo073Subtitle
US: "*Black Lotusjust because you can detect my traps do not think I am now vulnerable"
DE: "*Black Lotusjust because you can detect my traps do not think I am now vulnerable"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "흑수선, 내 함정을 탐지할 수 있다고 해서 나를 얕봐서는 안되오."
ZH: "\n黑蓮花，別以為你能夠偵測到我的陷阱，就認為我是好欺負的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo074Subtitle
US: "*Why would you send Jarmen Kell against me, General?"
DE: "*Why would you send Jarmen Kell against me, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "쟈멘 켈을 나한테 보내서 어쩌겠다는 거지?"
ZH: "\n將軍，為什麼您派遣賈曼卡爾來對付我呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo075Subtitle
US: "*Do not build any more Air Fields, GeneralI don't like them"
DE: "*Do not build any more Air Fields, GeneralI don't like them"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행장을 더이상 만들지 마시오. 별로 폭파하고 싶지도 않소."
ZH: "\n別再新建任何機場了，將軍。我不喜歡它們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo076Subtitle
US: "*The War Factory builds vehiclesvehicles that will set-off my Demo Traps"
DE: "*The War Factory builds vehiclesvehicles that will set-off my Demo Traps"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "군수공장은 내 폭발물에 걸려들 차량을 만드는 곳이지."
ZH: "\n戰車工廠生產的車輛將會引爆我的炸藥陷阱。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo077Subtitle
US: "*Do you think it is wise to build a Barracks, General?"
DE: "*Do you think it is wise to build a Barracks, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "막사를 만드는 게 현명한 선택인 것 같소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您自認為建造一座兵營是個明智之舉嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo078Subtitle
US: "*Please, General, don't sell-off what I could destroy for you"
DE: "*Please, General, don't sell-off what I could destroy for you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "제발, 장군. 내가 폭파시킬 건물들을 팔지 마시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，您用不著廉價出售任何東西，因為我能夠幫您摧毀它。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo079Subtitle
US: "*General, you're not playing fair. Now go step on some traps"
DE: "*General, you're not playing fair. Now go step on some traps"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 이건 반칙이오. 함정에 발을 좀 디뎌보시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，目前對您非常不利。現在踏進我的一些陷阱吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo080Subtitle
US: "*You're exceptionally lucky, General, but you can't avoid my Demo Traps forever"
DE: "*You're exceptionally lucky, General, but you can't avoid my Demo Traps forever"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신은 운이 좋소. 하지만 영영 내 함정을 피할 수는 없을 거요."
ZH: "\n將軍，您非常幸運，但是您無法永遠避開我的陷阱炸彈！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo081Subtitle
US: "*No one has beaten my traps, General, and you won't be the firstyou'll see"
DE: "*No one has beaten my traps, General, and you won't be the firstyou'll see"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "누구도 내 함정을 이기진 못했지. 결국은 내가 이길 것이오."
ZH: "\n將軍，沒有人可以打敗我的陷阱，而且你也不可能成為第一位贏家。等著瞧吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo082Subtitle
US: "*Do you think you're beating me, General? This could change in an instant--I don't fight fair"
DE: "*Do you think you're beating me, General? This could change in an instant--I don't fight fair"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "날 이겼다고 생각하나, 장군? 내가 이제 지저분하게 싸우기 시작하면 좀 힘들걸."
ZH: "\n將軍，您認為可以戰勝我嗎？局勢將在傾刻間逆轉—我向來不喜歡公平競爭。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo083Subtitle
US: "*You may have defeated me, General, but Deathstrike will avenge me"
DE: "*You may have defeated me, General, but Deathstrike will avenge me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "날 이겼을 지도 모르지만, 우리 두목이 복수해줄 것이다."
ZH: "\n將軍，您或許已經擊敗我，但是死亡攻擊將會為我復仇。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo084Subtitle
US: "*Ha ha! Your troops are falling to my traps, General. Soon they'll all be gone"
DE: "*Ha ha! Your troops are falling to my traps, General. Soon they'll all be gone"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "하하! 당신의 병사들이 내 함정에 걸려들었네, 장군. 곧 모두 다 사라지겠군."
ZH: "\n哈哈！將軍，您的軍隊落入我的圈套內，他們馬上會被我摧毀。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo085Subtitle
US: "*You're losing, General. My tactics elude you"
DE: "*You're losing, General. My tactics elude you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신은 지금 지고 있네. 내 전략이 당신을 속인 거지."
ZH: "\n將軍，您輸定了。我的戰術難倒了您。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo086Subtitle
US: "*You'll never defeat me, General. You should leave before you get hurt"
DE: "*You'll never defeat me, General. You should leave before you get hurt"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나를 결코 이기진 못할걸, 장군. 다치기 전에 떠나는게 좋을거요."
ZH: "\n將軍，您永遠不可能打敗我。您應該在受傷之前趕緊先離開。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo087Subtitle
US: "*I have so many explosives leftmore explosives than you have forces I'm afraid"
DE: "*I have so many explosives leftmore explosives than you have forces I'm afraid"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아직 폭약이 더 많이 남았는데 벌써 항복하면 안되지!"
ZH: "\n我還剩下這麼多炸藥，比您的軍隊還要多。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo088Subtitle
US: "*You lose, General. Too bad"
DE: "*You lose, General. Too bad"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "안됐지만, 당신은 패배했소."
ZH: "\n將軍！真不幸阿，您戰敗了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo089Subtitle
US: "*I have just the thing. Let's go make war"
DE: "*I have just the thing. Let's go make war"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나에겐 한방이 있지. 전쟁터로 보내주시오."
ZH: "\n我剛剛拿到這項東西。讓我們開戰吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo090Subtitle
US: "*Demolitions expert: How can I help you?"
DE: "*Demolitions expert: How can I help you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "폭약 전문가가 여기 있습니다. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"
ZH: "\n爆破專家：我如何幫助您？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo091Subtitle
US: "*I wonder if I could wire that button to explode?"
DE: "*I wonder if I could wire that button to explode?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 버튼을 폭약과 연결시키면 재밌겠군."
ZH: "\n我想知道是否能利用連線按鈕來引爆？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo092Subtitle
US: "*Please, General--enter my battlefieldbut watch where to step"
DE: "*Please, General--enter my battlefieldbut watch where to step"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전쟁터에서 봅시다. 그런데 발 밑은 항상 조심해야 될 거요."
ZH: "\n將軍，請吧--進入我的戰場，但是您可能不曉得要踩在哪才不會誤觸陷阱。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo093Subtitle
US: "*You were lucky this time, General. You could never beat me again"
DE: "*You were lucky this time, General. You could never beat me again"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이번에는 운이 좋았군. 다음에 또 이길 순 없을거요."
ZH: "\n將軍，這次是您走運。但是您不可能再打敗我第二次！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo094Subtitle
US: "*You were not prepared for this kind of war. Try again, if you dare"
DE: "*You were not prepared for this kind of war. Try again, if you dare"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전쟁에 매우 서툴군. 자신 있으면 한번 더 도전해보시지."
ZH: "\n您尚未對這類戰爭做好準備，將軍。假如您有膽量的話，可以再嘗試一次。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo095Subtitle
US: "*Here we see the battlefield--openuntouched by battlea blank slate for our little..."
DE: "*Here we see the battlefield--openuntouched by battlea blank slate for our little..."
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아직은 조용한 이 땅에 전쟁을 일으켜봐야 겠군. 우리의 무기에 아주 적합한 장소야."
ZH: "\n在這裡我們可以看到戰場。開啟從未啟動的地點，在如同白紙一般乾淨的場地交戰，為了我們的可愛戰\n爭……"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo096Subtitle
US: "*Now where did those Demo Traps come from?"
DE: "*Now where did those Demo Traps come from?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 폭약 함정들이 대체 어디에서 나타난 거지?"
ZH: "\n現在那些炸藥陷阱是從哪裡來的？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Demo097Subtitle
US: "*Perhaps I have a few cards hidden up my sleeve, but did you except any less from me, General?"
DE: "*Perhaps I have a few cards hidden up my sleeve, but did you except any less from me, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "사실 내가 속임수를 좀 쓰긴 하지만, 내가 원래 이런 건 다 알잖나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n或許我還有一些錦囊妙計。但是您不會計較屈居我下風吧，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger001Subtitle
US: "*Hey, General, you ever seen a Raptor up close?"
DE: "*Hey, General, you ever seen a Raptor up close?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이봐, 랩터가 머리 위로 지나가지 않았나?"
ZH: "\n嗨！將軍，您看到空中的猛禽戰機正在靠近您嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger002Subtitle
US: "*Hey, General, did you see that Stealth Fighter?"
DE: "*Hey, General, did you see that Stealth Fighter?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이봐, 스텔스 폭격기가 지나가는 걸 봤나?"
ZH: "\n嗨！將軍，您看到那架隱形戰鬥機嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger003Subtitle
US: "*Birds' away! Let's go hunt some dozers!"
DE: "*Birds' away! Let's go hunt some dozers!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "새떼가 나가신다, 불도저들은 꼭꼭 숨어라!"
ZH: "\n鳥兒們，走開！我們去找一些推土機吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger004Subtitle
US: "*I'm done playing with you, General. (Announcing to his own forces) Everyone attack!"
DE: "*I'm done playing with you, General. (Announcing to his own forces) Everyone attack!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 장난은 그만 하겠네. 전원 공격!"
ZH: "\n將軍，我準備好要和您一起遊戲。(向他自己的軍隊宣佈)全體開始進攻！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger005Subtitle
US: "*Will you look at thatUS military spending at its best"
DE: "*Will you look at thatUS military spending at its best"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "미국군이 최대한 노력한다고 한 저 꼴을 보라."
ZH: "\n您將會看到美軍盡全力做到最好。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger006Subtitle
US: "*(Singingbadly)and the rockets' red glare, the bombs bursting in air"
DE: "*(Singingbadly)and the rockets' red glare, the bombs bursting in air"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아...로켓들, 붉은 섬광, 공중에서 폭발하는 폭탄!"
ZH: "\n(嚴重的耳鳴)伴隨著火箭彈的紅色火光，炸彈在天際引爆開來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger007Subtitle
US: "*Here comes the rain of terror, General"
DE: "*Here comes the rain of terror, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "공포의 비를 내려주지, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，恐怖的雨來了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger008Subtitle
US: "*How are you enjoying the Shock-and-Awe, General?"
DE: "*How are you enjoying the Shock-and-Awe, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "충격과 공포 작전을 잘 감상하고 있나?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您還喜歡這個「震懾行動」嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger009Subtitle
US: "*Death from above!"
DE: "*Death from above!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "하늘에서 죽음이 내린다!"
ZH: "\n從上空降下死亡之雨！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger010Subtitle
US: "*It doesn't seem fair, does it, General"
DE: "*It doesn't seem fair, does it, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이건 좀 불공평하군."
ZH: "\n將軍，這看起來不怎麼公平，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger011Subtitle
US: "*It's time to pull the goalies. Everyone attack!"
DE: "*It's time to pull the goalies. Everyone attack!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "득점 찬스다! 전원 공격!"
ZH: "\n拖走防守人員的時候到了！全員進攻！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger012Subtitle
US: "*Bombs away!"
DE: "*Bombs away!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "폭탄 날아간다!"
ZH: "\n炸開！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger013Subtitle
US: "*It's awfully quiet out thereyou didn't leave did you, General?"
DE: "*It's awfully quiet out thereyou didn't leave did you, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "너무 조용하군. 벌써 도망친건 아니겠지?"
ZH: "\n這真是令人厭惡的安靜，您不會離開吧，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger014Subtitle
US: "*Don't worry, General, this is just the quiet before the storm"
DE: "*Don't worry, General, this is just the quiet before the storm"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "걱정 말게나, 장군. 폭풍 전야의 고요함일 뿐이니."
ZH: "\n將軍，別擔心，這是風雨前的寧靜"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger015Subtitle
US: "*I'd take this break to rebuild your defenses, General"
DE: "*I'd take this break to rebuild your defenses, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 병력을 재건할 시간을 주겠네."
ZH: "\n將軍，我將趁這個空檔重建您的防禦單位"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger016Subtitle
US: "*Shhdid you hear that? I wouldn't worry, it's probably nothing"
DE: "*Shhdid you hear that? I wouldn't worry, it's probably nothing"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "쉿, 들었나? 나라면 걱정 안할거야. 아무것도 아니겠지."
ZH: "\n噓！您聽到沒？我並不擔心，也許是虛驚一場"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger017Subtitle
US: "*Sorry, General, we're just taking a lunch-break-be with you in a minute"
DE: "*Sorry, General, we're just taking a lunch-break-be with you in a minute"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "미안하네, 장군. 지금은 점심시간이니 곧 돌아오겠네."
ZH: "\n將軍，抱歉，我們只是想馬上跟您一起稍作休息"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger018Subtitle
US: "*You've forced me to use tanksI hate using tanks"
DE: "*You've forced me to use tanksI hate using tanks"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 탱크를 사용하게끔 만드는군. 탱크는 정말 싫어."
ZH: "\n您迫使我不得不使用坦克車。我討厭用坦克車"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger019Subtitle
US: "*Having trouble crossing the river, General? Wanna lift?"
DE: "*Having trouble crossing the river, General? Wanna lift?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "강을 건너기 힘들지, 장군? 내가 실어다 줄까?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您在過河時遇到一些困難嗎？需要我送你一程嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger020Subtitle
US: "*Cowards! Stop hiding and fight!"
DE: "*Cowards! Stop hiding and fight!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "겁장이들! 그만 좀 숨고 이제 싸우자!"
ZH: "\n膽小鬼！別再躲了！開始戰鬥吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger021Subtitle
US: "*Stealth won't save you, General; we'll find you"
DE: "*Stealth won't save you, General; we'll find you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스텔스로 목숨을 건지기는 힘들걸. 자네는 곧 발견될걸세."
ZH: "\n將軍，隱形戰機也無法拯救您；我們會找到您的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger022Subtitle
US: "*Ouch, that must have been expensive"
DE: "*Ouch, that must have been expensive"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어이쿠, 이거 꽤 비쌌겠군."
ZH: "\n哎喲！那個東西一定很昂貴。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger023Subtitle
US: "*Huh, where are you going to train your troops now?"
DE: "*Huh, where are you going to train your troops now?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "허, 이제 당신 부대를 어디서 훈련시킬 거요?"
ZH: "\n哈！現在看您要到哪裡訓練部隊？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger024Subtitle
US: "*Having trouble keeping up those defenses, General?"
DE: "*Having trouble keeping up those defenses, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "방어 시설을 지키는데 무슨 문제라도 있소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，是不是在維持防禦單位時遇到一些麻煩呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger025Subtitle
US: "*You've lost a lot of buildings, General; were you planning on using harsh language now?"
DE: "*You've lost a lot of buildings, General; were you planning on using harsh language now?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건물을 많이 잃었군. 이제 입에서 욕 좀 나오겠는데?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您已失去許多建築物。您現在是不是很想罵人呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger026Subtitle
US: "*Dozers, start repairing our buildings!"
DE: "*Dozers, start repairing our buildings!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "불도저! 건물 수리를 시작하라!"
ZH: "\n推土機，開始修復我們的建築物！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger027Subtitle
US: "*I'll get you for this, General"
DE: "*I'll get you for this, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "복수할거요, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，我將會因此而逮到您。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger028Subtitle
US: "*You'll regret destroying that airfield, General"
DE: "*You'll regret destroying that airfield, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 비행장을 파괴한 걸 후회할거요, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，您將會後悔破壞那些機場！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger029Subtitle
US: "*Dozers, rebuild our defenses!"
DE: "*Dozers, rebuild our defenses!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "불도저! 방어 시설 수리를 시작하라!"
ZH: "\n推土機，重建我們的防禦單位！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger030Subtitle
US: "*This is General Granger to Aircraft Carrier Olympia: Send reinforcementsrepeat: send reinforcements"
DE: "*This is General Grainger to Aircraft Carrier Olympia: Send reinforcementsrepeat: send reinforcements"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n그레인저 장군이 항공모함 올림피아 호에 알린다. 당장 지원군을 파견하라.\n반복한다. 당장 지원군을 파견하라!"
ZH: "\n這是奧林匹亞航空母艦的葛陵格將軍：派遣支援，重複，派遣支援！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger031Subtitle
US: "*They're attacking the Command Center! All forces, regroup!"
DE: "*They're attacking the Command Center! All forces, regroup!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "커맨드 센터를 공격하고 있다. 전 부대, 재편성하라!"
ZH: "\n他們正在攻擊指揮中心！所有軍隊重新整合！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger032Subtitle
US: "*I don't appreciate you shooting down my planes, General"
DE: "*I don't appreciate you shooting down my planes, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 비행기들을 격추시키다니 용서하지 않겠소."
ZH: "\n將軍，我不樂於見到您擊落我的飛機。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger033Subtitle
US: "*They're taking over our Oil Derricks! Rangers, get out there and take them back!"
DE: "*They're taking over our Oil Derricks! Rangers, get out there and take them back!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리의 원유 유정탑을 차지하려 하고 있다. 레인저, 저 놈들을 몰아내라!"
ZH: "\n他們正要接管我們的油井！遊騎兵，出發到那裡將它們搶回來！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger034Subtitle
US: "*Get out of our base!"
DE: "*Get out of our base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지에서 나가시오!"
ZH: "\n滾出我們的基地！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger035Subtitle
US: "*Get out of my airspace, General!"
DE: "*Get out of my airspace, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 영공에서 사라지시오!"
ZH: "\n將軍，離開我的領空！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger036Subtitle
US: "*The enemy's in our perimeter! All planes return to base!"
DE: "*The enemy's in our perimeter! All planes return to base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "적들이 우리 반경에 있다! 전 항공기는 기지로 귀환하라!"
ZH: "\n敵人正在我們周圍！所有飛機返回基地！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger037Subtitle
US: "*Ground forces, defend the airfields!"
DE: "*Ground forces, defend the airfields!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지상 병력, 비행장을 방어하라!"
ZH: "\n地面部隊，防守機場！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger038Subtitle
US: "*You're not stealing my supplies, are you, General?"
DE: "*You're not stealing my supplies, are you, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 서플라이를 훔치려는 건 아니겠지, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您不是打算要偷我的補給品吧，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger039Subtitle
US: "*They're coming in the back-door!"
DE: "*They're coming in the back-door!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "적이 뒤로 들어오고 있다!"
ZH: "\n他們正從後門闖入！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger040Subtitle
US: "*Hiding in the village, huh. That's a coward's tactic, General"
DE: "*Hiding in the village, huh. That's a coward's tactic, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "마을로 숨다니, 원 참. 겁장이들의 전술이군."
ZH: "\n哈！原來躲在村莊裡。將軍，這是膽小鬼才會用的戰術。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger041Subtitle
US: "*Stop hiding, General. Don't make me come and get you"
DE: "*Stop hiding, General. Don't make me come and get you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그만 숨으시오, 장군. 내가 직접 나서서 당신을 잡게 하지 마시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，停止躲藏。別讓我親自動手抓人！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger042Subtitle
US: "*They're at the East gate!"
DE: "*They're at the East gate!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "적들이 동문에 있다!"
ZH: "\n他們現在正在東方大門！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger043Subtitle
US: "*Defend the East side!"
DE: "*Defend the East side!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "동쪽을 사수하라!"
ZH: "\n防禦東邊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger044Subtitle
US: "*Enemy forces approaching the West gate!"
DE: "*Enemy forces approaching the West gate!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "적들이 서문으로 접근하고 있다!"
ZH: "\n敵軍正往西方大門接近！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger045Subtitle
US: "*All forces to the West gate!"
DE: "*All forces to the West gate!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "모든 부대는 서문으로!"
ZH: "\n所有軍隊前往西邊大門！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger046Subtitle
US: "*Having trouble keeping your power up, General?"
DE: "*Having trouble keeping your power up, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전력 공급에 문제라도 있소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，在維持電力方面遇到一些麻煩嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger047Subtitle
US: "*Oops, your power's down - here come the bombs!"
DE: "*Oops, your power's down - here come the bombs!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "저런, 전력이 떨어졌군. 여기 폭탄이 있소!"
ZH: "\n哎喲！您的電力不足，炸彈來襲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger048Subtitle
US: "*Out of resources, General? Want to borrow some?"
DE: "*Out of resources, General? Want to borrow some?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자금이 바닥났다고? 내가 좀 빌려줄까?"
ZH: "\n資源耗盡了嗎，將軍？想跟我借一些嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger049Subtitle
US: "*Hey, General, how 'bout we call this one a draw?"
DE: "*Hey, General, how 'bout we call this one a draw?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이보게 장군, 이제 그만 비겼다고 하지."
ZH: "\n嘿，將軍，這次算是平手，好嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger050Subtitle
US: "*You may have won the battle, General, but the war is far from over"
DE: "*You may have won the battle, General, but the war is far from over"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 이번엔 이겼을지 모르지만 전쟁은 아직 끝나지 않았소."
ZH: "\n將軍，您或許贏了這場戰役，但是戰爭將不會因此結束。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger051Subtitle
US: "*So, you built a Scud Storm. Think you can defend it?"
DE: "*So, you built a Scud Storm. Think you can defend it?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 폭풍을 건설했단 말이지. 그걸 지켜낼 자신 있나?"
ZH: "\n這樣看來，您已建好生化死雨風暴。好好思考您能否防守它？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger052Subtitle
US: "*Hmm, that's a lot of anti-air, General Think it will be enough to calm the fear?"
DE: "*Hmm, that's a lot of anti-air, General Think it will be enough to calm the fear?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "대공 방어가 잘되어있군. 이제 좀 겁이 가라앉았나?"
ZH: "\n哼！這麼多的制空防禦單位，將軍，您認為這足以撫平您內心的恐懼嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger053Subtitle
US: "*Your tanks are no match for my planes, General"
DE: "*Your tanks are no match for my planes, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 탱크들은 비행기의 상대가 안될텐데."
ZH: "\n將軍，您的坦克不是我飛機的對手。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger054Subtitle
US: "*Anthrax! Everyone find cover!"
DE: "*Anthrax! Everyone find cover!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "탄저병이다! 전원 피신하라!"
ZH: "\n炭疽菌！大家快尋找掩護！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger055Subtitle
US: "*Garrison all the buildings you want, General-it won't help"
DE: "*Garrison all the buildings you want, General-it won't help"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "모든 건물에 수비대를 배치했군. 소용없을 텐데."
ZH: "\n駐守所有您想要的建築物，將軍。不過這對您毫無幫助。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger056Subtitle
US: "*How much more of this can you take, General?"
DE: "*How much more of this can you take, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "얼마다 더 당해야 정신을 차릴까, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您還能堅持多久呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger057Subtitle
US: "*Ready to surrender yet?"
DE: "*Ready to surrender yet?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아직 항복하려면 멀었나?"
ZH: "\n準備好要投降沒？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger058Subtitle
US: "*Haven't you lost enough troops, General?"
DE: "*Haven't you lost enough troops, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 부대를 잃을 만큼 잃었지 않았나?"
ZH: "\n將軍，看來您還覺得失去的軍隊不夠多？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger059Subtitle
US: "*This battle is over, General-surrender or prepare to die!"
DE: "*This battle is over, General-surrender or prepare to die!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전쟁은 끝났네, 장군. 항복하던지 아니면 죽을 준비 하게."
ZH: "\n這場戰役結束了，將軍－投降吧！否則就準備受死！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger060Subtitle
US: "*Not going to surrender, huh? Too bad"
DE: "*Not going to surrender, huh? Too bad"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "항복을 못하겠다고? 이런, 좋지 않군."
ZH: "\n嘿！還不準備投降嗎？那真叫人遺憾。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger061Subtitle
US: "*Bombs away, punk"
DE: "*Bombs away, punk"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "폭탄을 받아라!"
ZH: "\n炸彈爆炸了，菜鳥！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger062Subtitle
US: "*Come on, General--I'll show you the meaning of \"Death from Above.\""
DE: "*Come on, General--I'll show you the meaning of, \"Death from Above.\""
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "하늘에서 내리는 죽음이 무슨 말인지를 보여주지."
ZH: "\n別這樣，將軍。我將讓你知道什麼叫做真正的\"死亡置頂。\""
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger063Subtitle
US: "*Sonic-boom, baby. Let's do this thing"
DE: "*Sonic-boom, baby. Let's do this thing"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "음속 돌파! 이걸 한번 해볼텐가."
ZH: "\n音爆！親愛的！讓我們試試這個吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger064Subtitle
US: "*I guess it's time for me to go find a good airline job"
DE: "*I guess it's time for me to go find a good airline job"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 항공사에 취직자리나 알아봐야겠군."
ZH: "\n我想該是我去找個好航空工作的時候了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger065Subtitle
US: "*I win--you lose. What more is there to say?"
DE: "*I win--you lose. What more is there to say?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "난 이겼고 자넨 졌네. 더 이상 무슨 말이 필요한가?"
ZH: "\n我贏了--您輸了。這句話再貼切不過了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger066Subtitle
US: "*Be advised: This area is under the control of Air Force General Malcolm Granger. Withdraw now or prepare to be bombed back to the stone-age"
DE: "*Be advised: This area is under the control fo Air Force General Malcolm Grainger. Withdraw now or prepare to be bombed back to the stone-age"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "경고:\n이 지역은 에어포스 제너럴 말콤 그레인저의 통제 하에 있다.\n후퇴하지 않으면 초토화시켜버리겠다."
ZH: "\n警告：這個區域是屬於空軍將軍馬爾康所控管。馬上撤離，否則就準備被炸成碎塊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger067Subtitle
US: "*General, you're no match for me--I own the skies!"
DE: "*General, you're no match for me--I own the skies!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 당신은 내 상대가 아니야. 나는 하늘의 지배자란 말이오!"
ZH: "\n將軍，你不是我的對手。天空都是我的領域！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger068Subtitle
US: "*Watch the skies, General; we're going to put on an air-show"
DE: "*Watch the skies, General; we're going to put on an air-show"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "하늘을 보시오, 장군. 에어쇼를 시작할테니."
ZH: "\n看看天際，將軍；我們正準備作一場飛行表演。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger069Subtitle
US: "*Wanna see it again?"
DE: "*Wanna see it again?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "한번 더 볼텐가?"
ZH: "\n還想再看一次嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger070Subtitle
US: "*Ready-or-not, here I come!"
DE: "*Ready-or-not, here I come!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "준비가 됐건 말건, 시작하겠네!"
ZH: "\n準備好了沒，我來了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger071Subtitle
US: "*You don't mind if we drop-in, do ya General?"
DE: "*You don't mind if we drop-in, do ya General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 잠깐 들러도 되겠지? 괜찮나?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您不介意我降落吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger072Subtitle
US: "*That's two of my airfields you've hit, General. I'm starting to get annoyed"
DE: "*That's two of my airfields you've hit, General. I'm starting to get annoyed"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 비행장 두 군데를 공격하다니. 나를 슬슬 화나게 하는데."
ZH: "\n將軍，您已經擊中我的兩座機場，將軍。我開始火大了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger073Subtitle
US: "*Curse you, General. If you hit another airfield I'll come for you personally"
DE: "*Curse you, General. If you hit another airfield I'll come for you personally"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "제기랄! 내 비행장을 또 파괴하면 내가 직접 나서서 복수하지."
ZH: "\n將軍，我詛咒您！假如您破壞另一座機場，我將親自向您問罪"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger074Subtitle
US: "*That's the last airfield you destroy today. (Announcing to his own troops) Forces, target their Command Center"
DE: "*That's the last airfield you destroy today. (Announcing to his own troops) Forces, target their Command Center"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그게 당신이 오늘 파괴한 마지막 비행장이 될 것이네. 전 부대, 적의 커맨드 센터를 조준하라."
ZH: "\n這將是您今天摧毀的最後一座機場。（向他自己的軍隊宣佈）所有部隊，瞄準他們的指揮中心！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger075Subtitle
US: "*I can't believe you beat me, General. I salute your superior tactics"
DE: "*I can't believe you beat me, General. I salute your superior tactics"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신이 날 이기다니, 믿을 수 없군. 나보다 더 우월한 전략에 경의를 표하네."
ZH: "\n將軍，您居然擊敗我！我真不敢相信！我向您優異的戰術致敬！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger076Subtitle
US: "*It looks like you defeated me this time, General, but we'll meet again someday and I won't be so merciful because-"
DE: "*It looks like you defeated me this time, General, but we'll meet again someday and I won't be so merciful because-"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이번에는 날 이긴 것처럼 보이지만 언젠가 다시 만나면 봐주지 않겠소."
ZH: "\n將軍，看來這次您打敗我了，但是我們總有相遇的一天，下次我就不會這麼仁慈了，因為……"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger077Subtitle
US: "*I thought he'd never shut up"
DE: "*I thought he'd never shut up"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나를 이기리란 생각은 전혀 안해봤는데."
ZH: "\n我想他從不閉嘴。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger078Subtitle
US: "*You don't think I'm going to let you keep that Scud Storm, do you?"
DE: "*You don't think I'm going to let you keep that Scud Storm, do you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 스커드 폭풍을 내가 내버려둘 거라고 생각하나?"
ZH: "\n您該不會以為，我會讓您繼續這場生化死雨風暴吧，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger079Subtitle
US: "*Another Scud Storm? I guess it's time to take the up a notch"
DE: "*Another Scud Storm? I guess it's time to take the up a notch"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "또 스커드 폭풍을? 이제 콧대를 좀 꺾어줘야겠군."
ZH: "\n是另一座生化死雨風暴嗎？我認為該是去佔領一座峽谷的時候了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger080Subtitle
US: "*Pilots, watch-out for those Stinger Sites"
DE: "*Pilots, watch-out for those Stinger Sites"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전 조종사들은 스팅어 사이트를 조심하라."
ZH: "\n駕駛員，小心那些針刺飛彈陣地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger081Subtitle
US: "*So many Rangers-so few buildings to capture"
DE: "*So many Rangers-so few buildings to capture"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "레인저는 많은데 점령할 건물은 별로 없군."
ZH: "\n這麼多的遊騎兵—可以佔領的建築物卻那麼少。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger082Subtitle
US: "*General, do ya know how a Fuel-Air Bomb works? How 'bout a demonstration?"
DE: "*General, do ya know how a Fuel-Air Bomb works? How 'bout a demonstration?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 기화 폭탄이라고 들어봤나? 폭죽 한번 터뜨려볼까?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您知道如何油氣彈的作用是什麼嗎？我證明給您看看好嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger083Subtitle
US: "*Welcome to the party, Colonel Burton. You're in for it now, General"
DE: "*Welcome to the party, Colonel Burton. You're in for it now, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "파티에 잘 오셨소, 버튼 대령. 장군, 이제 자넨 끝장이네."
ZH: "\n貝頓上校，歡迎來到這個派對。將軍，你現在躲不掉了"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger084Subtitle
US: "*Do you know how to stop an A-10, General? Me neither"
DE: "*Do you know how to stop an A-10, General? Me neither"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "A10을 멈추는 법을 아시나? 나도 모르겠는걸."
ZH: "\n將軍，您知道如何停止A-10的攻擊嗎？就連我也不知道。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger085Subtitle
US: "*Hey, wanna see our new Bunker Buster?"
DE: "*Hey, wanna see our new Bunker Buster?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리의 새로운 벙커 버스터 한번 구경하겠나?"
ZH: "\n嘿！您想看看我們新作的碉堡炸彈嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger086Subtitle
US: "*Artillery! You think you can attack me with artillery?"
DE: "*Artillery! You think you can attack me with artillery?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "포병으로 나를 공격할 수 있다고 보나?"
ZH: "\n自走砲！您認為您可以用自走砲攻擊我嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger087Subtitle
US: "*You know that Scud Launcher is never going to make it to my base, right?"
DE: "*You know that Scud Launcher is never going to make it to my base, right?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 발사기는 사정 거리가 우리 기지까지 안될텐데."
ZH: "\n您知道生化飛彈發射車永遠不可能射中我的基地，對吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger088Subtitle
US: "*Wait, that's a Bomb Truck! Everyone look out!"
DE: "*Wait, that's a Bomb Truck! Everyone look out!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "폭탄 트럭이다! 모두들 조심하라."
ZH: "\n等等！那是輛炸彈卡車！大家小心！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger089Subtitle
US: "*You've forced me to use tanksI hate using tanks"
DE: "*You've forced me to use tanksI hate using tanks"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 탱크를 사용하게끔 만드는군. 탱크는 정말 싫어."
ZH: "\n您已迫使我必須使用坦克車！我討厭使用坦克車！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger090Subtitle
US: "*Having trouble crossing the river, General? Wanna lift?"
DE: "*Having trouble crossing the river, General? Wanna lift?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "강을 건너기 힘들지, 장군? 내가 실어다 줄까?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您在過河時遇到一些麻煩？想要用空運嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger091Subtitle
US: "*Cowards! Stop hiding and fight!"
DE: "*Cowards! Stop hiding and fight!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "겁장이들! 그만 좀 숨고 이제 싸우자!"
ZH: "\n膽小鬼！不要再躲了，快出來對決！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger092Subtitle
US: "*Stealth won't save you, General; we'll find you"
DE: "*Stealth won't save you, General; we'll find you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스텔스로 목숨을 건지기는 힘들걸. 자네는 곧 발견될걸세."
ZH: "\n將軍，隱形戰機將不能拯救您。我們將找到您"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Grainger093Subtitle
US: "*Hmm, that's a lot of anti-air, General"
DE: "*Hmm, that's a lot of anti-air, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "흠, 대공 방어가 잘 되어있군."
ZH: "\n哼，防空單位可真是多呢，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry001Subtitle
US: "*So, this is where you're hiding, General"
DE: "*So, this is where you're hiding, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그러니까 이런 곳에 숨어있었단 말이지?"
ZH: "\n這樣看來，這就是你的藏匿之處，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry002Subtitle
US: "*<sarcastic>Feeling overwhelmed General?"
DE: "*<sarcastic>Feeling overwhelmed General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "너무 나에게 압도당했나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n<嘲笑>將軍，您感到挫敗了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry003Subtitle
US: "*(Chinese infantry troops die) <angry voice> 1 billion more where that came from"
DE: "*(Chinese infantry troops die) <angry voice> 1 billion more where that came from"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아직 10억명을 더 해치워야 할걸세."
ZH: "\n(中國步兵軍隊陣亡)<怒聲>這十億以上的士兵是打哪來的阿！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry004Subtitle
US: "*(Paradrop)Like a swarm of locusts they descend from the sky to devour all those who stand against China"
DE: "*(Paradrop)Like a swarm of locusts they decend from the sky to devour all those who stand against China"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "하늘을 뒤덮은 메뚜기떼들처럼 중국에 대항하는 자는 누구든 먹어치우지 ."
ZH: "\n（傘兵）就像一群蝗蟲般，他們從天而降，消滅掉那些對抗中國軍的人。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry005Subtitle
US: "*Ever been hacked General?"
DE: "*Ever been hacked General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "해킹 당해본 적 있나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您曾經嚐過被砍殺的滋味嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry006Subtitle
US: "*<shouting>March!"
DE: "*<shouting>March!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "행군하라!"
ZH: "\n<大叫>前進！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry007Subtitle
US: "*They make good shields too"
DE: "*They make good shields too"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "좋은 방어막도 되지."
ZH: "\n他們也有堅固的防禦措施。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry008Subtitle
US: "*Here's a tip General, Surrender!"
DE: "*Here's a tip General, Surrender!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "충고 한마디 하지. 항복하게!"
ZH: "\n將軍，告訴您最後一招吧！就是投降！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry009Subtitle
US: "*Don't worry General, we don't take prisoners"
DE: "*Don't worry General, we don't take prisoners"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "걱정 말라고, 장군. 우린 포로는 안키워."
ZH: "\n將軍，別擔心，我們不會殺害戰俘。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry010Subtitle
US: "*Unleash Horde!"
DE: "*Unleash Horde!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "대군을 풀어라!"
ZH: "\n解放軍隊吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry011Subtitle
US: "*It's ok General, we've brought our own flag for your base"
DE: "*It's ok General, we've brought our own flag for your base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "괜찮소, 장군. 당신 기지에 꽂을 깃발은 우리가 준비했소."
ZH: "\n將軍，一切都搞定了，我們已替您的基地插上我方的旗幟。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry012Subtitle
US: "*Soon all your men will see are boots marching over them"
DE: "*Soon all your men will see are boots marching over them"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "곧 자네 병사들은 자신들의 몸뚱이 위로 군화들이 저벅거리는 걸 보겠지."
ZH: "\n您的士兵們馬上就可以看到軍鞋踐踏在他們身上。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry013Subtitle
US: "*Charge!"
DE: "*Charge!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장전!"
ZH: "\n衝阿！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry014Subtitle
US: "*Death to all who oppose us!"
DE: "*Death to all who oppose us!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "적에게 죽음을!"
ZH: "\n逆我者死！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry015Subtitle
US: "*Do you know how hard it is to feed a horde, General?"
DE: "*Do you know how hard it is to feed a horde, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 어마어마한 대군을 먹여살리기가 얼마나 힘든지 아나?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您知道養這麼一大群士兵有多麼困難嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry016Subtitle
US: "*I have enough men to hold a parade. Can we have it in your base?"
DE: "*I have enough men to hold a parade. Can we have it in your base?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나에겐 퍼레이드를 할 만큼 많은 병력이 있다네. 자넨 어떤가?"
ZH: "\n我擁有的士兵多到足以進行一場閱兵大典。我們可以在您的基地舉行嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry017Subtitle
US: "*Are you still here, General?"
DE: "*Are you still here, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아직 여기 있나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您還在這裡嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry018Subtitle
US: "*Are you just going to sit there and wait to be overrun?"
DE: "*Are you just going to sit there and wait to be overrun?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "거기 앉아서 죽을 때까지 기다릴건가?"
ZH: "\n您只想坐以待斃嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry019Subtitle
US: "*Are your resources getting low, General?"
DE: "*Are your resources getting low, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자원이 점점 줄고 있소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您的資源正在減少嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry020Subtitle
US: "*How long does it take for you to build your little tank force?"
DE: "*How long does it take for you to build your little tank force?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 작은 탱크 부대를 만드는데 얼마나 걸리나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您需要多久的時間製造您的小坦克？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry021Subtitle
US: "*<sarcastic> What tactic will you amaze me with now, General?"
DE: "*<sarcastic> What tactic will you amaze me with now, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어떤 전술로 나를 놀라게 해줄 건가, 장군?"
ZH: "\n<嘲諷>將軍，現在您還能用哪些戰術來迷惑我呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry022Subtitle
US: "*This can't be the best you can do, General"
DE: "*This can't be the best you can do, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이게 정말 최선을 다한 건가?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您應該可以做得更好。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry023Subtitle
US: "*So far I'm not impressed, General"
DE: "*So far I'm not impressed, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지금까진, 별로 감동을 못 받았소, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，到目前為止我還沒有深刻印象。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry024Subtitle
US: "*You were not prepared for this challenge, were you, General?"
DE: "*You were not prepared for this challenge, were you, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "챌린지를 성공하고 싶긴 한건가, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您尚未做好準備接受挑戰，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry025Subtitle
US: "*I have enough men to crush you without firing a shot"
DE: "*I have enough men to crush you without firing a shot"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "총 한 발 안 쏘고도 당신을 뭉개버릴만큼의 부하들이 있소."
ZH: "\n毋須用任何彈藥，我擁有足夠的士兵將您打敗。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry026Subtitle
US: "*We are coming for you, General"
DE: "*We are coming for you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리가 가겠네, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，我們為您而來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry027Subtitle
US: "*Awwwe've knocked over your little Tech Building. Boo-hoo"
DE: "*Awwwe've knocked over your little Tech Building. Boo-hoo"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "와아, 자네의 조그마한 테크 빌딩을 부숴버렸군! 이얏호!"
ZH: "\n哇～我們已經摧毀您小小的科技建築。您真是悽慘阿！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry028Subtitle
US: "*Now your Barracks is gone. How will you fight without men?"
DE: "*Now your Barracks is gone. How will you fight without men?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "막사가 무너졌군. 부하들 없이 어떻게 싸울거요?"
ZH: "\n現在您的兵營已經消失，沒有士兵您如何作戰？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry029Subtitle
US: "*Without a War Factory you'll have to fight me man-to-man, General"
DE: "*Without a War Factory you'll have to fight me man-to-man, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "군수공장이 없으면, 백병전을 해야 할텐데, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，在沒有戰車工廠的情況下，您將與我一對一的對決。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry030Subtitle
US: "*No more planes for you. Get on the ground and fight like a man"
DE: "*No more planes for you. Get on the ground and fight like a man"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신, 이제 비행기가 더 이상 없군. 지상에서 남자담게 싸워 보자구."
ZH: "\n您沒有任何飛機了。回到地面，和我來場男子漢的對決吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry031Subtitle
US: "*My men are marching right through you base defenses, General"
DE: "*My men are marching right through you base defenses, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 부하들이 당신 기지 방어막을 뚫고 진군하고 있소, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，我的士兵正強行通過您的基地防禦單位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry032Subtitle
US: "*There is only empty ground where your Command Center once stood, General"
DE: "*There is only empty ground where your Command Center once stood, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여기가 당신 커맨드 센터가 있던 자린데, 이젠 텅 빈 땅 뿐이군."
ZH: "\n將軍，這裡曾經是您的指揮中心所在，現在只剩下空空如也的土地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry033Subtitle
US: "*I have lost many men, General, but the cost to your buildings has been worth it"
DE: "*I have lost many men, General, but the cost to your buildings has been worth it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "부하들을 많이 잃었소, 하지만 당신 건물들만큼의 가치가 있지."
ZH: "\n將軍，我已經失去多位士兵，但能夠讓您的建築物成本大增，一切都是值得的。。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry034Subtitle
US: "*Leave my Tech Buildings alone, General!"
DE: "*Leave my Tech Buildings alone, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 테크 빌딩을 그냥 두시오, 장군!"
ZH: "\n將軍，離我的科技建築遠一點。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry035Subtitle
US: "*NO! Not my Barracks! We will build another, Generalthen you will pay"
DE: "*NO! Not my Barracks! We will build another, Generalthen you will pay"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "안돼! 내 막사! 다시 지어야지. 대가를 치르게 될거요."
ZH: "\n不！不會是我的兵營吧！將軍，我們會興建另一座的，而您將為此付出代價。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry036Subtitle
US: "*My War Factory is not essential to my victory, but do not destroy another"
DE: "*My War Factory is not essential to my victory, but do not destroy another"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 군수공장은 승리에 꼭 필요하진 않지만, 그래도 내버려 두시오."
ZH: "\n雖然我的戰車工廠並非獲勝的必要條件，但是還是請您別再破壞其他廠了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry037Subtitle
US: "*You have destroyed my Air Field! This is getting annoying, General"
DE: "*You have destroyed my Air Field! This is getting annoying, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 비행장을 부쉈어! 슬슬 나를 화나게 하는데, 장군."
ZH: "\n您已經摧毀我的機場！將軍，這真叫我火大。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry038Subtitle
US: "*Destroy all the base defenses you want--they're only there to slow you down anyway"
DE: "*Destoy all the base defenses you want--they're only there to slow you down anyway"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기지 방어 시설은 마음껏 부수시오. 어차피 당신을 지연시킬 목적으로 만든 거니까."
ZH: "\n摧毀所有您想要的基地防禦單位吧--它們在此只是用來拖延您的速度而已。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry039Subtitle
US: "*You have cost me many buildings, General. My men are coming to collect repayment"
DE: "*You have cost me many buildings, General. My men are coming to collect repayment"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 빌딩들을 많이 부쉈소, 장군. 내 부하들이 곧 보복하러 갈거요."
ZH: "\n您已經讓我花許多錢在建築物上了，將軍。我的士兵正準備向您追討！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry040Subtitle
US: "*Nooo! They destroyed my Command Center! Go get them! Keep them away from me!"
DE: "*Nooo! They destroyed my Command Center! Go get them! Keep them away from me!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "안돼! 내 커맨드 센터를 부수다니! 가서 잡아! 내 앞에서 쫓아 버려!"
ZH: "\n不不不！他們已摧毀我的指揮中心！快去阻止他們！讓他們離我遠一點！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry041Subtitle
US: "*Swat all the planes you like, General--we'll make more"
DE: "*Swat all the planes you like, General--we'll make more"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행기를 마음껏 부수시오. 또 만들면 되니까."
ZH: "\n將軍，攻擊所有您喜歡的飛機吧--反正我們會製造更多架。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry042Subtitle
US: "*My vehicles are not for your target practice, General"
DE: "*My vehicles are not for your target practice, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 차량들은 당신의 연습용 표적이 아니란 말이오."
ZH: "\n將軍，我的載具並不是您練習的靶子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry043Subtitle
US: "*There are many more in my army ready to sacrifice for China, General. You won't stop us"
DE: "*There are many more in my army ready to sacrifice for China, General. You won't stop us"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "중국을 위해서 희생할 준비가 된 수많은 군인들이 아직도 많소, 장군. 우릴 막지 못할거요."
ZH: "\n將軍，在我的軍隊裡有許多人願意為中國犧牲。您是無法阻止我們的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry044Subtitle
US: "*I see you've captured my Oil Derrick, General. We are coming to take back China's oil now"
DE: "*I see you've captured my Oil Derrick, General. We are coming to take back China's oil now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 원유 유정탑을 점령했군. 중국의 석유를 되찾으러 곧 가겠네."
ZH: "\n將軍，我知道您已經佔領我的油井。我們現在就要奪回屬於中國的石油。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry045Subtitle
US: "*That old Artillery Platform is destroyed, General; you'll never get it to work"
DE: "*That old Artillery Platform is destoyed, General; you'll never get it to work"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 낡은 캐논 플랫폼은 망가졌다네, 장군. 고치지 못할걸."
ZH: "\n將軍，那些老舊的砲兵陣地被摧毀了；您再也不能讓它復原了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry046Subtitle
US: "*Do you think that Oil Refinery is just there for anyone to use? Return the refinery to me now"
DE: "*Do you think that Oil Refinery is just there for anyone to use? Return the refinery to me now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "정유 공장이 아무나 쓰라고 있는 곳인줄 아시오? 당장 내놓으시오."
ZH: "\n您以為煉油廠是放在這裡免費給任何人使用的嗎？現在立刻把它還給我！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry047Subtitle
US: "*Get any closer to my base and I'll set the horde out on you"
DE: "*Get any closer to my base and I'll set the horde out on you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지에 가까이 오면, 내 대군을 풀겠소."
ZH: "\n再靠近我的基地一步，我就會派出大批人馬反擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry048Subtitle
US: "*I warn you, General, get away from my base. Do you know what a hundred men can do to a tank?"
DE: "*I warn you, General, get away from my base. Do you know what a hundred men can do to a tank?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n장군. 경고하건대 내 기지에서 나가시오.\n군인 백명이 탱크 한대에 무슨 짓을 할 수 있는지 아시오?"
ZH: "\n將軍，我警告您！快離開我的基地！您難道不知道眾志成城的故事嗎？大批士兵將摧毀您的坦克！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry049Subtitle
US: "*They're in our base! Kill them! Get them out of here!"
DE: "*They're in our base! Kill them! Get them out of here!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "적들이 기지에 있다! 죽여라! 여기서 몰아내!"
ZH: "\n他們在我們基地裡！殺了他們！讓他們滾出這裡！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry050Subtitle
US: "*They're getting too close! Protect me!"
DE: "*They're getting too close! Protect me!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "너무 가까이 왔어! 도와줘!"
ZH: "\n他們太靠近了！快保護我！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry051Subtitle
US: "*General, get away from my resources--my men need those"
DE: "*General, get away from my resources--my men need those"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 내 자원에서 물러나시오. 우리 부하들이 써야 되거든."
ZH: "\n將軍，離我的資源遠一點—我的士兵需要那些東西。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry052Subtitle
US: "*General, do not try to flank my base"
DE: "*General, do not try to flank my base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 측면 공격은 꿈도 꾸지 마시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，別想從側翼攻擊我的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry053Subtitle
US: "*A back-door attack will not help you, General"
DE: "*A back-door attack will not help you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "후면 공격은 소용 없을거요, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，從背後攻擊對您毫無幫助。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry054Subtitle
US: "*Attacking the front of my base is foolish, General"
DE: "*Attacking the front of my base is foolish, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "정면 공격은 멍청한 짓이오, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，從正面攻擊我的基地是很愚蠢的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry055Subtitle
US: "*Those are my Tech Buildings, General. Stay away"
DE: "*Those are my Tech Buildings, General. Stay away"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 테크 빌딩을 그냥 두시오, 장군!"
ZH: "\n將軍，那些是我的科技建築。請離它們遠一點。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry056Subtitle
US: "*Get out of my buildings, General!"
DE: "*Get out of my buildings, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 건물에서 나가시오 장군!"
ZH: "\n將軍，滾出我的建築物！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry057Subtitle
US: "*Crossing that bridge is a mistake, General"
DE: "*Crossing that bridge is a mistake, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "다리를 건넌 건 실수요, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，越過那道橋是個錯誤。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry058Subtitle
US: "*You've run out of power, General--your defenses are down and my men will invade soon"
DE: "*You've run out of power, General--your defenses are down and my men will invade soon"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전력이 떨어졌군. 방어 시설이 무용지물이 되었으니 우리 병사들이 곧 쳐들어갈것이오."
ZH: "\n將軍，您已經耗盡電力—您的防禦單位逐漸變弱，而我的士兵馬上就要大舉入侵。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry059Subtitle
US: "*Without power you'll never stop my horde, General"
DE: "*Without power you'll never stop my horde, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전력이 없으면 내 대군을 어떻게 막아낼 생각인가."
ZH: "\n將軍，在沒有電力的情況下，您將無法阻止我的大批軍隊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry060Subtitle
US: "*You've wasted all your resources fighting my menbut I still have more men"
DE: "*You've wasted all your resources fighting my menbut I still have more men"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 대군을 막아내기 위해 모든 자금을 다 썼나본데, 아직 내 병력은 넘쳐난다네."
ZH: "\n您已經花掉一切資源來跟我的士兵纏鬥，但是我仍然擁有很多士兵。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry061Subtitle
US: "*We are out of resources! How did this happen?"
DE: "*We are out of resources! How did this happen?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자원이 바닥나고 있다! 어떻게 이런 일이 생겼나?"
ZH: "\n我們的資源要用完了！怎麼會發生這種事呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry062Subtitle
US: "*Build your Scud Storm--it will only hit a few of my menthe rest will destroy you"
DE: "*Build your Scud Storm--it will only hit a few of my menthe rest will destroy you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 폭풍을 건설하게나. 우리 병사들이 좀 다치겠지만 나머지 병사들이 복수할걸세."
ZH: "\n建造您的生化死雨風暴吧--它只能射擊我少數的人馬，其他人將會摧毀您！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry063Subtitle
US: "*I thought nuclear missile were not allowed! This is hardly fair, General"
DE: "*I thought nuclear missile were not allowed! This is hardly fair, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵미사일은 금지된 걸로 아는데! 정정당당하지 못하오, 장군!"
ZH: "\n我認為核子彈是不合理的！將軍，這太不公平了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry064Subtitle
US: "*That Particle Cannon is useless against my horde!"
DE: "*That Particle Cannon is useless against my horde!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "파티클 캐논은 내 대군 앞에선 무용지물이지!"
ZH: "\n離子砲也無法對抗我的軍隊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry065Subtitle
US: "*Yes, you should build more base defenses--at least then you can stop the first wave of the charging horde"
DE: "*Yes, you should build more base defenses--at least then you can stop the first wave of the charging horde"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 기지 방어막을 더 만드시오. 적어도 나의 대군의 첫 줄 정도는 막을 수 있겠지."
ZH: "\n是的，您應該建造更多的基地防禦單位—至少您接下來可以阻止第一波的軍隊進攻。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry066Subtitle
US: "*Coward! You know that your tanks cannot crush my men, don't you?"
DE: "*Coward! You know that your tanks cannot crush my men, don't you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "겁장이같으니! 당신의 탱크가 내 부하들을 이길 수 없다는 걸 모르나?"
ZH: "\n膽小鬼！您知道坦克車無法碾碎我的士兵，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry067Subtitle
US: "*So many planesno matter, my horde and bring down your planes too"
DE: "*So many planesno matter, my horde and bring down your planes too"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행기가 많군.. 하지만 내 부하들에게 모두 격추당할것이오."
ZH: "\n這麼多的飛機！沒關係，我的軍隊照樣可以把你的飛機擊落！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry068Subtitle
US: "*You're mobilizing a horde of your own?! You will need many more men to match my strength, General"
DE: "*You're mobilizing a horde of your own?! You will need many more men to match my strength, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오, 당신도 대군을 한번 만드시겠다? 하지만 내 대군을 따라오려면 멀었는걸?"
ZH: "\n您正在動員自己的軍隊嗎？！將軍，您將需要更多士兵才能與我抗衡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry069Subtitle
US: "*You base has grown too large, General. It is time for my men to drop in and capture a few for China"
DE: "*You base has grown too large, General. It is time for my men to drop in and capture a few for China"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기지가 꽤 확장되었군. 이제 우리 병사들이 쳐들어가서 점령하기만 하면 되는군."
ZH: "\n將軍，您的基地已擴展地太過龐大。現在我的士兵將要好好拜訪您，順道俘虜一些人充當中國士兵。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry070Subtitle
US: "*Scud Storm! Scatter!"
DE: "*Scud Storm! Scatter!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 폭풍이다! 모두 흩어져!"
ZH: "\n生化死雨風暴！快散開！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry071Subtitle
US: "*Nuclear missile approaching! Flee! Get me out of here!"
DE: "*Nuclear missile approaching! Flee! Get me out of here!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵미사일이 오고 있다! 도망쳐라! 나를 여기서 꺼내줘!"
ZH: "\n核子飛彈接近中！快逃！快帶我離開這裡！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry072Subtitle
US: "*Ooh, look at the pretty light show. What do you hope to accomplish with that petty weapon, General?"
DE: "*Ooh, look at the pretty light show. What do you hope to accomplish with that petty weapon, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아, 저 아름다운 광선 쇼 좀 보시오. 그 귀여운 무기로 뭘하려고 하시오, 장군?"
ZH: "\n啊！看看那炫麗的聲光表演。將軍，您希望用這個美麗的武器完成什麼呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry073Subtitle
US: "*Get out of that building, General. We have ways of bringing you out by force if necessary"
DE: "*Get out of that building, General. We have ways of bringing you out by force if necessary"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건물에서 병사들을 내보내시오. 필요하다면 강제로 끌어내는 방법도 있소."
ZH: "\n將軍，滾出那棟建築物。必要的話，我們不惜用任何方式將您強制驅逐。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry074Subtitle
US: "*You've brought Colonel Burton to our little war, General. Even he will fall when faced with the horde"
DE: "*You've brought Colonel Burton to our little war, General. Even he will fall when faced with the horde"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "버튼 대령을 이 작은 전쟁에 데려왔군. 하지만 그라도 내 대군 앞에선 무용지물이지."
ZH: "\n將軍，您已經帶領貝頓上校參與我們的小型戰爭。即使是堅毅如他，當他碰到我的部隊時也必將倒下！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry075Subtitle
US: "*Black Lotus? How will she help you survive my horde, General?"
DE: "*Black Lotus? How will she help you survive my horde, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "흑수선? 그녀가 어떻게 하면 내 대군에서 당신을 지켜줄까?"
ZH: "\n黑蓮花？將軍，她如何幫助您逃出我的軍隊呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry076Subtitle
US: "*All forces beware: Jarmen Kell is hiding in the field"
DE: "*All forces beware: Jarmen Kell is hiding in the field"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전 병력 주의하라. 쟈멘 켈이 적진에 숨어있다."
ZH: "\n所有部隊注意：賈曼卡爾正藏匿在這戰場上。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry077Subtitle
US: "*I see that Air Field, General. Run to the air! Fear my horde!"
DE: "*I see that Air Field, General. Run to the air! Fear my horde!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행장이 보이는군, 공중으로 도망가시오! 내 대군을 마구 두려워하시오!"
ZH: "\n將軍，我看到那座機場了。快躲入空中吧！我的部隊讓您感到恐懼！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry078Subtitle
US: "*My men will tear your tanks apart as fast as you can make them, General"
DE: "*My men will tear your tanks apart as fast as you can make them, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 대군은 당신이 탱크를 만드는 똑같은 속도로 파괴할 것이오."
ZH: "\n將軍，我的部隊將會破壞您的坦克，儘速把它們分開吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry079Subtitle
US: "*My men are trained in groups of threehow fast can you train your men?"
DE: "*My men are trained in groups of threehow fast can you train your men?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 병사들은 3명이 한 조로 훈련받고 나오지. 당신 병사들은 어떤가?"
ZH: "\n我的士兵分三組在訓練，您訓練士兵的速度能有多快？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry080Subtitle
US: "*Selling your buildings? Foolish! What will you buy with the money to stop my horde?"
DE: "*Selling your buildings? Foolish! What will you buy with the money to stop my horde?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건물을 판다고? 어리석긴! 그 돈으로 내 대군을 멈출 수 있는 걸 살 수 있다고 보나?"
ZH: "\n出售您的建築物？笨蛋！您這些錢，能夠買到什麼足以對抗我軍隊的東西嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry081Subtitle
US: "*I have so many forces, how can you be winning this battle?"
DE: "*I have so many forces, how can you be winning this battle?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 병력이 너무 많군. 이 전쟁을 이길 수 있다고 생각하나?"
ZH: "\n我擁有這麼多的部隊，您如何在這場戰役中獲勝？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry082Subtitle
US: "*I have underestimated your tactics, General"
DE: "*I have underestimated your tactics, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 전술을 과소평가했소, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，我低估您的戰略了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry083Subtitle
US: "*You've caught me off guard, General, but now I am ready for you"
DE: "*You've caught me off guard, General, but now I am ready for you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "경계를 게을리 했었네, 하지만 이제는 당신과 겨룰 준비가 되었소."
ZH: "\n將軍，您趁我不備時擄獲過我。但我現在已作好面對您的準備。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry084Subtitle
US: "*You will not defeat my horde, General! Your current advantage will soon be lost"
DE: "*You will not defeat my horde, General! Your current advantage will soon be lost"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 대군을 이길 순 없소, 장군. 당신이 지금은 조금 유리하지만 오래 못갈 거요."
ZH: "\n將軍，您無法打敗我的軍隊！您目前的優勢很快就會消失。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry085Subtitle
US: "*I do not accept this defeat, General. My men will cover my escape and we will fight another day"
DE: "*I do not accept this defeat, General. My men will cover my escape and we will fight another day"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n이 패배를 받아들일 수 없소, 장군. 내 부하들이 내 탈출을 도와주니,\n우린 언젠가 다시 싸우게 될거요."
ZH: "\n將軍，我不接受這次的戰敗。我的部下將會掩護我逃走，我們總有一天會再交手！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry086Subtitle
US: "*My men outnumber you now, General. I would be wise to surrender"
DE: "*My men outnumber you now, General. I would be wise to surrender"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 부하들이 수적으로 우세하군. 나라면 현명하게 항복하겠소."
ZH: "\n將軍，現在我的士兵人數比您的還多。識相的話就快點投降！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry087Subtitle
US: "*This looks like the end for you, General"
DE: "*This looks like the end for you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 끝인 거 같소, 장군."
ZH: "\n將軍，對您來說似乎已經結束了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry088Subtitle
US: "*If you do not retreat now I will unleash the horde to scrape you from our land"
DE: "*If you do not retreat now I will unleash the horde to scrape you from our land"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지금 후퇴하지 않으면, 우리 영토에서 당신을 몰아낼 대군을 풀겠소."
ZH: "\n假如您現在不撤退，我將解放大批士兵，將您趕出我的領土。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry089Subtitle
US: "*Do you feel the end drawing near, General?"
DE: "*Do you feel the end drawing near, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "끝이 가까워 지는 것을 느끼시오, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您感覺到您的末日已不遠了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry090Subtitle
US: "*Haha! I have defeated you. Now you must choose to join my horde or die"
DE: "*Haha! I have defeated you. Now you must choose to join my horde or die"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 당신을 이겼군! 내 부대에 합류하던가 죽음을 택하시오, 장군."
ZH: "\n哈哈！我已經擊敗您。現在，您必須選擇加入我的軍隊，或是死路一條。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry091Subtitle
US: "*It is time to unleash the horde!"
DE: "*It is time to unleash the horde!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "대군을 풀 때가 왔다!"
ZH: "\n是解放大批士兵的時候了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry092Subtitle
US: "*Face me and fall like the rest"
DE: "*Face me and fall like the rest"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나랑 붙은 다른 사람들은 다 안좋게 됐지."
ZH: "\n好好面對我，然後像其他敵人一樣乖乖倒下吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry093Subtitle
US: "*My men will crush you"
DE: "*My men will crush you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 병사들이 당신을 으깨버릴 것이오."
ZH: "\n我的部下將摧毀您。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry094Subtitle
US: "*We will tear through you like locusts"
DE: "*We will tear through you like locusts"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우린 메뚜기떼처럼 당신을 조각낼 것이오."
ZH: "\n我們會像對付蝗蟲一樣，將您撕裂。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry095Subtitle
US: "*Men? Where are my men? You wouldn't consider letting me go would you? Please don't hurt me"
DE: "*Men? Where are my men? You wouldn't consider letting me go would you? Please don't hurt me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 부하들은 다 어디 갔지? 나를 풀어줄 거죠? 제발 나를 해치지 말아주세요."
ZH: "\n士兵？我的士兵在哪？您不可能考慮讓我走的，是嗎？請別傷害我。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry096Subtitle
US: "*We have nice uniforms in the hordeit won't be so badyou might even like it. But I doubt it"
DE: "*We have nice uniforms in the hordeit won't be so badyou might even like it. But I doubt it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리 대군의 유니폼은 멋지다고들 하지. 당신도 마음에 들어할 거요. 과연 그럴까? 아하핫!"
ZH: "\n我們的軍隊穿著好看的制服。穿上它也不是太糟糕，您甚至還有可能愛上它喔！雖然我還是有些懷疑。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry097Subtitle
US: "*Are you ready to face my horde, General?"
DE: "*Are you ready to face my horde, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 대군에 맞설 준비가 되었는가, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您準備好要面對我的軍隊嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Infantry098Subtitle
US: "*And think, this is just the first wave"
DE: "*And think, this is just the first wave"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그리고 알아두라고, 이번 공격은 단지 첫 대열일 뿐이지."
ZH: "\n還有，您想想看，這只是第一波攻擊而已。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser001Subtitle
US: "*I have you in my sights now, General"
DE: "*I have you in my sights now, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 시야에 당신이 보이는군."
ZH: "\n將軍，現在您在我視線範圍內了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser002Subtitle
US: "*Precision attack commencing"
DE: "*Precision attack commencing"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "정밀 공격 시작."
ZH: "\n開始精準攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser003Subtitle
US: "* (player units destroyed) Interesting choice of tactics, they didn't help my last opponent either"
DE: "* (player units destroyed) Interesting choice of tactics, they didn't help my last opponent either"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아주 흥미로운 전술이군. 그런데 저번 상대도 그 전술을 쓰다 패했지 아마."
ZH: "\n(玩家單位被摧毀)有趣的戰術選擇，但它們也無法幫助我最後的對手逃出生天。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser004Subtitle
US: "*I'm about to attack, I thought you could use the warning"
DE: "*I'm about to attack, I thought you could use the warning"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "막 공격할 참이오. 경보음을 울리는게 좋을거요."
ZH: "\n我即將發動攻擊，我想您最好重視這個預警。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser005Subtitle
US: "*Maybe you should re-evaluate your strategies, they obviously don't work"
DE: "*Maybe you should re-evaluate your strategies, they obviously don't work"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 전술을 재검토해야겠소. 전혀 구실을 못하고 있잖소."
ZH: "\n也許您該重新評估戰略，它們顯然作用不大。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser006Subtitle
US: "*How do you like my new toys General?"
DE: "*How do you like my new toys General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 새로운 장난감들이 어떻소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，您還喜歡我的新玩具吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser007Subtitle
US: "*Prepare yourself General, you're about to be taught a lesson in war"
DE: "*Prepare yourself General, you're about to be taught a lesson in war"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "준비하시오, 이번 전쟁에서 곧 교훈을 배우게 될 테니까."
ZH: "\n自己做好準備吧，將軍。您將在這場戰爭中好好上一堂課。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser008Subtitle
US: "*Easy come, easy go"
DE: "*Easy come, easy go"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "쉽게 얻은 건 쉽게 잃는 법."
ZH: "\n來得容易，去得也容易。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser009Subtitle
US: "*Maybe you're not cut out for this, try painting"
DE: "*Maybe you're not cut out for this, try painting"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신은 이 직업이 적성에 안맞아. 미술을 한번 해보지?"
ZH: "\n也許您還沒有安排好這件事，試著描繪看看。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser010Subtitle
US: "*Beautiful aren't they General"
DE: "*Beautiful aren't they General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아름답지 않소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，它們真是美麗，可不是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser011Subtitle
US: "*My lasers will cut through your defenses like a hot knife through butter"
DE: "*My lasers will cut through your defenses like a hot knife through butter"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 레이저가 뜨거운 칼이 버터를 자르듯 당신의 방어막을 부술 거요."
ZH: "\n我的雷射將穿透您的防禦單位，就像是熱刀劃過奶油一般地容易。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser012Subtitle
US: "*Checkmate"
DE: "*Checkmate"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군 받으시오."
ZH: "\n將軍"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser013Subtitle
US: "*It's a whole new age of warfare, General, and it's coming to your doorstep"
DE: "*It's a whole new age of warfare, General, and it's coming to your doorstep"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "최첨단 신무기가 당신의 집 문을 두드리고 있소."
ZH: "\n將軍，這是一個全新的戰爭時期，而且，我已經靠近您的門階了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser014Subtitle
US: "*Target is painted--all forces begin attack run"
DE: "*Target is painted--all forces begin attack run"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "목표가 표시되었다. 전 병력 공격 개시!"
ZH: "\n目標已經著色，所有軍隊開始攻擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser015Subtitle
US: "*Originally all my weapons also had laser targeting, but my enemies got confused"
DE: "*Originally all my weapons also had laser targeting, but my enemies got confused"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "원래 내 모든 무기들은 레이저 조준이 가능한데 적들은 항상 헷갈려 하더군."
ZH: "\n我所有的武器還具有雷射瞄準功能，並將敵人都被搞混了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser016Subtitle
US: "*Don't look directly at the laser--you could burn-out the back of your head"
DE: "*Don't look directly at the laser--you could burn-out the back of your head"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "레이저를 똑바로 쳐다보지 마시오. 뒷통수까지 타들어갈테니."
ZH: "\n不要直視雷射，您可能會被穿透後腦杓的雷射燒焦。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser017Subtitle
US: "*Charging lasersplease wait, General"
DE: "*Charging lasersplease wait, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "레이저 충전 중. 조금만 기다려 주시오, 장군."
ZH: "\n雷射正在充填能量，請稍候，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser018Subtitle
US: "*Lasers must be calibrated precisely for maximum effect"
DE: "*Lasers must be calibrated precisely for maximum effect"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "레이저는 최대 효과를 위해 구경이 정확하게 조정되어야 하지."
ZH: "\n為了發揮最大功效，雷射必須做精準校正。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser019Subtitle
US: "*Dozers, build more Reactors--lasers take a lot of power"
DE: "*Dozers, build more Reactors--lasers take a lot of power"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건설 불도저들은 발전소를 더 많이 건설하라. 레이저는 전력이 많이 들지."
ZH: "\n推土機，建造更多的反應爐，雷射需要大量電力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser020Subtitle
US: "*Can you match fifty million mega-joules of lasing power, General?"
DE: "*Can you match fifty million mega-joules of lasing power, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "500만 메가쥴의 레이저 파워에 대항할 수 있겠소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您能否達到五千萬兆焦耳的雷射能量呢？將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser021Subtitle
US: "*Looks like a big space battle, doesn't it"
DE: "*Looks like a big space battle, doesn't it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "커다란 우주 전쟁 같이 보이지 않소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n看起來像是場大型空戰，可不是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser022Subtitle
US: "*My lasers are going to turn your armor to vapor"
DE: "*My lasers are going to turn your armor to vapor"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 레이저가 당신의 무기를 증발시켜 버리고 있군."
ZH: "\n我的雷射將讓您的裝甲化為烏有。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser023Subtitle
US: "*General, you should really try to coordinate your attacks--this has been all to easy for me"
DE: "*General, you should really try to coordinate your attacks--this has been all to easy for me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 공격을 계획성있게 하는게 좋겠소. 지금까지는 나한테 너무 쉬웠소."
ZH: "\n將軍，您的確該調整一下進攻方法，這對我來說已經太簡單了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser024Subtitle
US: "*Don't get distracted by the pretty lights, General"
DE: "*Don't get distracted by the pretty lights, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "예쁜 불빛에 현혹되지 마시오, 장군."
ZH: "\n別讓這些美麗的光線給迷惑了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser025Subtitle
US: "*Would you like me to \"beam you up,\" General?"
DE: "*Would you like me to \"beam you up,\" General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "빛을 좀 쬐 드릴까, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您希望我\"用光束射擊您，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser026Subtitle
US: "*Your weapons can't match my pinpoint accuracy, General. Why not just surrender?"
DE: "*Your weapons can't match my pinpoint accuracy, General. Why not just surrender?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나의 칼날같은 정확도에 당신의 무기는 상대가 안 돼, 그냥 항복하는게 어떻소?"
ZH: "\n您的武器跟不上我精確點的準確性，將軍！何不投降算了？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser027Subtitle
US: "*Why don't you build another Barracks, General? I'll enjoy destroying that one too"
DE: "*Why don't you build another Barracks, General? I'll enjoy destroying that one too"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "막사를 더 짓는게 어떻소? 그것도 좀 파괴해보고 싶은데."
ZH: "\n為何您不建造另一座兵營呢，將軍？我同樣也會享受摧毀它的樂趣。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser028Subtitle
US: "*If you can't protect your War Factory, how safe could your Command Center be?"
DE: "*If you can't protect your War Factory, how safe could your Command Center be?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "군수공장조차 보호할 수 없다면 커맨드 센터는 얼마나 안전할 것 같소?"
ZH: "\n假如您連自己的戰車工廠都無法保護，更別說您的指揮中心能有多安全了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser029Subtitle
US: "*Your planes are not safe from my lasers, especially without your Air Field"
DE: "*Your planes are not safe from my lasers, especially without your Air Field"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 비행기들도 내 레이저로부터 안전할 수 없소, 특히 비행장이 날아가 버렸으니 말이지."
ZH: "\n您的飛機無法避開我的雷射，特別是沒有機場的時候"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser030Subtitle
US: "*Your base defenses are worthless against me"
DE: "*Your base defenses are worthless against me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 기지 방어물들은 무용지물이오."
ZH: "\n您的基地防禦單位對我來說是沒用的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser031Subtitle
US: "*Ah, the Command Center--queen of this chessboard. This match is all but over now, General"
DE: "*Ah, the Command Center--queen of this chessboard. This match is all but over now, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오, 커맨드 센터! 이 체스판의 여왕격이지. 하지만 이 게임은 끝났소, 장군."
ZH: "\n哎呀，指揮中心--如同西洋棋盤上的皇后，這個比賽現在已經快要分出勝負了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser032Subtitle
US: "*My lasers have destroyed so many of your buildingshow do you keep fighting?"
DE: "*My lasers have destroyed so many of your buildingshow do you keep fighting?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 레이저가 당신의 건물들을 거의 다 파괴했는데… 얼마나 더 싸울 거요?"
ZH: "\n我的雷射已經摧毀您這麼多建築物了，您還要繼續戰鬥下去嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser033Subtitle
US: "*General, don't destroy my Tech Buildings, I need those"
DE: "*General, don't destroy my Tech Buildings, I need those"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 테크 빌딩을 그냥 두시오, 장군! 그게 필요하단 말이오."
ZH: "\n將軍，請不要摧毀我的科技建築，我需要它們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser034Subtitle
US: "*Get away from my Barracks!"
DE: "*Get away from my Barracks!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 막사에서 물러나!"
ZH: "\n滾出我的兵營！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser035Subtitle
US: "*My War Factory! Noooo!"
DE: "*My War Factory! Noooo!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 군수공장! 안돼애애!"
ZH: "\n我的戰車工廠！不不不！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser036Subtitle
US: "*How dare you destroy my Air Field!"
DE: "*How dare you destroy my Air Field!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "감히 내 비행장을 파괴하다니!"
ZH: "\n您居然敢摧毀我的機場！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser037Subtitle
US: "*They're destroying our defenses! All forces: defend the base!"
DE: "*They're destroying our defenses! All forces: defend the base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 방어 시설을 부수고 있군! 전부대, 기지를 사수하라!"
ZH: "\n他們正在摧毀我們的防禦單位！全體軍隊注意：防守基地！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser038Subtitle
US: "*General, these losses are unacceptable. I'll repay you for destroying my buildings"
DE: "*General, these losses are unacceptable. I'll repay you for destroying my buildings"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 피해가 막심하오. 댓가를 치르게 해주지."
ZH: "\n將軍，這些損失叫人無法接受！這筆帳我會向您討回來的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser039Subtitle
US: "*No! Quickly, Dozers rebuild the Command Center!"
DE: "*No! Quickly, Dozers rebuild the Command Center!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "안돼! 불도저! 빨리 와서 커맨드 센터를 다시 건설해!"
ZH: "\n不！快！推土機儘速重建指揮中心！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser040Subtitle
US: "*General, if you bring down any more of my planes I'll use all my Super Weapons to destroy you!"
DE: "*General, if you bring down any more of my planes I'll use all my Super Weapons to destroy you!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군님, 내 비행기를 한 대라도 더 격추시키면 나는 슈퍼 무기를 사용할 줄 아시오!"
ZH: "\n將軍，假如您敢再讓我的任何一架飛機掉落，我會動用所有的超級武器消滅您！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser041Subtitle
US: "*Leave my vehicles alone, General!"
DE: "*Leave my vehicles alone, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 차량들을 내버려두시지!"
ZH: "\n離我的載具遠一點，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser042Subtitle
US: "*You're hunting my men on purpose, aren't you, General"
DE: "*You're hunting my men on purpose, aren't you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 병사들을 사냥하는 걸 즐기고 있군."
ZH: "\n您故意打傷我的人，對吧，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser043Subtitle
US: "*Reap the rewards from that Oil Derrick while you can; we'll be there to take it soon"
DE: "*Reap the rewards from that Oil Derrick while you can; we'll be there to take it soon"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "할 수 있는 만큼 원유 유정탑에서 자금을 얻으시오. 우리가 곧 점령하러 갈테니까."
ZH: "\n可以的話，您會從這個油井獲利；我們將會在這裡立刻使用它。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser044Subtitle
US: "*That Artillery Platform is no match for my airborne lasers"
DE: "*That Artillery Platform is no match for my airborne lasers"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "캐논 플랫폼은 내 공중 레이저의 상대가 되지 못한다네."
ZH: "\n砲兵陣地不是我空載雷射的對手。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser045Subtitle
US: "*Did you know that that Oil Refinery will let you build vehicles faster and more efficiently? Oops, I probably shouldn't have told you that"
DE: "*Did you know that that Oil Refinery will let you build vehicles faster and more efficiently? Oops, I probably shouldn't have told you that"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n정유 공장이 차량들을 보다 빠르고 효율적으로 생산하게 해준다는 걸 몰랐소?\n이런, 얘기하지 말았어야 하는 건데."
ZH: "\n您知道煉油廠可讓您更快速地、更有效率地建造載具嗎？哎喲！我或者不該告訴您的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser046Subtitle
US: "*You've tripped our outer perimeter warning lasers, General. We know you're there now"
DE: "*You've tripped our outer perimeter warning lasers, General. We know you're there now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신은 방금 기지 반경 경계 레이더를 스쳤소. 이제 우린 당신이 어디 있는지 알지."
ZH: "\n您已經誤觸我們在外面周邊陣地所設下的預警雷射，將軍！現在我們知道您的位置了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser047Subtitle
US: "*I see you approaching my base, General. I wouldn't advise coming any closer"
DE: "*I see you approaching my base, General. I wouldn't advise coming any closer"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리 기지에 접근하는 게 보이는군. 더 오지 않기를 권고하네."
ZH: "\n我發現您正接近我的基地，將軍！我建議您最好不要繼續靠近！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser048Subtitle
US: "*The enemy is in our base! All forces return and deploy lasers!"
DE: "*The enemy is in our base! All forces return and deploy lasers!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "적이 기지에 있다! 전 병력 귀환하여 레이저를 배치하라!"
ZH: "\n敵人正在我們的基地內！全體軍隊回來部署雷射！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser049Subtitle
US: "*Get away from my Reactors, General!"
DE: "*Get away from my Reactors, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 발전소에서 물러나시오!"
ZH: "\n離開我的反應爐，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser050Subtitle
US: "*General, those resources are for me--stay away from them"
DE: "*General, those resources are for me--stay away from them"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 그 자원들은 내 것이니 거기서 물러서시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，這些資源是我的--您最好離它們遠一點！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser051Subtitle
US: "*Attacking from the flanks, eh? It will take more than tactical tricks to beat me"
DE: "*Attacking from the flanks, ey? It will take more than tactical tricks to beat me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "측면에서 공격을? 나를 이기려면 전략으로 재주 부리는 것 정도로는 어림도 없을텐데."
ZH: "\n從側翼攻擊，是吧？這得需要更多戰略技巧才能打敗我！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser052Subtitle
US: "*Flanking attacks?! You are devious, General"
DE: "*Flanking attacks?! You are devious, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "측면 공격? 사악하군."
ZH: "\n側翼攻擊？！您真卑鄙，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser053Subtitle
US: "*Yes, come straight through my front-door, Generalif you dare"
DE: "*Yes, come straight through my front-door, Generalif you dare"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "용기만 있다면, 정문으로 떳떳하게 들어오란 말이오, 장군."
ZH: "\n是的，直接從我的前門經過，將軍！假如您有這個膽量的話！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser054Subtitle
US: "*Be careful, General--the back-door of my base isn't so undefended as it seems"
DE: "*Be careful, General--the back-door of my base isn't so undefended as it seems"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "조심하시오, 장군. 내 기지의 뒷면은 보기처럼 허술하지 않단 말이오."
ZH: "\n小心，將軍--我的基地後門可不像外表看起來這麼地毫無防備！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser055Subtitle
US: "*You are foolish to come here, General"
DE: "*You are foolish to come here, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이쪽으로 오다니 어리석군, 장군."
ZH: "\n您是笨蛋，所以才會來這裡，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser056Subtitle
US: "*These resources are not enough to save your failed strategy, General"
DE: "*These resources are not enough to save your failed strategy, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 자원들은 당신의 실패한 전술을 메꾸기엔 충분치 않을 것 같소, 장군."
ZH: "\n這些資源不足以挽回您失敗的戰略，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser057Subtitle
US: "*No! Stay away! I need those reactors to power my lasers!"
DE: "*No! Stay away! I need those reactors to power my lasers!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "안돼! 물러서란 말이오! 내 레이저를 유지하려면 이 발전소들이 필요하단 말이오!"
ZH: "\n不！滾遠點！我需要這些反應爐提供電力給雷射！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser058Subtitle
US: "*Out of power?! How could you let your base run out of power?"
DE: "*Out of power?! How could you let your base run out of power?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전력 부족? 어떻게 당신 기지를 전력 부족으로 만들 수 있단 말이오?"
ZH: "\n沒電了？！您怎麼能讓基地把電力耗盡呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser059Subtitle
US: "*Running out of power is a fatal mistake, General"
DE: "*Running out of power is a fatal mistake, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전력이 차단되게 하는 건 치명적인 실수라오, 장군."
ZH: "\n耗盡電力是致命的錯誤，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser060Subtitle
US: "*You're out of resources, General. You'll never recover before we overrun you"
DE: "*You're out of resources, General. You'll never recover before we overrun you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신은 자원이 바닥 났소. 장군. 회복하기 전에 우리가 쳐들어 갈거요."
ZH: "\n您的資源已經用盡，將軍！在我們勝過您之前，您將無法重新獲得資源。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser061Subtitle
US: "*Out of resources?! This is unacceptable! Chinooks, gather faster!"
DE: "*Out of resources?! This is unacceptable! Chinooks, gather faster!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자원이 고갈되고 있다고?! 인정할 수 없군! 치누크, 빨리빨리 움직여!"
ZH: "\n資源用完了？！這是無法接受的！運輸直昇機，快點集合！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser062Subtitle
US: "*Sell that Scud Storm, General, or I'll destroy it for you"
DE: "*Sell that Scud Storm, General, or I'll destroy it for you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 스커드 폭풍을 파시오, 장군. 그렇지 않으면 내가 부숴주지."
ZH: "\n販售生化死雨風暴武器，將軍！要不然，我也可以替您消滅它！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser063Subtitle
US: "*That Nuke Silo won't stop me, General"
DE: "*That Nuke Silo won't stop me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵 미사일로 날 멈출 수는 없을거요, 장군."
ZH: "\n就算是核彈發射井也無法阻擋我，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser064Subtitle
US: "*If you build a Particle Cannon and I destroy it with a Particle Beamis that irony?"
DE: "*If you build a Particle Cannon and I destroy it with a Particle Beamis that irony?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n자네가 파티클 캐논을 만들면 내가 파티클 캐논으로 파괴할텐데,\n이런 아이러니가 또 어디 있나?"
ZH: "\n假如您建立一座離子砲，而我又用粒子光束這個有反諷意味的武器來摧毀它呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser065Subtitle
US: "*That excessive amount of base defenses will only slow down my laser, General"
DE: "*That excessive amount of base defenses will only slow down my laser, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기지 방어 시설이 많으면 내 레이저의 공격이 지연되긴 하겠군."
ZH: "\n這些為數眾多的基地防禦單位，只不過是減慢我的雷射進攻速度而已，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser066Subtitle
US: "*Your conventional tanks are no match for my laser based weapons platforms, General"
DE: "*Your conventional tanks are no match for my laser based weapons platforms, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 재래식 탱크는 내 레이저의 상대가 못된다니까."
ZH: "\n您的傳統坦克不是我雷射型武器的對手，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser067Subtitle
US: "*That's quite a lot of planes, General. Are you putting on an air show?"
DE: "*That's quite a lot of planes, General. Are you putting on an air show?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아주 많은 비행기들이군. 에어쇼라도 할텐가?"
ZH: "\n這可真是數量頗多的飛機，將軍。您正在作飛行表演嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser068Subtitle
US: "*Quite a few infantry you've trained there, General. I can't wait to see this crazy plan"
DE: "*Quite a few infantry you've trained there, General. I can't wait to see this crazy plan"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "꽤 많은 보병을 훈련시켰군. 당신의 어리석은 작전을 빨리 구경하고 싶은데."
ZH: "\n您在這裡訓練了不少步兵，將軍。我等不及觀賞這場瘋狂的計畫了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser069Subtitle
US: "*Your base is starting to look like a housing tract, General. Maybe I should play some connect-the-dots with the Particle Cannon to thin your numbers a bit"
DE: "*Your base is starting to look like a housing tract, General. Maybe I should play some connect-the-dots with the Particle Cannon to thin your numbers a bit"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n당신 기지가 주택단지같은 모습이 되어가는군.\n내가 파티클 캐논으로 하늘에서 점선 이어 그리기 놀이를 해서 건물을 좀 태워주지."
ZH: "\n您的基地開始看起來像個大型住宅區，將軍。或許我應該扮演連結點的角色，用離子砲替您減少房屋數\n量。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser070Subtitle
US: "*I will shoot those scud missiles down, General. Then you will pay"
DE: "*I will shoot those scud missiles down, General. Then you will pay"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 미사일들은 내가 없애주지."
ZH: "\n我將擊落這些生化飛彈，將軍。接下來，您會為此付出代價！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser071Subtitle
US: "*My lasers will bring that nuke down, General. The fallout will be on your hands"
DE: "*My lasers will bring that nuke down, General. The fallout will be on your hands"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 레이저는 핵미사일도 녹일 수 있다는 걸 모르나? 낙진이 다 당신 기지로 떨어질텐데."
ZH: "\n我的雷射將會擊落核子武器，將軍。輻射性落塵將會掉落在您的手心。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser072Subtitle
US: "*Particle Cannon?! I wonder what would happen if we crossed the beams"
DE: "*Particle Cannon?! I wonder what would happen if we crossed the beams"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "파티클 캐논? 광선을 서로 교차시키면 어떤 일이 발생할지 궁금하군!"
ZH: "\n離子砲？！我猜想，假如我們用粒子光束穿透它的話，不曉得結果將是如何。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser073Subtitle
US: "*General, don't garrison that building; come out and play"
DE: "*General, don't garrison that building; come out and play"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 건물에 숨지 말고 어서 나와 놀자고."
ZH: "\n將軍，別駐守著建築物；出來一較高下吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser074Subtitle
US: "*General, Colonel Burton is a bumbling fool"
DE: "*General, Colonel Burton is a bumbling fool"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 버튼 대령은 무능한 바보일 뿐이네."
ZH: "\n將軍，貝頓上校是個老是犯錯的笨蛋。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser075Subtitle
US: "*Black Lotus is not invisible to my lasers, General"
DE: "*Black Lotus is not invisible to my lasers, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "흑수선은 내 레이저한테는 다 보이지."
ZH: "\n黑蓮花躲不過我的雷射，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser076Subtitle
US: "*I hope Jarmen Kell isn't using a laser scope on his rifleit wouldn't work against me"
DE: "*I hope Jarmen Kell isn't using a laser scope on his rifleit wouldn't work against me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "쟈멘 켈이 레이저 스코프를 사용하지 않기를 바라네. 나한테는 안먹히니까."
ZH: "\n我希望賈曼卡爾在他的步槍上沒有使用雷射掃瞄，這樣他就無法對抗我。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser077Subtitle
US: "*Building an Air Field only provides airborne targets for my lasers, General"
DE: "*Building an Air Field only provides airborne targets for my lasers, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행장을 건설하는 건 내 레이저에 공중 표적을 제공하는 것일 뿐이오, 장군."
ZH: "\n建造一座機場，只不過是替我的雷射提供空載目標而已，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser078Subtitle
US: "*You're going to need a lot of tanks to get to me, General. Good luck"
DE: "*You're going to need a lot of tanks to get to me, General. Good luck"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "날 잡으려면 탱크가 훨씬 더 필요할거요. 행운을 빌겠소."
ZH: "\n您必須有許多坦克才能打敗我，將軍。祝您好運！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser079Subtitle
US: "*Building a Barracks will only get your men hurt, General"
DE: "*Building a Barracks will only get your men hurt, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "막사를 건설하면 단지 희생될 병사들을 더 만드는 것일 뿐이오."
ZH: "\n建造一座兵營，只不過是讓您的人員受傷而已，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser080Subtitle
US: "*Selling off your structures eh? That the first mistake of a desperate general"
DE: "*Selling off your structures eh? That the first mistake of a desperate general"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건물들을 팔아치운다고? 절박한 장군들이 처음 저지르는 실수지."
ZH: "\n廉價出售您的建築物阿？這是挺而走險的將領所會犯下的第一個錯誤。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser081Subtitle
US: "*What?! You can't be beating me! Your lack of precision alone should ensure my victory"
DE: "*What?! You can't be beating me! Your lack of precision alone should ensure my victory"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "뭐라고?! 나를 꺾는다는 건 말도 안돼! 당신처럼 정확도가 떨어지는 자에게 질 리가 없어!"
ZH: "\n什麼？！您絕對無法打敗我！您的缺乏準確性只是確保我的勝利而已。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser082Subtitle
US: "*I can't lose to you--you're a bumbling buffoon!"
DE: "*I can't lose to you--you're a bumbling buffoon!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신에게 패배할 수는 없지. 이 무능한 어릿광대 같으니!"
ZH: "\n我不可能輸給您--您是個老是犯錯的丑角。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser083Subtitle
US: "*How can you be winning? This isn't how it played out in the simulation"
DE: "*How can you be winning? This isn't how it played out in the simulation"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어떻게 이길 수가 있지? 시뮬레이션 상에서는 이렇지 않았는데."
ZH: "\n您怎麼可能獲勝？這跟想像中的結局完全不同。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser084Subtitle
US: "*I've calculated every variable, yet you're winninghow is this possible?"
DE: "*I've calculated every variable, yet you're winninghow is this possible?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "모든 변수를 계산해놨는데, 어떻게 당신이 이기는 것이 가능하단 말인가?"
ZH: "\n我已經估計過所有的變數，但是關於您的勝利，這怎麼可能呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser085Subtitle
US: "*No! This can't be the end! What trickery did you use to beat me?!"
DE: "*No! This can't be the end! What trickery did you use to beat me?!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "안돼! 이게 끝일 리가 없어! 날 이길려고 어떤 꾀를 부린건가?"
ZH: "\n不！怎麼會這樣結束呢！您究竟是用了什麼詭計來打敗我？！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser086Subtitle
US: "*My planning a preparation is leading me to a clear victory"
DE: "*My planning a preparation is leading me to a clear victory"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나의 계획된 준비가 깔끔한 승리를 이끌었소."
ZH: "\n我的準備工作規劃將帶我邁向明確的勝利之路！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser087Subtitle
US: "*Precision will always defeat brute force, General"
DE: "*Precision will always defeat brute force, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "정확도는 언제나 야만적인 힘을 물리치지."
ZH: "\n準確性永遠會擊敗毫無理性的軍事力量，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser088Subtitle
US: "*This must be like a nightmare for you, General"
DE: "*This must be like a nightmare for you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이건 당신에게 마치 악몽같겠네, 장군."
ZH: "\n這對您來說絕對像個惡夢，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser089Subtitle
US: "*Have you decided how you are going to accept this defeat, General?"
DE: "*Have you decided how you are going to accept this defeat, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 패배를 어떻게 받아들일지 결정하셨소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您已經決定好如何接受這個失敗的事實了嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser090Subtitle
US: "*You are defeated, General. But then that was never really in question, was it?"
DE: "*You are defeated, General. But then that was never really in question, was it?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신은 패배한거요, 장군. 하지만 당연히 이의 제기는 안하겠지, 그렇지?"
ZH: "\n您被打敗了，將軍。不過，這原本就是無庸置疑的結果，不是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser091Subtitle
US: "*Lasers charged--tracking targets now"
DE: "*Lasers charged--tracking targets now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "레이저 충전 완료. 목표 추적중."
ZH: "\n雷射充填能量，追蹤目標中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser092Subtitle
US: "*You're not in my class, General--try an easier opponent"
DE: "*You're not in my class, General--try an easier opponent"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "난 당신이랑 차원이 다르니 다른 쉬운 상대를 찾아보시오."
ZH: "\n您的等級跟我差遠了，將軍。試試比較容易的對手吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser093Subtitle
US: "*I calculate that you will lose this battle, General"
DE: "*I calculate that you will lose this battle, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 계산해본 결과 당신은 이 전투에서 패배할 것이오."
ZH: "\n我估計您將會輸掉這場戰役，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser094Subtitle
US: "*Lasers make superior weapons"
DE: "*Lasers make superior weapons"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "레이저가 뛰어난 무기들로 되었소."
ZH: "\n雷射是種更優秀的武器。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser095Subtitle
US: "*You defeated me, General, but I will scan your tactics and devise a superior strategy"
DE: "*You defeated me, General, but I will scan your tactics and devise a superior strategy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n당신이 나를 패배시켰소, 장군. 하지만, 나는 당신의 전술을 분석해서\n더 강한 전술을 고안해 낼거요."
ZH: "\n您打敗我了，將軍。但是我將好好觀察您的戰術，想出更好的戰略。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser096Subtitle
US: "*Your weaknesses became obvious when I scanned your tactics"
DE: "*Your weaknesses became obvious when I scanned your tactics"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 당신의 전술을 분석했을 때 이미 약점이 다 노출되었었지."
ZH: "\n仔細觀察過您的戰術後，發現您的弱點變得很明顯。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser097Subtitle
US: "*There you go, General--I've drawn the line in the sand"
DE: "*There you go, General--I've drawn the line in the sand"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "좋아 장군, 내가 여기 모래 위에 선을 그었네."
ZH: "\n就這樣了，將軍。我已經劃好線。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Laser098Subtitle
US: "*Now I dare you to cross it. Come and get me, General"
DE: "*Now I dare you to cross itcome and get me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 이 선을 넘을 배짱이 있다면, 와서 나를 잡아보시지, 장군!"
ZH: "\n現在我諒您也不敢橫越過來我這裡，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke001Subtitle
US: "*At least it's a dry heat, General"
DE: "*At least it's a dry heat, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래도 이건 건조하고 깔끔한 열기잖소, 장군."
ZH: "\n至少它是乾熱型的，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke002Subtitle
US: "*Soon your base will glow like the sun"
DE: "*Soon your base will glow like the sun"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "곧 자네의 기지는 태양처럼 빛나게 될 것이네."
ZH: "\n您的基地馬上就會像太陽一般灼熱。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke003Subtitle
US: "*How do you expect to fight this, General?"
DE: "*How do you expect to fight this, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여기엔 어떻게 대응하겠나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您沒想到要這樣作戰吧，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke004Subtitle
US: "*Your weapons are no match for my power!"
DE: "*Your weapons are no match for my power!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 무기는 내 것에 비할 바가 아니군."
ZH: "\n您的武器比不上我的電力！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke005Subtitle
US: "*Melt! Everything must melt!"
DE: "*Melt! Everything must melt!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "녹아라! 모든 것이 녹아야 돼!"
ZH: "\n熔化！所有事物必須熔化！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke006Subtitle
US: "* The glow! The wonderful glow! Can't you see it, General?"
DE: "* The glow! The wonderful glow! Can't you see it, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "저 빛! 아름다운 빛이야! 보이지 않나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n這灼熱的光！驚人的白熱光！您看不到它嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke007Subtitle
US: "*It looks like a nuclear winter this year, General"
DE: "*It looks like a nuclear winter this year, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "올 겨울은 핵겨울이겠네, 장군."
ZH: "\n這看起來像是今年的核冬天，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke008Subtitle
US: "*The end is near, General"
DE: "*The end is near, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "종말이 머지 않았다."
ZH: "\n快結束了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke009Subtitle
US: "*This is only the beginning, General. The beginning of the end"
DE: "*This is only the beginning, General. The beginning of the end"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이건 단지 시작일 뿐이라고. 종말의 시작."
ZH: "\n這只不過是剛開始而已，將軍。卻是您的結束。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke010Subtitle
US: "*Don't worry, General, the warheads are on their way"
DE: "*Don't worry, General, the warheads are on their way"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "걱정 말게나, 장군. 핵탄두가 날아간다네."
ZH: "\n別擔心，將軍，彈頭還在途中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke011Subtitle
US: "*Sorry for the delay, General; just gathering my forces"
DE: "*Sorry for the delay, General; just gathering my forces"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "늦어서 미안하네, 장군. 병력을 좀 모으느라."
ZH: "\n抱歉讓您久等了，將軍；因為要集合我所有的軍隊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke012Subtitle
US: "*Is the heat getting to you, General?"
DE: "*Is the heat getting to you, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "열기가 자네에게 전달되고 있나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您感受到灼熱了嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke013Subtitle
US: "*Having a meltdown, General?"
DE: "*Having a meltdown, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "일이 좀 꼬이고 있지, 장군?"
ZH: "\n有被熔化的感覺嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke014Subtitle
US: "*All forces, prepare for the next assault"
DE: "*All forces, prepare for the next assault"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전 병력, 다음 공격을 준비하라!"
ZH: "\n所有的軍隊，準備"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke015Subtitle
US: "*Now where did I put those launch codes?"
DE: "*Now where did I put those launch codes?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "발사 코드를 어디다 놨었던가?"
ZH: "\n我現在在在那裡放置發射密碼？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke016Subtitle
US: "*Are you ready for more, General?"
DE: "*Are you ready for more, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "좀 더 당할 준비가 됐나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您準備好面對更多挑戰嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke017Subtitle
US: "*I think this is your half-life, General"
DE: "*I think this is your half-life, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지금이 자네의 전성기인 듯 하네, 장군."
ZH: "\n我想您只剩半條命了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke018Subtitle
US: "*I hope your radar isn't down, General; I'd hate for you to miss what's coming next"
DE: "*I hope your radar isn't down, General; I'd hate for you to miss what's coming next"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "레이다가 고장나지 않았기를 바라네, 장군. 다음에 뭐가 올지 당신이 모르는 건 난 싫단 말이오."
ZH: "\n我希望您的雷達沒故障，將軍；假如您錯過即將來臨的好戲，我會恨您的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke019Subtitle
US: "*I know your weaknesses now, General. The next attack will be unstoppable"
DE: "*I know your weaknesses now, General. The next attack will be unstoppable"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 약점을 알지, 장군. 다음 공격은 절대 막을 수 없을 걸."
ZH: "\n我現在知道您的弱點了，將軍。您將無法抵擋我下一波攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke020Subtitle
US: "*Soon you will know the glory of my nuclear arsenal"
DE: "*Soon you will know the glory of my nuclear arsenal"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "곧 영광스런 내 핵무기를 알게 될 걸세."
ZH: "\n您馬上就會認識這個令我感到驕傲的核子兵工廠。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke021Subtitle
US: "*I'd stock up on sun-block if I were you, General"
DE: "*I'd stock up on sun-block if I were you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 자네라면 선탠로션을 잔뜩 준비해놨을걸."
ZH: "\n假如我是您的話，我會多買一些防曬霜，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke022Subtitle
US: "*"
DE: "*"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵이 없다고? 누가 그런 생각을 했지?"
ZH: "\n*"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
US: Ne
DE: Ng
FR: Nf
ES: Ns
IT: Ni
KO: Nk
ZH: Nc
BP: Nb
PL: Np
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke023Subtitle
US: "*Eventually someone must win the arms race, or what's the point of racing?"
DE: "*Eventually someone must win the arms race, or what's the point of racing?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "마침내 누군가는 군비 경쟁에서 이겨야 하는군, 그런데 경쟁은 왜 하는 건가?"
ZH: "\n最終一定要有某人贏得這場軍備競賽，不然比賽還有何樂趣可言呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke024Subtitle
US: "*Time to put on the lead underwear"
DE: "*Time to put on the lead underwear"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "납으로 된 속옷을 입을 시간이군."
ZH: "\n是穿上前衛式內衣的時候了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke025Subtitle
US: "*Remember: Don't look directly at the blast, General"
DE: "*Remember: Don't look directly at the blast, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기억하게나. 핵폭발을 똑바로 쳐다보지 말라고."
ZH: "\n記住：不要直視爆炸，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke026Subtitle
US: "*It appears you have only trained your men to die, General"
DE: "*It appears you have only trained your men to die, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 병사들은 훈련받자마자 죽는군."
ZH: "\n看來您只訓練好部下如何死亡而已，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke027Subtitle
US: "*Now your War Factory is a glow crater. Wonderful"
DE: "*Now your War Factory is a glow crater. Wonderful"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 자네의 군수공장은 새빨간 분화구가 되었어. 훌륭하군."
ZH: "\n現在您的戰車工廠已經變成灼熱的火山口，太棒了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke028Subtitle
US: "*Your defenses crack like so many eggshells, General"
DE: "*Your defenses crack like so many eggshells, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 방어 시설은 계란껍질처럼 깨지는군."
ZH: "\n您的防禦單位被炸成像一堆蛋殼了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke029Subtitle
US: "*Oh, you weren't in that Command Center, were you, General?"
DE: "*Oh, you weren't in that Command Center, were you, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네, 커맨드 센터 안에 없었나? 아니면 있었나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n喔，您該不會在指揮中心裡吧，原來您真的在裡面嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke030Subtitle
US: "*Why do you destroy my barracks, General? It isn't my men you should fear"
DE: "*Why do you destroy my barracks, General? It isn't my men you should fear"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "왜 내 막사를 파괴하는건가? 당신이 두려워 해야 할 건 내 보병들이 아니야."
ZH: "\n您為何不摧毀我的兵營呢，將軍？您應該不會害怕我的部下吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke031Subtitle
US: "*My War Factory! What have you done?! My precious tanksgone..."
DE: "*My War Factory! What have you done?! My precious tanksgone..."
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 군수공장! 무슨 짓을 하는 건가! 내 소중한 탱크들이 박살났군."
ZH: "\n我的戰車工廠！看您做了什麼好事？！我昂貴的坦克都毀了….。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke032Subtitle
US: "*Leave me alone! What have I ever done to you?"
DE: "*Leave me alone! What have I ever done to you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나를 그냥 내버려둬! 도대체 내가 당신에게 무슨 짓을 했다고 그러나?"
ZH: "\n離我遠一點！我跟您有什麼深仇大恨嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke033Subtitle
US: "*My Command Center! No!!! I won't lose command! I won't!"
DE: "*My Command Center! No!!! I won't lose command! I won't!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 커맨드 센터! 안돼! 절대 잃을 순 없어!"
ZH: "\n我的指揮中心！不！！！我不可能會失去指揮中心！我絕對不會！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke034Subtitle
US: "*I can't believe you are beating me! Perhaps you would give me a moment to rebuild?"
DE: "*I can't believe you are beating me! Perhaps you would give me a moment to rebuild?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신이 나를 이기고 있다니 믿을 수가 없군! 나에게 재건할 시간은 주겠지?"
ZH: "\n真教我無法置信，您居然打敗我！或者您應該再多給我一些重建的時間。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke035Subtitle
US: "*We have suffered great loses at your hands, General, but this isn't over yet"
DE: "*We have suffered great loses at your hands, General, but this isn't over yet"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 때문에 막대한 손실을 입었네, 장군. 하지만, 아직 끝난 건 아니야."
ZH: "\n我們已經從您手上遭受到莫大損失，將軍。不過，我知道這一切還沒結束。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke036Subtitle
US: "*General, you can have that oil derrick, but it won't help you stop me"
DE: "*General, you can have that oil derrick, but it won't help you stop me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 원유 유정탑은 가져도 좋아, 하지만 나를 막는데 도움은 안될걸세."
ZH: "\n將軍，您可以取走這個油井，但是這仍然無法幫您阻擋我！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke037Subtitle
US: "*Get out of my base, General! I won't ask twice"
DE: "*Get out of my base, General! I won't ask twice"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지에서 나가시지, 장군! 두번 묻지는 않겠소."
ZH: "\n滾出我的基地，將軍！我不會再說第二次！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke038Subtitle
US: "*How long were you planning on stay in my base, General? Should I prepare a bunk for you?"
DE: "*How long were you planning on stay in my base, General? Should I prepare a bunk for you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지에 얼마나 머물 작정인가, 장군? 내가 침대라도 만들어 줘야겠나?"
ZH: "\n您打算待在我的基地多久呢，將軍？我應該準備一個床位給您嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke039Subtitle
US: "*Leave my base, General, or I will be forced detonate my warheads"
DE: "*Leave my base, General, or I will be forced detonate my warheads"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지를 떠나지, 장군. 안 그러면 내 핵탄두를 터뜨릴 수 밖에 없어."
ZH: "\n離開我的基地，將軍！不然我不得已必須發射彈頭！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke040Subtitle
US: "*Do you like my village, General? Please, make yourself at home"
DE: "*Do you like my village, General? Please, make yourself at home"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 마을이 마음에 드나? 편히 지내라구."
ZH: "\n您喜歡我的村莊嗎，將軍？別客氣，就當在自己家一樣。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke041Subtitle
US: "*Coming to inspect the nukes, General? You can look, but don't touch"
DE: "*Coming to inspect the nukes, General? You can look, but don't touch"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵사찰을 하러 왔나? 보기만 하고 만져서는 안되네."
ZH: "\n準備視察核子武器嗎，將軍？您可以觀看，但是請勿觸摸。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke042Subtitle
US: "*I'd be careful, General; these nuclear depots tend to leak"
DE: "*I'd be careful, General; these nuclear depots tend to leak"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나라면 조심하겠네, 장군. 핵이 창고에서 잘 새니까."
ZH: "\n我會小心的，將軍；快找到這些核武倉庫了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke043Subtitle
US: "*Get away from my supplies, General!"
DE: "*Get away from my supplies, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 자원을 내버려 둬, 장군!"
ZH: "\n滾出我的補給站，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke044Subtitle
US: "*General, I wouldn't capture that oil derrick if I were you--I'll only destroy it"
DE: "*General, I wouldn't capture that oil derrick if I were you--I'll only destroy it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 나라면 그 원유 유정탑을 점령하지 않을거야. 단지 파괴해버리지."
ZH: "\n將軍，假如我是您的話，我不會佔領這個油井，我只會摧毀它。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke045Subtitle
US: "*Get away from my silos, General!"
DE: "*Get away from my silos, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 미사일에서 떨어지지 못하겠나, 장군!"
ZH: "\n滾出我的飛彈發射井，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke046Subtitle
US: "*I see your power is down, General. Should I send you some nuclear energy?"
DE: "*I see your power is down, General. Should I send you some nuclear energy?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 전력이 바닥이 났군. 핵 에너지라도 대줄까?"
ZH: "\n我知道您的電力逐漸減少，將軍。我是否該送給您一些核能呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke047Subtitle
US: "*Out of funds already? Don't you know war is expensive, General?"
DE: "*Out of funds already? Don't you know war is expensive, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자금이 바닥났다고? 전쟁엔 돈이 많이 든다는 사실을 몰랐나보군."
ZH: "\n資金已經用完？您難道不知道戰爭是昂貴的嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke048Subtitle
US: "*Please, build more tanks, General; even they will melteventually"
DE: "*Please, build more tanks, General; even they will melteventually"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "부탁이니 탱크를 좀 더 만들게. 그래야 나중에 녹일 게 있잖나."
ZH: "\n請盡量建造更多坦克，將軍；雖然它們最終仍將被熔化。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke049Subtitle
US: "*Keep those planes away from my silos!"
DE: "*Keep those planes away from my silos!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 미사일에서 그 비행기들을 치워!"
ZH: "\n讓這些飛機離我的飛彈發射井遠一點！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke050Subtitle
US: "*So many soldiers, General. Do they have their radiation suits on?"
DE: "*So many soldiers, General. Do they have their radiation suits on?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "병사가 많군. 방호복은 다들 입고 있나?"
ZH: "\n有這麼多的士兵，將軍。您讓他們都穿上抗輻射衣了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke051Subtitle
US: "*How many nukes do you think it will take me to destroy that new weapon, General?"
DE: "*How many nukes do you think it will take me to destroy that new weapon, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 신무기를 파괴하는데 핵이 얼마나 필요할 거 같나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您想我會用多少核子武器來摧毀這個新型武器呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke052Subtitle
US: "*How many nukes do you think it will take me to destroy that new weapon, General?"
DE: "*How many nukes do you think it will take me to destroy that new weapon, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 신무기를 파괴하는데 핵이 얼마나 필요할 거 같나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您想我會用多少核子武器來摧毀這個新型武器呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke053Subtitle
US: "*Selling off buildings? General, if you wanted to clear that area I could have done it for you"
DE: "*Selling off buildings? General, if you wanted to clear that area I could have done it for you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건물을 팔아? 장군, 단지 그 지역을 치우고 싶었던 거였다면 내가 해줬을 걸 그랬네."
ZH: "\n廉價出售建築物？將軍，假如您想讓這個區域變乾淨些，我很樂意幫您這個忙。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke054Subtitle
US: "*You cannot stand against my might, General"
DE: "*You cannot stand against my might, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 힘에 대적할 수는 없을 것이오, 장군."
ZH: "\n您無法對抗我的力量，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke055Subtitle
US: "*Surrender! Or do you want the bombing will continue?"
DE: "*Surrender! Or do you want the bombing will continue?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "항복하시오! 아니면 계속 미사일에 맞고 싶은가?"
ZH: "\n投降吧！除非您想要我繼續轟炸下去？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke056Subtitle
US: "*You are losing this war, General. A few more bombs and your base will fall!"
DE: "*You are losing this war, General. A few more bombs and your base will fall!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자넨 이 전쟁에서 지고 있네. 미사일 몇 방이면 기지가 전부 날아갈 것이네."
ZH: "\n您快輸掉這場戰爭了，將軍。只要再多丟一些炸彈，您的基地就會塌落！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke057Subtitle
US: "*Might makes right. Wouldn't you agree, General"
DE: "*Might makes right. Wouldn't you agree, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "힘이 곧 정의인 세상이지. 내 말이 맞지 않나?"
ZH: "\n強權即公理。您難道不同意這論點嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke058Subtitle
US: "*And now for my final attack. Hold on, General, you're going to like thiswait, no you won't"
DE: "*And now for my final attack. Hold on, General, you're going to like thiswait, no you won't"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n자 이제 나의 마지막 공격을 받게나! 아, 잠깐 기다리게.\n기다리다가 스트레스로 죽을 것 같아 보이네, 장군."
ZH: "\n現在才是我最後的進攻。撐住，將軍，您會喜歡這個的，絕對！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke059Subtitle
US: "*None will stand against our nuclear arsenal"
DE: "*None will stand against our nuclear arsenal"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 핵무기엔 누구도 대적하지 못하지."
ZH: "\n沒有任何事物能夠和我們的核子兵工廠抗衡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke060Subtitle
US: "*Challenge me and your base will glow like the sun"
DE: "*Challenge me and your base will glow like the sun"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나에게 도전하면 당신 기지는 태양처럼 빛나게 되겠지."
ZH: "\n向我挑戰，您的基地將像太陽一樣灼熱。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke061Subtitle
US: "*Soon you'll be nothing more than nuclear waste"
DE: "*Soon you'll be nothing more than nuclear waste"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "곧 당신은 핵폐기물로 변할것이오."
ZH: "\n您馬上就會變成一堆核廢料。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke062Subtitle
US: "*Another moment and I would have reduced you to dust"
DE: "*Another moment and I would have reduced you to dust"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "시간이 조금만 더 있었으면 자네를 먼지로 만들어 버릴 수 있는데."
ZH: "\n下一次我一定會把您化為灰燼！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke063Subtitle
US: "*You are lucky to have survived this battle intact. Challenge me again if you dare"
DE: "*You are lucky to have survived this battle intact. Challenge me again if you dare"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 전쟁에서 운좋게 살아남았군. 용기가 있으면 다시 내게 도전하시지."
ZH: "\n您很幸運，能從戰役中平安存活下來。有膽量的話，就再向我挑戰！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke064Subtitle
US: "*Welcome to the party, General. Please excuse the mess"
DE: "*Welcome to the party, General. Please excuse the mess"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "파티에 오신 것을 환영하네, 장군. 좀 어수선한 걸 양해하게."
ZH: "\n歡迎來到這場派對，將軍。請原諒這裡的雜亂。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke065Subtitle
US: "*Now, General, I think you understand why I am known as Mao the Nuke"
DE: "*Now, General, I think you understand why I am known as Mao the Nuke"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 이제 왜 내가 '핵장군' 으로 불리는 지를 알게 될 것이네."
ZH: "\n現在，將軍，我想您已經明白，為什麼我以核武專家聞名了吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke066Subtitle
US: "*We've been waiting for you, General. Please accept our gifts"
DE: "*We've been waiting for you, General. Please accept our gifts"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기다리고 있었소, 장군. 우리 선물을 받으시오."
ZH: "\n我們已經等候您多時，將軍。請接受我們的禮物吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke067Subtitle
US: "*More gifts, General. Our generosity is limitless"
DE: "*More gifts, General. Our generosity is limitless"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "선물이 더 있소, 장군. 우리의 관대함은 끝이 없지."
ZH: "\n更多的禮物，將軍。這是我們無限的慷慨。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke068Subtitle
US: "*Now the battle begins in earnest. Prepare yourself, General"
DE: "*Now the battle begins in earnest. Prepare yourself, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 전쟁이 진짜로 시작되려 하니 준비하시게, 장군."
ZH: "\n現在戰役才真正開始。您自己得做好準備，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke069Subtitle
US: "*Cold fusion is no way to create power, General"
DE: "*Cold fusion is no way to create power, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "상온 핵융합 발전소로는 진정한 동력을 얻을 수 없지."
ZH: "\n冷熔當然無法產生電力，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke070Subtitle
US: "*It pains me to destroy your reactors, General"
DE: "*It pains me to destroy your reactors, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "원자로를 파괴하는 건 나로서는 매우 고통스럽다네."
ZH: "\n摧毀您的反應爐真叫我感到痛苦阿，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke071Subtitle
US: "*You call that a \"super weapon\", General? It breaks like a toy"
DE: "*You call that a \"super weapon\", General? It breaks like a toy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이걸 슈퍼 무기라고 부른건가? 장난감처럼 부서지는데."
ZH: "\n您稱呼其為 \"超級武器\"嗎，將軍？它像玩具一樣容易毀壞"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke072Subtitle
US: "*No! My warheads! My beautiful warheads! You will pay, General"
DE: "*No! My warheads! My beautiful warheads! You will pay, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "안돼! 내 핵탄두! 내 아름다운 핵탄두들! 복수하겠소, 장군."
ZH: "\n不！我的飛彈彈頭！我美麗的彈頭！您將為此付出代價，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke073Subtitle
US: "*That's okay, General, I have more nukes for you"
DE: "*That's okay, General, I have more nukes for you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "괜찮네, 장군. 핵 미사일은 더 많거든."
ZH: "\n沒關係，將軍。我還有更多的核子武器可以對付您。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke074Subtitle
US: "*Hey, do you know how much that nuke silo costs?"
DE: "*Hey, do you know how much that nuke silo costs?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이봐, 핵 미사일 건설에 돈이 얼마나 드는지 아나?"
ZH: "\n嘿！您知道這個核彈發射井、要花多少錢嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke075Subtitle
US: "*Okay, General, that's enough--I'm running out of nukes!"
DE: "*Okay, General, that's enough--I'm running out of nukes!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "좋아 여기까지. 이제 핵 미사일이 부족하단 말이오!"
ZH: "\n好，將軍，這樣就夠了--我快用完核子武器了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke076Subtitle
US: "*Why do you want to blow-up my nukes anyway, General?"
DE: "*Why do you want to blow-up my nukes anyway, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "도대체 왜 내 핵 미사일을 날려버리려는 거지, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您為何無論如何都想炸毀我的核子武器呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke077Subtitle
US: "*No! That was my last nuclear silo! Why, General..why?"
DE: "*No! That was my last nuclear silo! Why, General..why?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "안돼! 저게 내 마지막 핵 미사일이었는데! 왜 그랬나.. 왜?!"
ZH: "\n不！這已經是我最後一座核彈發射井了！為什麼呢，將軍…為什麼？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke078Subtitle
US: "*(enemy lost all silo) You have destroyed all of my siloswhy, General? Why?!"
DE: "*(enemy lost all silo) You have destroyed all of my siloswhy, General? Why?!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 핵 미사일을 다 파괴했네, 장군. 도대체 무엇 때문에?!"
ZH: "\n（敵人失去所有的發射井）您已經摧毀我所有的發射井了。為什麼呢，將軍，為什麼？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke079Subtitle
US: "*(enemy caps player barracks) I've captured your barracks, General. Perhaps I will sell it"
DE: "*(enemy caps player barracks) I've captured your barracks, General. Perhaps I will sell it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 막사를 점령했네. 그냥 팔아버려야겠군."
ZH: "\n（敵人佔領玩家的兵營）我已經佔領您的兵營，將軍。或者我會把它賣掉。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke080Subtitle
US: "*(enemy caps player war factory) My men have captured your War Factory. You really should have guarded it better"
DE: "*(enemy caps player war factory) My men have captured your War Factory. You really should have guarded it better"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 군수공장을 점령했네. 경비를 잘했어야지."
ZH: "\n（敵人佔領玩家的戰車工廠）我的部下已經佔領您的戰車工廠了！您早該採取更嚴密的防守。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke081Subtitle
US: "*(player base) Your defenses are weak, General; we have entered you base"
DE: "*(player base) Your defenses are weak, General; we have entered you base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 기지는 방어가 아주 약하군. 우리가 들어왔네."
ZH: "\n（玩家基地）您的防禦單位不堪一擊，將軍；我們已經進入您的基地了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke082Subtitle
US: "*(combat zone) My forces are in the field, General. Soon they will roll into your base"
DE: "*(combat zone) My forces are in the field, General. Soon they will roll into your base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전장에 있는 내 병사들이 곧 자네 기지로 돌진할 것이네."
ZH: "\n（戰鬥區）我的軍隊正在戰場上，將軍。他們馬上就會攻入您的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke083Subtitle
US: "*(supply dock area) Ah, we've found some supplies. Soon we will control all of the resources!"
DE: "*(supply dock area) Ah, we've found some supplies. Soon we will control all of the resources!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "서플라이를 좀 찾았소. 우리가 곧 모든 자원을 갖게 될거요."
ZH: "\n（補給站區域）哎呀，我們已經找到一些補給站。很快地我們就能控制所有的資源。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke084Subtitle
US: "*(second supply dock area) More supplies for us. How are you funding your troops, General?"
DE: "*(second supply dock area) More supplies for us. How are you funding your troops, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "더 많은 서플라이가 필요한데. 자넨 어떤 식으로 군자금을 대나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n（第二補給站區域）我們有源源不絕的補給。您如何提供資源給部隊呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke085Subtitle
US: "*(oil derrick area) Red Guard--capture that oil derrick!"
DE: "*(oil derrick area) Red Guard--capture that oil derrick!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "홍위병, 저 원유 유정탑을 점령하라!"
ZH: "\n（油井區）紅衛兵--佔領那座油井！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke086Subtitle
US: "*It appears we have used all the supplies in the area. I hope you've made other arrangements, General"
DE: "*It appears we have used all the supplies in the area. I hope you've made other arrangements, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 지역의 서플라이는 우리가 이미 다 써버렸네. 다른 수단을 찾아보시게나, 장군."
ZH: "\n看來我們已經使用這個區域的所有補給站了。希望您已做好其他安排，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke087Subtitle
US: "*(enemy out of power) What?! I'm out of power? How can I be out of power? Someone get me more power! Now!"
DE: "*(enemy out of power) What?! I'm out of power? How can I be out of power? Someone get me more power! Now!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "뭐? 우리 전력이 차단되었다고? 어떻게 그게 가능하지? 누가 지금 당장 전력을 끌어와봐!"
ZH: "\n（敵人的電力用完）什麼？！我的電力用完了？我怎麼能夠發生這種事呢？誰快給我更多的電力吧！馬\n上！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke088Subtitle
US: "*(ambulance) That ambulance will not save your men from the radiation"
DE: "*(ambulance) That ambulance will not save your men from the radiation"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "앰뷸런스로는 당신 부하들을 방사능에서 구할 순 없다네."
ZH: "\n（救護車）這輛救護車無法讓您的部下免於輻射傷害。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke089Subtitle
US: "*(strat center) A Strategy Center? What strategy could you possibly devise to fight me?"
DE: "*(strat center) A Strategy Center? What strategy could you possibly devise to fight me?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전략 센터? 나와 싸우는데 무슨 전략을 세울 수 있겠나?"
ZH: "\n（戰略中心）一座戰略中心？您能有什麼好戰略可以對抗我呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke090Subtitle
US: "*(black market) The Black Market won't sell you anything powerful enough to stop me, General"
DE: "*(black market) The Black Market won't sell you anything powerful enough to stop me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "암시장에서 나를 막을 수 있는 강력한 무기를 팔 것 같소?"
ZH: "\n（黑市）黑市將不會賣給您任何足以阻止我的任何東西，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke091Subtitle
US: "*(propaganda center) Your propaganda will not turn anyone against my nuclear power, General"
DE: "*(propaganda center) Your propaganda will not turn anyone against my nuclear power, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 선전 전술도 내 핵에 맞서도록 사람들을 세뇌시킬 순 없을거요."
ZH: "\n（思想強化中心）您的思想強化中心無法讓任何人對抗我的核子武力，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke092Subtitle
US: "*Oh, look--I have a nuke ready for you"
DE: "*Oh, look--I have a nuke ready for you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오, 보라고. 당신만을 위해 준비한 핵이네."
ZH: "\n喔，看吧。我已經為您準備好一項核子武器了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke093Subtitle
US: "*Wow, two nukes! I am pleased"
DE: "*Wow, two nukes! I am pleased"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "와, 핵이 두 개? 기쁨 두 배!"
ZH: "\n哇，兩項核子武器！我非常高興。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke094Subtitle
US: "*Three nukes?!? That's three times the fun!"
DE: "*Three nukes?!? That's three times the fun!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵이 세 개면 세 배로 즐겁겠군!"
ZH: "\n三項核子武器？！那麼樂趣也會乘上三倍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke095Subtitle
US: "*Four nukes? Incredible!"
DE: "*Four nukes? Incredible!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵이 네 개? 나 자신도 못믿겠어!"
ZH: "\n四項核子武器？叫人難以置信！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke096Subtitle
US: "*Five nukes? Maybe you want me to send you a clean pair of shorts now?"
DE: "*Five nukes? Maybe you want me to send you a clean pair of shorts now?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵이 다섯 개? 아마 자네한테 새 바지를 한 벌 보내줘야겠네. 오줌을 쌌을테니!"
ZH: "\n五項核子武器？或許您會希望我現在就送您一條乾淨的運動短褲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Nuke097Subtitle
US: "*(player sells building) General, if you sell off any more buildings I'll win by default"
DE: "*(player sells building) General, if you sell off any more buildings I'll win by default"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 건물을 더 팔았다간 내가 부전승 한다네."
ZH: "\n（玩家出售建築物）將軍，假如您再廉價出售任何建築物的話，我就算是獲勝了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth001Subtitle
US: "*Look at what I've found"
DE: "*Look at what I've found"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여어, 이게 누군가."
ZH: "\n看我找到了什麼東西！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth002Subtitle
US: "*Here comes my next attacktry to be ready this time, General"
DE: "*Here comes my next attacktry to be ready this time, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나의 후속 공격을 받으시지. 이번엔 준비가 되셨겠지, 장군?"
ZH: "\n這是我這次準備好的下一波進攻，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth003Subtitle
US: "*You can't kill what you can't see"
DE: "*You can't kill what you can't see"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "보이지 않는 걸 죽일 순 없지."
ZH: "\n您無法消滅您看不到的東西。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth004Subtitle
US: "*You didn't need those troops anyways"
DE: "*You didn't need those troops anyways"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어차피 그런 부대들은 필요가 없을 텐데."
ZH: "\n但是您不再需要這些軍隊了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth005Subtitle
US: "*Sleeping on the job again?"
DE: "*Sleeping on the job again?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "근무시간에 또 자고 있나?"
ZH: "\n又在工作時睡著了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth006Subtitle
US: "*hanks for the new units. They'll prove useful in destroying you"
DE: "*hanks for the new units. They'll prove useful in destroying you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "새 유닛 고맙군. 자네를 꺾는데 유용하게 쓰이겠지."
ZH: "\n感謝這些新單位。他們將摧毀您，以證明自己的用處。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth007Subtitle
US: "*Watch this! Oh wait, you can't"
DE: "*Watch this! Oh wait, you can't"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이것 보게! 아, 자넨 볼 수가 없겠군. 흐흐흐.."
ZH: "\n看看這個！喔，等等，您不行。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth008Subtitle
US: "*Did you bring your thermal goggles?"
DE: "*Did you bring your thermal goggles?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "적외선 고글 가져왔나?"
ZH: "\n您帶來自己的耐高溫護目鏡嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth009Subtitle
US: "*I think it's time to acquire a new base"
DE: "*I think it's time to acquire a new base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "새 기지를 얻을 시간이군."
ZH: "\n我想是獲得一座新基地的時候了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth010Subtitle
US: "*It was never meant to be General. Good bye!"
DE: "*It was never meant to be General. Good bye!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군이 될려고 한 건 아니었는데. 잘있게나!"
ZH: "\n作將軍不如想像中這麼容易。再見了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth011Subtitle
US: "*Closing your eyes will not make the pain of defeat any easier"
DE: "*Closing your eyes will not make the pain of defeat any easier"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "눈을 감는다고 패배의 아픔이 줄어들지는 않는다네."
ZH: "\n闔上您的雙眼也無法減輕一丁點失敗的痛苦。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth012Subtitle
US: "*My stealth assassins will make short work of your forces, General"
DE: "*My stealth assassins will make short work of your forces, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 스텔스 암살자들이 자네 병력을 좀 줄여놓을 걸세, 장군."
ZH: "\n我的秘密刺客將迅速解決您的軍隊，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth013Subtitle
US: "*We will strike like the snake--quick and invisible"
DE: "*We will strike like the snake--quick and invisible"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리는 뱀처럼 공격할 거요. 빠르고 보이지 않게."
ZH: "\n我們將會像蛇一樣發動攻擊--快速且隱密。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth014Subtitle
US: "*You will not stand against this attack, General"
DE: "*You will not stand against this attack, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 공격을 절대 견디지 못할 걸, 장군."
ZH: "\n您將無法抵抗這波進攻，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth015Subtitle
US: "*Handsome Generals always win battles"
DE: "*Handsome Generals always win battles"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "얼굴도 못생긴 것들이 전쟁에서 이기려 들기는!"
ZH: "\n英勇的將軍永遠會戰鬥勝利。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth016Subtitle
US: "*You'll never see me until it is too late , General"
DE: "*You'll never see me until it is too late , General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나를 발견했을 땐 이미 늦었을 것이네, 장군."
ZH: "\n等您看到我的時候，就表示已經太遲了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth017Subtitle
US: "*General, perhaps you could introduce me to Black Lotus. I'm a great admirer of heruh, work"
DE: "*General, perhaps you could introduce me to Black Lotus. I'm a great admirer of heruh, work"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n장군, 나를 흑수선한테 좀 소개시켜 주면 어떤가? 나는 그녀의 열렬한 숭배자요.\n아, 아니 그녀가 해낸 일들을 존경한다는 말이지.."
ZH: "\n將軍，或許您能夠將我介紹給黑蓮花。我十分敬佩她的作為！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth018Subtitle
US: "*When it is quiet you should fear me the most"
DE: "*When it is quiet you should fear me the most"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "조용한 때가 당신이 나를 가장 두려워 해야 할때요."
ZH: "\n當四周無聲時，應該就是您最害怕我的時候了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth019Subtitle
US: "*I can't wait for your next attack, General. Can we expect it today?"
DE: "*I can't wait for your next attack, General. Can we expect it today?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 다음 공격을 기다릴 수가 없는데, 장군. 오늘 안에는 되겠소?"
ZH: "\n我等不到您的下一波進攻了，將軍。我們可以今天就開始嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth020Subtitle
US: "*Don't let your senses grow dull, General--you can expect my attack any moment now"
DE: "*Don't let your senses grow dull, General--you can expect my attack any moment now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 감각을 무뎌지게 두지 말게나, 장군. 내가 언제라도 공격할 수 있다는 걸 생각해야지."
ZH: "\n別讓您的感官變遲鈍，將軍--現在您可以假設我隨時都有可能發動進攻。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth021Subtitle
US: "*You can't defeat me, General"
DE: "*You can't defeat me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나를 패배시킬 수 없을 걸세, 장군."
ZH: "\n您無法打敗我，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth022Subtitle
US: "*I will attack when you least expect it, General"
DE: "*I will attack when you least expect it, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "가장 예상 못했을 때, 내가 공격할 것이네, 장군."
ZH: "\n我將趁您出奇不意時發動攻擊，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth023Subtitle
US: "*My men are all over the battlefield, General...hidden from viewready to strike"
DE: "*My men are all over the battlefield, General...hidden from viewready to strike"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 부하들은 전장 어디에든 있지. 시야에서 숨은 채로 공격할 준비를 하고 있소."
ZH: "\n我的部下全都上戰場了，將軍...躲在景物後準備襲擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth024Subtitle
US: "*Stealth is my allyand your enemy"
DE: "*Stealth is my allyand your enemy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스텔스는 나의 동지이자 자네의 적이지."
ZH: "\n秘密行動是我的好幫手，也是您的敵人。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth025Subtitle
US: "*You've lost your Tech Building, General. What shall you lose next?"
DE: "*You've lost your Tech Building, General. What shall you lose next?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 지금 테크 빌딩을 잃었군, 장군. 다음엔 뭘 잃게 될까?"
ZH: "\n您已經失去科技建築，將軍。下一次您將會損失什麼？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth026Subtitle
US: "*You could not stop me from destroying you Barracks, General. What do you value if not your men?"
DE: "*You could not stop me from destroying you Barracks, General. What do you value if not your men?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n자네는 내가 자네 막사를 파괴하는 걸 막을 수 없었군.\n자네 부하들보다 더 가치있는 게 어디에 또 있을까?"
ZH: "\n您無法阻止我摧毀您的兵營，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth027Subtitle
US: "*Destroying you War Factory was child's-play. Your Command Center can't be far behind"
DE: "*Destroying you War Factory was child's-play. Your Command Center can't be far behind"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 군수공장을 파괴하는 건 식은 죽 먹기였네. 커맨드 센터도 머지 않아 파괴되겠군."
ZH: "\n摧毀您的戰車工廠只是小孩子的把戲。接下來就快輪到您的指揮中心了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth028Subtitle
US: "*Your planes have lost their Air Field, and you have lost your advantage, General"
DE: "*Your planes have lost their Air Field, and you have lost your advantage, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 비행기들의 비행장이 없어졌으니, 강점이 사라졌네, 장군."
ZH: "\n您的飛機已經失去機場，而您也失去優勢了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth029Subtitle
US: "*There is a hole in your defenses now, General. Who can say how many of my men are in your base now"
DE: "*There is a hole in your defenses now, General. Who can say how many of my men are in your base now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n자네의 방어막에는 구멍이 있네, 장군. 자네 기지에 내 부하들이 몇 명이나 있는지\n말할 수 있는 사람 없나?"
ZH: "\n現在您的防禦單位出現漏洞，將軍。誰能夠說明，現在您的基地裡有多少我的部下呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth030Subtitle
US: "*Your Command Center is gone, General. My victory is all but assured"
DE: "*Your Command Center is gone, General. My victory is all but assured"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 커맨드 센터가 날아갔군. 내가 거의 이겼다고 할 수 있네."
ZH: "\n您的指揮中心已經消失，將軍。我已是勝利在望！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth031Subtitle
US: "*I don't relish destroying your buildings, General, but you leave me no choice"
DE: "*I don't relish destroying your buildings, General, but you leave me no choice"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 건물 부수는 걸 그리 즐기진 않지만, 자네가 부술 건물들을 많이 만들어 주니 할 수 없지."
ZH: "\n我並不喜歡摧毀您的建築物，將軍，但是您讓我毫無選擇。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth032Subtitle
US: "*You are targeting my Tech Buildings because you have no hope of reaching my base"
DE: "*You are targeting my Tech Buildings because you have no hope of reaching my base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 테크 빌딩을 겨냥한 걸 보니 내 기지까지는 사정거리가 안되나보군."
ZH: "\n您正瞄準我的科技建築，但您別妄想到達我的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth033Subtitle
US: "*You have destroyed my Barracks, but we will rebuild and those men will be avenged"
DE: "*You have destroyed my Barracks, but we will rebuild and those men will be avenged"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 막사를 파괴했지만, 다시 지어서 복수할걸세."
ZH: "\n您已經摧毀了我的兵營，但是我們會進行重建，而且這些士兵也會展開復仇。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth034Subtitle
US: "*My Arms Dealer will not be pleased that you destroyed his depot, General"
DE: "*My Arms Dealer will not be pleased that you destroyed his depot, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 무기상은 자네가 그의 가게를 부순 걸 기뻐하지 않을 걸세."
ZH: "\n您摧毀了軍火商的倉庫，他勢必會為此大感不快，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth035Subtitle
US: "*You have destroyed that base defense, General, but that just may have allowed my men time to out-flank you"
DE: "*You have destroyed that base defense, General, but that just may have allowed my men time to out-flank you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n내 기지 방어막을 뚫었군. 하지만 그건 내 부하들이 자네를 측면에서 기습할 시간을\n벌어다 줬을 뿐이오."
ZH: "\n您已經摧毀基地防禦單位，將軍，但這不過是多留給我們的部隊一些時間，從側翼包抄您們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth036Subtitle
US: "*You've destroyed many of my buildings, but with even one factory left I am a dangerous opponent, General"
DE: "*You've destroyed many of my buildings, but with even one factory left I am a dangerous opponent, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 건물들을 많이 부쉈지만, 공장 하나만 남아 있어도 나는 자네의 가장 무서운 적이지, 장군."
ZH: "\n您已經摧毀我許多建築物了，但是，就算我只剩下一座工廠，我仍然是您最危險的敵人，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth037Subtitle
US: "*Nicely played, General; you've destroyed my Command Center. Now I will be forced to fight dirty"
DE: "*Nicely played, General; you've destroyed my Command Center. Now I will be forced to fight dirty"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "잘했소, 장군. 내 커맨드 센터를 부수다니. 이제부턴 내가 좀 지저분하게 싸워도 원망 마시오."
ZH: "\n作得好，將軍；您已經摧毀我的指揮中心。現在我只好勉強和黑暗對抗！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth038Subtitle
US: "*You're quite adept at discovering my camouflaged vehicles, General. I'll consider a new tactic"
DE: "*You're quite adept at discovering my camouflaged vehicles, General. I'll consider a new tactic"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "위장해 놓은 내 차량들을 찾아내다니 대단하군. 새 전술을 생각해 봐야겠는데."
ZH: "\n您相當善於發現我經過偽裝的載具，將軍。我會考慮採用新戰術。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth039Subtitle
US: "*Your brutish tactics are costing me men, General. I'll reconsider my tactics now that I know you have none"
DE: "*Your brutish tactics are costing me men, General. I'll reconsider my tactics now that I know you have none"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n자네의 야만적인 전술이 내 부하들을 희생시키고 있군. 자네가 전술이란 게 없는 걸 알았으니,\n내 전술을 재고해야겠군."
ZH: "\n您殘酷的戰術讓我的人員傷亡慘重，將軍。既然我知道您什麼也沒有，我將會重新考慮戰術。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth040Subtitle
US: "*Now that I've captured this Oil Derrick, my forces will grow even faster"
DE: "*Now that I've captured this Oil Derrick, my forces will grow even faster"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "원유 유정탑을 점령했으니 내 부대는 더욱 빠르게 증가하겠군."
ZH: "\n既然我已經佔領這個油井，我的軍隊將會成長地更快。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth041Subtitle
US: "*Artillery Platforms are so brutish, but I can't let you have it, can I?"
DE: "*Artillery Platforms are so brutish, but I can't let you have it, can I?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "캐논 플랫폼은 야만적이라 싫어하지만, 그래도 자네가 차지하게 놔둘 순 없지, 안그런가?"
ZH: "\n雖然這個煉油廠如此簡陋，但是我還是不能讓您擁有它，對嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth042Subtitle
US: "*This Oil Refinery is now mine, General"
DE: "*This Oil Refinery is now mine, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 정유 공장은 이제 내 것이네, 장군."
ZH: "\n煉油廠現在是我的了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth043Subtitle
US: "*General, you are coming dangerously close to my base"
DE: "*General, you are coming dangerously close to my base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 자네는 위험할 정도로 내 기지에 가까이 접근하고 있네."
ZH: "\n將軍，您正逐漸陷入危險，靠近我的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth044Subtitle
US: "*I see forces approaching my base, General. You don't mean to invade do you?"
DE: "*I see forces approaching my base, General. You don't mean to invade do you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지로 다가오는 부대가 보이는군. 침투를 하려는 건 아니겠지?"
ZH: "\n我看到軍隊正接近我的基地，將軍。您不是打算要侵略我吧，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth045Subtitle
US: "*You are testing my patience, General. Remove you forces from my base"
DE: "*You are testing my patience, General. Remove you forces from my base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 인내심을 시험하고 있군. 내 기지에서 당장 나가시지."
ZH: "\n您正在挑戰我的耐性，將軍。把您的軍隊從我的基地裡撤出。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth046Subtitle
US: "*If you do not remove your forces from my base, I'll remove them permanently"
DE: "*If you do not remove your forces from my base, I'll remove them permanently"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지에서 자네 부대를 철수시키지 않으면, 영원히 사라지게 할거요."
ZH: "\n假如您還不把軍隊從我的基地撤出，我會永遠讓它們消失不見。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth047Subtitle
US: "*So you're trying to enter my base from the flank. We'll put a stop to that"
DE: "*So you're trying to enter my base from the flank. We'll put a stop to that"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 측면에서 내 기지로 들어오시겠다? 좀 막아줘야겠어."
ZH: "\n這樣看來，您正試著從側翼進入我的基地。我們會制止您的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth048Subtitle
US: "*A back-door attack? I didn't realize you were so devious, General"
DE: "*A back-door attack? I didn't realize you were so devious, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "뒤에서 공격을? 자네가 그렇게 사악한 인간인 줄은 몰랐네, 장군."
ZH: "\n秘密攻擊？我從來不曉得，原來您是這麼鬼鬼祟祟的人，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth049Subtitle
US: "*A frontal assault? That will prove a fatal mistake, General"
DE: "*A frontal assault? That will prove a fatal mistake, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "정면 공격? 치명적인 실수가 될거요, 장군."
ZH: "\n正面攻擊？我將會證明這是您致命的錯誤，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth050Subtitle
US: "*Those are my resources, General--go find your own"
DE: "*Those are my resources, General--go find your own"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그건 내 자원이네, 장군. 다른 데 가서 알아보시게."
ZH: "\n這些是我的資源，將軍--去找您自己的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth051Subtitle
US: "*Why do you insist on approaching my base that way, General?"
DE: "*Why do you insist on approaching my base that way, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "왜 그런 식으로 내 기지에 접근하는 거요, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您為何堅持用這種方式接近我的基地，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth052Subtitle
US: "*That route is not as unguarded as it seems, General"
DE: "*That route is not as unguarded as it seems, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 루트는 보기만큼 수비 병력이 없는 것이 아닌데."
ZH: "\n那條路並不是如他所見的一無防禦，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth053Subtitle
US: "*The only thing you will find here is your own destruction, General"
DE: "*The only thing you will find here is your own destruction, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여기서 자네가 곧 경험할 것은 자네의 파멸이지."
ZH: "\n您在這裡唯一可能找到的東西，就是死路一條，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth054Subtitle
US: "*What is your fascination with this area, General?"
DE: "*What is your facination with this area, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 곳의 뭐가 그렇게 매력이 있나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n這個區域令您著迷的是什麼，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth055Subtitle
US: "*We are nearing your base, General. There may be cross-hairs on your head right now"
DE: "*We are nearing your base, General. There may be cross-hairs on your head right now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 기지에 접근중이네. 머리에 조준경이 맞춰져 있을 걸세."
ZH: "\n我們正慢慢接近您的基地，將軍。現在您的頭上可能會出現一個瞄準的十字線。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth056Subtitle
US: "*Your outer defenses are weak, General. Let's hope you base is better protected"
DE: "*Your outer defenses are weak, General. Let's hope you base is better protected"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 외곽 방어는 약하네, 장군. 기지 방어가 더 훌륭하기를 바랄 뿐이네."
ZH: "\n您的外部防禦單位相當脆弱，將軍。讓我們祈禱您的基地有較好的防護能力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth057Subtitle
US: "*We have entered you base, General. Ignore us at your own peril"
DE: "*We have entered you base, General. Ignore us at your own peril"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 기지에 들어섰네. 위험을 각오하고 그냥 신경쓰지 말던가."
ZH: "\n我們已經進入您的基地，將軍。不理會我們的話，後果將由您自負。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth058Subtitle
US: "*Your defenses are broken, General. How will you repel us now?"
DE: "*Your defenses are broken, General. How will you repel us now?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "방어가 깨졌네, 장군. 이젠 우릴 어떻게 물리칠건가?"
ZH: "\n您的防禦單位已被破壞，將軍。現在看您如何擊退我們？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth059Subtitle
US: "*You really should be defending these resources, General, or this battle will be very short"
DE: "*You really should be defending these resources, General, or this battle will be very short"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 자원들을 꼭 지켜내야 하네, 장군. 안 그러면 이 전쟁은 무척 짧아질테니까."
ZH: "\n您真的應該好好保護這些資源，將軍，不然這場戰役將會非常短暫。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth060Subtitle
US: "*I've found your Tech Buildings, General. What should I do with them?"
DE: "*I've found your Tech Buildings, General. What should I do with them?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 테크 빌딩을 찾았소, 장군. 내가 이걸로 뭘 하면 좋겠나?"
ZH: "\n我已經發現您的科技建築，將軍。我該怎麼處置它們呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth061Subtitle
US: "*I've found the back-door to your base, General"
DE: "*I've found the back-door to your base, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 기지의 후문을 찾았네, 장군."
ZH: "\n我已經發現您基地的後門了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth062Subtitle
US: "*Can you defend against my flanking attack, General? Let's find out"
DE: "*Can you defend against my flanking attack, General? Let's find out"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 측면 공격을 방어할 수 있나, 장군? 한번 보자고."
ZH: "\n您能否防範我的側翼攻擊呢，將軍？讓我們試試看吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth063Subtitle
US: "*Only a careless general would allow the power to fail"
DE: "*Only a careless general would allow the power to fail"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "부주의한 장군들이 전기를 나가게 하더군."
ZH: "\n只有粗心大意的將軍，才會出現電力不足的情況。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth064Subtitle
US: "*Your power is down, General. You did not plan your infrastructure properly. Let's hope it isn't a fatal mistake"
DE: "*Your power is down, General. You did not plan your infrastructure properly. Let's hope it isn't a fatal mistake"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n자네의 전력이 차단되었군. 기반 시설을 제대로 계획하지 않아서지.\n이게 치명적인 실수가 아니길 바랍시다."
ZH: "\n您的電力正在減少，將軍。您沒有妥善規劃公共建築。讓我們祈禱這不是個致命的錯誤。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth065Subtitle
US: "*General, you can't fight without resources. What will you do now?"
DE: "*General, you can't fight without resources. What will you do now?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 자원 없이는 싸울 수가 없소. 이제 뭘 할 거요?"
ZH: "\n將軍，沒有資源，您將無法作戰。現在您該怎麼辦呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth066Subtitle
US: "*You have robbed me of my resources, General. Now I will return the favor"
DE: "*You have robbed me of my resources, General. Now I will return the favor"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 자원을 자네가 훔쳐갔나 보군. 아주 고맙네. 이 은혜는 갚도록 하지."
ZH: "\n您已經搶走我的資源，將軍。現在我將向您討回來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth067Subtitle
US: "*So, you have built a Scud Storm. We will have to deal with this new threat"
DE: "*So, you have built a Scud Storm. We will have to deal with this new threat"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 폭풍을 만들었군. 이 새로운 위협을 잘 다뤄야겠는데."
ZH: "\n這樣看來，您已經建立一座生化死雨風暴。我們必須處理這個全新的威脅。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth068Subtitle
US: "*Nuclear weapons have no place in this battle, General. Why do you insist on building them?"
DE: "*Nuclear weapons have no place in this battle, General. Why do you insist on building them?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵무기는 이 전쟁에 끼어들 자리가 없는데 왜 그것들을 만들겠다고 고집하는 거요, 장군?"
ZH: "\n核子武器在這場戰役中已經沒有優勢了，將軍。為何您堅持繼續建造它們？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth069Subtitle
US: "*You would strike at me from space with your cowardly Particle Cannon? I am disappointed, General"
DE: "*You would strike at me from space with your cowardly Particle Cannon? I am disappointed, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 파티클 캐논으로 겁장이처럼 우주에서부터 나를 치겠다고? 실망했네, 장군."
ZH: "\n您想從空中用您那卑微的離子砲將我擊垮嗎？我很失望，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth070Subtitle
US: "*So many base defenses, General. What are you afraid of?"
DE: "*So many base defenses, General. What are you afraid of?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "꽤 많은 기지 방어 시설이오, 장군. 뭐가 그렇게 두려운건가?"
ZH: "\n建造這麼多基地防禦單位，將軍。您在怕什麼呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth071Subtitle
US: "*You're building tanks, are you. Well, a few more sniper should take care of that"
DE: "*You're building tanks, are you. Well, a few more sniper should take care of that"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "탱크를 만들고 있군. 음, 그것들을 손 봐 줄 저격수들이 더 필요하겠는데."
ZH: "\n您正在建造坦克，是嗎？好吧，不少狙擊兵應該會來處理這件事情。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth072Subtitle
US: "*More planes? Why so many, General? Afraid to come down and face me?"
DE: "*More planes? Why so many, General? Afraid to come down and face me?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행기가 더 필요해? 왜 그렇게 많이 원하시나, 장군? 내려와서 나를 대하는 게 겁나는가?"
ZH: "\n更多飛機？為什麼需要這麼多呢，將軍？是不是害怕掉落下來並面對我呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth073Subtitle
US: "*Let me give you some advice, General. That large group of infantry is no match for my snipers"
DE: "*Let me give you some advice, General. That large group of infantry is no match for my snipers"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 충고 몇 가지 하지, 장군. 대규모 보병은 나의 저격수들의 상대가 안된다오."
ZH: "\n讓我給您一些建議，將軍。這個大型步兵團不是我狙擊兵的對手。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth074Subtitle
US: "*Your base has grown so large, General. Do you think you can defend all your buildings from capture?"
DE: "*Your base has grown so large, General. Do you think you can defend all your buildings from capture?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 기지가 꽤 넓어졌군. 그 건물들을 다 지킬 수 있을 것 같소?"
ZH: "\n您的基地已經成長到如此龐大，將軍。您認為您可以防禦所有的建築物，不被我佔領嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth075Subtitle
US: "*You've launched! You'll regret using that Scud Storm, General"
DE: "*You've launched! You'll regret using that Scud Storm, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이런, 발사했군! 스커드 폭풍을 사용한걸 후회하게 될 거요, 장군."
ZH: "\n您已經發動戰爭！您會後悔使用了生化死雨風暴，"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth076Subtitle
US: "*Nuclear missiles! I thought you were bluffing, General"
DE: "*Nuclear missiles! I thought you were bluffing, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵 미사일! 허세를 부리는 줄 알았는데, 장군."
ZH: "\n核子飛彈！我還以為您只不過是虛張聲勢，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth077Subtitle
US: "*Yes, look at the cowardly particle beam. Enjoy this, General--my answer will be swift and brutal"
DE: "*Yes, look at the cowardly particle beam. Enjoy this, General--my answer will be swift and brutal"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "저 비열한 파티클 빔을 좀 봐. 즐겨 보시오, 장군. 내 대답은 빠르고도 잔인할테니."
ZH: "\n是的，看看這個卑微的粒子光束。好好欣賞吧，將軍--我的答案將會是迅速而且殘忍的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth078Subtitle
US: "*By all means, General, garrison that buildingmy snipers can possibly hit them in there"
DE: "*By all means, General, garrison that buildingmy snipers can possibly hit them in there"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 건물에 수비대를 둬도 결국엔 내 저격수들이 거기를 칠 거요."
ZH: "\n無論如何，將軍，請務必派兵駐守那棟建築物。狙擊兵可能會射中他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth079Subtitle
US: "*Colonel Burton, General? Perhaps you should make him the general; you'll only lead him to an early grave"
DE: "*Colonel Burton, General? Perhaps you should make him the general; you'll only lead him to an early grave"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "버튼 대령? 그를 장군으로 만들려는 모양인데, 자네는 그 친구를 무덤으로 빨리 보내게 될 거요."
ZH: "\n貝頓上校嗎，將軍？或許您應該將他擢升為將軍；那您只會讓他更早走進墳墓裡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth080Subtitle
US: "*Ah the beautiful Black Lotus. Perhaps after you're defeated, General, she'll agree to join me"
DE: "*Ah the beautiful Black Lotus. Perhaps after you're defeated, General, she'll agree to join me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아, 아름다운 흑수선. 자네가 패하고 나면, 그녀는 순순히 나의 편이 될거요, 장군."
ZH: "\n哎呀，美麗的黑蓮花。將軍，或許在您被打敗後，她會考慮加入我這一方。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth081Subtitle
US: "*Jarmen Kell?! All snipers beware: Jarmen Kell has entered the field"
DE: "*Jarmen Kell?! All snipers beware: Jarmen Kell has entered the field"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "쟈멘 켈? 모든 저격수들은 주의하라. 쟈멘 켈이 전장에 들어왔다."
ZH: "\n賈曼卡爾？！所有狙擊兵注意：賈曼卡爾已經進入戰場。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth082Subtitle
US: "*Wise choice, building an Air Field, but planes alone will not be enough to defeat me, General"
DE: "*Wise choice, building an Air Field, but planes alone will not be enough to defeat me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "현명한 선택이군. 비행장을 짓다니, 하지만 비행기만으론 나를 이길 수 없네, 장군."
ZH: "\n建造一座機場，的確是聰明的選擇，但是只靠飛機是無法打敗我的，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth083Subtitle
US: "*My spies tell me you've finally built your War Factory, General. Are you ready to fight now?"
DE: "*My spies tell me you've finally built your War Factory, General. Are you ready to fight now?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 첩자들에 의하면 자네가 군수공장을 지었다고하던데. 이제 싸울 준비가 된건가?"
ZH: "\n我的間諜說，您已經建造完戰車工廠，將軍。您現在準備好開始戰鬥了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth084Subtitle
US: "*Train all the men you wish from that Barracks, General; they are no match for my snipers"
DE: "*Train all the men you wish from that Barracks, General; they are no match for my snipers"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "막사의 모든 자네 부하들을 훈련시키게, 장군. 그들은 내 저격수들의 상대가 못 되지."
ZH: "\n在兵營裡訓練所有您想要的人員，將軍，不過這些人不是我狙擊兵的對手。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth085Subtitle
US: "*You've sold-off one of your buildings. Such tactics lead to defeat, General"
DE: "*You've sold-off one of your buildings. Such tactics lead to defeat, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건물을 하나 팔았군. 그런 전술로는 패배할텐데."
ZH: "\n您已經廉價出售其中一棟建築物。這樣的戰術必然導致失敗，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth086Subtitle
US: "*How are you defeating my forces?! It's not possible!"
DE: "*How are you defeating my forces?! It's not possible!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어떻게 내 부대를 무찌를 수 있었지? 불가능해!"
ZH: "\n您居然擊敗我的軍隊？這怎麼可能呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth087Subtitle
US: "*You may have the upper-hand now, but your desperate tactics will not endure, General"
DE: "*You may have the upper-hand now, but your desperate tactics will not endure, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지금은 자네의 병력이 우위에 있지만, 자네의 절박한 임기응변 전술은 오래 가지 못할 걸세."
ZH: "\n雖然您現在佔了上風，但是您這種孤注一擲的戰術是無法持久的，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth088Subtitle
US: "*My forces will rise up against your oppression and we will defeat you, General"
DE: "*My forces will rise up against your oppression and we will defeat you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 병사들이 자네의 억압에 반기를 들고 자네를 무찌를 것이네, 장군."
ZH: "\n我的部隊將起身反抗您的壓迫，而且我一定會打敗您，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth089Subtitle
US: "*Enjoy your advantage for now, Generalyou'll make a mistake soon and I'll turn the tide of this battle"
DE: "*Enjoy your advantage for now, Generalyou'll make a mistake soon and I'll turn the tide of this battle"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지금은 유리해 보일지 몰라도 조금의 헛점이라도 보이면 전세는 역전될거요, 장군."
ZH: "\n現在好好享受您的優勢吧，將軍。您很快就會犯錯，而我將掌握這場戰役的局勢。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth090Subtitle
US: "*So it endsyou've defeated me, General, but someday I'll have my revenge. Watch your back, General"
DE: "*So it endsyou've defeated me, General, but someday I'll have my revenge. Watch your back, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나의 최후군, 당신이 이겼소. 하지만, 언젠가는 복수를 하리라."
ZH: "\n結束了，您已經打敗我，將軍。但總有一天我會報一箭之仇。小心您背後阿，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth091Subtitle
US: "*Your forces are weakening, General. Accept defeat and I'll go easy on you"
DE: "*Your forces are weakening, General. Accept defeat and I'll go easy on you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네의 군대는 점점 더 약해지고 있네, 장군. 지금 항복하면 잘 봐줄 수도 있지."
ZH: "\n您的軍隊正慢慢被削弱，將軍。接受失敗吧，我會考慮手下留情。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth092Subtitle
US: "*Your attacks are ineffective against me, General. Soon we'll sweep in and destroy you"
DE: "*Your attacks are ineffective against me, General. Soon we'll sweep in and destroy you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 따위 공격으로는 날 이길 수 없어, 장군. 이제 곧 진짜 '공격'이 뭔지 알려주지."
ZH: "\n您的攻擊對我無效，將軍。我們馬上就會橫掃戰場，將您摧毀。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth093Subtitle
US: "*I'm enjoying this little game, General, but your pathetic attacks are beginning to bore me"
DE: "*I'm enjoying this little game, General, but your pathetic attacks are beginning to bore me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이번 게임이 흥미롭긴 하지만, 그대의 미미한 공격은 점점 지루해지고 있네, 장군."
ZH: "\n我正在享受這場小遊戲，將軍。但是您微弱的攻擊開始讓我感到無聊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth094Subtitle
US: "*I thought you would provide more of a challenge, General. I guess I overestimated you"
DE: "*I thought you would provide more of a challenge, General. I guess I overestimated you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기대에 못미치는 성적이군, 장군. 내가 그대를 과대평가했었던 모양이야."
ZH: "\n我本來以為您帶給我的不僅僅是挑戰而已，將軍。不過，我想我是太高估您了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth095Subtitle
US: "*You have fallen to Kassad, like all have before you"
DE: "*You have fallen to Kassaad, like all have before you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그대도 카사드에게 무릎을 꿇게 되는군."
ZH: "\n您已經落入科塞德的手中，就如同在您面前所呈現的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth096Subtitle
US: "*We will strike like the snake--unseen and deadly"
DE: "*We will strike like the snake--unseen and deadly"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "독사와 같이 일격을 가하리라. 보이지 않는 치명타를."
ZH: "\n我們將會像蛇一樣發動攻擊，不讓人發現且致命。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth097Subtitle
US: "*Now you see me--now you're dead"
DE: "*Now you see me--now you're dead"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "날 발견했단 말이지… 당신은 끝장이야."
ZH: "\n現在您看到我了，準備受死吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth098Subtitle
US: "*I am Kassad"
DE: "*I am Kassaad"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나는 카사드일지어다!"
ZH: "\n我就是科塞德。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth099Subtitle
US: "*This will not go well for you, General"
DE: "*This will not go well for you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "별로 좋은 결과는 바라지 마시게, 장군."
ZH: "\n您不會有好日子過的，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth100Subtitle
US: "*My men will not accept this defeat from their leader, General. You have signed my death warrant with your superior tactics"
DE: "*My men will not accept this defeat from their leader, General. You have signed my death warrant with your superior tactics"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 병사들은 패배한 지도자를 가만 안놔둔단 말이오. 이제 큰일났군."
ZH: "\n我的部下將不會接受領導人的失敗，將軍。您已經用出色的戰術簽署了我的死刑執行令。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth101Subtitle
US: "*Accept your bitter defeat and remove yourself from my sight, General"
DE: "*Accept your bitter defeat and remove yourself from my sight, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "쓰라린 패배를 인정하고 내 앞에서 사라지게, 장군."
ZH: "\n接受您難堪的失敗吧，滾出我的視線外，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth102Subtitle
US: "*And another who stood against me falls"
DE: "*And another who stood against me falls"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "으흐흐흐..나에게 맞섰던 또 하나가 쓰러지는군.."
ZH: "\n讓反抗我的人失敗。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth103Subtitle
US: "*And so it will be for you, General--no warning, no mercy"
DE: "*And so it will be for you, General--no warning, no mercy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그대도 같은 꼴을 당할 테니 잘 보게, 장군… 난 자비 따윈 베풀지 않아."
ZH: "\n而這將是為您準備的，將軍。這不是警告而已，也不會有任何憐憫。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Stealth104Subtitle
US: "*You still have time to flee with your life, General. <evil laughter trailing off to silence>"
DE: "*You still have time to flee with your life, General. <evil laughter trailing off to silence>"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아직 도망칠 시간은 있네, 장군. 흐흐흐.."
ZH: "\n您仍然有時間逃走，將軍。<邪惡的笑聲逐漸消失>"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank001Subtitle
US: "*I see you haven't run in fear, General. Soon you'll wish you had"
DE: "*I see you haven't run in fear, General. Soon you'll wish you had"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "날 보고 도망치지 않다니… 곧 후회하게 만들어 주지, 장군."
ZH: "\n我看您還沒害怕地逃走，將軍。您馬上就會後悔沒提早逃離。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank002Subtitle
US: "*My forces are at your door, General"
DE: "*My forces are at your door, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 부대가 문앞까지 다가갔소, 장군."
ZH: "\n我的部隊就在您門口了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank003Subtitle
US: "*The iron dragon marches through your puny defenses"
DE: "*The iron dragon marches through your pewny defenses"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "철갑을 두른 용과 같은 내 부대가 그대 수비를 완전히 뚫고 있소."
ZH: "\n這個鐵血飛龍強行通過您的防禦單位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank004Subtitle
US: "*I fear this will end you, General"
DE: "*I fear this will end you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이게 아마 그대의 최후일 것이오, 장군."
ZH: "\n我擔心這將會結束您的生命，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank005Subtitle
US: "*Mmmcan you feel the thunderous song of approaching armor, General?"
DE: "*Mmmcan you feel the thunderous song of approaching armor, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이야, 전진하는 내 전차 부대가 마치 천둥번개와 같지 않소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n恩，您聽到裝甲坦克節節逼近的轟隆聲響嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank006Subtitle
US: "*Are you protecting your flanks, General? Why don't we have a look"
DE: "*Are you protecting your flanks, General? Why don't we have a look"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "후방 수비는 제대로 했나, 장군? 한번 봅시다."
ZH: "\n您準備要防守側翼嗎，將軍？我們何不先看看再說。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank007Subtitle
US: "*Are you impressed with the modifications to my tanks, General?"
DE: "*Are you impressed with the modifications to my tanks, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "업그레이드한 내 탱크가 어떤가, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您是否對我的坦克車大幅改裝感到印象深刻呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank008Subtitle
US: "*Armor...crush them"
DE: "*Armor...crush them"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기갑 부대! 그들을 없애버려랏!"
ZH: "\n裝甲部隊…碾碎他們！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank009Subtitle
US: "*Soon, the field will fill with tanksmy tanks"
DE: "*Soon, the field will fill with tanksmy tanks"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "곧 전쟁터는 내 탱크로 가득 찰 것이다. 사랑스러운 내 탱크들!"
ZH: "\n很快地，這個戰場上將都會是我的坦克車。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank010Subtitle
US: "*All units...attack"
DE: "*All units...attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "모든 유닛, 공격 개시하라."
ZH: "\n所有單位….進攻！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank011Subtitle
US: "*Nice base, Generalcare to surrender it?"
DE: "*Nice base, Generalcare to surrender it?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "쓸 만한 기지군, 항복할 생각은 없나?"
ZH: "\n不錯的基地，將軍，擔心它被佔領嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank012Subtitle
US: "*This spells your doom, General"
DE: "*This spells your doom, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군의 최후가 곧 오리라."
ZH: "\n這意味著您的厄運，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank013Subtitle
US: "*We're in your base, General; your defenses were inadequate"
DE: "*We're in your base, General; your defenses were inadequate"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이미 당신 기지에 들어왔소, 장군. 방어에 신경 좀 쓰시지."
ZH: "\n我們正在您的基地裡，將軍；您的防禦單位是無法對付我。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank014Subtitle
US: "*You dare attack my War Factory! All forces, remove this pest!"
DE: "*You dare attack my War Factory! All forces, remove this pest!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "감히 나의 군수 공장을 공격하다니! 전 부대는 들어라! 이들을 없애버렷!"
ZH: "\n您膽敢攻擊我的戰車工廠！所有軍隊，將這個害人精趕出去！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank015Subtitle
US: "*Tanksbuild more tanks"
DE: "*Tanksbuild more tanks"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "탱크, 탱크를 더 만들어야 해!"
ZH: "\n坦克能夠建造更多坦克。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank016Subtitle
US: "*Another battalion is on its way, General, please make them feel welcome"
DE: "*Another battalion is on its way, General, please make them feel welcome"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "조만간 한 부대가 또 갈 것이야, 장군. 환영 인사를 잘 해주게."
ZH: "\n另一批軍隊正在途中，將軍，請讓他們感到賓至如歸吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank017Subtitle
US: "*Ah, this is the part of the battle I enjoy the mostthe part just before I finish off my enemy"
DE: "*Ah, this is the part of the battle I enjoy the mostthe part just before I finish off my enemy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아, 내가 제일 좋아하는 순간이야. 내 적을 쓸어버리기 바로 직전의 순간."
ZH: "\n哎呀，戰爭之中我最喜歡的一個部份，就是將我的敵人全部消滅。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank018Subtitle
US: "*Tanks: move fasterbefore our opponent considers an actual attack"
DE: "*Tanks: move fasterbefore our opponent considers an actual attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전차 부대는 들어라 - 아무래도 상대는 자고 있는 것 같은데, 전속력으로 돌진하라."
ZH: "\n坦克：在敵人估算到我們實際行動前，快一點移動吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank019Subtitle
US: "*It's quiet out there, General. There must be a lot of tanks rolling towards your base, don't you think?"
DE: "*It's quiet out there, General. There must be a lot of tanks rolling towards your base, don't you think?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "너무 고요하지 않나, 장군? 수많은 탱크가 그쪽으로 달려가는 소리가 안 들리나 보지?"
ZH: "\n外面看來十分平靜，將軍。但是一定有許多坦克正朝您的基地前進，您不這麼認為嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank020Subtitle
US: "*I'm going to take this time to construct more defensesno, wait, I'll build more tanks instead"
DE: "*I'm going to take this time to construct more defensesno, wait, I'll build more tanks instead"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "음, 수비를 강화해야겠군. 아니야, 탱크를 더 만들어야겠어."
ZH: "\n我準備花時間建造更多的防禦單位。不，等等，我想還是建造更多坦克好了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank021Subtitle
US: "*This area was once fertile farm land. Soon your blood will make it fertile again"
DE: "*This area was once fertile farm land. Soon your blood will make it fertile again"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "예전에 이 지역은 풍요로운 땅이였다고 하지. 곧 그대의 피로 다시 기름질 것이야."
ZH: "\n這個地區曾是肥沃豐饒的農地。很快地，您流的血將讓它再度肥沃。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank022Subtitle
US: "*Your tactics amuse me, General"
DE: "*Your tactics amuse me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어설픈 전략이 훤히 보이는군, 장군."
ZH: "\n您的戰術讓我發笑，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank023Subtitle
US: "*Enjoy the rest, General--soon the attacks will begin again"
DE: "*Enjoy the rest, General--soon the attacks will begin again"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "잘 쉬고 있나, 장군? 곧 나의 공격이 시작될 것이야."
ZH: "\n好好享受這段休戰期吧，將軍。我的攻擊馬上就會再度展開。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank024Subtitle
US: "*We're awaiting your assault, General, but I'm beginning to wonder if it will ever come"
DE: "*We're awaiting your assault, General, but I'm beginning to wonder if it will ever come"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군의 공격을 한참동안 기다리고 있는데… 심심해 죽겠다."
ZH: "\n我們正在等待您的攻擊，將軍，但是我已開始懷疑您是否會反擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank025Subtitle
US: "*Our War Factories are working hard to make more tanks, just for you, General"
DE: "*Our War Factories are working hard to make more tanks, just for you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "군수 공장에서 당신만을 위한 특별 선물을 열심히 준비하고 있소, 장군."
ZH: "\n我們的戰車工廠正努力建造更多坦克，是專門為了您所作的，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank026Subtitle
US: "*How much longer can you survive such loses, General? Perhaps it is time to consider surrender"
DE: "*How much longer can you survive such loses, General? Perhaps it is time to consider surrender"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이런 손해를 얼마나 더 버틸 수 있소, 장군? 이제 항복을 생각할 때가 온 것 같은데."
ZH: "\n在經歷這麼嚴重的損失後，您還能撐多久呢，將軍？或許是您考慮投降的時候了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank027Subtitle
US: "*Tanks amass in our base, preparing for the final assault. Will your defenses hold this time?"
DE: "*Tanks amass in our base, preparing for the final assault. Will your defenses hold this time?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "마지막 공격을 위한 준비는 거의 완료했소. 이번에 막아낼 수 있을까?"
ZH: "\n坦克聚集在我們的基地，正準備作最後進攻。您的防禦單位這次還能夠抵擋嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank028Subtitle
US: "*Soon we will remove you from our lands"
DE: "*Soon we will remove you from our lands"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 곧 당신의 부대를 싹슬이 하겠소."
ZH: "\n我們馬上就會把您趕出領土。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank029Subtitle
US: "*This will be your last chance to prove yourself, General. Soon my tanks will end your pitiful army"
DE: "*This will be your last chance to prove yourself, General. Soon my tanks will end your pitiful army"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이번이 마지막 기회라 생각하고 덤비시오, 장군. 이제 곧 나의 전차 부대는 쳐들어간다."
ZH: "\n這將是您證明自己的最後機會，將軍。我的坦克馬上就會消滅您可憐的軍隊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank030Subtitle
US: "*You cannot believe your luck will hold out much longercan you, General?"
DE: "*You cannot believe your luck will hold out much longercan you, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "얼마나 더 버틸 수 있다고 생각하오, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您該不會以為您的好運會一直持續吧，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank031Subtitle
US: "*You didn't want that Tech Building, did you?"
DE: "*You didn't want that Tech Building, did you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 건물은 없어도 상관없나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您不想要那座科技建築了，是吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank032Subtitle
US: "*Your Barracks has fallen to my tanks, General"
DE: "*Your Barracks has fallen to my tanks, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그대의 막사는 내 전차 부대에 당했소, 장군."
ZH: "\n您的兵營已經被我的坦克包圍了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank033Subtitle
US: "*There goes your factory, General. How will you match my armor now?"
DE: "*There goes your factory, General. How will you match my armor now?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "공장이 날아갔네, 장군. 이제 뭘로 내 전차를 상대할 셈인가?"
ZH: "\n您的工廠已經倒了，將軍。您現在如何對抗我的裝甲部隊呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank034Subtitle
US: "*Without your airfield you've lost your only chance against me, General"
DE: "*Without your airfield you've lost your only chance against me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행장이 없이는 절대 날 상대 못해, 장군."
ZH: "\n沒有了機場，您等於失去最後反擊的機會，將軍。我等您投降。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank035Subtitle
US: "*Your defenses fall like toys before my armor"
DE: "*Your defenses fall like toys before my armor"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 방어선은 내 병력 앞에선 종이조각에 불과하군."
ZH: "\n在我的裝甲坦克面前，您的防禦單位像玩具般不堪一擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank036Subtitle
US: "*You can't lost your Command Center and all hope to win against me, General. I await your surrender"
DE: "*You can't lost your Command Center and all hope to win against me, General. I await your surrender"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "커맨드 센터를 잃고도 이길 생각은 아니겠지, 장군. 당신의 항복을 기다리네."
ZH: "\n您千萬不能失去指揮中心，因為這是您能贏我的全部希望，將軍。我等您投降。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank037Subtitle
US: "*You've lost a lot of buildings, Generalisn't it time to surrender?"
DE: "*You've lost a lot of buildings, Generalisn't it time to surrender?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "많은 건물을 잃었네, 장군. 항복할 시간이 아닌가?"
ZH: "\n您已經失去許多建築物，將軍。是不是該投降了？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank038Subtitle
US: "*That tech building was mine, General; you will regret destroying it"
DE: "*That tech building was mine, General; you will regret destroying it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 테크 빌딩은 내 거였네, 장군. 나중에 후회할 걸세."
ZH: "\n那座科技建築是我的，將軍；您將會為摧毀它而感到後悔。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank039Subtitle
US: "*So, you've destroyed my Barracks--so be it. Now I will destroy yours"
DE: "*So, you've destroyed my Barracks--so be it. Now I will destroy yours"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 막사를 부쉈군. 좋아, 이번에 당신 차례야."
ZH: "\n這樣看來，您已經摧毀我的兵營。既然如此，現在我也將摧毀您的兵營。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank040Subtitle
US: "*We will rebuild that War Factory. Soon the tanks will again flow to your base like water"
DE: "*We will rebuild that War Factory. Soon the tanks will again flow to your base like water"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "군수공장을 다시 건설하지. 곧 탱크 부대가 당신 기지를 휩쓸 거야."
ZH: "\n我們將會重建那座戰車工廠。坦克馬上就會再次如潮水般淹沒您的基地。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank041Subtitle
US: "*Destroying my Airfield will not stop me, General"
DE: "*Destroying my Airfield will not stop me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행장을 파괴한다고 날 막지 못하오, 장군."
ZH: "\n即使是摧毀我的機場，也無法阻止我，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank042Subtitle
US: "*Destroying my defenses only let's me know where you are, General"
DE: "*Destroying my defenses only let's me know where you are, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 방어 건물을 부수면 당신 위치를 노출시킬 뿐이네, 장군."
ZH: "\n摧毀我的防禦單位，只是讓我知道您的所在位置而已，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank043Subtitle
US: "*General, you are destroying an unacceptable number of my buildings. This must stop"
DE: "*General, you are destroying an unacceptable number of my buildings. This must stop"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 너무 많은 건물들을 부쉈군. 이 이상은 곤란하겠어."
ZH: "\n將軍，您正在摧毀我許多建築物。您必須停止！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank044Subtitle
US: "*You've destroyed my Command CenterI am impressed, General...few survive this long"
DE: "*You've destroyed my Command CenterI am impressed, General...few survive this long"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 커맨드 센터를 파괴하다니... 놀랍군, 장군. 이렇게 오래 버틸 수 있는 사람은 별로 없네."
ZH: "\n您已經摧毀我的指揮中心，真讓我印象深刻，將軍...很少人能夠倖存這麼久。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank045Subtitle
US: "*You're shooting at my planes?! Do you think this is the best tactic against me, General?"
DE: "*You're shooting at my planes?! Do you think this is the best tactic against me, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 비행기를 격추시키고 있어?! 이게 가장 효과적인 전술이라고 생각하나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您正在射擊我的飛機嗎？！您以為這是對付我的最佳戰術嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank046Subtitle
US: "*Enough! Do not destroy any more of my tanks, General"
DE: "*Enough! Do not destroy any more of my tanks, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그만! 내 탱크를 더 이상 파괴하지 말게, 장군."
ZH: "\n夠了！別再摧毀我任何一輛坦克車，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank047Subtitle
US: "*Stop targeting my infantry, you coward!"
DE: "*Stop targeting my infantry, you coward!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 보병을 그만 죽이게, 겁쟁이 같으니!"
ZH: "\n停止瞄準我的步兵，您這個膽小鬼！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank048Subtitle
US: "*General, I need that Oil Derrick for my tanks. Release it to me or pay"
DE: "*General, I need that Oil Derrick for my tanks. Release it to me or pay"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 내 탱크 부대는 그 원유 유정탑이 필요하네. 어서 포기하거나 사용료를 내시오."
ZH: "\n將軍，我的坦克需要油井。立刻把它讓出，否則您將為此付出代價。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank049Subtitle
US: "*That Artillery Platform is no match for my armor, General"
DE: "*That Artillery Platform is no match for my armor, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 캐논 플랫폼은 내 병력 앞엔 소용없네, 장군."
ZH: "\n砲兵陣地不是我裝甲坦克的對手，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank050Subtitle
US: "*Ah, I see you captured an Oil Refinery. Perhaps I should take it from you"
DE: "*Ah, I see you captured an Oil Refinery. Perhaps I should take it from you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "정유 공장을 점령했군. 아무래도 내가 탈환해야겠는데."
ZH: "\n哎呀，我發現您已經佔領一座煉油廠。或許我應該從您那邊搶過來。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank051Subtitle
US: "*We are approaching you base, General. Prepare yourself"
DE: "*We are approaching you base, General. Prepare yourself"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 기지에 접근 중이네, 장군. 준비하게."
ZH: "\n我們正慢慢接近您的基地，將軍。您自己得做好準備。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank052Subtitle
US: "*Ah, my tanks are almost in range of your base. This should be over soon"
DE: "*Ah, my tanks are almost in range of your base. This should be over soon"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아, 내 탱크 부대는 거의 당신 기지를 사거리에 두고 있네. 곧 끝날 걸세."
ZH: "\n哎呀，我的坦克快進入您的基地範圍內。應該很快就能摧毀它。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank053Subtitle
US: "*We've breached your defenses, General. Now your factories will begin to fall"
DE: "*We've breached your defenses, General. Now your factories will begin to fall"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 방어선을 돌파했네, 장군. 이제 당신 공장들을 잿더미로 만들 걸세."
ZH: "\n我已經破壞您的防禦單位，將軍。現在您的工廠將開始倒塌。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank054Subtitle
US: "*Thank you for inviting us into your base, General"
DE: "*Thank you for inviting us into your base, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기지에 초대해줘서 고맙네, 장군."
ZH: "\n感謝您邀請我們進入您的基地，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank055Subtitle
US: "*I see your flank is exposed, General. I expected as much"
DE: "*I see your flank is exposed, General. I expected as much"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "측면이 노출됐군, 장군. 그럴 줄 알았네."
ZH: "\n我看到您的側翼毫無屏障，將軍。就跟我期望的一樣。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank056Subtitle
US: "*There are no guards at your backdoor--a fatal mistake on your part, General"
DE: "*There are no guards at your backdoor--a fatal mistake on your part, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "후방에는 방어 병력이 없군. 치명적인 실수네, 장군."
ZH: "\n您的後門沒有任何哨兵，這是您犯下的致命錯誤，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank057Subtitle
US: "*I see you've built a second base, General. It will soon be removed"
DE: "*I see you've built a second base, General. It will soon be removed"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "두번째 기지를 구축했군, 장군. 곧 사라질 걸세."
ZH: "\n我發現您已經建好第二座基地，將軍。它很快就會被拆掉。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank058Subtitle
US: "*Ah, I've found your Tech Building. Now, should I destroy it or capture it?"
DE: "*Ah, I've found your Tech Building. Now, should I destroy it or capture it?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아, 테크 빌딩을 찾았네. 자, 이걸 파괴할까, 아니면 점령할까?"
ZH: "\n哎呀，我已經找到您的科技建築。現在，我應該摧毀還是佔領它呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank059Subtitle
US: "*Your power is down--your forces are finished"
DE: "*Your power is down--your forces are finished"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전력이 나갔군. 곧 당신 병력도 끝장날 것이오."
ZH: "\n您的電力正在減少，這表示您的軍隊即將完蛋。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank060Subtitle
US: "*I would suggest restoring your power, Generalbefore we turn it off permanently"
DE: "*I would suggest restoring your power, Generalbefore we turn it off permanently"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전력을 되찾는 게 좋지 않을까, 장군. 아니면 우리가 완전히 전력이 필요없게 만들어주지."
ZH: "\n在我們永遠毀掉它之前，我建議您多儲存一些電力，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank061Subtitle
US: "*Your supply pile looks lownow nothing can stop us"
DE: "*Your supply pile looks lownow nothing can stop us"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "서플라이 더미가 많이 없어졌군. 이젠 우릴 막을 수 없네."
ZH: "\n您的補給堆看來正在減少，現在已經沒有任何事物可以阻擋我們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank062Subtitle
US: "*Supplies! I need more supplies!"
DE: "*Supplies! I need more supplies!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "서플라이! 서플라이가 필요해!"
ZH: "\n補給品！我需要更多補給品！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank063Subtitle
US: "*And what you plan to do with that Scud Storm, General?"
DE: "*And what you plan to do with that Scud Storm, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 폭풍으로 무슨 짓을 벌일 생각이지, 장군?"
ZH: "\n現在您打算如何對付生化死雨風暴呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank064Subtitle
US: "*And now this war has gone nuclearexcellent"
DE: "*And now this war has gone nuclearexcellent"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 이 전쟁이 핵전쟁이 되었군, 훌륭해."
ZH: "\n現在這場戰爭已經變成大型核子戰爭。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank065Subtitle
US: "*That Particle Cannon will never live to fire on me"
DE: "*That Particle Cannon will never live to fire on me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 파티클 캐논은 절대로 쏠 수 없을 것이네."
ZH: "\n那座離子砲將永遠活不到向我發射的時候。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank066Subtitle
US: "*So many base defenses, Generalall so useless"
DE: "*So many base defenses, Generalall so useless"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "방어 건물이 너무 많군. 하지만 아무 소용없네, 장군."
ZH: "\n有這麼多的基地防禦單位，將軍。不過，這些都是沒有用的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank067Subtitle
US: "*So, you're trying to match my tanks in the field. I question your tactics, General"
DE: "*So, you're trying to match my tanks in the field. I question your tactics, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 탱크 부대와 맞서려고 하는군, 장군. 무의미한 전술이네."
ZH: "\n這樣看來，您準備要對付我在戰場上的坦克。我對您的戰術感到懷疑，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank068Subtitle
US: "*I see many planes, General--like gnats waiting to be swatted out of the sky"
DE: "*I see many planes, General--like gnats waiting to be swatted out of the sky"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행기가 많군. 마치 곧 죽어나갈 하루살이떼 같아."
ZH: "\n我看到許多飛機，將軍。就像小蟲子一樣在空中，等著被我拍打。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank069Subtitle
US: "*You have trained too many men, General; they will all be crushed beneath my treads"
DE: "*You have trained too many men, General; they will all be crushed beneath my treads"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "너무 많은 보병들을 훈련시켰네, 장군. 곧 탱크로 짓밟아주겠네."
ZH: "\n您已經訓練太多人員了，將軍；他們將全部都被我踐踏在腳下。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank070Subtitle
US: "*Your base has grown too large, General--my tanks will enjoy the target practice"
DE: "*Your base has grown too large, General--my tanks will enjoy the target practice"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 기지는 너무 확장했네, 장군. 곧 내 탱크 부대가 연습 훈련에 나갈 걸세."
ZH: "\n您的基地已擴展地太過龐大，將軍。我的坦克將會好好享受這場瞄準目標的練習。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank071Subtitle
US: "*Your Scud Storm will harm us, but now you have made me angry, General"
DE: "*Your Scud Storm will harm us, but now you have made me angry, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "스커드 폭풍은 약간의 피해 밖에 못 줬지만, 나를 아주 화나게 만들었네, 장군."
ZH: "\n雖然您的生化死雨風暴將傷害我們，但是現在您已經惹火我了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank072Subtitle
US: "*Only a failed General would resort to nuclear missiles"
DE: "*Only a failed General would resort to nuclear missiles"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "덜떨어진 장군만 핵 미사일을 사용하는 법이지."
ZH: "\n只有失敗的將軍才會依賴核子飛彈。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank073Subtitle
US: "*This particle beam will not defeat us, General"
DE: "*This particle beam will not defeat us, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이 파티클 빔은 우릴 제압할 수 없네, 장군."
ZH: "\n這個粒子光束無法擊敗我們，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank074Subtitle
US: "*Yes, garrison your buildings--you only delay the inevitable"
DE: "*Yes, garrison your buildings--you only delay the inevitable"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 건물들에 병력을 배치해봐. 그럼 패배의 시간을 지연시키겠지."
ZH: "\n是的，派兵駐防您的建築物。您只是拖延時間而已，無法阻止悲劇發生。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank075Subtitle
US: "*No one soldier can turn the tide, not even Colonel Burton"
DE: "*No one soldier can turn the tide, not even Colonel Burton"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아무리 버튼 대령이라도 단 한명의 병사로 전세를 바꿀 수는 없을텐데."
ZH: "\n沒有任何士兵能夠扭轉局勢，即使是貝頓上校。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank076Subtitle
US: "*Ah, Black Lotus, you grace us with your presence. Perhaps you would consider fighting for me"
DE: "*Ah, Black Lotus, you grace us with your presense. Perhaps you would consider fighting for me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아, 흑수선, 자넬 볼 수 있어 영광이네. 우리편에서 싸우지 않겠나?"
ZH: "\n哎呀，黑蓮花，您的出現讓我們增光不少。或許您應該考慮替我作戰。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank077Subtitle
US: "*All tanks beware: Jarmen Kell has entered the field"
DE: "*All tanks beware: Jarmen Kell has entered the field"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "모든 탱크는 주의하라. 쟈멘 켈이 전장에 나타났다."
ZH: "\n所有坦克注意：賈曼凱爾已經進入戰場。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank078Subtitle
US: "*An Air Field is a wise choice against me, but it won't save you from defeat, General"
DE: "*An Air Field is a wise choice against me, but it won't save you from defeat, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행장은 괜찮은 선택이었지만 패배를 막을 수는 없네, 장군."
ZH: "\n如果想對抗我，一座機場是聰明的選擇，但是這樣無法讓您避免失敗，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank079Subtitle
US: "*Build your War Factories, General; they still will not produce tanks capable of stopping mine"
DE: "*Build your War Factories, General; they still will not produce tanks capable of stopping mine"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "군수공장을 건설하게, 장군. 내 병력을 막을 만한 탱크들을 생산할 수 없을 걸세."
ZH: "\n建造您的戰車工廠，將軍；但這些工廠仍然無法製造出能夠阻止我的坦克。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank080Subtitle
US: "*I see you've built a Barracks, General. Please, try to keep your men out from under my tanks"
DE: "*I see you've built a Barracks, General. Please, try to keep your men out from under my tanks"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "막사를 구축했군, 장군. 제발 내 탱크에 깔리는 참사가 없으면 좋겠네."
ZH: "\n我發現您已經造好一座兵營，將軍。請吧！試試看能否讓您的人員躲開我的坦克攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank081Subtitle
US: "*Yes, sell all of your buildings and flee from the field, General. This battle is lost to you"
DE: "*Yes, sell all of your buildings and flee from the field, General. This battle is lost to you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 모든 건물을 팔고 전장에서 도망가게, 장군. 이 전투는 당신의 패배라네."
ZH: "\n是的，出售您所有的建築物，逃離戰場吧，將軍。這場戰爭您輸定了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank082Subtitle
US: "*You are losing, General. This battle is mine"
DE: "*You are losing, General. This battle is mine"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신이 지고 있네, 장군. 이 전투는 나의 승리군."
ZH: "\n您輸定了，將軍。這場戰爭，勝利是屬於我的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank083Subtitle
US: "*All hope is gone now, General. Surrender or die"
DE: "*All hope is gone now, General. Surrender or die"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "모든 희망이 사라졌네, 장군. 항복하거나 아니면 죽게."
ZH: "\n現在一切希望都落空了，將軍。選擇投降吧，不然只有死路一條。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank084Subtitle
US: "*General, my forces outnumber yoursit is only a matter to time now"
DE: "*General, my forces outnumber yoursit is only a matter to time now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 내 병력이 우세하네. 승리는 시간의 문제일세."
ZH: "\n將軍，我的軍隊人數遠剩過您的。輸贏只是時間早晚的問題。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank085Subtitle
US: "*Your inferior strategy has lead you to this place, General. You can't win now"
DE: "*Your inferior strategy has lead you to this place, General. You can't win now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 하등한 전략이 자네를 이 상황으로 몰았네, 장군. 당신은 나를 이길 수 없어."
ZH: "\n因為您拙劣的戰略，所以才落到這個地步，將軍。現在您絕對無法獲勝。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank086Subtitle
US: "*My victory was assured from the beginning"
DE: "*My victory was assured from the beginning"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 승리는 처음부터 확실했네."
ZH: "\n從一開始，我的勝利就是必然的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank087Subtitle
US: "*Your tactics have given you a momentary advantage,General, but you won't maintain it"
DE: "*Your tacitcs have given you a momentary advantage,General, but you won't maintain it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 전술로 전황이 당신에게 잠시 유리해졌지만 곧 바뀔 걸세."
ZH: "\n您的戰術讓您暫時握有優勢，將軍。但是這將不會持續太久。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank088Subtitle
US: "*No! You will not win, General. We will build more tanks and defeat you"
DE: "*No! You will not win, General. We will build more tanks and defeat you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "안돼! 당신은 이길 수 없어, 장군. 우리는 탱크를 더 많이 생산하여 당신을 이길 것이오."
ZH: "\n不！您絕對不會獲勝，將軍。我們將建造更多坦克打敗您。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank089Subtitle
US: "*Your cowardly tactics may have gotten you this far, but this foolishness ends now"
DE: "*Your cowardly tactics may have gotten you this far, but this foolishness ends now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 겁장이 전술이 여기까지 당신을 지켜줬지만 더 이상 이런 운이 통해서는 안되지."
ZH: "\n您卑微的戰術居然讓您支持了這麼久，不過，現在這愚蠢的伎倆可以結束了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank090Subtitle
US: "*I think I've let you win long enough, General. Prepare for the end"
DE: "*I think I've let you win long enough, General. Prepare for the end"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아무래도 너무 많이 져준 것 같군. 이제 질 준비를 하시지."
ZH: "\n我想我已經讓您贏得夠多了，將軍。準備下台一鞠躬吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank091Subtitle
US: "*Arrrrrgh! This cannot be! How have you defeated my tanks?!"
DE: "*Arrrrrgh! This cannot be! How have you defeated my tanks?!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아아악! 말도 안돼! 어떻게 내 탱크들을 파괴했지?"
ZH: "\n啊！這怎麼可能！您竟然打敗我的坦克車？！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank092Subtitle
US: "*Time to unleash the war machine"
DE: "*Time to unleash the war machine"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전쟁 기계들을 풀 시간이군."
ZH: "\n解放戰爭機器的時候到了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank093Subtitle
US: "*Your tank rush is nothing compared to mine"
DE: "*Your tank rush is nothing compared to mine"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 탱크 공격은 내 탱크들에 비해 별 볼일 없었네."
ZH: "\n您的坦克快攻比不上我的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank094Subtitle
US: "*Don't challenge my tanks, General--you will lose"
DE: "*Don't challenge my tanks, General--you will lose"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지기 싫다면 내 탱크 부대와 맞서려고 하지 말게, 장군."
ZH: "\n千萬別挑戰我的坦克，將軍。您絕對會輸！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank095Subtitle
US: "*My armor will crush your pathetic forces"
DE: "*My armor will crush your pathetic forces"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기갑부대는 당신의 하찮은 부대를 뭉개버릴 걸세."
ZH: "\n我的裝甲坦克將會碾碎您可憐的軍隊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank096Subtitle
US: "*You may have defeated my tanks, General, but the Tigress will crush you like an insect"
DE: "*You may have defeated my tanks, General, but the Tigress will crush you like an insect"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신은 내 탱크 부대를 제압했겠지만 곧 만나게 될 암호랑이는 당신을 벌레처럼 짓밟아버릴 것이오."
ZH: "\n您已經打敗我的坦克，將軍。但是雌虎會像對付一隻昆蟲般把您碾碎。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank097Subtitle
US: "*Tanks are the key to any victory, as you well know"
DE: "*Tanks are the key to any victoryas you well know"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "탱크는 아시다시피 모든 승리의 열쇠이지."
ZH: "\n坦克車是任何勝利的關鍵，我相信您很明白這點。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank098Subtitle
US: "*I see you defeated my scouts, General. The next attack won't go so well for you, I think"
DE: "*I see you defeated my scouts, General. The next attack won't go so well for you, I think"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 정찰병들을 처리했군, 장군. 다음 공격은 당신 생각만큼 쉽지 않을 거요."
ZH: "\n我知道您已經打敗我的偵察兵，將軍。我想下一波攻擊將不會讓您這麼好過。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank099Subtitle
US: "*Here we come, General, I hope your defenses are up"
DE: "*Here we come, General, I hope your defenses are up"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "준비하게, 장군. 방어선을 제대로 구축했길 비네."
ZH: "\n我們到了，將軍。我希望您的防禦單位已經待命。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank100Subtitle
US: "*And these are just my Battlemasters, Generaljust wait until the Overlord join the battle"
DE: "*And these are just my Battlemasters, Generaljust wait until the Overlord join the battle"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이건 내 배틀마스터 부대일 뿐이네, 장군. 오버로드 부대가 올 때까지 쓰러지면 안되네."
ZH: "\n而這些只不過是我的戰神坦克而已，將軍。等著看我的炎黃坦克加入戰局吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Tank101Subtitle
US: "*I'd be careful, General, sometimes the Red Guard like to take over buildings while you're busy with my tanks"
DE: "*I'd be careful, General, sometimes the Red Guard like to take over buildings while you're busy with my tanks"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "조심하게, 장군. 당신이 내 탱크를 상대하는 동안 내가 홍위병으로 건물들을 점령할 걸세."
ZH: "\n我會小心的，將軍。有時當您忙著對付我的坦克車時，紅衛兵總喜歡趁機佔領您的建築物。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin001Subtitle
US: "*I see you!"
DE: "*I see you!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "보이는군!"
ZH: "\n我看到您！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin002Subtitle
US: "*One taste, and you'll never go back -- even if you wanted to!"
DE: "*One taste, and you'll never go back -- even if you wanted to!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "한번만 맛보면 절대로 잊을 수 없을 거야. 잊고 싶어도!"
ZH: "\n試一次，您就永遠回不來了。即使您想要回來！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin003Subtitle
US: "*Have a taste of my own medicine!"
DE: "*Have a taste of my own medicine!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 만든 쓴 약을 한번 마셔봐!"
ZH: "\n想試試看我自製的藥物嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin004Subtitle
US: "*How long can you hold your breath?"
DE: "*How long can you hold your breath?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "언제까지 숨을 참고 있을 거지?"
ZH: "\n您能停止呼吸多久？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin005Subtitle
US: "*Ready for another chemistry lesson?"
DE: "*Ready for another chemistry lesson?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "화학 수업 받을 준비됐나?"
ZH: "\n準備好上另一門化學課了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin006Subtitle
US: "*It's not so bad. You should only feel a long and painful burning after this!"
DE: "*It's not so bad. You should only feel a long and painful burning after this!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그렇게 나쁘지 않아. 전투가 끝나면 끔찍한 고통만 남을 뿐이야."
ZH: "\n這還不錯。試過之後，您應該只會感覺到漫長而痛苦的灼燒感。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin007Subtitle
US: "*Toxin troopers, attack!"
DE: "*Toxin troopers, attack!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "독소 부대, 공격!"
ZH: "\n生化兵，攻擊！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin008Subtitle
US: "*Here we come, General, like a chemical spill"
DE: "*Here we come, General, like a chemical spill"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리가 왔다. 화학 물질 유출이다!"
ZH: "\n我們到了，將軍，就像化學品溢漏般蜂擁而至。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin009Subtitle
US: "*It's so hard to find a doctor that makes housecalls, but Dr. Thrax does"
DE: "*It's so hard to find a doctor that makes housecalls, but Dr. Thrax does"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "왕진을 하는 의사는 더 이상 찾기 어렵지만 스랙스 박사는 다르지."
ZH: "\n找一位可以直接進行解毒的醫生十分困難，但崔克斯博士辦到了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin010Subtitle
US: "*Spill on isle one!"
DE: "*Spill on isle one!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "뿌려대!"
ZH: "\n散落在小島上！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin011Subtitle
US: "*Like acid rain, we decend upon your base, General"
DE: "*Like acid rain, we decend upon your base, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우린 산성비처럼 당신 기지에 내릴 거야, 장군."
ZH: "\n就像酸雨般，我們降落在您的基地上，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin012Subtitle
US: "*Go forth, my toxic warriors! Bring our message to the masses!"
DE: "*Go forth, my toxic warriors! Bring our message to the masses!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전진, 내 독소 전사들이여! 적들에게 우리의 메시지를 알리자!"
ZH: "\n前進吧！我的生化戰士！將我們的訊息傳給大眾！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin013Subtitle
US: "*Oh, you're going to like this, General. No, waitno you won't"
DE: "*Oh, you're going to like this, General. No, waitno you won't"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오, 이건 자네 마음에 꼭 들거요, 장군.. 아니, 안 좋아하겠군."
ZH: "\n喔！您準備像這樣子嗎，將軍？不，等等，您將不會得逞！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin014Subtitle
US: "*You've brought this on yourself, General. Now watch your men pay for your mistake"
DE: "*You've brought this on yourself, General. Now watch your men pay for your mistake"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이건 당신이 자초한 거네, 장군. 당신 병사들이 당신의 실수로 죽어가는 모습을 봐.."
ZH: "\n您是自找的，將軍。現在親自看著您的部下為您的錯誤付出代價吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin015Subtitle
US: "*Silent but deadly"
DE: "*Silent but deadly"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "조용하지만... 치명적이지…"
ZH: "\n沈默卻致命"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin016Subtitle
US: "*That's right -- sit back and relax! Give my toxins more time to work!"
DE: "*That's right -- sit back and relax! Give my toxins more time to work!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "맞네... 편안히 앉아 긴장을 풀게! 독소가 몸 구석구석 돌 수 있는 시간을 주게!"
ZH: "\n這就對了。好好休息，放輕鬆！讓我的生化兵有更多時間可以工作！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin017Subtitle
US: "*The suspense it's killing you!"
DE: "*The suspense it's killing you!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "긴장감.. 아주 죽겠지?"
ZH: "\n這個暫停將會讓您毀滅！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin018Subtitle
US: "*Time to brew another batch!"
DE: "*Time to brew another batch!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "또 한 통 더 만들어야 겠군."
ZH: "\n是製造另一批的時候了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin019Subtitle
US: "*Every moment you delay, you die a little bit more!"
DE: "*Every moment you delay, you die a little bit more!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신이 시간을 끄는 동안 조금씩 죽어가는 거야!"
ZH: "\n當您多拖延一次，就表示您又朝死亡更近些。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin020Subtitle
US: "*You can tell they're just right when the flesh falls off the bone!"
DE: "*You can tell they're just right when the flesh falls off the bone!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "살이 뼈에서 떨어져나간다는 말이 사실 맞지?"
ZH: "\n當血肉與骨頭分離時，您能夠斷定它們確實是對的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin021Subtitle
US: "*Anthrax it does a body bad"
DE: "*Anthrax it does a body bad"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "탄저병... 정말 몸에 나쁘지."
ZH: "\n炭疽菌會讓身體變差。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin022Subtitle
US: "*Smell that? No?"
DE: "*Smell that? No?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "냄새 나? 아직 안 나?"
ZH: "\n聞到了嗎？還沒嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin023Subtitle
US: "*And breathe in out and again feel better?"
DE: "*And breathe in out and again feel better?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "숨을 들이마시고... 다시 내뱉고... 좀 나아졌나?"
ZH: "\n再吸氣、吐氣一次，感覺好多了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin024Subtitle
US: "*Good to the last drop!"
DE: "*Good to the last drop!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "마지막 한 방울까지 훌륭하군!"
ZH: "\n滴滴香濃，意猶未盡！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin025Subtitle
US: "*I'll give you a \"breather\" before our next attack"
DE: "*I'll give you a \"breather\" before our next attack"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "다음 공격 때까지 '숨좀 쉬게' 해주지.. 클클클"
ZH: "\n在我們下次進攻之前，我將會給您一個 \"休息時間\"。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin026Subtitle
US: "*We have a clogged toxin nozzle, Generalgive me a second to fix it"
DE: "*We have a clogged toxin nozzle, Generalgive me a second to fix it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "독소 노즐이 막혔다, 장군. 잠깐만 시간을 줘봐."
ZH: "\n我們的毒物噴嘴被堵住，將軍，給我另外一個，才能拿去送修。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin027Subtitle
US: "*You'll come for the toxin, but you'll staybecause you're dead!"
DE: "*You'll come for the toxin, but you'll staybecause you're dead!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "독소를 제거하러 왔겠지만, 다시 돌아가진 못할 걸세. 죽어있을 테니깐!"
ZH: "\n雖然您是為了毒素而來，但是您也會因此而留下，因為屆時您已經死了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin028Subtitle
US: "*You will regret intruding on my experiments, General"
DE: "*You will regret intruding on my experiments, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 실험을 방해하다니, 후회할 거야."
ZH: "\n您將會後悔打斷我的實驗，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin029Subtitle
US: "*Are you going to attack me, or are you afraid of what you might find at my base, General?"
DE: "*Are you going to attack me, or are you afraid of what you might find at my base, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "날 공격할 건가, 아니면 내 기지에서 찾아낼 것 때문에 두려운가?"
ZH: "\n您準備攻擊我嗎，還是您根本就害怕在我的基地可能找出的東西呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin030Subtitle
US: "*Nothing can live beneath my toxic cloud, General"
DE: "*Nothing can live beneath my toxic cloud, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 독소 구름 속에선 아무 것도 살아남을 수 없어, 장군."
ZH: "\n沒有任何事物可以在我的毒素雲下倖存，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin031Subtitle
US: "*You didn't really need that anyway"
DE: "*You didn't really need that anyway"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "별 필요 없어 보이길래 부쉈지."
ZH: "\n反正您並不是真正需要那個。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin032Subtitle
US: "*Your troops appear intoxicated, General!"
DE: "*Your troops appear intoxicated, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "네 병력은 중독됐다, 장군!"
ZH: "\n您的部隊看來中毒了，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin033Subtitle
US: "*Ohh general, looks like your troops can't hold their toxin"
DE: "*Ohh general, looks like your troops can't hold their toxin"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오오, 장군, 당신 병력이 독소를 견딜 수 없어 하는데?"
ZH: "\n喔，將軍！看來您的軍隊無法抵擋他們的毒素。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin034Subtitle
US: "*Your Air Field is destroyed, General. Now you'll have to walk through my clouds of death"
DE: "*Your Air Field is destroyed, General. Now you'll have to walk through my clouds of death"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행장이 파괴됐군. 이제 내 독소 구름 안으로 걸어 들어와야 겠어."
ZH: "\n您的機場被摧毀了，將軍，現在您將必須步行通過我的死亡之霧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin035Subtitle
US: "*Notice how the toxins tear everything apart?"
DE: "*Notice how the toxins tear everything apart?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "독소가 모든걸 산산조각 내는 것이 보이나?"
ZH: "\n注意看毒素是如何將所有東西撕裂。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin036Subtitle
US: "*Argh! I had my wine collection in there!"
DE: "*Argh! I had my wine collection in there!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이런! 거긴 내 술창고였는데!"
ZH: "\n啊！我把收藏的酒放在那裡！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin037Subtitle
US: "*My toxins and your troops certainly have chemistry!"
DE: "*My toxins and your troops certainly have chemistry!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 독소가 그대 병사들과 잘 어울리는 것 같군!"
ZH: "\n我的毒素和您的部隊絕對會產生化學作用。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin038Subtitle
US: "*I didn't need that anyway!"
DE: "*I didn't need that anyway!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그건 필요도 없는 건물이였어!"
ZH: "\n反正我不需要這個。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin039Subtitle
US: "*Now where will my chemical soldiers come from?"
DE: "*Now where will my chemical soldiers come from?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 내 화학 전사들은 어디서 만들란 말인가?"
ZH: "\n現在我的化學兵會從哪裡出現呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin040Subtitle
US: "*My toxin trucks will roll again!"
DE: "*My toxin trucks will roll again!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 독소 트럭은 다시 부활하리라!"
ZH: "\n我的毒素運送車將會再度啟動！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin041Subtitle
US: "*See, people don't belong in the air"
DE: "*See, people don't belong in the air"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "괜찮아, 원래 난 고소 공포증이 있었어."
ZH: "\n看吧，人們不適合住在空中。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin042Subtitle
US: "*You inconvenience me, General!"
DE: "*You inconvenience me, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "민폐가 심한거 아니야, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您造成我的不便，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin043Subtitle
US: "*Stop destroying my buildings, General, or I will make thingsunpleasant for you"
DE: "*Stop destroying my buildings, General, or I will make thingsunpleasant for you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 그만하지 장군. 내가 진짜 열받는 걸 보고 싶나?"
ZH: "\n停止摧毀我的建築物，將軍。否則我也會作些讓您不快的舉動。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin044Subtitle
US: "*You've destroyed my Command Center! Ah well, I always hated my commanders anywaynow it's just you and me, General"
DE: "*You've destroyed my Command Center! Ah well, I always hated my commanders anywaynow it's just you and me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n내 커맨드 센터를 파괴했군! 흠, 내 말 안듣는 사령관놈들을 싫어하긴 했지.\n이제 당신과 나 단 둘이서 붙는 거야!"
ZH: "\n您已經摧毀我的指揮中心！哎呀，我會永遠憎恨我的指揮官。總之，現在只剩下您跟我之間的恩怨而已，\n將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin045Subtitle
US: "*General, if you keep destroying my vehicles, how can I bring you your medicine?"
DE: "*General, if you keep destroying my vehicles, how can I bring you your medicine?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 자꾸 내 차량들을 파괴하면, 나보고 걸어서 약을 뿌리고 다니란 말인가?"
ZH: "\n將軍，假如您繼續摧毀我的載具，我如何把藥送給您呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin046Subtitle
US: "*My brave warriors! How can you do this to them? What did they ever do to-- oh wait, never mind"
DE: "*My brave warriors! How can you do this to them? What did they ever do to-- oh wait, never mind"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n내 용감한 전사들! 그들에게 도대체 무슨 짓을 한 거야! 도대체 무슨 죄를 저질렀길래!?\n잠깐, 죄는 많이 짓긴 했군."
ZH: "\n我英勇的戰士們！您怎麼能這麼對待他們呢？之前他們作了什麼事得罪您。喔，等等，您就別放在心上\n吧。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin047Subtitle
US: "*Give that Oil Derrick back! Don't you know petroleum is a key ingredient in my toxins?!"
DE: "*Give that Oil Derrick back! Don't you know petroleum is a key ingredient in my toxins?!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 원유 유정탑을 내놔! 독소를 만들려면 꼭 필요한 게 석유란 걸 몰라?"
ZH: "\n把油井還給我！您難道不知道石油是我的毒素主要成分嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin048Subtitle
US: "*That Artillery Platform will not stop me, General"
DE: "*That Artillery Platform will not stop me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "난 캐논 플랫폼 따윈 상관 안해."
ZH: "\n砲兵陣地也無法阻擋我，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin049Subtitle
US: "*General, I need that Refinery to purify my toxins. What could you possibly need it for?"
DE: "*General, I need that Refinery to purify my toxins. What could you possibly need it for?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 난 그 정유 공장이 있어야 독소를 생산할 수 있다네. 자넨 뭣때문에 이 시설이 필요한가?"
ZH: "\n將軍，我需要煉油廠來提煉毒素。而您可能會用煉油廠作什麼用嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin050Subtitle
US: "*Did I give you permission to come in?"
DE: "*Did I give you permission to come in?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 언제 들어오라고 허락했었나?"
ZH: "\n我有同意讓您進入嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin051Subtitle
US: "*What are you doing in here? The recipes are mine!"
DE: "*What are you doing in here? The recipes are mine!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여기서 도대체 뭘하려고? 제조 비법을 훔치러 왔군!"
ZH: "\n您在這裡作什麼？這些製作方法是我的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin052Subtitle
US: "*You are a fool to come into my base, General!"
DE: "*You are a fool to come into my base, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어리석게 내 기지에 들어오다니, 장군!"
ZH: "\n您真是個笨蛋，居然敢闖入我的基地，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin053Subtitle
US: "*You are too close to my precious toxins, General. Now you must die"
DE: "*You are too close to my precious toxins, General. Now you must die"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 소중한 독소에 너무 가까이 왔네, 장군. 없애버리겠어."
ZH: "\n您太靠近我寶貴的毒素了，將軍。現在您必須受死！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin054Subtitle
US: "*Stay away from my scud missiles! I'll give them to you when I'm ready!"
DE: "*Stay away from my scud missiles! I'll give them to you when I'm ready!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 스커드 미사일 가까이 오지마! 때가 되면 그리로 보내줄께!"
ZH: "\n離我的生化飛彈遠一點！準備妥當後，我絕對會好好向您展示！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin055Subtitle
US: "*I don't think you want those supplies, they aren't  ready yet"
DE: "*I don't think you want those supplies, they aren't  ready yet"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 서플라이는 필요 없을텐데. 내용물이 아주 부실하거든."
ZH: "\n我不認為您想要這些補給品，它們尚未做好。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin056Subtitle
US: "*I see you're building another base. Soon it will be abandoned"
DE: "*I see you're building another base. Soon it will be abandoned"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기지를 또 세우고 있군. 곧 쓸모 없게 될거야."
ZH: "\n我發現您正在建造另一座基地，很快地它也會被拋棄。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin057Subtitle
US: "*Get out of my village, General. There's not much left of it, but it is mine!"
DE: "*Get out of my village, General. There's not much left of it, but it is mine!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 마을에서 당장 떠나시오, 장군. 뭐, 남은건 별로 없지만, 내꺼란 말야!"
ZH: "\n滾出我的村莊，將軍。雖然它剩下的東西不多，但它仍是屬於我的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin058Subtitle
US: "*Be careful as you cross that bridge, General--the water below isn't safe for swimming"
DE: "*Becareful as you cross that bridge, General--the water below isn't safe for swimming"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 다리는 조심하는게 좋을거야, 장군… 언제 무너질지 모르니까."
ZH: "\n當您過橋時要小心，將軍。底下的水可不適合游泳喔！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin059Subtitle
US: "*Watch out, General, that bridge might not be safebut then, what is around here?"
DE: "*Watch out, General, that bridge might not be safebut then, what is around here?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 다리는 부실공사로 만들었다지? 살살 움직이셔, 장군."
ZH: "\n小心，將軍！橋可能不是很安全，此外，這裡四周還有什麼呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin060Subtitle
US: "*Do you think you're being clever, sneaking in my backdoor?"
DE: "*Do you think you're being clever, sneaking in my backdoor?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "뒤쪽으로 들어오면 누가 모를 줄 알고?"
ZH: "\n躲在我的後門鬼鬼祟祟，您自以為很聰明嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin061Subtitle
US: "*So, you've made it across the river. Now the battle gets interesting"
DE: "*So, you've made it across the river. Now the battle gets interesting"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "음, 강을 드디어 건너 왔군. 이제야 좀 흥미롭군."
ZH: "\n這樣看來，您已經成功通過這條河。現在戰鬥變得更耐人尋味了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin062Subtitle
US: "*It looks like you're out of power, General. Perhaps I should attack now"
DE: "*It looks like you're out of power, General. Perhaps I should attack now"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전력이 좀 부족한 모양이야, 장군. 슬슬 공격이나 해볼가?"
ZH: "\n看來您的電力已經耗盡，將軍。或許我應該立刻展開攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin063Subtitle
US: "*You're out of power, General. It's time for me to come and play"
DE: "*You're out of power, General. It's time for me to come and play"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전력이 모자라는군, 장군. 한번 붙어보자구!"
ZH: "\n您的能源已經耗盡，將軍。是輪到我大展身手的時候了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin064Subtitle
US: "*Your resource pile has grown small,General. I don't think you have enough left to stop my next attackexcellent"
DE: "*Your resource pile has grown small,General. I don't think you have enough left to stop my next attackexcellent"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자금난에 허덕이나 보네, 장군. 조만간 다가올 내 공격을 막아낼 수 있을까?\n좋아, 아주 좋아!"
ZH: "\n您的補給堆逐漸變小，將軍。我不認為您有足夠的剩餘物資可以阻擋我下一波強烈攻勢。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin065Subtitle
US: "*Budget?! I don't want to hear about the budget!"
DE: "*Budget?! I don't want to hear about the budget!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "예산이 모자란다고?! 예산따윈 알고 싶지 않아!"
ZH: "\n預算？！我不想聽到關於預算的問題。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin066Subtitle
US: "*You dare to build a Scud Storm in my presence! You know, of course, that we are all immune to its toxins, right, General?"
DE: "*You dare to build a Scud Storm in my presence! You know, of course, that we are all immune to its toxins, right, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "감히 내 앞에 스커드 폭풍을 만들어? 우린 모두 독소에 면역인건 알고 있겠지, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您膽敢在我面前建造生化死雨風暴！當然，您一定知道的，我們對它的毒素完全免疫，對嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin067Subtitle
US: "*A Nuke Silo? I would not have expected you to use toxic radiationperhaps we could work together sometime"
DE: "*A Nuke Silo? I would not have expected you to use toxic radiationperhaps we could work together sometime"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵이라? 같은 화생방 업계 분인 줄 몰라봤구료. 언제 사업 얘기좀 해볼까요? 클클.."
ZH: "\n一座核彈發射井？！或許要等到某一天我們能夠並肩合作時，我才會期望您使用這個輻射毒素。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin068Subtitle
US: "*So, a Particle Cannon to counter my toxins, eh? Your technology is no match for my toxins, General"
DE: "*So, a Particle Cannon to counter my toxins, eh? Your technology is no match for my toxins, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n그러니까, 파티클 캐논으로 내 독소에 대적하시겠다? 그 말씀인가?\n당신 기술은 내 독소의 상대가 안돼."
ZH: "\n這樣看來，您準備用一座離子砲對抗我的毒素，是吧？您的技術根本不是我毒素的對手，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin069Subtitle
US: "*So many defenses, General. ALL USELESS!!!"
DE: "*So many defenses, General. ALL USELESS!!!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "수많은 방어 시설을 세웠군, 장군. 다 필요없어!!"
ZH: "\n有這麼多的防禦單位，將軍。但是，這些全部對我無效！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin070Subtitle
US: "*Metal is only a temporary barrier to my toxins!"
DE: "*Metal is only a temporary barrier to my toxins!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "철갑도 독소를 잠시만 막아줄 뿐이야."
ZH: "\n金屬只能暫時擋住我的毒素。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin071Subtitle
US: "*Ah -- coward! Your pilots still need to breathe!"
DE: "*Ah -- coward! Your pilots still need to breathe!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어허, 겁장이 같으니! 파일롯이라고 숨은 안 쉴줄 알았나?"
ZH: "\n哎呀，膽小鬼！您的駕駛員還需要呼吸！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin072Subtitle
US: "*Do you enjoy seeing your men glow in the dark? Build more, then!"
DE: "*Do you enjoy seeing your men glow in the dark? Build more, then!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그대 병사들이 독소에 감염되서 번쩍번쩍 빛나는게 그렇게 보기 좋은가? 그럼 더 만들라고."
ZH: "\n您喜歡看到您的部下在黑暗中發光發熱嗎？那麼就建造更多吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin073Subtitle
US: "*Your base has grown large, Generala perfect target for my Scud Storm"
DE: "*Your base has grown large, Generala perfect target for my Scud Storm"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 기지가 꽤 많이 컸군. 내 스커드 폭풍의 완벽한 타겟이야."
ZH: "\n您的基地面積已逐漸變大，將軍。對我的生化死雨風暴而言是很明顯的瞄準目標。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin074Subtitle
US: "*Yes, fire your Scud Stormvisit your useless toxins upon my base"
DE: "*Yes, fire your Scud Stormvisit your useless toxins upon my base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 스커드 폭풍을 날려보시지. 내 기지는 끄떡도 하지 않을거야."
ZH: "\n是的，發射您的生化死雨風暴到我的基地上，看看您用的毒素對我根本無效。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin075Subtitle
US: "*Your nuclear missile will only mutate us and make us stronger, General"
DE: "*Your nuclear missile will only mutate us and make us stronger, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵 미사일은 우릴 돌연변이로 만들어 더욱 강하게 만들걸, 장군."
ZH: "\n您的核子飛彈只會改造我們，讓我們變得更強壯，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin076Subtitle
US: "*You cannot hope to clear my toxins with that particle beam, General"
DE: "*You cannot hope to clear my toxins with that particle beam, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어찌 내 독소를 파티클 빔 따위로 맞설 생각을 했나, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您別奢望用這個粒子光束將我的毒素清除乾淨，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin077Subtitle
US: "*Yes, garrison that building--I'm sure my Toxin Tractors will love that"
DE: "*Yes, garrison that building--I'm sure my Toxin Tractors will love that"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "음, 그 건물 참 잘 점령했소… 내 독소 트랙터가 좋아할거야."
ZH: "\n是的，派兵駐守那棟建築吧--我相信我的毒素車一定會愛上這個。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin078Subtitle
US: "*If you bring Colonel Burton into this I'll have to release Jarmen Kell"
DE: "*If you bring Colonel Burton into this I'll have to release Jarmen Kell"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "굳이 버튼 대령까지 투입할 생각이라면 우리에게도 쟈멘켈이 있지."
ZH: "\n假如您帶貝頓上校到這裡，我就不得不放出賈曼卡爾。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin079Subtitle
US: "*Black Lotus? You know, of course, that the black lotus is a poisonous flowerI think that's in one of my toxinsbut I digress"
DE: "*Black Lotus? You know, of course, that the black lotus is a poisonous flowerI think that's in one of my toxinsbut I digress"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n흑수선? 흑수선이라면 독이 들어 있는 꽃인데! 아마도 내 독소에 들어간 첨가제일걸.\n아, 얘기가 딴 길로 샜군."
ZH: "\n黑蓮花？當然，您一定知道的，黑蓮花是一種珍貴的花，我認為它也算是毒素成分之一，我想我離題過\n遠了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin080Subtitle
US: "*I see Jarmen Kell has joined our little war. Perhaps mine would enjoy a sniper duel"
DE: "*I see Jarmen Kell has joined our little war. Perhaps mine would enjoy a sniper duel"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우리의 작은 전쟁에 자멘 켈이 참가했군. 서로의 저격술을 시험해 볼까?"
ZH: "\n我發現賈曼卡爾已經加入我們的小型戰爭。或許我的部下會喜歡來場狙擊兵大對決！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin081Subtitle
US: "*Now what do you want with that Air Field, General?"
DE: "*Now what do you want with that Air Field, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "비행장으로 무슨 꿍꿍이를 벌이실려고, 장군?"
ZH: "\n現在您想如何處置那座機場呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin082Subtitle
US: "*So our General builds a War Factory. How predictable of you"
DE: "*So our General builds a War Factory. How predictable of you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오호, 우리 장군께서 군수공장을 세우셨다? 뻔하게 나오시는군."
ZH: "\n這樣看來，我們的將軍會建造一座戰車工廠。您的預測可真準！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin083Subtitle
US: "*Yeeesss, build a Barracks--send you men to me"
DE: "*Yeeesss, build a Barracks--send you men to me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "좋아! 막사를 만들어서 내게 병사들 좀 보내줘."
ZH: "\n是是是...的！建造一座兵營，把您的人員奉送給我！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin084Subtitle
US: "*Sell off allyour buildings, Generaland send your men to me"
DE: "*Sell off allyour buildings, Generaland send your men to me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건물은 모두 팔고, 남은 병사는 내게 제물로 바치시오, 장군."
ZH: "\n廉價出售您所有的建築物，將軍。這等於是把您的人員奉送給我。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin085Subtitle
US: "*Give up now, and I guarantee you'll breathe easy"
DE: "*Give up now, and I guarantee you'll breathe easy"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지금 항복하면 그나마 참혹한 마무리는 보지 않을 거야."
ZH: "\n現在放棄吧，我保證會讓您過得輕鬆點。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin086Subtitle
US: "*Your troops are short of breath, General. Give up!"
DE: "*Your troops are short of breath, General. Give up!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기력이 조금 약해진 것 같은데, 장군? 포기하시지!"
ZH: "\n您的軍隊只剩最後一口氣，將軍，放棄吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin087Subtitle
US: "*My second wind spells your doom, General!"
DE: "*My second wind spells your doom, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 결과는 뻔해, 장군!"
ZH: "\n我的重振旗鼓等於預告了您的死亡，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin088Subtitle
US: "*Let me drown your sorrows with a nice toxin!"
DE: "*Let me drown your sorrows with a nice toxin!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "달콤한 독소로 그대의 슬픔을 달래주리라!"
ZH: "\n讓我用一種好用的毒素替您解憂吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin089Subtitle
US: "*Toxic Fatality"
DE: "*Toxic Fatality"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "중독사."
ZH: "\n中毒而死。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin090Subtitle
US: "*You are defeated, General. Perhaps this will teach you to defy Dr. Thrax"
DE: "*You are defeated, General. Perhaps this will teach you to defy Dr. Thrax"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 졌구만. 다음부턴 섣불리 스랙스 박사에게 덤비지 말라고."
ZH: "\n您將被打敗，將軍。或許這次的失敗可以教您如何抵抗崔克斯博士。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin091Subtitle
US: "*Would you consider a peace offering? An antidote, perhaps?"
DE: "*Would you consider a peace offering? An antidote, perhaps?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 평화 협정을 생각해 보는게 좋지 않을까? 해독제를 제시하지."
ZH: "\n您考慮過送上友好贈品嗎？一個解毒劑，或許可行。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin092Subtitle
US: "*Perhaps I've inhaled too many of my own toxins--You can't possibly be defeating me"
DE: "*Perhaps I've inhaled too many of my own toxins--You can't possibly be defeating me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 독소를 너무 많이 먹었나…당신이 나한테 이길 리가 있다니."
ZH: "\n或許我已吸入太多自己的毒氣，您怎麼可能打敗我！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin093Subtitle
US: "*Get away from me! You will not defeat me, General. Do you hear me!"
DE: "*Get away from me! You will not defeat me, General. Do you hear me!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "가까이 오지마! 절대 날 이기지 못한단 말이야. 절대!"
ZH: "\n離我遠一點！您將不會打敗我，將軍！您聽到我所說的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin094Subtitle
US: "*What do you have against toxins? Have you seen what they put in food these days?"
DE: "*What do you have against toxins? Have you seen what they put in food these days?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "독소가 좀 어때서? 요즘 음식엔 더 심한 것도 넣는단 말이야!"
ZH: "\n您用什麼來對付毒素？您已經看到最近他們在食物裡加進什麼東西了吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin095Subtitle
US: "*Even if you defeat me, my toxins will get to you -- eventually!"
DE: "*Even if you defeat me, my toxins will get to you -- eventually!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 무너져도, 내 독소가 결국엔 복수해 줄 것이다!"
ZH: "\n即使您打敗我，我的毒素最終還是會傳染給您！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin096Subtitle
US: "*No! No. I am defeated. Now where is that cyanide capsule"
DE: "*No! No. I am defeated. Now where is that cyanide capsule"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "안돼! 내가 패배하다니… 청산가리 캡슐이 어디 있지?"
ZH: "\n不！不！我居然被打敗。現在那個含氰逃生艙在哪裡？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin097Subtitle
US: "*That button was covered with poisonyou're already dead"
DE: "*That button was covered with poisonyou're already dead"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "방금 클릭한 버튼에는 독소가 묻었지.. 당신은 이미 끝났어!"
ZH: "\n那個按鈕已經塗上毒藥，您死定了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin098Subtitle
US: "*You dare select Dr. Thrax? You should reconsider, General"
DE: "*You dare select Dr. Thrax? You should reconsider, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "감히 이 스랙스 박사를 선택하다니, 다시 생각해 보시지?"
ZH: "\n您膽敢選擇崔克斯博士？您應該再三思，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin099Subtitle
US: "*You cannot defeat my toxins, General"
DE: "*You cannot defeat my toxins, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 독소를 이길 수 있다고 생각하나?"
ZH: "\n您無法打敗我的毒素，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin100Subtitle
US: "*Perhaps I shouldn't have gotten my degree from a mail-order college"
DE: "*Perhaps I shouldn't have gotten my degree from a mail-order college"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "젠장, 돈 주고 박사학위 사면 진짜 박사가 될 줄 알았는데."
ZH: "\n或許我不該只有從函授學院混到一個學位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin101Subtitle
US: "*You thought my toxins were ineffective and now look what has happened to you, General"
DE: "*You thought my toxins were ineffective and now look what has happened to you, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 독소를 무시하면 어떤 결과가 생기는지 명심해 두시오, 장군."
ZH: "\n您以為我的毒素完全無效，現在看看您發生了什麼事，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin102Subtitle
US: "*Hello, General. Do not think I cannot see your spies flying over my base. Please, look all you wish, because this may be the last time you ever see my stronghold"
DE: "*Hello, General. Do not think I cannot see your spies flying over my base. Please, look all you wish, because this may be the last time you ever see my stronghold"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n반갑네, 장군. 내 기지 위로 날아다니는 저 정찰기에 대해선 다 알고 있지.\n보고 싶은 만큼 보시지, 내 기지를 보는 건 이게 마지막일테니."
ZH: "\n嗨，將軍。別以為我不知道您的間諜在我的基地上空盤旋。請便吧，想看就看個夠，因為這或許是您最\n後一次看到我的要塞。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin103Subtitle
US: "*As you can see, my defenses are impenetrable...and my toxic weapon systems will poison your troops long before they can reach me"
DE: "*As you can see, my defenses are impenetrable...and my toxic weapon systems will poison your troops long before they can reach me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n보시다시피, 나의 방어를 뚫기는 불가능하지.\n내 독소 무기 시스템은 자네 부대가 날 잡으로 오기 훨씬 전에 중독시킬걸."
ZH: "\n正如您所見，我的防禦單位牢固且難以通過。而我的毒素武器系統，在您的軍隊到達我這裡之前，將會\n使您的軍隊中毒。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin104Subtitle
US: "*And do not worry about hurting the civilian population, General; they have long since fled this valley of toxic death. Our little war will play-out uninterruptedand your delicate sensibilities will not be taxed"
DE: "*And do not worry about hurting the civilian population, General; they have long since fled this valley of toxic death. Our little war will play-out uninterruptedand your delicate sensibilities will not be taxed"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n민간인 피해 따위는 걱정하지 않아도 된다네, 장군. 모두 내 소문을 듣고 이미 모두가\n도망갔으니. 이번 전쟁의 희생자는 오직 그대와 그대의 병사일 뿐이오."
ZH: "\n不用擔心傷害平民百姓，將軍；自從逃離有致命毒素的山谷後，他們已經永遠免疫了。我們的小型戰爭\n將不斷上演，讓您的感官能力更加敏銳，而且我不會向您索取費用。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin105Subtitle
US: "*Ah yes, and here is where you've placed your pathetic base. Now make your stand against me--Dr. Thrax--and once your forces have breathed their last breath of my toxic air, I can return to my experiments"
DE: "*Ah yes, and here is where you've placed your pathetic base. Now make your stand against me--Dr. Thrax--and once your forces have breathed their last breath of my toxic air, I can return to my experiments"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n아, 이런 곳에 한심한 기지를 세웠군. 어디 한번 도전해 보시지, 장군.\n나, 스랙스 박사는 한방에 그대의 나약한 병사를 무찌르겠어."
ZH: "\n喔，棒極了！這裡就是您設置您那可憐的基地之處。現在您可以開始和我對抗『崔克斯博士』而且您的\n軍隊曾吸入我的毒氣，早已奄奄一息。我可以繼續作實驗了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin106Subtitle
US: "*Do you trust your senses, General? By engaging me, you have doomed yourself to a long and painful death, for I am Dr. Thrax, and my weapons strike unseen!"
DE: "*Do you trust your senses, General? By engaging me, you have doomed yourself to a long and painful death, for I am Dr. Thrax, and my weapons strike unseen!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n아직도 느끼는 바가 없나, 장군? 나는 스랙스 박사이고, 나에게 도전하는 모든 이들은\n보이지 않는 적에 의해 아주 길고 고통스러운 최후가 기다리지."
ZH: "\n將軍，您相信自己的直覺嗎？與我對戰，您注定要面對漫長與痛苦的死亡，因為我是崔克斯博士，而且\n我的武器攻擊是您看不到的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin107Subtitle
US: "*Breathe easy, General, for I am Dr. Thrax, and with every breath you take, you are on your way to defeat!"
DE: "*Breathe easy, General, for I am Dr. Thrax, and with every breath you take, you are on your way to defeat!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n나는 스랙스 박사라는 사람이오, 장군. 당신이 숨을 한번 두 번 쉴 때마다 점점 더 패배로\n가고 있다는 사실을 알아두시지."
ZH: "\n放輕鬆，深呼吸，將軍，因為我就是崔克斯博士。而您每一次的呼吸，都代表您朝死亡更邁進一步。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin108Subtitle
US: "*The first sample is free!"
DE: "*The first sample is free!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "첫공격은 맛보기일 뿐!"
ZH: "\n第一次的示範是免費的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin109Subtitle
US: "*Would you like the green or the blue? Both are equally satisfying!"
DE: "*Would you like the green or the blue? Both are equally satisfying!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "초록색으로 줄까? 파란색으로 줄까? 둘다 모두 화끈하지!"
ZH: "\n您想要綠色或藍色的？兩種都一樣令人滿意！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin110Subtitle
US: "*Prepare to tell your 3-eyed grandchildren of your defeat this day!"
DE: "*Prepare to tell your 3-eyed grandchildren of your defeat this day!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "자네 손자는 눈 셋 달린 돌연변이가 되서 나올걸세! 오늘 당한 얘길 해주게나!"
ZH: "\n做好心理準備吧！未來您會跟您的三眼兒孫講述今日的慘敗吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin111Subtitle
US: "*My precious chemicals! Do you know how long it takes to mix those?"
DE: "*My precious chemicals! Do you know how long it takes to mix those?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 소중한 기지! 이걸 만들려고 얼마나 힘들었는지 자네가 알아?"
ZH: "\n我寶貴的化學藥品！您知道我花了多少時間來調配嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin112Subtitle
US: "*More victi- ah- volunteers for my experiments!"
DE: "*More victi- ah- volunteers for my experiments!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 인체실험에 필요한 희생자, 아니 지원자를 더 확보했군!"
ZH: "\n更多犧牲者，喔，不，應該說是自願者，加入我的實驗！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin113Subtitle
US: "*Now I have more vehicles to ferry my toxins! So generous of you!"
DE: "*Now I have more vehicles to ferry my toxins! So generous of you!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 독소를 운반할 차량을 더 만들 수 있겠군! 고맙기도 하여라!"
ZH: "\n現在我有更多載具可空運毒素！您對我真慷慨！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin114Subtitle
US: "*Oh, did I forget to tell you about those? Watch the mines, General!"
DE: "*Oh, did I forget to tell you about those? Watch the mines, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이런, 미리 얘기하지 않았나, 장군? 내 지뢰들 조심하세요!"
ZH: "\n喔，我忘了告訴您這件事嗎？瞧我這記性，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin115Subtitle
US: "*Now where did I put those chemical troops?"
DE: "*Now where did I put those chemical troops?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "흠, 내 화생방 부대는 어디로 갔지?"
ZH: "\n現在我該派化學部隊前往哪裡呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin117Subtitle
US: "*Bah! You!"
DE: "*Bah! You!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "흥, 당신이군!"
ZH: "\n你！我呸！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Toxin118Subtitle
US: "*Ah yes, and here is where you've placed your pathetic base"
DE: "*Ah yes, and here is where you've placed your pathetic base"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아이고, 이런 곳에 그대의 비실비실한 기지를 숨겨놨군."
ZH: "\n喔，太棒了，這裡就是您設置您那可憐的基地之處。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle001Subtitle
US: "*Oh, you're still here, General. I'm impressed by your determination. Let's dance"
DE: "*Oh, you're still here, General. I'm impressed by your determination. Let's dance"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아직도 살아있소, 장군? 어차피 패배한 전투, 왠만하면 포기하시지. 자, 갑니다!"
ZH: "\n喔，您還在這裡阿，將軍。我對您的決心印象深刻。讓我們共舞吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle002Subtitle
US: "*That didn't hurt too much, did it?"
DE: "*That didn't hurt too much, did it?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이런, 너무 아프진 않았죠, 장군?"
ZH: "\n這不會傷害太重吧，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle003Subtitle
US: "*The battlefield is a rough place, General"
DE: "*The battlefield is a rough place, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전쟁터란 참으로 냉혹한 곳이오, 장군."
ZH: "\n戰場真是個粗暴的地方，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle004Subtitle
US: "*Another perfectly executed strike"
DE: "*Another perfectly executed strike"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "또 하나의 완벽한 일격이다!"
ZH: "\n另一波成功執行的進攻"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle005Subtitle
US: "*It's all going according to plan"
DE: "*It's all going according to plan"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "모든게 나의 계획대로 가고 있군."
ZH: "\n這完全照計畫進行"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle006Subtitle
US: "*Everything seems to be going my way"
DE: "*Everything seems to be going my way"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "아무래도 전세는 내게 기울고 있는 것 같소."
ZH: "\n每件事看來都依照我的計畫進行"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle007Subtitle
US: "*How does that feel, General?"
DE: "*How does that feel, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어때, 좀 쓰라리지 않소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n這種感覺如何呢，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle008Subtitle
US: "*Tactical superiority is key, General. Here, let me show you"
DE: "*Tactical superiority is key, General. Here, let me show you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "우월한 전술이 언제나 승리의 열쇠이지. 이런 식으로 말이오…"
ZH: "\n戰略優勢才是關鍵，將軍。這裡，讓我表演給您看看。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle009Subtitle
US: "*I really don't think you're going to be able to stop this next attackdo you?"
DE: "*I really don't think you're going to be able to stop this next attackdo you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 다음 공격을 막아내지 못할 것 같은데... 틀렸으면 말해보시죠?"
ZH: "\n我確實不認為您將能阻止下一波的攻擊，您真的行嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle010Subtitle
US: "*Here comes another attackoh, and almost all of my Generals Powers are ready to gowhich one do you want to see first?"
DE: "*Here comes another attackoh, and almost all of my Generals Powers are ready to gowhich one do you want to see first?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n나 또 들어갑니다. 아, 그리고 내 제너럴 특수 기술 거의 전부가 준비 완료됐는데,\n어떤 것부터 보여줄까?"
ZH: "\n下一波攻擊即將到來，幾乎我所有的將軍能力都已待命，您想先看到哪一個呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle011Subtitle
US: "*Is that my Superweapon ready to go? Oh no, my attacks just feel like that"
DE: "*Is that my Superweapon ready to go? Oh no, my attacks just feel like that"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이제 내 슈퍼 무기 맛을 보여주겠소. 진짜 슈퍼 무기는 아니고, 그에 맞먹는 공격이란 얘기지."
ZH: "\n我的超級武器準備啟用了嗎？喔，不！我的攻擊正需要這個。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle012Subtitle
US: "*All units: Attack pattern alpha! Just kiddingwho would call something \"alpha\"?"
DE: "*All units: Attack pattern alpha! Just kiddingwho would call something \"alpha\"?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "모든 유닛은 들어라. 알파 공격 형태를 유지하라! 하하, 그냥 농담이였소."
ZH: "\n所有單位注意：攻擊阿爾發型！好好戲弄那些不知叫啥\"阿爾發的玩意"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle013Subtitle
US: "*Here comes some of my units, General. Would you mind helping them gain some veterancy?"
DE: "*Here comes some of my units, General. Would you mind helping them gain some veterancy?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 유닛을 보내고 있소, 장군. 부탁 하나 있는데, 그들이 베테랑이 되도록 힘 좀 써주지 않겠소?"
ZH: "\n我的一些單位即將到來，將軍。您介不介意幫他們擄獲一些老弱殘兵呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle014Subtitle
US: "*I rarely send in the troops, but you deserve special attention, General"
DE: "*I rarely send in the troops, but you deserve special attention, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 왠만하면 내 특수 유닛까진 보내지 않는데, 장군만을 위한 특별한 호의라 생각하시오."
ZH: "\n我很難得才會派遣軍隊，但是您值得我特別注意，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle015Subtitle
US: "*I warn you not to underestimate me"
DE: "*I warn you not to underestimate me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "경고하지만, 날 절대 과소평가하지 마시오."
ZH: "\n我警告您，別低估我。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle016Subtitle
US: "*You may think I'm hiding, but I'm really just planning"
DE: "*You may think I'm hiding, but I'm really just planning"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 숨고 있다고 생각하지 마시오. 사실은 전술을 짜고 있는 중…"
ZH: "\n您可以說我是躲起來，但實際上我正在暗中策劃。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle017Subtitle
US: "*Fools rush in, General. I take my time"
DE: "*Fools rush in, General. I take my time"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어리석은 자가 서두르는 법이오, 장군."
ZH: "\n笨蛋才會橫衝莽撞，將軍！我則是習慣從容不迫。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle018Subtitle
US: "*You don't know what to expect from me, do you?"
DE: "*You don't know what to expect from me, do you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신은 내가 뭘 보여줄지 모르고 있소, 그렇지 않소?"
ZH: "\n您不知道我可能做出什麼令您意想不到的事情吧，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle019Subtitle
US: "*If you fail to plan, you plan to fail, General. Think about it"
DE: "*If you fail to plan, you plan to fail, General. Think about it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "계획하는 데 실패하면 실패만을 계획하게 되지. 무슨 말인지 알아들으셨지?"
ZH: "\n假如您沒有事先做好規劃，您的計畫必然失敗，將軍。好好想想吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle020Subtitle
US: "*My greatest \"super weapon\" is my brainwouldn't you agree, General?"
DE: "*My greatest \"super weapon\" is my brainwouldn't you agree, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나의 가장 위대한 슈퍼 무기는 나의 두뇌지. 동의하지 않소, 장군?"
ZH: "\n我最偉大的\"超級武器\"是我的中樞，您說是嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle021Subtitle
US: "*Come on, General, take your best shot"
DE: "*Come on, General, take your best shot"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 어서 당신의 능력을 보여주세요."
ZH: "\n拜託喔，將軍，秀出您最拿手的射擊本事吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle022Subtitle
US: "*We're waiting for you, General. What's keeping you?"
DE: "*We're waiting for you, General. What's keeping you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "계속 당신이 뭘 보여줄지 기다리고 있는데 왜 이리 오래 걸리는 건가요?"
ZH: "\n我們正在等您，將軍。什麼事情叫您耽擱呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle023Subtitle
US: "*I've been analyzing you tactics and I'm just amazeddo you even have any tactics, General?"
DE: "*I've been analyzing you tactics and I'm just amazeddo you even have any tactics, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 전술을 분석해보고 매우 놀랐소. 무전술이 전술이라니!"
ZH: "\n我分析過您的戰術，真叫我驚訝。您有任何戰術可言嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle024Subtitle
US: "*I'd attack if I were you, General. If you wait then I'll just have one more Superweapon to fire at you"
DE: "*I'd attack if I were you, General. If you wait then I'll just have one more Superweapon to fire at you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n내가 당신이라면 지금 공격할것이오, 장군. 당신이 시간을 끄는 동안 난 당신에게 쓸\n슈퍼 무기를 하나 더 만들것이오."
ZH: "\n假如我是您，我就會進攻，將軍。假如您等待的話，那麼我將命令更多的超級武器向您發射。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle025Subtitle
US: "*So, your over-all strategy is to bore me off the battlefield?"
DE: "*So, your over-all strategy is to bore me off the battlefield?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "너무 전략 짜는데 시간이 오래 걸리니 너무 지루해 죽겠군."
ZH: "\n這樣看來，您所有的戰術不過是為了讓我感到無聊，因而離開戰場。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle026Subtitle
US: "*Are you rethinking the wisdom of attacking me, General?"
DE: "*Are you rethinking the wisdom of attacking me, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "날 공격하는 걸 재고해 보는 중이오, 장군?"
ZH: "\n您正在重新思考攻擊我的策略嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle027Subtitle
US: "*I've been trying to go easy on you, General, but you're starting to annoy me"
DE: "*I've been trying to go easy on you, General, but you're starting to annoy me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "나는 당신을 좀 봐줄려고 했는데, 이제 날 성가시게 하는군."
ZH: "\n我已經努力試圖要溫柔地對待您，將軍。但是您卻開始惹火我了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle028Subtitle
US: "*This has been fun, General, but I think it's time to end this"
DE: "*This has been fun, General, but I think it's time to end this"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 즐거웠소. 이제 슬슬 끝낼 때가 된 것 같군."
ZH: "\n這曾經有過不少樂趣，將軍。但是，我想該是結束的時候了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle029Subtitle
US: "*Maybe we should do this some other timewhen you're not so distractedat least, I hope that's what's wrong. You did say you were a \"general\", right?"
DE: "*Maybe we should do this some other timewhen you're not so distractedat least, I hope that's what's wrong. You did say you were a \"general\", right?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n아무래도 당신이 정신이 좀 있을 때 다시 겨뤄봐야 될 것 같군.\n그런데 이상한 점이 한 가지 있는데, 당신 '장군' 맞긴 맞나?"
ZH: "\n或許我們該改天再來處理，至少在您不是如此心煩意亂時。我希望那只是某個地方出錯。您確實說過您\n曾是位\"將軍\"，對吧？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle030Subtitle
US: "*You weren't using that, were you?"
DE: "*You weren't using that, were you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "사용 안하고 있는것 같길래 부쉈죠."
ZH: "\n您沒有用過這個吧，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle031Subtitle
US: "*I didn't like the look of that Barracks, at all"
DE: "*I didn't like the look of that Barracks, at all"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "막사 생김새가 너무 맘에 안드는군."
ZH: "\n我不喜歡那兵營的外觀，完全不喜歡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle032Subtitle
US: "*Your vehicles are getting on my nerves"
DE: "*Your vehicles are getting on my nerves"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 차량들이 내 신경을 건드리는데."
ZH: "\n您的載具讓我心煩。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle033Subtitle
US: "*Stay out of the air, General--you'll be safer on the ground"
DE: "*Stay out of the air, General--you'll be safer on the ground"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "공중은 위험하니까 땅에서만 노시지."
ZH: "\n離天空遠一點，將軍。您在地面上會安全些。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle034Subtitle
US: "*Was that supposed to keep me out of your base, General?"
DE: "*Was that supposed to keep me out of your base, General?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이게 날 기지에 못 들어오게 하려던 시설들 맞나?"
ZH: "\n您確定那可以將我阻擋在您的基地之外嗎，將軍？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle035Subtitle
US: "*Wow, you just lost your Command Center. That's not very good, is it"
DE: "*Wow, you just lost your Command Center. That's not very good, is it"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "와우, 커맨드 센터를 잃으셨네. 별로 기분 안좋겠군."
ZH: "\n哇，您剛失去您的指揮中心。這不太好吧，的確是的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle036Subtitle
US: "*Your base was much too cluttered before"
DE: "*Your base was much too cluttered before"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "원래부터 당신 기지는 너저분했지."
ZH: "\n您的基地以前太過凌亂了。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle037Subtitle
US: "*You have no respect for other people's property!"
DE: "*You have no respect for other people's property!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "다른 사람들의 재산을 건드리면 안되지!"
ZH: "\n您根本毫不尊重其他人的資產！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle038Subtitle
US: "*People, who was supposed to be guarding the Barracks!"
DE: "*People, who was supposed to be guarding the Barracks!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "막사는 누가 지키고 있었던 거야!"
ZH: "\n人民，是可以守護兵營的人！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle039Subtitle
US: "*I was using that War Factory!"
DE: "*I was using that War Factory!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "군수공장은 내가 쓰고 있었단 말이야!"
ZH: "\n我正在使用那座戰車工廠。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle040Subtitle
US: "*Is keeping my air field too much to ask"
DE: "*Is keeping my air field too much to ask"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 비행장을 가지고 있는 게 문제라도 됐단 말인가?"
ZH: "\n佔領我的機場不過是多此一舉。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle041Subtitle
US: "*I put that there for a reason!"
DE: "*I put that there for a reason!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 괜히 이걸 여기 배치해놓은 줄 아나? 왜 부수는거야!"
ZH: "\n我把那個放在那裡是有原因的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle042Subtitle
US: "*I had just gotten all of those buildings where I wanted them"
DE: "*I had just gotten all of those buildings where I wanted them"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 원하는 곳에 건물을 잘 배치해놨었는데.."
ZH: "\n我已經獲得這些建築物的一切，在這裡我要他們"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle043Subtitle
US: "*I don't appreciate that kind of disrespect!"
DE: "*I don't appreciate that kind of disrespect!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이런 무례는 참지 못해!"
ZH: "\n我一點也不欣賞這種不敬的行為。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle044Subtitle
US: "*I built all of those planes for a reason!"
DE: "*I built all of those planes for a reason!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 항공기들을 괜히 만든줄 알아? 왜 부수는 거지?"
ZH: "\n我建造所有的飛機是有原因的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle045Subtitle
US: "*Destroy as many vehicles as you like. See if I care"
DE: "*Destroy as many vehicles as you like. See if I care"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "차량은 원하는 만큼 부수라고. 내가 눈 하나 깜짝하나."
ZH: "\n您想摧毀多少載具就去作吧。我一點兒也不在乎。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle046Subtitle
US: "*How dare you hurt my soldiers!"
DE: "*How dare you hurt my soldiers!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "감히 어떻게 우리 군인들을 다치게 했어?"
ZH: "\n您膽敢傷害我的士兵！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle047Subtitle
US: "*I let you have that one"
DE: "*I let you have that one"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그래, 그건 가지라고."
ZH: "\n我讓您擁有那樣東西"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle048Subtitle
US: "*I didn't need that anyway"
DE: "*I didn't need that anyway"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어차피 저런 건물은 부수던지 말던지."
ZH: "\n反正我不需要。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle049Subtitle
US: "*Capturing the Refinery? Why, General, I didn't know you were so efficiency conscious"
DE: "*Capturing the Refinery? Why, General, I didn't know you were so efficiency conscious"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "정유 공장을 점령했어? 그렇게 돈 몇 푼 아끼고 싶었나?"
ZH: "\n佔領煉油廠？為什麼，將軍？我不知道您原來這麼有先見之明。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle050Subtitle
US: "*Who invited you here?"
DE: "*Who invited you here?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "초대는 받고 오셨나?"
ZH: "\n誰邀請您到這裡的？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle051Subtitle
US: "*I don't think you have the right security clearance to be here"
DE: "*I don't think you have the right security clearance to be here"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신은 이곳을 출입하기엔 신분 조회에서 불합격이야."
ZH: "\n我不認為您有權對此處進行調查。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle052Subtitle
US: "*What gives you the right to be in my base?"
DE: "*What gives you the right to be in my base?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "누가 맘대로 내 기지에 오라고 했어?"
ZH: "\n是誰讓您進入我的基地？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle053Subtitle
US: "*This is my base, get out now!"
DE: "*This is my base, get out now!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여긴 내 기지야! 나가!"
ZH: "\n這是我的基地，現在給我滾出去！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle054Subtitle
US: "*Don't expect me to be a good hostess"
DE: "*Don't expect me to be a good hostess"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 인심 좋은 아줌마이길 바라지 말게."
ZH: "\n別妄想我會是個溫柔的主人！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle055Subtitle
US: "*I don't like unexpected visitors, General"
DE: "*I don't like unexpected visitors, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "불청객은 사절이네, 장군."
ZH: "\n我不喜歡不速之客，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle056Subtitle
US: "*What do you think you're doing here?"
DE: "*What do you think you're doing here?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여기서 뭐하는 건가?"
ZH: "\n您認為在這裡您能夠作什麼？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle057Subtitle
US: "*Intruders!"
DE: "*Intruders!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "침입자다!"
ZH: "\n擅闖者！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle058Subtitle
US: "*Your presence is starting to bother me, General"
DE: "*Your presence is starting to bother me, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신이 여기 있는 것 자체가 불쾌해."
ZH: "\n您的出現開始令我心煩，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle059Subtitle
US: "*Who was supposed to be guarding that area?!?"
DE: "*Who was supposed to be guarding that area?!?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여기 방어 책임자 누구야?"
ZH: "\n誰可以捍衛這個區域呢？！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle060Subtitle
US: "*So you've managed to crack my defensesthat won't happen again"
DE: "*So you've managed to crack my defensesthat won't happen again"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지 방어를 뚫고 왔군. 하지만 여기까지네."
ZH: "\n這樣看來，您已設法炸毀我的防禦單位。這種事不會再發生！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle061Subtitle
US: "*Get out of my base, General. Don't think I'm above dropping the Particle Cannon right here"
DE: "*Get out of my base, General. Don't think I'm above dropping the Particle Cannon right here"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 기지에서 나가시지. 내가 여기에다 파티클 캐논을 쏘지 않을 거란 생각은 마시고."
ZH: "\n滾出我的基地，將軍。別以為我不會在這裡投離子砲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle062Subtitle
US: "*It's looking a little dark in your base, General"
DE: "*It's looking a little dark in your base, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 기지가 좀 컴컴한데."
ZH: "\n您的基地看來有點暗，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle063Subtitle
US: "*Did someone forget to pay the electric bill?"
DE: "*Did someone forget to pay the electric bill?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전기세를 안내서 그런 거지?"
ZH: "\n某人忘記繳電費了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle064Subtitle
US: "*You didn't manage your resources very wisely, did you?"
DE: "*You didn't manage your resources very wisely, did you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "돈 관리를 잘 했어야지."
ZH: "\n您並沒有好好管理您的資源，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle065Subtitle
US: "*You are pushing me over-budget, General"
DE: "*You are pushing me over-budget, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신 때문에 예산을 초과해버렸군."
ZH: "\n您迫使我超出預算，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle066Subtitle
US: "*How could this have happened! I had everything planned so perfectly!"
DE: "*How could this have happened! I had everything planned so perfectly!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "어떻게 이런 일이 일어날 수가! 너무나도 완벽하게 준비했었는데!!"
ZH: "\n這怎麼可能發生！我把一切都計畫得如此完美！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle067Subtitle
US: "*Do you think I'm scared of your little Scud Storm?"
DE: "*Do you think I'm scared of your little Scud Storm?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그 알량한 스커드 폭풍에 내가 겁먹을 줄 아는가?"
ZH: "\n您認為我會害怕您小小的生化死雨風暴嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle068Subtitle
US: "*That Nuke Silo doesn't frighten me"
DE: "*That Nuke Silo doesn't frighten me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "핵 미사일도 겁이 안나는걸."
ZH: "\n核彈發射井無法嚇倒我。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle069Subtitle
US: "*I appreciate your choice in weaponry, but I'm the only one allowed to have a Particle Cannon on this battlefield"
DE: "*I appreaciate your choice in weaponry, but I'm the only one allowed to have a Particle Cannon on this battlefield"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "\n음, 무기는 하나 잘 골랐군. 하지만 전쟁터에서 파티클 캐논은 나 혼자만 사용하도록\n되어 있는데."
ZH: "\n我欣賞您對武器的選擇能力，但是在這個戰場上，我是唯一被允許擁有一座離子砲的人。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle070Subtitle
US: "*Is that as secure as your base can be? Is it?"
DE: "*Is that as secure as your base can be? Is it?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "기지 방어가 이 정도 뿐인가?"
ZH: "\n那可以跟您的基地一樣安全牢靠嗎？是這樣嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle071Subtitle
US: "*That's a lot of tanks, General. Have you seen what a Particle Cannon can do to a lot of tanks?"
DE: "*That's a lot of tanks, General. Have you seen what a Particle Cannon can do to a lot of tanks?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "탱크가 많긴 하군. 파티클 캐논이 많은 탱크들을 어떻게 처리하는지 아시오, 장군?"
ZH: "\n這坦克真是數量眾多，將軍。您看到了嗎？一座離子砲就足以對付這麼多的坦克。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle072Subtitle
US: "*All these planes are just air pollution to me"
DE: "*All these planes are just air pollution to me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "저 비행기들은 대기 오염의 주범이야."
ZH: "\n所有的飛機對我而言就像是空氣污染而已。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle073Subtitle
US: "*So many troops, General. You weren't actually planning to rush me with them were you?"
DE: "*So many troops, General. You weren't actually planning to rush me with them were you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "병사들이 너무 많군. 정말 저 병사들과 함께 나한테 달려들 셈인가요?"
ZH: "\n這麼多的軍隊，將軍。您不是真的計畫要派他們突襲吧，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle074Subtitle
US: "*That's quite a base you have going there, General. You did remember to space out your buildings to avoid weapon strikes, right?"
DE: "*That's quite a base you have going there, General. You did remember to space out your buildings to avoid weapon strikes, right?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "꽤 기지답게 지었군. 슈퍼 무기에 대응하려면 기지를 넓찍이 지었어야지."
ZH: "\n那就是您去過的基地，將軍。您確實記得要隔開建築物，避免遭受武器攻擊，對嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle075Subtitle
US: "*Do you know how long it's going to take to clean that up?!?"
DE: "*Do you know how long it's going to take to clean that up?!?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여길 치우려면 얼마나 오래 걸리는지 알아?"
ZH: "\n您知道清除那個得花多少時間嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle076Subtitle
US: "*Get that disgusting radiation out of my base!"
DE: "*Get that disgusting radiation out of my base!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "저 역겨운 방사능을 내 기지에서 가져가!"
ZH: "\n讓那個討厭的輻射遠離我的基地！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle077Subtitle
US: "*Hey, that's my Particle Cannon! You're not authorized to use it!"
DE: "*Hey, that's my Particle Cannon! You're not authorized to use it!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 파티클 캐논! 어디 허가도 안 받고 사용을!"
ZH: "\n嘿！那是我的離子砲！您無權使用它！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle078Subtitle
US: "*Is that a tactical move, or are you just hiding?"
DE: "*Is that a tactical move, or are you just hiding?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "전술적 행동인가, 아니면 그냥 숨어있는 건가?"
ZH: "\n那是一種戰略性的行動嗎？或者您只是想躲起來而已？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle079Subtitle
US: "*Colonel Burton? Really? Do you think he's going to help you?"
DE: "*Colonel Burton? Really? Do you think he's going to help you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "버튼 대령? 정말? 그가 정말 당신을 도울 거라고 생각하나?"
ZH: "\n貝頓上校？真的嗎？您以為他會來幫助您嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle080Subtitle
US: "*Black Lotus? I guess it's just a girl-power showdown, isn't it?"
DE: "*Black Lotus? I guess it's just a girl-power showdown, isn't it?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "흑수선? 그래, 어디 여자들끼리 한번 붙어보자구."
ZH: "\n黑蓮花？我猜這將只是弱質女流的最後對決吧，不是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle081Subtitle
US: "*Jarmen Kell! He better stay away from my tanks!"
DE: "*Jarmen Kell! He better stay away from my tanks!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "쟈멘 켈!! 내 탱크에서 떨어져 있으라고 전해주시게."
ZH: "\n賈曼卡爾！他最好離我的坦克車遠一點！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle082Subtitle
US: "*Nice Air Field, General--just keep those planes away from my Particle Cannon"
DE: "*Nice Air Field, General--just keep those planes away from my Particle Cannon"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "멋진 비행장이네, 장군. 비행기들을 내 파티클 캐논 근처로 보내진 마시길."
ZH: "\n不錯的機場，將軍。不過您最好讓這裡的飛機離我的離子砲遠一點！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle083Subtitle
US: "*A War Factory? You're seriously going to attack me, aren't you? It's about time"
DE: "*A War Factory? You're seriously going to attack me, aren't you? It's about time"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "군수공장? 정말 날 공격할 셈인가? 때가 되었군."
ZH: "\n一座戰車工廠？您真的要攻擊我嗎？您是認真的嗎？您總算要開始了！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle084Subtitle
US: "*Good for you - you can build a barracks"
DE: "*Good for you - you can build a barracks"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "좋아, 막사는 지어도 상관 안할께."
ZH: "\n作得好，您可以建立一座兵營。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle085Subtitle
US: "*Selling your buildings? Is that part of your going out of business sale?"
DE: "*Selling your buildings? Is that part of your going out of business sale?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "건물을 판다고? 폐업 처분 세일이라도 하나?"
ZH: "\n出售您的建築物？這代表您準備關門大吉嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle086Subtitle
US: "*Why don't you just give up? I have better things I could be doing today"
DE: "*Why don't you just give up? I have better things I could be doing today"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "그냥 포기하시지 그러나? 난 오늘 내 능력의 일부만 보여줬을 뿐이거든."
ZH: "\n您為何不乾脆放棄呢？我還有更好的事情等著我去作。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle087Subtitle
US: "*Why can't I ever find one that lasts more than 5 minutes"
DE: "*Why can't I ever find one that lasts more than 5 minutes"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "날 5분 이상 버티는 놈을 찾기가 왜 이리 힘든 건지."
ZH: "\n為何我從未找到能持續五分鐘以上的對手呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle088Subtitle
US: "*Looks like you're losing, General. Now what did I say about planning to fail?"
DE: "*Looks like you're losing, General. Now what did I say about planning to fail?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "지고 있는 것 같네, 장군. 내가 패배를 계획한다고 얘기한 거 기억 나시나?"
ZH: "\n看來您輸了，將軍。對於您的失敗，現在我該說什麼才好呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle089Subtitle
US: "*That's quite a beating you're taking, General. Are you ready for more?"
DE: "*That's quite a beating you're taking, General. Are you ready for more?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "꽤 두들겨 맞았군. 더 맞아볼텐가?"
ZH: "\n您將會敗得一踏塗地，將軍。您準備好接受慘敗了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle090Subtitle
US: "*I'd like to say, \"good fight,\" but clearly your mind wasn't in it, General"
DE: "*I'd like to say, \"good fight,\" but clearly your mind wasn't in it, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "수고하셨습니다 하고 말해주고 싶긴 하지만, 당신 지금 인사 받을 정신도 없군."
ZH: "\n我想說，\"好好打一場仗，\"但顯然地您的心思根本沒在這上頭，將軍"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle091Subtitle
US: "*I can't believe you would beat-up on a girl like this"
DE: "*I can't believe you would beat-up on a girl like this"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "여자를 이렇게 심하게 다루는 사람인 줄 몰랐는데."
ZH: "\n我無法相信您居然會像這樣痛打一名女子。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle092Subtitle
US: "*I need time to think. Go away, General!"
DE: "*I need time to think. Go away, General!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "생각할 시간이 필요하군.. 당장 나가!"
ZH: "\n我需要更多時間思考。滾開，將軍！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle093Subtitle
US: "*Your tactics are hardly sporting, General. Play nice!"
DE: "*Your tactics are hardly sporting, General. Play nice!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "당신의 전술은 정정당당하지 못하군. 떳떳하게 플레이하란 말이오!"
ZH: "\n您的戰術欠缺公平，將軍！光明正大地比一場吧！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle094Subtitle
US: "*General, look over there! Someone is capturing your buildings! Didn't buy it, huh?"
DE: "*General, look over there! Someone is capturing your buildings! Didn't buy it, huh?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "장군, 누가 당신 건물을 점령하고 있소! 돈도 안내고 날로 먹는군?"
ZH: "\n將軍，仔細檢查這裡！某人正要『佔領』您的建築物！而不是『買下』它，哈哈。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle095Subtitle
US: "*You know, if you were a gentleman, you'd give me five minutes to rebuild my defenses"
DE: "*You know, if you were a gentleman, you'd give me five minutes to rebuild my defenses"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "만약 당신이 신사라면 나한테 기지를 재건할 시간을 5분 정도 줄텐데."
ZH: "\n您知道嗎，假如您真的是位紳士，您就應該給我幾分鐘，好讓我重建防禦單位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle096Subtitle
US: "*What?! It's over? Well, it was nice dancing with you, General. Maybe next time I'll lead"
DE: "*What?! It's over? Well, it was nice dancing with you, General. Maybe next time I'll lead"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "뭐? 끝났다고? 흥, 잘 놀고 가요. 다음번엔 내가 초대하지."
ZH: "\n什麼？！結束了？這樣看來，能與您共舞真好，將軍。或許下次換我來領導！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle097Subtitle
US: "*My Super Weapons are ready... are you?"
DE: "*My Super Weapons are readyare you?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 슈퍼 무기는 준비되었는데, 당신은 어떤가?"
ZH: "\n我的超級武器準備好了，那您呢？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle098Subtitle
US: "*You'll never crack my defenses, General"
DE: "*You'll never crack my defenses, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내 방어를 깨지 못할거요, 장군."
ZH: "\n您永遠不可能炸毀我的防禦單位，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle099Subtitle
US: "*Your rush tactics won't work on me"
DE: "*Your rush tactics won't work on me"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "러시 전략은 나한테는 안통할텐데."
ZH: "\n您的襲擊戰術對我無效。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle100Subtitle
US: "*It's not fair! One more Super Weapon and I would have beaten you, General. Challenge me again, I dare you"
DE: "*It's not fair! One more Super Weapon and I would have beaten you, General. Challenge me again, I dare you"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이건 불공평해! 슈퍼 무기가 하나만 더 있었어도 내가 이겼을거야. 한번 더 겨뤄보시지?"
ZH: "\n不公平！再多一項超級武器，我一定能夠打贏您，將軍。再挑戰我一次，我對你。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle101Subtitle
US: "*I told you you'd never beat my Super Weapons, General. Care to try again?"
DE: "*I told you, you'd never beat my Super Weapons, General. Care to try again?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "내가 진작 얘기했을텐데. 당신은 내 슈퍼 무기를 당해내지 못해. 한번 더 도전할건가?"
ZH: "\n我告訴過您，您永遠無法打敗我的超級武器，將軍。想再試試看嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle102Subtitle
US: "*Welcome, General. Are you ready to begin?"
DE: "*Welcome, General. Are you ready to begin?"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "환영합니다, 장군님. 시작할 준비되셨습니까?"
ZH: "\n歡迎光臨，將軍。您準備要開始了嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle103Subtitle
US: "*Oh, what's that sound? Now I see a light in the sky... Hmm"
DE: "*Oh, what's that sound? Now I see a light in the sky... Hmm"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "음? 이 소리는? 하늘에 불빛들이 보이는군..음.."
ZH: "\n喔，那是什麼聲音？我看到空中出現一道光芒…嗯"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle104Subtitle
US: "*Oh my!"
DE: "*Oh my!"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "이런!"
ZH: "\n喔！我的！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle106Subtitle
US: "*oh dearI'm sorry, General, but that's just how I like to say, \"hello.\" Well, good luck, General"
DE: "*oh dearI'm sorry, General, but that's just how I like to say, \"hello.\" Well, good luck, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "오 이런, 미안합니다 장군님, 하지만 저는 이런 식으로 인사를 한답니다.\n행운을 빕니다, 장군."
ZH: "\n喔！親愛的，我很抱歉，將軍。但這正是我想說的，\"哈囉。\"那麼，祝您好運囉，將軍"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:Taunts_Turtle107Subtitle
US: "*Well, good luck, General"
DE: "*Well, good luck, General"
FR: "***"
ES: "***"
IT: "***"
KO: "행운을 빕니다, 장군."
ZH: "\n就這樣吧，祝您好運，將軍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina001Subtitle
US: "*The Americans use the Sentry Drone as an early warning enemy detection system. The drone becomes invisible when it is not moving, and we've seen some of them upgraded with machine guns. Though no match for tanks, the drone can cause problems for foot soldiers"
DE: "*The Americans use the Sentry Drone as an early warning enemy detection system. The drone becomes invisible when it is not moving, and we've seen some of them upgraded with machine guns. Though no match for tanks, the drone can cause problems for foot soldiers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEE.UU. usa el teledirigido centinela como primer sistema de detección del enemigo. Son invisibles cuando no se mueven, y algunos llevan ametralladoras. Son eficaces contra la infantería."
IT: "\nIl Drone da ricognizione americano, invisibile quando immobile e potenzialmente armato, serve per rilevare la presenza nemica. Inutile contro i carri armati, è letale contro la fanteria."
KO: "\n미국군은 조기 경보를 위해 센트리 드론을 사용합니다. 드론은 움직이지 않을 때는 보이지\n않고 머신건 업그레이드를 할 수 있습니다. 탱크에 약하고 보병에 강합니다."
ZH: "\n美軍使用使用無人哨兵機作為敵人預警的防護系統。這種蜂型機不移動時肉眼無法看見。而且我們可以\n看到它們利用機關槍來升級。雖然比不上坦克車，但這種蜂型機仍可對步兵造成一些困擾。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina002Subtitle
US: "*The American Microwave Tank is a big microwave gun that disables structures and vehicles. The radiation from the tank can also hurt infantry, so keep our men at a safe distance"
DE: "*The American Microwave Tank is a big microwave gun that disables structures and vehicles. The radiation from the tank can also hurt infantry, so keep our men at a safe distance"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl tanque de microondas americano incapacita edificios y vehículos. La radiación daña a la infantería, de modo que hay que alejarla."
IT: "\nIl Carro a microonde americano disattiva strutture e veicoli. Le sue radiazioni feriscono anche la fanteria."
KO: "\n미국군의 초단파 탱크는 건물과 차량을 무력화 시키는 커다란 초단파 총입니다. 탱크에서\n나오는 파동은 보병에게도 피해를 주므로 아군 보병들을 탱크에서 멀리 떨어뜨리십시오."
ZH: "\n美軍的微波坦克可說是一種大型的微波砲，能破壞建築物和載具。這種從坦克發出的放射線也可以癱瘓\n步兵部隊，所以最好讓我們的部下跟它保持安全距離。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina003Subtitle
US: "*The Avenger is an American laser based anti-air vehicle able to shoot down missiles and aircraft. It also helps other US units target our planes, so they should be considered high priority targets when encountered within a battle group"
DE: "*The Avenger is an American laser based anti-air vehicle able to shoot down missiles and aircraft. It also helps other US units target our planes, so they should be considered high priority targets when encountered within a battle group"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Avenger americano es un vehículo láser antiaéreo capaz de derribar misiles y aviones. Identifica blancos para otras unidades, por lo que es un objetivo de alta prioridad."
IT: "\nL'Avenger è un veicolo antiaereo con capacità antimissile. Permette inoltre ai velivoli USA di colpire il nemico e, pertanto, è un bersaglio estremamente importante."
KO: "\n어벤져는 미사일과 항공기를 격추시키는 미국군의 레이저 대공 무기입니다.\n또한 우선순위가 높은 표적에 표시를 하여 미국 유닛들이 우리 항공기에 조준하도록 합니다."
ZH: "\n復仇者支援車是一種美國製、以雷射為主要武器的制空載具，能夠擊落飛彈與飛機。它也可以協助其他\n美軍單位瞄準我們的飛機。所以當我們在一群戰鬥團體中碰到它時，應該把它作為優先瞄準攻擊的目標。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina004Subtitle
US: "*The Specter Gunship is a large jet powered aircraft with multiple weapon systems fixed to its side enabling it to circle a target area and rain death from above. Typical American engineering--using a shotgun to swat a fly"
DE: "*The Specter Gunship is a large jet powered aircraft with multiple weapon systems fixed to its side enabling it to circle a target area and rain death from above. Typical American engineering--using a shotgun to swat a fly"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl helicóptero Spectre tiene numerosas armas en el lateral, pudiendo volar en círculo mientras ataca. Típica ingeniería americana: matar moscas a cañonazos."
IT: "\nLa Cannoniera Spectre è un grande aereo pesantemente armato, progettato per colpire in modo risolutivo la zona bersaglio."
KO: "\n스펙터 건쉽은 다중 무기 체계를 기체 옆면에 장착한 커다란 제트기로, 목표물 상공을\n선회하며 무시무시한 포격을 퍼붓습니다. 미국인들은 파리 잡으려고 샷건을 쏘죠."
ZH: "\n鬼魅炮艇機是一種大型、以噴射引擎為動力的飛機，有多種武器系統安裝在它周邊，使其能夠在目標區\n盤旋，從上空降下生化死雨。典型的美國工程學，利用一把散彈槍來飛行掃射。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina005Subtitle
US: "*The Chemical Suit upgrade, makes infantry more resistant to toxins and radiation"
DE: "*The Chemical Suit upgrade, makes infantry more resistant to toxins and radiation"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl traje antiquímico hace que la infantería resista mejor toxinas y radiación."
IT: "\nL'aggiornamento Tute chimiche rende la fanteria più resistente a tossine e radiazioni."
KO: "방호복 업그레이드는 보병들이 독소와 방사능에 더 잘 견디게 해줍니다."
ZH: "\n生化防護衣升級，讓步兵更能抵禦毒素和放射線。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina006Subtitle
US: "*The US Countermeasures upgrade reduces the effectiveness of enemy fire against their air units. Missiles will often miss, and bullets do less damage"
DE: "*The US Countermeasures upgrade reduces the effectiveness of enemy fire against their air units. Missiles will often miss, and bullets do less damage"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas contramedidas de EE.UU. reducen la efectividad del fuego enemigo contra sus unidades aéreas. Los misiles fallan más y las balas hacen menos daño."
IT: "\nLe Contromisure USA riducono l'efficacia di tutte le armi nemiche contro le unità aeree."
KO: "\n미국군의 전자전 장비 업그레이드는 적들의 대공 사격의 효율을 감소시킵니다.\n미사일은 종종 명중하지 않고, 탄환에 입는 피해는 원래보다 감소합니다."
ZH: "\n美軍反制裝置升級可降低敵人開火反擊空中單位時的效率。飛彈會常常失誤，而且彈藥的殺傷力也會變\n弱。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina007Subtitle
US: "*The US Hellfire Drone upgrade creates an remote air drone that defends the parent vehicle with an automated hellfire missile system"
DE: "*The US Hellfire Drone upgrade creates an remote air drone that defends the parent vehicle with an automated hellfire missile system"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl teledirigido Hellfire americano vuela sobre su vehículo nodriza y lo defiende con un sistema de misiles Hellfire."
IT: "\nIl Drone Hellfire è dotato di comando a distanza e difende il suo veicolo con un sistema missilistico automatico."
KO: "\n미국군의 헬파이어 드론 업그레이드는 헬파이어 미사일로 모체를 보호하는 원격 조정 비행\n드론을 만들게 해줍니다."
ZH: "\n美軍的地獄火蜂型機升級可變成一種遙控式空中蜂型機，能夠用自動化的地獄火飛彈系統來保護機體。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina008Subtitle
US: "*The Bunker Buster is an upgrade to the US Stealth Fighter and the Aurora designed to penetrate garrisoned buildings"
DE: "*The Bunker Buster is an upgrade to the US Stealth Fighter and the Aurora designed to penetrate garrisoned buildings"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl antibúnker es una mejora del caza invisible y el Aurora; penetra en edificios guarnecidos."
IT: "\nIl Cacciatore di bunker è un aggiornamento del Caccia stealth e dell'Aurora, in grado di colpire edifici presidiati."
KO: "\n벙커 버스터는 적 병력이 주둔한 건물의 파괴를 위한 미국군의 스텔스 전투기와 오로라\n폭격기의 업그레이드 기능입니다."
ZH: "\n碉堡殺手是美軍的隱形戰鬥機升級和曙光轟炸機的升級品，設計用來通過被駐守的建築物。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina009Subtitle
US: "*The Supply Lines Upgrade increases the rate that the US gathers resources from supply docks, supply drops, and oil derricks"
DE: "*The Supply Lines Upgrade increases the rate that the US gathers resources from supply docks, supply drops, and oil derricks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas líneas de suministro aceleran la captación de recursos de puertos, torres o lanzamientos desde el aire."
IT: "\nL'aggiornamento Linee di rifornimento aumenta la velocità di raccolta delle risorse USA."
KO: "\n보급선 업그레이드는 미국군이 서플라이 도크, 투하 지역, 원유 유정탑 등에서 자금을\n획득하는 비율을 높여줍니다."
ZH: "\n補給線升級可增加美軍從補給站、補給空投區和油井收集資源的速度。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina010Subtitle
US: "*The US Generals have seen the wisdom of propaganda. By using a Leaflet Drop they are able to temporarily disable units while they stop to read the propaganda"
DE: "*The US Generals have seen the wisdom of propaganda. By using a Leaflet Drop they are able to temporarily disable units while they stop to read the propaganda"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos generales de EE.UU. han visto la utilidad de la propaganda. Soltando folletos desde el aire, incapacitan temporalmente a las unidades que los leen."
IT: "\nCon un Lancio di volantini propagandistici, i generali USA possono bloccare temporaneamente ogni attività delle truppe nemiche."
KO: "\n미국은 선전전술의 효과를 깨닫기 시작했습니다. 선전물 투하를 통해 적 병사들이 멈추어\n선전물을 읽는 동안 유닛들을 무력화 시킬 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n美軍將軍已經看到思想強化的高明之處。藉由使用空投傳單，當他們停下來去閱讀思想強化內容時，就\n可以暫時使他們癱瘓。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina011Subtitle
US: "*The MOAB is an upgrade to the US Fuel Air Bomb that includes a stun ability, temporarily shutting down surviving units and structures"
DE: "*The MOAB is an upgrade to the US Fuel Air Bomb that includes a stun ability, temporarily shutting down surviving units and structures"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa MDTB mejora la bomba incendiaria de EE.UU. al incapacitar por un tiempo a las unidades y edificios supervivientes."
IT: "\nLa MDTB è un aggiornamento della bomba a benzina in grado di disattivare unità e strutture superstiti."
KO: "\nMOAB은 미국군의 기화 폭탄의 업그레이드입니다. 살아남은 적 유닛과 건물을 잠시\n무력화 시키는 스턴 기능도 가지고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n炸彈之母是美軍油氣彈的升級品，含有某種『昏迷』功效，可暫時使救援單位和建築物無法行動。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina012Subtitle
US: "*The US Fire Base structure is a defensive position surrounded by sandbags and includes a howitzer and 4 firing positions"
DE: "*The US Fire Base structure is a defensive position surrounded by sandbags and includes a howitzer and 4 firing positions"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa base de disparo de EE.UU. es una posición defensiva con sacos de arena, un obús y 4 puestos de tiro."
IT: "\nLa Base di fuoco USA è una struttura difensiva con howitzer e 4 postazioni armate."
KO: "\n미국군의 파이어 베이스 건물은 유탄포 한 대와 4개의 사격 지점을 갖추고 모래주머니로\n둘러싸인 방어 시설입니다."
ZH: "\n美軍火力基地是一個防守重地，四周由沙袋圍住，有一顆榴彈砲和四個發射位置。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina013Subtitle
US: "*The Napalm Bomb is an upgrade to our Helix airship, allowing it to drop a pair of bombs which create a large firestorm effect"
DE: "*The Napalm Bomb is an upgrade to our Helix airship, allowing it to drop a pair of bombs which create a large firestorm effect"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa bomba de napalm mejora el Helix, que así puede soltar dos bombas incendiarias que provocan una tormenta."
IT: "\nLa Bomba al napalm è un aggiornamento dell'Helix e consente di scatenare una tempesta di fuoco."
KO: "\n네이팜탄은 아군 헬릭스의 업그레이드인데, 커다란 화염 폭풍 효과를 일으키는 폭탄\n한 쌍을 투하하게 됩니다."
ZH: "\n汽油彈是我們螺旋直昇機的升級品，讓飛機能夠空投一對炸彈，產生大型火風暴。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina014Subtitle
US: "*Our Listening Outpost is a slow, stealthed vehicle with a large sight radius, that can be garrisoned with 2 infantry as guards. Besides uncovering stealthed objects, it can be used to determine enemy destinations by clicking on units in range"
DE: "*Our Listening Outpost is a slow, stealthed vehicle with a large sight radius, that can be garrisoned with 2 infantry as guards. Besides uncovering stealthed objects, it can be used to determine enemy destinations by clicking on units in range"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestro puesto de escucha es un vehículo lento y encubierto con un gran campo de visión y 2 guardias de infantería. Revela objetos ocultos y determina el destino de las unidades enemigas a la vista."
IT: "\nLa Postazione d'ascolto è un veicolo mimetizzato con ampio campo visivo, con due soldati a bordo. Oltre a rilevare i nemici mimetizzati, puoi scoprirne le destinazioni con un clic."
KO: "\n아군의 감시 아웃포스트는 느리지만 스텔스 기능과 광범위한 시야를 갖추었고 2명의\n보병d이 탑승합니다. 범위 안의 유닛에 클릭함으로써 적 유닛의 목적지를 알 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n我們的前哨監聽車是一種速度緩慢的隱形載具，具有寬廣的瞄準半徑，可以派兩名步兵充當警衛來駐守。\n除了能夠讓使隱形物件現身，點選它有效距離內的單位，可用來確定敵人方位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina015Subtitle
US: "*Our Helix 2 airship is a slow transport helicopter that can carry infantry or a single vehicle. Although armed with a light machine gun, it can be upgraded with the Gattling Cannon, Propaganda Tower, or Battle Bunker. It can also be upgraded to carry a large napalm bomb"
DE: "*Our Helix 2 airship is a slow transport helicopter that can carry infantry or a single vehicle. Although armed with a light machine gun, it can be upgraded with the Gattling Cannon, Propaganda Tower, or Battle Bunker. It can also be upgraded to carry a large napalm bomb"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestro Helix 2 es un helicóptero que puede llevar infantería o bien un vehículo. Está armado con una ametralladora ligera, pero puede mejorarse con un cañón Gattling, una torre de propaganda, un búnker de combate o una gran bomba de napalm."
IT: "\nIl velivolo Helix 2 è un elicottero da trasporto per fanteria o veicoli singoli. Può ricevere come aggiornamenti Cannone gatling, Diffusore, Bunker da battaglia e Bomba al napalm."
KO: "\n아군의 헬릭스 2 에어쉽은 보병이나 차량을 수송하는 헬기입니다. 머신건으로 무장하였고\n개틀링 캐논, 프로퍼갠더 타워, 배틀 벙커, 네이팜탄 투하 등의 업그레이드가 가능합니다."
ZH: "\n我們的螺旋直昇機 2 是一種速度緩慢的運輸直昇機，可以運送步兵或一架載具。雖然裝配輕型機關槍，\n它仍然可以加上蓋特砲、思想強化電塔或戰鬥碉堡加以升級。它也可以升級用來攜帶一顆大型汽油彈。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina016Subtitle
US: "*The ECM Tank disrupts electronic tracking systems, diverting enemy missile fire. It's electro-magnetic pulse can be used to disable a single enemy vehicle. It also creates a radar jamming field that disables all drones within its range"
DE: "*The ECM Tank disrupts electronic tracking systems, diverting enemy missile fire. It's electro-magnetic pulse can be used to disable a single enemy vehicle. It also creates a radar jamming field that disables all drones within its range"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl tanque CME altera los sistemas electrónicos y desvía misiles enemigos. Su impulso electromagnético incapacita a un vehículo enemigo. También inhabilita los teledirigidos en su radio de acción."
IT: "\nIl Carro ECM disturba i sistemi di volo dei missili e può disattivare un singolo veicolo. Inoltre, blocca tutti i Droni entro la sua portata."
KO: "\nECM 탱크는 전자 추적 시스템을 교란하여 적의 미사일을 궤도에서 이탈하게 합니다.\n또한 전자기파로 적 차량과 드론을 무력화시킬 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n電子干擾坦克會干擾電子追蹤系統，移轉敵人的飛彈射擊方向。它的電磁波脈衝可用來癱瘓一部敵軍載\n具。它也可以製造人為雷達干擾場域，癱瘓有效距離內的所有無人飛機。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina017Subtitle
US: "*The Neutron Shell is an upgrade to our Nuclear Cannon, allowing it to fire neutron shells. These shells kill all infantry, and vehicle pilots inside the blast radius"
DE: "*The Neutron Shell is an upgrade to our Nuclear Cannon, allowing it to fire neutron shells. These shells kill all infantry, and vehicle pilots inside the blast radius"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl cañón de neutrones mejora los proyectiles del nuclear. Dentro del radio afectado, aniquilarán infantería y pilotos de vehículos."
IT: "\nIl Proiettile a neutroni è un aggiornamento del Cannone nucleare. Uccide tutte le forme di vita nel raggio dell'esplosione."
KO: "\n중성자탄은 핵 캐논의 업그레이드로, 중성자탄을 발사할 수 있게 합니다.\n폭파 범위 내에 있는 보병들과 차량 운전자들을 제거합니다."
ZH: "\n中子砲彈是我們的核子加農砲的升級品，讓它發射中子砲彈。這些砲彈可以消滅它們轟炸半徑內的所有\n步兵和載具駕駛員。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina018Subtitle
US: "*The Systems Hack allows your hackers to steal a random Generals power from our enemies. Level 1 allows theft of a 1-star or 3-star power, while level 2 allows theft of a 5-star power"
DE: "*The Systems Hack allows your hackers to steal a random Generals power from our enemies. Level 1 allows theft of a 1-star or 3-star power, while level 2 allows theft of a 5-star power"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCon el pirateo de sistema, tus hackers se apropian del poder de un general enemigo al azar. El nivel 1 permite acceder al poder de 1-3 estrellas, mientras que el nivel 2 alcanza las 5."
IT: "\nGli Hacker, violando i sistemi, rubano un potere qualsiasi del generale. A livello 1 rubano un potere a 1 o 3 stelle, a livello 2 un potere a 5 stelle."
KO: "\n시스템 해킹은 아군 해커들로 하여금 적의 제너럴 특수기술 중 무작위로 한 가지를\n훔치도록 합니다. 레벨 1은 대위 또는 중령, 레벨 2는 준장의 기술을 훔칠 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n系統入侵能力可讓您的駭客從我們敵軍身上隨機偷取某一種將軍能力。等級一可以竊取一項一星級或三\n星級的能力，而等級二可以盜取一項五星級的能力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina019Subtitle
US: "*Our new Carpet Bomber plane drops a series of bombs along a targeted path, decimating all enemy forces"
DE: "*Our new Carpet Bomber plane drops a series of bombs along a targeted path, decimating all enemy forces"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestro nuevo bombardero a nivel siembra de bombas una ruta objetivo, diezmando al enemigo."
IT: "\nIl Bombardamento a tappeto decima le truppe nemiche presenti nella zona bersaglio."
KO: "\n새로운 융단 폭격기는 목표 지점까지 가는 길을 따라 폭격을 해서 모든 적을 파괴합니다."
ZH: "\n我們全新的地毯式轟炸機，會隨著目標路徑沿路投擲一連串的炸彈，大量毀滅敵軍部隊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina020Subtitle
US: "*Our Neutron Mines are an alternative to standard explosive mines. Neutron Mines instantly disable vehicles and kill any nearby infantry"
DE: "*Our Neutron Mines are an alternative to standard explosive mines. Neutron Mines instantly disable vehicles and kill any nearby infantry"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestras minas de neutrones son una alternativa a las explosivas corrientes. Anulan vehículos y matan a la infantería cercana"
IT: "\nLe Mine a neutroni sono un'alternativa a quelle standard:\ndisattivano i veicoli e uccidono la fanteria."
KO: "\n아군의 중성자 지뢰는 일반 지뢰의 대안으로 등장했는데, 적 차량을 무력화시키고\n근처의 보병을 제거합니다."
ZH: "\n我們的中子地雷是標準爆炸性地雷的另一種類型。中子地雷會立刻癱瘓載具，並且消滅附近的任何步兵"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina021Subtitle
US: "*Our hackers, once vulnerable to attack, will find safety and increased hacking ability in our new Internet Center"
DE: "*Our hackers, once vulnerable to attack, will find safety and increased hacking ability in our new Internet Center"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestro nuevo centro de internet dotará de mayor seguridad y posibilidades a nuestros hackers."
IT: "\nGli Hacker troveranno riparo e protezione all'interno del Centro Internet."
KO: "\n아군의 해커는 공격에 취약한 단점이 있었지만, 인터넷 센터 안에서 보호를 받으며\n더 발전된 해킹 기술을 발휘할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n我們的駭客一度很容易受到攻擊。在我們全新的網際網路中心，他們將有安全的環境和更強的侵入能力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina022Subtitle
US: "*The Satellite Hack I is an internet Center upgrade that allows a reveal around every opponent's Command Center"
DE: "*The Satellite Hack I is an internet Center upgrade that allows a reveal around every opponent's Command Center"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl pirateo de satélite I es una mejora del centro de Internet que revela el centro de mando de cada oponente"
IT: "\nViolazione satellite I rivela la posizione\ndi tutti i Centri comando nemici."
KO: "\n위성 해킹 1은 인터넷 센터에서 업그레이드 할 수 있고,모든 적의 커맨드 센터의 위치를\n보여줍니다."
ZH: "\n衛星侵入 I 是一種網際網路中心的升級品，可以顯示您周圍每個對手的指揮中心"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina023Subtitle
US: "*The Satellite Hack II is an Internet Center upgrade that grants a temporarily reveals the entire map, including stealthed enemy forces"
DE: "*The Satellite Hack II is an Internet Center upgrade that grants a temporarily reveals the entire map, including stealthed enemy forces"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl pirateo de satélite II es una mejora del centro de internet que revela temporalmente todo el mapa, incluyendo fuerzas enemigas ocultas."
IT: "\nViolazione satellite II rivela temporaneamente tutta la mappa, unità mimetizzate comprese."
KO: "\n위성 해킹 2는 인터넷 센터에서 업그레이드 할 수 있고, 잠시동안 전 지도에 있는\n스텔스 상태인 것들을 포함한 모든 유닛과 건물을 표시해줍니다."
ZH: "\n衛星侵入II 是一種網際網路的升級品，可暫時顯示整個地圖，包括隱形的敵軍部隊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina024Subtitle
US: "*The GLA Saboteur is a stealth infantry unit that can climb cliffs and effect enemy buildings by entering them. Entering a power plant will temporarily cut power, while entering a superweapon will reset the timer. A saboteur who enters an enemy command center will reset the timers on all enemy General's Powers"
DE: "*The GLA Saboteur is a stealth infantry unit that can climb cliffs and effect enemy buildings by entering them. Entering a power plant will temporarily cut power, while entering a superweapon will reset the timer. A saboteur who enters an enemy command center will reset the timers on all enemy General's Powers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl saboteador del GLA es una unidad encubierta de infantería que escala barrancos y opera entrando en edificios del enemigo. En una central eléctrica cortará el suministro, o reiniciará la cuenta atrás en una superarma o centro de mando del enemigo."
IT: "\n*"
KO: "\nGLA의 새보터는 절벽을 탈 수 있는 스텔스 유닛으로 적의 건물에 들어가 영향을 미칠 수\n있는 유닛입니다. 발전소 전력 차단, 슈퍼무기 타이머와 제너럴 특수기술 리셋이 가능합니다."
ZH: "全球解放軍破壞者是一種隱形的步兵單位，可以攀越懸崖峭壁，也可以入侵敵軍建築物加以破壞。侵入\n一座發電廠將會暫時停電，而入侵一項超級武器時則會重設計時器。入侵某個敵軍指揮中心的破壞者，\n將重新設定所有敵軍將軍能力的計時器"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina025Subtitle
US: "*The Combat Cycle initially comes with a GLA Rebel driver and a mounted machine gun. The Rebel can be replaced with any other GLA infantry, granting the cycle their unique powers"
DE: "*The Combat Cycle initially comes with a GLA Rebel driver and a mounted machine gun. The Rebel can be replaced with any other GLA infantry, granting the cycle their unique powers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa moto de combate lleva un conductor rebelde del GLA, reemplazable por uno de infantería, y una ametralladora fija."
IT: "\nLa Moto da combattimento è dotata di una mitragliatrice e può essere guidata da varie unità della fanteria ELG."
KO: "\n컴뱃 사이클은 GLA 반군을 태우고 머신건을 탑재한 상태로 생산됩니다.\n반군 대신 다른 GLA 보병을 태우면 그 보병의 속성에 맞는 기능을 수행합니다."
ZH: "\n戰鬥摩托車最初是全球解放軍反抗軍的駕駛者所使用，配有一門機關槍。反抗軍可以用任何其他的全球\n解放軍步兵來取代，其獨特的動力可以自動循環使用。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina026Subtitle
US: "*The GLA Battle Bus can hold up to 8 infantry, who fire out windows. If destroyed, the heavy steel cabin remains like a bunker"
DE: "*The GLA Battle Bus can hold up to 8 infantry, who fire out windows. If destroyed, the heavy steel cabin remains like a bunker"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl bus de combate puede llevar 8 de infantería que disparan por las ventanas. Si es destruido, su cabina de acero actúa como búnker."
IT: "\nL'Autobus da battaglia ospita fino a 8 soldati. Se viene distrutto, diventa un Bunker."
KO: "\nGLA의 배틀 버스는 8명의 보병을 태울 수 있고, 이들은 창문을 통해 사격할 수 있습니다.\n파괴될 경우 차체의 잔해가 벙커와 같은 기능을 수행합니다."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍戰鬥巴士最多可搭載八名步兵，他們可以開槍射穿巴士玻璃。假如車子被摧毀，這個重型鋼\n製座艙仍然會像碉堡一樣完好無缺。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina027Subtitle
US: "*The GLA have upgraded their Workers with Shoes to squeeze even more forced labor from their peasants"
DE: "*The GLA have upgraded their Workers with Shoes to squeeze even more forced labor from their peasants"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA ha mejorado a sus trabajadores con botas para exprimir aún más los trabajos forzados de sus campesinos."
IT: "\nGli Operai dell'ELG hanno delle scarpe per rendere ancora di più sul lavoro."
KO: "\nGLA는 일꾼 신발 업그레이드를 통해 그들을 더욱 착취할 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍已經替工人加上工作鞋以提升其等級，好從這些農民身上壓榨更多勞力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina028Subtitle
US: "*The Camo Netting is an upgrade to GLA base defense structures, making them invisible to normal detection"
DE: "*The Camo Netting is an upgrade to GLA base defense structures, making them invisible to normal detection"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa red de camuflaje mejora las defensas de la base del GLA, haciéndolas invisibles ante la detección común."
IT: "\nLe Reti mimetiche rendono invisibili le strutture difensive dell'ELG."
KO: "\n위장망은 GLA 방어 시설의 업그레이드로, 시설을 적의 시야에서 보이지 않게 위장합니다."
ZH: "\n偽裝網是全球解放軍基地防禦建築的升級品，普通的偵測方式看不見它們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina029Subtitle
US: "*The GLA have begun garrisoning Elite Guard troops equipped with RPGs in all their structures. Use caution when infiltrating any GLA bases"
DE: "*The GLA have begun garrisoning Elite Guard troops equipped with RPGs in all their structures. Use caution when infiltrating any GLA bases"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl GLA ha comenzado a desplegar a la guardia de élite con RPG en todos sus edificios. Precaución al infiltrarse en ellas."
IT: "\nL'ELG posiziona soldati scelti con RPG in tutte le strutture."
KO: "\nGLA는 RPG로 무장한 엘리트 가드 병사들을 모든 건물에 주둔시키기 시작했습니다.\nGLA 기지에 침투할 때는 이에 주의해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍已經開始派駐精英守衛部隊，他們全體都配有推進式榴彈。當滲透任何全球解放軍的基地時，\n請小心使用。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina030Subtitle
US: "*The GLA Booby Trap upgrade enables the rebel to wire structures and civilian vehicles to explode when the enemy attempts to capture or garrison them. Watch for Rebels lurking around buildings in your area"
DE: "*The GLA Booby Trap upgrade enables the rebel to wire structures and civilian vehicles to explode when the enemy attempts to capture or garrison them. Watch for Rebels lurking around buildings in your area"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa trampa explosiva del GLA permite alambrar edificios y vehículos civiles para que exploten cuando el enemigo se apropie de ellos. Atención a la presencia de rebeldes en edificios del área."
IT: "\nL'Ordigno esplosivo dell'ELG permette di far saltare i veicoli civili quando il nemico cerca di utilizzarli."
KO: "\n반군은 GLA의 폭약 함정을 건물과 민간인 차량 등에 연결시켜서 적이 건물이나 차량을\n점령하거나 탈취하려고 할 때 폭발하게 만들 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n當敵人試圖佔領或駐守建築物與一般載具時，全球解放軍的詭雷升級可以讓反抗軍引爆它們。得小心反\n抗軍埋伏在您區域內建築物四周。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina031Subtitle
US: "*The GLA tricks have reached a new level. They are now building Fake Structures that look like their real buildings, but are only booby-trapped facades. Destroy everything from range to avoid any GLA surprises"
DE: "*The GLA tricks have reached a new level. They are now building Fake Structures that look like their real buildings, but are only booby-trapped fascades. Destroy everything from range to avoid any GLA surprises"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos trucos del GLA han alcanzado un nuevo nivel. Construyen edificios falsos que son fachadas con trampas explosivas. Destruye todo lo que esté a tiro para evitar sorpresas."
IT: "\nL'ELG realizza delle false strutture, identiche a quelle vere, per attirare in trappola le truppe nemiche."
KO: "\nGLA의 잔꾀가 새로운 단계로 도약했습니다. 이제 그들은 진짜처럼 보이지만 사실은\n함정이 설치된 껍데기 뿐인 위장 건물을 건설합니다."
ZH: "\n全球解放軍的戰術謀略已提升到全新等級。它們現在可以建造看似真實建築物的假建築，但實際上只是\n表面陷阱。摧毀有效距離內的任何東西，避免和任何全球解放軍單位不期而遇。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina032Subtitle
US: "*The GPS Scrambler targets an area of units and makes them invisible to normal detection"
DE: "*The GPS Scrambler targets an area of units and makes them invisible to normal detection"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl codificador GPS enfocado hacia un grupo de unidades las hace invisibles ante la detección común."
IT: "\nL'Interferenza GPS rende invisibile un gruppo di unità."
KO: "\nGPS 교란 장치는 범위 내의 유닛을 적의 시야에 보이지 않도록 위장합니다."
ZH: "\nGPS干擾器可以瞄準一個區域內的軍事單位，而且讓普通的偵測方式看不見它們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina033Subtitle
US: "*The Sneak Attack power allows GLA Generals to place a defenseless tunnel network anywhere they have explored. Although slightly weaker than a normal tunnel, it is connected to the main network"
DE: "*The Sneak Attack power allows GLA Generals to place a defenseless tunnel network anywhere they have explored. Although slightly weaker than a normal tunnel, it is connected to the main network"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl ataque furtivo permite al GLA crear una red de túneles sin defensas en lugares explorados. Es más débil que un túnel normal, pero conecta con la red principal."
IT: "\nL'Attacco furtivo permette ai generali dell'ELG di posizionare una Rete di tunnel in qualsiasi luogo esplorato."
KO: "\n잠입 공격 능력으로 GLA는 지도 상의 이미 탐색한 지점들 어느 곳에든지 방어 병력이 없는\n터널 네트워크를 건설합니다. 비록 약하지만 모든 네트워크와 연결됩니다."
ZH: "\n偷襲能力讓全球解放軍能設置一個不受任何防守的地道網路系統，在他們所經過的任何區域皆可。它與\n主要網路是相連的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina034Subtitle
US: "*The Artillery Platform is a fixed-position cannon capable of single-handedly controlling an area from enemy assault. It should be a priority capture on any battlefield"
DE: "*The Artillery Platform is a fixed-position cannon capable of single-handedly controlling an area from enemy assault. It should be a priority capture on any battlefield"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa estación de artillería es un cañón fijo capaz de controlar por sí solo un área ante un asalto enemigo. Es prioritario tomar su control en cualquier campo de batalla."
IT: "\nLa Postazione di artiglieria è un cannone fisso capace di arrestare da solo l'avanzata nemica. Si tratta di un bersaglio primario."
KO: "\n캐논 플랫폼은 고정식 캐논이 설치되어 있고 적의 습격으로부터 방어 지역을 손쉽게\n방어하도록 도와줍니다. 전투 시에 가장 먼저 점령해야 할 건물입니다."
ZH: "\n砲兵陣地是一個位置固定的加農砲，能用單獨操控所在區域避開敵軍的攻擊。在任何戰場上，應該優先\n考慮佔領它！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina035Subtitle
US: "*A Reinforcement Pad allows a free periodic armor airdrop. Free Battlemasters can turn the tide of any battle"
DE: "*A Reinforcement Pad allows a free periodic armor airdrop. Free Battlemasters can turn the tide of any battle"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nUna plataforma de refuerzo permite el reparto periódico de blindados desde el aire. Los Battlemaster disponibles pueden decidir cualquier batalla."
IT: "\nUn Centro rinforzo fa giungere periodicamente un Battlemaster sul campo di battaglia."
KO: "\n지원군 패드는 자금 소모 없이 정기적으로 지원군을 공수 받을 수 있습니다.\n무료로 얻게 되는 배틀마스터 탱크는 전투의 흐름을 바꿀 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n一座增援機坪可提供免費的定期空投裝甲。 免費的戰神坦克可以逆轉任何戰役的局勢。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXChina036Subtitle
US: "*The Repair Bay tech building, when captured, allows battlefield repairs for any ground vehicles. Repairs for damaged armor in a forward position can make the difference between victory and defeat"
DE: "*The Repair Bay tech building, when captured, allows battlefield repairs for any ground vehicles. Repairs for damaged armor in a forward position can make the difference between victory and defeat"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nTomar un compartimento de reparación técnica permite reparar vehículos terrestres en el campo de batalla. Reparar blindados en posiciones avanzadas puede ser decisivo."
IT: "\nIl Garage, quando viene catturato, permette di riparare tutti i veicoli terrestri."
KO: "\n수리 시설 테크 빌딩은 점령할 경우 모든 지상 차량의 현장 수리가 가능해집니다.\n전쟁의 현장에서 손상된 장갑을 수리할 수 있느냐 없느냐에 따라 승패가 좌우될 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n維修機坪這個科技化的建築，當您佔領它時，可以在戰場上維修任何地面載具。在前線位置就能修復受\n損的裝甲，這個作用將決定誰勝誰負。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA001Subtitle
US: "*Be careful of the American Sentry Drone, General; it can see stealthed units and often has a mounted gun"
DE: "*Be careful of the American Sentry Drone, General; it can see stealthed units and often has a mounted gun"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCuidado con el teledirigido centinela americano, general; detecta unidades encubiertas y suele incorporar un cañón fijo."
IT: "\nAttenzione al Drone da ricognizione USA: rileva le unità mimetizzate ed è armato."
KO: "\n미국군의 센트리 드론을 조심하십시오, 장군님. 스텔스 유닛을 탐지할 수 있고 종종\n머신건을 장착하고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n小心美軍的無人哨兵機，將軍；它能夠找出隱形的軍事單位，並且不時配有一門機架式機槍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA002Subtitle
US: "*The US Microwave Tank has a beam that disables structures and units. It should be attacked by large groups only"
DE: "*The US Microwave Tank has a beam that disables structures and units. It should be attacked by large groups only"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl tanque de microondas de EE.UU. dispone de un rayo que incapacita edificios y unidades. Sólo deberían atacarlo grupos grandes."
IT: "\nIl Carro a microonde USA può disattivare unità e strutture."
KO: "\n미국군의 초단파 탱크는 건물과 유닛을 무력화 시키는 파동을 발사합니다.\n파괴하려면 많은 수의 유닛이 소모될 것입니다."
ZH: "\n美國的微波坦克會發射光束，癱瘓建築物和軍事單位。只有大型的軍團才能攻擊它。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA003Subtitle
US: "*The US Warlock Tank has a beam that disables structures and units. It should be attacked by large groups only"
DE: "*The US Warlock Tank has a beam that disables structures and units. It should be attacked by large groups only"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl tanque Warlock de EE.UU. dispone de un rayo que incapacita edificios y unidades. Sólo deberían atacarlo grupos grandes."
IT: "\nIl Carro Warlock USA può disattivare unità e strutture."
KO: "\n미국군의 워락 탱크는 건물과 유닛을 무력화 시키는 광선을 발사합니다.\n파괴하려면 많은 수의 유닛이 소모될 것입니다."
ZH: "\n美軍瘋狂坦克會發射光束，癱瘓建築物和單位。只有大型的軍團才能攻擊它。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA004Subtitle
US: "*The US Avenger is a powerful laser-base anti-air vehiclebut we have no planes, so the danger from it is minimal"
DE: "*The US Avenger is a powerful laser-base anti-air vehiclebut we have no planes, so the danger from it is minimal"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Avenger de EE.UU. es un potente vehículo láser antiaéreo... pero no tenemos aviones, así que su peligro es mínimo."
IT: "\nL'Avenger USA è un potente mezzo antiaereo laser."
KO: "\n미국군의 어벤져는 레이저 빔을 사용하는 대공 차량인데, 우리는 비행 유닛이 없기 때문에\n피해를 많이 입지는 않을 것입니다."
ZH: "\n復仇者支援車是一種威力強大、以雷射為主要武器的制空載具。但是我們已經沒有任何飛機了，所以它\n對我們的危險性很小。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA005Subtitle
US: "*The American Specter Gunship is a large plane with big guns. Do not engage it--seek refuge underground until it leaves the area"
DE: "*The American Specter Gunship is a large plane with big guns. Do not engage it--seek refuge underground until it leaves the area"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl helicóptero Spectre americano tiene grandes cañones. Evítalo; busca refugio bajo tierra hasta que abandone el área."
IT: "\nLa Cannoniera Spectre è un grande aereo pesantemente armato: affrontarlo significa suicidarsi."
KO: "\n미국군의 스펙터 건쉽은 커다란 대포를 장착한 거대한 항공기입니다.\n이 유닛을 보게 되면 맞서 싸우지 말고 그 지역에서 벗어날 때까지 숨어 있으십시오."
ZH: "\n美軍的鬼魅炮艇機是一種配有大砲的大型飛機。別跟它纏鬥，最好尋找地底藏身之處躲起來，直到它離\n開區域為止。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA006Subtitle
US: "*With the Chemical Suit upgrade, enemy infantry become more resistant to our toxins. But that won't stop our bullets, will it?"
DE: "*With the Chemical Suit upgrade, enemy infantry become more resistant to our toxins. But that won't stop our bullets, will it?"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl traje antiquímico hace más resistente a la infantería enemiga ante nuestras toxinas, pero no detendrá nuestras balas."
IT: "\nCon le Tute chimiche, la fanteria nemica diventa più resistente alle tossine."
KO: "\n방호복 업그레이드를 한 적 보병들은 우리의 독소에 더욱 저항력이 생길 것입니다.\n하지만 방호복이 방탄복은 아니지 않습니까? 총알은 막을 순 없겠죠."
ZH: "\n利用生化防護衣升級能力，敵軍的步兵就變得更能抵抗我們毒素。但是它將無法阻止我們的彈藥，是嗎？"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA007Subtitle
US: "*The Countermeasures upgrade reduces the effect of enemy fire against US air units. Missiles will often miss, and bullets do less damage"
DE: "*The Countermeasures upgrade reduces the effect of enemy fire against US air units. Missiles will often miss, and bullets do less damage"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas contramedidas reducen la eficacia del fuego enemigo contra las unidades aéreas de EE.UU. Los misiles fallan más y las balas hacen menos daño."
IT: "\nLe Contromisure USA riducono l'efficacia di tutte le armi nemiche contro le unità aeree."
KO: "\n미국군의 전자전 장비 업그레이드는 적들의 대공 사격의 효율을 감소시킵니다.\n미사일은 종종 명중하지 않고, 탄환에 입는 피해는 원래보다 감소합니다."
ZH: "\n反制裝置升級可降低敵人開火反擊空中單位時的影響力。飛彈會常常失誤，而且彈藥的殺傷力也會變弱。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA008Subtitle
US: "*The US Hellfire Drone upgrade is a little toy plane with a missile attached. Another example of American's cowardly tactics"
DE: "*The US Hellfire Drone upgrade is a little toy plane with a missile attached. Another example of American's cowardly tactics"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl teledirigido Hellfire de EE.UU. es una mejora consistente en un avioncito con un misil. Un ejemplo de la cobardía americana."
IT: "\nIl Drone Hellfire USA è un piccolo aereo senza pilota, armato con un missile."
KO: "\n미국군의 헬파이어 드론 업그레이드는 미사일이 장착된 조그마한 비행기를 유닛 주변에\n맴돌게 합니다. 미국군의 겁장이같은 전술의 또 다른 예입니다."
ZH: "\n美軍的地獄火蜂型機升級，是一架小型玩具飛機再附帶一顆飛彈而成。這只是美軍另一項膽小的戰術示\n範而已。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA009Subtitle
US: "*The Bunker Buster Bomb is an upgrade to the US Stealth Fighter and the Aurora. They use it to try to attack our bunkers"
DE: "*The Bunker Buster Bomb is an upgrade to the US Stealth Fighter and the Aurora. They use it to try to attack our bunkers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos misiles antibúnker son una mejora del caza invisible y el Aurora empleada para atacar nuestros búnkeres."
IT: "\nLa bomba Cacciatore di bunker permette ai Caccia stealth e all'Aurora di colpire i nostri Bunker."
KO: "\n벙커 버스터 폭탄은 미국군의 스텔스 전투기와 오로라 폭격기의 업그레이드입니다.\n우리의 벙커를 공격하는데 사용될 것입니다."
ZH: "\n碉堡殺手炸彈是美軍的隱形戰鬥機升級和曙光轟炸機的升級品。它們用這種炸彈試圖攻擊我們的碉堡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA010Subtitle
US: "*The Supply Lines Upgrade increases the rate that the US gathers resources from supply docks, supply drops, and oil derricks"
DE: "*The Supply Lines Upgrade increases the rate that the US gathers resources from supply docks, supply drops, and oil derricks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas líneas de suministro aceleran la captación de recursos de puertos, torres o lanzamientos desde el aire."
IT: "\nLe Linee di rifornimento aumentano la velocità di raccolta delle risorse USA."
KO: "\n보급선 업그레이드는 미국군이 서플라이 도크, 투하 지역, 원유 유정탑 등에서 자금을\n획득하는 비율을 높여줍니다."
ZH: "\n補給線升級可增加美軍從補給站、補給空投區和油井收集資源的速度。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA011Subtitle
US: "*The US Leaflet Drop temporarily disables our units as they stop to read the propaganda"
DE: "*The US Leaflet Drop temporarily disables our units as they stop to read the propaganda"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl lanzamiento de propaganda de EE.UU. inhabilita temporalmente a las unidades mientras la leen."
IT: "\nIl Lancio di volantini propagandistici USA blocca temporaneamente tutte le nostre unità."
KO: "\n미국군의 선전물 투하는 적 병사들이 멈추어 선전물을 읽는 동안 유닛들을\n무력화 시킬 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n美軍的空投傳單可以暫時癱瘓我們的軍事單位，因為他們會停下來去閱讀傳單內的思想強化內容。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA012Subtitle
US: "*The MOAB is an upgrade to the Fuel Air Bomb that includes a stun ability, temporarily shutting down surviving units and structures"
DE: "*The MOAB is an upgrade to the Fuel Air Bomb that includes a stun ability, temporarily shutting down surviving units and structures"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa MDTB mejora la bomba incendiaria de EE.UU. al incapacitar por un tiempo a las unidades y edificios supervivientes."
IT: "\nLa MDTB è un aggiornamento della Bomba a benzina in grado di disattivare unità e strutture superstiti."
KO: "\nMOAB은 기화 폭탄의 업그레이드입니다. 살아남은 적 유닛과 건물을 잠시 무력화 시키는\n스턴 기능도 가지고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n炸彈之母是油氣彈的升級品，含有某種『昏迷』功效，可暫時使救援單位和建築物無法行動。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA013Subtitle
US: "*The Fire Base is the American answer to our Stinger sites...but watch out for the big cannon in the middle"
DE: "*The Fire Base is the American answer to our Stinger sites...but watch out for the big cannon in the middle"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa base de disparo es la respuesta americana a nuestros emplazamientos Stinger... Cuidado con el gran cañón central."
IT: "\nLa Base di fuoco è la versione USA della Postazione Stinger."
KO: "\n파이어 베이스는 우리의 스팅어 사이트와 같은 기능을 가집니다. 하지만 가운데에 위치한\n커다란 유탄포를 조심하십시오."
ZH: "\n火力基地是美國因應我們的針刺飛彈陣地所做的…但是還得密切注意它正中央的大型加農砲。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA014Subtitle
US: "*China's Napalm Bomb is a Helix upgrade, allowing it to drop a pair of bombs which create a large firestorm"
DE: "*China's Napalm Bomb is a Helix upgrade, allowing it to drop a pair of bombs which create a large firestorm"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa bomba de napalm china es una mejora del Helix que permite lanzar un par de bombas y crear una gran tormenta."
IT: "\nLa Bomba al napalm cinese permette all'Helix di scatenare una tempesta di fuoco."
KO: "\n중국군의 네이팜탄은 헬릭스의 업그레이드인데, 커다란 화염 폭풍 효과를 일으키는\n폭탄 한 쌍을 투하하게 됩니다."
ZH: "\n中國的汽油彈是螺旋直昇機的升級品，讓飛機能夠空投一對炸彈，產生大型火風暴。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA015Subtitle
US: "*The Listening Outpost is a slow, stealthed vehicle the China uses to find our stealthed units. Avoid them to remain hidden"
DE: "*The Listening Outpost is a slow, stealthed vehicle the China uses to find our stealthed units. Avoid them to remain hidden"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl puesto de escucha es un vehículo lento y encubierto que China emplea para localizar nuestras unidades ocultas. Evítalos para mantenerte oculto."
IT: "\nLa Postazione d'ascolto viene usata dai cinesi per localizzare le unità mimetizzate."
KO: "\n감시 아웃포스트는 느리지만 스텔스 기능을 갖춘 차량으로, 중국군이 우리의 스텔스 유닛을\n찾아내는데 사용합니다. 이 차량들이 계속 스텔스 상태로 남아있게 해서는 안됩니다."
ZH: "\n前哨監聽車是一種速度緩慢的隱形載具，中國利用它來找出我們的隱形軍事單位。避開它們就能繼續藏\n匿。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA016Subtitle
US: "*China's Helix 2 is a slow transport helicopter that can carry infantry or a single vehicle"
DE: "*China's Helix 2 is a slow transport helicopter that can carry infantry or a single vehicle"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Helix 2 chino es un helicóptero que puede llevar infantería o bien un vehículo."
IT: "\nL'Helix cinese è un elicottero che trasporta fanteria o un singolo veicolo."
KO: "\n중국군의 헬릭스 2는 수송 헬기인데, 비록 느리지만 보병과 한 대의 차량을 수송할 수\n있습니다."
ZH: "\n我們的螺旋直昇機 2 是一種速度緩慢的運輸直昇機，可以運送步兵或一架載具。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA017Subtitle
US: "*The Chinese ECM Tank is a vehicle which disrupts electronic tracking systems, diverting enemy missile fire"
DE: "*The Chinese ECM Tank is a vehicle which disrupts electronic tracking systems, diverting enemy missile fire"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl tanque CME chino altera los sistemas electrónicos y desvía misiles enemigos."
IT: "\nIl Carro ECM cinese è in grado di disturbare i sistemi di puntamento dei missili nemici."
KO: "\n중국군의 ECM 탱크는 전자 유도 시스템을 교란하여 적의 미사일을 빗나가게 합니다."
ZH: "\n中國的電子干擾坦克是一種會干擾電子追蹤系統的載具，可移轉敵人的飛彈射擊方向。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA018Subtitle
US: "*The Neutron Shell is an upgrade to the Chinese Nuke Cannon, allowing it to fire neutron shells. These shells kill all infantry, and vehicle pilots inside the blast radius"
DE: "*The Neutron Shell is an upgrade to the Chinese Nuke Cannon, allowing it to fire neutron shells. These shells kill all infantry, and vehicle pilots inside the blast radius"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl cañón de neutrones mejora los proyectiles del cañón nuclear chino. Dentro del radio afectado, aniquilarán infantería y pilotos de vehículos."
IT: "\nIl Proiettile a neutroni è un aggiornamento del Cannone nucleare. Uccide tutte le forme di vita nel raggio dell'esplosione."
KO: "\n중성자탄은 중국군 핵 캐논의 업그레이드로, 중성자탄을 발사할 수 있게 합니다.\n폭파 범위 내에 있는 보병들과 차량 운전자들을 제거합니다."
ZH: "\n中子砲彈是中國核子加農砲的升級品，可讓它發射中子砲彈。這些砲彈可以消滅它們轟炸半徑內的所有\n步兵和載具駕駛員。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA019Subtitle
US: "*China's new Systems Hack technique allows hackers to steal a random power from their enemies. Such is the downfall of depending on power to fight wars"
DE: "*China's new Systems Hack technique allows hackers to steal a random power from their enemies. Such is the downfall of depending on power to fight wars"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl nuevo pirateo de sistemas chino permite a sus hackers apropiarse del poder de sus enemigos. Es la desventaja de depender del poder para combatir."
IT: "\nGli Hacker cinesi possono rubare un potere a caso al loro nemico."
KO: "\n시스템 해킹은 중국 해커들로 하여금 적의 제너럴 특수기술 중 무작위로 한 가지를\n훔지도록 합니다. 전쟁에서 너무 제너럴 특수기술에만 의존하면 이런 점이 안좋은 것입니다."
ZH: "\n中國全新的系統入侵技術可讓駭客從他們敵人身上隨機偷取某一種將軍能力。這樣的技術，是造成純正\n武力的戰爭類型沒落的原因之一。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA020Subtitle
US: "*The Carpet Bomber is a plane that drops a series of bombs along a targeted path, decimating the enemy"
DE: "*The Carpet Bomber is a plane that drops a series of bombs along a targeted path, decimating the enemy"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl bombardero a nivel es un avión que siembra de bombas una ruta objetivo, diezmando al enemigo."
IT: "\nIl Bombardamento a tappeto decima le truppe nemiche presenti nella zona bersaglio."
KO: "\n융단 폭격기는 목표 지점까지 가는 길을 따라 폭격을 해서 모든 적을 파괴합니다."
ZH: "\n地毯式轟炸機是一種會隨著目標路徑沿路投擲一連串的炸彈、大量毀滅敵軍部隊的飛機。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA021Subtitle
US: "*The Neutron Mines are an alternative to standard Chinese Mines which disable vehicles. The mines still kill infantry as well"
DE: "*The Neutron Mines are an alternative to standard Chinese Mines which disable vehicles. The mines still kill infantry as well"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas minas de neutrones son una alternativa a las chinas corrientes; anulan vehículos y matan a la infantería"
IT: "\nLe Mine a neutroni sono un'alternativa a quelle cinesi standard:\ndisattivano i veicoli e uccidono la fanteria."
KO: "\n중성자 지뢰는 일반 중국군 지뢰의 대안으로 등장했는데, 적 차량을 무력화시키고\n근처의 보병을 제거합니다."
ZH: "\n中子地雷，是標準中國式地雷的另一種類型，能夠癱瘓載具。這種地雷也可以消滅步兵"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA022Subtitle
US: "*The Internet Center allows China's hackers to increase their effectiveness"
DE: "*The Internet Center allows China's hackers to increase their effectiveness"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl centro de internet permite a los hackers chinos aumentar su efectividad."
IT: "\nIl Centro Internet rende più efficaci gli Hacker cinesi."
KO: "\n인터넷 센터는 중국의 해커들의 효율성을 높여줍니다."
ZH: "\n網際網路中心可讓中國的駭客增加他們的效率。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA023Subtitle
US: "*The Satellite Hack I is an internet Center upgrade that allows China to see every opponent's Command Center"
DE: "*The Satellite Hack I is an internet Center upgrade that allows China to see every opponent's Command Center"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl pirateo de satélite I es una mejora del centro de Internet que permite a China ver el centro de mando de cada oponente"
IT: "\nViolazione satellite I rivela alla Cina la posizione\ndi tutti i Centri comando nemici."
KO: "\n위성 해킹 1은 인터넷 센터에서 업그레이드 할 수 있고,모든 적의 커맨드 센터의 위치를\n보여줍니다."
ZH: "\n衛星侵入 I 是一種網際網路中心的升級品，可以讓中國軍隊看到每個對手的指揮中心"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA024Subtitle
US: "*The Satellite Hack II is a Chinese Internet Center upgrade that grants a temporary reveal of the entire map, as well as revealing stealthed objects"
DE: "*The Satellite Hack II is a Chinese Internet Center upgrade that grants a temporary reveal of the entire map, as well as revealing stealthed objects"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl pirateo de satélite II es una mejora del centro de internet chino que revela temporalmente todo el mapa, incluyendo objetos ocultos."
IT: "\nViolazione satellite II rivela temporaneamente alla Cina tutta la mappa, unità mimetizzate comprese."
KO: "\n위성 해킹 2는 인터넷 센터에서 업그레이드 할 수 있고, 잠시동안 전 지도에 있는\n스텔스 상태인 것들을 포함한 모든 유닛과 건물을 표시해줍니다."
ZH: "\n衛星侵入II 是一種中國網際網路中心的升級品，可暫時性的顯示整個地圖，也可以顯示隱形的物件。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA025Subtitle
US: "*The Saboteur is a stealth unit that can climb cliffs and effect enemy buildings by entering them"
DE: "*The Saboteur is a stealth unit that can climb cliffs and effect enemy buildings by entering them"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl saboteador es una unidad encubierta que escala barrancos y opera entrando en edificios del enemigo."
IT: "\nIl Sabotatore è un'unità nemica in grado di sabotare le strutture nemiche entrando al loro interno."
KO: "\n새보터는 절벽을 탈 수 있는 스텔스 유닛으로 적의 건물에 들어가 영향을 미칠 수 있는\n유닛입니다."
ZH: "\n破壞者是一種隱形的軍事單位，可以攀越懸崖峭壁，也可以入侵敵軍建築物加以破壞。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA026Subtitle
US: "*Our new Combat Cycle has mounted machine guns and is enhanced by the abilities of any infantry riding it"
DE: "*Our new Combat Cycle has mounted machine guns and is enhanced by the abilities of any infantry riding it"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestra nueva moto de combate incorpora ametralladoras y puede ser conducida por un soldado de infantería."
IT: "\nLa nostra nuova Moto da combattimento monta una mitragliatrice e sfrutta le abilità del suo pilota."
KO: "\n우리의 새로운 컴뱃 사이클은 머신건을 탑재하고, 탑승한 유닛의 속성에 따라 여러가지\n기능을 가집니다."
ZH: "\n我們全新的戰鬥摩托車已經安裝了機關槍，而且其能力也加以強化，任何步兵都能騎乘。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA027Subtitle
US: "*The Battle Bus is a slow moving transport that can hold up to 8 infantry, who may fire out of the bus. If destroyed, the hull of the Battle Bus remains and functions like a bunker"
DE: "*The Battle Bus is a slow moving transport that can hold up to 8 infantry, who may fire out of the bus. If destroyed, the hull of the Battle Bus remains and functions like a bunker"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl bus de combate lleva hasta a 8 de infantería que pueden disparar desde dentro. En caso de destrucción, el armazón actúa como búnker."
IT: "\nL'Autobus da battaglia ospita fino a 8 soldati. Se viene distrutto, diventa un Bunker."
KO: "\n배틀 버스는 최대 8명의 보병을 수송할 수 있는 느린 운송수단으로, 보병들은 차 안에서\n사격을 할 수 있습니다. 파괴되면 차체의 잔해가 벙커와 같은 역할을 수행합니다."
ZH: "\n戰鬥巴士是一種移動緩慢的交通工具，最多可搭載八名步兵，他們可以在巴士內向外射擊。假如車子被\n摧毀，這個戰鬥巴士的外殼仍會像碉堡一樣完好無缺，繼續運作。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA028Subtitle
US: "*The Worker Shoes upgrade increase speed and gathering efficiency for all our loyal workers"
DE: "*The Worker Shoes upgrade increase speed and gathering efficiency for all our loyal workers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa mejora de las botas de trabajador aumenta la eficiencia recolectora de nuestros leales obreros."
IT: "\nLe Scarpe da operaio li rendono più efficaci sul lavoro."
KO: "\n일꾼 신발 업그레이드는 우리의 충성스러운 일꾼들의 이동 속도와 서플라이 수집의\n효율을 높일 것입니다."
ZH: "\n工人鞋這種升級配備，可以替我們所有忠心的勞工增加速度和收集資源的效率。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA029Subtitle
US: "*The Camo Netting is an upgrade to our base defense structures, allowing them to be stealthed"
DE: "*The Camo Netting is an upgrade to our base defense structures, allowing them to be stealthed"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa red de camuflaje es una mejora de las defensas de la base que permite encubrirlas."
IT: "\nLa Rete mimetica nasconde le difese della nostra base."
KO: "\n위장망은 우리의 기지 방어 건물의 업그레이드로, 건물이 스텔스 상태를 유지하게 해줍니다."
ZH: "\n偽裝網是我們基地防禦建築的升級品，可以使它們隱形。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA030Subtitle
US: "*The Elite Guard Upgrade is a structure ability, garrisoning the structure with 4 RPG Troopers"
DE: "*The Elite Guard Upgrade is a structure ability, garrisoning the structure with 4 RPG Troopers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa mejora de guardia de élite guarnece el edificio dotándolo de 4 soldados RPG."
IT: "\nLe Guardie d'élite proteggono le strutture con 4 soldati armati con RPG."
KO: "\n엘리트 가드 업그레이드는 건물에 4명의 RPG 트루퍼를 주둔시킬 수 있게 합니다."
ZH: "\n精英守衛升級是一種建築能力，用四位火箭兵來駐守建築物。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA031Subtitle
US: "*The Booby Trap is an upgrade to the rebel, allowing the unit to wire structures and civilian vehicles to explode when the enemy attempts to capture or garrison them. Captured structures are automatically booby trapped"
DE: "*The Booby Trap is an upgrade to the rebel, allowing the unit to wire structures and civilian vehicles to explode when the enemy attempts to capture or garrison them. Captured structures are automatically booby trapped"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa trampa explosiva es una mejora rebelde que permite alambrar estructuras y vehículos civiles para que exploten cuando el enemigo se apropie de ellos. Se colocan automáticamente en los edificios tomados."
IT: "\nL'Ordigno esplosivo permette al Ribelle di far saltare i veicoli civili quando il nemico cerca di utilizzarli."
KO: "\n부비 트랩은 반군의 업그레이드로, 건물과 민간 차량 등에 폭발물을 연동시켜서 적이\n건물을 점령하거나 차량을 탈취하려고 할 때 폭발하게 만들 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n詭雷是反抗軍的升級品，當敵人試圖佔領或駐守建築物與一般載具時，詭雷可以讓反抗軍引爆它們。被\n佔領的建築物會自動設下陷阱。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA032Subtitle
US: "*Fake Structures can be built for a greatly reduced cost. These buildings are initially a booby-trapped façade, but can be upgraded to fully functional versions of the structure"
DE: "*Fake Structures can be built for a greatly reduced cost. These buildings are initially a booby-trapped façade, but can be upgraded to fully functional versions of the structure"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos edificios falsos tienen un bajo coste. Son fachadas con trampas explosivas, pero pueden convertirse en edificios funcionales."
IT: "\nLe false strutture sono inizialmente delle trappole esplosive, ma si possono anche tramutare in edifici operativi."
KO: "\n위장 건물은 매우 저렴한 비용으로 건설할 수 있습니다. 이 건물들은 부비 트랩이 설치된\n빈 껍데기뿐인 건물이지만 업그레이드 할 경우 실제 건물이 될 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n可以建造假建築大幅節省成本。這些建築物剛開始時是一種表面陷阱，但是也可以升級成可完全運作的\n建築物版本。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA033Subtitle
US: "*Our newly acquired GPS Scrambler targets an area of units and renders them invisible to enemies"
DE: "*Our newly acquired GPS Scrambler targets an area of units and renders them invisible to enemies"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestro nuevo codificador GPS oculta a un grupo de unidades ante el enemigo."
IT: "\nLa nuova Interferenza GPS rende invisibili al nemico le unità presenti in una determinata zona."
KO: "\n새로 생긴 GPS 교란 장치는 한 무리의 유닛을 적에게 보이지 않게 해줄 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n我們最新取得的GPS干擾器可以瞄準一個區域內的軍事單位，而且讓敵軍看不見他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA034Subtitle
US: "*Our Sneak Attack allows placement of a defenseless tunnel network at any area that has been explored. Although slightly weaker than a normal tunnel, it is connected to the main network"
DE: "*Our Sneak Attack allows placement of a defenseless tunnel network at any area that has been explored. Although slightly weaker than a normal tunnel, it is connected to the main network"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nNuestro ataque furtivo permite crear una red de túneles sin defensas en un área explorada. Es más débil que un túnel normal, pero conecta con la red principal."
IT: "\nL'Attacco furtivo permette ai generali dell'ELG di posizionare una Rete di tunnel in qualsiasi luogo esplorato."
KO: "\n잠입 공격 능력으로 GLA는 지도 상의 이미 탐색한 지점들 어느 곳에든지 방어 병력이 없는\n터널 네트워크를 건설합니다. 비록 약하지만 모든 네트워크와 연결됩니다."
ZH: "\n我們的偷襲能力能讓我們設置一個不受任何防守的地道網路系統，在所經過的任何區域皆可。雖然比一\n條普通地道稍微脆弱，但它是與主要網路相連的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA035Subtitle
US: "*The Artillery Platform fires a weapon similar to the US Strategy Center in terms of range and damage. Capture or avoid its deadly cannon"
DE: "*The Artillery Platform fires a weapon similar to the US Strategy Center in terms of range and damage. Capture or avoid its deadly cannon"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa estación de artillería se parece al centro de estrategia de EE.UU. en alcance y daño. Captura su letal cañón o evítalo."
IT: "\nLa Postazione di artiglieria è simile al Centro strategico USA, come portata e danno."
KO: "\n캐논 플랫폼은 사정거리와 파괴력이 미국군 전략 센터의 배틀 캐논과 유사한 캐논을\n발사합니다. 이 캐논을 점령하던지 아니면 피해 가십시오."
ZH: "\n這個砲兵陣地所發射的武器，與美國戰略中心所用的武器在射程和傷害力上都很雷同。要不就佔領它，\n不然就是躲開它致命的加農砲！"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA036Subtitle
US: "*The Reinforcement Pad periodically delivers a group of Scorpion tanks for our cause"
DE: "*The Reinforcement Pad periodically delivers a group of Scorpion tanks for our cause"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa plataforma de refuerzos permite el suministro periódico de un grupo de tanques Scorpion para nuestra causa."
IT: "\nIl Centro rinforzo invia periodicamente in battaglia dei carri Scorpion."
KO: "\n지원군 패드에는 자금 소모 없이 정기적으로 스콜피온 탱크가 공수됩니다."
ZH: "\n增援機坪會定期投遞一組天蠍坦克供我們使用。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXGLA037Subtitle
US: "*The Repair Bay is a front-line repair facility for vehicles. It repairs vehicles like an Arms Dealer"
DE: "*The Repair Bay is a front-line repair facility for vehicles. It repairs vehicles like an Arms Dealer"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl compartimento de reparación permite reparar vehículos en el frente. Repara vehículos como una tienda de armas."
IT: "\nIl Garage permette di riparare i veicoli, esattamente come il Trafficante d'armi."
KO: "\n수리 시설은 최전방의 차량 수리 시설입니다. 무기상과 같이 차량을 수리합니다."
ZH: "\n維修機坪是一種在戰地前線的載具維修工廠。它就像軍火商一樣，能夠修復所有載具。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA001Subtitle
US: "*The Sentry Drone is a mobile unit capable of tracking enemy movements, including those that are camouflaged. The Sentry Drone itself is also capable of stealth when not moving, and may be upgraded with an anti-personnel machine gun from the strategy center"
DE: "*The Sentry Drone is a mobile unit capable of tracking enemy movements, including those that are camouflaged. The Sentry Drone itself is also capable of stealth when not moving, and may be upgraded with an anti-personnel machine gun from the strategy center"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl teledirigido centinela es una unidad móvil que rastrea el movimiento enemigo, incluso el camuflado. Es invisible si no se desplaza y puede incorporar una ametralladora antipersonal."
IT: "\nIl Drone da ricognizione è un'unità mobile capace di rilevare i movimenti delle unità nemiche, anche mimetizzate. Quando è fermo, può essere armato con una mitragliatrice."
KO: "\n센트리 드론은 위장된 적을 포함해 모든 적들의 움직임을 추적할 수 있는 이동 유닛입니다.\n정지 상태에서 스텔스를 유지하고 전략 센터에서 업그레이드하여 머신건 장착이 가능합니다."
ZH: "\n無人哨兵機是一種機動單位，能夠追蹤敵人的行動，包括那些偽裝者。無人哨兵機不移動時，本身也可\n以隱形，而且還可以使用戰略中心研發出升級的殺傷性機關槍。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA002Subtitle
US: "*The Microwave Tank is armed with a Direct-Energy microwave panel that disables targeted structures and vehicles. It also emits a continuous microwave field which damages infantry"
DE: "*The Microwave Tank is armed with a Direct-Energy microwave panel that disables targeted structures and vehicles. It also emits a continuous microwave field which damages infantry"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl tanque de microondas está armado con un panel de microondas y es efectivo contra edificios y vehículos. Su campo continuo daña a la infantería."
IT: "\nIl Carro a microonde può disattivare strutture e veicoli, uccidendo la fanteria."
KO: "\n초단파 탱크는 목표 건물과 차량을 무력화 시키는 초단파 발산 패널을 장착했습니다.\n이 유닛이 끊임없이 발산하는 초단파는 보병에게도 손상을 입힙니다."
ZH: "\n微波坦克用直接能源的微波控制盤武裝起來，可以癱瘓預定攻擊的建築物和載具。它也可以發射連續的\n微波場傷害步兵。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA003Subtitle
US: "*The Warlock tank is armed with a Direct-Energy microwave panel that disables targeted structures and vehicles. It also emits a continuous microwave field which damages infantry"
DE: "*The Warlock tank is armed with a Direct-Energy microwave panel that disables targeted structures and vehicles. It also emits a continuous microwave field which damages infantry"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl tanque Warlock está armado con un panel de microondas y es efectivo contra edificios y vehículos. Su campo continuo daña a la infantería."
IT: "\nIl Carro Warlock può disattivare strutture e veicoli, uccidendo la fanteria."
KO: "\n워락 탱크는 목표 건물과 차량을 무력화 시키는 초단파 발산 패널을 장착했습니다.\n이 유닛이 끊임없이 발산하는 초단파는 보병에게도 손상을 입힙니다."
ZH: "\n瘋狂坦克會用直接能源的微波控制盤做好武裝，可以癱瘓預定攻擊的建築物和載具。它也可以發射連續\n的微波場傷害步兵。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA004Subtitle
US: "*The Avenger is a laser based anti-air vehicle able to shoot down missiles and aircraft. It can also award bonuses to units attacking it's \"painted\" target"
DE: "*The Avenger is a laser based anti-air vehicle able to shoot down missiles and aircraft. It can also award bonuses to units attacking it's \"painted\" target"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Avenger es un vehículo láser antiaéreo capaz de derribar misiles y aviones Puede otorgar bonus a otras unidades que ataquen su diana \"\"pintada\"\"\""
IT: "\nL'Avenger è un mezzo antiaereo laser, con capacità antimissile."
KO: "\n어벤져는 미사일과 항공기를 격추시키는 레이저 대공 무기입니다. 또한 우선 순위가 높은\n표적에 표시를 하여 다른 미국 유닛들이 적 항공기들에 조준하는 것을 도와줍니다."
ZH: "\n復仇者支援車是一種威力強大、以雷射為主要武器的制空載具，能夠擊落飛彈和飛機。攻擊復仇者支援\n車的軍事單位，如果攻擊它的 \"被照亮的\"目標，也有可能獲得獎賞紅利。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA005Subtitle
US: "*The Specter Gunship is a large jet powered aircraft with multiple weapon systems fixed to it's wings. While it circles the target, it auto-acquires enemies. Manual targeting is allowed, and it can upgrade to deploy countermeasures"
DE: "*The Specter Gunship is a large jet powered aircraft with multiple weapon systems fixed to it's wings. While it circles the target, it auto-acquires enemies. Manual targeting is allowed, and it can upgrade to deploy countermeasures"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl helicóptero Spectre a reacción tiene numeroso armamento en sus alas. Rodea al objetivo identificando enemigos automáticamente. Permite fijar objetivos manualmente y se puede mejorar con contramedidas."
IT: "\nLa Cannoniera Spectre è un potente velivolo con sistemi d'arma multipli. Dispone di un puntamento automatico e può essere aggiornato con le Contromisure."
KO: "\n스펙터 건쉽은 다중 무기 체계를 기체 옆면에 장착한 커다란 제트기로, 목표물 상공을\n선회하며 적을 자동 포착합니다. 수동 조준과 전자전 장비 업그레이드도 가능합니다."
ZH: "\n鬼魅炮艇機是一種大型、以噴射引擎為動力的飛機，有多種武器系統安裝在它的機翼上。當它環繞目標\n時，它會自動俘虜敵人。也可以用手控來瞄準目標，而且能升級為可再配置反制裝置。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA006Subtitle
US: "*With the Chemical Suit upgrade, infantry become more resistant to toxins and radiation"
DE: "*With the Chemical Suit upgrade, infantry become more resistant to toxins and radiation"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl traje antiquímico hace que la infantería resista mejor toxinas y radiación."
IT: "\nCon la Tuta chimica, la fanteria resiste meglio a tossine e radiazioni."
KO: "\n방호복 업그레이드로 보병 유닛은 독소와 방사능을 견딜 수 있게 됩니다."
ZH: "\n利用生化防護衣升級能力，敵軍的步兵就變得更能抵抗毒素和放射線。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA007Subtitle
US: "*The Countermeasures upgrade reduces the effect of enemy fire against US air units. Missiles will often miss, and bullets do less damage"
DE: "*The Countermeasures upgrade reduces the effect of enemy fire against US air units. Missiles will often miss, and bullets do less damage"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas contramedidas reducen la eficacia del fuego enemigo contra las unidades aéreas de EE.UU. Los misiles fallan más y las balas hacen menos daño."
IT: "\nLe Contromisure riducono l'effetto del fuoco nemico contro le unità USA."
KO: "\n미국군의 전자전 장비 업그레이드는 적들의 대공 사격의 효율을 감소시킵니다.\n미사일은 종종 명중하지 않고, 탄환에 입는 피해는 원래보다 감소합니다."
ZH: "\n反制裝置升級，可降低敵人開火反擊空中單位時的效率。飛彈會常常失誤，而且彈藥彈的殺傷力也會變\n弱。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA008Subtitle
US: "*The Hellfire Drone upgrade equips the parent vehicle with a drone capable of firing a single missile. The drones auto-acquire and require time to reload"
DE: "*The Hellfire Drone upgrade equips the parent vehicle with a drone capable of firing a single missile. The drones auto-aqcuire and require time to reload"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Hellfire puede mejorarse dotándolo de un teledirigido capaz de disparar un misil. Los teledirigidos apuntan automáticamente y necesitan un tiempo de recarga."
IT: "\nIl Drone Hellfire è armato con un missile singolo. Dispone di puntamento automatico."
KO: "\n헬파이어 드론 업그레이드는 모체에 미사일 발사가 가능한 드론을 탑재시킵니다.\n드론들은 목표를 자동 포착하고 재장전 하는데 시간이 소요됩니다."
ZH: "\n地獄火蜂型機升級，除了原先的主機之外，會再多配備一架能發射一顆飛彈的無人飛機。飛機會自動取\n得飛彈，並要求時間重新裝填。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA009Subtitle
US: "*The Bunker Buster is an upgrade to the Stealth Fighter and the Aurora. In addition to their normal effects, these upgraded missiles damage and even kill units garrisoned within structures, including the GLA Palace, Tunnel Network, and the Chinese Battle Bunker"
DE: "*The Bunker Buster is an upgrade to the Stealth Fighter and the Aurora. In addition to their normal effects, these upgraded missiles damage and even kill units garrisoned within structures, including the GLA Palace, Tunnel Network, and the Chinese Battle Bunker"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl antibúnker es un misil mejorado del caza invisible y el Aurora que daña e incluso aniquila unidades guarnecidas en edificios como la red de túneles, el palacio del GLA o el búnker de combate chino."
IT: "\nIl Cacciatore di bunker è un aggiornamento del Caccia stealth e dell'Aurora, in grado di colpire edifici presidiati uccidendo le truppe al loro interno."
KO: "\n벙커 버스터는 미국군의 스텔스 전투기와 오로라 폭격기의 업그레이드 기능입니다.\n이 미사일은 GLA의 궁전, 터널 네트워크, 중국의 배틀 벙커 안에 있는 유닛들까지 파괴합니다."
ZH: "\n碉堡殺手是美軍隱形戰鬥機升級和曙光轟炸機的升級品。除了具有它們的一般功效外，這些升級的飛彈\n可以傷害、甚至消滅建築物內的駐守單位，包括全球解放軍的皇宮、地道網路系統和中國碉堡殺手。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA010Subtitle
US: "*The Supply Lines Upgrade increases the amount of money gathered from supply docks, supply drops, and oil derricks"
DE: "*The Supply Lines Upgrade increases the amount of money gathered from supply docks, supply drops, and oil derricks"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas líneas de suministro aumentan la cantidad de dinero obtenido de puertos, torres o lanzamientos desde el aire."
IT: "\nLe Linee di rifornimento aumentano la velocità di raccolta delle risorse."
KO: "\n보급선 업그레이드는 서플라이 도크, 투하 지역, 원유 유정탑 등에의 자금 획득량을\n증가시킵니다."
ZH: "\n補給線升級可增加從補給站、補給空投區和油井收集到的金錢數量。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA011Subtitle
US: "*The Leaflet Drop temporarily disables units as they stop to read the propaganda. The plane dispenses leaflets over the targeted area and the effect only lasts a short time"
DE: "*The Leaflet Drop temporarily disables units as they stop to read the propaganda. The plane dispenses leaflets over the targeted area and the effect only lasts a short time"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl lanzamiento de propaganda inhabilita brevemente a las unidades mientras se detienen a leer los folletos distribuidos por el avión."
IT: "\nIl Lancio di volantini USA blocca temporaneamente tutte le unità nemiche."
KO: "\n선전물 투하는 적들이 멈춰서 선전물을 읽을 동안 그 유닛들을 무력화 시킵니다.\n비행기가 선전물을 목표 지역 부근에 투하하고 그 효과는 아주 잠시 지속됩니다."
ZH: "\n空投傳單可以暫時癱瘓軍事單位，因為他們會停下來去閱讀傳單內的思想強化內容。這架飛機會在指定\n區域分發傳單，效果只會持續一會兒。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA012Subtitle
US: "*The MOAB is an upgrade to the Fuel Air Bomb that includes a stun ability, temporarily shutting down surviving units and structures"
DE: "*The MOAB is an upgrade to the Fuel Air Bomb that includes a stun ability, temporarily shutting down surviving units and structures"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa MDTB mejora la bomba incendiaria de EE.UU. al incapacitar por un tiempo a las unidades y edificios supervivientes."
IT: "\nLa MDTB è un aggiornamento della Bomba a benzina in grado di disattivare unità e strutture superstiti."
KO: "\nMOAB은 기화 폭탄의 업그레이드입니다. 살아남은 적 유닛과 건물을 잠시 무력화 시키는\n스턴 기능도 가지고 있습니다."
ZH: "\n炸彈之母是油氣彈的升級品，含有某種『昏迷』功效，可暫時使救援單位和建築物無法行動。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA013Subtitle
US: "*The Fire Base is surrounded by sandbags and includes a howitzer and 4 firing positions. Infantry entering the Fire Base will take firing positions behind the sandbags"
DE: "*The Fire Base is surrounded by sandbags and includes a howitzer and 4 firing positions. Infantry entering the Fire Base will take firing positions behind the sandbags"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa base de disparo está rodeada por sacos de arena e incluye un cañón y 4 posiciones de tiro que ocupará la infantería que entre."
IT: "\nLa Base di fuoco è dotata di un howitzer e di 4 postazioni di fuoco. La fanteria dispone di sacchi di sabbia come protezione."
KO: "\n파이어 베이스 건물은 유탄포 한 대와 4개의 사격 지점을 갖추고 모래주머니로 둘러싸인\n방어 시설입니다. 파이어 베이스에 들어간 보병들은 모래주머니 뒤에서 사격을 할 것입니다."
ZH: "\n火力基地的四周由沙袋圍住，有一顆榴彈砲和四個發射位置。進入火力基地的步兵，將會待在沙包後面\n的發射位置。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA014Subtitle
US: "*The Napalm Bomb is a Helix upgrade, allowing it to drop a pair of bombs which create a large firestorm"
DE: "*The Napalm Bomb is a Helix upgrade, allowing it to drop a pair of bombs which create a large firestorm"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa bomba de napalm es una mejora del Helix que permite lanzar un par de bombas y crear una gran tormenta."
IT: "\nLa Bomba al napalm è un aggiornamento dell'Helix e consente di scatenare una tempesta di fuoco."
KO: "\n네이팜탄은 헬릭스의 업그레이드인데, 커다란 화염 폭풍 효과를 일으키는 폭탄 한 쌍을\n투하하게 됩니다."
ZH: "\n汽油彈是螺旋直昇機的升級品，讓飛機能夠空投一對炸彈，產生大型火風暴。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA015Subtitle
US: "*The Listening Outpost is a slow, stealthed vehicle with a large sight radius, and can be garrisoned with 2 infantry as guards. Besides uncovering stealthed objects, it can be used to determine enemy destinations by clicking on units in range"
DE: "*The Listening Outpost is a slow, stealthed vehicle with a large sight radius, and can be garrisoned with 2 infantry as guards. Besides uncovering stealthed objects, it can be used to determine enemy destinations by clicking on units in range"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl puesto de escucha es un vehículo lento y encubierto con un gran campo de visión y 2 guardias de infantería. Revela objetos ocultos y determina el destino de las unidades enemigas a la vista."
IT: "\nLa Postazione d'ascolto è un veicolo mimetizzato con ampio campo visivo, con due soldati a bordo. Oltre a rilevare i nemici mimetizzati, puoi scoprirne le destinazioni con un clic."
KO: "\n감시 아웃포스트는 느리지만 스텔스 기능을 갖춘 차량으로, 2명의 보병을 태울 수 있습니다.\n스텔스 유닛을 드러내거나 범위 내의 적을 클릭하여 적의 목적지를 알아낼 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n前哨監聽車是一種速度緩慢的隱形載具，具有寬廣的瞄準半徑，可以派兩名步兵充當警衛來駐守。除了\n能夠讓使隱形物件現身，點選它有效距離內的單位，可用來確定敵人方位。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA016Subtitle
US: "*The Helix 2 is a slow transport helicopter that can carry infantry or a single vehicle. Although armed with a light machine gun, it can be upgraded with the Gattling Cannon, Propaganda Tower, or Battle Bunker. It can also be upgraded to carry a large napalm bomb"
DE: "*The Helix 2 is a slow transport helicopter that can carry infantry or a single vehicle. Although armed with a light machine gun, it can be upgraded with the Gattling Cannon, Propaganda Tower, or Battle Bunker. It can also be upgraded to carry a large napalm bomb"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl Helix 2 es un helicóptero que puede llevar infantería o bien un vehículo. Está armado con una ametralladora ligera, pero puede mejorarse con un cañón Gattling, una torre de propaganda, un búnker de combate o una gran bomba de napalm."
IT: "\nIl velivolo Helix è un elicottero da trasporto per fanteria o veicoli singoli. Può ricevere come aggiornamenti Cannone gatling, Diffusore, Bunker da battaglia e Bomba al napalm."
KO: "\n헬릭스 2는 보병이나 차량을 실어 나르는 느린 수송용 헬기입니다. 머신건으로 무장하였고\n개틀링 캐논, 프로퍼갠더 타워, 배틀 벙커, 네이팜탄 투하 등의 업그레이드가 가능합니다."
ZH: "\n螺旋直昇機 2 是一種速度緩慢的運輸直昇機，可以運送步兵或一架載具。雖然裝配輕型機關槍，它仍然\n可以加上蓋特砲、思想強化電塔或戰鬥碉堡加以升級。它也可以升級用來攜帶一顆大型汽油彈。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA017Subtitle
US: "*The ECM Tank is a vehicle which disrupts electronic tracking systems, diverting enemy missile fire. It's ECM pulse can be used to disable single enemy vehicles. Finally, it creates a radar jamming field, disabling all drones within its range"
DE: "*The ECM Tank is a vehicle which disrupts electronic tracking systems, diverting enemy missile fire. It's ECM pulse can be used to disable single enemy vehicles. Finally, it creates a radar jamming field, disabling all drones within its range"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl tanque CME altera los sistemas electrónicos de seguimiento, desvía misiles enemigos e inhabilita vehículos individuales y aparatos teledirigidos."
IT: "\nIl Carro ECM è un veicolo in grado di disturbare i sistemi di puntamento nemici. Disattiva inoltre tutti i Droni entro il suo raggio d'azione."
KO: "\nECM 탱크는 전자 추적 시스템을 교란하여 적의 미사일을 궤도에서 이탈하게 합니다. 또한\n전자기파를 발사하여 적차량과 드론을 무력화시킬 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n電子干擾坦克是一種會干擾電子追蹤系統的載具，可移轉敵人的飛彈射擊方向。它的電磁脈衝可用來癱\n瘓一部敵軍載具。最後要說的是，它也可以製造人為雷達干擾場域，癱瘓有效距離內的所有無人飛機。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA018Subtitle
US: "*The Neutron Shell is an upgrade to the Chinese Nuke Cannon, allowing it to fire neutron shells. These shells kill all infantry, and vehicle pilots inside the blast radius"
DE: "*The Neutron Shell is an upgrade to the Chinese Nuke Cannon, allowing it to fire neutron shells. These shells kill all infantry, and vehicle pilots inside the blast radius"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl cañón de neutrones mejora los proyectiles del cañón nuclear chino. Dentro del radio afectado, aniquilarán infantería y pilotos de vehículos."
IT: "\nIl Proiettile a neutroni è un aggiornamento del Cannone nucleare cinese. Uccide tutte le forme di vita nel raggio dell'esplosione."
KO: "\n중성자탄은 중국군 핵 캐논의 업그레이드로, 중성자탄을 발사할 수 있게 합니다.\n폭파 범위 내에 있는 보병들과 차량 운전자들을 제거합니다."
ZH: "\n中子砲彈是中國核子加農砲的升級品，可讓它發射中子砲彈。這些砲彈可以消滅它們轟炸半徑內的所有\n步兵和載具駕駛員。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA019Subtitle
US: "*The Systems Hack allows your hackers to steal a random power from your enemies. Level 1 allows theft of a tier 1 or 3 power, while level 2 allows theft of a 5-star power"
DE: "*The Systems Hack allows your hackers to steal a random power from your enemies. Level 1 allows theft of a tier 1 or 3 power, while level 2 allows theft of a 5-star power"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nCon el pirateo de sistema, tus hackers se apropian del poder de un general enemigo al azar. El nivel 1 permite acceder al poder de 1-3 estrellas, mientras que el nivel 2 alcanza las 5."
IT: "\nGli Hacker, violando i sistemi, rubano un potere qualsiasi del Generale. A livello 1 rubano un potere a 1 o 3 stelle, a livello 2 un potere a 5 stelle."
KO: "\n시스템 해킹은 아군의 해커들로 하여금 적의 제너럴 특수기술 중 무작위로 한 가지를\n훔치도록 합니다. 레벨 1은 대위 또는 중령, 레벨 2는 준장의 파워를 훔칠 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n系統入侵能力可讓您的駭客從我們敵軍身上隨機偷取某一種將軍能力。等級一可以竊取一項一星級或三\n星級的能力，而等級二可以盜取一項五星級的能力。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA020Subtitle
US: "*The Carpet Bomber is a plane that drops a series of bombs along a targeted path, decimating the enemy"
DE: "*The Carpet Bomber is a plane that drops a series of bombs along a targeted path, decimating the enemy"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl bombardero a nivel es un avión que siembra de bombas una ruta objetivo, diezmando al enemigo."
IT: "\nIl Bombardamento a tappeto decima le truppe nemiche presenti nella zona bersaglio."
KO: "\n융단 폭격기는 목표 지점까지 가는 길을 따라 폭격을 해서 모든 적을 파괴합니다."
ZH: "\n地毯式轟炸機是一種會隨著目標路徑沿路投擲一連串的炸彈、大量毀滅敵軍部隊的飛機。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA021Subtitle
US: "*The Neutron Mines are an alternative to standard Chinese Mines which disable vehicles. The mines still kill infantry as well"
DE: "*The Neutron Mines are an alternative to standard Chinese Mines which disable vehicles. The mines still kill infantry as well"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLas minas de neutrones son una alternativa a las chinas corrientes; anulan vehículos y matan a la infantería"
IT: "\nLe Mine a neutroni sono un'alternativa a quelle cinesi standard:\ndisattivano i veicoli e uccidono la fanteria."
KO: "\n중성자 지뢰는 일반 중국군 지뢰의 대안으로 등장했는데, 적 차량을 무력화시키고\n근처의 보병을 제거합니다."
ZH: "\n中子地雷，是標準中國式地雷的另一種類型，能夠癱瘓載具。這種地雷也可以消滅步兵"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA022Subtitle
US: "*The Internet Center allows hackers to increase their effectiveness at generating money, and allows the use of Satellite Hacks I & II"
DE: "*The Internet Center allows hackers to increase their effectiveness at generating money, and allows the use of Satellite Hacks I & II"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl centro de internet mejora la efectividad de los hackers en la obtención de dinero y permite el empleo del pirateo de satélite I y II."
IT: "\nIl Centro Internet rende più efficaci gli Hacker cinesi e consente di usare Violazione satellite I e II."
KO: "\n인터넷 센터는 중국의 해커들의 효율성을 높여주어 자금을 훔치고 위성 해킹 1, 2 등등을\n할 수 있도록 도와줍니다."
ZH: "\n網際網路中心可讓駭客又能賺錢，也可以增加他們的戰鬥力，而且可以使用衛星侵入 I & II 。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA023Subtitle
US: "*The Satellite Hack I is an internet Center upgrade that allows a reveal around every opponent's Command Center"
DE: "*The Satellite Hack I is an internet Center upgrade that allows a reveal around every opponent's Command Center"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl pirateo de satélite I es una mejora del centro de Internet que revela el centro de mando de cada oponente"
IT: "\nViolazione satellite I rivela la posizione\ndi tutti i Centri comando nemici."
KO: "\n위성 해킹 1은 인터넷 센터에서 업그레이드 할 수 있고,모든 적의 커맨드 센터의 위치를\n보여줍니다."
ZH: "\n衛星侵入 I 是一種網際網路中心的升級品，可以顯示每個對手的指揮中心"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA024Subtitle
US: "*The Satellite Hack II is an internet Center upgrade that grants a temporary reveal of the entire map, as well as revealing stealthed objects"
DE: "*The Satellite Hack II is an internet Center upgrade that grants a temporary reveal of the entire map, as well as revealing stealthed objects"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl pirateo de satélite II es una mejora del centro de internet que revela temporalmente todo el mapa, incluyendo objetos ocultos."
IT: "\nViolazione satellite II rivela temporaneamente tutta la mappa, unità mimetizzate comprese."
KO: "\n위성 해킹 2는 인터넷 센터에서 업그레이드 할 수 있고, 잠시동안 전 지도에 있는 스텔스\n상태인 것들을 포함한 모든 유닛과 건물을 표시해줍니다."
ZH: "\n衛星侵入II 是一種網際網路的升級品，可暫時顯示整個地圖，也可以顯示隱形的物件。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA025Subtitle
US: "*The Saboteur is a stealth unit that can climb cliffs and effect enemy buildings by entering them. Entering a power plant will temporarily cut power, while entering a superweapon will reset the timer. A saboteur who enters an enemy command center will reset the timers on all enemy General's Powers"
DE: "*The Saboteur is a stealth unit that can climb cliffs and effect enemy buildings by entering them. Entering a power plant will temporarily cut power, while entering a superweapon will reset the timer. A saboteur who enters an enemy command center will reset the timers on all enemy General's Powers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl saboteador es una unidad encubierta que escala barrancos y opera entrando en edificios del enemigo. En una central eléctrica cortará el suministro, o reiniciará la cuenta atrás en una superarma o centro de mando del enemigo."
IT: "\n*"
KO: "\n새보터는 절벽을 탈 수 있는 스텔스 유닛으로 적의 건물에 들어가 영향을 미칠 수\n있는 유닛입니다. 발전소 전력 차단, 슈퍼무기 타이머와 제너럴 특수기술 리셋이 가능합니다."
ZH: "破壞者是一種隱形的步兵單位，可以攀越懸崖峭壁，也可以入侵敵軍建築物加以破壞。侵入一座發電廠\n將會暫時停電，而入侵一項超級武器時則會重設計時器。入侵某個敵軍指揮中心的破壞者，將重新設定\n所有敵軍將軍能力的計時器"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA026Subtitle
US: "*The Combat Cycle initially comes with a Rebel driver and a mounted machine gun. Replacing him with a RPG Trooper will allow the bike to fire missiles. A Terrorist will create a suicide bike. Jarmen Kell, Hijackers, and Saboteurs can also ride, making the bike stealthed"
DE: "*The Combat Cycle initially comes with a Rebel driver and a mounted machine gun. Replacing him with a RPG Trooper will allow the bike to fire missiles. A Terrorist will create a suicide bike. Jarmen Kell, Hijackers, and Saboteurs can also ride, making the bike stealthed"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa moto de combate lleva una ametralladora fija y un conductor rebelde, pero si se reemplaza por un soldado RPG, podrá disparar misiles, mientras que con un terrorista se convertirá en un vehículo suicida. Jarmen Kell, secuestradores y saboteadores la pilotarán de forma encubierta."
IT: "\nLa Moto da combattimento è dotata di una mitragliatrice e può essere guidata da varie unità della fanteria ELG, assumendone le capacità."
KO: "\n컴뱃 사이클은 GLA 반군을 태우고 머신건을 탑재한 상태로 생산됩니다.\n반군 대신 다른 GLA 보병을 태우면 그 보병의 속성에 맞는 기능을 수행합니다."
ZH: "\n戰鬥摩托車最初是反抗軍的駕駛者所使用，配有一門機關槍。用火箭兵來取代他可讓摩托車發射飛彈。\n恐怖份子使用的話將會製成自殺摩托車。賈曼卡爾，劫機犯，和破壞也可以騎乘，並且會讓車子隱形。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA027Subtitle
US: "*The Battle Van is a slow moving transport that can hold up to 8 infantry, who may fire out of the bus. If destroyed, the hull of the Battle Van remains and functions like a bunker. If it is destroyed, anyone inside is also killed"
DE: "*The Battle Van is a slow moving transport that can hold up to 8 infantry, who may fire out of the bus. If destroyed, the hull of the Battle Van remains and functions like a bunker. If it is destroyed, anyone inside is also killed"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl bus de combate lleva hasta a 8 unidades de infantería que pueden disparar desde dentro. En caso de destrucción, el armazón actúa como búnker. Si es destruido, sus ocupantes morirán."
IT: "\nL'Autobus da battaglia ospita fino a 8 soldati. Se viene distrutto, diventa un Bunker."
KO: "\n배틀 버스는 최대 8명의 보병을 수송할 수 있는 느린 운송수단으로, 보병들은 차 안에서\n사격을 할 수 있습니다. 파괴되면 차체의 잔해가 벙커와 같은 역할을 수행합니다."
ZH: "\n戰鬥巴士是一種移動緩慢的交通工具，最多可搭載八名步兵，他們可以在巴士內向外射擊。假如車子被\n摧毀，這個戰鬥車的外殼仍會像碉堡一樣完好無缺，繼續運作。但假如它被摧毀，車內的人都會死亡。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA028Subtitle
US: "*The Worker Shoes upgrade increase speed and gathering efficiency for all GLA workers"
DE: "*The Worker Shoes upgrade increase speed and gathering efficiency for all GLA workers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa mejora de las botas de trabajador aumenta la eficiencia recolectora de los obreros del GLA."
IT: "\nLe Scarpe da operaio li rendono più efficaci sul lavoro."
KO: "\n일꾼 신발 업그레이드는 GLA 일꾼들의 이동 속도와 서플라이 수집의 효율을 높일 것입니다."
ZH: "\n工人鞋這種升級配備，可以替所有的全球解放軍工人增加速度和收集效率。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA029Subtitle
US: "*The Camo Netting is an upgrade to GLA base defense structures, allowing them to be stealthed"
DE: "*The Camo Netting is an upgrade to GLA base defense structures, allowing them to be stealthed"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa red de camuflaje es una mejora de las defensas de la base del GLA que permite encubrirlas."
IT: "\nLa Rete mimetica mimetizza le difese della base dell'ELG."
KO: "\n위장망은 GLA 방어 시설의 업그레이드로, 시설을 적의 시야에서 보이지 않게 위장합니다."
ZH: "\n偽裝網是全球解放軍基地防禦建築的升級品，可以使它們隱形。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA030Subtitle
US: "*The Elite Guard Upgrade is an structure ability, garrisoning the structure with 4 RPG Troopers"
DE: "*The Elite Guard Upgrade is an structure ability, garrisoning the structure with 4 RPG Troopers"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa mejora de guardia de élite guarnece el edificio dotándolo de 4 soldados RPG."
IT: "\nLa Guardia d'élite posiziona 4 soldati con RPG a guardia delle strutture."
KO: "\n엘리트 가드 업그레이드는 건물에 4명의 RPG 트루퍼를 주둔시킬 수 있게 합니다."
ZH: "\n精英守衛升級是一種建築能力，用四位火箭兵來駐守建築物。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA031Subtitle
US: "*The Booby Trap is an upgrade to the rebel, allowing the unit to wire structures and civilian vehicles to explode when the enemy attempts to capture or garrison them. The explosion damages everything within a small radius. Structures captured by an upgraded rebel are automatically booby trapped"
DE: "*The Booby Trap is an upgrade to the rebel, allowing the unit to wire structures and civilian vehicles to explode when the enemy attempts to capture or garrison them. The explosion damages everything within a small radius. Structures captured by an upgraded rebel are automatically booby trapped"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa trampa explosiva es una mejora rebelde que permite alambrar estructuras y vehículos civiles para que exploten cuando el enemigo se apropie de ellos. El radio dañado por la explosión es pequeño. Se colocan automáticamente en los edificios tomados por un rebelde mejorado."
IT: "\nL'Ordigno esplosivo dell'ELG permette di far saltare i veicoli civili quando il nemico cerca di utilizzarli. Tutte le strutture catturate da un ribelle aggiornato vengono automaticamente minate."
KO: "\n부비 트랩은 반군의 업그레이드로, 건물과 민간 차량 등에 폭발물을 연동시켜서\n적이 건물을 점령하거나 차량을 탈취하려고 할 때 폭발하게 만들 수 있습니다."
ZH: "詭雷是反抗軍的升級品，當敵人試圖佔領或駐守建築物與一般載具時，詭雷可以讓反抗軍引爆它們。佔\n領建築物可說是自尋死路。這個爆炸將傷害小型半徑範圍內的一切。被升級的反抗軍佔領的建築物會自\n動設下陷阱。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA032Subtitle
US: "*Fake Structures can be built for a greatly reduced cost. These buildings are initially a booby-trapped façade, but can be upgraded to fully functional versions of the structure"
DE: "*Fake Structures can be built for a greatly reduced cost. These buildings are initially a booby-trapped façade, but can be upgraded to fully functional versions of the structure"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLos edificios falsos tienen un bajo coste. Son fachadas con trampas explosivas, pero pueden convertirse en edificios funcionales."
IT: "\nLe false strutture sono inizialmente delle trappole esplosive economiche, ma si possono anche tramutare in edifici operativi."
KO: "\n위장 건물은 매우 저렴한 비용으로 건설할 수 있습니다. 이 건물들은 부비 트랩이 설치된\n빈 껍데기뿐인 건물이지만 업그레이드 할 경우 실제 건물이 될 수 있습니다."
ZH: "\n可以建造假建築大幅節省成本。這些建築物剛開始時是一種表面陷阱，但是也可以升級成可完全運作的\n建築物版本。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA033Subtitle
US: "*The GPS Scrambler targets an area of units and renders them stealthed to enemies"
DE: "*The GPS Scrambler targets an area of units and renders them stealthed to enemies"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl codificador GPS enfocado hacia un grupo de unidades las hace invisibles ante los enemigos."
IT: "\nL'Interferenza GPS rende invisibile un gruppo di unità."
KO: "\nGPS 교란 장치는 범위 내의 유닛을 적의 시야에 보이지 않도록 위장합니다."
ZH: "\nGPS干擾器可以瞄準一個區域內的軍事單位，而且讓敵軍看不見他們。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA034Subtitle
US: "*The Sneak Attack allows placement of a defenseless tunnel network at any area that has been explored. Although slightly weaker than a normal tunnel, it is connected to the main network"
DE: "*The Sneak Attack allows placement of a defenseless tunnel network at any area that has been explored. Although slightly weaker than a normal tunnel, it is connected to the main network"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl ataque furtivo permite crear una red de túneles sin defensas en un área explorada. Es más débil que un túnel normal, pero conecta con la red principal."
IT: "\nL'Attacco furtivo permette ai generali dell'ELG di posizionare una Rete di tunnel in qualsiasi luogo esplorato."
KO: "\n잠입 공격 능력은 GLA가 지도 상의 이미 탐색한 지점들 어느 곳에든지 방어 병력이 없는\n터널 네트워크를 건설하도록 합니다. 약하긴 하지만, 모든 터널 네트워크와 연결되어 있습니다."
ZH: "\n偷襲能力能讓我們設置一個不受任何防守的地道網路系統，在所經過的任何區域皆可。雖然比一條普通\n地道稍微脆弱，但它是與主要網路相連的。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA035Subtitle
US: "*The artillery platform is armed with a large caliber howitzer. It is an excellent suppression weapon. It is also a good gathering point from which to launch an assault"
DE: "*The artillery platform is armed with a large caliber howitzer. It is an excellent supression weapon. It is also a good gathering point from which to launch an assault"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa estación de artillería está dotada de un obús de gran calibre, excelente como fuego de cobertura. Además, es un buen punto de partida para lanzar un asalto."
IT: "\nLa Postazione di artiglieria è armata con un howitzer di grosso calibro. È un ottima arma di repressione. Inoltre si presta egregiamente come punto di raduno per sferrare un attacco."
KO: "\n캐논 플랫폼은 대구경 유탄포를 탑재한 훌륭한 진압 무기입니다. 공격 시작을 위한 좋은\n집결지이기도 합니다."
ZH: "\n砲兵陣地用大型口徑的榴彈砲武裝起來。它是一個相當好用的鎮壓武器。它也是理想的集合點，從此處\n開始展開攻擊。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA036Subtitle
US: "*The Reinforcement Pad Periodically reinforces the player with one of his side's main battle tank (Scorpion, Battlemaster, Crusader)"
DE: "*The Reinforcement Pad Periodically reinforces the player with one of his side's main battle tank (Scorpion, Battlemaster, Crusader)"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nLa plataforma de refuerzos suministra periódicamente un tanque según el bando del jugador (Scorpion, Battlemaster, Crusader)"
IT: "\nUn Centro rinforzo fa giungere dei carri armati sul campo."
KO: "\n지원군 패드는 플레이어에게 자신의 진영의 주력 탱크를 정기적으로 공급해줍니다.\n(스콜피온 탱크, 배틀마스터 탱크, 크루세이더 탱크)"
ZH: "\n增援機坪會定期提供玩家側翼區的主要戰鬥坦克之一（天蠍、戰神和十字軍），來強化自己的武力"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

DIALOGEVENT:UnitDescriptXUSA037Subtitle
US: "*The Repair Bay is a repair facility for vehicles. Vehicles must dock with the structure in the same way that they must dock with the war factory"
DE: "*The Repair Bay is a repair facility for vehicles. Vehicles must dock with the structure in the same way that they must dock with the war factory"
FR: "***"
ES: "\nEl compartimento de reparación permite reparar vehículos. Los vehículos deben \"atracar\" en el edificio igual que hacen en la fábrica de guerra."
IT: "\nIl Garage, quando viene catturato, permette di riparare tutti i veicoli terrestri."
KO: "\n수리 시설은 차량 수리 시설입니다. 차량들은 군수 공장에 도킹하듯이 이 수리 시설에\n도킹해야 합니다."
ZH: "\n維修機坪是一種載具維修工廠。載具必須『停靠』這棟建築才能接受維修，同樣地，載具也必須靠近戰\n車工廠。"
BP: "***"
PL: "***"
END

